#: cuts/afailed.sve:10
msgid "Chosen. The village dies. All of our futures die, too."
msgstr "Être Elu. Le village se meurt. Tous nos avenirs meurent eux aussi."

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:20
msgid "Chosen, the spirits of our ancestors guide me to world of dreams"
msgstr ""
"Etre Elu, les esprits de nos ancêtres me guident vers le monde des rêves"

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:70
msgid "that I may touch thoughts."
msgstr "que je pourrais toucher par pensées."

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:100
msgid " Our village suffers without the holy GECK."
msgstr " Notre village souffre sans le JEK sacré."

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:170
msgid "Your hands hold our lives as a father holds his children."
msgstr "Nos vies sont entre tes mains comme un père tient celle de ses enfants."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:15
msgid "Once again my spirit touches you from the void."
msgstr "Une fois de plus mon esprit te touche à travers le vide."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:60
msgid "Chosen, our crops fail, our reserves are meager."
msgstr "Etre Elu, nos récoltes manquent, nos réserves sont maigres."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:140
msgid "Return to us with the GECK."
msgstr "Reviens-nous avec le JEK."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:175
msgid "Your failure is our lost light."
msgstr "Ton échec est notre..."

#: cuts/artimer3.sve:10
msgid "Chosen. The village weakens. It is harder to touch your dreams."
msgstr ""
"Etre Elu. Le village s'affaiblit. Il est plus difficile de toucher tes rêves."

#: cuts/artimer3.sve:85
msgid "You must hurry or we will all..."
msgstr "Tu dois faire vite ou nous allons tous..."

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:10
msgid "Chosen? Chosen? Do you hear me?"
msgstr "Etre Elu ? Etre Elu ? M'entends-tu ?"

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:90
msgid "The village dies. All of our futures die, too."
msgstr "Le village se meurt. Tous nos avenirs meurent eux aussi."

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:180
msgid "We have little left in both time and essence."
msgstr "Il nous reste très peu de temps et d'essence."

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:270
msgid "Hurry. Hurry..."
msgstr "Fais vite. Vite."

#: cuts/boil1.sve:1
msgid ""
"RemindBoy message: Water supplies running low in Vault 13.  Find the water "
"chip quickly."
msgstr ""
"Message de RemindBoy : Les réserves d'eau sont faibles dans l'Abri 13. "
"Trouvez rapidement la puce d'eau."

#: cuts/boil2.sve:1
msgid ""
"RemindBoy message: Water supplies nearly gone in Vault 13.  Situation "
"critical."
msgstr ""
"Message du Remind-Boy : réserves d'eau de l'Abri 13 presque épuisées. "
"Situation critique."

#: cuts/boil3.sve:1
msgid ""
"RemindBoy message: Water supplies exhausted. Vault 13 is dead.  Mission over."
msgstr ""
"Message du Remind-Boy : réserves d'eau épuisées. L'Abri 13 n'est plus. "
"Mission terminée."

#: cuts/credits.sve:20
msgid "War. War never changes."
msgstr "La guerre, toujours la guerre."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:70 cuts/narrate.txt:3
msgid "The end of the world occurred pretty much as we had predicted."
msgstr "La fin du monde s'est déroulée plus ou moins comme nous l'avions prévu."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:125 cuts/narrate.txt:4
msgid "Too many humans, not enough space or resources to go around."
msgstr "Trop de monde. Pas assez d'espace ni de ressources."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:190 cuts/narrate.txt:5
msgid ""
"The details are trivial and pointless, the reasons, as always, purely human "
"ones."
msgstr ""
"Les détails sont triviaux et inutiles. Les causes, elles, sont comme "
"toujours purement humaines."

#: cuts/credits.sve:285
msgid "The Earth was nearly wiped clean of life."
msgstr "La Terre fut presque entièrement balayée de toute vie."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:360 cuts/narrate.txt:7
msgid ""
"A great cleansing, an atomic spark struck by human hands, quickly raged out "
"of control."
msgstr ""
"Un grand nettoyage. Une étincelle atomique allumée par la main de l'homme "
"prit rapidement des proportions incontrôlables."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:460 cuts/narrate.txt:8
msgid "Spears of nuclear fire rained from the skies."
msgstr "Il pleuvait des lances de feu nucléaire."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:520 cuts/narrate.txt:9
msgid ""
"Continents were swallowed in flames and fell beneath the boiling oceans."
msgstr ""
"Les continents furent engloutis par les flammes sous des océans en "
"ébullition."

#: cuts/credits.sve:600
msgid "Humanity was almost extinguished,"
msgstr "L'humanité avait presque disparu,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:630
msgid ""
"their spirits becoming part of the background radiation that blanketed the "
"Earth."
msgstr ""
"Son spectre venait hanter la couche de radiations qui enveloppait la Terre."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:720 cuts/narrate.txt:11
msgid "A quiet darkness fell across the planet, lasting many years."
msgstr ""
"Des ténèbres silencieuses allaient s'abattre sur la planète pour de longues "
"années."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:810 cuts/narrate.txt:12
msgid "Few survived the devastation."
msgstr "Très peu survécurent au désastre."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:840 cuts/narrate.txt:13
msgid ""
"Some had been fortunate enough to reach safety, taking shelter in great "
"underground vaults."
msgstr ""
"Certains eurent plus de chance que d'autres et parvinrent à se réfugier dans "
"d'immenses abris souterrains."

#: cuts/credits.sve:920
msgid "When the great darkness passed, these vaults opened,"
msgstr "Quand l'obscurité totale fut passée, ces abris s'ouvrirent,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:980
msgid "and their inhabitants emerged to begin their lives again."
msgstr ""
"libérant ainsi leurs habitants qui allaient devoir reconstruire leur vie."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1040 cuts/narrate.txt:15
msgid ""
"One of the northern tribes claims they are descended from one such Vault."
msgstr "Une tribu du Nord revendique son origine d'un de ces abris."

#: cuts/credits.sve:1100
msgid "They hold that their founder and ancestor,"
msgstr "Ces gens racontent que leur fondateur et ancêtre,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:1140
msgid ""
"one known as the \"Vault Dweller,\" once saved the world from a great evil."
msgstr ""
"connu sous le nom d'Habitant de l'Abri, a autrefois sauvé le monde d'un "
"grand mal."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1210 cuts/narrate.txt:17
msgid "According to their legend, this evil arose in the far south."
msgstr "Leur légende raconte que ce mal naquit dans le Sud lointain."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1280 cuts/narrate.txt:18
msgid ""
"It corrupted all it touched, twisting men inside, turning them into beasts."
msgstr ""
"Il contaminait tout sur son passage, tordant les hommes de douleur, les "
"changeant en monstres."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1370 cuts/narrate.txt:19
msgid "Only through the bravery of this Vault Dweller was the evil destroyed."
msgstr "Seul le courage de cet Habitant de l'Abri permit d'éradiquer ce mal."

#: cuts/credits.sve:1440
msgid "But in so doing, he lost many of his friends and suffered greatly,"
msgstr ""
"Mais en le détruisant, il perdit un grand nombre de compagnons et connut de "
"grandes souffrances,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:1500
msgid "sacrificing much of himself to save the world."
msgstr "sacrifiant ainsi sa vie pour sauver le monde."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1570 cuts/narrate.txt:21
msgid ""
"When at last he returned to the home he had fought so hard to protect, he "
"was cast out."
msgstr ""
"Quand enfin il rentra chez lui, après avoir tant lutté pour protéger sa "
"patrie, il fut chassé."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1650 cuts/narrate.txt:22
msgid "Exiled."
msgstr "Exilé."

#: cuts/credits.sve:1685
msgid "In confronting that which they feared,"
msgstr "En ayant affronté ce pour quoi ils tremblaient,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:1740
msgid ""
"he had become something else in their eyes... and no longer their champion."
msgstr "il n'était plus le même... Il n'était plus leur champion."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1795 cuts/narrate.txt:24
msgid "Forsaken by his people, he strode into the wasteland."
msgstr "Abandonné par son peuple, il erra dans le désert."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1860 cuts/narrate.txt:25
msgid "He traveled far to the north, until he came to the great canyons."
msgstr "Il s'aventura loin au Nord, jusqu'à la région des grands canyons."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1930 cuts/narrate.txt:26
msgid ""
"There, he founded a small village, Arroyo, where he lived out the rest of "
"his years."
msgstr "Là, il fonda un petit village, Arroyo, où il vécut ses derniers jours."

#: cuts/credits.sve:2025
msgid "And so, for a generation since its founding, Arroyo has lived in peace,"
msgstr ""
"Et c'est ainsi que, le temps d'une génération après sa création, Arroyo "
"vécut en paix,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:2095
msgid "its canyons sheltering it from the outside world."
msgstr "protégé par ses canyons du reste du monde."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:2165 cuts/narrate.txt:28
msgid "It is home. Your home."
msgstr "C'est de là que tu viens, c'est chez toi."

#: cuts/credits.sve:2225
msgid ""
"But the scars left by the war have not yet healed. And the Earth has not "
"forgotten."
msgstr ""
"Mais les blessures laissées par la guerre n'ont pas encore cicatrisé. Et la "
"Terre n'a pas oublié."

#: cuts/elder.sve:25
msgid "Come in, Chosen One. There are things you must know."
msgstr "Entre, Etre Elu. Il y a des choses que tu dois savoir."

#: cuts/elder.sve:120
msgid "The village is dying. The signs are everywhere."
msgstr "Le village se meurt. Les signes ne manquent pas."

#: cuts/elder.sve:170
msgid "withering crops..."
msgstr "nos récoltes s'assèchent..."

#: cuts/elder.sve:210
msgid "dying brahmin..."
msgstr "nos brahmines agonisent..."

#: cuts/elder.sve:310
msgid "sick children."
msgstr "nos enfants sont malades."

#: cuts/elder.sve:370
msgid "There is hope, however. A slim hope that few know of."
msgstr "Il y a un espoir. Un mince espoir que peu de gens connaissent."

#: cuts/elder.sve:470
msgid "The old disks speak of an item called the Garden of Eden Creation Kit."
msgstr ""
"Les disques anciens parlent d'un objet appelé JEK, le Jardin d'Eden en Kit."

#: cuts/elder.sve:570
msgid "It is said it can bring life to the wasteland."
msgstr "On dit qu'il peut redonner vie au désert."

