#: dialog/kcdunton.msg:207 dialog/kcsajag.msg:137 dialog/nccody.msg:215
#: dialog/rclou.msg:301 dialog/scbuster.msg:110 dialog/scbuster.msg:127
#: dialog/scbuster.msg:130 dialog/scbuster.msg:133 dialog/scbuster.msg:136
#: dialog/scbuster.msg:139 dialog/scbuster.msg:142 dialog/scdocjub.msg:115
#: dialog/scduppo.msg:127 dialog/scdusty.msg:109 dialog/scgunthr.msg:159
#: dialog/scmikey.msg:108 dialog/scratch.msg:109 dialog/scratch.msg:136
#: dialog/scskeete.msg:138 dialog/scwestin.msg:138 dialog/vced.msg:115
#: dialog/vced.msg:153 dialog/vclynett.msg:438 dialog/vcmoore.msg:225
#: dialog/vcsteve.msg:107
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "Au revoir."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:116
msgid "Hmmm -- spend a day with me and I'll teach you how to punch harder."
msgstr "Hum, passe une journée avec moi et je t'apprendrai à frapper plus fort."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:117
msgid "Okay. Let's do it."
msgstr "Très bien, allons-y."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:118
msgid "Sorry, don't have the time right now."
msgstr "Je regrette mais je n'ai pas le temps pour le moment."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:119
msgid ""
"You know all I can teach you, Chosen One. Good luck to you on your quest."
msgstr ""
"Tu connais déjà tout ce que je peux t'enseigner. Bonne chance pour ta quête."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:120 dialog/acfist.msg:122 dialog/acfist.msg:124
#: dialog/acfist.msg:126 dialog/bcdalia.msg:147 dialog/dccaesar.msg:261
#: dialog/dclara.msg:241 dialog/gcbrain.msg:462 dialog/rcsavine.msg:147
#: dialog/rcstanwl.msg:147 dialog/rcwade.msg:147 dialog/vcvltgrd.msg:139
msgid "Oh, okay."
msgstr "Oh, d'accord."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:121
msgid ""
"Ha! Chosen One, you aren't graceful enough for me to teach you anything."
msgstr ""
"Etre Elu, tu manques d'élégance pour que je t'enseigne quoi que ce soit."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:123
msgid ""
"You are not quick enough in combat for my training to help you, Chosen One."
msgstr ""
"Tu n'es pas assez rapide au combat pour que mon entraînement puisse t'aider, "
"Etre Elu."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:125
msgid ""
"You need to learn more about combat before I can help you, little brother."
msgstr "Tu dois en apprendre plus sur le combat avant que je puisse t'aider."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:127
msgid "I can teach you a more powerful kick. It will take us all of one day."
msgstr ""
"Je peux t'apprendre un coup de pied plus puissant. Ca va nous prendre toute "
"une journée."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:128 dialog/acfist.msg:130 dialog/actemvil.msg:124
