#: game/proto.msg:670 game/skill.msg:1004
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:129
msgid "I can teach you enough to fight better. It will take us all of one day."
msgstr ""
"Je peux t'apprendre à mieux te battre. Ca va nous prendre toute une journée."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:131
msgid "You have learned well, Chosen One. May the wind be at your back."
msgstr "Tu as bien appris, Etre Elu. Que le vent te pousse dans ta quête."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:132 dialog/dcrnslvr.msg:266 dialog/gcfolk.msg:130
#: dialog/gcrglow.msg:143 dialog/tribec2.msg:201 dialog/vcmelind.msg:121
#: dialog/vcmelind.msg:139
msgid "Thanks for your help."
msgstr "Merci de ton aide."

#: dialog/acfist.msg:133
msgid "I have taught you all I can, Chosen One. Good luck on your quest."
msgstr ""
"Je t'ai enseigné tout ce que je pouvais, Etre Elu. Bonne chance pour ta "
"quête."

#: dialog/acgecko.msg:100
msgid "The gecko sneers at you."
msgstr "Gecko te sourit d'un air moqueur."

#: dialog/acgecko.msg:101
msgid "The gecko sneers at "
msgstr "Gecko sourit d'un air moqueur à "

#: dialog/acjordan.msg:100 dialog/acjordan.msg:101 dialog/acjordon.msg:100
#: dialog/acjordon.msg:101
msgid "You see Jordan, twirling his spear as usual."
msgstr "Tu vois Jordan, tournoyant sa lance comme d'habitude."

#: dialog/acjordan.msg:102
msgid "Good luck! Our village depends on you."
msgstr "Bonne chance ! L'avenir de notre village dépend de toi."

#: dialog/acjordan.msg:103
msgid ""
"Chosen One, the way you use a spear, you'll be meat for the geckos\n"
" in no time. I can show you a few tricks."
msgstr ""
"Etre Elu, vu la manière dont tu utilises ta lance, tu ne vas pas faire long "
"feu contre les geckos. Je peux t'apprendre quelques trucs."

#: dialog/acjordan.msg:105 dialog/cck9.msg:293 dialog/dccaesar.msg:248
#: dialog/hcencha.msg:110 dialog/hchench.msg:204 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:209
#: dialog/scbuster.msg:124
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "Non, merci."

#: dialog/acjordan.msg:106 dialog/acjordon.msg:106
msgid "This will take a little while."
msgstr "Ca prendra un petit peu de temps."

#: dialog/acjordan.msg:107
msgid ""
"You're a swift student -- it looks like you've learned all I can\n"
" teach you."
msgstr ""
"Tu es un élève hors pair. On dirait que tu as compris tout ce que je pouvais "
"t'apprendre."

#: dialog/acjordan.msg:108 dialog/acjordon.msg:108
msgid "Thanks Jordan, that's going to help a lot."
msgstr "Merci Jordan, ça va beaucoup m'aider."

#: dialog/acjordon.msg:102
msgid "Good luck! I must get back to my training."
msgstr "Bonne chance ! Je dois retourner à mon entraînement."

#: dialog/acjordon.msg:103
msgid ""
"Hello Chosen One. I see you're in need of a little training. Can I be of "
"help?"
msgstr ""
"Salut à toi Etre Elu. Je vois que tu as besoin d'un entraînement. Besoin "
"d'aide ?"

#: dialog/acjordon.msg:105
msgid "No Thanks."
msgstr "Non merci."

#: dialog/acjordon.msg:107
msgid "There, you have learned what I can teach you about spears."
msgstr "Voilà, tu as appris tout ce que je peux t'enseigner sur les lances."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:100
msgid "You see Klint, a fellow tribesman."
msgstr "Tu vois Klint, un membre de la tribu."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:101
msgid "You see Klint."
msgstr "Tu vois Klint."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:102 dialog/actemvil.msg:102
msgid ""
"You see a young man with bulging muscles and a very confident air about him."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un jeune homme à la musculature impressionnante. Il a l'air sûr de "
"lui."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:103
msgid "Good day to you, "
msgstr "Bonjour à toi, "

#: dialog/acklint.msg:104
msgid ". You have not completed the trial of the Elder and may not pass."
msgstr ". Tu ne peux pas passer. Tu n'as pas terminé l'épreuve de la Doyenne."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:105 dialog/ccdrgrd.msg:118 dialog/ccqmstr.msg:108
#: dialog/ccraul.msg:116 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:721 dialog/dctyler.msg:322
#: dialog/gcbrain.msg:444 dialog/ncangbis.msg:411 dialog/nclloyd.msg:616
#: dialog/ncmcgee.msg:321 dialog/ocgrutha.msg:105 dialog/scwesgrd.msg:121
#: dialog/vcbarkus.msg:220
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Euh..."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:106
msgid "I need to go back to the village."
msgstr "Je dois retourner au village."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:107 dialog/fccrocke.msg:161 dialog/gclumpy.msg:154
#: dialog/gclumpy.msg:163 dialog/kcmaida.msg:235 dialog/kcsajag.msg:184
#: dialog/kcsulik.msg:797 dialog/mcbaltha.msg:203 dialog/ocdalia.msg:111
msgid "I have some questions for you."
msgstr "J'ai quelques questions à te poser."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:108
msgid "All right, I'm off to take the test."
msgstr "Très bien, je vais relever le défi."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:109
msgid "(sigh) "
msgstr "(soupir) "

#: dialog/acklint.msg:110
msgid ""
". You go temple. You take test. You not come back here until take test. Obey "
"Elder. Go!"
msgstr ""
". Toi aller temple. Toi relever défi. Toi pas revenir avant avoir réussi "
"épreuve. Obéir à doyenne. Toi partir !"

#: dialog/acklint.msg:111 dialog/ahelder.msg:175 dialog/ccdrill.msg:112
#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2812 dialog/echermit.msg:117 dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:253
#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:134 dialog/mcjo.msg:220 dialog/mckarl.msg:178
#: dialog/ocgoris.msg:105 dialog/ocgoris.msg:115 dialog/ocgoris.msg:191
#: dialog/ocsandy.msg:133 dialog/scfelix.msg:130 dialog/scgunthr.msg:171
msgid "Me go."
msgstr "Moi aller."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:112
msgid "Forgive me, "
msgstr "Désolé, "

#: dialog/acklint.msg:113
msgid ""
", but I cannot allow you to pass. If you wish to return to the village you "
"may do so only by passing the trial set before you."
msgstr ""
", mais je ne peux pas te laisser passer. Si tu veux retourner au village, tu "
"dois simplement relever le défi qui se présente à toi."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:114
msgid "I see. I guess I'll be going then."
msgstr "Je vois. Je crois que je vais y aller alors."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:115
msgid "Can I ask you some questions then?"
msgstr "Puis-je te poser quelques questions ?"

#: dialog/acklint.msg:116
msgid "I could kick your ass and just walk out of here."
msgstr "Je pourrais te botter le cul et te chasser."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:117
msgid ""
"Forgive me, but I have no answers to your questions. Take the trial set "
"before you by the Elder and prove yourself worthy to lead our people."
msgstr ""
"Pardonne-moi mais je n'ai pas de réponses à tes questions. Relève le défi "
"que t'a préparé la Doyenne et montre-toi digne de diriger notre peuple."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:118 dialog/ecbridge.msg:107 dialog/fcdrwong.msg:154
#: dialog/ncethwri.msg:352 dialog/vcgatgrd.msg:165 dialog/vcgreg.msg:175
#: dialog/vclynett.msg:818
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "Très bien."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:119
msgid ""
"Two people working together can move the obelisk that blocks the path. "
"Alone, you would fail. I have no intention of helping you until you pass the "
"trial of the Elder."
msgstr ""
"Deux personnes travaillant ensemble peuvent déplacer l'obélisque qui bloque "
"le passage. Sans aide, tu échouerais. Je n'ai pas l'intention de t'aider "
"avant que tu aies relevé le défi de la Doyenne."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:120
msgid "Uh-huh. I get the picture."
msgstr "Euh, je comprends."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:121
msgid "Greetings, Chosen One! It is good to see you. How may I serve you?"
msgstr ""
"Bienvenue, Etre Elu. Je suis content de te voir. Que puis-je faire pour toi ?"

#: dialog/acklint.msg:122
msgid "Me say hi. That all."
msgstr "Moi juste dire bonjour."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:123
msgid "Just thought I'd say hello. I'll be leaving on my quest soon."
msgstr ""
"Je voulais juste te dire bonjour. Je vais rapidement reprendre ma quête."

#: dialog/acklint.msg:124
msgid ""
"May the spirits of our ancestors protect you, Chosen One. I wish you well on "
"your journey."
msgstr ""
"Que les esprits de nos ancêtres te protègent, Etre Elu. Je te souhaite un "
"bon voyage."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:100
msgid "You see Morlis, one of your aunts -- the one who never liked you."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois Morlis, une de tes tantes, celle qui ne t'a jamais manifesté le "
"moindre amour."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:101
msgid "Why do you bother me, nephew? Can't you see I'm busy?"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi me déranges-tu, mon neveu ? Ne vois-tu pas que je suis occupée ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:102
msgid "Umm, okay. Sorry."
msgstr "Euh... d'accord... excuse-moi."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:103
msgid "What is it? You know I have a lot to do!"
msgstr "Que veux-tu ?! Tu sais que j'ai des tas de choses à faire !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:104
msgid "Ummm, Mynoc said..."
msgstr "Euh... Mynoc a dit..."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:105
msgid "Mynoc said what? Out with it, child!"
msgstr "Mynoc a dit quoi ?! Assez, mon enfant !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:106
msgid "That, umm, you might have some flint."
msgstr "Que, euh... tu avais peut-être du silex."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:107
msgid "I do. You want some, is that it?"
msgstr "C'est vrai. Tu en veux, c'est ça ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:108
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr "Ben, ouais."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:109
msgid ""
"Well... I want three doses of healing powder. Bad times are coming\n"
" and I'm going to be ready. Bring them to me and you can have the flint. "
"Now\n"
" get to it!"
msgstr ""
"Très bien. Je veux trois doses de poudre de guérison. Les mauvais jours "
"arrivent et je dois me préparer. Apporte les moi et je te donnerai le silex. "
"Allez !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:110
msgid "Yes, ma'am!"
msgstr "D'accord !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:111
msgid "Now don't waste my time. Do you have the powders?"
msgstr "Ne me fais pas perdre mon temps. Tu as la poudre ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:112 dialog/epac17.msg:491
msgid "Yes, here they are."
msgstr "Oui, la voici."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:113
msgid "Umm, I guess not."
msgstr "Hum, j'ai bien peur que non."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:114
msgid "Here is the flint. Now off with you! I don't have time to gossip."
msgstr "Voilà le silex. Maintenant, va-t'en ! Je n'ai pas le temps de bavarder."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:115
msgid "Thank you, Aunt Morlis."
msgstr "Merci, tante Morlis."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:116
msgid ""
"Again you waste my time, worthless nephew! How did you ever become\n"
" the Chosen One?"
msgstr ""
"Tu me fais encore perdre mon temps ! Comment as-tu pu devenir l'Etre Elu ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:117 dialog/acmorlis.msg:153 dialog/acmorlis.msg:156
#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:203 dialog/acmorlis.msg:207 dialog/acmorlis.msg:211
#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:214 dialog/acmorlis.msg:216
msgid "Yes, Aunt Morlis."
msgstr "Oui, tante Morlis."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:118
msgid "Uh, Aunt Morlis, I have three right here."
msgstr "Euh, tante Morlis, j'ai ici trois doses."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:150
msgid ""
"Aunt Morlis, I'm on a perilous quest for the salvation of our village.\n"
" My chances of success will be greatly enhanced if I keep the healing "
"powders\n"
" for myself and you give me the flint. Don't you agree?"
msgstr ""
"Tante Morlis, je dois faire une quête périlleuse pour le salut de notre "
"village. Mes chances de réussite seront meilleures si je peux garder les "
"poudres de guérison et que tu me donnes ce silex. Qu'en dis-tu ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:151
msgid ""
"What do you think you are doing, child? This is no way for the Chosen One to "
"act. Now get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""
"Mais que fais-tu, petit ? Ce n'est pas comme ça que devrait se comporter "
"l'Etre Elu. Allez, débarrasse le plancher !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:152
msgid ""
"If this flint is so important that you are willing to disgrace the name of "
"the Chosen One, then here. Take\n"
" the flint and get out of my sight."
msgstr ""
"Si ce silex est si important au point que tu es prêt à déshonorer le nom de "
"l'Etre Elu, alors le voilà. Prends le silex et débarrasse le plancher."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:154
msgid ""
"Well... Oh, very well. Here is the flint. I wish you a safe journey, child. "
msgstr ""
"Eh bien... Bon, d'accord. Voilà le silex. Je te souhaite un bon voyage, "
"petit. "

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:155
msgid "No, I don't. Now stop wasting my time and get out of here!"
msgstr ""
"C'est hors de question. Arrête de me faire perdre mon temps et fiche le camp "
"!"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:200
msgid "So you've returned. Did you find the holy Thirteen?"
msgstr "Alors tu es de retour ? As-tu trouvé le saint Treize ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:201
msgid "No, Aunt Morlis, I..."
msgstr "Non, tante Morlis, je..."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:202
msgid "Then get yourself out of here and find it! People are depending on you!"
msgstr ""
"Alors débarrasse-moi le plancher et trouve-le ! La vie de notre peuple "
"dépend de toi !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:204
msgid ""
"Well, here you are again. Have you once again failed to complete your quest?"
msgstr "Ah, te revoilà. As-tu encore échoué dans ta quête ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:205
msgid "Yes, Aunt Morlis, but..."
msgstr "Oui, tante Morlis, mais..."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:206
msgid ""
"Then get yourself out of here and don't come back until you do! Why waste "
"time coming back here, when you could be using that time to continue your "
"search!?"
msgstr ""
"Alors débarrasse-moi le plancher et ne reviens pas avant de l'avoir trouvé ! "
"Pourquoi perdre ton temps à revenir ici alors que tu pourrais l'utiliser "
"pour poursuivre tes recherches ?!"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:208
msgid ""
"The fact that you are standing here must mean that you have completed your "
"quest. You wouldn't waste precious time returning here empty-handed, would "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que si tu es là, c'est que tu as terminé ta quête. Tu ne perdrais "
"pas un temps précieux à revenir ici les mains vides, pas vrai ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:209
msgid ""
"Yes, Aunt Morlis. I mean no, Aunt Morlis. Uh, I've got to go, Aunt Morlis."
msgstr ""
"Oui, tante Morlis. Enfin, j'veux dire non, tante Morlis. Euh, je dois "
"partir, tante Morlis."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:210
msgid ""
"So, child. Once again you stand before me. Are you empty-handed yet again?"
msgstr "Alors, comme ça tu reviens me voir. Tu as encore les mains vides ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:212
msgid "Listen, "
msgstr "Ecoute, "

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:213
msgid ""
". People are dying, cattle are dying, and crops are failing. Everyone is "
"either hungry, sick, or both. Our time draws near. If you do not find the "
"GECK soon, we are doomed. Do you understand me?"
msgstr ""
". Les gens se meurent, le bétail est à l'agonie et les récoltes sont "
"détruites. Tout le monde est ou affamé, ou malade... ou les deux à la fois. "
"Le temps nous est compté. Si tu ne trouves pas rapidement le J.E.K, nous "
"sommes condamnés. Est-ce que tu me comprends ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:215
msgid ""
"Then get yourself out of here and find the GECK! People are depending on you!"
msgstr ""
"Alors, va-t'en et trouve le J.E.K ! La vie de nombreuses personnes dépend de "
"toi !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:300
msgid ""
"Well, I seem to have misplaced the flint. Oh well, at least I got my "
"powders. Now off with you! I don't have time to gossip."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je crois avoir perdu mon silex. Bon, au moins j'ai mes poudres. "
"Maintenant va-t'en ! Je n'ai pas le temps de bavarder."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:301
msgid "Why do you bother me, niece? Can't you see I'm busy?"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi me déranges-tu, ma nièce ? Ne vois-tu pas que je suis occupée ?"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:302
msgid ""
"Well, I can't seem to find the flint. I'm sure you took it from me when I "
"wasn't looking though. I caught you before. Now off with you! I don't have "
"time to gossip."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je n'arrive pas à mettre la main sur ce silex. Je suis sûre que tu "
"me l'as pris lorsque j'avais le dos tourné. Que je ne t'y reprenne pas. "
"Maintenant va-t'en ! Je n'ai pas le temps de bavarder."

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:303
msgid ""
"Well... Oh, I'm sorry but I seem to have misplaced the flint. I wish you a "
"safe journey though, child. "
msgstr ""
"Hé bien... Oh, je suis désolée mais il me semble avoir perdu le silex. Je te "
"souhaite une bonne journée, petit. "

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:304
msgid ""
"I already gave you the flint, stupid. Now stop wasting my time and get out "
"of here!"
msgstr ""
"Je t'ai déjà donné le silex, andouille. Arrête de me faire perdre mon temps "
"et va-t'en !"

#: dialog/acmorlis.msg:305
msgid ""
"I already gave you the flint, stupid. Oh well, at least I got my powders. "
"Now off with you! I don't have time to gossip."
msgstr ""
"Je t'ai déjà donné le silex, andouille. Au moins, j'ai mes poudres de "
"guérison. Ca suffit ! Je n'ai pas le temps de bavarder."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:100
msgid "You see the bridge guard."
msgstr "Tu vois le garde du pont."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:101
msgid "You see Mynoc, the bridge guard."
msgstr "Tu vois Mynoc, le garde du pont."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:150
msgid ""
"Before you stands a large warrior of your village,\n"
" holding a spear."
msgstr ""
"Devant toi se dresse un grand guerrier de ton village, tenant une lance."

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:151 dialog/acvillgr.msg:151 dialog/acwarior.msg:151
#: dialog/dcanna.msg:152 dialog/dcbilly.msg:152 dialog/dccaesar.msg:151
#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:151 dialog/dcfranki.msg:152 dialog/dcjoey.msg:151
#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:152 dialog/dcsheila.msg:152 dialog/dctubby.msg:152
#: dialog/dcvic.msg:152
msgid "[TALK]"
msgstr "[Parler]"

#: dialog/acmynoc.msg:152
msgid "Hello, Chosen One. Off to find the GECK?"
msgstr "Bonjour, Etre Elu. Tu pars chercher le J.E.K ?"

