#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:169
msgid "I'm glad we straightened that out. See you later."
msgstr "C'est une bonne chose que l'on se soit expliqué. A plus tard."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:170
msgid "Hello. It's good to see you."
msgstr "Bonjour. Content de te voir."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:171
msgid "Hi Metzger. We need to talk."
msgstr "Salut Metzger. Il faut qu'on parle."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:172
msgid "You too. Bye."
msgstr "Moi aussi. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:173
msgid "Blurp."
msgstr "Blurp."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:174
msgid "I am Metzger, Head of the Slaver's Guild. Whatcha need?"
msgstr ""
"Je m'appelle Metzger et j'suis l'chef de la Guilde des Esclavagistes. T'as "
"besoin de quelque chose ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:175 dialog/fcoz7.msg:169
msgid "Yes, I have some questions."
msgstr "Oui, j'ai quelques questions."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:176
msgid "No thanks. I'll just go now."
msgstr "Non merci. Je vais partir maintenant."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:177
msgid "Swavuh???"
msgstr "Clavagistes ?!?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:178
msgid "Please leave. Now."
msgstr "Va-t'en. Maintenant."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:179 dialog/dcfranki.msg:166
msgid "Or what?"
msgstr "Quoi ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:180
msgid "Alright. But I'll be back!"
msgstr "Très bien. Mais je reviendrai !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:181 dialog/dcsheila.msg:207
msgid "OK. Bye."
msgstr "Ok. Salut."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:183
msgid "About Trader Vic..."
msgstr "Au sujet de Vic le marchand..."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:184
msgid "Can I join the Slaver's Guild?"
msgstr "Puis-je rejoindre la Guilde des Esclavagistes ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:185
msgid "I'd like to sell my husband into slavery."
msgstr "Je voudrais vendre mon mari au marché aux esclaves."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:186
msgid "I'd like to sell my wife. How much?"
msgstr "Je voudrais vendre ma femme. Combien ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:187
msgid "I'd like to sell one of my friends here."
msgstr "Je voudrais vendre un de mes amis ici."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:188
msgid "Tell me about the guild."
msgstr "Parle-moi de la Guilde."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:189
msgid "What cities buy your slaves?"
msgstr "Quelles villes achètent vos esclaves ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:190
msgid "I'd like to buy a slave."
msgstr "Je voudrais acheter un esclave."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:191
msgid "I'm looking for Vault 13. Have you heard of it?"
msgstr "Je cherche l'Abri 13. En as-tu entendu parler ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:192
msgid "Metzger? That's a strange name."
msgstr "Metzger ? Quel nom étrange..."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:193
msgid "Nothing. I have to go."
msgstr "Rien. Je dois partir."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:195
msgid "It's from an old language, prewar or something."
msgstr "C'est une vieille langue, d'avant-guerre ou quelque chose comme ça."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:196
msgid "Metzger means butcher. Fitting, don't you think?"
msgstr "Metzger signifie boucher. Pas mal, non ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:197
msgid ""
"That was my great grandfather's name. He came from somewhere far to\n"
" the east. Across a large body of water."
msgstr ""
"C'était le nom de mon arrière grand-père. Il venait de loin à l'Est. Au-delà "
"d'un large bras de mer."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:198
msgid "I read some book about a Metzger. He was a president, or something."
msgstr ""
"J'ai lu un livre à propos d'un Metzger. Il était président, ou... quelque "
"chose dans le genre..."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:199
msgid "Look who's talking tribal."
msgstr "Ben voyons."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:200
msgid ""
"It's Germen, German, Garmen, or something. Ancient language, from a\n"
" long time ago."
msgstr ""
"C'est de l'Allamand, de l'Allemend, de l'Ellemand, ou... dans le genre. Un "
"vieux, très vieux langage."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:201
msgid "Et tu, Brutus?"
msgstr "Et toi, Brutus ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:202
msgid "I see. I still have a question, though."
msgstr "Je vois. J'ai encore une question, malgré tout."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:203
msgid "That is the dumbest thing I have ever heard."
msgstr "C'est la chose la plus bête que j'aie jamais entendue."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:204
msgid "Fascinating. Gotta go."
msgstr "C'est fascinant. Je dois partir."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:205
msgid ""
"Our mission is to provide a steady and high-quality labor force to\n"
" handle the ever-growing demands of the larger cities. Would you like to "
"join?"
msgstr ""
"Notre mission est de fournir une force de travail solide et de grande "
"qualité pour satisfaire les demandes toujours plus exigeantes des plus "
"grandes cités. Tu veux te joindre à nous ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:206
msgid "Sure. Sounds great."
msgstr "D'accord. Ca a l'air super."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:207 dialog/dcfred.msg:522 dialog/fckenlee.msg:204
#: dialog/hcrsuper.msg:148 dialog/hcsuper.msg:148
msgid "No way."
msgstr "Pas question."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:208
msgid "I'll get back to you on that. What cities buy your slaves?"
msgstr ""
"J'en reviens à une de mes questions. Quelles villes achètent tes esclaves ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:209
msgid "Sorry, that's private guild information."
msgstr "Désolé, c'est une information confidentielle."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:210
msgid "OK. Sign me up!"
msgstr "Ok. Inscris-moi !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:211
msgid "No! You guys are sick people!"
msgstr "Non ! Vous êtes tous malades !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:212
msgid "I'll consider that. I have more questions."
msgstr "Je vais y réfléchir. J'ai d'autres questions."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:213
msgid "Hmm, I'll come back later."
msgstr "Hmm, je reviendrai plus tard."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:214
msgid ""
"We will need to brand a small marking on your forehead to show to all\n"
" your allegiance with the slavers guild. Are you ready?"
msgstr ""
"On devra marquer ton front pour montrer à tous ton allégeance à la Guilde "
"des Esclavagistes. T'es d'accord ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:215
msgid "Sounds great! Do it!"
msgstr "Plutôt deux fois qu'une !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:216
msgid "I've changed my mind. Can I ask another question?"
msgstr "J'ai changé d'avis. Je peux te poser une autre question ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:217
msgid "I don't have time right now. I have to go."
msgstr "Je n'ai plus le temps. Je dois partir."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:218
msgid "Welcome to the guild!"
msgstr "Bienvenue à la Guilde !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:219
msgid "Great, I have questions!"
msgstr "Super ! Alors dis-moi..."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:220
msgid "OK, thanks. I'll be back."
msgstr "Ok, merci. Je reviendrai."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:221
msgid "Vault 13? No. Wait... I think Vic's from Vault City. Maybe that's it."
msgstr ""
"L'Abri 13 ? Non. Attends... Je crois que Vic vient de la Cité de l'Abri. "
"C'est peut-être ça."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:222
msgid "Yes, where is it?"
msgstr "Oui, où est-ce ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:223
msgid "No. I have another question though."
msgstr "Non. J'ai une autre question..."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:224
msgid "No, never mind."
msgstr "Non. Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:225
msgid ""
"We sell most of our slaves to Vault City and New Reno. New Reno is\n"
" south east of here and most of the Den trades with it."
msgstr ""
"On vend la plupart de nos esclaves à la Cité de l'Abri et à New Reno. New "
"Reno est au Sud-Est et la plupart des gens de la Fosse traitent avec eux."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:226
msgid "Where is Vault City?"
msgstr "Où est la Cité de l'Abri ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:227 dialog/dccaesar.msg:230 dialog/fccrocke.msg:140
#: dialog/fckenlee.msg:144 dialog/fckenlee.msg:168 dialog/fcsuze.msg:114
#: dialog/fcsuze.msg:118 dialog/fcsuze.msg:122 dialog/fcsuze.msg:126
#: dialog/hcchad.msg:139 dialog/hcchad.msg:142 dialog/hcchad.msg:157
#: dialog/hcchad.msg:162 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:166 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:170
#: dialog/hcmarcus.msg:174 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:180 dialog/hcphil.msg:207
#: dialog/hcsteve.msg:147 dialog/hcsteve.msg:196
msgid "I have more questions."
msgstr "J'ai d'autres questions."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:228
msgid "Thanks, gotta go."
msgstr "Merci, je dois y aller."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:229
msgid "Vault City is east of here, and a little south. Vic's from there."
msgstr ""
"La Cité de l'Abri est à l'Est, et un peu au Sud. C'est de là-bas qu'il vient "
"Vic."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:231
msgid "Thanks; gotta go."
msgstr "Merci, je dois y aller."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:232
msgid "Hmm, looks like a healthy slave. I'll give you "
msgstr "Hmm, un esclave qui m'a l'air en bonne forme. Je t'en donne "

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:233 dialog/dccaesar.msg:246
msgid " coins."
msgstr " pièces."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:234
msgid "OK! It's a deal."
msgstr "Ok, ça marche."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:235
msgid "Uh, never mind."
msgstr "Euh, oublie ça tu veux..."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:236
msgid "No way! I want double!"
msgstr "Pas question ! J'en veux le double !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:237
msgid "You drive a hard bargain. Here is your money!"
msgstr ""
"T'es du genre pas facile quand il faut négocier toi.... Bon, voilà ton "
"argent."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:238
msgid "Thanks. I have some more questions."
msgstr "Merci. J'ai encore quelques questions."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:241
msgid "Yes, I have a question."
msgstr "Oui, j'ai une question."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:242 dialog/hctyphon.msg:205 dialog/vibaron.msg:373
msgid "Nope. Bye."
msgstr "Non. Salut."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:243
msgid "Which \"friend\" are you selling?"
msgstr "Quel *camarade* vends-tu ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:244
msgid "Um, never mind."
msgstr "Euh, laisse tomber."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:245
msgid "Interesting. I'll give you "
msgstr "Intéressant, je t'en donne "

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:247 dialog/dccaesar.msg:252
msgid "Sold!"
msgstr "Affaire conclue !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:249
msgid "I want more money than that!"
msgstr "Je veux plus d'argent que ça !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:250
msgid "Alright, I'll give you "
msgstr "Très bien, je t'en donne "

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:251
msgid " but no more!"
msgstr " pièces, mais pas plus ! "

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:253
msgid "Not good enough."
msgstr "C'est pas assez."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:254
msgid "That's way too little. I'm leaving."
msgstr "C'est pas assez. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:255
msgid ""
"What do you want with Vic? He's my property now. He shouldn't have fucked "
"with me."
msgstr ""
"Que lui veux-tu à Vic ? Il est désormais ma propriété. Il ne fallait pas "
"qu'il essaie de baiser."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:256
msgid "I'd like to buy him."
msgstr "Je voudrais l'acheter."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:257 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:445 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:476
msgid "Why are you keeping him here?"
msgstr "Pourquoi le gardes-tu enfermé ici ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:258 dialog/dcjoey.msg:163
msgid "Nothing. Never mind."
msgstr "Rien. Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:259
msgid "He is not for sale, yet."
msgstr "Il est pas encore à vendre."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:260 dialog/gcgordon.msg:270 dialog/ncjules.msg:696
#: dialog/qccurlng.msg:231 dialog/vcnancy.msg:189
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ça ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:262
msgid "He will cost $2000."
msgstr "Il coûtera $2 000."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:263 dialog/dccaesar.msg:266
msgid "Here is your money."
msgstr "Voilà ton argent."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:264
msgid "That's a lot. Maybe later."
msgstr "C'est beaucoup. Peut-être plus tard."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:265
msgid "The cost is $1000."
msgstr "Le prix est fixé à $1 000."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:267
msgid "Don't have that much yet. Bye."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas encore cette somme. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:268
msgid "Our radio is broken and he's in charge of fixing it."
msgstr "Notre radio est cassée et il est chargé de la réparer."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:270
msgid "You haven't got the money!"
msgstr "Tu n'as pas l'argent !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:271
msgid "Too bad for me. Can I ask you a question?"
msgstr "Dommage pour moi. Je peux te poser une question ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:272
msgid "Sorry, I'll come back."
msgstr "Je regrette, je reviendrai."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:307
msgid ""
"How dare you return after abandoning your brothers during a Slave Run! "
"Guards! Attack!"
msgstr ""
"Comment oses-tu revenir après avoir abandonné tes frères pendant une chasse "
"aux esclaves ?! Gardes ! A l'Attaque !!"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:309
msgid ""
"Excellent! It may take a few days for you to travel there and back. Are you "
"ready to leave now?"
msgstr ""
"Excellent ! Il te faudra bien quelques jours le temps d'aller là-bas et de "
"revenir. Tu peux partir maintenant ?"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:310 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:396
msgid "No. I'll come back."
msgstr "Non. Je reviendrai."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:311
msgid "Yes, I'm ready. Let's go."
msgstr "Oui. Allons-y."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:312
msgid "Ah, you are back from the Slave run. Let's see how you did..."
msgstr ""
"Ah, tu reviens de la chasse aux esclaves. Voyons voir comment tu te "
"débrouilles..."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:313 dialog/dccaesar.msg:314 dialog/dccaesar.msg:316
#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:318 dialog/ziblkjck.msg:121
msgid "[more]"
msgstr "[Suite]"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:315
msgid ""
"You killed potential slaves! A dead man brings us no income! Only kill the "
"ones that are a threat,\n"
" the others are of no threat."
msgstr ""
"Tu as tué des esclaves potentiels ! Un homme mort ne nous rapporte rien ! Ne "
"tue que ceux qui sont une menace et épargne les autres."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:317
msgid ""
"You returned no slaves at all! What the hell is wrong with you? We're trying "
"to make money here,\n"
" not lose it."
msgstr ""
"Tu n'as ramené aucun esclave ! Qu'est-ce qui t'a pris ?! On essaie de faire "
"de l'argent ici, pas d'en perdre !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:319
msgid ""
"Overall, you did well this Run. Keep up the good work and I might keep you "
"around a while."
msgstr ""
"Bon, tu t'en es pas mal tiré. Continue comme ça et je te garderai peut-être "
"un moment."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:320
msgid "Thank you. I will."
msgstr "Merci. Compte sur moi."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:321
msgid "I don't know if I like this too much."
msgstr "Je n'sais pas si tout ça me plaît vraiment."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:322
msgid "You need to improve your enslavement technique."
msgstr "Tu as besoin d'améliorer ta technique."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:324
msgid "I apologize for my poor performance."
msgstr "Je m'excuse pour ma maigre performance."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:325
msgid "I think I'm good enough."
msgstr "Je m'trouve plutôt pas mal comme esclavagiste."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:326
msgid ""
"Damn it! You did terribly in this Run. Are you trying to ruin me? Be more "
"careful next time.\n"
" You don't need to kill them all! Just kill off the hostile ones. Leave the "
"unarmed ones for collection."
msgstr ""
"Bon dieu ! T'as pas du tout assuré cette fois-ci. T'essaies d'me ruiner ou "
"quoi ?! La prochaine fois, fais gaffe. Tu n'as pas besoin de tous les tuer ! "
"Ne tue que ceux qui sont hostiles. Laisse ceux qui sont désarmés pour le "
"ramassage."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:327
msgid "I'm sorry, Metzger."
msgstr "Je m'excuse, Metzger."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:328
msgid "Hey, it's tough work to be a Slaver!"
msgstr "Hé, c'est pas facile d'être esclavagiste !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:329
msgid "I'd like to see you do better."
msgstr "Je voudrais te voir faire mieux."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:330 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:261
msgid "I'd like to go on a slave run."
msgstr "J'aimerais participer à une chasse aux esclaves."

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:331
msgid ""
"Damn it! I hate losing any guild member on a Run. Try to watch each other's "
"back!"
msgstr ""
"Bon dieu ! Je déteste perdre un membre de la guilde lors d'une chasse. "
"Tâchez de vous entr'aider !"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:332
msgid "Overall, you did well this Run. Here is $"
msgstr "Quoi qu'il en soit, belle chasse ! Voilà tes $"

#: dialog/dccaesar.msg:333
msgid " as an incentive for you to keep up the good work."
msgstr ". Il faut continuer comme ça."

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:100
msgid "You see a child shouting corny slogans."
msgstr "Tu vois un enfant criant des slogans racoleurs."

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:101
msgid ""
"This dirty child appears to be employed to advertise a tourist attraction of "
"some sort."
msgstr ""
"Cet enfant sale est apparemment payé pour faire de la publicité pour une "
"sorte d'attraction touristique."

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:500
msgid "See the Mysterious Mummy!"
msgstr "Rencontrez la mystérieuse momie !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:501
msgid "See the Ancient Wonder!"
msgstr "Vivez le miracle antique !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:502
msgid "A Jan-u-wine Mummy, here now!"
msgstr "Une momie Véri-ta-ble, maintenant !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:503
msgid "See the Egyptian Prince!"
msgstr "Rencontrez le Prince Egyptien !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:504
msgid "See the Queen of the Nile!"
msgstr "Rencontrez la Reine du Nil !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:505
msgid "Enter the Jan-u-wine haunted house!"
msgstr "Pénétrez la maison hantée par la Véri-ta-ble Reine du Nil !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:506
msgid "Mysteries of the Netherworld revealed!"
msgstr "Les mystères des profondeurs révélés !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:507
msgid "Come one, come all!"
msgstr "Venez seuls, venez tous !"

#: dialog/dccarnkd.msg:508
msgid "The educational opportunity of a lifetime!"
msgstr "Une occasion unique dans la vie d'apprendre !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:150
msgid "The guard is guarding the old church."
msgstr "Le garde se tient devant la vieille église."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:152
msgid "How dare you show your face again!"
msgstr "Comment oses-tu te montrer encore ici ?!"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:154
msgid "Ho! No one enters the Family Wright warehouse at night!"
msgstr "Hé ! Personne n'entre dans l'entrepôt de la Famille Wright la nuit !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:155
msgid ""
"Well, Mr. Wright himself sent me on an errand. If you don't know about it, "
"too bad."
msgstr ""
"Hé bien, M. Wright lui-même m'a envoyé faire une course. Si t'es pas au "
"courant, c'est dommage pour toi."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:156
msgid "I'll come back tomorrow."
msgstr "Je reviendrai demain."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:157
msgid "I need to get in there now."
msgstr "Je dois entrer, maintenant."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:158
msgid "[Looking nervous] Sorry... I didn't know. Do you have any papers?"
msgstr "[Il a l'air nerveux] Désolé... Je n'en savais rien. Tu as des papiers ?"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:159
msgid "Please! Can you even read?"
msgstr "Allez ! Tu sais lire au moins ?"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:160
msgid "No, he didn't give me any."
msgstr "Non, il ne m'a rien donné."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:161
msgid "I left them back with my guard. I'll go fetch them."
msgstr "Je les ai laissé à mes gardes. je vais les chercher."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:162
msgid "You cannot get in without papers."
msgstr "Tu ne peux pas entrer sans autorisation."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:163
msgid "Here's my authorization! Attack!"
msgstr "Voilà mon autorisation ! A l'attaque !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:165
msgid "[Embarrassed] No... um... alright, just go on in..."
msgstr "[Embarrassé] Non... hum... d'accord, vas-y entre..."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:167 dialog/rcbette.msg:179 dialog/rccamint.msg:179
msgid "That's more like it."
msgstr "Je préfère ça."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:168
msgid "What do you people want?"
msgstr "Que voulez-vous ?"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:169
msgid "We need to go inside."
msgstr "Nous devons entrer."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:170
msgid "We were sent here by the boss."
msgstr "Le boss nous envoie."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:171
msgid "I would have heard if a group was sent here. Be off!"
msgstr "Je le saurais si un groupe avait été envoyé ici. Barrez-vous !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:172
msgid "Off with your head!"
msgstr "Pas sans ta tête !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:173
msgid "OK, OK; we're going."
msgstr "Ok, Ok, on se casse."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:174
msgid "What is your business here?"
msgstr "Que fais-tu ici ?"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:175
msgid "I need to go inside."
msgstr "Je dois entrer."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:176
msgid "I've been sent on official business by the boss. Stand aside!"
msgstr ""
"J'ai été envoyé pour une affaire officielle par le boss. Ecarte-toi de mon "
"chemin !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:177
msgid "Removing your head from your shoulders."
msgstr "Je viens pour t'arracher la tête."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:178
msgid "Sorry, wrong place."
msgstr "Désolé, je me suis trompé."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:179
msgid "Hello again. You can go on in."
msgstr "Rebonjour. Tu peux entrer."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:181
msgid "Hey, get the hell away from the door!"
msgstr "Hé, fous-moi le camp de devant cette porte !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:182
msgid "Don't touch the door again unless you want trouble."
msgstr "Ne touche pas à cette porte sauf si tu veux avoir des problèmes."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:183
msgid "I see you touch that door again, you're gonna get a bullet in the head."
msgstr ""
"Je vois que tu as encore touché cette porte, tu vas donc te prendre un "
"pruneau dans la cervelle."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:184 dialog/dcpetey.msg:226
msgid "Hey, what do you think you're doing?"
msgstr "Hé, que crois-tu faire ?"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:185
msgid "I've had enough of you."
msgstr "J'en ai vraiment marre de toi."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:186
msgid ""
"Sorry; I can let you in, but your friends are gonna have to wait outside."
msgstr ""
"Désolé, je peux te laisser entrer, mais tes amis doivent attendre dehors."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:187
msgid "Only one of you are allowed in at a time."
msgstr "Je ne peux en laisser passer qu'un à la fois."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:200
msgid "Good evening."
msgstr "Bonsoir."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:201
msgid "Good afternoon."
msgstr "Bonne après-midi."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:202
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr "Bonjour."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:203
msgid "Just finish up your business, thank you."
msgstr "Allez, termine ce que t'as à faire et merci."

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:250
msgid "You know, pal, I've had enough of your shit!"
msgstr "Tu sais quoi mon salaud ? J'en ai vraiment marre de tes conneries !"

#: dialog/dcchcgrd.msg:251
msgid "You know, bitch, I've had enough of your shit!"
msgstr "Tu sais quoi salope ? J'en ai vraiment marre de tes conneries !"

#: dialog/dccraps.msg:100
msgid "Sorry, the boss says we can't let you play here anymore."
msgstr "Je regrette, le patron ne veut plus te laisser jouer ici."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:100
msgid "You see a customer."
msgstr "Tu vois un client."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:101 dialog/kcbhcust.msg:102 dialog/kcbuck.msg:102
#: dialog/mcperson.msg:100
msgid "You see a townsperson."
msgstr "Tu vois un habitant de la ville."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:150
msgid "He looks like he's headed somewhere."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il va quelque part."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:151
msgid "She looks like she's headed somewhere."
msgstr "On dirait qu'elle va quelque part."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:152
msgid "He's busy drinking and talking to other customers."
msgstr "Il est occupé à boire et à parler aux autres clients."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:153
msgid "She seems to be busy talking."
msgstr "Elle est occupée à parler."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:154
msgid "He's looking over Tubby's shelves."
msgstr "Il regarde les étagères de Dodu."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:155
msgid "She seems to be looking around Tubby's store."
msgstr "On dirait qu'elle regarde un peu partout dans le magasin de Dodu."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:156
msgid "You don't see anything unusual about him."
msgstr "Tu ne vois rien de suspect sur lui."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:157
msgid "You don't see anything unusual about her."
msgstr "Tu ne vois rien de suspect sur elle."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:201 dialog/dcstory1.msg:105 dialog/dctubfri.msg:464
#: dialog/epac4.msg:330 dialog/hcfemale.msg:218 dialog/hcmale.msg:218
#: dialog/kchild.msg:167 dialog/mcchild.msg:167 game/combatai.msg:14001
msgid "Leave me alone!"
msgstr "Laisse-moi tranquille."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:202 dialog/dcderek.msg:321 dialog/fcelrind.msg:144
#: dialog/hcfemale.msg:220 dialog/hcmale.msg:220
msgid "Don't touch me!"
msgstr "Ne me touche pas !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:203 dialog/dcstory1.msg:103 dialog/dcstory2.msg:103
msgid "Stop it!"
msgstr "Arrête !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:300
msgid "Sorry, can't talk now."
msgstr "Je regrette. J'ai pas le temps de parler."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:301
msgid "Where was I going again?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que je voulais faire déjà ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:303 dialog/fcslabte.msg:110 dialog/vccrtcit.msg:106
msgid "Excuse me."
msgstr "Excuse-moi."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:305
msgid "Becky's place is the best, and not just cuz of the prices."
msgstr "Chez Babeth, c'est le top. Et pas seulement pour les prix. "

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:306
msgid "You here for the drinks or the tables?"
msgstr "T'es ici pour la boisson ou pour le jeu ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:307
msgid "All we need now are some troubadours."
msgstr "Il ne nous manque plus que des troubadours."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:309
msgid "You a gambler?"
msgstr "Tu joues ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:310
msgid "How's the outside world?"
msgstr "Comment c'est, le monde extérieur ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:311
msgid "Frankie's a scum bag. He's mean to Becky for no reason."
msgstr "Frankie est une ordure. Il est méchant avec Babeth sans raison."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:312
msgid "You a friend of Becky?"
msgstr "Babeth est l'une de tes amies ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:313
msgid "Grab a drink, friend!"
msgstr "Prends un verre !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:314
msgid "Drink up! Drinks are cheap!"
msgstr "Cul sec ! Les boissons ne coûtent pas cher !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:315
msgid "There's no way these are watered down."
msgstr "Elles ne sont pas coupées à l'eau."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:316
msgid "That Dyer sure knows her stuff."
msgstr "Cette Dyer connaît bien son truc !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:317
msgid "Nothing like good drinks and good company."
msgstr "Il n'y a rien de tel qu'un bon verre avec de la bonne compagnie !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:318
msgid "Only trouble with Becky's drinks is you tend to drink to many!"
msgstr "Les alcools de Babeth vont te jouer des tours si tu en bois trop !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:319
msgid "Becky... I mean Rebecca sure is a sweetheart."
msgstr "Babeth... je veux dire Elisabeth, est un amour."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:320
msgid "If anyone ever lays a finger on her, they'll regret it."
msgstr "Si quelqu'un touche à un de ses cheveux, gare !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:321
msgid "This is some good stuff."
msgstr "Ca c'est du bon."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:340
msgid "We should kill you for what you did."
msgstr "On devrait te tuer pour ce que tu as fait !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:341
msgid "I don't know what she did to you but she didn't deserve to die."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas ce qu'elle t'a fait, mais elle ne méritait pas de mourir."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:342
msgid "Maybe we should head to New Reno, since Becky's is closed."
msgstr ""
"Maintenant que Chez Babeth est fermé, on devrait peut-être aller à New Reno."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:343
msgid "I miss Becky's smile."
msgstr "Le sourire de Babeth me manque."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:344
msgid "No more cheap booze."
msgstr "Plus de bibine bon marché."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:345
msgid "The Den isn't the same without Becky's."
msgstr "La Fosse n'est plus la même sans Babeth."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:360
msgid "Frankie's is truly a hole... in the wall, that is."
msgstr "Chez Frankie c'est vraiment un trou..."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:361
msgid "I like the Hole better than Becky's."
msgstr "Je préfère le Trou à chez Babeth."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:362
msgid "We call this place the Hole."
msgstr "On appelle cet endroit \"Le Trou\"."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:363
msgid "Take a seat. Oh, wait. Maybe not."
msgstr "Assieds-toi. Oh, attends. Peut-être pas."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:364
msgid "Frankie's has action. Becky's is just a money pit."
msgstr ""
"Chez Frankie, y'a d'l'action. Chez Babeth, c'est juste une pompe à fric."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:365
msgid "Frankie sure doesn't like Becky."
msgstr "Frankie n'aime pas Babeth."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:366
msgid "Frankie says Becky's drinks are watered down."
msgstr "Frankie dit que les alcools de Babeth sont coupés à l'eau."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:367 dialog/dcg2grd.msg:272 dialog/dcg2grd.msg:301
#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:260 dialog/dctyler.msg:373 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:506
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr "Comment ça va ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:368
msgid "Frankie knows how to party."
msgstr "Frankie c'est un vrai fêtard."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:369
msgid "Becky's tables are rigged! Well, that's what Frankie says."
msgstr "D'après Frankie, les tables de Babeth sont truquées !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:370
msgid "Bottoms up!"
msgstr "Cul sec !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:390
msgid "Damn, I warned Frankie about how he treated people."
msgstr ""
"J'lui avais pourtant dit à Frankie qu'il fallait qu'il traite bien les gens !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:391
msgid "Frankie should have watched his temper."
msgstr "Frankie aurait dû contrôler son mauvais caractère."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:392
msgid "Now where we going to hang out?"
msgstr "Et maintenant, où va-t-on aller ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:393
msgid "Too bad Frankie's gone. He knew how to party."
msgstr "Dommage que Frankie soit plus là. Il savait faire la fête."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:394
msgid "You got quite a temper. What'd Frankie do to you?"
msgstr "T'en as du caractère ! Que t'as fait Frankie ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:395
msgid "Frankie insult your mom or something?"
msgstr "Frankie a insulté ta mère ou quoi ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:411
msgid "I'm not sure what I'm looking for."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas ce que je cherche."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:412
msgid "Tubby sure goes through a lot of Jet."
msgstr "Dodu prend beaucoup de Jet."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:413
msgid "You see anything good?"
msgstr "Tu vois quelque chose d'intéressant ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:414
msgid "Not much here."
msgstr "Pas grand-chose ici."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:415
msgid "Tubby needs to get some better suppliers."
msgstr "Dodu doit trouver des meilleurs fournisseurs."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:416
msgid "You need drugs? Tubby is normally well stocked."
msgstr "Tu veux du matos ? Dodu en général est bien fourni."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:430
msgid "What did you kill Tubby for?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tu as tué Dodu ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:431
msgid "No great loss, but Tubby was the only real shop in town."
msgstr "C'est pas une grosse perte, mais il avait le seul magasin en ville."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:432
msgid "What'd Tubby do to piss you off?"
msgstr "Qu'a fait Dodu pour te rendre aussi furax ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:433
msgid "Tubby sold you some bad shit, didn't he?"
msgstr "Dodu t'a vendu de la mauvaise came, hein ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:434
msgid "The rumor is you whacked Tubby because of a bad deal or something."
msgstr "La rumeur dit que t'as buté Dodu à cause d'une mauvaise affaire."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:435
msgid "Not surprised really. A lot of people have been sore with Tubby lately."
msgstr ""
"C'est pas vraiment une surprise. Beaucoup de gens avaient une dent contre "
"Dodu ces temps-ci."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:440
msgid "Nothing I'm interested in today..."
msgstr "Rien qui m'intéresse pour l'instant..."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:441
msgid "Oh, hi. Just talking to my good friend Flick."
msgstr "Oh salut ! Je parle avec mon bon ami Flick."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:442
msgid "What are you doing in here?"
msgstr "Que fais-tu ici ? "

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:443
msgid "You a friend of Flick's, too?"
msgstr "Toi aussi, tu connais Flick ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:444 dialog/dctubfri.msg:323
msgid "I didn't do anything."
msgstr "J'ai rien fait."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:445 dialog/vcharry.msg:148
msgid "What are you staring at?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu regardes ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:446
msgid "Just pretend you don't see me."
msgstr "Fais comme si j'étais pas là."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:447
msgid "Don't mind me."
msgstr "Ne fais pas attention à moi."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:460
msgid "Damn. You killed Flick."
msgstr "Merde. Tu as tué Flick."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:461
msgid "Flick rip you off?"
msgstr "Flick a essayé de t'arnaquer ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:462
msgid "Flick's been into some dangerous work."
msgstr "Flick a mouillé dans des affaires dangereuses."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:463
msgid "That sucks about Flick."
msgstr "Ca craint ce qui est arrivé à Flick."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:464
msgid "Wonder what all those kids are going to do now that Flick is dead."
msgstr ""
"J'me demande ce que vont devenir tous ces gamins maintenant que Flick est "
"mort."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:465
msgid "Surprised Flick lasted this long."
msgstr "C'est surprenant que Flick ait tenu si longtemps."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:480
msgid "We call this home."
msgstr "On appelle ça la maison."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:481
msgid "Most of us grew up on Mom's cooking."
msgstr "La plupart d'entre nous avons été nourris par Mamma."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:482
msgid "I've known Mom since I was a kid."
msgstr "Je connais Mamma depuis tout jeune."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:483
msgid "Mom takes care of everyone in the Den."
msgstr "Mamma prend soin de tout le monde à La Fosse."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:484
msgid "Mom can make a sandwich out of anything."
msgstr "Mamma peut faire un sandwich avec n'importe quoi."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:485
msgid "I hope you get to know Mom as well as us."
msgstr "J'espère que tu connaîtras Mamma aussi bien que nous."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:486
msgid "Great company, great food. What else could you ask for?"
msgstr "Une bonne compagnie et des bons plats. Que demander de plus ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:487
msgid "Cheers!"
msgstr "Santé !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:500
msgid "How could you have hurt poor old Mom?"
msgstr "Comment as-tu pu faire du mal à Mamma ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:501
msgid "I've known, I mean, knew Mom all my life."
msgstr "Je connais Mamma enfin... je connaissais Mamma depuis ma naissance."

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:502 dialog/dcgamble.msg:204
msgid "What did she ever do to you?"
msgstr "Que t'avait-elle fait ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:503
msgid "Murderer! Poor Mom..."
msgstr "Assassin ! Pauvre Mamma !"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:504
msgid "Why did you have to do that?"
msgstr "Pourquoi as-tu fait ça ?"

#: dialog/dccustmr.msg:505
msgid "You heartless monster!"
msgstr "Tu n'es qu'un monstre au coeur de pierre !"

#: dialog/dcdealer.msg:100 dialog/dcdealer.msg:101 dialog/ncdrgdlr.msg:151
msgid "You see a drug dealer."
msgstr "Tu vois un dealer de drogue."

#: dialog/dcdealer.msg:102
msgid "If you are looking to deal, I got the stuff."
msgstr "Si t'en veux, j'ai ce qu'il te faut."

#: dialog/dcdealer.msg:103
msgid "Sure, show me."
msgstr "Bien sûr, montre-moi."

#: dialog/dcdealer.msg:104 dialog/vcgreg.msg:170 dialog/vcmainwk.msg:223
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr "Peut-être plus tard."

#: dialog/dcdealer.msg:105
msgid "Find what you need?"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé ce qu'il te fallait ?"

#: dialog/dcdealer.msg:200 dialog/dcdealer.msg:201 dialog/dcg1grd2.msg:100
#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:100 dialog/dcthug.msg:100
msgid "You see a thug."
msgstr "Tu vois un voyou."

#: dialog/dcdealer.msg:202
msgid "I'm here for protection. Talk to the dealer if you wanna buy."
msgstr "Je suis le garde du corps. Parle au dealer si tu veux acheter."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:100 dialog/dcfred.msg:100
msgid "You see a citizen of the Den."
msgstr "Tu vois un citoyen de La Fosse."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:101
msgid "You see Derek."
msgstr "Tu vois Derek."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:150
msgid "He looks quite agile."
msgstr "Il a l'air très agile."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:200 dialog/dcfred.msg:225 dialog/dcg2grd.msg:254
#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:182 dialog/dcmetrom.msg:256 dialog/dctyler.msg:310
#: dialog/dctyler.msg:416
msgid "Beat it."
msgstr "Casse-toi."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:201
msgid "I'm too tired to talk."
msgstr "J'ai pas la force de parler."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:202
msgid "Get out of my place."
msgstr "Sors de chez moi !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:203
msgid "Get your own place to sleep."
msgstr "Trouve-toi un autre endroit pour dormir."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:204 dialog/ncperson.msg:637 dialog/ncperson.msg:688
#: dialog/ncperson.msg:734 game/combatai.msg:14002
msgid "Stop bothering me."
msgstr "Arrête de m'embêter !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:205 dialog/ncmcknee.msg:203
msgid "I'm bushed."
msgstr "Je suis sur les rotules."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:206
msgid "Doh!"
msgstr "Ho !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:207
msgid "Hey, what are you doing here?"
msgstr "Hé, que fais-tu là ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:220
msgid "Stay away from Metzger, tribal."
msgstr "Hé, tribal ! Ne t'approche pas de Metzger !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:221
msgid "Why is it always so damn hot?"
msgstr "Pourquoi fait-il toujours si chaud ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:222
msgid "Why do we live in the desert?"
msgstr "Pourquoi vit-on dans le désert ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:223
msgid "I'm a good cook."
msgstr "J'suis un bon cuisto."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:224
msgid "I'm going to open my own restaurant someday."
msgstr "Un jour, j'ouvrirai mon propre restaurant."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:225
msgid "I wish I had a real kitchen."
msgstr "Ca m'plairait tellement d'avoir une vraie cuisine !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:226
msgid "Why am I always getting the short end of life?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est-ce que je me fais toujours avoir ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:227
msgid "People are always screwing me."
msgstr "Les gens m'arnaquent tout le temps."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:228
msgid "Fred's a dreamer - master plan, my ass."
msgstr "Fred est un rêveur. Son plan directeur, mon c%$ oui !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:240
msgid "Shhhh! They're everywhere."
msgstr "Chut ! Ils sont partout."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:241
msgid "Make them stop!"
msgstr "Arrête-les ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:242
msgid "So you found that damn book?"
msgstr "Alors, tu l'as trouvé ce bouquin ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:243
msgid "I don't know why Becky won't hire me."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas pourquoi Babeth ne veut pas m'embaucher."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:244
msgid "I will not go insane!"
msgstr "Je ne disjoncterai pas !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:245
msgid "I got my quarters!"
msgstr "Quel pied !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:246
msgid "They come out at night, mostly."
msgstr "Ils sortent habituellement la nuit."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:247
msgid "I like potatoes!"
msgstr "J'aime les pommes de terre !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:248
msgid "Don't walk on the green stuff without boots!"
msgstr "Ne marche pas sur ce truc vert sans bottes !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:249
msgid "Just turn it inside out."
msgstr "Mets-le à l'envers."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:250
msgid "Oh, my head hurts really bad now."
msgstr "Oh, j'ai vraiment mal à la tête maintenant."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:251
msgid "I'm a grandmaster cook!"
msgstr "Je suis un vrai Cordon Bleu !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:252
msgid "I would never poison a newbie's food."
msgstr "Je n'empoisonnerai jamais la nourriture des nouveaux-nés."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:260
msgid "Hey you looking for some freshly baked bread?"
msgstr "Hé, tu cherches du pain frais ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:262 dialog/dcderek.msg:282
msgid "I'm looking for Becky's book."
msgstr "Je cherche le livre de Babeth."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:263 dialog/dcjoey.msg:261
msgid "No, bye."
msgstr "Non, salut."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:270
msgid "Oh, hi again."
msgstr "Oh, salut !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:271
msgid "So where's Becky's book?"
msgstr "Je ne le trouve nulle part."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:272
msgid "Hey, how about some of that bread?"
msgstr "Hé, que dis-tu de ce pain ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:280
msgid ""
"Ha! So am I. Have I told you what a great cook I am? Becky wont' hire me for "
"some reason. She says I'm unstable."
msgstr ""
"Ha ! C'est moi. Je t'ai dit que j'étais un vrai cordon bleu ? Babeth ne veut "
"pas me prendre. Elle dit que je suis instable."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:281
msgid "She's probably right."
msgstr "Elle a peut-être raison."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:283
msgid "That's great. I've uh... got to go."
msgstr "C'est super. Il faut que... heu, j'y aille."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:290
msgid "What? You! Screw you buddy! I'm not... Ow! Fuck."
msgstr "Quoi ? Toi ! Va t'faire mec ! Je suis pas... Oh ! Merde."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:291
msgid "What? You! Screw you lady! I'm not... Ow! Fuck."
msgstr "Quoi ? Toi ! Va t'faire foutre pôv' pouff ! Je suis pas... Oh ! Merde."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:292 dialog/fcjuavki.msg:192
msgid "Damn."
msgstr "Putain."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:293
msgid "Nuf Said."
msgstr "J'en ai assez dit."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:300
msgid ""
"Oh yeah. I didn't like it. Too much kissing. I threw it in the corner of "
"that building... no that building... no... was it a building? Maybe I "
"dropped it somewhere else... or did I throw it? Ow! My head!"
msgstr ""
"Oh oui. Je n'aimais pas ça. Trop de bisous. Je l'ai jeté au coin de ce "
"bâtiment... non celui-ci, non celui-là..."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:301
msgid ""
"Book? Oh, that book. Who sent you? I'm not sure if that's the proper side. "
"Don't forget the tissue."
msgstr ""
"Un livre ? Oh, ce livre ? Qui t'envoie ? Je sais pas si c'est bien. N'oublie "
"pas ton mouchoir."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:302
msgid "I can't! They're... oh crap... Do you have the cheese? Hide!"
msgstr "Je ne peux pas ! Ils... oh merde... As-tu le fromage ? Cache-toi ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:303
msgid ""
"Hey! Not my problem. What was I supposed to do? Fight them? Little green "
"men, big pointy teeth! Fuck! Ouch! Stop that!"
msgstr ""
"Hé, c'est pas mon problème. Qu'aurais-je dû faire ? Me battre contre eux ? "
"Petits hommes verts, grandes dents pointues ! Merde ! Aïe ! Arrête !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:304
msgid "My head hurts! What... who said that?"
msgstr "J'ai mal à la tête ! Quoi... qui a dit ça ?"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:305
msgid "That helps a lot."
msgstr "C'est très utile."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:310
msgid ""
"What? Are you mocking me! Screw you! I'm not unstable! I can cook! I don't "
"have voices in my head!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ! Tu te moques de moi ! Va te faire foutre ! Je ne suis pas instable ! "
"Je sais cuisiner ! J'entends pas de voix !"

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:311
msgid "I'm gonna- shit! Fuck! Damn it! Stop that. Be quiet! What?... Okay."
msgstr "Je vais... merde ! Fais chier ! Arrête ça ! Silence ! Quoi ? D'accord."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:312
msgid "Hey! Sto- do... fuck."
msgstr "Hé ! Arr... ne... merde."

#: dialog/dcderek.msg:320
msgid "Hey! Get away from me!"
msgstr "Hé ! Casse-toi de là !"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:100
msgid "You see a thin, greasy looking, man."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme mince à l'apparence graisseuse."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:150
msgid "You see Flick, giving his groin a thorough scratching."
msgstr "Tu vois Flick. Il se gratte furieusement entre les cuisses."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:151
msgid "You see an unclean fellow with a nasty facial-twitch."
msgstr "Tu vois un type pas propre dont le visage est agité par un tic."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:200
msgid "Get outta heeya, you dumb-ass."
msgstr "Barre-toi d'là, imbécile !"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:201
msgid "Hey meatball! Yeah, you. Get outta heeya."
msgstr "Hé, gros tas ! Hé toi ! Barre-toi d'là !"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:202
msgid "You dumb or sumpin'?"
msgstr "T'es bête ou quoi ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:203
msgid "Whatchur problem, eh?"
msgstr "C'est quoi ton problème, hein ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:204
msgid "Get the hell outta heeya."
msgstr "Casse-toi d'ici vite fait !"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:220
msgid "Hey der, I'm Flick. What the fuck do you want, huh?"
msgstr "Hé ! Je m'appelle Flick. Qu'est-ce que tu veux bordel ? Hein ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:221
msgid "Now what? You wastin' my time heeya."
msgstr "Quoi ? Tu me fais perdre mon temps."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:222
msgid "What's with the wacky accent, Flick?"
msgstr "C'est quoi cet accent minable, Flick ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:223
msgid "What the hell do you do here?"
msgstr "Que fous-tu ici ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:224
msgid ""
"I'm looking for a Vault - oh yeah, and some trader named Vic, too. Know "
"where they might be?"
msgstr ""
"Je cherche un Abri, oh et un marchand, un certain Vic. Tu sais où il peut-"
"être ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:225
msgid "I'd like to trade with you."
msgstr "J'aimerais faire des affaires avec toi."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:240
msgid "That 'bout do it for ya, pal?"
msgstr "Ce s'ra tout ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:241
msgid "Actually I'd like to take another look at your goods if I may."
msgstr "En fait j'aimerais beaucoup jeter un coup d'oeil à tes marchandises."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:242
msgid "Actually, I'd like to ask you a question."
msgstr "En fait, j'aimerais te poser une question."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:243
msgid "That did it. See you around, Flick."
msgstr "A bientôt, Flick."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:260
msgid "I'm a fuckin' provider, waddya think? I'm like a good Samurai-itan guy."
msgstr ""
"Je suis qu'un simple fournisseur, qu'est-ce tu crois ?! Comme un Bon "
"Samouraïtain."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:261
msgid "Say what?"
msgstr "Quoi ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:262
msgid "Yeah, uh, well... let me ask you something else."
msgstr "Ouais, heu, ben... j'aimerais te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:263
msgid "Uh, oh. OK. Goodbye, Flick."
msgstr "Oh, heu. D'accord. Au revoir Flick."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:280
msgid "I provide fer them little paisanos."
msgstr "Je suis le fournisseur des petits paisanos."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:281 dialog/dcflick.msg:412
msgid "You provide little pianos?"
msgstr "Tu vends des pianos ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:290 dialog/dcflick.msg:440
msgid "Pai-san-o, you know, the kids. My kids."
msgstr "Pai-sa-no, tu sais, les enfants. Mes enfants."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:291
msgid "Your kids?"
msgstr "Tes enfants ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:292
msgid ""
"Well, I'm not really interested in music lessons for children. Let me ask "
"you about something else."
msgstr ""
"Les cours de musique pour enfants c'est pas trop mon truc. J'aimerais te "
"poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:300
msgid ""
"Yeah, well they work for me. They bring me things. Little things. You know."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, ils travaillent pour moi. Ils me rapportent des choses. Des petits "
"trucs. Tu sais..."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:302
msgid "Oh, OK. Let me ask you something else then."
msgstr "Oh, d'accord. J'aimerais te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:303
msgid "Ah, I see. Well, I don't want to cramp your, uh, style. Goodbye."
msgstr "Bon. Je ne veux pas te faire perdre tous tes, euh, moyens. Salut. "

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:315 dialog/dcflick.msg:450
msgid ""
"They bring me stuff that they find. Little, little things. Stuff no one "
"ain't usin' no more. In return, I takes care of 'em."
msgstr ""
"Ils me ramènent les trucs qu'ils trouvent. De petites, petites choses. Des "
"trucs que plus personne n'utilise aujourd'hui. En échange, je prends bien "
"soin d'eux."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:316 dialog/dcflick.msg:451
msgid "Sounds like a nice arrangement."
msgstr "On dirait un bon arrangement."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:325
msgid "(Flick shrugs) I get by OK."
msgstr "(Flick hausse les épaules.) Je m'en sors pas trop mal."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:326
msgid "Let me ask you about something else then."
msgstr "J'aimerais te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:327
msgid ""
"They must have brought you some real bargains. Let's see what you've got."
msgstr ""
"Ils ont dû te rapporter de sacrées belles affaires. Voyons un peu ce que tu "
"as."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:328 dialog/dcflick.msg:472
msgid "Just checking. Well, goodbye Flick."
msgstr "J'faisais juste un tour dans le coin. Salut, Flick."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:340
msgid ""
"What you talkin' about? You think I'm a fucking stupid pirla? Some dumb "
"filio di puttana? You think I'm some kinda clown? Am I here to amuse you, is "
"that it?"
msgstr ""
"De quoi tu parles ? Tu me prends pour un pauvre pirla, un figlio di puttana "
"débile ? Tu me prends pour un clown ? Et je suis là pour te faire rire, hein "
"?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:341
msgid "Uh, no. Sorry, I was just curious. Let me ask you about something else."
msgstr ""
"Heu, non. Pardon, je voulais simplement savoir. J'aimerais te poser encore "
"une question."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:342
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's right, shithead. And nothing's going to amuse me more than your "
"death-throes."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, c'est ça, tête de noeud. Et rien ne peut me faire plus rire que tes "
"menaces."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:343
msgid "Well, if you're going to get all huffy about it, I'm leaving."
msgstr "Eh ben si tu le prends sur ce ton, je m'en vais."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:360
msgid ""
"Vault huh? Maybe Momma knows about that, 'cause I don't. But that Vic guy - "
"him I know. Metzger's got that porca pistola."
msgstr ""
"L'Abri, hein ? Mamma sait peut-être quelque chose, moi non. Mais je connais "
"ce mec, Vic. C'est Metzger qui fait surveiller ce porca pistola."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:361
msgid "Vic? Ain't that him with you? You biota. But Momma, her I know."
msgstr ""
"Vic ? C'est pas lui qui est avec toi ? Biota. Mais la Mamma elle, elle doit "
"savoir."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:362 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:422 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:218
#: dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:281 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:302 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:383
#: dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:413
msgid "Who's Metzger?"
msgstr "Qui c'est Metzger ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:363
msgid "Who's Momma?"
msgstr "Qui c'est la Mamma ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:364 dialog/dcflick.msg:382 dialog/dcflick.msg:403
#: dialog/epac22.msg:323 dialog/gcharold.msg:210 dialog/gcharold.msg:216
#: dialog/gcharold.msg:219 dialog/kcsulik.msg:3102 dialog/tribec12.msg:129
msgid "Thanks. Let me ask you something else."
msgstr "Merci. Permets-moi de te demander autre chose."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:365 dialog/dcflick.msg:383 dialog/dcflick.msg:404
msgid "Thanks, that's all I need to know. Goodbye."
msgstr "Merci. C'est tout ce que je voulais savoir. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:380
msgid ""
"Momma runs a food place over in da East side a town. Just past the "
"graveyard. Nice place, she got good pasta, Mama mia."
msgstr ""
"Mamma tient un restaurant dans le quartier Est de la ville, juste après le "
"cimetière. L'endroit est chouette, et les pâtes... mamma mia !"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:381
msgid "Thanks, What about that Metzger fellow that's got Vic?"
msgstr "Merci. Parle-moi de ce Metzger qui garde Vic prisonnier."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:400
msgid ""
"That's right. Metzger, that stronzo, he's dead. I don't know what happen to "
"Vic."
msgstr "Metzger, ce salaud, il est mort. Je ne sais pas ce que Vic est devenu."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:401
msgid ""
"That Metzger, he's a real rompiballe, that one. Runs the Slaver's Guild. "
"East side of town, just north of Momma's. Anyhow, he got Vic, I know."
msgstr ""
"Ce Metzger, c'est vraiment un casse-noix. Il dirige la Guilde des "
"Esclavagistes, dans le quartier Est, au Nord de chez Mamma. C'est là que Vic "
"est prisonnier, ça c'est sûr."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:402
msgid "Thanks, now what about Momma?"
msgstr "Merci. Et Mamma ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:410
msgid ""
"Well fuck me sideways, look who came by. The good samaritan who \"saved the "
"children\" decided to grace me with his presence.\n"
" You know, I'm a good Samurai-itan guy myself -- providin' fer them little "
"paisanos and all. That is, until you came along and made that\n"
" fuckin' orphanage idea a reality."
msgstr ""
"Hé bien, sacré nom d'un chien, regardez qui voilà. Le bon samaritain qui a "
"sauvé les enfants me fait grâce de sa présence. Je suis un bon Samourai-itan "
"aussi. Je fourni les petits paisanos et tout. Ca, jusqu'à ce que tu t'amènes "
"et que tu fasses de cette idée d'orphelinat une réalité."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:411
msgid ""
"Well fuck me sideways, look who came by. The good samaritan who \"saved the "
"children\" decided to grace me with her presence.\n"
" You know, I'm a good Samurai-itan guy myself -- providin' fer them little "
"paisanos and all. That is, until you came along and made that\n"
" fuckin' orphanage idea a reality."
msgstr ""
"Hé bien, sacré nom d'un chien, regardez qui voilà. Le bon samaritain qui a "
"sauvé les enfants me fait grâce de sa présence. Je suis un bon Samourai-itan "
"aussi. Je fourni les petits paisanos et tout. Ca, jusqu'à ce que tu t'amènes "
"et que tu fasses de cette idée d'orphelinat une réalité."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:413
msgid ""
"You sound like you don't like the fact that the children are no longer "
"roaming the streets."
msgstr ""
"On dirait que tu n'aimes pas le fait que les enfants ne rôdent plus dans les "
"rues de cette ville."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:420
msgid ""
"Hey, don't get me wrong. Life on the street is tough fer them kids, but it's "
"the end of our little arrangement that gets me down."
msgstr ""
"Hé, ne te méprends pas. La vie dans les rues est dure pour ces enfants, mais "
"c'est la fin de notre petit arrangement qui me fout en l'air."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:421
msgid "What arrangement?"
msgstr "Quel arrangement ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:422
msgid ""
"You mean them pickpocketing from people and bringing the items to you to "
"sell."
msgstr ""
"Tu veux dire leur jeu du vol des objets qu'ils te ramènent pour les vendre."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:430
msgid ""
"Don't you get smart with me asshole. The kids bring me items they *find.* I "
"don't know where they get them and frankly, I don't give a fuck."
msgstr ""
"Ne te fais pas plus malin que tu n'es, trou du cul. Les enfants me ramènent "
"des objets qu'ils *trouvent*. Je ne sais pas où ils les trouvent et "
"franchement, j'en ai rien à foutre."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:432
msgid ""
"You're full of it. I'm sick of skum like you who use people for their own "
"benefit. Time to die!"
msgstr ""
"Ca suffit. J'en ai ma claque des enfoirés comme toi qui se servent des "
"autres pour leur propre compte. C'est l'heure de crever !"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:441
msgid "And you have an arrangement with them?"
msgstr "Et tu as un arrangement avec eux ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:460
msgid ""
"Yeah... business was good 'til you came along. See, yer little stunt's gonna "
"cost me. My business is gonna suffer thanks to you.\n"
" Because of this, I don't really like you too much. In fact, I fuckin' hate "
"you. But, I'm a business man, so if you need to barter,\n"
" get to it. If not, fuck off."
msgstr ""
"Ouais... le business était bon jusqu'à ce que tu t'amènes. Tu vois, tes "
"petites galipettes vont me coûter cher. Mon établissement va souffrir à "
"cause de toi. Et du coup, je ne t'aime plus beaucoup. A vrai dire je crois "
"que je te hais. Mais je suis un business man, donc si t'es là pour affaire, "
"grouille-toi, sinon dégage."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:461
msgid "Alright, let's see what you have in stock then."
msgstr "D'accord, voyons voir ce que tu as en stock."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:462
msgid "I think I have all I need. Goodbye."
msgstr "Je pense que j'ai tout ce qu'il me faut. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:463
msgid "I think I'll stay... and kick your ass."
msgstr "Je crois que je vais rester... et te botter le cul."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:470
msgid ""
"You again? You better be here to make some good trades, 'cause I'm getting "
"real fuckin' sick of looking at you.\n"
" In fact, I vomit in my mouth a little every time I see yer face. That's how "
"much you disgust me. And if yer not here to\n"
" trade, then I suggest you turn around and walk the fuck outta here."
msgstr ""
"Toi encore ? J'espère que t'es là pour le business, ou alors tu vas devoir "
"te barrer fissa."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:471 dialog/dctubby.msg:158 dialog/vibaron.msg:251
msgid "Let's trade."
msgstr "Faisons affaire."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:480
msgid "You done wastin' my time?"
msgstr "T'as fini de me faire perdre mon temps ?"

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:481
msgid "Let me take another look."
msgstr "Laisse-moi regarder encore une fois."

#: dialog/dcflick.msg:482
msgid "That should do it. Goodbye Flick."
msgstr "Ca devrait le faire. A la prochaine, Flick."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:100
msgid "You see the owner of The Hole."
msgstr "Tu vois le propriétaire du Trou."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:101
msgid "You see Frankie, owner of The Hole."
msgstr "Tu vois Frankie, le propriétaire du Trou."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:150
msgid "This appears to be the owner of this place."
msgstr "Voici le propriétaire de cet endroit."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:151
msgid "This is Frankie. He owns this joint."
msgstr "Voici Frankie, c'est le propriétaire de ce bistrot."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:153
msgid ""
"I'm Frankie and yer standing in 'The Hole.' Best damn bar for\n"
" a hundred miles! Everyone crawls into The Hole when it's time to let loose."
"\n"
" Now don't you be causing too much trouble, y'hear?"
msgstr ""
"C'est moi, Frankie. Je suis l'proprio. Tu fais la queue comme tout l'monde, "
"Ok ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:154
msgid "I hear ya."
msgstr "D'ac."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:155
msgid "Yeah, okay. Whatever."
msgstr "C'est cela même..."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:156
msgid "I see why you call this place \"The Hole.\""
msgstr "Je comprends pourquoi cet endroit s'appelle *Le Trou*."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:158
msgid "What's yer pleasure?"
msgstr "Que te faut-il ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:159 dialog/dcfranki.msg:182
msgid "Whiskey."
msgstr "Du whisky."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:160
msgid "Women."
msgstr "Des femmes."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:161
msgid "Men."
msgstr "Des mecs."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:162
msgid "Info."
msgstr "Des renseignements."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:163
msgid "Nothing today. Bye."
msgstr "Rien pour aujourd'hui. Salut."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:164
msgid "Wee wee."
msgstr "J'veux faire pipi."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:165
msgid "Hey! You better shut your hole!"
msgstr "Hé, tu ferais mieux de fermer ton trou !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:167
msgid "Just do your job and get me a drink."
msgstr "Fais ton boulot et sers-moi un verre."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:168
msgid "I'll just leave instead."
msgstr "Je crois que je vais plutôt m'en aller."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:169
msgid "Whiskey is $"
msgstr "Le whisky, ça fait $"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:170
msgid " a shot."
msgstr " le verre."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:171 dialog/rcjosh.msg:128
msgid "Here's your money."
msgstr "Voilà ton argent."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:172
msgid "No way! That's too much!"
msgstr "Pas question ! C'est trop cher !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:173
msgid "Why does your whiskey cost so much more than Becky's?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ton whisky coûte-t-il plus cher que chez Elisabeth ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:177 dialog/gcwooz.msg:725
msgid "Nope, thanks."
msgstr "Non, merci."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:178
msgid "You don't have enough money! This ain't no charity!"
msgstr "T'as pas assez d'argent ! C'est pas une oeuvre de charité ici !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:179
msgid "Oh, sorry. I'm low on funds."
msgstr "Oh, pardon. J'ai peu de ressources."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:183
msgid "Nothing. I'm leaving."
msgstr "Rien. Je pars."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:184
msgid "Wahdo a peedee!"
msgstr "Wah un perro !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:185
msgid "And stay out!"
msgstr "Et reste dehors !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:186
msgid "[EXIT]"
msgstr "[Partir]"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:187
msgid "I don't want people like you in my place. Get out!"
msgstr "Je veux pas de spécimens dans ton genre chez moi. Dégage !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:188
msgid "Alright, I'm going."
msgstr "D'accord, je m'en vais."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:190
msgid ""
"Those New Reno families charge an arm and a leg for their booze. I don't "
"know how she does it!"
msgstr ""
"Ces familles de New Reno font payer leur bibine les yeux de la tête. Je ne "
"sais pas comment elle fait !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:191
msgid "Well, you should try to find out."
msgstr "Tu devrais chercher à savoir."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:192
msgid "I could find out."
msgstr "Je pourrais trouver..."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:193
msgid "I know how she does it."
msgstr "Je sais pas comment elle fait."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:194
msgid "I'll just go buy whiskey from her."
msgstr "Je vais aller acheter du whisky chez elle."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:195
msgid "If you find out where she gets her booze, I'll pay you $100."
msgstr "Si tu trouves où elle achète sa bibine, je te paierai $100."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:196
msgid "OK, I'll find out."
msgstr "D'accord, je trouverai."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:197
msgid "Nope, not interested."
msgstr "Non, ça m'intéresse pas."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:198
msgid "So, how does Becky do it? How does she sell her booze so cheap?"
msgstr ""
"Alors, comment elle se débrouille Babeth ? Pourquoi sa bibine est-elle si "
"bon marché ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:199
msgid "She has a still."
msgstr "Elle a un alambic."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:200
msgid "I don't know yet. I'll come back."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas encore. Je reviendrai."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:201
msgid ""
"What? A still! Damn. Hey, here's the $100, and I'll pay you $500 to destroy "
"it. You can use my crowbar, in the back room over there. That'll do a number "
"on her stupid little still!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ! Un alambic ! Hé, voilà $100. J'te donnerai $500 si tu le détruis."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:202
msgid "I already did."
msgstr "C'est déjà fait."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:203
msgid "OK, I'll destroy it."
msgstr "D'accord, je le détruirai."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:204
msgid "No way. That's too much. I got the information. You handle it."
msgstr ""
"Pas question. C'est trop. J'ai trouvé les renseignements. A toi de jouer "
"maintenant."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:205
msgid "No, I have a better idea."
msgstr "Non, j'ai une meilleure idée."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:206
msgid ""
"So, is the still destroyed? Like I said, just use my crowbar on it. That'll "
"really fuck it up fast."
msgstr "Alors, l'alambic est-il détruit ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:207
msgid "Yes, it is."
msgstr "Oui."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:208
msgid "I have a better idea."
msgstr "Non, j'ai eu une meilleure idée."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:209
msgid "Nope. I'll let you know when it is."
msgstr "Non. Je te ferai savoir quand ça sera fait."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:210
msgid "Then here's the $500. Thanks."
msgstr "Alors voilà $500. Merci."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:211 dialog/scdrvpay.msg:121
msgid "Nice doing business with you."
msgstr "J'aime faire des affaires avec toi."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:212
msgid "You know, Frankie, she's just going to build another one."
msgstr "Tu sais Frankie, elle va en fabriquer un autre."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:214
msgid "Damn! Well, in the mean time she'll have no booze."
msgstr "Merde ! Bon, mais en attendant, elle n'aura plus de bibine."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:215
msgid "Why fight her, Frankie? Join her."
msgstr "Pourquoi te battre contre elle ? Associe-toi avec elle plutôt."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:216
msgid "Think. Where else can you get liquor?"
msgstr "Réfléchis. Où peux-tu trouver de l'alcool ailleurs ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:217 dialog/ecabolst.msg:361 dialog/epac12.msg:375
#: dialog/gcharold.msg:130 dialog/gclenny.msg:291 dialog/gcwooz.msg:451
#: dialog/ncjimmyj.msg:716 dialog/qhprzrch.msg:221 dialog/qhprzrch.msg:231
#: dialog/rcdick.msg:177 dialog/rchoffy.msg:166 dialog/rclou.msg:216
#: dialog/rcmcgrew.msg:120 dialog/rcmcgrew.msg:126 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:169
#: dialog/rcmodjes.msg:175 dialog/scwestin.msg:121 dialog/vcmclure.msg:269
#: dialog/vcstark.msg:276 dialog/vcstark.msg:304
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu dire ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:218
msgid ""
"Buy liquor from her. It's cheaper than New Reno's, so you'll make more "
"money, too."
msgstr ""
"Achète-lui de l'alcool. C'est moins cher qu'à New Reno. Tu feras même des "
"bénéfices en plus."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:219
msgid "I don't want to do this."
msgstr "Je veux pas faire ça."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:221
msgid "Look, I just want her still destroyed. Will you do it?"
msgstr "Je veux juste que tu détruises son alambic. Tu le feras ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:222
msgid "Alright, I will."
msgstr "D'accord."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:223
msgid "No, I won't. Good bye."
msgstr "Non. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:224
msgid "Maybe you're right. I'll talk to her. Thanks."
msgstr "Tu as peut-être raison. Je vais lui parler. Merci."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:225
msgid "Hey, what are friends for?"
msgstr "Hé, les amis sont là pour ça !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:227
msgid "Information I do not have."
msgstr "Des renseignements que je n'ai pas."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:228
msgid "Really? How about why Becky's drinks are so much cheaper than yours?"
msgstr ""
"Ah ? Comment se fait-il que les boissons de Babeth soient bien moins chères "
"que les tiennes ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:229
msgid "I thought bartenders knew everything."
msgstr "Je croyais que les barmen savaient tout."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:230
msgid "Then I'm in the wrong place. Bye."
msgstr "Alors, je ne suis pas au bon endroit. Salut."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:231
msgid "Go talk to Sheila. Hey, Sheila, you got a customer!"
msgstr "Va parler à Sheila. Hé Sheila, quelqu'un pour toi !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:232
msgid "Wait, that's not what I want!"
msgstr "Hé, c'est pas ça que je veux !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:234
msgid ""
"Yeah, I bet. You must have the damnedest time getting men. Try your luck "
"somewhere else, sister. I ain't into no charities."
msgstr "Va tenter ta chance ailleurs, petite. Ouah, ah !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:235
msgid "Fine! Something else then."
msgstr "Et si on essayait autre chose ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:236
msgid "Why, you little..."
msgstr "Tu n'es qu --"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:238
msgid "I have a room over there. You and I can use it."
msgstr "J'ai une chambre là-bas. On peut y aller."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:240
msgid "No, I didn't mean that!"
msgstr "Non, je ne voulais pas dire ça !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:242
msgid "Neither were you."
msgstr "Si."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:243
msgid "I might have tried if you knew how to please a woman."
msgstr "Tu as moins de 50% de mauvais en toi."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:244
msgid "You were the best I ever had. Really. I mean that."
msgstr "C'est toi qui détiens la palme pour le moment. Sérieux !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:245
msgid "I hate to eat and run, but..."
msgstr "J'ai horreur qu'on me presse, mais..."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:246
msgid "Well, see you later."
msgstr "Bon, à bientôt."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:248
msgid "Yeah, whatever. Just clean up after yourself this time, will ya?"
msgstr "Ouais, c'est ça. Nettoie quand tu as fini cette fois-ci, hein !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:249
msgid "Hey, everyone! Let's hear it for Billy. He's actually getting some!"
msgstr ""
"Hé, la compagnie ! Un petit bravo pour Billy ! Il est en pleine action !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:250
msgid "You need a mop?"
msgstr "Tu veux une serpillière ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:251
msgid "See ya in five."
msgstr "A plus tard."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:252
msgid "Sheila! Watch the bar!"
msgstr "Sheila ! Surveille le bar !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:253
msgid "Hey, Billy, get outta here!"
msgstr "Hé Billy ! Sors d'ici !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:254
msgid "Now where were we?"
msgstr "Alors, où en étions-nous ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:255
msgid "Where are you, woman?"
msgstr "Femme, où es-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:256
msgid "Would you get in here?"
msgstr "Viens ici !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:257
msgid "Come on, baby."
msgstr "Viens, mon chou."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:259
msgid "No woman stands me up. Get the hell out!"
msgstr "Aucune femme ne me tient tête. Dégage !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:261
msgid ""
"I forgot; I had something else I had to attend to right away. Please forgive "
"me, baby."
msgstr ""
"J'avais oublié... J'ai un truc urgent à faire. Je regrette, pardon, mon chou."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:262
msgid "I decided I didn't want to sleep with your ugly ass after all."
msgstr "Finalement, je veux plus coucher avec ta sale tronche de cake."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:263
msgid "Lucky for you, I'm a nice guy. Just don't pull that crap with me again."
msgstr ""
"Tu as de la chance, je suis sympa. Mais ne recommence pas ton cinéma avec "
"moi."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:264
msgid "I won't, baby, I promise."
msgstr "D'accord mon chou, c'est promis."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:265
msgid "I'm gonna put my foot in your ass, woman!"
msgstr "Tu vas te prendre un coup de pied au derrière, pauvre tache !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:266
msgid "No one talks to me like that! Die!"
msgstr "Personne ne me parle sur ce ton ! Prends ça !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:267
msgid "I've given you all the chances I'm gonna give ya. Now get out."
msgstr "Je t'ai laissé toutes tes chances. Maintenant, dégage d'ici."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:268
msgid "You're not going in my back room with that trash!"
msgstr "Pas question que tu viennes dans ma chambre avec cette merde !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:300
msgid ""
"Hey, I didn't fucking say I'd pay you to kill the bitch. Get the fuck out!"
msgstr ""
"Hé, je n'ai jamais dit que je te paierai pour tuer cette salope. Casse-toi "
"de là !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:350
msgid "Wow! Holy fuck. That was amazing."
msgstr "Hé ben Bon Dieu ! Ca c'était quelque chose !"

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:351
msgid "Damn, you were pretty good baby."
msgstr "Purée, t'étais pas mal mon chou."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:352
msgid "Thanks, it was fun. Now get out."
msgstr "Merci, c'était amusant. Maintenant, tire-toi."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:353
msgid "You were, uhhh... Never mind, get out."
msgstr "Tu étais wahou... Peu importe. Tire-toi."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:354
msgid "Well, I've never had worse than that."
msgstr "Putain ! Je parie qu'avec Billy ç'aurait été mieux qu'avec toi."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:400
msgid ""
"You know baby, you might be hot and all, but you've got lots and lots to "
"learn."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, mon chou, tu as peut-être le sang chaud et tout ça. Mais tu baises "
"vraiment mal. Tu peux peut-être te faire le petit Frankie un jour."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:410
msgid ""
"Baby, I do have work to do you know. I don't just stand around in this spot "
"all day and do nothing.\n"
" Well, okay, so what if I do? That's what I'm here to do."
msgstr ""
"Mon chou, j'ai du boulot tu sais. Je ne reste pas là toute la journée à rien "
"faire. Bon, d'accord, ça change rien de toute façon... C'est mon boulot."

#: dialog/dcfranki.msg:420
msgid "Look, I just wanted her still destroyed and you do it. Now beat it."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, je voulais simplement que son alambic soit détruit et tu l'as fait. "
"Maintenant casse-toi."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:101
msgid "You see Fred."
msgstr "Tu vois Fred."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:102
msgid "You see Fred, wearing very fine clothes."
msgstr "Tu vois Fred. Il porte des vêtements très raffinés."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:150
msgid "He seems to be busy thinking about something."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il réfléchit à quelque chose."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:151
msgid "He seems pretty happy with his fine new threads."
msgstr "Il a l'air content de ses nouvelles fringues."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:200
msgid "I'm going to make it big some day."
msgstr "Un jour, je serai riche."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:201
msgid "Oh, leave me alone. I'm busy."
msgstr "Oh, laisse-moi tranquille. J'ai des choses à faire."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:202
msgid "The master plan..."
msgstr "Le plan directeur..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:203
msgid "Going to figure it out some day..."
msgstr "Un jour, je trouverai la solution..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:204
msgid "Why do I always lose?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est-ce que je perds toujours ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:205
msgid "Tables must be rigged."
msgstr "Les tables doivent être truquées..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:206
msgid "...I'll own my own place some day."
msgstr "Un jour, je dirigerai ma propre affaire..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:207
msgid "Going to get nice clothes."
msgstr "J'aurai des beaux habits..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:220
msgid "Hey, man! It's late. Leave me alone."
msgstr "Hé ! Il est tard, mon vieux. Laisse-moi tranquille."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:221
msgid "No, I don't need any company."
msgstr "Non, je n'ai pas besoin de compagnie."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:222
msgid "Do you know what time it is?"
msgstr "Tu sais quelle heure il est ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:223
msgid "I don't have anything."
msgstr "Je n'ai rien."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:224
msgid "Bug me in the morning. I'm tired."
msgstr "J'ai sommeil. Reviens demain matin."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:226
msgid "No one's home."
msgstr "Y'a personne à la maison."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:227
msgid "Can't talk. I'm getting ready for bed."
msgstr "Je peux pas parler. Je vais me coucher."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:228
msgid "Hey, lady! It's late. Leave me alone."
msgstr "Hé, poupée ! Il est tard. Laisse-moi tranquille."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:240
msgid "No more money! Leave me alone."
msgstr "Plus d'argent ! Laisse-moi tranquille..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:241
msgid "There's no work. What am I going to do?"
msgstr "Y'a pas de boulot. Que vais-je devenir ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:242
msgid "Don't tell me I owe someone else! Ahh!"
msgstr "Ne me dis pas que j'ai des dettes ! Ah !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:243
msgid "I'm never going to make it big now."
msgstr "C'est foutu. Je serai jamais riche."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:244
msgid "I'm so broke."
msgstr "J'suis complètement fauché."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:245
msgid "Oh man, I need some cash."
msgstr "J'ai vraiment besoin de fric..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:246
msgid "I'll never get to buy new clothes now."
msgstr "Je pourrai jamais acheter des nouveaux habits..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:247
msgid "Got to get a new master plan..."
msgstr "Je dois trouver un nouveau plan directeur..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:260
msgid "Thanks for covering for me!"
msgstr "Merci. Heureusement que tu étais là."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:261
msgid "You're a real life saver."
msgstr "Tu m'as sauvé la vie."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:262
msgid "I'll have the money for you soon."
msgstr "Je te rendrai ton argent bientôt."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:263
msgid "I'll win it big anytime soon!"
msgstr "Je vais bientôt gagner gros."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:264
msgid "You're the first person I'll see when I win big."
msgstr "C'est toi que je viendrai voir quand j'aurai gagné le gros lot."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:275
msgid "Master plan is in action!"
msgstr "Le plan directeur est en action !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:276
msgid "Thanks for the loan! Your money's in good hands!"
msgstr "Merci pour le prêt ! Ton argent est entre de bonnes mains."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:277
msgid "Those tables sure are rough, but don't worry."
msgstr "T'en fais pas, les tables sont solides."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:278
msgid "I'll win big some day, thanks to you."
msgstr "Un jour, je gagnerai gros, grâce à toi."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:279
msgid "I'm due any day! I can feel it."
msgstr "C'est pour bientôt ! Je l'sens !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:280
msgid "I'm going to pay you back, I swear!"
msgstr "Je te rembourserai, je l'jure !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:281
msgid "I'm going to win it big soon. I can smell it."
msgstr "Je vais gagner gros très bientôt. Je l'sens !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:295
msgid "Huh? Do I know you? What do you want?"
msgstr "Hein ? On se connaît ? Que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:296
msgid ""
"Why do you keep bothering me? I don't even know you. Go bug someone else."
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi tu me lâches pas un peu ? Je te connais même pas. Va emmerder "
"quelqu'un d'autre."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:297
msgid "I'm here to collect some money you owe someone."
msgstr "Je viens chercher l'argent que tu dois à quelqu'un."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:299
msgid "Uk!"
msgstr "Uk !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:310
msgid ""
"HEY! There you are! I've been looking all over for you! Check out these "
"threads!"
msgstr "Hé ! Te voilà ! Je te cherchais partout ! Vise un peu ces fringues !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:311 dialog/gcfolk.msg:129
msgid "Thanks again."
msgstr "Encore merci !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:312
msgid "Looking very nice."
msgstr "Pas mal."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:313
msgid "You look like crap!"
msgstr "T'as l'air d'un sac !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:314
msgid "Yuk!"
msgstr "Berk !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:320
msgid ""
"Thank you. Thank you very much! Thanks to you, I have four sets just like "
"these!"
msgstr "Merci. Merci infiniment ! Grâce à toi, j'ai 4 jeux identiques !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:321
msgid "So you won it big after all?"
msgstr "Alors, tu es riche, finalement ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:322
msgid "So, where's my money?"
msgstr "Alors, où est mon argent ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:330
msgid ""
"You don't like my threads? You know, I think you're right. I don't like them "
"either. Time for some new ones - I can afford it!"
msgstr ""
"Tu n'aimes pas mes fringues ? Tu as raison. Moi non plus. Je vais renouveler "
"ma garde-robe. Je peux me le permettre !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:331
msgid "So, you won it big after all?"
msgstr "Alors, tu es riche, finalement ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:332
msgid "Where's my money?"
msgstr "Où est mon argent ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:333 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:293 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:351
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr "Hum."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:340
msgid ""
"I was getting there! Won't even let me bask in my glory? I worked hard for "
"this you know."
msgstr ""
"J'allais y venir ! Laisse-moi savourer ma victoire ! J'ai travaillé dur pour "
"y arriver."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:341
msgid "I know, I'm sorry."
msgstr "Je sais. Je regrette."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:342
msgid "Screw that. Where's the money I covered you for?"
msgstr "Va t'faire ! Où est l'argent que je t'ai prêté ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:343
msgid "I don't give a crap. Where's my money?"
msgstr "J'en ai rien à battre ! Où est mon argent ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:350
msgid ""
"Fine. Here. [Fred gives you $500] There's a little extra for trusting me. "
"Well, see you later. Thanks again."
msgstr ""
"Bon. Voilà. [Fred te donne $500.] Voici un petit bonus pour m'avoir fait "
"confiance. A plus tard. Merci encore."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:352
msgid "What ever."
msgstr "Bref."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:360
msgid ""
"Thanks a lot for covering for me. It really meant a lot to me, to be trusted "
"by a complete stranger. Let me give you this."
msgstr ""
"Merci pour ton aide. C'est important pour moi d'avoir obtenu la confiance "
"d'une personne complètement étrangère. Je voudrais te donner ceci..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:362 dialog/dcfred.msg:372
msgid "You shouldn't have."
msgstr "Tu n'aurais pas dû."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:370
msgid ""
"I owe you a lot. You trusted me when I was down on my luck. As a small "
"gesture of gratitude I have something for you."
msgstr ""
"Je te dois beaucoup. Tu m'as fait confiance quand la chance m'a abandonné. "
"J'ai un petit quelque chose pour toi en témoignage de ma gratitude."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:380
msgid ""
"Here. [Fred give you $1000.] I hope this helps. I'm sure you'll find "
"someplace to spend it."
msgstr ""
"Voilà. [Fred te donne $1 000.] J'espère que ça t'aidera. Tu sauras "
"l'utiliser à bon escient je n'en doute pas."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:381 dialog/dcfred.msg:391
msgid "Sorry, I can't accept this."
msgstr "Je regrette, je ne peux pas accepter."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:383 dialog/dcfred.msg:393
msgid "Not really, but I'll take it."
msgstr "C'est pas sûr, mais je l'accepte."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:384 dialog/dcfred.msg:394 dialog/ncangbis.msg:224
msgid "Yum."
msgstr "Miam."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:390
msgid ""
"Here. [Fred gives you $2000, 5 Fusion Cells, 5 Energy Cells, and a Plasma "
"Grenade.] I hope this helps, at least a little."
msgstr ""
"Voilà. [Fred te donne $2 000, 5 Cellules à Fusion, 5 Cellules Energétiques, "
"et une Grenade à Plasma.] Ca t'aidera peut-être un peu."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:392 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:532
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Merci infiniment."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:400
msgid ""
"What? Well, okay, if you insist. Thank you so very much. Take good care of "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? D'accord, si tu insistes. Merci infiniment. Prends bien soin de toi."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:410
msgid ""
"What? You doing some strange drug? You don't look like a jethead. Get away "
"from me you freak."
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? Tu prends des trucs ? Pourtant, t'as pas l'air de quelqu'un qui plane "
"au Jet. Ne t'approche pas de moi, sale junkie !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:411
msgid "Beat it!"
msgstr "Casse-toi !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:420
msgid ""
"What are you talking about? I don't owe anyone anything. Who the hell are "
"you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"De quoi tu parles ? Je ne dois rien à personne. De qui parles-tu bon sang ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:421
msgid ""
"Yea, you said that last time. I don't know what you're talking about? Who's "
"this imaginary person again?"
msgstr ""
"Ouais, t'as dit ça la dernière fois. Je ne sais pas de quoi tu parles. Tu te "
"fais des films."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:422
msgid "Becky says you owe her $500"
msgstr "Babeth dit que tu lui dois $500."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:423
msgid "Becky sent me."
msgstr "C'est Babeth qui m'envoie."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:424
msgid "Rebecca says she lent you $200."
msgstr "Elisabeth dit qu'elle t'a prêté $200."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:430
msgid "Oh yeah, right. Rebecca lent me $200... Oh, wait. Maybe- ummm..."
msgstr "Ah, ouais. Elisabeth m'a prêté $200... Oh, attends. Peut-être... hum..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:431
msgid "She's told me to break your neck if you don't pay."
msgstr "Elle m'a dit de te casser la figure si tu ne payais pas."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:432
msgid "Hand it over."
msgstr "Allez, donne-moi l'argent."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:440
msgid "Yeah, right. I've never seen that much money before in my life."
msgstr "Ouais, c'est ça. J'ai jamais vu autant d'argent de ma vie."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:441 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:212 dialog/kcardin.msg:331
#: dialog/rcgenpes.msg:135
msgid "Hmmm."
msgstr "Hum !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:442 dialog/dclara.msg:322 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:342
#: dialog/dcrebecc.msg:471 dialog/dctyler.msg:418 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:435
#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:648 dialog/rcmarion.msg:132
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "Oh !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:450
msgid ""
"Right! That'll be the day. Becky wouldn't hurt a fly. She sure is pretty "
"though."
msgstr ""
"Et puis quoi encore ! Babeth ne ferait pas de mal à une mouche. Elle est pas "
"mal par contre..."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:451
msgid "Well, you're wrong, asshole."
msgstr "T'as tort, espèce de trou duc."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:452
msgid "Maybe it was someone else."
msgstr "C'était peut-être quelqu'un d'autre."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:460
msgid ""
"Damn. I think you're right, but - I'm almost broke. I can't afford that kind "
"of money! I've got to eat you know."
msgstr ""
"Merde. Tu as raison, mais... Je suis presque à sec. Je ne peux pas me "
"permettre de sortir cet argent ! Il faut que je mange moi, tu comprends ?!"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:461 dialog/dclara.msg:572 dialog/dcmaggie.msg:199
#: dialog/dcsheila.msg:155 dialog/hcjacob.msg:227 dialog/hcjacob.msg:229
#: dialog/shtandi.msg:294
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Pardon."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:462
msgid "Tough luck."
msgstr "Pas de chance, c'est pas ton jour hein ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:470
msgid ""
"Oh, damn it. I can barely afford $100. Could you spot me half? I promise "
"I'll pay you back!"
msgstr ""
"Oh merde... J'ai à peine $100. Tu peux m'avancer le reste ? J'te promets que "
"j'te l'rendrai !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:471
msgid "No sorry."
msgstr "Non, je regrette."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:472
msgid "Come on. Pay up the full amount!"
msgstr "Allez... Paie le tout !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:473
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr "D'accord, c'est bon."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:480
msgid ""
"Damn it. You're going to ruin me! Well, okay, here. Now I'm completely broke."
msgstr ""
"Merde ! Tu vas me ruiner ! Bon, d'accord. Voilà. Je suis complètement à sec "
"maintenant."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:481
msgid "Oh, fine. I'll cover you."
msgstr "Oh, d'accord. Je t'avance."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:482
msgid "Thanks. Manage your money better next time."
msgstr "Merci. Gère mieux ton argent la prochaine fois."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:483
msgid "Thank you for your business."
msgstr "Merci pour tout."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:490
msgid ""
"I told you! I can't! I'll starve if I do. Oh, come on, can't you help me out?"
msgstr ""
"Je te l'ai dit ! Je peux pas ! Sinon je vais mourir de faim. Oh, allez, tu "
"peux pas m'aider ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:491
msgid "All right. I'll cover half of it."
msgstr "D'accord. Je t'avance la moitié."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:492
msgid "No sorry. I don't have the cash either."
msgstr "Non, je regrette. J'ai pas d'argent sur moi non plus."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:493 dialog/dcsheila.msg:160 dialog/ecfarmer.msg:135
#: dialog/echomest.msg:135 dialog/fcchip.msg:128 dialog/fcdrshng.msg:302
#: dialog/fcdrshng.msg:331 game/combatai.msg:2306 game/combatai.msg:36801
msgid "I'll be back."
msgstr "Je reviendrai."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:500
msgid ""
"What? Really? Wow! Thanks a lot, man! Here's a $100. I'll get the other $100 "
"to you as soon as possible!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? C'est vrai ? Super ! Merci mon pote ! Voilà $100. Je te rendrai les "
"autres $100 dès que possible !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:501
msgid ""
"What? Really? Wow! Thanks a lot, lady! Here's a $100. I'll get the other $"
"100 to you as soon as possible!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? C'est vrai ? Super ! Merci poupée ! Voilà $100. Je te rendrai les "
"autres $100 dès que possible !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:502 dialog/dcfred.msg:551 dialog/dclara.msg:291
#: dialog/epac10.msg:1406 dialog/epac10.msg:1904 dialog/epac17.msg:511
#: dialog/epac2.msg:412 dialog/hcfrank.msg:155 dialog/hcguard2.msg:231
#: dialog/hcmarcus.msg:206 dialog/hcrsuper.msg:153 dialog/hcsuper.msg:153
#: dialog/nhmyron.msg:508 dialog/tribec1.msg:442 dialog/tribec1.msg:452
#: dialog/vcdrtroy.msg:230
msgid "No problem."
msgstr "Pas de problème."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:503
msgid "You better pay me back."
msgstr "Tu as intérêt à me rembourser."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:510
msgid ""
"Oh, don't worry. I will! You have my word and I won't forget about it this "
"time!"
msgstr ""
"Oh, ne t'en fais pas. Tu as ma parole et cette fois, je n'oublierai pas."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:520
msgid ""
"Say, you know what? That hundred's really going to uh... delay things. Do "
"you think I could borrow a little bit back?"
msgstr ""
"Au fait, tu sais quoi ? Ces $100 vont vraiment, euh... retarder les choses. "
"Tu crois que je pourrais en réemprunter une partie."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:521 dialog/dcjoey.msg:200 dialog/dclara.msg:442
#: dialog/fcdrfung.msg:113 dialog/fcdrfung.msg:116 dialog/hcdoc.msg:114
#: dialog/hcdoc.msg:117 dialog/tribemer.msg:275 dialog/zccrpdel.msg:153
msgid "How much?"
msgstr "Combien ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:530
msgid ""
"Wait! I know. Tell you what, I'll give you $100 and you spot me for the "
"other $100 I owe Becky. I'll pay you back real soon."
msgstr ""
"Attends. Ecoute, je te donne $100 et tu paies les $100 restants que je dois "
"à Babeth. Je te les rendrai très bientôt."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:531 dialog/dcfred.msg:613
msgid "Okay fine."
msgstr "D'accord, c'est bon."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:532 dialog/fclaocho.msg:453 dialog/fclaocho.msg:482
#: dialog/tribemer.msg:285 dialog/tribemer.msg:352
msgid "No deal."
msgstr "Pas question."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:540
msgid "Just $50. Please! It's all part of the master plan!"
msgstr "$50 seulement. Je t'en prie ! Ca fait partie du plan directeur !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:542
msgid "But that'll only leave me with $50 to pay your $200 loan."
msgstr "Ca me laisse seulement $50 pour payer ton prêt de $200."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:550
msgid "Wha- uh... Damn! You won't regret this! I'm good for it!"
msgstr "Quoi ? Heu... merde ! Tu ne le regretteras pas ! J'assure !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:560
msgid ""
"Uh, yeah. I see your math skills- I mean, please! It's not much to you I'm "
"sure, but it's a hell of a lot for me."
msgstr ""
"Heu, ouais. Je vois que tu sais compter. Je t'en prie ! C'est presque rien "
"pour toi, mais c'est énorme pour moi."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:570
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure she did. Everyone knows she hates that name. You're not fooling "
"me!"
msgstr ""
"Ouais, bien sûr. Tout le monde sait qu'elle déteste ce nom. C'est pas "
"nouveau !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:571
msgid "I don't owe her anything."
msgstr "Je ne lui dois rien."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:572
msgid "She said you were forgetful."
msgstr "Elle a dit que tu avais la mémoire courte."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:573
msgid "Look, I don't have time for this. Pay up damn it!"
msgstr "Ecoute, je n'ai pas de temps à perdre. Paie, merde !"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:574
msgid "Rebecca said she lent it to you a while ago."
msgstr "Elisabeth a dit qu'elle te l'avait prêté il y a quelque temps."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:580
msgid ""
"I am not! I... wait. There was that one time. Didn't I pay her back? I "
"thought I did..."
msgstr ""
"Non ! Ecoute... Attends. Ah, cette fois-là... Je ne l'ai pas remboursée ? Je "
"croyais que oui."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:581
msgid "No, you didn't. That's why she sent me."
msgstr "Non. C'est pour ça qu'elle m'envoie."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:582
msgid "Just pay up so I can get out of here."
msgstr "Aboule le fric que j'me casse."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:590
msgid ""
"I don't remember... but Becky sure has helped me and my friends out in the "
"past."
msgstr ""
"Je ne me souviens pas. Mais Babeth a aidé mes amis et moi-même par le passé, "
"c'est sûr."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:591
msgid "Hand over the $200."
msgstr "Aboule les $200."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:592
msgid "Just give me the money."
msgstr "Donne-moi ce fric."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:601 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:564 dialog/dcsheila.msg:154
#: dialog/dcsheila.msg:188 dialog/dctubfri.msg:278 dialog/dcvic.msg:195
#: dialog/epac2.msg:411 dialog/fclaocho.msg:156 dialog/fcoz9.msg:172
#: dialog/hczaius.msg:161 dialog/ncangbis.msg:521 dialog/nhmyron.msg:3025
#: dialog/scslvovr.msg:124 dialog/scwestin.msg:164
msgid "Whatever."
msgstr "Peu importe."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:610
msgid ""
"Uh. Hi again. So, uh, I suppose you want the money. Do you think you could "
"cover me for half?"
msgstr ""
"Heu... Salut ! Alors, je suppose que tu veux le fric. Tu crois que tu peux "
"m'avancer la moitié ?"

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:611 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:257 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:392
#: dialog/dctyler.msg:482 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:490 dialog/epac17.msg:592
#: dialog/hcfranci.msg:149
msgid "No, sorry."
msgstr "Non, désolé."

#: dialog/dcfred.msg:612
msgid "If she lent you $200, you'll pay it."
msgstr "Si elle te prête $200, faut que tu rembourses."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:150
msgid "He's one of Tyler's guards."
msgstr "Tu vois l'un des gardes de Tyler."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:151
msgid "She's one of Tyler's guards."
msgstr "C'est une des gardes de Tyler."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:200
msgid "You still alive?"
msgstr "T'es encore en vie ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:210
msgid "We showed them, didn't we?"
msgstr "On leur a donné une bonne leçon, hein ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:211
msgid "No one messes with us."
msgstr "Personne ne vient nous emmerder."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:212
msgid "We kicked ass."
msgstr "On a bien assuré !"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:213
msgid "About time we finished them off."
msgstr "C'est le moment de les achever !"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:214
msgid "I can't forget the look on his face. It was great."
msgstr "Je n'oublierai jamais son regard. C'était génial."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:215
msgid "I'm surprised Metzger didn't get pissed."
msgstr "C'est bizarre que Metzger ne se soit pas énervé."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:216
msgid "I wonder why Metzger didn't step in."
msgstr "Je me demande pourquoi Metzger n'est pas intervenu."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:225
msgid "I don't know why Metzger has us guard this shit."
msgstr "Je sais pas pourquoi Metzger nous fait garder cette merde."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:226
msgid "Who's going to try and steal this crap?"
msgstr "Qui pourrait essayer de voler ça ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:227
msgid "This job is a cakewalk."
msgstr "Ce boulot, c'est du tout cuit."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:228
msgid "No one ever messes with us."
msgstr "Faut pas nous chercher."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:229
msgid "I think this stuff came from a Vault or something."
msgstr "Ca doit venir d'un Abri ou d'un truc comme ça."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:230
msgid "What are you looking for anyway?"
msgstr "Que cherches-tu, au fait ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:231
msgid "There's nothing in here but us mice."
msgstr "Il n'y a rien ici, à part nous et les souris."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:232
msgid "Don't waste your time, we've checked this stuff over a million times."
msgstr "Ne perds pas ton temps, on a déjà regardé ce truc des millions de fois."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:233
msgid "Tonight's the night."
msgstr "Ce soir, c'est le grand soir."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:234 dialog/dcg2grd.msg:257
msgid "I hate waiting."
msgstr "J'ai horreur d'attendre."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:235
msgid "I'll pass up drinks for this anytime."
msgstr "Pour ça, je laisserais bien tomber l'alcool."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:236
msgid "Is it time yet? I can hardly wait."
msgstr "Ca y est ? Je meurs d'impatience !"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:237
msgid "I hope I get the first kill."
msgstr "J'espère que c'est moi qui ferai la première victime."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:238
msgid "Why did they wait until now to mess with us?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ils ont attendu pour nous emmerder ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:239
msgid "This is going to be interesting."
msgstr "Ca promet d'être intéressant."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:240
msgid "Too bad we didn't get any action after all."
msgstr "Dommage qu'on ait pas eu beaucoup d'action !"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:241
msgid "I wonder why they changed their minds."
msgstr "J'me demande pourquoi ils ont changé d'avis."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:242
msgid "All that waiting and nothing."
msgstr "Toute cette attente pour rien."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:243
msgid "So what ever happened to that trap you were going to help us set?"
msgstr "Qu'est-il arrivé à ce guet-apens que tu devais nous aider à organiser ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:244
msgid "What happened the other night?"
msgstr "Que s'est-il passé la nuit dernière ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:245
msgid ""
"Too bad those cowards chickened out. It would have been nice to finish them "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Dommage que ces mauviettes se soient dégonflées, on les aurait volontiers "
"achevées."

#: dialog/dcg1grd.msg:246
msgid "Can't believe those bastards were going to try and ambush us."
msgstr ""
"Je n'arrive pas à croire que ces salauds voulaient nous tendre une embuscade "
"!"

#: dialog/dcg1grd2.msg:101
msgid "He's Tyler's friend."
msgstr "C'est l'ami de Tyler."

#: dialog/dcg1grd2.msg:110
msgid "You here to party?"
msgstr "T'es de la fête ?"

#: dialog/dcg1grd2.msg:111
msgid "*hickup* Brews on me!"
msgstr "<Hic> Une bière pour moi !"

#: dialog/dcg1grd2.msg:112
msgid "Hooker's in the back if you want a ride."
msgstr "Y'a de la défonce au fond si tu veux planer."

#: dialog/dcg1grd2.msg:120
msgid "Nobody fucks up a party when I am around."
msgstr "Personne n'osera foutre en l'air la soirée si je suis là."

#: dialog/dcg1grd2.msg:130
msgid "We showed those fuckers... Ruining *hickup* a good party and all."
msgstr ""
"Vais montrer à ces connards... Réduire en charp... <Hic> c'est une bonne "
"fête après tous."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:100
msgid "You see a gangster."
msgstr "Tu vois une espèce de gangster."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:150
msgid "He seems to be a member of Lara's gang."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il fait partie de la bande de Lara."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:151
msgid "She seems to be a member of Lara's gang."
msgstr "On dirait qu'elle fait partie de la bande de Lara."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:200
msgid "Wise guy."
msgstr "Très prudent."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:201 dialog/dcslaver.msg:200 dialog/slvcc2.msg:200
#: dialog/slvcc5.msg:200
msgid "There you are."
msgstr "Ah te voilà."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:202
msgid "Pay back."
msgstr "Tu vas le payer !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:203 dialog/gcharold.msg:310 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:333
#: dialog/qhprzrch.msg:332
msgid "Come here."
msgstr "Viens ici."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:204
msgid "I'm not through with you."
msgstr "J'en ai pas fini avec toi."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:205 dialog/ncbitch.msg:406 dialog/ncprosti.msg:233
msgid "Bitch."
msgstr "Salope."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:225
msgid "Wonder how long things will last around here with Metzger gone?"
msgstr "J'me demande comment les choses vont tourner sans Metzger."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:226
msgid "So, Metzger's finally dead?"
msgstr "Alors, Metzger est mort ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:227
msgid "Was that your handiwork?"
msgstr "C'est ton oeuvre ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:228
msgid "The Den'll never be the same again."
msgstr "La Fosse ne sera plus jamais comme avant."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:240
msgid "I can't believe it, we actually beat them!"
msgstr "Je n'arrive pas à le croire, on les a enfin eus !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:241
msgid "Metzger's got to show us respect now."
msgstr "Maintenant, il faut que Metzger nous traite avec respect."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:242
msgid "We sure showed them."
msgstr "On leur a donné une bonne leçon."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:243
msgid "We gave 'em our own brand of justice."
msgstr "On leur a montré la justice de notre cru."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:244
msgid "We couldn't have done it without you!"
msgstr "On n'y serait jamais arrivés sans toi !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:245
msgid "Thank you for your help!"
msgstr "Merci de nous avoir aidés !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:246 dialog/dclara.msg:530
msgid "We did it!"
msgstr "On les a eus !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:247
msgid "You screwing around with us?"
msgstr "Tu nous cherches ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:248
msgid "Better watch your step."
msgstr "Fais gaffe !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:249
msgid "Lara's the only reason we don't string you up right now."
msgstr "Heureusement que Lara est là, sinon on te pendrait !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:250
msgid "What were you trying to pull?"
msgstr "Qu'essayais-tu de viser ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:251
msgid "Coward."
msgstr "Mauviette !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:252
msgid "You make me sick."
msgstr "Tu m'dégoûtes."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:253 dialog/vcgatgrd.msg:117 dialog/vcskeeve.msg:105
msgid "Get lost."
msgstr "Casse-toi !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:255
msgid "We're ready when you are."
msgstr "C'est quand tu veux."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:256
msgid "It's about time we pay them back."
msgstr "C'est le moment de leur faire payer."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:258
msgid "Let's go already."
msgstr "Allons-y !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:259
msgid "You ready yet?"
msgstr "On peut y aller ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:260
msgid "Just let Lara know when it's time."
msgstr "Quand c'est le moment, dis-le à Lara."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:270
msgid "You looking to join up?"
msgstr "Tu veux nous rejoindre ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:271
msgid "You must be here to see Lara."
msgstr "Tu dois être ici pour voir Lara ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:273
msgid "Lara's the person you should be talking to."
msgstr "Tu devrais t'adresser à Lara."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:275
msgid "You here to see Lara?"
msgstr "T'es là pour voir Lara ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:302
msgid "Hope things are going good."
msgstr "J'espère que les affaires vont bien."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:303
msgid "So you might be able to help us out?"
msgstr "Alors, il paraît que tu pourrais nous aider ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:304
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "Ca fait plaisir de t'voir."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:305
msgid "We'll pay back Tyler soon..."
msgstr "Bientôt, on va le faire payer à Tyler..."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:306
msgid "Any new developments?"
msgstr "Du nouveau ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:310
msgid "Thanks for the help. Too bad about Lara."
msgstr "Merci de ton aide. C'est dommage pour Lara."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:311
msgid "We finally got em!"
msgstr "On les a eus, enfin !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:312
msgid "We couldn't have done this without you."
msgstr "On n'y serait jamais arrivés sans toi !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:313
msgid "At least Lara went out in fight."
msgstr "Au moins, Lara se s'ra battue jusqu'au bout."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:314
msgid "I can't believe Lara didn't make it."
msgstr "Je n'arrive pas à croire que Lara y soit restée."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:315
msgid "We sure showed Metzger who's best."
msgstr "On a montré à Metzger qu'on était les meilleurs."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:316
msgid "Metzger's better off with us."
msgstr "Metzger s'en sortira mieux avec nous."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:350
msgid "You said it!"
msgstr "Tu as raison !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:351
msgid "They're dead meat!"
msgstr "Ils sont foutus."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:352
msgid "We're going to kick some serious ass!"
msgstr "On va leur mettre la pâtée !"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:400
msgid "We kicked serious ass! We'll be over at the church if you need us."
msgstr "On leur a bien botté le cul ! On sera à l'église si tu nous cherches."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:500
msgid ""
"Shit, I can't believe we lost Lara. We took care of the skeleton crew here, "
"but Tyler and his crew are still alive.\n"
" If we attack them now during their party over in the Residential area, "
"we're sure to catch them off guard. Let's finish this job. You still in?"
msgstr ""
"Merde, je peux pas croire que Lara soit morte. On s'est fait une bonne "
"partie de la bande, mais Tyler et ses potes sont toujours en vie. Si nous "
"les attaquons pendant leur fête dans la Zone Résidentielle, ils ne seront "
"pas sur leurs gardes. Finissons ce travail. T'es toujours partant ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:501 dialog/dclara.msg:701
msgid "Let me heal first. I'll tell you when I am ready."
msgstr "Laisse-moi un moment pour me soigner. J'te dirai quand je serai prêt."

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:510 dialog/dclara.msg:710
msgid "You ready to take Tyler and his crew out?"
msgstr "T'es prêt à défoncer Tyler et ses potes ?"

#: dialog/dcg2grd.msg:520
msgid "Hey, don't stray too far. We need to finish this tonight."
msgstr "Hé, te barre pas trop loin. On doit finir ça cette nuit."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:100 dialog/rcgamble.msg:100
msgid "You see a gambler."
msgstr "Tu vois un joueur."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:101
msgid "This gambler seems to be doing extremely well."
msgstr "On dirait que cette personne a beaucoup de chance."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:102
msgid "He seems to be winning, but all his money is on the table."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il gagne, mais il a misé tout son argent."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:103
msgid "She seems to be winning, but all her money is on the table."
msgstr "On dirait qu'elle gagne, mais elle a misé tout son argent."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:104
msgid "This person doesn't seem to be winning or losing."
msgstr "Cette personne ne perd pas mais elle ne gagne pas non plus."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:105
msgid "This person hasn't won in a while."
msgstr "Cette personne n'a pas gagné depuis longtemps."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:106
msgid "She looks like she's about to cry and seems to almost be out of money."
msgstr "Elle a l'air d'être au bord des larmes et presque à court d'argent."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:107
msgid "He looks very angry and seems to be losing big."
msgstr "Il a l'air très en colère et on dirait qu'il perd gros."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:200 dialog/dcslave.msg:332 dialog/dctubfri.msg:460
#: dialog/fcskids.msg:131 dialog/hcfemale.msg:221 dialog/hcmale.msg:221
#: dialog/slvcc4.msg:332
msgid "Don't hurt me!"
msgstr "Ne me fais pas mal."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:201 dialog/dcgamble.msg:402
msgid "Don't shoot!"
msgstr "Ne tire pas !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:202
msgid "I don't have any money!"
msgstr "Je n'ai pas d'argent !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:203
msgid "Why did you have to kill poor Becky?"
msgstr "Pourquoi as-tu tué la pauvre Babeth ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:205
msgid "I didn't do anything!"
msgstr "J'ai rien fait !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:206
msgid "Please go, I won't tell."
msgstr "Va-t'en. Je ne dirai rien."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:300
msgid "Yes! The dice love me!"
msgstr "Oui ! La chance me sourit !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:301
msgid "Oh, that was close."
msgstr "Oh, c'était tout juste !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:302
msgid "Don't interrupt me. You'll ruin my winning streak."
msgstr "Ne m'interromps pas, tu vas faire partir ma chance !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:303
msgid "I'm hot!"
msgstr "J'ai chaud !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:304
msgid "Money, money, money!"
msgstr "Ah ! Le pouvoir de l'argent !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:305
msgid "I love this game!"
msgstr "Je l'adore ce jeu !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:306
msgid "You see that! Yes!"
msgstr "Tu as vu ça ! Oui !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:307
msgid "Roulette is the game to play!"
msgstr "La roulette, c'est le meilleur jeu qui existe !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:308
msgid "I'm doing pretty good, how about you?"
msgstr "Ca marche bien pour moi, et pour toi ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:309
msgid "I'm doing better than normal."
msgstr "Je fais mieux que d'habitude."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:310
msgid "Great place don't you think?"
msgstr "Super endroit, tu trouves pas ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:311
msgid "Becky's tables are better than New Reno."
msgstr "Les tables de jeu de Babeth sont mieux qu'à New Reno."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:312
msgid "You like this game? It's a lot of fun."
msgstr "Tu aimes ce jeu ? C'est vraiment délirant !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:313
msgid "I haven't had a good roll in a while."
msgstr "J'ai rien gagné depuis longtemps."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:314
msgid "I need a good roll."
msgstr "Que la chance soit avec moi !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:315
msgid "Well, at least I'm not losing."
msgstr "Au moins, je ne perds pas."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:316 dialog/vcmclure.msg:163
msgid "I'm not going anywhere."
msgstr "J'arrive à rien."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:317
msgid "I'm just breaking even."
msgstr "J'arrive à peine à m'en sortir !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:318
msgid "You've got to play the numbers."
msgstr "Il faut jouer sur les nombres."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:319
msgid "Just betting on the red or black is bad odds."
msgstr "Ca diminue les chances de jouer que le rouge ou le noir."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:320
msgid "The dice aren't behaving."
msgstr "Les dés ne sont pas bons."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:321
msgid "I'm down and it's not looking good."
msgstr "Je suis au plus bas et ça se présente mal."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:322
msgid "I hope you do better than I."
msgstr "J'espère que tu feras mieux que moi."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:323
msgid "I've seen better days."
msgstr "J'ai connu des jours meilleurs."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:324
msgid "I know how to play, honest."
msgstr "Je sais comment jouer, sérieux."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:325
msgid "The ball's not bouncing my way today."
msgstr "La boule ne réagit pas en ma faveur aujourd'hui."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:326
msgid "Another payday lost for good."
msgstr "Un autre jour de paie perdu à jamais..."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:327
msgid "I'm almost broke!"
msgstr "Je suis presque à sec !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:328
msgid "Damn it. This sucks."
msgstr "Merde ! Ca craint !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:329
msgid "Why does this always happen to me?"
msgstr "Pourquoi moi ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:330
msgid "I can't win."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas gagner."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:331
msgid "I hate this game."
msgstr "Je l'déteste ce jeu."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:400
msgid "Damn, Becky's was the only place to gamble around here!"
msgstr "Merde ! Le seul endroit où on pouvait jouer, c'était chez Babeth."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:401
msgid "Stay away."
msgstr "T'approche pas !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:403
msgid "Please leave us alone."
msgstr "Laisse-nous tranquille."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:500
msgid "Don't stop there."
msgstr "T'arrête pas là."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:501
msgid "Keep moving."
msgstr "Ne t'arrête pas."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:502
msgid "COME ON 7!"
msgstr "ALLEZ, LE 7 !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:503 dialog/dcgamble.msg:508 dialog/dcslave.msg:423
#: dialog/hcliz.msg:119 dialog/hcprof.msg:111 dialog/ncresear.msg:252
#: game/combatai.msg:41366
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr "Oui !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:504
msgid "Keep it coming!"
msgstr "Allez, continue... Vas-y !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:505
msgid "Becky! I'm going to take all your money today!"
msgstr "Babeth, je vais rafler tout ton argent ce soir !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:506
msgid "Woohoo! Winner!"
msgstr "Youpiiiii ! Gagné !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:507
msgid "Give me another good bounce!"
msgstr "Allez, fais-moi gagner... Encore plus !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:509
msgid "All right!"
msgstr "Très bien !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:510
msgid "Again, let's see that again."
msgstr "Allez, encore une fois."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:511
msgid "Come on."
msgstr "Allez."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:512
msgid "That's what I wanted."
msgstr "C'est ce que je voulais."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:513
msgid "Almost."
msgstr "Presque."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:514 dialog/dcrnslvr.msg:320 dialog/dctyler.msg:413
#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4708
msgid "Not bad."
msgstr "Pas mal."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:515
msgid "How did that happen?"
msgstr "Comment c'est arrivé ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:517
msgid "No whammies, no whammies. Stop!"
msgstr "Ah, c'est pas vrai ! Stop !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:518
msgid "Well, the game lives up to its name."
msgstr "Eh bien, ce jeu porte bien son nom."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:519
msgid "I just need one big win."
msgstr "Il faut que je gagne le paquet."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:520
msgid "Figures!"
msgstr "C'est bien ma veine !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:521
msgid "Again?"
msgstr "Encore ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:522
msgid "This isn't looking good."
msgstr "Ca ne se présente pas bien."

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:523
msgid "Roulette sucks!"
msgstr "La roulette, c'est nul !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:524
msgid "Becky! You're tables are killing me!"
msgstr "Babeth ! Tes tables de jeu me tueront !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:525
msgid "Are those loaded dice or what?"
msgstr "Ces dés sont pipés ou quoi ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:526
msgid "Not again!"
msgstr "Encore ?!"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:527 dialog/rcgamble.msg:106 dialog/tribec1.msg:351
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr "Pourquoi moi ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:528
msgid "Damn it! So close!"
msgstr "Merde ! C'était si près !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:529
msgid "Oh sweet sweet Jesus, KILL ME NOW!"
msgstr "Oh, doux Jésus, TUE-MOI MAINTENANT !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:530
msgid "I hate this game!"
msgstr "Je l'déteste ce jeu !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:531
msgid "Damn! That was my number on the last spin!"
msgstr "Merde ! C'était quoi mon chiffre sur le dernier jeu ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:532
msgid "Black again!?!?"
msgstr "Noir, encore ?!!"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:601
msgid "Why did you do that?"
msgstr "Pourquoi as-tu fait ça ?"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:603
msgid "Stop it, I'm fragile."
msgstr "Arrête, je suis fragile !"

#: dialog/dcgamble.msg:604
msgid "I wouldn't do that to you."
msgstr "Je ne te ferai jamais ça !"

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:100
msgid "You see an intimidating ruffian."
msgstr "Tu vois une brute intimidante."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:101
msgid "You see a guard of the Den."
msgstr "Tu vois un garde de la Fosse."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:102
msgid "Not now; I'm on duty."
msgstr "Pas maintenant. Je suis de service."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:103
msgid "I cannot speak to you."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas te parler."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:104 dialog/ecrobin.msg:106
msgid "Please go away."
msgstr "Va-t'en s'il te plaît."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:105
msgid "Do not bother me."
msgstr "Ne me dérange pas."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:106
msgid "Please see my boss."
msgstr "Va voir mon patron."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:107
msgid "I am not allowed to answer your questions."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas autorisé à répondre à tes questions."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:108
msgid "You must cease bothering me."
msgstr "Arrête de me déranger."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:109
msgid "I just work here."
msgstr "Je travaille juste ici."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:110
msgid "I know nothing."
msgstr "Je ne sais rien."

#: dialog/dcgengrd.msg:111
msgid "I speak only to my boss."
msgstr "Je ne parle qu'à mon patron."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:101
msgid "You see Joey."
msgstr "Tu vois Joey."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:150
msgid "This guy doesn't look too friendly."
msgstr "Ce gars là n'a pas l'air très commode."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:152
msgid "I'm gonna cut you up, fucker!"
msgstr "Hé, je vais te tailler en pièces !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:153
msgid "Yeah? Come on and try."
msgstr "Ah ouais ? Essaie un peu pour voir !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:154
msgid "Hey, wait just one minute!"
msgstr "Hé, attends une minute !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:155
msgid "I'd think twice if I were you."
msgstr "Si j'étais toi, je réfléchirais."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:156
msgid ""
"What do you want? Why shouldn't I just kill you rather than listen\n"
" to your bullshit after what you've done?"
msgstr ""
"Que veux-tu ? Je devrais te tuer au lieu d'écouter tes conneries après ce "
"que t'as fait !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:157
msgid "I want to talk to you about a ghost that comes around here at night."
msgstr "Je veux te parler d'un fantôme qui vient de temps en temps ici la nuit."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:158
msgid "Did you take a locket from the haunted house?"
msgstr "As-tu pris un médaillon dans la maison hantée ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:159
msgid "Never mind. I'll just kick your ass instead."
msgstr "Tant pis. On va se battre."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:160
msgid "Nothing. Just passing through."
msgstr "Rien. Je passais par là."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:161 dialog/epac5.msg:221 dialog/gcwooz.msg:152
#: dialog/tribec12.msg:311
msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr "Mais de quoi parles-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:162
msgid "Did you steal a locket from that haunted house?"
msgstr "As-tu volé un médaillon dans la maison hantée ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:164
msgid "Forget it. I'll kill you now and sort out the pieces later."
msgstr ""
"Laisse tomber. Je vais juste libérer ton âme de ses barrières terrestres."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:165
msgid "I-I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr "Je sais pas de quoi tu parles."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:166
msgid ""
"Oh, I think you do! You stole a dead girl's locket, and now her spirit can't "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais ce que t'as fait, t'as volé le médaillon d'une fille morte, et "
"maintenant, son fantôme doit errer sur terre tant que tu n'as pas rendu le "
"bijou."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:167
msgid "Then I'll take it by force."
msgstr "Alors, je te le prendrai de force !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:168
msgid ""
"T-That's f-fucking crazy! Y-you must h-have been r-really fucked up on some "
"of Tubby's shit. I-I n-never s-saw no g-ghost w-when I stayed t-there- just "
"a bad trip, wasn't f-fucking real."
msgstr ""
"C'est absurde ! Tu dois vraiment être en train de planer avec une des merdes "
"que t'as refilé Tubby. J'ai jamais vu de fantôme, c'était juste un bad trip, "
"ça n'a jamais été vrai."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:169
msgid "Look, I'll buy it from you."
msgstr "Ecoute, je te l'achète."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:170
msgid "Give it to me or you can join her."
msgstr "Donne-le moi ou je te le prendrai de force !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:171
msgid ""
"If you don't return it now, she'll come after you. And she can't\n"
" be stopped."
msgstr ""
"Si tu ne le rends pas tout de suite, elle viendra le chercher. On ne peut "
"pas l'arrêter."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:172
msgid ""
"Huh? Oh yeah. Yeah. T-That's for damn sure. You're gonna have to fork over "
"some bucks for sure. You ain't gettin' this for free! $50 or beat it!"
msgstr ""
"Ah ouais ? Et bien... Il va falloir que tu paies pour ça ! Tu ne l'aura pas "
"gratuit je te préviens ! $50 minimum ou casse-toi !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:173
msgid "Okay, here's the money."
msgstr "D'accord, voilà l'argent."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:174
msgid "Take $20 and be happy I don't just take it from you."
msgstr "Voilà $20. J'aurais pu le prendre sans rien te donner."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:175
msgid "Nah, I changed my mind. See ya."
msgstr "Non, j'ai changé d'avis. A plus."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:176
msgid "Give it to me or I kill you for it."
msgstr "Donne-le moi sinon je te tue !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:177
msgid "Here. Now just leave me alone."
msgstr "D'accord, voilà le médaillon. Laisse-moi tranquille."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:178
msgid "Gladly."
msgstr "Avec plaisir."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:179
msgid "Don't let me catch you doing this again!"
msgstr "Que je ne t'y reprenne plus !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:180
msgid "H-Hey! You don't have the money! Get the hell out of here!"
msgstr "Hé, t'as même pas l'argent !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:181
msgid "Oops. I'll come back."
msgstr "Hou la ! Je reviens."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:182
msgid "Then I guess I have to kill you."
msgstr "Alors, je crois qu'il va falloir que je te tue..."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:183
msgid "Hey. How's it goin'?"
msgstr "Hé ! Comment ça va depuis le temps ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:184
msgid "OK, and you?"
msgstr "Pas mal, et toi ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:186
msgid "Did you take a locket from that haunted house?"
msgstr "As-tu pris un médaillon dans la maison hantée ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:187
msgid "What do you know about that ghost that comes around here at night?"
msgstr "J'ai un problème existentiel."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:188
msgid "Hey, man, I'm Joey. What're you doin' on my turf?"
msgstr "Hé, salut ! Je m'appelle Joey. Que fais-tu sur mon territoire ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:189
msgid "Your turf? I don't think so."
msgstr "Ton territoire ? Ca m'étonnerait."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:190
msgid "Maybe I'm looking for you."
msgstr "Peut-être que c'est toi que je suis venu chercher..."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:191
msgid "Just leaving. Bye."
msgstr "Je pars. Salut."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:192
msgid "Looking for some information."
msgstr "Je cherche des renseignements."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:193
msgid "Hey, baby cakes. You looking for Joey? Here I am."
msgstr "Hé, mon chou. Tu cherches Joey ? Me voici."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:194
msgid "No. Go away."
msgstr "Non, va-t'en."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:195
msgid "Maybe. What are you offering me?"
msgstr "Peut-être. Que me proposes-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:196 dialog/fctnkbar.msg:107 dialog/fctnkgmr.msg:108
#: dialog/fctnkmer.msg:107
msgid "I want some information."
msgstr "J'ai besoin d'informations."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:197
msgid "No, sorry. I have to go now."
msgstr "Non, il faut que je parte."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:198
msgid ""
"Hey, I got some Jet. It's great stuff and brand new from Reno. Want some?"
msgstr "Hé, j'ai du Jet. C'est du bon, tout droit venu de New Reno. T'en veux ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:199 dialog/scenlone.msg:164
msgid "No way!"
msgstr "Ca va pas la tête ?!"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:201
msgid "No, I want information."
msgstr "Non, je voudrais des renseignements."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:202 dialog/mcdavin.msg:200
msgid "I have to go. Bye."
msgstr "Je dois partir. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:203
msgid "How about you and I get it on?"
msgstr "Et si on passait un peu de temps ensemble, toi et moi ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:205
msgid "Not if you were the last nonmutated man on the planet."
msgstr ""
"Même si tu étais le dernier être non mutant sur cette planète, tu pourrais "
"toujours courir !!"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:206
msgid "Er, no... I don't think so. I need something else."
msgstr "Heu... non merci. Je voudrais autre chose."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:207
msgid "You'll be coming back."
msgstr "Tu reviendras."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:208 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:250 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:237
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr "Peut-être."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:209 dialog/pi8ball.msg:203 dialog/zi8ball.msg:203
msgid "Don't count on it."
msgstr "N'y compte pas."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:210
msgid "Wait! Can I ask you something?"
msgstr "Attends ! Je peux te poser une question ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:211
msgid "Nobody talks to me like that!"
msgstr "Personne ne me parle sur ce ton !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:212
msgid "I just did. You do anything more than talk?"
msgstr "Moi oui. Tu sais faire autre chose que parler ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:213
msgid "Whatever. Are you selling anything or just making small talk?"
msgstr ""
"Peu importe. T'as quelque chose à vendre ou tu veux juste tailler une "
"bavette ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:214
msgid "My apologies. I'm actually looking around and don't know the area."
msgstr "Pardon. Je ne connais pas bien la région et je ne sais plus où je suis."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:216
msgid "I'm looking for a locket."
msgstr "Je cherche un médaillon."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:217
msgid "I need to know more about that haunted house."
msgstr "J'ai besoin d'en savoir plus sur la maison hantée."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:218
msgid "What's the deal with the old church and those guards?"
msgstr "C'est quoi l'histoire avec la vieille église et ces gardes ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:219
msgid "Nothing you can provide."
msgstr "Est-ce que tous les habitants de cette ville sont des junkies ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:220 dialog/ncftully.msg:316
msgid "Have you heard of Vault 13?"
msgstr "As-tu entendu parler de l'Abri 13 ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:221
msgid "Um, never mind. See you around."
msgstr "Heu, peu importe. A un de ces jours..."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:222
msgid ""
"Oh, you mean Tyler and his gang? They guard some shit that comes in from "
"Vault City. Big fucking crates. Once in a while you see them get picked up "
"by caravans heading to New Reno."
msgstr ""
"Oh tu veux parler de Tyler et de son gang ? Ils gardent ces trucs qui "
"viennent de la Cité de l'Abri. Des putains de grosses boites. De temps en "
"temps ils les chargent sur des caravanes en direction de New Reno."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:223
msgid "Can I ask you more about them?"
msgstr "J'aimerais savoir autre chose."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:224 dialog/dcjoey.msg:234 dialog/dcjoey.msg:238
#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:242 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:322 dialog/kcsulik.msg:153
#: dialog/vcmelind.msg:111 dialog/vcmelind.msg:116 dialog/vcmelind.msg:120
#: dialog/vcmelind.msg:124 dialog/vcmelind.msg:127 dialog/vcmelind.msg:131
#: dialog/vcmelind.msg:138 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:114 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:119
#: dialog/vcmsmith.msg:123 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:128 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:132
#: dialog/vcmsmith.msg:137 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:141 dialog/vcmsmith.msg:148
#: dialog/vcstark.msg:199 dialog/vcstark.msg:211
msgid "Can I ask you something else?"
msgstr "Puis-je te poser une autre question ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:225 dialog/dcjoey.msg:235 dialog/dcjoey.msg:239
#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:243
msgid "OK, thanks. Bye."
msgstr "D'accord, merci. Salut."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:226
msgid "What else you wanna know?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu savoir d'autre ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:227
msgid "Who's Tyler?"
msgstr "Qui c'est Tyler ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:228 dialog/dclara.msg:341
msgid "Where's New Reno?"
msgstr "Où c'est New Reno ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:229
msgid "So, what are they guarding?"
msgstr "Mais... Ils gardent quoi exactement ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:230
msgid "I want to ask you about something else."
msgstr "J'aimerais te demander autre chose."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:231
msgid "That's it. Bye."
msgstr "C'est ça. Salut."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:232
msgid ""
"Tyler's just some weasel who screwed all the rest of us out of a sweet deal "
"with\n"
" Metzger, but fuck that shit! I don't fucking care anymore. I could kick his "
"fucking ass though.\n"
" Lara and him still have some really bad blood. Something about Tyler and "
"her brother."
msgstr ""
"Tyler c'est juste un petit enculé qui nous l'a mis bien profond en faisant "
"un deal avec Metzger. J'en ai plus rien à foutre maintenant. Je pourrais lui "
"faire bouffer la poussière si j'voulais. Lara et lui ont encore un sacré "
"différent. Un truc entre son frère et Tyler."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:233
msgid "That could be useful. Can I ask you more about them?"
msgstr "C'est intéressant. J'aimerais savoir autre chose."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:236
msgid ""
"New Reno is down to the south a long ways, then east some. There's a lot\n"
" of action to be made there, but it's pretty fucking dangerous too. I might "
"head back\n"
" some day. Here, I can show you where it's at on that fancy screen thing of "
"yours."
msgstr ""
"New Reno se trouve assez loin au Sud. Il y a pas mal d'action sur place et "
"c'est putain de dangeureux aussi. J'y retournerai bien un jour. Tiens je "
"vais te montrer ou c'est sur ton écran qui scintille là."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:237
msgid "I think I can find it now. Can I ask you more about them?"
msgstr "Je crois que je vais trouver. J'aimerais savoir autre chose sur eux."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:240
msgid "Hell if I know."
msgstr "Si seulement je le savais."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:241
msgid "Interesting. Can I ask you more about them?"
msgstr "Intéressant. Mais dis-moi..."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:244
msgid "For you, I will sell Jet for $500."
msgstr "Je vends du Jet à $500, parce que c'est toi."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:245 dialog/hcjacob.msg:293
msgid "No, thanks. Bye."
msgstr "Non merci. Salut."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:246
msgid "No, thanks, but I would like to ask you something."
msgstr "Non merci, mais j'aimerais te poser une question."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:247
msgid "That's too much!"
msgstr "C'est trop !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:248 dialog/dcjoey.msg:255
msgid "OK, I'll buy it."
msgstr "D'accord, j'achète."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:249
msgid ""
"If you don't have the money, come back when you can afford it. Don't let me "
"see\n"
" you buying from anyone else or I'll kick your fucking ass. I'm the only one "
"with the pure\n"
" uncut shit, shipped directly from New Reno. "
msgstr ""
"Je regrette. Si t'as pas le fric sur toi, reviens quand tu pourras te le "
"permettre. Et va pas en chercher ailleurs ou je viendrais te botter le cul. "
"Je suis le seul à avoir de la pure bonne cam, directement en provenance de "
"New Reno."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:250
msgid "Wait, I'll buy it."
msgstr "Attends, j'vais l'acheter."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:251
msgid "Well, can I ask you something?"
msgstr "Est-ce que je peux te poser une question ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:253
msgid ""
"OK, I'll drop the price to $350, but no less! That's my final offer. You got "
"to pay\n"
" top dollar for the good shit. Don't buy from Tubby or any of those losers. "
"They cut their\n"
" shit. I'm the only one for miles that can get a hold of the best stuff."
msgstr ""
"Bon, $350, mais c'est mon dernier prix ! C'est normal de payer le prix fort "
"pour de la super cam. Va pas l'acheter chez Tubby ou ces autres gros cons, "
"ils coupent leur merde. Je suis le seul a avoir de la cam pure à 100% dans "
"la région."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:254
msgid "Forget it. Can I ask you something?"
msgstr "Laisse tomber. Je peux te poser une question ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:256 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:262 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:502
msgid "Never mind. Bye."
msgstr "Tant pis. Salut."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:257
msgid ""
"Vault... Vault... Vault 13? Nope, never heard of it. Don't tell me they've "
"come up\n"
" with another new drug! Nothing can beat Jet!"
msgstr ""
"L'Abri... L'Abri.. 13 tu dis ? Non, jamais entendu parler. Ne me dit pas que "
"c'est un genre de nouveau truc qui défonce. Il y a rien qui peut te la "
"mettre autant que le Jet !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:258
msgid "No, you moron."
msgstr "Non, imbécile !"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:259
msgid "No, it's a place. Can I ask something else?"
msgstr "Non, c'est un endroit. Je peux te poser une autre question ?"

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:260
msgid "Yes, a wonderful drug."
msgstr "Oui, en fait, c'est une super drogue."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:262
msgid "Joey here isn't much of a conversationalist."
msgstr "Eh ben, ce Joey n'a pas beaucoup de conversation..."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:300 dialog/dcmom.msg:542
msgid "Probably not. Bye."
msgstr "Peut-être pas. Salut."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:350
msgid ""
"You been sleeping? Turns out that Lara's a mean little bitch after all. She "
"gunned Tyler down. I hear Metzger was in on it. Well, I better get back "
"to... work."
msgstr ""
"Tu dormais ou quoi ? Au final Lara s'est avéré être une belle salope. Elle a "
"flingué Tyler. J'ai même entendu dire que Metzger était dans le coup. Bon, "
"il faut que je retourne... euh.. travailler."

#: dialog/dcjoey.msg:351
msgid ""
"You been sleeping? Turns out that Lara was a mean little bitch after all- "
"too bad she's dead. Whipped out Tyler's group. Her gang's running things "
"over there now, last I heard."
msgstr ""
"Tu dormais ou quoi ? Au final Lara s'est avéré être une belle salope - "
"dommage qu'elle y soit restée. C'est du passé le groupe de Tyler. D'après ce "
"que j'ai entendu, son gang prend les choses en main désormais."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:100
msgid "You see Lara."
msgstr "Tu vois Lara."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:150
msgid "She's the leader of this gang."
msgstr "C'est la chef de ce gang."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:200
msgid ""
"The name's Lara; I run this gang. You better not be here to cause trouble "
"or\n"
" you're in for a world of hurt."
msgstr ""
"Je m'appelle Lara, je suis à la tête de ce gang. Si tu viens nous chercher "
"des noises, gare à toi !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:201
msgid "Hi again. Need something?"
msgstr "Rebonjour. T'as besoin de quelque chose ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:202 dialog/dclara.msg:231 dialog/dclara.msg:242
#: dialog/dclara.msg:252
msgid "Got any work?"
msgstr "T'aurais pas du travail ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:203 dialog/hcbnkgrd.msg:106 dialog/hcbnkgrd.msg:140
#: dialog/ocjimmy.msg:107 dialog/scfelix.msg:110
msgid "Just looking around."
msgstr "Je ne fais que passer."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:204 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:272
msgid "I'm looking for a merchant named Vic."
msgstr "Je cherche un marchand nommé Vic."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:205
msgid "Aruh."
msgstr "Arou."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:206
msgid "Rara."
msgstr "Rara."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:220
msgid "We don't have any doctors in town and I can't help you."
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de docteur en ville et je ne peux pas t'aider."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:221
msgid "Sorry, I still don't understand."
msgstr "Je regrette, je ne comprends toujours pas."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:222
msgid "Ack."
msgstr "Berk."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:230
msgid ""
"The name doesn't ring a bell, but then again I don't keep track of who comes "
"in and out of town. Check with Becky. Everyone ends up going through there. "
"She might know."
msgstr ""
"Ce nom ne me dit rien. Mais je ne me souviens pas forcément de tous ceux qui "
"passent dans cette ville. Demande à Babeth. Tout le monde passe par chez "
"elle. Elle saura peut-être."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:240
msgid ""
"If you didn't come to the Den for a specific reason you should probably "
"leave. It's not very safe around here."
msgstr ""
"Si tu n'as pas une bonne raison d'être à La Fosse, tu devrais partir. Ce "
"n'est pas très sûr par ici."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:243
msgid "I can handle myself."
msgstr "Je sais ce que j'ai à faire."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:244 dialog/dclara.msg:253 dialog/dclara.msg:342
#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:432 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:461 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:334
#: dialog/dcrebecc.msg:342 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:323 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:416
#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:298 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:313 dialog/ocgordon.msg:140
#: dialog/vcgatgrd.msg:143 dialog/vcoldjoe.msg:118
msgid "Okay, thanks."
msgstr "D'accord, merci."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:250
msgid "No doubt. Otherwise you probably wouldn't have made it here alive."
msgstr ""
"C'est sûr. Sinon, tu n'aurais jamais pu arriver jusqu'ici sans te faire "
"trouer la peau."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:251
msgid "Uh, yes, so I heard. You said that already."
msgstr "Heu, oui. J'ai déjà entendu ça. Tu me l'as déjà dit."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:260
msgid ""
"Well it depends on what you're good at. There is something I'm curious "
"about. If you can find out, I'll pay you a bit."
msgstr ""
"Ca dépend de ce que tu sais faire. Quelque chose m'intrigue. Si tu peux "
"découvrir ce qui m'intéresse, je te paierais."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:261
msgid ""
"As I said, I'm looking for more information on a certain something... or "
"someplace. I'll pay of course."
msgstr ""
"Je te l'ai dit. Je cherche des informations sur quelque chose, ou un "
"endroit. Je te paierai bien entendu."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:262
msgid "Sure what's that?"
msgstr "Bien sûr. Qu'est-ce que c'est ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:263 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:524 dialog/epac9.msg:212
#: dialog/fcoz7.msg:149 dialog/fsface.msg:143 dialog/scmerk.msg:208
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "Peut-être plus tard."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:270
msgid "Let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "Fais-moi savoir si tu changes d'avis."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:280
msgid ""
"Well, there's a church east of here. Metzger has some people guarding "
"whatever\n"
" is inside. Find out what and I'll pay you $200."
msgstr ""
"Il y a une église à l'Est. Metzger a posté ses hommes à l'extérieur pour "
"garder je ne sais quoi. Si tu trouves ce qu'il cache, je te paie $200."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:281
msgid "That was easy. I already know."
msgstr "C'est facile. Je sais déjà."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:290
msgid "Thanks. Don't get in a fight... yet. I have a plan."
msgstr "Merci. Ne te bats pas... encore. J'ai un plan."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:292
msgid "I'll be right back."
msgstr "Je reviens tout de suite."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:300 dialog/dcsmitty.msg:461 dialog/dctubfri.msg:261
#: dialog/epac17.msg:411 dialog/epac17.msg:532 dialog/rcascort.msg:131
#: dialog/rcmarge.msg:151
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "C'est quoi, ça ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:301 dialog/dclara.msg:391
msgid "Raw chemical compounds in large crates."
msgstr "Des composés chimiques bruts dans de grosses caisses."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:302 dialog/dclara.msg:392
msgid "Big containers holding chemicals of some kind."
msgstr "De gros conteneurs remplis de produits chimiques."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:303
msgid "Let me check again."
msgstr "Laisse-moi vérifier encore."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:310
msgid "That makes sense actually. Thanks. Here's your money."
msgstr "C'est clair. Merci. Voici ton argent."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:311 dialog/qcbird.msg:122 dialog/rcdrjohn.msg:224
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ça ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:312 dialog/hcenchb.msg:125 dialog/hczaius.msg:152
#: dialog/scvortis.msg:170
msgid "No problem. Bye."
msgstr "Pas de problème. Salut."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:320
msgid ""
"I've seen caravans from Vault City come in and then some of it gets picked "
"up by caravans from New Reno."
msgstr ""
"J'ai vu des caravanes de la Cité de l'Abri rentrer et après une partie de la "
"marchandise a été emportée par des caravanes de New Reno."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:321
msgid "So? Why does that make sense?"
msgstr "Comment ça, c'est clair ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:340
msgid ""
"New Reno is the drug capital around here. They have to get the raw materials "
"to make their drugs from somewhere, right? It seems like they're getting "
"some, or all of it, from Vault City."
msgstr ""
"New Reno c'est la capitale des stupéfiants. Il faut bien qu'ils trouvent la "
"matière première quelque part. Il semblerait qu'une partie, ou la totalité, "
"provienne de la Cité de l'Abri."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:350
msgid ""
"Not sure exactly. Somewhere to the south I think. I've never been there, I "
"just see their caravans stop by once in a while - once in a long while."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas exactement. Au Sud je crois. Je n'y suis jamais allée. Je "
"vois seulement leurs caravanes s'arrêter par ici de temps en temps... mais "
"ça fait un moment."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:351 dialog/gcbrain.msg:506
msgid "Oh, okay. Thanks."
msgstr "Oh, d'accord. Merci."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:360
msgid "You looking for some more quick and easy cash? $50. Easy money."
msgstr ""
"Tu veux gagner de l'argent sans te fatiguer ? Disons... encore $50. Très "
"facile."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:362 dialog/ncrenesc.msg:700
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "Fais vite."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:370
msgid ""
"I need you to check with Metzger to see if he'd be okay if Tyler and I "
"settled some old matters. He'll understand what I mean."
msgstr ""
"Je veux que tu ailles voir si Metzger serait d'accord si Tyler et moi on "
"réglait un vieux problème. Il comprendra ce que je veux dire."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:371
msgid "Why do you want me to ask?"
msgstr "Pourquoi veux-tu que je demande ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:372
msgid "If I get a chance."
msgstr "Si ça m'est possible."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:380
msgid ""
"Because I don't want Tyler to see any of my people going into or out of "
"Metzger's place. I don't want to tip our hand."
msgstr ""
"Je ne veux pas que Tyler voit mes hommes entrer ou sortir de chez Metzger. "
"Je ne veux pas dévoiler notre jeu."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:381
msgid ""
"Don't you get it? If Tyler sees me all of a sudden talking to Metzger he "
"might catch wind of something fishy."
msgstr ""
"Tu ne comprends donc pas ? Si Tyler me voit tout à coup parler à Metzger, il "
"se doutera qu'il y a anguille sous roche."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:382 dialog/dcsheila.msg:179
msgid "We'll see."
msgstr "On verra."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:390
msgid "So did you find out what's in there?"
msgstr "Alors, tu as trouvé ce qu'il y a à l'intérieur ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:400
msgid "So did you talk to him yet? What did he say?"
msgstr "Alors, tu lui as parlé ? Qu'a-t-il dit ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:401
msgid "He said yes. If you win, you can have their job, like before."
msgstr "Il a dit oui. Si tu gagnes, tu peux avoir leur boulot, comme avant."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:402 dialog/dclara.msg:474 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:264
msgid "Na."
msgstr "Non."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:410
msgid ""
"Great. I was hoping as much. I hear he's been complaining about them lately. "
"Here's your money."
msgstr ""
"Génial ! C'est ce que j'attendais. Je sais qu'il n'était pas très content "
"d'eux dernièrement. Voilà ton argent."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:411
msgid "I assume there's something else now?"
msgstr "Je suppose qu'il y a autre chose maintenant."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:420
msgid ""
"I have one more job for you. I'm not sure how you'll do it, but since you "
"were able to get inside maybe they trust you."
msgstr ""
"J'ai une autre mission pour toi. Je ne sais pas comment tu t'y prendras, "
"mais tu as déjà réussi à entrer et ils te feront peut-être confiance."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:421
msgid "I snuck inside."
msgstr "J'ai réussi à me faufiler à l'intérieur."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:422 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:481 dialog/hctyphon.msg:124
#: dialog/hiwell.msg:140 dialog/vcdrtroy.msg:164 dialog/vcmclure.msg:332
#: dialog/vcrandal.msg:211 dialog/vcstark.msg:349
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "Qu'y a-t-il ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:430
msgid "I'm sure you can figure something out."
msgstr "Tu trouveras une solution, il n'y a aucun doute là-dessus."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:431
msgid "Okay, what is it?"
msgstr "D'accord. Qu'est-ce que c'est ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:440
msgid ""
"We can't take them at their present strength. They have extra funding\n"
" and slightly outnumber us. If you can find some kind of weakness we could "
"use\n"
" to balance out the odds or something we can exploit..."
msgstr ""
"On ne peut pas se mesurer à eux, ils sont trop forts. Ils ont des réserves "
"et ils sont un peu plus nombreux que nous. Si tu pouvais trouver leur point "
"faible, ça équilibrerait les chances de réussite..."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:441
msgid "Huh? Find a weakness? How am I supposed to do that?"
msgstr "Heu... Trouver leur point faible ? Comment je fais ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:443
msgid "Consider it done."
msgstr "C'est comme si c'était fait."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:450
msgid ""
"We'll give you $150. There's no way we can get close enough to find out by "
"ourselves."
msgstr ""
"Je te donnerai $150. On ne pourra jamais s'approcher assez pour découvrir ça "
"nous-mêmes."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:451
msgid "If I get around to it."
msgstr "Si je peux m'en approcher."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:460
msgid "I don't know. That's why I'm asking you to help."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas. C'est pour ça que j'ai besoin de ton aide."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:461 game/proto.msg:674 game/skill.msg:1005
msgid "I'll try."
msgstr "Je vais essayer."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:462
msgid "This is pointless."
msgstr "C'est inutile."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:470
msgid "Did you find anything?"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé quelque chose ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:471
msgid "Yes. They're having a party tonight."
msgstr "Oui. Une fête est organisée ce soir."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:473
msgid "Gra."
msgstr "Gra."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:480
msgid ""
"Excellent! They're sure to leave a skeleton crew. Those should be good\n"
" odds. We'll take out those at the party after we hit the church."
msgstr ""
"Parfait ! Il n'y aura presque plus personne sur place. C'est un avantage "
"pour nous. On cueillera ceux qui sont à la fête après être passé à l'église."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:481
msgid "And my money?"
msgstr "Et mon argent ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:490
msgid ""
"I don't think so. You'll have to come with us if you want your money. You\n"
" won't have to fight but just to be sure it's not a trap. We'll give you $"
"300 total."
msgstr ""
"Tu nous accompagnes si tu veux ton fric. Tu ne devras pas te battre mais "
"assure-toi que ce n'est pas un guet-apens. Je te donnerai $300 en tout."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:491 dialog/ecravpty.msg:179
msgid "You ready?"
msgstr "C'est bon ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:492
msgid "Okay, let's do it."
msgstr "D'accord, ça marche."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:493
msgid "Give me a bit to get ready."
msgstr "Laisse-moi un instant pour me préparer."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:494
msgid "No way. Keep your money!"
msgstr "Pas question. Tu peux le garder ton fric !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:500
msgid ""
"Okay, but we've got to act soon so don't take too long or we'll ruin our "
"chance."
msgstr ""
"D'accord. Mais il faut y aller bientôt, alors fais vite. Sinon on risque de "
"gâcher nos chances."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:510
msgid "You don't have to fight. Easy money."
msgstr "Tu n'auras pas à te battre. C'est de l'argent facile."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:511
msgid "Well, have you changed your mind?"
msgstr "Hé ben, tu as changé d'avis ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:512
msgid "Let's go. I'm ready."
msgstr "Allons-y !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:513
msgid "Okay, I'll be right back."
msgstr "D'accord. Je reviens tout de suite."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:515
msgid "Uk"
msgstr "Uk."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:520
msgid "Because of you we blew our chance."
msgstr "Tu as tout foutu en l'air !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:521
msgid "Coward!"
msgstr "Mauviette !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:522
msgid "You get nothing."
msgstr "Tu n'auras rien !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:523
msgid "It was probably a trap anyhow."
msgstr "C'était sûrement un guet-apens de toute façon."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:524
msgid "Sorry, you're not reliable."
msgstr "Je regrette, on ne peut pas te faire confiance."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:525
msgid "I can't trust you."
msgstr "Je ne te fais pas confiance."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:532
msgid "Special thanks to you!"
msgstr "Et un grand merci à toi."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:533
msgid "I've finally paid Tyler back for what he did to my brother."
msgstr "Tyler a enfin payé pour ce qu'il a fait à mon frère."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:534
msgid "Thank you again."
msgstr "Encore merci."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:540
msgid "Now that Metzger's dead, I don't know what'll happen."
msgstr "Maintenant que Metzger est mort, je ne sais pas ce qu'il va se passer."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:541
msgid "Maybe we should just pack up."
msgstr "On devrait peut-être plier bagage."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:542
msgid "Did you hear Metzger died? I don't know what to do now."
msgstr ""
"Tu savais, toi, que Metzger est mort ? Je ne sais pas quoi faire maintenant."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:543
msgid "What's going to happen to the Den now? Maybe something better."
msgstr ""
"Que va devenir La Fosse maintenant ? Peut-être quelque chose de mieux..."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:544
msgid "This could actually be for the better."
msgstr "Ca ne peut que s'améliorer."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:550 dialog/ectrader.msg:136 game/cmbatai2.msg:1682
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36082 game/combatai.msg:1682 game/combatai.msg:36082
msgid "Bastard!"
msgstr "Ordure !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:551 dialog/mcmiria.msg:150 dialog/ncboxer.msg:342
#: game/combatai.msg:18147
msgid "Bitch!"
msgstr "Salope !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:560
msgid "Thanks. Here's your money and $100 extra."
msgstr "Merci. Voilà ton argent, et $100 de plus."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:570
msgid ""
"Did you kill Tyler and his guards? How are we supposed to prove ourselves to "
"Metzger? He'll never hire us now. That was our only chance."
msgstr ""
"Tu as tué Tyler et ses gardes ? Comment peut-on faire nos preuves devant "
"Metzger ? Il ne nous embauchera jamais. Tu as gâché notre seule chance."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:571
msgid ""
"We don't have any work. Someone killed off Metzger's guards and now he won't "
"talk to us. He thinks we did it. Oh well."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons plus de travail. Quelqu'un a tué les gardes de Metzger et il ne "
"veut plus nous parler. Il pense qu'on est responsables. Tant pis."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:573
msgid "Too bad."
msgstr "Dommage."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:574
msgid "That was me, and you're next."
msgstr "C'était moi et le prochain tour, c'est toi."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:575
msgid "Oh. Okay, bye."
msgstr "Oh, d'accord. Salut."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:576
msgid "Uhr?"
msgstr "Heu... ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:590
msgid ""
"I told you we would go together. Since no one was there to watch the place, "
"it got ransacked and now Metzger's madder than hell."
msgstr ""
"Je t'avais dit qu'on irait ensemble. Comme personne n'était là pour monter "
"la garde, la maison a été pillée et maintenant Metzger est furax."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:591
msgid ""
"I told you to find a weakness, not kill them! Since no one was there to "
"watch the place, it got ransacked and now Metzger's madder than hell."
msgstr ""
"Je t'avais dit de trouver un point faible, pas de les tuer ! Comme personne "
"n'était là pour monter la garde, la maison a été pillée, et maintenant "
"Metzger est furax."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:592
msgid ""
"Damn it! I told you to ask Metzger, not to kill them! Since no one was there "
"to watch the place, it got ransacked and now Metzger's madder than hell."
msgstr ""
"Merde ! Je t'avais dit de demander à Metzger, pas de les tuer ! Comme "
"personne n'était là pour monter la garde, la maison a été pillée, et "
"maintenant Metzger est furax."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:593
msgid ""
"Damn it! I told you not to attack them! Since no one was there to watch the "
"place, it got ransacked and now Metzger's madder than hell."
msgstr ""
"Merde ! Je t'avais dit de ne pas les attaquer ! Comme personne n'était là "
"pour monter la garde, la maison a été pillée et maintenant Metzger est furax."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:594
msgid "Oh, well, I've got to go."
msgstr "Oh. Bon, il faut que je parte."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:595
msgid "That's a shame."
msgstr "Quel dommage."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:596
msgid "You're next, bitch."
msgstr "C'est ton tour, salope !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:597
msgid "Hmph!"
msgstr "Hum !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:598
msgid "You next."
msgstr "C'est ton tour !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:610
msgid "You really know how to screw things up, don't you?"
msgstr "T'as vraiment le don de tout foutre en l'air !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:611
msgid "We don't need any more of your help."
msgstr "On n'a plus besoin de ton aide."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:612
msgid "Go bother someone else."
msgstr "Va emmerder quelqu'un d'autre !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:613
msgid "Metzger better not take anything out on us."
msgstr "Metzger n'a pas intérêt à s'en prendre à nous."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:614 dialog/wsterm3b.msg:173 dialog/wsterm3b.msg:177
msgid "I'm sorry. I can't help you."
msgstr "Je regrette, je ne peux rien faire."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:615
msgid "Can't talk. I'm trying to figure out what to do now."
msgstr ""
"J'ai pas le temps de te parler. Faut que je réfléchisse à ce que je vais "
"faire maintenant."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:616
msgid "I hope Metzger doesn't think we were involved."
msgstr "J'espère que Metzger ne nous croit pas impliqués."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:617
msgid "What are we going to do now?"
msgstr "Que va-t-on faire maintenant ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:618
msgid "We better leave soon in case Metzger thinks we killed his guards."
msgstr ""
"On devrait vite partir au cas où Metzger penserait qu'on a tué ses gardes."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:619
msgid "You ever been to New Reno? Maybe we'll head there - or north."
msgstr "Tu connais New Reno ? On peut peut-être aller là-bas... ou au Nord."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:650
msgid "Alright! Let's go! Everyone follow me!"
msgstr "D'accord ! Allons-y ! Suivez-moi tous !"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:700
msgid ""
"Alright, we took care of the skeleton crew here at the church, but there "
"still is Tyler and his cronies over in the Residential area.\n"
" They should be pretty drunk by now and we can easily catch them off guard. "
"You ready to finish this?"
msgstr ""
"Très bien, on s'est fait une bonne partie de la bande ici, mais il reste "
"encore Tyler et ses potes dans la Zone Résidentielle. Ils doivent être "
"complètement saouls à l'heure qu'il est et nous devrions avoir aucun mal à "
"nous les faire pendant qu'ils ne sont pas sur leurs gardes. T'es prêt à "
"finir le boulot ?"

#: dialog/dclara.msg:720
msgid ""
"Well, don't stray too far. We need to finish this tonight or we'll do it "
"without you."
msgstr "Hé, te barre pas trop loin. On doit finir ça cette nuit."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:721
msgid "I'll be back shortly."
msgstr "Je reviens tout de suite."

#: dialog/dclara.msg:730
msgid ""
"We did it. I can't believe it! We're heading back to the church to take "
"charge. Meet us back there for your reward."
msgstr ""
"On l'a fait ! Bordel, je peux pas le croire ! On retourne à l'église pour "
"monter la garde. Retrouve-nous là-bas pour ta récompense."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:100
msgid "You see a middle aged man."
msgstr "Vous voyez un homme d'âge moyen."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:101
msgid "He is unshaven and reeks of alcohol."
msgstr "Il est mal rasé et pue l'alcool."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:102
msgid "*hickup* Do I know you?"
msgstr "<Hic> J'vous connais ?"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:103
msgid "It's 11 O'clock. Do you know where your children are?"
msgstr "Il est 11 heures. Savez-vous où est votre enfant ?"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:104
msgid "(Looks at you sleepily) What? *hickup* It's 11 already?"
msgstr ""
"[Il vous regarde d'un air endormi.] Quoi ? <Hic> Il est déjà 11 heures ?"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:105
msgid ""
"Actually no it isn't, I just wanted to say that. But seriously, do you know "
"where your children are?"
msgstr ""
"En fait, non, je voulais juste dire ça. Blague à part, savez-vous où est "
"votre enfant ?"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:106
msgid ""
"Actually yeah it is, but that's not important right now. Seriously though, "
"do you know where your children are?"
msgstr ""
"En fait, ouais, mais ce n'est pas le plus important pour le moment. "
"Sérieusement, savez-vous où est votre enfant ?"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:107
msgid ""
"*hickup* I have children? *hickup* Oh yeah, I do. He..or is it she..*hickup* "
"should be around here somewhere."
msgstr ""
"<Hic> J'ai des gosses moi ? <Hic> Oh ouais, j'en ai un. Il... ou bien "
"elle... <Hic> doit traîner quelque part."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:108
msgid ""
"Wow, you're such a drunk. Well, good thing I am working on a way to get your "
"child out of here."
msgstr ""
"Wow, vous êtes vraiment défoncé. Bon, je ferai bien de chercher un moyen de "
"sortir votre fils d'ici."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:109
msgid ""
"(Ignores what you just said.) Yeah that's great. *hickup* Now let me get "
"back to this drink."
msgstr ""
"[Ignorant ce que vous venez de dire.] Ouais c'est super. <Hic> Maintenant "
"laissez-moi me concentrer sur cette bouteille."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:110
msgid "You are a hero to all fathers out there. Keep it up!"
msgstr "Vous êtes un héros pour tous les pères ici bas. Continuez !"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:111
msgid "zzzZZZZzzz..."
msgstr "zzzZZZZzzz..."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:112
msgid "zZZZZzzZZzzz..."
msgstr "zZZZZzzZZzzz..."

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:113
msgid "*mumbles*"
msgstr "::Marmonnements::"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:114
msgid "Can't you see I'm drinking here? *hickup*"
msgstr "Vous voyez pas que je bois là ? <Hic>"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:115
msgid "Don't bother me. *hickup*"
msgstr "Me dérangez pas. <Hic>"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:116
msgid ""
"Actually it is a little before 11 O'clock, but that's not important right "
"now. Seriously though, do you know where your children are?"
msgstr ""
"En fait il est un peu moins de 11 heures, mais ce n'est pas le plus "
"important pour le moment. Sérieusement, savez-vous où est votre enfant ?"

#: dialog/dclbfthr.msg:117
msgid ""
"Actually it is a little past 11 O'clock, but that's not important right now. "
"Seriously though, do you know where your children are?"
msgstr ""
"En fait il est un peu plus de 11 heures, mais ce n'est pas le plus important "
"pour le moment. Sérieusement, savez-vous où est votre enfant ?"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:100 dialog/dcpeasnt.msg:400 dialog/mcchild.msg:100
#: dialog/mcjonny.msg:100 dialog/vilchild.msg:100
msgid "You see a small boy."
msgstr "Tu vois un petit garçon."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:101
msgid "You see Little Bobby."
msgstr "Vous voyez le petit Bobby."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:102
msgid "He is wearing dirty clothing and has bruises on his neck and face."
msgstr "Il porte des vêtements sales et a des bleus sur le cou et la figure."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:103
msgid "He is wearing new clothing and has a smile on his face."
msgstr "Il porte des vêtements neufs et a un visage souriant."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:104
msgid "Hi mister! My name's Bobby and I live here with my Dad."
msgstr "Salut monsieur ! Mon nom est Bobby et je vis ici avec mon père."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:105
msgid "Hi miss! My name's Bobby and I live here with my Dad."
msgstr "Salut mademoiselle ! Mon nom est Bobby et je vis ici avec mon père."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:106
msgid "I see. Well tha-"
msgstr "Je vois. Hé bien, c'est..."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:107
msgid ""
"Are you here 'cause my dad owes you money? I don't know if he's here or not. "
"But if I knew where he was,\n"
" I'd tell you, 'cause maybe you'd beat him up so bad he wouldn't ever come "
"home again."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes ici parce que mon père vous doit de l'argent ? Je ne sais pas où "
"il est. Mais si je savais, je vous le dirais, parce que peut-être que vous "
"le cogneriez tellement qu'il ne reviendrait jamais à la maison."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:108
msgid ""
"This sounds horrible, Bobby. Your father has no right to treat you that way "
"-- no parent does."
msgstr ""
"C'est terrible, Bobby. Ton père n'a pas le droit de te traiter de cette "
"façon - aucun parent ne l'a."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:109
msgid ""
"Hah! I'd beat my son too if he didn't listen to me. Your father sounds like "
"a good man."
msgstr ""
"Ha ! Je battrais aussi mon fils s'il ne m'écoutait pas. Ton père a l'air "
"d'être un homme bien."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:110
msgid ""
"[His eyes light up.] You aren't like the others that come through here. I "
"like you. [He sighs heavily.]\n"
" I wish my dad was more like you. Sometimes I think about running away. Some "
"of my friends don't have homes, and they say\n"
" it's not so bad. As long as they bring Mr. Flick enough things, they get to "
"eat once a day. But Mr. Flick doesn't sound very\n"
" nice either -- actually, he sounds a lot like my dad."
msgstr ""
"[Ses yeux s'illuminent.] Vous n'êtes pas comme ceux qui sont venus ici déjà. "
"Je vous aime bien. [Il soupire bruyamment.] Je souhaiterais que mon père "
"soit quelqu'un comme vous. Parfois je pense à m'enfuir. Certains de mes amis "
"n'ont pas de maison, et ils disent que ce n'est pas si mal. Du moment qu'ils "
"rapportent assez de matos à M Flick, ils ont de quoi manger chaque jour. "
"Mais M. Flick ne semble pas très gentil non plus - En fait, il ressemble "
"beaucoup à mon père."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:111
msgid "You're a meanie! Go away. I don't like you."
msgstr "Vous êtes méchant ! Allez-vous-en. Je ne vous aime pas."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:112
msgid ""
"There's gotta be something that can be done about this. Can you think of any "
"adults in this town that'd be willing to\n"
" look after you -- or any of these homeless kids?"
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose doit être fait. Parmi les adultes de cette ville, qui serait "
"disposé à s'occuper de toi ? - ou de ces orphelins ?"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:113
msgid ""
"[Bobby shrugs.] Maybe Mom? I don't mean *my* mom -- my mom's dead -- but "
"there's a lady that people call Mom. I dunno why.\n"
" Maybe 'cause she's really nice? She's got a diner on the other side of "
"town. [He points to the Northeast.] My homeless friends go\n"
" there and she sneaks them free food. I wish Dad would take me there, 'cause "
"she knows how to make rat taste really yummy!"
msgstr ""
"[Bobby hausse les épaules.] Mamma peut-être ? Je ne veux pas dire *ma mamma* "
"- ma maman est morte - mais il y a une dame que les gens appellent Mamma. Je "
"sais pas pourquoi. Peut-être parce qu'elle est vraiment gentille ? Elle a un "
"restaurant de l'autre côté de la ville. [Il désigne le Nord-Est.] Mes amis "
"orphelins sont allés là-bas et elle leur a donné de la nourriture "
"gratuitement. J'aimerais que mon père m'y emmène, parce qu'elle sait "
"vraiment bien préparer le rat !"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:114
msgid ""
"Hmm, I *am* feeling a bit hungry. Perhaps I'll go pay Mom a visit. You take "
"care of yourself, Bobby."
msgstr ""
"Hmm, j'ai un peu faim. Je vais peut-être rendre une petite visite à Mamma. "
"Prends soin de toi, Bobby."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:115
msgid ""
"You're such a little brat. I better leave now before I kick the shit outta "
"you. Bye."
msgstr ""
"Tu es un petit morveux. Je ferais mieux de partir maintenant avant de te "
"botter le cul. Salut."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:116
msgid ""
"Guess what, Bobby? I spoke with Mom, and she's going to be opening up a nice "
"big new home where you and all your\n"
" homeless friends are welcome to go live together. It's going to be in the "
"big building that's right across the street from here.\n"
" She said she'll have it all set up in a couple days."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais quoi, Bobby ? J'ai parlé avec Mamma, et elle va bientôt ouvrir une "
"chouette et grande maison où toi et tes amis orphelins serez les bienvenus "
"pour y vivre ensemble. Ce sera dans cette grande maison juste en face. Elle "
"a dit que tout serait prêt d'ici 2 ou 3 jours."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:117
msgid ""
"[A huge smile lights up the boy's face.] Really? That's great! [He hugs you.]"
" I can't wait to live there with all my\n"
" friends! I'm so excited! Thanks again mister, you're the best!"
msgstr ""
"[Un énorme sourire illumine le visage du garçon.] Vraiment ? C'est génial ! ["
"Il vous sourit.] Je ne vais jamais pouvoir attendre d'aller vivre là-bas "
"avec tous mes amis ! Je suis tellement content ! Merci encore monsieur, vous "
"êtes le meilleur !"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:118
msgid ""
"[A huge smile lights up the boy's face.] Really? That's great! [He hugs you.]"
" I can't wait to live there with all my\n"
" friends! I'm so excited! Thanks again miss, you're the best!"
msgstr ""
"[Un énorme sourire illumine le visage du garçon.] Vraiment ? C'est génial ! ["
"Il vous sourit.] Je ne vais jamais pouvoir attendre d'aller vivre là-bas "
"avec tous mes amis ! Je suis tellement content ! Merci encore mademoiselle, "
"vous êtes la meilleure !"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:119
msgid "You're welcome kid. See you around."
msgstr "Je t'en prie petit. A un de ces jours."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:120
msgid "Hi again! Did you talk to the Mom lady?"
msgstr "Salut ! Vous avez parlé à Mamma ?"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:121
msgid "Don't worry Bobby, I'm working on it."
msgstr "Ne t'inquiète pas Bobby, je m'y emploie."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:122
msgid "You help Bobby find a better life."
msgstr "Vous avez aidé Bobby à avoir une vie meilleure."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:123
msgid ""
"Hi again! Thanks for everything. I love this new place. Mom is such a great "
"lady!"
msgstr ""
"Salut ! Merci pour tout. J'adore ma nouvelle maison. Mamma est vraiment une "
"très grande dame !"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:124
msgid "I love this new place. Mom is such a great lady!"
msgstr "J'adore ma nouvelle maison. Mamma est vraiment une très grande dame !"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:125
msgid "I'm so excited! Time to pack my stuff."
msgstr "Je suis si content ! Il est temps de faire mes valises."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:126
msgid "I wonder if dad will notice I am gone."
msgstr "Je me demande si Papa se rendra compte que je suis parti."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:127
msgid "This is going to be so much better."
msgstr "Ca va être bien mieux."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:200
msgid "I don't like you. Go away!"
msgstr "Je ne vous aime pas. Allez-vous-en !"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:210
msgid "It sounds like you're not too fond of your dad. Mind if I ask why?"
msgstr ""
"On dirait que tu n'aimes pas beaucoup ton père. Puis-je te demander pourquoi "
"?"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:211
msgid ""
"You little brat, what gives you the right to talk about your dad like that?"
msgstr ""
"Tu es un petit morveux, qu'est-ce qui te donne le droit de parler de ton "
"père comme ça ?"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:220
msgid ""
"Cause my dad's not very nice. He leaves me home alone all the time, and when "
"he *is* home, he's always drunk or\n"
" he says he's flying on Jet, which is a lie 'cause I never see him fly "
"anywhere. Sometimes, he brings a\n"
" girlfriend home -- he's got lots of girlfriends -- and he makes me go "
"outside for awhile, even if its the middle of the night\n"
" and it's cold or raining."
msgstr ""
"Parce que mon père n'est pas très gentil. Il me laisse tout seul à la maison "
"tout le temps, et quand il est à la maison, il boit ou il dit qu'il vole "
"avec son jet. C'est un mensonge parce que je ne l'ai jamais vu s'envoler "
"nulle part. De temps en temps, il ramène une fille à la maison - il a plein "
"de petites amies - et il me met dehors, même si c'est au milieu de la nuit, "
"qu'il fasse froid ou qu'il pleuve."

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:221
msgid "That's-"
msgstr "C'est-"

#: dialog/dclilbby.msg:230
msgid ""
"Oh! And sometimes he tells me to take things from people in secret. He says "
"it's a game and that he gives it back later,\n"
" but I don't' believe him. But if I don't do it, then he gets real mad and "
"his eyes get all scary looking, and he hurts me.\n"
" See? [He lifts up his shirt sleeve, revealing a nasty bruise on his arm.]"
msgstr ""
"Oh ! Et parfois il me dit de prendre des choses aux gens, discrètement. Il "
"dit que c'est un jeu et qu'il le rendra plus tard, mais je le crois pas. "
"Mais si je ne le fais pas, il devient vraiment fou, son regard devient "
"effrayant, et il me frappe. Vous voyez ? [Il soulève sa manche, révélant un "
"méchant bleu sur son bras.]"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:100
msgid "You see the owner of the saloon."
msgstr "Tu vois la propriétaire du saloon."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:101
msgid "You see Becky."
msgstr "Tu vois Babeth."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:150
msgid "This looks like the owner."
msgstr "On dirait que c'est la propriétaire."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:151
msgid "This is Becky, owner of this place."
msgstr "C'est Babeth, la propriétaire de cet endroit."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:153
msgid "Hello, stranger, and welcome to my saloon. I'm Becky."
msgstr "Bonjour, étranger, et bienvenue dans mon saloon. Je m'appelle Babeth."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:154
msgid "Hello, I am "
msgstr "Bonjour, je suis "

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:155
msgid ". What's there to do around here?"
msgstr ". Y'a des choses à faire par ici ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:156
msgid "Hi, I'm "
msgstr "Salut, je suis"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:157
msgid ". Can I ask some questions?"
msgstr ". Je peux poser des questions ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:159
msgid "Mag gah."
msgstr "Mag gah."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:160
msgid "Run along. I don't need your kind here."
msgstr "Va-t'en. Je n'ai pas besoin de toi ici."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:162 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:343 dialog/fcjuavki.msg:178
#: dialog/scmerk.msg:251
msgid "Screw you."
msgstr "Va t'faire !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:163 dialog/ncorvill.msg:292
msgid "I'm going."
msgstr "J'y vais."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:164
msgid "Sorry, no offense was meant. Can I ask something?"
msgstr ""
"Désolé, je ne voulais pas t'offenser. Je peux te demander quelque chose ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:165
msgid ""
"Drink of whiskey is $5 and the gambling tables are right over there. Have a "
"good one."
msgstr ""
"Un verre de whisky coûte 5 dollars et les tables de jeu sont juste là. Passe "
"une bonne soirée."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:166 dialog/dcmaggie.msg:192 dialog/dcmaggie.msg:216
#: dialog/dcrebecc.msg:306
msgid "Can I ask a question?"
msgstr "Puis-je te poser une question ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:167
msgid "I want a drink!"
msgstr "Je veux un verre !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:168
msgid "Hmm, those are some cheap drinks. Let's see one."
msgstr "Hmm, ce sont des boissons bon marché. Laisse-moi essayer."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:170
msgid "Vault 13? Nope, never heard of it."
msgstr "L'Abri 13 ? Non, jamais entendu parler."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:171
msgid "Hmm, can I ask something else?"
msgstr "Hmm, je peux demander autre chose ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:172
msgid "Damn, I need to find it. Bye."
msgstr "Mince, je dois le trouver. Salut."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:174
msgid "Where's a good place to eat?"
msgstr "Où est un bon endroit pour manger ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:175 dialog/shtandi.msg:158
msgid "Do you know where Vault 13 is?"
msgstr "Sais-tu où se trouve l'Abri 13 ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:176 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:304
msgid "Why are your drinks so cheap?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tes boissons sont si bon marché ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:177 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:276 dialog/ecabolst.msg:305
#: dialog/fcdokgrd.msg:204 dialog/fclaocho.msg:129 dialog/fcmarc.msg:110
#: dialog/fcrocman.msg:114 dialog/fcrocman.msg:126 dialog/fcrocman.msg:131
#: dialog/hcbrian.msg:112 dialog/hcchad.msg:129 dialog/hcjacob.msg:196
#: dialog/hcprof.msg:109 dialog/ocariel.msg:113 dialog/vcmacrae.msg:123
msgid "Nothing. Bye."
msgstr "Rien. Salut."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:178
msgid "Mom runs a little restaurant across town."
msgstr "Maman tient un petit restaurant à l'autre bout de la ville."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:179
msgid "Mommy! Mommy!"
msgstr "Maman ! Maman !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:180
msgid "One more question."
msgstr "Une dernière question."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:183
msgid "Gwah."
msgstr "Gwah."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:184
msgid "I'll give you something to beat."
msgstr "Je vais te donner quelque chose à battre."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:185
msgid "Quick question first?"
msgstr "Une petite question d'abord ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:187
msgid "A shot of whiskey is $5. Pay first."
msgstr "Un verre de whisky coûte 5 dollars. Payez d'abord."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:189
msgid "Here's the money."
msgstr "Voilà l'argent."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:190
msgid "Changed my mind."
msgstr "J'ai changé d'avis."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:191
msgid "I'm a little short of cash. Can I have a tab?"
msgstr "Je suis un peu à court d'argent. Je peux avoir une note ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:193
msgid "Gotta go."
msgstr "Je dois y aller."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:194
msgid "Here's the drink. Anything else?"
msgstr "Voici la boisson. Autre chose ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:195
msgid "Question?"
msgstr "Une question ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:196
msgid "Yeha, how about you and I..."
msgstr "Yeha, que dirais-tu de toi et moi..."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:198
msgid ""
"Hey, you don't enough cash for this drink. You're poorer than even these "
"sops!"
msgstr ""
"Hé, tu n'as pas assez d'argent pour cette boisson. Tu es plus pauvre que ces "
"soporifiques !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:200
msgid "Hmm, I'll come back."
msgstr "Hmm, je reviendrai."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:201
msgid ""
"Hmm. Let me get someone to watch the bar. You and I can go into the back "
"room and play a little\n"
" game I call \"First Strike.\" If you're good, well, there's \"Ground Zero.\""
msgstr ""
"Hmm. Je vais chercher quelqu'un pour surveiller le bar. Toi et moi, on peut "
"aller dans l'arrière-salle et jouer à un petit jeu que j'appelle \"First "
"Strike.\" Si tu es bon, eh bien, il y a \"Ground Zero.\""

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:202 dialog/dcsheila.msg:176
msgid "OK!"
msgstr "D'accord !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:203
msgid "Er... uh... I have to go."
msgstr "Er...uh...je dois y aller."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:205
msgid "You were OK."
msgstr "Tu étais bien."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:206
msgid "Next time, let's play \"Into the Glow.\" But for now..."
msgstr "La prochaine fois, jouons à \"Into the Glow\". Mais pour l'instant..."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:207 dialog/fcbadger.msg:153
msgid "Can you do something for me?"
msgstr "Tu peux faire quelque chose pour moi ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:208
msgid "I have to go, but I'll come back."
msgstr "Je dois partir, mais je reviendrai."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:209
msgid "What can I do for you, sweet cheeks?"
msgstr "Que puis-je faire pour toi, ma belle ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:210
msgid "I need some more lovin'."
msgstr "J'ai besoin d'un peu plus d'amour."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:211 dialog/scmerk.msg:137
msgid "I got some questions."
msgstr "J'ai quelques questions."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:212
msgid "How can you sell your drinks so cheaply?"
msgstr "Comment peux-tu vendre tes boissons si bon marché ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:213
msgid "How about a drink?"
msgstr "Que dirais-tu d'un verre ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:214 game/cmbatai2.msg:3112 game/combatai.msg:3112
msgid "Gotta run. See ya."
msgstr "Je dois y aller. A plus tard."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:215
msgid "Not now. Maybe later. Yes, definitely later."
msgstr "Pas maintenant. Peut-être plus tard. Oui, définitivement plus tard."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:217 dialog/fctnkbar.msg:119
msgid "Later then."
msgstr "Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:218
msgid ""
"I have a still in the basement. I made it myself. Beats paying triple to "
"those New Reno\n"
" gangsters."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un alambic au sous-sol. Je l'ai fabriqué moi-même. C'est mieux que de "
"payer le triple à ces gangsters de New Reno."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:219
msgid "Smart girl! I like that!"
msgstr "Une fille intelligente ! J'aime bien ça !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:220
msgid "Hmm, I have to go. I'll see you later."
msgstr "Hmm, je dois y aller. Je te verrai plus tard."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:221
msgid "Why? Why did you destroy my still? You bastard!"
msgstr "Pourquoi ? Pourquoi as-tu détruit mon alambic ? Espèce de salaud !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:222
msgid "Nothing personal. I got paid to do it."
msgstr "Rien de personnel. J'ai été payé pour le faire."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:223 dialog/dcstory2.msg:165 dialog/epac11.msg:261
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "Quel dommage !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:225
msgid "I'll just make another one, you know."
msgstr "Je vais en faire un autre, tu sais."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:226
msgid "I know."
msgstr "Je sais."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:227
msgid "Well, that's good."
msgstr "C'est une bonne chose."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:232
msgid "Why? Why did you destroy my still? You bitch!"
msgstr "Pourquoi ? Pourquoi as-tu détruit mon alambic ? Espèce de salope !"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:233
msgid "Where are you, baby?"
msgstr "Où es-tu, bébé ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:234
msgid "Are you coming?"
msgstr "Tu viens ?"

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:235 dialog/dcsheila.msg:216
msgid "I'm waiting."
msgstr "J'attends."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:236
msgid "I'm in here, lover."
msgstr "Je suis là, mon amour."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:237
msgid "I've got a bar to run."
msgstr "J'ai un bar à gérer."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:238
msgid "Follow me, sugar."
msgstr "Suis-moi, mon chou."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:240
msgid "How did you... Do that... Uhhh..."
msgstr "Comment as-tu... fait ça... Euhhh..."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:241
msgid "It's O.K., size doesn't really matter."
msgstr "C'est bon, la taille n'a pas vraiment d'importance."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:242
msgid "That was, ummm, nice -- I guess."
msgstr "C'était, ummm, sympa -- je suppose."

#: dialog/dcmaggie.msg:243
msgid "Thanks, sweety; that was fun."
msgstr "Merci, chérie, c'était amusant."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:101
msgid "You see Marc, a guard."
msgstr "Tu vois Marc, un garde."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:102
msgid "You see Marc, one of Tyler's guards."
msgstr "Tu vois Marc, l'un des gardes de Tyler."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:150
msgid "Yo, Tyler!"
msgstr "Hé ho, Tyler !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:200
msgid "What the...?"
msgstr "Mais qu'est-ce... ?"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:225
msgid "Thanks for the tip. That was some fun stuff."
msgstr "Merci du conseil. C'était très... divertissant."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:226
msgid "I knew we could take those pussies."
msgstr "Je savais qu'on les aurait ces mauviettes !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:227
msgid "Too bad we killed them all. Now what are we to do?"
msgstr "Dommage qu'on les ait tous tués, parce que maintenant, que fait-on ?"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:228
msgid "Are we hot or what?"
msgstr "On assure à mort, hein ?"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:229
msgid "We're too good."
msgstr "On est vraiment trop bons !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:230
msgid "We fucking kicked some ass! Fuck yeah!"
msgstr "On leur a mis la pâtée ! Putain !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:250
msgid "Tyler's the one to talk to, not me, lady."
msgstr "Il faut parler à Tyler, ma belle, pas à moi."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:251
msgid "What's up. You need something, you gotta talk to Tyler here."
msgstr "Quoi de neuf ? Va voir Tyler si tu veux quelque chose."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:252
msgid "What you looking at?"
msgstr "Que regardes-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:253
msgid "Tyler's the one to talk to, not me, man."
msgstr "Il faut parler à Tyler, pas à moi."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:255
msgid "We're going to kick some ass tonight!"
msgstr "On va leur mettre la pâtée, ce soir !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:256
msgid "Tonight's the night!"
msgstr "Ce soir, c'est le grand soir !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:257
msgid "I'm going to remember this night for sure."
msgstr "Cette nuit, j'm'en souviendrai toute ma vie !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:258
msgid "Don't even tell me they chickened out."
msgstr "Ne m'dis pas qu'ils se sont dégonflés !!"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:259
msgid "Oh, I sure hope those fuckers show."
msgstr "Oh, j'espère que ces connards vont se montrer."

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:260
msgid "I knew those pussies wouldn't show."
msgstr "Je savais que ces poules mouillées n'allaient pas se montrer !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:261
msgid "We should just go kick their asses just for thinking about fighting us."
msgstr ""
"On devrait leur casser la gueule juste parce qu'ils veulent se battre contre "
"nous !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:262
msgid "We would have ripped through them if they had showed."
msgstr "On les aurait éventrés s'ils étaient venus !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:263
msgid "I could have taken them on by myself."
msgstr "J'aurais pu tous me les faire !"

#: dialog/dcmarc.msg:264
msgid "Tyler and I would have kicked some serious ass."
msgstr "Tyler et moi, on leur aurait vraiment mis la pâtée !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:100
msgid "You see a tough middle-aged slaver."
msgstr "Tu vois un esclavagiste costaud, d'âge moyen."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:101 dialog/dcrnslvr.msg:102
msgid "You see a rather large slaver."
msgstr "Tu vois un esclavagiste à la stature imposante."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:150 dialog/dcrnslvr.msg:150
msgid "There's a slaver who seems to enjoy his work."
msgstr "Un esclavagiste qui semble faire son travail avec plaisir."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:151 dialog/dcrnslvr.msg:151
msgid "This slaver seems to be very strong but not too bright."
msgstr "Cet esclavagiste semble être très fort mais pas très intelligent."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:200
msgid "Get the hell away from the door."
msgstr "Ne reste pas près de cette porte !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:201
msgid "What the fuck do you think your doing?"
msgstr "Que fais-tu ? Tu te crois où toi ?!"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:202
msgid "Metzger'll have your head. Back off man."
msgstr "Metzger aura ta peau ! Bouge de là !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:203
msgid "Hey, bitch, get away from that door."
msgstr "Hé, la pétasse ! Reste pas près de cette porte !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:204
msgid "No bitch is going in Metzger's room. Back off."
msgstr "Pas de femelle en chaleur dans la pièce de Metzger ! Allez, dégage !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:205
msgid "Back off, bitch. Slaver or not, Metzger's room is off limits."
msgstr ""
"Hé, la pétasse ! Bouge de là ! Esclavagiste ou pas, c'est interdit d'entrer "
"dans la pièce de Metzger."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:250
msgid "Talk to Metzger, not me, buddy."
msgstr "Va parler à Metzger, pas à moi."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:251
msgid "You going to join the guild?"
msgstr "Tu vas devenir membre de la Guilde ?"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:252
msgid "There's good money if you're in the guild."
msgstr "La Guilde, ça gagne bien."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:253
msgid "You'll get a lot of action if you're in the guild."
msgstr "Tu auras beaucoup d'action si tu es dans la Guilde."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:254
msgid "Talk to Metzger, not me, lady."
msgstr "Va parler à Metzger, poulette, pas à moi."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:255
msgid "Metzger's not going to hire a bitch so beat it."
msgstr "Metzger n'embauchera jamais une meuf, alors, casse-toi !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:257
msgid "Hey, man."
msgstr "Hé !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:258
msgid "You're lucky you only have to go on the runs."
msgstr "T'as de la chance d'avoir que les chasses à faire."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:259
msgid "Being a door guard's a boring life."
msgstr "Etre gardien de porte, c'est vraiment barbant !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:261
msgid "You're the first woman Metzger's ever hired."
msgstr "T'es la première femme embauchée par Metzger !"

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:262
msgid "Metzger must have a soft spot for you."
msgstr "T'as dû toucher le point sensible de Metzger."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:263
msgid "You're all alone little lady."
msgstr "T'es toute seule, ma belle."

#: dialog/dcmetrom.msg:264
msgid "A woman slaver... Never thought I would see it."
msgstr "Une femme esclavagiste... j'aurais jamais cru voir ça."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:100
msgid "You see a mean looking man."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme à l'air méchant."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:101
msgid "You see Metzger, the slaver master."
msgstr "Tu vois Metzger, le Maître des esclavagistes."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:150
msgid "Metzger's the head of the Slaver's Guild."
msgstr "Metzger est le chef de la Guilde des esclavagistes."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:200
msgid "You'll pay for that."
msgstr "Tu paieras pour ça."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:210
msgid ""
"What the fuck do you want? This is the Slaver's Guild, not some safe\n"
" house for you fucking jetheads."
msgstr ""
"Que veux tu ? Ici, c'est la Guilde des esclavagistes, pas un refuge pour les "
"allumés au Jet dans ton genre !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:211
msgid ""
"What the hell do you want, you ugly bitch? This is the Slaver's\n"
" Guild, not some fucking whorehouse."
msgstr "Que veux-tu ?! Ici, c'est la Guilde des esclavagistes, pas un bordel !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:212
msgid ""
"What the hell do you want, bitch? This is the Slaver's Guild, not some\n"
" fucking whorehouse."
msgstr ""
"Que veux-tu ?! Ici, c'est la Guilde des esclavagistes, pas une maison de "
"passe !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:213
msgid "You're starting to piss me off. What the hell do you want now?"
msgstr "Tu commences à me gonfler. Qu'est-ce tu veux ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:214
msgid "Now what, damn it?"
msgstr "Qu'y a-t-il encore ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:216
msgid "Oh, you better make it quick."
msgstr "Oh, t'as intérêt à être rapide !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:217
msgid "You here to work for a fucking change?"
msgstr "T'es là pour travailler, ça change un peu."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:218
msgid ""
"I'm starting to get used to your ugly mug. So... are you here for a reason "
"or what?"
msgstr ""
"Je commence à me faire à ta face de rat. Alors, t'as une bonne raison d'être "
"ici ou non ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:219
msgid ""
"Do I look like your fucking dad or something? I sure as hell hope not. Now "
"spit it\n"
" out, what do you want?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai la même tronche que ton père ou quoi ? J'espère bien que non ! Alors, "
"que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:220
msgid ""
"Oh, look who's here. You think you're special or something? Speak up or get "
"the\n"
" fuck out."
msgstr ""
"Oh, regardez-moi qui est là. Tu te prends pour qui ? Parle ou barre-toi !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:221
msgid "What do you want now, slaver?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu, l'esclavagiste ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:222
msgid "You just going to stand there or are you going to say something?"
msgstr "Tu restes là à rien faire ou tu te décides à parler ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:223
msgid "Speak up. I don't have all day for this crap."
msgstr "Parle. On va pas y passer la journée !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:230
msgid ""
"Oh, and 'who' would that be? I hope you don't plan on seeing this person "
"again..."
msgstr ""
"Oh, et *qui* ça pourrait bien être ? J'espère que tu n'as pas dans l'idée de "
"revoir cette personne..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:231
msgid ""
"You don't have anyone that I'm interested in. I'm only interested in people -"
"\n"
" normal ones, that is."
msgstr ""
"Les personnes que tu as ne m'intéressent pas. Je m'intéresse seulement aux "
"gens... normaux."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:232
msgid ""
"You fucking moron, what do you think I am, a fucking store or something? If "
"you get\n"
" a slave you'd like to sell, let me know. If you want to sell something "
"else, go to a fucking store."
msgstr ""
"Pauvre imbécile ! Tu crois qu'ici, c'est un magasin ?! Si tu veux vendre un "
"esclave, fais-le-moi savoir. Si tu veux vendre autre chose, va dans un "
"magasin, bordel !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:233 dialog/mcgrisha.msg:412 dialog/mcjo.msg:629
#: game/pro_crit.msg:16400 game/scrname.msg:206
msgid "Miria"
msgstr "Miria"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:234 dialog/mcgrisha.msg:413 dialog/mcjo.msg:630
#: dialog/mcjohnny.msg:187 game/pro_crit.msg:16300 game/scrname.msg:199
msgid "Davin"
msgstr "Davin"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:235 game/pro_crit.msg:6200 game/scrname.msg:150
msgid "Vic"
msgstr "Vic"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:236 game/pro_crit.msg:16000 game/scrname.msg:537
msgid "Myron"
msgstr "Myron"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:237 game/scrname.msg:672
msgid "Cassidy"
msgstr "Cassidy"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:238 game/pro_crit.msg:9700 game/scrname.msg:483
msgid "Sulik"
msgstr "Sulik"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:239
msgid "Can I ask you another question instead?"
msgstr "Est-ce que je peux te poser une autre question à la place."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:240
msgid "I changed my mind. Bye."
msgstr "J'ai changé d'avis. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:241 game/pro_crit.msg:50300 game/scrname.msg:1506
msgid "Dex"
msgstr "Dex"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:242 game/pro_crit.msg:50400 game/scrname.msg:1507
msgid "Cat Jules"
msgstr "Cat Jules"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:243 dialog/epai13.msg:303 game/pro_crit.msg:50200
#: game/scrname.msg:1508
msgid "Kitsune"
msgstr "Kitsune"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:245 dialog/rcmcgrew.msg:249
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr "Vas-y, continue !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:246 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:254 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:245
#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:245 dialog/ncrenesc.msg:703 dialog/scsherif.msg:161
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Vraiment ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:247
msgid "I'm not your fucking servant, so hurry it up."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas ton domestique, bordel, alors dépêche-toi !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:248
msgid "What is it? I don't have all day."
msgstr "Qu'y a-t-il ? On va pas y passer la journée !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:249 dialog/scdocjub.msg:127
msgid "Shoot."
msgstr "Accouche !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:255
msgid "I have someone I'd like to sell."
msgstr "J'aimerais vendre quelque chose."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:256 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:234
msgid "About Vic..."
msgstr "A propos de Vic..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:257
msgid "I'm looking for a merchant."
msgstr "Je cherche un marchand."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:258
msgid "Lara wanted me to ask you for permission to fight Tyler."
msgstr "Lara voulait que je te demande la permission de se battre avec Tyler."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:259
msgid "Can I join the guild?"
msgstr "Puis-je adhérer à la Guilde ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:260
msgid "What can you tell me about your guild?"
msgstr "Que peux-tu me dire sur ta Guilde ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:263
msgid " want to ill."
msgstr " vouloir tuer."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:265
msgid ""
"I was looking over the slaves you got back there, but you see, I have very, "
"uh...*selective* tastes, and none of\n"
" them are quite what I'm looking for. Are these all the slaves you have to "
"offer?"
msgstr ""
"Ca fait beaucoup d'esclaves que tu as là derrière. C'est le seul endroit où "
"tu les détiens ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:270
msgid ""
"You think you can cut it? I don't take in just anyone... What the hell. If\n"
" you fuck up, I'll sell you off. You'll have to get a tattoo on your "
"forehead\n"
" identifying you as a slaver to everyone. It's permanent, so no second "
"thoughts."
msgstr ""
"Tu penses faire l'affaire ? Je ne prends pas n'importe qui tu sais. Si tu "
"déconnes, je me débarrasse de toi. Tu devras te faire tatouer sur le front "
"pour que tout le monde sache que tu es esclavagiste. C'est indélébile. Faut "
"bien réfléchir."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:271
msgid ""
"So, our delicate little flower girl returns... You changed your mind then?\n"
" Going to get that tat after all?"
msgstr ""
"Alors notre fragile petite fille des fleurs est de retour... Tu as changé "
"d'avis ? Tu vas l'faire ce tatouage ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:272
msgid ""
"Yeah, you might do... You don't need much in the way of brains to go on a "
"run.\n"
" If you fuck up, I'll just sell you off. If you think you can cut it you'll "
"have\n"
" to get a tattoo on your forehead identifying you to everyone as slaver."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, tu pourrais faire l'affaire. Faut pas une grosse cervelle pour aller "
"à la chasse. Si tu déconnes, je te revendrai. Si tu penses être à la "
"hauteur, faudra te faire tatouer le front pour que tout le monde sache que "
"tu es esclavagiste."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:273 dialog/epai37.msg:501 dialog/epai37.msg:511
#: dialog/epai37.msg:521 dialog/fcdrfung.msg:224 dialog/fcjuavki.msg:171
#: dialog/fsface.msg:142 dialog/hcprof.msg:128 dialog/ncstulit.msg:506
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr "Allons-y."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:274
msgid "I have to think about it. I'll get back to you."
msgstr "Faut que je réfléchisse. Je reviendrai te voir."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:275
msgid "Maybe not. Bye."
msgstr "Peut-être pas. Salut."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:276
msgid "Uya! [nod]"
msgstr "Uïa ! [Acquiesce.]"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:277
msgid "No no no no no!"
msgstr "Non, non, non, non, non."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:285
msgid ""
"What do you fucking think? This is a slaving guild. I buy and sell slaves."
msgstr ""
"Que crois-tu, bordel ? Ici, c'est une guilde pour l'esclavage. Je vends et "
"j'achète des esclaves."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:286
msgid "Where do you get the slaves?"
msgstr "Où prends-tu les esclaves ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:287
msgid "I'd like to join."
msgstr "Je voudrais devenir membre."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:288
msgid "Another question please."
msgstr "Une autre question, s'il te plaît."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:289 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:303 dialog/dcstory1.msg:143
msgid "Oh, okay. Bye."
msgstr "Oh, Ok. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:300
msgid ""
"Oh, here and there. We mainly collect primitives and nomads when we run "
"across them."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ça et là. On prend surtout des primitifs et des nomades quand on tombe "
"dessus."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:301
msgid "Sounds like fun. How can I get in on that?"
msgstr "Ca m'a l'air amusant. Comment pourrais-je participer ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:302 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:423 dialog/dcrebecc.msg:431
msgid "I have another question."
msgstr "Je voudrais te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:310
msgid ""
"What do you know, you didn't even cry. I'm so proud of you... actually, that "
"tat\n"
" looks pretty good on you. Just give a holler when you're ready for your "
"first slave run."
msgstr ""
"Regarde-moi ça, t'as même pas pleuré. Je suis fier de toi. Ca te va bien "
"d'ailleurs ce tatouage. Pousse un bon beuglement quand tu voudras participer "
"à ta première chasse aux esclaves."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:312
msgid "I'm ready right now."
msgstr "J'accepte."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:313
msgid "Me Kill NOW!"
msgstr "Moi Tuer MAINTENANT !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:314
msgid "Okey-Dokey."
msgstr "D'accord, pas de blème."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:320
msgid ""
"Two of my men will get you fairly close to your targets. Your pay will be "
"based\n"
" on the number of the slaves you return, but watch each other's backs. If "
"anyone\n"
" gets killed, your pay will be severely cut."
msgstr ""
"Deux de mes hommes te mèneront assez près de tes cibles. Ta paie est "
"calculée en fonction du nombre d'esclaves que tu ramènes. Mais fais "
"attention à tes collègues. S'il y a des morts, ta paie sera réduite en "
"conséquence."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:321
msgid ""
"Damn, we're all farmed out. Have to wait for some primitives to move back "
"into the\n"
" area. Maybe we should start breeding them."
msgstr ""
"Merde, plus de travail. Il faut attendre que des primitifs reviennent dans "
"la région. On devrait peut-être commencer à les prendre pour esclaves..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:322
msgid ""
"Sorry, you're just not working out. Too many losses and this is a business. "
"I need\n"
" to make money, not lose it."
msgstr ""
"Je regrette, mais ça ne va pas. Tu as trop de pertes. J'ai un commerce à "
"faire tourner. Je dois gagner de l'argent, pas en perdre."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:323
msgid "All right. They're ready."
msgstr "D'accord, ils sont prêts."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:324
msgid "Good, you can leave now."
msgstr "Bien. Tu peux partir maintenant."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:325
msgid "Get a move on it then."
msgstr "Alors, vas-y. Dépêche-toi."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:326
msgid "Good. See me when you're done."
msgstr "Bien. Viens me voir quand tu as fini."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:340
msgid ""
"Just kill all the hostile ones. If they attack you, kill them. I don't\n"
" want to deal with them anymore, too big of a fucking hassle. Once you're "
"done,\n"
" the other slavers will round up and tag the rest."
msgstr ""
"Tue seulement les plus hostiles. S'ils t'attaquent, tue-les. Je ne veux plus "
"avoir affaire à eux, c'est trop chiant. Une fois que tu auras fini, les "
"autres esclavagistes les encercleront et marqueront le reste."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:350
msgid ""
"Once they start tagging the slaves, you can head back if you like. It takes\n"
" special training, so don't try to subdue the others yourself. You can do "
"whatever\n"
" you want just as long as you don't damage the goods."
msgstr ""
"Quand ils commencent à marquer les esclaves, tu peux revenir si tu veux. Ils "
"sont entraînés spécialement pour ça alors n'essaie pas de soumettre les "
"survivants tout seul. Fais ce que tu veux tant que tu ne gâches pas la "
"marchandise."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:352 dialog/ecfarmer.msg:120 dialog/echomest.msg:120
#: dialog/gcwooz.msg:341
msgid "Uh huh."
msgstr "Euh..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:360
msgid "Ah, yeah. She's pretty nice. I'll give you $"
msgstr "Ah, ouais. Elle est pas mal. Je t'en donne $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:361
msgid "He's okay. I could probably take him off your hands for, oh, say $"
msgstr "Ca va. Je pourrais te le prendre pour... oh, disons... $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:362
msgid ""
"You fucking idiot. What the hell makes you think I want that moron back? It "
"took\n"
" him forever to fix a damn radio! A radio! You're stuck with him. I don't "
"want him\n"
" breaking anything else around here."
msgstr ""
"Espèce de pauvre imbécile ! Qu'est-ce qui te fait croire que je veux "
"récupérer ce neu-neu ? Je l'ai choisi pour qu'il répare une radio ! Une "
"radio ! Tu l'as, tu le gardes. Je ne veux pas qu'il casse quoi que ce soit "
"ici."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:363
msgid ""
"I don't know, this one's pretty skinny... but a smart one? That might be "
"worth something. I'll give you $"
msgstr ""
"Je sais pas... Assez maigre on dirait... Mais l'air intelligent ? Ca peut "
"valoir quelque chose. Je t'en donne $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:364
msgid "This one looks like he could really put up a fight. Hmm... $"
msgstr "Celui-là a l'air de savoir se battre. Hum... $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:365
msgid ""
"Another primitive. This one's a freak show. Still, he looks strong and that "
"look might fetch something extra. $"
msgstr ""
"Un autre primitif. Il fait peur à voir, celui-là. Il a l'air fort et son "
"regard vaut bien un petit extra. $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:366
msgid "How about someone else?"
msgstr "Quelqu'un d'autre ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:367
msgid "Well, let me ask you another question then."
msgstr "Bon, laisse-moi te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:371
msgid "Not worth it."
msgstr "Ca en vaut pas la peine."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:380
msgid "All right, boys, put him in the pens."
msgstr "D'accord, les gars. Foutez-le dans l'enclos."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:381
msgid "All right, boys, put her in the pens."
msgstr "D'accord, les gars. Foutez-la dans l'enclos."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:382
msgid "Right, boss."
msgstr "Ok Patron."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:390
msgid ""
"Well don't waste my fucking time then. If you ever get someone you're\n"
" looking to part with, come see me."
msgstr ""
"Ne me fais pas perdre de temps, bordel ! Si tu as un jour quelque chose dont "
"tu veux te séparer, viens me voir."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:391
msgid "I've got another question for you."
msgstr "J'aimerais te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:392 dialog/fcchemst.msg:140 dialog/fcfmatt.msg:146
#: dialog/fcfmatt.msg:151 dialog/fcfmatt.msg:162 dialog/fckenlee.msg:210
#: dialog/hcjacob.msg:286 dialog/hcliz.msg:130 dialog/kcdunton.msg:169
#: dialog/ocgordon.msg:112 dialog/ocjoseph.msg:121
msgid "Okay. Bye."
msgstr "Ok. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:400
msgid ""
"What the hell crawled up her ass all of a sudden? I gave that bitch a "
"chance\n"
" a while back. Didn't think she had the balls to try this."
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce qu'il lui a pris tout à coup ? J'ai donné sa chance à cette "
"traînée il y a quelque temps. Je ne pensais pas qu'elle aurait le courage de "
"le faire."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:401 dialog/hcsulvan.msg:110 dialog/hcsulvan.msg:117
#: dialog/mccornel.msg:192 dialog/ncnikki.msg:420 dialog/qhprzrch.msg:329
#: dialog/scenlone.msg:123 dialog/schenry.msg:112 dialog/vcdrtroy.msg:187
#: dialog/vcskeeve.msg:154
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "De quoi parles-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:402
msgid "So it's okay?"
msgstr "Alors, c'est bon ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:410
msgid ""
"Oh, don't play coy with me. I know exactly what she's planning to do. I\n"
" gave her a chance a while back and she couldn't cut it, but if she\n"
" thinks she's up to it..."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ne joue pas à ça avec moi. Je sais très bien ce qu'elle va faire. Je lui "
"ai donné sa chance il y a quelque temps et elle n'était pas à la hauteur, "
"mais si elle croit qu'elle est prête maintenant..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:411
msgid "So, it's okay?"
msgstr "Alors, c'est bon ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:420
msgid ""
"Well, I did say the offer would remain open. If she finally thinks she can "
"kick his ass and\n"
" is better able to guard my shit..."
msgstr ""
"Bon, j'avais dit que la proposition tenait toujours. Si elle pense qu'elle "
"peut le battre et qu'elle est capable de garder ma camelote..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:421 dialog/nhmyron.msg:931 dialog/scvortis.msg:117
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "Eh bien ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:422
msgid "So, that's a yes?"
msgstr "Alors, c'est oui ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:430
msgid ""
"Look, I don't give a shit which of them guards it. Just as long as none of "
"my goods are\n"
" damaged, I don't care."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, j'm'en tape de savoir qui monte la garde. Tant qu'aucune des "
"marchandises n'est endommagée, j'm'en tamponne."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:431
msgid "Another question, please."
msgstr "Une autre question, s'il te plaît."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:440
msgid ""
"What the fuck are you asking me for? Do I look like some kind of fucking... "
"oh,\n"
" wait. You're probably looking for Vic?"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi m'as-tu appelé ? Tu crois que j'ai la tronche d'un... Oh, attends. "
"Tu dois certainement chercher Vic."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:441
msgid ""
"He's the one that 'specializes' in vault technology, or so he says. He's my\n"
" property now. He's not going anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Il est *spécialisé* dans la technologie de l'Abri, c'est ce qu'il dit. Il "
"est à moi, maintenant et il ne sort pas d'ici."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:442
msgid "What about him?"
msgstr "Alors, lui ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:443
msgid "Yeah, that's him."
msgstr "Ouais, c'est lui."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:444 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:459 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:257
#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:288 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:289
msgid "Can I see him?"
msgstr "Puis-je le voir ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:446 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:304 dialog/dcslvgrt.msg:402
msgid "Okay, thanks. Bye."
msgstr "D'accord, merci. Salut."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:455
msgid ""
"That little fuck - he sold me a radio that he said would be able to pick up\n"
" some transmissions. It didn't. I caught his ass trying to sneak out of town "
"before\n"
" I found out. Bad mistake. No one fucks with me. He's lucky to be alive."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit tas de merde m'a vendu une radio. Il m'a promis qu'elle capterait "
"quelques transmissions. Ca n'a jamais marché. Il a essayé de se faire la "
"malle, je l'ai rattrapé à temps. Grosse erreur. Faut pas me prendre pour un "
"con. Il a de la chance d'être en vie."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:456
msgid "Like I said. He needs to fix something first. After that we'll see."
msgstr "Je te l'ai dit. Avant, il doit réparer quelque chose. Après, on verra."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:457
msgid ""
"Well he's finally gotten that damn radio to work, but it doesn't mean I'm "
"going to let\n"
" him off that easy."
msgstr ""
"Bon, il a finalement réussi à faire marcher cette sacrée radio. Mais ça veut "
"pas dire que je le laisserai partir si facilement."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:458
msgid "He still tried to screw me over."
msgstr "Il a encore essayé de m'entuber."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:460
msgid "What kind of transmissions are you talking about?"
msgstr "De quel genre de transmissions veux-tu parler ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:462
msgid "Maybe some money might help clear things up?"
msgstr "Peut-être qu'un peu d'argent aidera à clarifier la situation ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:463
msgid "What kind transmissions were you talking about before?"
msgstr "De quel genre de transmissions parlais-tu tout à l'heure ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:475
msgid ""
"What for? Ah, fuck, never mind. Just don't keep him from fixing that damn\n"
" radio - and he better fix it soon. I'm sick of feeding his lazy ass."
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi faire ? Ah, merde, peu importe. Ne l'empêche pas de réparer cette "
"foutue radio. Le plus tôt sera le mieux. Je commence à en avoir ma claque "
"d'entretenir cette grosse feignasse."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:485
msgid ""
"The Enclave and New... Hey, what the hell you care for? It's business. I "
"need to be sure no one's trying to fuck me over. That's all you need to know."
msgstr ""
"L'Enclave et New... Hé ! Qu'est-ce que ça peut te foutre ? C'est secret "
"professionnel. Je veux être sûr que personne n'essaie de me doubler. C'est "
"tout ce que t'as besoin savoir."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:486
msgid "Mind your own business."
msgstr "Mêle-toi de tes affaires."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:495
msgid "Sure, but it'll cost you $"
msgstr "Bien sûr. Ca te coûtera $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:496 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:544 dialog/dcmetzge.msg:547
#: dialog/hczaius.msg:302 dialog/zccrpdel.msg:500
msgid "$"
msgstr "$"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:497
msgid "Can't we work something out?"
msgstr "Peut-on s'arranger ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:498
msgid "Okay. Here."
msgstr "D'accord. Voilà."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:499
msgid "Can I ask you some more questions first."
msgstr "Je peux te poser d'autres questions avant ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:500
msgid "Sorry, can't afford that yet."
msgstr "Je regrette, ça n'est pas encore dans mes moyens."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:510
msgid ""
"Okay, he's yours, but get his ass out of here before I change my mind\n"
" and put a bullet in that stupid fucking head of his."
msgstr ""
"D'accord, il est à toi. Emmène-le loin d'ici avant que je change d'avis et "
"que j'lui troue sa petite cervelle !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:511
msgid "Can I ask you some more questions first?"
msgstr "Je peux te poser d'autres questions avant ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:520
msgid ""
"Oh, yes. We can work everything out nice and smooth... I'll give you\n"
" half off if you make it worth my while..."
msgstr ""
"Oh, oui. On peut trouver un arrangement sympa. Je te fais 50% si tu me "
"donnes ce que je veux en échange..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:521
msgid "You had best stop teasing me, girly. I'm not much with patience."
msgstr "Tu essaies de me pousser à bout, hein ? Ma patience a des limites."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:522
msgid "Only if you're good to me."
msgstr "Seulement si tu fais ce que je veux."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:523 dialog/scenlone.msg:189
msgid "Sure, why not."
msgstr "Sûr."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:530
msgid "Oh, you better believe it."
msgstr "Oh, tu as intérêt à y croire."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:531 dialog/ocjimmy.msg:116
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bon."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:540
msgid "Here's $"
msgstr "Voilà $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:541
msgid "Here's your $"
msgstr "Voici tes $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:542
msgid "Good job out there. Here's $"
msgstr "C'est du bon boulot. Voilà "

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:543
msgid "Here's your money, "
msgstr "Voici ton argent : "

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:545
msgid "Well it's $"
msgstr "Bon, ça fait"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:546
msgid "It wasn't that tough, now was it? Next time no mistakes. Here's $"
msgstr ""
"Ce n'était pas assez brutal cette fois. Pas d'erreurs la prochaine fois. "
"Voilà "

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:548
msgid "Come on! $"
msgstr "Allez ! "

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:549
msgid ""
"Remember, watch each other's backs and only kill the hostile slaves. Here's $"
msgstr ""
"Rappelle-toi, fais attention aux autres et ne tue que les esclaves hostiles. "
"Voilà $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:550
msgid "Only $"
msgstr "Seulement $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:551
msgid ""
"You want to make any money or not? You're pissing me off. How fucking\n"
" hard can it be? Now take your $"
msgstr ""
"Tu veux gagner de l'argent ou pas ? Tu me les brises. C'est pas si dur "
"pourtant ! Maintenant, prends tes $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:552
msgid ""
"What the hell was your problem? You don't earn shit this time. We're\n"
" in this to make money, not dick around."
msgstr ""
"C'était quoi ton problème, merde ? Tu auras que dalle cette fois. On fait ça "
"pour gagner de l'argent, pas pour faire les cons."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:553
msgid "I'll do better next time."
msgstr "Je ferai mieux la prochaine fois."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:554
msgid "Thanks for nothing."
msgstr "Merci et bonjour chez vous."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:570
msgid ""
"Damn bitch, was that your first time? There's no way that was not your first "
"time."
msgstr "Pauvre conne, c'était la première fois ? Ca valait pas un clou."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:571
msgid "Damn girl, was that your first time?"
msgstr "Pauvre fille, c'était la première fois ? "

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:572
msgid "Pretty good, I guess."
msgstr "Pas mal du tout."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:573
msgid "Very nice, maybe we can do it again sometime."
msgstr "Pas mal. On pourra peut-être remettre ça une autre fois."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:574
msgid "Damn! That was... very well spent money."
msgstr "Putain ! C'était... de l'argent bien dépensé."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:575
msgid "Damn! You were the best piece of ass I've ever had, and I've had a lot."
msgstr ""
"Putain ! Tu es vraiment le meilleur coup que j'ai jamais eu... et j'en ai eu "
"beaucoup !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:600
msgid ""
"YOU STUPID FUCK! How dare you abandon your fellow slavers out there? [Spits "
"in your face] KILL HIM!"
msgstr ""
"TU N'ES QU'UNE LARVE ! Comment as-tu pu abandonner les autres esclavagistes "
"là-bas ? [Il te crache à la figure.] TUEZ-LE !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:601
msgid "But I..."
msgstr "Mais je..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:602
msgid "Alright, let's do this."
msgstr "D'accord, on va faire comme ça."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:620
msgid "Well, nice to see you could make it back."
msgstr "Bien. Tu as pu trouver le chemin du retour, c'est bien."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:621
msgid "Yeah, it was a tough run."
msgstr "Ouais, c'était une chasse difficile."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:622
msgid "Thanks. Things got a little hairy out there."
msgstr "Merci. Les choses ont un peu dégénéré là-bas."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:623
msgid "Agra Moo ne!"
msgstr "Deun arge ein !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:630
msgid "Oh, you want money? You want to be paid?"
msgstr "Oh, tu veux de l'argent ? Tu veux qu'on te paie ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:631
msgid "Yah."
msgstr "Ouais."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:640
msgid ""
"Of course I'd LOVE to help you out but... there's this slight problem I "
"have... something about attacking one of my men."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais TELLEMENT t'aider, mais j'ai un petit problème... Tu sais, à "
"propos de l'attaque de l'un de mes hommes... ??!"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:641
msgid "Sorry! I didn't mean to- I mean... Ug?"
msgstr "Pardon ! Je ne voulais pas... je veux dire... hein ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:642 dialog/qcgencit.msg:116
msgid "Uh, oh."
msgstr "Heu, oh."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:650
msgid ""
"Oh, don't worry. I'm sure I can find it in my heart to pay- I mean repay "
"you. Men, it's payday."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ne t'inquiète pas. Je trouverai de quoi te payer.. Je veux dire, je te "
"revaudrai ça... Allez. C'est jour de paie aujourd'hui."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:651
msgid ""
"Oh, don't worry. I'm sure I can find it in my heart to pay- I mean repay "
"you. Men,\n"
" take this bitch down."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ne t'inquiète pas. Je trouverai de quoi te payer.. Je veux dire, je te "
"revaudrai ça... Allez, emmenez-moi cette ordure !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:653
msgid "Garaka!"
msgstr "Garaka !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:654
msgid "Uh... Tank?"
msgstr "Heu... mèssi ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:670
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm sure. This line of work isn't to be taken lightly. It takes trust "
"and loyalty. We watch each other's backs. Good policy don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, certainement. Ce genre de travail n'est pas à prendre à la légère. La "
"confiance et la loyauté, c'est important. On se couvre les uns, les autres. "
"Jolis principes, tu trouves pas ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:671
msgid "I guess."
msgstr "Je suppose."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:672
msgid "Uh, what's going on?"
msgstr "Heu, que se passe-t-il ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:673 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:227
msgid "Definitely."
msgstr "Sans aucun doute."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:680
msgid ""
"You guess? I didn't think you were that smart. You really are a stupid fuck."
"\n"
" [Metzger glares at you then looks to his guards and motions in your "
"direction.]"
msgstr ""
"Tu supposes ? Je ne te savais pas aussi intelligent ! T'es vraiment qu'une "
"larve ! [Metzger te regarde furieux, regarde ses gardes, et se dirige vers "
"toi.]"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:681
msgid "Actions?"
msgstr "De l'action ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:690
msgid ""
"Oh, so you aren't as dumb as you act. Well, that's a shame. You see, I'm "
"having a bit of a dilemma. Someone had the nerve to attack my men."
msgstr ""
"Oh, alors t'es pas aussi bête que t'en as l'air ! C'est dommage. Tu vois, je "
"suis face à un dilemme. Quelqu'un a osé attaquer mes hommes."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:691 dialog/dcmom.msg:360 dialog/dcstory1.msg:156
#: dialog/dcstory2.msg:150 dialog/gclumpy.msg:201 dialog/hcmarcus.msg:137
#: dialog/kcsulik.msg:944
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Vraiment ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:692
msgid "It was an accident!"
msgstr "C'était un accident !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:700
msgid ""
"Really? I'm so glad you agree. Now what would you do if someone betrayed "
"this trust?"
msgstr ""
"Ah bon ? Tu es d'accord, je suis ravi. Comment tu réagirais toi si quelqu'un "
"trahissait cette confiance ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:701
msgid "Uh, give them a warning?"
msgstr "Heu... Je donnerais un avertissement."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:702
msgid "Here. Let me show you. [attack]"
msgstr "Voilà. Je vais te montrer. [Attaque.]"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:703
msgid "Make them pay."
msgstr "Je lui ferais payer !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:710
msgid ""
"You think so? Honestly? I don't know. I was thinking of something a little "
"more... permanent. [With an evil grin, Metzger looks to his guards and nods.]"
msgstr ""
"Tu penses vraiment ? Honnêtement ? Je ne sais pas. Je pensais à quelque "
"chose de plus... définitif. [Metzger affiche un rictus diabolique, regarde "
"ses gardes et acquiesce.]"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:712 dialog/nccomedi.msg:7001
msgid "Oh boy..."
msgstr "Oh, merde..."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:720
msgid ""
"I'm glad we're in agreement. [Metzger looks to his guards.] Men, it's payday."
msgstr ""
"Je suis content qu'on soit du même avis. [Metzger regarde ses gardes.]. "
"Allez. C'est jour de paie !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:730
msgid ""
"Yes. It's a shame really. This person just doesn't seem to get it, but\n"
" I think they are about to. [You see Metzger making a small hand gesture to "
"his\n"
" men.] Play time."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Quel dommage. Cette personne ne comprend vraiment pas, mais je crois "
"que ça va venir. [Tu vois Metzger qui fait un geste de la main à ses hommes.]"
" Récréation !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:731
msgid "Oh really?"
msgstr "Ah bon ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:732
msgid "Uh oh."
msgstr "Heu, oh."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:740
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm afraid accidents happen around here quite often. In fact, I'm "
"afraid we're about to have another one. [Metzger smiles pleasantly and then "
"nods towards his men.]"
msgstr ""
"Oui, j'ai bien peur que les accidents arrivent souvent par ici. Et je crois "
"qu'il va s'en produire un autre très bientôt. [Metzger sourit joyeusement "
"puis acquiesce en direction de ses hommes.]"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:741 dialog/rcsavine.msg:200 dialog/vibaron.msg:341
#: dialog/wsterm3b.msg:152
msgid "Bring it on!"
msgstr "Vas-y, ramène-toi !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:742
msgid "I'm not getting out of this am I?"
msgstr "Je ne m'en sortirai pas, c'est ça ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:750
msgid "Oh, but this will be fun. Trust me."
msgstr "Oh, mais ça sera amusant. Fais-moi confiance."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:800
msgid "You've killed the leader of the Slave Guild."
msgstr "Tu as tué le chef de la Guilde des esclavagistes."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:900
msgid ""
"What you see is what you get. If you don't like my merchandise, then get the "
"fuck out of my face and stop wasting my time."
msgstr ""
"C'est quoi ces questions à la noix ?! Tu commences vraiment à me les broyer "
"menu ! Si tu n'as pas quelque chose de mieux à dire, dégage."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:901
msgid "Uh, sorry. Let me ask you something else then."
msgstr "Euh, désolé. J'avais autre chose en tête."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:902
msgid "Right. I think I'll go then."
msgstr "Ok. Je crois que je vais partir alors."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:903
msgid ""
"Actually, I think I'm going to waste *you* and your whole sick fucking "
"operation."
msgstr "Non, je vais te faire dégager *toi* et toute ta petite opération."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:910
msgid ""
"This is all I've got in stock here, you picky fuck, but I've always got new "
"merchandise coming in from my other slave camp.\n"
" Maybe if you check back later, I'll have something that tickles your fancy "
"-- but they're mostly ignorant tribals that all look the\n"
" fucking same, so if that's not your thing, you might be shit outta luck."
msgstr ""
"C'est tout ce que j'ai en stock ici, enfoiré de chipoteur. Mais j'ai encore "
"de la marchandise en arrivage de mon autre camp. Peut-être que si tu reviens "
"plus tard, j'aurais quelque chose qui pourrait bien te satisfaire -- mais ce "
"sont pour la plupart des idiots de tribales qui se ressemblent tous, donc si "
"c'est pas ton truc, c'est pas la peine."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:911
msgid ""
"Look, this might be an unusual request, but I'd really like to get first "
"dibs on any new merchandise you got. Is there some\n"
" way I could go check out the stock at your other camp? Of course, I'd be "
"willing to pay a premium price."
msgstr ""
"Bon ça va ptet te paraitre inhabituel, mais j'aimerai vraiment avoir être le "
"prem's sur une de te nouvelles marchandise. Il y a pas moyen que j'aille "
"voir directement le stock que tu as à ton autre camp ? Je suis prêt à payer "
"le supplément."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:912
msgid "Alright, I'll keep checking back then."
msgstr "D'accord, je reviendrais voir alors."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:913
msgid ""
"Good, but next time do me a favor and don't waste my time unless you've got "
"actual business to discuss."
msgstr ""
"Bien, la prochaine fois, fait moi une faveur et évite de me faire perdre mon "
"temps à moins d'avoir de vraies affaires à discuter."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:914
msgid ""
"Premium price, huh? Now you're talking my kinda language. We usually handle "
"sales here, but I suppose an exception could be made,\n"
" as long as you're serious. I'll tell you how to get there, but you better "
"keep it to your fucking self. I swear, if you turn out to be a\n"
" spy for them fucking Rangers, I'll hunt you down and skin you alive. [You "
"listen to his directions, and note the Slaver Camp's location in your Pip-"
"Boy.]"
msgstr ""
"Un supplément, hein ? Je vois qu'on parle le même langage. Habituellement on "
"fait les ventes ici, mais je peux faire une exception, seulement si t'es un "
"mec sérieux. Je vais te dire comment y aller, mais tu va devoir bien fermer "
"ton clapet. J'te le promet, si tu t'avère être un sale espions de ces foutus "
"Rangers, j'te traquerai comme un animal et j'te dépècerai vivant. [Tu "
"écoutes ses indications, et tu notes la position du Camp des Esclavagistes "
"sur ton Pip-Boy.]"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:915
msgid "Got it. Let me ask you something else."
msgstr "Bien reçu. Je voudrais te demander autre chose."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:916
msgid "Thanks. I'll be on my way now. Bye."
msgstr "Merci. Je vais y aller. A plus."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1360
msgid " for her. How about it?"
msgstr " pour elle. Combien ?"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1540
msgid ". Pretty fucking good job."
msgstr ". Joli boulot, putain ! "

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1541
msgid ". You kicked some serious ass. Keep it up."
msgstr ". Tu les as bien éclatés. Félicitations. Continue comme ça."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1543
msgid ". $"
msgstr ". $"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1544
msgid " isn't something to laugh at, but you can't make a lot more than that."
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de quoi se moquer mais tu peux faire mieux que ça."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1545
msgid " this time. Pretty good job."
msgstr "$ cette fois. C'est pas mal du tout."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1547
msgid "? Not bad."
msgstr " ? Pas mal."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1548
msgid "? You can do better than that."
msgstr " $ ? Tu peux mieux faire !"

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1550
msgid "! That's fucking pitiful! Shape up or I'll kick your ass out."
msgstr " $ ! C'est vraiment pitoyable ! Reprends-toi ou je t'éclate."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:1551
msgid " and get out."
msgstr ", et sors d'ici."

#: dialog/dcmetzge.msg:15401
msgid ". Pretty fucking good job, "
msgstr ". Du sacré bon boulot, "

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:100
msgid "You see a kindly-looking older woman."
msgstr "Tu vois une femme d'un certain âge. Elle a l'air gentille."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:150
msgid "You see Mom, busily cooking and cleaning."
msgstr "Tu vois la Mamma, affairée à la cuisine et au ménage."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:151
msgid "You see a robust older woman, with a cheerful smile on her face."
msgstr "Tu vois une femme d'un certain âge, robuste, au sourire jovial."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:200
msgid "Hello there, I'm Mom. I haven't seen you around here before."
msgstr "Bonjour. Je suis la Mamma. Je m'trompe ou t'es pas d'ici ?!"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:201
msgid "Hello again. What can Mom do for you?"
msgstr "Rebonjour. Que peut faire la Mamma pour toi ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:203
msgid "Mmmm. Ook? Bye bye Mommy."
msgstr "Hum. Ok ? Au revoir Môman."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:220
msgid ""
"You already half-ate me out of house and home. Why dontcha find someplace "
"else to hang out for a while? You've eaten here enough today."
msgstr ""
"Tu bouffes tellement que tu nous as presque mis sur la paille ! Trouve-toi "
"donc un autre endroit ! Tu as assez mangé ici pour aujourd'hui."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:221
msgid "Well "
msgstr "Eh bien, "

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:222
msgid ""
" you sure do look as though you're a mite confused. I hate to see a critter "
"suffer. Want something to eat?"
msgstr ""
" , tu as vraiment l'air perdu. Je n'aime pas voir souffrir de pauvres "
"créatures. Tu veux manger quelque chose ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:223
msgid "Me full. Mom food good. Bye Mom."
msgstr "Moi ventre plein. Mamma bon manger. Au revoir Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:224
msgid "Me pay?"
msgstr "Moi payer ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:225
msgid "Me go. Bye Mom."
msgstr "Moi partir. Au revoir Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:240
msgid "Well, OK. Whatcha got? (Mom reaches for your purse)"
msgstr "Bon, d'accord. Combien tu as ? [Elle prend ton porte-monnaie.]"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:241
msgid "Mom? (you hold out your purse)"
msgstr "Mamma ? [Tu lui tends ton porte-monnaie.]"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:242
msgid "No! Me go. Bye Mommy."
msgstr "Non ! Moi partir. Au revoir, Môman."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:250
msgid ""
"No, not really. I'm sorry. We just have rat-pie, rat-loaf, and spaghetti."
msgstr ""
"Non, je regrette. Il nous reste seulement de la tourte aux rats, un pain de "
"rat, et des spaghettis."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:251
msgid "What'll it be this time around?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que ça sera, cette fois ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:252
msgid "Uh, could I get something without so much rat in it?"
msgstr "Heu, puis-je avoir un truc avec moins de rats ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:253
msgid "I guess I'll have the rat-loaf."
msgstr "Je prendrai un pain de rat."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:254
msgid "I guess I'll have the rat-pie."
msgstr "Une tourte aux rats."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:270
msgid ""
"You could have the spaghetti. It doesn't have too much rat in it - just the "
"sauce, that's all."
msgstr ""
"Tu peux prendre les spaghettis. Il n'y a pas trop de rats dedans. Juste un "
"peu dans la sauce."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:271
msgid "Well, OK, I guess I'll have the spaghetti with rat-sauce."
msgstr "Bon, d'accord. Allons-y pour les spaghettis à la sauce au rat."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:280
msgid "I'll get you a nice helping right away. That'll be $10."
msgstr "Je t'apporte une belle plâtrée tout de suite. Ca fera $10."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:281
msgid "I don't have enough money right now. Let me ask you a question instead."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas assez d'argent pour le moment. A la place, j'aimerais te poser "
"une question."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:282
msgid ""
"$10 for rat? You've got to be crazy. Heck, around the village we charge much "
"more for a nice juicy one. That's a deal."
msgstr ""
"$10 pour du rat ? C'est fou ! Dans le village, un bon gros rat bien juteux "
"coûte bien plus cher. C'est vraiment une affaire !"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:283
msgid "Well, OK. Here's your money."
msgstr "Bon, d'accord. Voilà l'argent."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:284
msgid "I think I've changed my mind. Let me ask you a question instead."
msgstr ""
"Je crois que j'ai changé d'avis. J'aimerais te poser une question à la place."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:285
msgid "I think I'll come back later. Goodbye."
msgstr "Je reviendrai plus tard. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:300
msgid ""
"You have quite an appetite there. I love to see a healthy eater. Will that "
"do it for you?"
msgstr ""
"Tu as bon appétit. J'aime les gens qui mangent bien. Est-ce que ça te "
"suffira ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:301
msgid "Not a chance, Mom. I want seconds."
msgstr "Oh que non, Mamma, je vais en reprendre !"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:302
msgid "Sure will. Let me ask you something, Mom."
msgstr "Certainement. Laisse-moi te poser une question."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:303
msgid "That's it for now. Goodbye, Mom."
msgstr "C'est tout pour le moment. Au revoir Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:320
msgid ""
"Well, I sure need someone to deliver a meal to Smitty. He's just west of "
"here at the junkyard. Will you do it for me? I'll give you a free meal if "
"you do."
msgstr ""
"Bon, j'ai besoin de quelqu'un pour livrer un repas à Smitty. Il est au Sud-"
"Ouest d'ici, au dépotoir. Tu veux bien me rendre ce service ? En échange, tu "
"auras un repas gratuit."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:321
msgid "Sure, I don't mind."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Ca ne me dérange pas."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:322
msgid ""
"Let me think about it. In the meantime, let me ask you about something else."
msgstr ""
"Laisse-moi réfléchir. En attendant, j'aimerais te poser une autre question. "

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:323
msgid "Uh, sorry, Mom. I can't. Goodbye."
msgstr "Heu, je regrette, Mamma. Je ne peux pas. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:340
msgid "You're in luck. We're having radscorpion stew."
msgstr "Tu as de la chance. On a du ragoût de radscorpions."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:341
msgid "We're having braised pig-rat."
msgstr "On a du rat-cochon braisé."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:342
msgid "We're serving steamed radscorpion tails in drawn butter."
msgstr ""
"On a des queues de radscorpions cuites à la vapeur et revenues dans du "
"beurre."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:343
msgid "Cabbage soup is all I've got right now."
msgstr "Je n'ai que de la soupe au chou en ce moment."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:344
msgid "Fresh brahmin fries!"
msgstr "Frites de Brahmine croustillantes !"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:345
msgid "Pipin' hot gecko pie, comin' up."
msgstr "Une tourte de gecko bien chaude : ça marche !"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:346
msgid "Flank steak."
msgstr "Steak de flanchet."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:347
msgid "Well-marbled molerat."
msgstr "Rataupe marbré."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:348
msgid "Fricasseed floater."
msgstr "Fricassée de Flotteur."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:349
msgid "Filet mignon."
msgstr "Filet mignon."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:350
msgid "Medallions of grilled gecko."
msgstr "Médaillons de gecko grillé."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:351
msgid "Mantis marsala."
msgstr "Mante Marsala."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:352
msgid "Molerat manicotti."
msgstr "Rataupe Manicotti."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:353
msgid "Brahmin en brochette."
msgstr "Brahmine en brochette."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:354
msgid "Radscorpion en croute."
msgstr "Radscorpion en croûte."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:355
msgid "It's Smeat!"
msgstr "Succulent cochon de lait."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:356
msgid "Uh, I'm not sure, but it tastes like chicken."
msgstr "Heu, je ne sais pas, mais le goût ressemble à celui du poulet."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:357
msgid "Centaur chops, my specialty."
msgstr "Côtelette de Centaure, ma spécialité."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:358
msgid "It's a surprise."
msgstr "C'est une surprise."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:359
msgid "I can't give away my secret recipes!"
msgstr "C'est de la viande en boîte !"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:375
msgid ""
"Here you go. You look half-starved. (Mom hands you a big steaming plate of "
"delicious smelling food.)"
msgstr ""
"Et voilà. Tu as l'air presque famélique. [Mamma te tend une assiette fumante "
"au parfum délicieux.]"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:376
msgid "Tank-u, Mom."
msgstr "Mèssi Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:385
msgid "There you go. I knew you'd enjoy that."
msgstr "Et voilà. Je savais que ça te plairait."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:386
msgid "Mmm, yum yum. Bye, Mom."
msgstr "Miam-miam... Salut, Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:395
msgid ""
"Thanks so much. I'd do it myself but there's nobody to watch the place while "
"I'm gone. Here's Smitty's meal. If I didn't have it brought to him I'm sure "
"he'd forget to eat."
msgstr ""
"Merci infiniment. Je l'aurais bien fait moi-même mais il n'y aurait plus "
"personne pour surveiller ici. Tiens, voilà le repas de Smitty. Si je ne lui "
"faisais pas porter le déjeuner, je suis sûre qu'il oublierait de manger !"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:396
msgid "I'll bring it right over to him."
msgstr "Je le lui apporterai."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:405
msgid ""
"I'm so disappointed in you. Poor Smitty had to come get his own meal. Now "
"what do you want?"
msgstr ""
"Tu m'as déçue. Le pauvre Smitty a dû venir chercher son repas lui-même. "
"Maintenant, que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:406
msgid ""
"Hello there, my name's Mom and I run this place. Got the best food north of "
"New Reno, too."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour, je m'appelle Mamma et je tiens ce restaurant. La meilleure cuisine "
"au Nord de New Reno."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:407
msgid "What did you want to talk to Mom about?"
msgstr "De quoi voulais-tu parler avec Mamma ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:408
msgid "You're not my mom."
msgstr "T'es pas ma mère."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:409
msgid "Have you heard of a Vault or anyone named Vic?"
msgstr "Connais-tu un Abri ou quelqu'un nommé Vic ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:410
msgid "What's there to do here in town?"
msgstr "Que peut-on faire ici en ville ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:411
msgid "What do you have to eat here?"
msgstr "Qu'as-tu à manger ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:417
msgid "Well if it isn't my hero. What can Mom do you for today?"
msgstr ""
"Tiens, ce ne serait pas mon héros par hasard ? Que peut faire Mamma pour toi "
"?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:425
msgid ""
"I know that. But everyone calls me that. Heck, I even treat people like "
"they're my kin - long as you obey my rules that is."
msgstr ""
"J'sais bien, mais tout le monde m'appelle comme ça. Les gens sont un peu de "
"la famille, mais seulement s'ils respectent mes règles."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:426
msgid "Rules?"
msgstr "Les règles ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:435
msgid ""
"That's right. No stealing, no cursing, and no fighting - not in my shop you "
"don't. 'Cause if'n you do, out you'll go. I like things peaceful here."
msgstr ""
"C'est ça. Pas de vol, pas de gros mots, pas de bagarre. Pas chez moi en tout "
"cas. Sinon, j'te flanque dehors ! J'aime avoir la paix ici."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:436 dialog/fcdrwong.msg:362 dialog/rcmarion.msg:161
msgid "I see. Let me ask you something else."
msgstr "Je vois. J'aimerais te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:437
msgid "That makes sense. See you later, Mom."
msgstr "C'est sûr. A plus tard, Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:445
msgid ""
"Well now, there's a Vault City a ways east of here and a little north. And "
"Vic, hmm, lemme think."
msgstr ""
"Bon, alors il y a une Cité de l'Abri à l'Est d'ici, légèrement vers le Nord. "
"Et Vic, hum... Laisse-moi réfléchir."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:446
msgid "I sure hope you know where Vic is. He's a trader."
msgstr "J'espère que tu sais où se trouve Vic. C'est un marchand."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:447
msgid "Thanks but that's all I need to know. Bye, Mom."
msgstr "Merci. C'est tout ce que je voulais savoir."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:455
msgid ""
"Trader Vic? Now that rings a bell. Yes, I think he's being held by Metzger "
"for some reason."
msgstr ""
"Vic le Marchand ? Ca me rappelle quelque chose. Oui, je crois que Metzger "
"l'a enfermé."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:456
msgid "Who's Metzger and where do I find him?"
msgstr "Qui est Metzger et où puis-je le trouver ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:457
msgid "That's great, Mom. Thanks."
msgstr "T'es super, Mamma. Merci."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:465
msgid ""
"Metzger's the head of the local Slaver's Guild. He's got all kinds of people "
"locked up in his place. It's right up the street, just north of here."
msgstr ""
"Metzger c'est le chef de la Guilde des Esclavagistes. Il a enfermé des tas "
"de gens chez lui. Il habite un peu plus haut dans la rue, au Nord d'ici."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:466
msgid ""
"Metzger used to be the head of the local Slaver's Guild. He had all kinds of "
"people locked up in his place. But I don't know now - I heard he's been "
"killed."
msgstr ""
"Metzger c'était le chef de la Guilde des Esclavagistes. Il avait enfermé des "
"tas de gens chez lui. Mais je ne sais pas, j'ai entendu dire qu'il avait été "
"tué."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:467
msgid "Thanks for the information. Let me ask you something else, Mom."
msgstr "Merci pour ces renseignements. Mais dis-moi, Mamma..."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:468
msgid "I need to go take care of some business. Thanks, Mom."
msgstr "Je dois partir m'occuper d'une affaire. Merci, Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:475
msgid "Go on and get that meal to Smitty now."
msgstr "Vas-y et porte ce repas à Smitty maintenant."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:476
msgid "I won't help you out until you keep your word."
msgstr "Je ne t'aiderai pas tant que tu n'auras pas tenu parole."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:477
msgid "Hurry up now."
msgstr "Dépêche-toi maintenant."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:478
msgid "Go give Smitty his meal. Hurry up."
msgstr "Va donner le repas à Smitty. Dépêche-toi."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:479
msgid "Stop your lollygagging and get that meal to Smitty."
msgstr "Ne reste pas là à rien faire ! Porte ce repas à Smitty."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:485
msgid ""
"That was good work. You must have worked up quite an appetite.\n"
" I have a real treat for you as a reward. A combination plate of the best\n"
" darn food I have here, just for you."
msgstr ""
"C'est du bon travail. Tu dois avoir très faim. Je t'ai préparé une petite "
"gâterie pour te récompenser. Un assortiment de mes meilleurs plats. "
"Uniquement pour toi."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:486
msgid "That sounds great! Let me at it!"
msgstr "Ca m'a l'air génial ! Voyons ça."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:487
msgid "Gee, Mom. I don't think I can eat just now, but thanks anyhow. Goodbye."
msgstr ""
"Oh, Mamma. Je ne pense pas pouvoir manger maintenant. Merci quand même. Au "
"revoir."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:500
msgid ""
"Hmm, don't know much about that. Someone's probably just having\n"
" a little fun, that's all."
msgstr ""
"Hum. Je sais pas grand-chose là-dessus. C'est peut-être seulement quelqu'un "
"qui s'amuse."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:501
msgid "Has it always been haunted?"
msgstr "Elle a toujours été hantée ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:502
msgid "Does anyone use that house?"
msgstr "Cette maison est-elle encore habitée ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:503
msgid "I agree. Bye."
msgstr "Je suis d'accord. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:520
msgid ""
"Started about 2 years back. I heard about the moaning and the spirits and "
"all.\n"
" Don't believe it myself."
msgstr ""
"Ca a commencé il y a 2 ans. J'ai entendu parler de gémissements et "
"d'esprits. Mais j'y crois pas."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:521
msgid "Two years, huh? Anybody use the place back then?"
msgstr "Il y a 2 ans, hein ? La maison était-elle habitée à l'époque ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:522
msgid "Me neither. Thanks."
msgstr "Moi non plus. Merci."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:540
msgid ""
"One of the boys used to sleep there a few years back. Maybe he knows "
"something."
msgstr ""
"L'un des garçons dormait là-bas il y a quelques années. Il sait peut-être "
"quelque chose."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:541 dialog/scfelix.msg:123 dialog/vcchet.msg:120
msgid "Who?"
msgstr "Qui ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:560
msgid ""
"He used to come by and try to pawn stuff. Jewelry mostly. I remember\n"
" a little gold locket he kept for himself."
msgstr ""
"Il venait de temps en temps mettre des bijoux en gage. Je me souviens d'un "
"petit médaillon en or qu'il a gardé pour lui."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:561
msgid "Do you remember his name?"
msgstr "Tu te souviens de son nom ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:562
msgid "Locket? Strange. Who was it?"
msgstr "Un médaillon ? Etrange. Qui c'était ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:580
msgid ""
"Not sure. Think it was Joseph, Joel or something like that. He's almost 19\n"
" now.... A shame, really. I believe he's joined up with some local thugs."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais plus. Joe ou Joël, un truc dans ce genre là. Il a presque 19 ans "
"maintenant. Il fait partie d'une bande de voyous du coin."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:581
msgid "Thanks. I have another question for you."
msgstr "Merci. J'aimerais te poser une autre question."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:600
msgid "What do you know about that haunted house?"
msgstr "Que sais-tu de cette maison hantée ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:800
msgid "I noticed there seems to be a lot of orphans around town."
msgstr "Les orphelins sont vraiment nombreux dans cette ville."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:801
msgid ""
"It's a shame, isn't it? Those poor children living on the streets like "
"that... A lot of them steal to get by -- from\n"
" outsiders mostly -- so if you catch one trying to relieve you of something, "
"please take pity on 'em. I'm not saying it's\n"
" right, but it's a harsh world we live in, and we all do what we have to in "
"order to make it through the day."
msgstr ""
"Oui, c'est malheureux hein ? Ces enfants n'ont pas de maison et ils volent "
"pour vivre... C'est terrible."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:802
msgid ""
"There's gotta be something we can do about this. From what I hear, you seem "
"to be the only person around that\n"
" actually gives a damn about those kids."
msgstr ""
"Il doit bien y avoir quelque chose que l'on puisse faire à ce sujet. D'après "
"ce que j'ai entendu, tu sembles être la seule personne aux alentours qui se "
"préoccupe vraiment de ces enfants."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:803
msgid ""
"Why of course I do. Children are our future. They don't *have* to grow up to "
"be jetheads, thugs, and whores like\n"
" most of their deadbeat parents. Why, with an education and some love and "
"care, these kids could grow into the kind of\n"
" decent folk that we so desperately need in this world. I've tried "
"establishing an orphanage for them, but sadly, that\n"
" didn't pan out."
msgstr ""
"Ces enfants ont besoin d'un endroit pour vivre et d'une vraie éducation. Il "
"y a quelques années je voulais ouvrir un orphelinat mais c'était impossible. "
"Personne n'en voulait, et il n'y a jamais eu d'endroit pour ça. C'est "
"vraiment navrant. Les enfants sont notre futur... Ils ont tous oublié ça "
"depuis la guerre."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:804
msgid ""
"Maybe it's time to give it another try. I'm not going to be in town for too "
"much longer, but I'll do what I can to help while I'm here."
msgstr "Ca m'intéresse. Que puis-je faire pour t'aider ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:805
msgid "That's too bad. Well, nice talking with you. Bye."
msgstr "Quel dommage. Bon, c'était sympa de te parler. Allez, salut."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:806
msgid ""
"Yes, perhaps you *could* help. You see, I procured a large building over on "
"the south-west side that, with a little work, would make an excellent\n"
" orphanage. But a bunch of lowlifes are squatting there and refuse to leave "
"unless I pay an absurd fee. Even if I *had* the money, I wouldn't give\n"
" it to them bullies -- they'd just use it to further poison themselves. I'd "
"go to the authorities, but unfortunately, there's no such thing in the Den.\n"
" Perhaps you'd have better luck at convincing them to leave?"
msgstr ""
"Tu veux m'aider ? Génial ! Je connais un endroit parfait qui pourrait "
"facilement être reconverti en orphelinat. Il y a un grand bâtiment abandonné "
"dans la zone résidentielle. Il reste des squatteurs là-bas, mais si on "
"trouve un moyen de les faire partir, on pourra restaurer le bâtiment et ce "
"sera parfait. Qu'en penses-tu ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:807
msgid ""
"I'm sure I could get them out of there. One way, or another. I'll let you "
"know once they're gone."
msgstr ""
"Ca pourrait marcher. Je reviendrai te prévenir quand j'aurais fait évacuer "
"le bâtiment."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:808
msgid ""
"Never was a fan of evicting people. Perhaps someone else is better suited "
"for this."
msgstr ""
"J'ai jamais vraiment aimé expulser les gens, tu sais. Peut-être que tu "
"pourrais trouver quelqu'un d'autre ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:809
msgid ""
"Oh... I see. That's really too bad. Thanks for trying though. Would you like "
"anything before you go?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, je vois... C'est vraiment dommage. Merci d'avoir essayé, tu n'as besoin "
"de rien d'autre ?"

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:810
msgid "Nope. Bye Mom."
msgstr "Rien. Salut Mamma."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:811
msgid ""
"If I catch one of them little bastards stealing from me, it'll be the last "
"thing they ever do. I don't care what\n"
" their excuse is, a thief is a thief. Bye."
msgstr ""
"Si j'attrape un de ces petits salopards en train de me voler, ce sera la "
"dernière fois. Je me fiche de savoir quelle est leur excuse, un voleur est "
"un voleur. A plus."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:820
msgid ""
"Good news, Mom. The building's all yours. I ran into a little snag, but "
"those squatters won't be bothering you again."
msgstr ""
"Bonne nouvelle, Mamma. J'ai nettoyé le bâtiment. J'ai eu un petit "
"accrochage, mais ces squatteurs ne seront plus un problème."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:821
msgid ""
"The squatters said they'd leave and that they're sorry for causing trouble. "
"They're currently cleaning the place up to try and make it up to you. I was "
"thinking maybe, if they do well enough, you could offer some of them jobs."
msgstr ""
"J'ai parlé avec les squatteurs. Ils ont dit qu'ils allaient partir et qu'ils "
"étaient désolés d'avoir causé des ennuis. Ils sont en train de nettoyer "
"l'endroit pour essayer de se racheter. Je me disais que peut-être, s'ils "
"s'en sortent assez bien, vous pourriez leur offrir des emplois."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:822
msgid ""
"Oh, that's great news! Thank you so much! I just hope no one was hurt in the "
"process. I'll get in touch with some friends and we'll get\n"
" started right away. If you're still in town a few days from now, you should "
"stop by. Hopefully, we'll have things up and running by then. Oh,\n"
" I'm so excited! Thanks again. Here, this meal's on me."
msgstr ""
"C'est une excellente nouvelle. J'espère que personne n'a été blessé dans "
"cette histoire. Bien, je vais contacter quelques amis et on pourra "
"commencer. Reviens dans la zone résidentielle d'ici quelques jours pour voir "
"l'orphelinat. Je suis si heureuse ! Encore une fois, merci. Tiens, voilà un "
"repas que j'ai préparé."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:823
msgid ""
"Hmm... I suppose everyone deserves a second chance. I'll stop over there "
"with some friends and we'll talk things over with 'em. Thank you so much\n"
" for helping me with this. If you're still in town a few days from now, you "
"should stop by. Hopefully, we'll have things up and running by then. Oh, I'm "
"so\n"
" excited! Thanks again. Here, this meal's on me."
msgstr ""
"Mmh... Je suppose que tout le monde mérite une seconde chance. Bien, je vais "
"contacter quelques amis et on pourra commencer. Reviens dans la zone "
"résidentielle d'ici quelques jours pour voir l'orphelinat. Je suis si "
"heureuse ! Encore une fois, merci. Tiens, voilà un repas que j'ai préparé."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:824
msgid "Thanks Mom. See you around."
msgstr "Merci Mamma. A la prochaine."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:850
msgid "You help establish an orphanage for the children of The Den."
msgstr ""
"Tu as aidé à l'établissement d'un orphelinat pour les enfants de la Fosse."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:1821
msgid ""
"Good news, Mom. The building's all yours. It took a little convincing, but I "
"got the squatters to agree to pack up and move on.\n"
" I don't think they'll be bothering you again."
msgstr ""
"Bonne nouvelle, Mamma. J'ai convaincu les squatteurs de partir. Je ne pense "
"pas qu'ils vous dérangeront à nouveau."

#: dialog/dcmom.msg:1822
msgid ""
"Oh, that's great news! Thank you so much! I'll get in touch with some "
"friends and we'll get started right away. If you're still in town\n"
" a few days from now, you should stop by. Hopefully, we'll have things up "
"and running by then. Oh, I'm so excited! Thanks again. Here, this meal's on "
"me."
msgstr ""
"C'est une excellente nouvelle. Bien, je vais contacter quelques amis et on "
"pourra commencer. Reviens dans la zone résidentielle d'ici quelques jours "
"pour voir l'orphelinat. Je suis si heureuse ! Encore une fois, merci. Tiens, "
"voilà un repas que j'ai préparé."

