#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:237
msgid "Hey, you hear? Metzger's dead or something."
msgstr "Hé, tu connais la nouvelle ? Y paraît que Metzger est mort."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:238
msgid "Wow, someone diced the Metzger the Butcher."
msgstr "Oh, oh... Quelqu'un a buté Metzger le Boucher."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:239
msgid "Hope Tubby can stay in business with Metz gone."
msgstr ""
"J'espère que Dodu pourra rester dans les affaires même si Metzger est mort."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:250
msgid "Wow, man. He killed Tubby."
msgstr "Hé ! Il a tué Dodu !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:251
msgid "I think my shit went bad."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression que mon matos est pourri."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:252
msgid "Woh, what's going on?"
msgstr "Oh, qu'est-ce qui s'passe ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:253
msgid "What was all that noise?"
msgstr "C'était quoi tout ce bruit ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:254
msgid "Dang, that was nasty shit."
msgstr "Merde, c'était pas du bon matos."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:255
msgid "Wow, man. She killed Tubby."
msgstr "Hé ! Elle a tué Dodu !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:260
msgid "Ooooohhyaaa... Good stuff."
msgstr "Ooooohhouuaaahh... c'est du bon."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:262
msgid "Oh, yeah, I'm flying now."
msgstr "Ah ouais... Je plane..."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:263
msgid "Oh so warm."
msgstr "Oh, il fait chaud."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:264
msgid "She's so pretty."
msgstr "Elle est tellement belle !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:265
msgid "Oh, blackout... Shit, I can't see."
msgstr "Oh, c'est le blackout... merde, je vois plus rien."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:270
msgid "Wow, you see that?"
msgstr "Hé, tu vois c'que j' vois ?!"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:271
msgid "Yeah, you know what it was?"
msgstr "Ouais, tu sais ce que c'était ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:272
msgid "I think it was a bird."
msgstr "Je crois que c'était un oiseau."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:273
msgid "No, a dog."
msgstr "Non, un chien."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:274
msgid "But it was flying, man."
msgstr "Mais, ça volait !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:275
msgid "No way - it zoomed across the ground."
msgstr "La vache... Ca a traversé le sol en trombe."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:276
msgid "Yeah, you seeing things, man."
msgstr "T'as des hallus mon vieux !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:277
msgid "No way. That was real."
msgstr "Mais non, j'délire pas !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:279
msgid "Ohhhh it's kicking in again. Ahh."
msgstr "Ohhh, ça recommence à donner des coups de pieds. Ahhh !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:290
msgid "Pretty lights."
msgstr "Jolies lumières."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:291
msgid "Lots of lights."
msgstr "Beaucoup de lumières."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:292
msgid "They're so warm."
msgstr "Il fait si bon."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:293
msgid "And the trees."
msgstr "Et les arbres."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:294
msgid "Where are the women?"
msgstr "Où sont les femmes ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:295
msgid "So green and pretty."
msgstr "Si vertes et si belles."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:296
msgid "I like potatoes."
msgstr "J'aime les pommes de terre."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:297
msgid "Trees are made of wood."
msgstr "Les arbres sont en bois."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:298
msgid "I like women and potatoes."
msgstr "J'aime les femmes et les pommes de terre."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:299
msgid "They make smoke when they burn."
msgstr "Ca fait de la fumée quand ça brûle."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:300
msgid "But not together."
msgstr "Mais pas ensemble."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:301
msgid "Animals live in trees."
msgstr "Les animaux habitent dans les arbres."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:302
msgid "No, not women and trees, women and potatoes."
msgstr "Non, pas des femmes et des arbres ! Des femmes et des pommes de terre !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:303
msgid "I can climb a tree."
msgstr "Je sais grimper aux arbres."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:304
msgid "A woman climbing a tree eating potatoes? You're dumb."
msgstr ""
"Une femme qui grimpe aux arbres en mangeant de pommes de terre ? T'es grave, "
"toi."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:305
msgid "Where do trees come from?"
msgstr "D'où ils viennent les arbres ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:306
msgid "You can't climb a tree and eat potatoes."
msgstr "Tu peux pas grimper aux arbres en mangeant des pommes de terre."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:307
msgid "I like bushes, too."
msgstr "J'aime aussi les arbustes."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:308
msgid "Well, not very easily."
msgstr "Enfin, c'est difficile."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:309
msgid "Because they're green."
msgstr "Parce qu'ils sont verts."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:310
msgid "Potatoes aren't green."
msgstr "Les pommes de terre ne sont pas vertes."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:311
msgid "Ohhh, the pretty lights."
msgstr "Oh, les jolies lumières !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:312
msgid "Oh, my head hurts..."
msgstr "Oh, j'ai mal à la tête..."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:320
msgid "Don't talk to me, man. My head hurts."
msgstr "Ne me parle plus, j'ai mal à la tête."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:321
msgid "I won't tell anyone."
msgstr "Je ne le dirai à personne."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:322 dialog/ecspammr.msg:128 dialog/hcghoul.msg:180
msgid "Don't hurt me."
msgstr "Ne me fais pas mal."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:324
msgid "I didn't see anything."
msgstr "J'ai rien vu."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:325
msgid "I didn't hear anything."
msgstr "J'ai rien entendu."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:326
msgid "Please, just leave."
msgstr "Va-t'en, s'il te plaît."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:327
msgid "Lady, I don't feel much like talking. My fucking head is killing me."
msgstr "Eh, la miss, j'ai pas trop envie de causer. J'ai un méga mal de crâne."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:340
msgid "Oh man, you suck."
msgstr "Putain, tu crains."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:341
msgid "What did you go and ruin a perfect high for?"
msgstr "Pourquoi t'as gâché un trip aussi parfait ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:342
msgid "Man, that hurt!"
msgstr "Putain c'que ça fait mal !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:343
msgid "What the hell?"
msgstr "Oh, ça va aller oui ?!"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:344
msgid "How's that going to happen?"
msgstr "Comment est-ce que ça va arriver ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:400
msgid "Tubby's so wonderful."
msgstr "Dodu est fantastique."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:401
msgid "Jet makes me so horny."
msgstr "Le Jet, ça m'excite complètement."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:402
msgid "Tubby knows how to take care of his women!"
msgstr "Dodu a le doigté pour s'occuper de ses femmes."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:403
msgid "Isn't Tubby wonderful?"
msgstr "Tu trouves pas qu'il est fantastique Dodu ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:404
msgid "Oh, baby- Wait! You ain't Tubby."
msgstr "Oh, oui mon chou ! Hé, arrête ! T'es pas Dodu !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:405
msgid "Where's our big man at?"
msgstr "Où il est notre homme ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:406
msgid "Doesn't it just make your skin tingle?"
msgstr "Tu sens des picotements dans la peau, hein ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:407
msgid "Tubby has the best supply in town."
msgstr "Dodu est le meilleur fournisseur de toute la ville !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:420
msgid "Did you hear a loud bang?"
msgstr "As-tu entendu un grand \"Boum\" ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:421
msgid "Haven't seen Tubby in a while."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas vu Dodu depuis un bout de temps."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:422
msgid "Where's Tubby?"
msgstr "Où il est Dodu ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:423
msgid "You seen Tubby?"
msgstr "T'aurais pas vu Dodu ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:440
msgid "Oh, my head!"
msgstr "Oh, ma tête !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:441
msgid "Where's Tubby! I think I'm going to die!"
msgstr "Où il est Dodu ?! Je crois que je vais mourir."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:443
msgid "Oh, the pain is getting really bad."
msgstr "Oh, cette douleur devient de plus en plus forte !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:444
msgid "Tubby hasn't given us any in a while. Where he at?"
msgstr "Ca fait un moment que Dodu ne nous a plus approvisionnés. Où est-il ?"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:445
msgid "My lips are numb."
msgstr "Je sens plus mes lèvres."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:446
msgid "I can't feel my fingers."
msgstr "Je sens plus mes doigts."

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:461
msgid "Please, don't!"
msgstr "Non, arrête !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:462
msgid "I didn't take it!"
msgstr "Je ne l'ai pas !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:463
msgid "It wasn't me!"
msgstr "C'était pas moi !"

#: dialog/dctubfri.msg:465
msgid "I didn't know it was yours!"
msgstr "Je savais pas que c'était à toi !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:100
msgid "You see Tyler."
msgstr "Tu vois Tyler."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:101
msgid "You see Tyler, the leader of this gang."
msgstr "Tu vois Tyler, le chef de ce gang."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:150
msgid "He seems fairly strong."
msgstr "Il a l'air plutôt fort."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:200
msgid "Hey, don't touch the fucking door."
msgstr "Hé ! Touche pas à cette porte !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:201 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:321
msgid "Moron."
msgstr "Débile !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:210
msgid "Now we finish it."
msgstr "Maintenant, faut finir."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:220
msgid "Told you it would be a piece of cake."
msgstr "Je t'avais dit que ça serait du gâteau."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:221
msgid "That was like leading lambs to the slaughter."
msgstr "C'était comme si on menait des agneaux à l'abattoir."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:222
msgid "That fucking bitch is finally dead!"
msgstr "Cette salope est enfin crevée !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:223
msgid "Thanks for the tip, that was sweet."
msgstr "Merci pour le conseil, c'était très sympa."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:230
msgid "Where the hell were you?"
msgstr "T'étais où, bordel ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:231
msgid "Trap my ass! Fucking liar."
msgstr "Un piège, mon cul ! Tu mens comme tu respires."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:232
msgid "I should gut you right now."
msgstr "Je devrais t'étriper !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:233
msgid "So much for the plan, asshole."
msgstr "D'enfer le plan !!!"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:234
msgid "You better not have been jerking me around."
msgstr "J'espère que t'as pas passé ton temps à te foutre de ma gueule !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:235
msgid "How'd you fuck this one up?"
msgstr "Comment t'as fait pour bousiller celui-là ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:240
msgid "You just lead those dumb bastards here and we'll nail them to the wall."
msgstr "Amène ces connards ici qu'on les cloue au mur !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:241
msgid "We're waiting."
msgstr "On attend."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:242
msgid "We can't wait all night."
msgstr "On peut pas attendre toute la nuit."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:243
msgid "What are you waiting for? I'm ready for blood."
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'on attend ? J'veux que ça saigne moi."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:244
msgid "Do it already! Don't let them get suspicious."
msgstr "Ben vas-y ! N'attends pas qu'ils se doutent de quelque chose !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:245
msgid "Hurry the hell up."
msgstr "Magne-toi !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:250
msgid "Who the hell are you and what do you want?"
msgstr "Qui es-tu et que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:251
msgid "So, what do you want this time?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu, cette fois ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:252 dialog/slvcc1.msg:107
msgid "Metzger sent me."
msgstr "Metzger m'envoie. Il a besoin de quelques esclaves."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:253
msgid "I'm here to inspect the church."
msgstr "Je suis là pour inspecter l'église."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:256
msgid "Aruwa?"
msgstr "Arouva ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:260
msgid "What the hell for? His stuff's not going anywhere."
msgstr "Pour quoi faire ? Ses affaires ne bougent pas d'ici."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:261
msgid "His crap still hasn't moved an inch."
msgstr "Ses trucs n'ont pas bougé d'un pouce."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:262
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah. You're a slaver now, eh? So what did he want? It's not going "
"anywhere - not like it could."
msgstr ""
"Ah ouais ? T'es esclavagiste maintenant, hein ? Alors, que voulait-il ? Ca "
"ne bouge pas d'ici... impossible."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:263
msgid "He wanted me to check it for him."
msgstr "Il voulait que je vérifie à sa place."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:264
msgid "Well, he wants to be sure."
msgstr "Eh bien, il veut seulement être sûr."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:270
msgid "Sure he did. I've never seen you around here before. Now, beat it."
msgstr "Ouais c'est ça. J'ai jamais vu ta tête par ici, alors, casse-toi !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:271
msgid "Let me in there now, before I have to get angry on your face!"
msgstr "Laisse-moi rentrer *tout de suite* ou j'me fâche !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:272
msgid ""
"Look, he had me come into town just to inspect his damn stuff. I could care "
"less."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, il m'a fait venir en ville pour que j'inspecte ses foutus trucs. "
"Moi, j'en ai rien à cirer."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:280
msgid ""
"Whatever, slaver. Just go on in. Does he think it's just going to up and "
"leave?\n"
" Who the hell would want that shit?"
msgstr ""
"Bon, d'accord, l'esclavagiste. Vas-y. Il croit peut-être que ça va s'envoler "
"comme ça ? De toute façon, j'vois pas qui voudrait de cette merde..."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:281
msgid ""
"Fuck it. Just go in. Does he think it's just going to up and leave? Who the\n"
" hell would want that shit anyhow?"
msgstr ""
"Et merde. Vas-y. Il croit peut-être que ça va s'envoler comme ça ? De toute "
"façon, j'vois pas qui voudrait de cette merde..."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:290
msgid ""
"Okay, fuck. It's not like I really care. Like you would know what to do with "
"any of that shit anyway."
msgstr ""
"D'accord. De toute façon, je m'en fiche. Que pourrais-tu faire avec ces "
"merdes de toute façon ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:291
msgid "Grrrr."
msgstr "Grrrr."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:300
msgid "Beat it, tough guy, before I get angry on Your face."
msgstr "Casse-toi, mon gars. Sinon, je me fâche et c'est toi qui prends !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:301
msgid ""
"Beat it, bitch. Metzger wouldn't have sent a woman anyhow, so take a hike."
msgstr ""
"Tire-toi, la pétasse. Metzger n'aurait jamais envoyé une femme. Alors, bouge "
"de là."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:302
msgid "Bitch? I'll show you what this bitch can do."
msgstr "Pétasse, hein ? Je vais te montrer moi ce que la pétasse peut faire !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:304
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[Partir]"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:320
msgid "That's nice. Me Tyler. Me go bye bye."
msgstr "Sympa ! Moi Tyler. Moi partir. Salut."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:321
msgid "Ur."
msgstr "Heu."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:330
msgid "Beat it, freak."
msgstr "Dégage, espèce de monstre."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:331
msgid "Sukyu!"
msgstr "Couillole !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:332
msgid "Arug!"
msgstr "Aroug !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:340
msgid "I don't think so. Now beat it."
msgstr "Je crois pas. Maintenant, tire-toi."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:342
msgid "But!"
msgstr "Mais !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:350
msgid "Yeah, I bet you are. Who sent you?"
msgstr "Ouais, tu m'étonnes. Qui t'envoie ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:351
msgid "Yeah, you said that already, fuck head. Who sent you?"
msgstr "Ouais, tu te répètes, tête à claques. Qui t'envoie ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:352
msgid "Who do you think, moron? Now stop dicking around and let me in."
msgstr "D'après toi, débile ? Arrête de me faire chier et laisse-moi rentrer !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:353
msgid "The pink panther."
msgstr "La panthère rose."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:354
msgid "Okay, you'll regret that."
msgstr "Bon, eh bien, tu vas le regretter !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:360
msgid "The what? Get outta here!"
msgstr "La quoi ? Barre-toi d'ici !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:361
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Mais..."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:370
msgid ""
"Now what the hell does the boss want? Another stupid fucking inspection?"
msgstr ""
"Bon, qu'est-ce qu'il veut, le Patron ? Encore une inspection de mes deux ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:372 dialog/qcgensci.msg:117 dialog/rcdrjohn.msg:155
#: dialog/rclou.msg:109
msgid "What now?"
msgstr "Quoi encore ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:374 dialog/ocgoris.msg:110
msgid "Sorry, gotta go."
msgstr "Excuse-moi, je dois partir."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:375
msgid "Uk."
msgstr "Ok."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:376
msgid "Lub?"
msgstr "Hein ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:380
msgid ""
"Actually, great! Almost forgot - a buddy of mine won it big at the tables "
"and he's sharing the wealth, if you know what I mean."
msgstr ""
"Au fait, super ! J'avais presque oublié. Un de mes potes a gagné gros au jeu "
"et maintenant il doit partager son magot, si tu vois ce que j'veux dire."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:381
msgid ""
"Pretty fucking bored. I hate guarding - but, hey, things can't be that bad. "
"A buddy of mine won it big at the tables and he's sharing the wealth, if you "
"know what I mean."
msgstr ""
"Ca m'emmerde de monter la garde. Mais, ça pourrait être pire ! Un de mes "
"potes a gagné gros au jeu et maintenant il doit partager son magot, si tu "
"vois ce que j'veux dire."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:382
msgid "Big plans, then?"
msgstr "Des grands projets, hein ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:383
msgid "Sounds like fun."
msgstr "Ca a l'air cool."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:390
msgid "Yeah, he's throwing a party tonight at his place. Should be a blast."
msgstr "Ouais, il organise une fête ce soir chez lui. Ca va cartonner."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:391
msgid ""
"Yeah, he's throwing a party tonight at his place. Should be a blast. I'd "
"invite you, honey, but it's only for his closest friends."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, il organise une fête ce soir chez lui. Ca devrait être top. "
"J'aimerais t'inviter, mon chou, mais c'est réservé à ses amis intimes."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:392
msgid "Down a few brews for me."
msgstr "Bois quelques verres à ma santé."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:393
msgid "I understand, thanks. Have fun."
msgstr "Je comprends. Amuse-toi bien."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:400
msgid "You better believe it! We're going to drink until we drop!"
msgstr "Crois-moi. On va boire jusqu'à ce qu'on tombe par terre !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:410
msgid "What the fuck do you care. Beat it."
msgstr "En quoi ça t'regarde ? Casse-toi."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:411
msgid "Yeah, so-so."
msgstr "Ouais, ouais."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:412
msgid "You trying to annoy me?"
msgstr "T'essaies de m'énerver ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:414
msgid "Tired."
msgstr "Fatiguant."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:417
msgid "Been better."
msgstr "Ca pourrait aller mieux."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:430
msgid "Can't wait for that party. Hope he has a few whores there again."
msgstr ""
"Je me languis de cette fête ! J'espère qu'il va \"réinviter\" ses filles..."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:431
msgid "My buddy really knows how to throw a party."
msgstr "Mon pote sait vraiment bien organiser les fêtes."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:432
msgid "Almost party time."
msgstr "C'est bientôt l'heure de faire la fête !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:433
msgid "Party! Wish I was there now."
msgstr "La fête ! J'aimerais déjà y être !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:440
msgid "Hey, what's up? Almost time for that party."
msgstr "Hé, quoi de neuf ? C'est presque l'heure de la fête !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:441 dialog/gcfolk.msg:163 dialog/rcgenpes.msg:118
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Quoi de neuf ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:442
msgid "I have some information you might be interested in."
msgstr "J'ai quelques renseignements susceptibles de t'intéresser."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:444
msgid "Uhg."
msgstr "Argh."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:445
msgid "Urseco?"
msgstr "Ouga ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:450
msgid "Damn, what the hell's wrong with you today? Lay off the drugs."
msgstr "Merde, qu'est-ce que t'as aujourd'hui ? Arrête un peu de planer !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:451
msgid "Drugs are bad for you, man."
msgstr "Les stimulants, c'est mauvais pour toi, mon vieux."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:452
msgid "Drugs are bad for you, lady."
msgstr "Les stimulants, c'est mauvais pour toi, ma vieille."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:453
msgid "[Grunt]"
msgstr "[grognement]"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:460
msgid "Oh, yeah? What's that?"
msgstr "Ah ouais ? Et quoi donc ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:461
msgid "It'll cost you."
msgstr "Les infos, ça s'paie..."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:462 dialog/dctyler.msg:481
msgid "Lara's planning on hitting this place tonight."
msgstr "Lara doit faire une descente ici ce soir."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:463
msgid "Wait a minute."
msgstr "Attends une minute."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:470
msgid ""
"You fucking earned this. Here's your money. I've been wanting to finish them "
"off\n"
" for a while."
msgstr ""
"Tiens. Tu l'as bien gagné ton argent. Ca fait un bon moment qu'j'essaie de "
"les liquider."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:480
msgid ""
"Yeah, fuck you. It depends on what it is. You tell me, then I'll decide\n"
" if I pay you anything for it."
msgstr ""
"Va t'faire foutre. Ca dépend de ce que c'est. Dis-moi et après, je déciderai "
"si je te paie ou non."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:490
msgid ""
"Oh really? So that bitch has got some balls after all? Well, that's worth a "
"$100."
msgstr "Ah bon ? Alors elle a des couilles finalement ? Bon, ça vaut $100."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:500
msgid ""
"Not so fast, slick. Just to be sure, we'll wait until after they show.\n"
" You could be lying to me for all I know. You just be sure they show, and "
"I'll pay you after."
msgstr ""
"Pas si vite. D'abord, je veux voir... Tu pourrais très bien me mentir après "
"tout. Fais en sorte qu'ils se montrent et ensuite, je te paierai."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:501
msgid "But I'm a lover, not a fighter."
msgstr "Mais, j'fais l'amour moi, pas la guerre."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:510
msgid ""
"Look, I don't give a rat's ass what you are. I'm not giving you a dollar\n"
" until after they show. We'll do the fighting, but you better be sure they "
"show."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, j'en ai rien à cirer de savoir c'que tu fais ! Tu n'auras pas un "
"dollar avant qu'ils se montrent. On se battra, mais assure-toi qu'ils "
"viennent."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:600
msgid "So, you're the boss's new whipping boy?"
msgstr "Alors, c'est toi la nouvelle coqueluche du Patron ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:601
msgid "What do ya want?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:602
msgid "What's up with Metzger? Doesn't he trust us anymore?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'il a Metzger, il ne nous fait plus confiance ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:603
msgid "You done checking that shit yet?"
msgstr "T'as fini de vérifier cette camelote ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:604
msgid "Told you Metzger's shit wasn't going anywhere."
msgstr "Je t'avais dit que la camelote de Metzger n'irait nulle part."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:605
msgid "So, you finished in there or what?"
msgstr "Alors, tu as bientôt fini ou quoi ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:606
msgid ""
"I'm sure Metzger needs you for something. Why don't you run along and check?"
msgstr "Je parie que Metzger a besoin de toi. Va vite voir."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:607
msgid ""
"What the fuck's wrong with Metzger? Thinking we're not guarding his shit..."
msgstr ""
"Il y a quelque chose qui tourne pas rond chez Metzger. Il croit qu'on ne "
"surveille pas son matos..."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:608
msgid ""
"You still here? Don't you have another little errand to run for Metzger?"
msgstr "T'es encore là ! T'as pas une autre course à faire pour Metzger ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:609
msgid "So, you're the boss's new whipping girl?"
msgstr "Alors, c'est toi la nouvelle coqueluche du Patron ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:700
msgid "I'm not in the mood."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas d'humeur."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:701
msgid "Not now."
msgstr "Pas maintenant."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:702
msgid "I'm busy."
msgstr "J'ai à faire."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:710
msgid ""
"The smart ass is back! So you really want in this church? Why? There's "
"nothing in here you'd be interested in."
msgstr ""
"L'enfoiré est de retour ! Alors, tu cherches quoi dans cette église ? "
"Pourquoi ? Il n'y a rien ici qui pourrait t'intéresser."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:711
msgid "Now what the fuck do you want?"
msgstr "Bordel, mais que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:712
msgid "You see this mark on my forehead? Let me in. Now!"
msgstr "Tu vois cette marque sur mon front ? Laisse-moi entrer. Tout de suite."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:713
msgid ""
"I'm his new bitch, that's why! If you don't let me in right now, I'll be "
"sure you find yourself at the top of his shit list."
msgstr ""
"Je suis sa nouvelle nana, c'est pour ça. Si tu ne me laisses pas "
"immédiatement entrer, je parie que tu seras en haut de sa liste d'ordures."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:714
msgid ""
"Look, buddy. Metzger's going to have my hide if I don't inspect everything "
"soon. You know how he gets."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, mon pote. Metzger va me faire la peau si je n'inspecte pas tout "
"rapidement. Tu sais comment il est."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:715
msgid ""
"None of your fucking business. If the Boss wants his shit checked out, "
"that's what I do. I don't ask questions."
msgstr ""
"Putain, ce ne sont pas tes affaires. Si le Boss veut qu'on vérifie sa merde, "
"je le fais. Je ne pose pas de questions."

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:717
msgid "Shaka?"
msgstr "Shaka ?"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:800
msgid ""
"Who the- Hey! It's you. You came to *hickup* party with us. I knew you "
"would. (Tyler stumbles over to you and grabs your shoulder)\n"
" Did I ever tell you how much I-(He spies Lara's gang) What the fuck! No "
"fuckin way! This party ain't endin *hickup* cause of some fuckin bitch\n"
" and her cronies. Time to lock and load guys!"
msgstr ""
"Qui est - Hé ! C'est toi. Tu viens faire la fête <Hips> avec nous. Je sais "
"que tu en as envie. (Tyler trébuche sur toi et t'attrape l'épaule) Je t'ai "
"déjà dit à quel point je - (Il remarque le gang de Lara) Putain de merde ! "
"Pas question ! Cette fête ne se terminera pas <Hips> à cause d'une salope et "
"ses larbins. C'est l'heure de se défoncer les gars !"

#: dialog/dctyler.msg:1255 dialog/hcphil.msg:105 dialog/hcphil.msg:300
#: dialog/hczaius.msg:1130 dialog/ncanounc.msg:2106 dialog/ncanounc.msg:2107
#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1290 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1280 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1402
#: dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1202 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1203 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1204
#: dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1257 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1258 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1259
#: dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1290 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1291 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1292
#: dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1355 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1356 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1388
#: dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1389 dialog/ncboxfan.msg:1390 dialog/nccaspat.msg:503
#: dialog/nccaspat.msg:625 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:1202 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:1202
#: dialog/nccorbro.msg:5712 dialog/ncfluffe.msg:1236 dialog/ncfluffe.msg:1238
#: dialog/ncfluffe.msg:1378 dialog/ncorvill.msg:5243 dialog/ncorvill.msg:5261
#: dialog/ncperson.msg:1203 dialog/ncperson.msg:1493 dialog/ncprosti.msg:2195
#: dialog/ncrnggrl.msg:101 dialog/ncwrichi.msg:1178 dialog/ncwriply.msg:5279
#: dialog/vcrandal.msg:225
msgid "!"
msgstr " !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:100 dialog/ncslave.msg:102 dialog/slvcc4.msg:100
msgid "You see a slave."
msgstr "Tu vois un esclave."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:101
msgid "You see Vic."
msgstr "Tu vois Vic."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:150
msgid "This slave seems to be kept under tight surveillance."
msgstr "On dirait que cet esclave est sous haute surveillance."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:151
msgid "This is Vic."
msgstr "C'est Vic."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:153
msgid ""
"Would you tell him I can't... wait. Who are you? You're not a\n"
" slaver. What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""
"Pourrais-tu lui dire que je ne peux pas... attendre ? Qui es-tu ? Tu n'es "
"pas esclavagiste. Que fais-tu ici ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:155
msgid ". I'm here to get you out."
msgstr ". Je suis là pour t'aider à sortir d'ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:157
msgid ", but why have you been locked in this room?"
msgstr ". Pourquoi t'ont-ils enfermé dans cette cellule ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:158
msgid "Can you tell me where Vault 13 is?"
msgstr "Peux-tu me dire où se trouve l'Abri 13 ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:160
msgid ". I'll be right back."
msgstr ". Je reviens tout de suite."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:161
msgid "Dubba iba "
msgstr "Moi être "

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:163
msgid ""
"Metzger's still quite upset with me, even though we fixed his darn radio.\n"
" He's threatening to sell me off! I'll do anything you ask if you can get me "
"out\n"
" of this mess."
msgstr ""
"Metzger m'en veut encore, même après lui avoir réparé sa foutue radio. Il "
"menace de me vendre ! Je ferai tout ce que tu veux pour que tu me sortes de "
"ce pétrin !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:164
msgid "OK, I will."
msgstr "D'accord. Compte sur moi."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:165
msgid "Sorry, I can't. Bye."
msgstr "Je regrette, je peux pas. Salut."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:166
msgid "Whoo."
msgstr "Eh ben !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:167
msgid ""
"Oh, hi again. This darn radio isn't going to repair itself. How does\n"
" he expect me to fix it?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, salut ! Encore toi ! Cette foutue radio ne va pas se réparer toute "
"seule. Comment veut-il que j'arrive à la réparer ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:168
msgid "Where can I get the parts?"
msgstr "Où puis-je trouver des pièces de rechange ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:169
msgid "Maybe I can repair it."
msgstr "Je peux peut-être la réparer."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:170
msgid "Can you use this radio I found?"
msgstr "Peux-tu utiliser cette radio que j'ai trouvée ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:172
msgid "Spa pa?"
msgstr "Pèz de change ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:173
msgid ""
"I know I can do it, I just need some spare parts. There is an old radio in\n"
" my shack back in Klamath that has exactly what I need. You been to the "
"Dunton's?\n"
" My shack's... well, it was just east of their place."
msgstr ""
"Je peux le faire ! Mais il me faut des pièces de rechange. Je pourrais les "
"prendre sur une vieille radio que j'ai dans ma cabane à Klamath. Tu vois le "
"magasin des Dunton ? Ben, ma cabane se trouve à l'Est de chez eux."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:174
msgid "Do you mean this radio?"
msgstr "Tu veux parler de cette radio ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:175
msgid "I'll go look for it."
msgstr "Je vais aller la chercher."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:176
msgid "Hmmm... I'll be back."
msgstr "Hum... Je vais revenir."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:177
msgid "That's great! I'll have the radio fixed in no time."
msgstr "Super ! Je vais réparer cette radio en un rien de temps."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:178
msgid "Okay, I'll talk to Metzger."
msgstr "D'accord. Je vais parler à Metzger."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:181
msgid "Pardon? I'm sorry but I don't understand."
msgstr "Pardon ? Je ne comprends pas."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:182
msgid "hurm."
msgstr "Hum..."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:183
msgid "Thank you! I'm forever in your debt. What can I do to repay you?"
msgstr ""
"Merci ! Je te suis éternellement reconnaissant. Que puis-je faire pour te "
"remercier ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:184
msgid "Tell me where Vault 13 is."
msgstr "Dis-moi où se trouve l'Abri 13."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:186
msgid "Come with me, I could use a hand."
msgstr "Viens avec moi. J'ai besoin d'un coup de main."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:187
msgid "It was nothing. Good bye."
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de quoi. Au revoir."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:188
msgid "Candy?"
msgstr "Bonbon ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:189
msgid ""
"Vault 13? There's a Vault City east of here. I trade there,\n"
" sometimes."
msgstr ""
"L'Abri 13 ? La Cité de l'Abri se trouve au Sud-Est. Je vais faire des "
"échanges là-bas de temps en temps."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:190
msgid "Want to go there with me?"
msgstr "Tu veux venir avec moi là-bas ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:192
msgid ""
"Sure, I'll join up with you! This old fart has one big adventure left\n"
" in him. I'm sure of it! I'm pretty good at repairing things too, despite "
"what\n"
" Metzger says."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr ! Je t'accompagne. Ce vieux machin a encore une belle vie devant "
"lui. J'en suis certain. Metzger a beau dire, je me débrouille pas mal en "
"bricolage."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:193
msgid "Great, let's go."
msgstr "Génial. Allons-y !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:194
msgid "Welcome aboard."
msgstr "Bienvenue à bord."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:196
msgid "Vic me bess frend."
msgstr "Vic et moi meilleurs copains."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:197
msgid "Want to join me on my search?"
msgstr "Tu veux m'accompagner dans ma quête ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:198 dialog/vclynett.msg:379
msgid "Great! Thanks."
msgstr "Génial ! Merci."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:203
msgid "Vault City is east of here. I'll point it out on that map of yours."
msgstr ""
"La Cité de l'Abri se trouve à l'Est d'ici. Là, je vais te montrer sur la "
"carte."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:206
msgid "It's right here. [pointing to a map]"
msgstr "C'est juste là. [Désignant une carte du doigt.]"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:220
msgid ""
"Darn it. That's close, but I need the radio from my shack in Klamath. I know "
"that one has the parts I need."
msgstr ""
"Ca va pas marcher. Je sais que la radio que j'ai à Klamath, dans ma cabane, "
"a les pièces qu'il faut."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:300
msgid ""
"Yeah, I can probably help you, but you've got to get me out of here first."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, je peux peut-être t'aider, mais d'abord, tu dois m'aider à sortir "
"d'ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:301
msgid ""
"I told you. If you can get me out of here, I'll help you with anything you "
"want."
msgstr ""
"Je te l'ai dit. Si tu peux me faire sortir d'ici, je ferai tout ce que je "
"peux pour t'aider."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:302
msgid "How do we do that?"
msgstr "Comment on va faire ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:303
msgid "You're on you own then."
msgstr "Alors, débrouille-toi. "

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:304
msgid "Okay, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "D'accord, je vais voir ce que je peux faire."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:350
msgid "You think you can help me out?"
msgstr "Tu crois que tu peux m'aider ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:351
msgid "Metzger still won't let me leave."
msgstr "Metzger ne veut pas me laisser partir."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:352
msgid "I can't take much more of this."
msgstr "J'en ai assez de tout ça."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:353
msgid "I'll do anything for you if you help me."
msgstr "Je ferai n'importe quoi pour toi si tu m'aides."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:354
msgid "I'll earn back any expenses you may incur!"
msgstr "Je payerai toutes les dépenses que tu auras dû engager."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:400
msgid ""
"You haven't been by my place yet have you? I really need that radio,\n"
" Metzger's getting angrier with me by the day."
msgstr ""
"J'ai vraiment besoin de cette radio ! Metzger est chaque jour un peu plus en "
"colère contre moi."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:450
msgid "Where did you get this water flask?"
msgstr "Où as-tu eu cette fiole d'eau ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:451
msgid ""
"I had a water flask that had a big yellow 13 on it. Do you remember where "
"you got it?"
msgstr ""
"J'avais une fiole d'eau sur laquelle un grand 13 jaune était inscrit. Tu te "
"souviens de l'endroit où tu l'as eue ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:500
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah. I remember that. I bought that from Ed. He's a brahmin dealer over "
"in Vault City."
msgstr ""
"Ouais. Je me souviens. C'est Ed qui me l'a vendue. C'est un marchand de "
"Brahmines de la Cité de l'Abri."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:501
msgid ""
"Water Flask? Oh, wait. Yea, I had a few dozen of'm. Sold pretty well. I "
"got'm from Ed, a\n"
" brahmin dealer over in Vault City."
msgstr ""
"Une fiole d'eau ? Oh, attends. Ouais, j'en avais une bonne douzaine. Ca se "
"vendait plutôt bien. Je les ai eues par Ed, un marchand de Brahmines de la "
"Cité de l'Abri."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:502
msgid "Vault City?"
msgstr "La Cité de l'Abri ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:550
msgid "Would you stop calling me Boss?"
msgstr "Tu veux bien arrêter de m'appeler *Patron* ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:600
msgid "Sure thing, Chief!"
msgstr "Pas de blème, Chef !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:601
msgid "I mean it! STOP IT!"
msgstr "Ca SUFFIT, maintenant !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:602
msgid "I guess that'll have to do."
msgstr "Il faudra bien que ça fasse l'affaire !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:650
msgid "You got it, Sport!"
msgstr "Ok, mon vieux !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:651
msgid "Uggg!"
msgstr "Oouggh !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:700
msgid "Bee my friend."
msgstr "Toi et moi faire ami-ami."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:710
msgid ""
"Would you tell him I can't fix this without the parts. I don't know... wait."
"\n"
" Who are you? Some new recruit? He didn't send you here to rough me up again "
"did\n"
" he? It's not going to make any difference. I can't fix it here."
msgstr ""
"Dis-lui que je ne peux pas réparer sa radio sans pièces de rechange. Je sais "
"pas... Attends. Qui es-tu ? Une nouvelle recrue ? Il a encore chargé "
"quelqu'un de venir me tirer les bretelles, hein ? Ca ne changera rien, je ne "
"peux pas la réparer ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:750
msgid ""
"Wow! You'd do that for me? I'd do anything if you could get me out this mess."
"\n"
" Only problem is that Metzger's got me locked up here until I fix this radio "
"and\n"
" I don't have the parts I need."
msgstr ""
"Tu ferais ça pour moi ? Je ferais n'importe quoi pour que tu me sortes "
"d'ici. Le problème, c'est que Metzger ne me laissera pas sortir d'ici tant "
"que j'aurai pas réparé sa radio et je n'ai pas les pièces de rechange."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:753
msgid "Where can I get the parts you need?"
msgstr "Où puis-je trouver les pièces dont tu as besoin ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:760
msgid ""
"It's a long story. I guess you could say that Metzger's keeping me here "
"until\n"
" I fix this darn radio. The crystal's shot and I don't have any spare parts. "
"How does\n"
" he expect me to fix it?"
msgstr ""
"C'est une longue histoire. Disons que Metzger me garde ici jusqu'à ce que "
"j'aie réparé cette foutue radio. La galène est foutue et je n'ai pas de "
"pièces de rechange. Comment veut-il que j'arrive à la réparer ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:761
msgid "Well, I'm here to get you out."
msgstr "Je suis ici pour te sortir de là."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:764
msgid "Don't know. See ya."
msgstr "Aucune idée. Salut."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:800
msgid ""
"I've got to get this radio fixed. If you can help me do that, then maybe we "
"can reason with him."
msgstr ""
"Il faut que je répare cette radio. Avec ton aide, on pourra peut-être le "
"raisonner."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:801 dialog/nclloyd.msg:397 dialog/ncorvill.msg:341
msgid "How can I help?"
msgstr "Que puis-je faire ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:803
msgid "I doubt it. Good luck."
msgstr "J'en doute. Bonne chance."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:810
msgid ""
"Why'd you kill poor Mom... I guess you had your reasons... I'm sorry, Boss. "
"It's not my place to question you. This is a pretty bad town. I'm sure she "
"did something pretty bad."
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi as-tu tué cette pauvre Mamma... J'imagine que tu avais tes raisons. "
"Je regrette, Boss. Je n'ai pas à te poser de questions. C'est une sale "
"ville. Elle avait dû faire quelque chose de mal."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:811
msgid ""
"Hey, Boss. Thanks for getting me out of that mess with Metzger. You need "
"anything? Mom's been kind enough to feed me while you've been gone. I help "
"her around the place..."
msgstr ""
"Hé, Boss, merci de m'avoir tiré de ce bordel avec Metzger. T'as besoin de "
"quelque chose ? Mamma a été assez gentille pour me nourrir en ton absence. "
"Je lui donne un coup de main..."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:813
msgid "Oooh."
msgstr "Oooh."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:814
msgid "Beiye"
msgstr "Beiye"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:823
msgid "Where is your friend Ed, again?"
msgstr "Où est ton ami Ed, déjà ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:830
msgid ""
"I would if I could, but you're just not looking good. I'd only be a burden. "
"Now that Mom's gone, I think I'll just head out. Don't know where... maybe "
"we'll see each other again. Thank you for everything you've done for me."
msgstr ""
"Je le ferais si je le pouvais, mais tu n'as pas l'air très bien. Je serai un "
"fardeau. Maintenant que Mamma n'est plus là, je crois que je vais partir. Je "
"ne sais pas où... Nous nous reverrons peut-être. Merci pour tout ce que tu "
"as fait pour moi."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:831
msgid ""
"I would if I could, but you're just not looking good. Looks like you can "
"barely take care of yourself. I'd only be a burden. I'll just wait here, "
"Mom's cooking reminds me of my ex-wife..."
msgstr ""
"Je le ferais si je le pouvais, mais tu n'as pas l'air très bien. On dirait "
"que tu as déjà du mal à t'occuper de toi. Je serai un fardeau. Je vais "
"attendre ici, la cuisine de Mamma me rappelle mon ex-femme..."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:832
msgid ""
"I would, honest. I'd do almost anything for you. It's just that you don't "
"look like you're in any shape to lead anyone. I'd only be a burden. I'll "
"just head over to Mom's, in a bit... until you can work things out. I "
"haven't had her home cooking for a long time."
msgstr ""
"Je le ferai, honnêtement. Je ferai presque n'importe quoi pour toi. C'est "
"juste que tu n'as pas l'air en forme pour mener quelqu'un. Je vais aller "
"chez la Mamma, tout à l'heure... Jusqu'à ce que tu règles tout. Je n'ai pas "
"goûté à sa cuisine maison depuis un bon moment."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:833
msgid ""
"Sorry, Boss. Looks like you're pretty crowded. Now that Mom's gone, I think "
"I'll just head out. Don't know where... maybe we'll see each other again. "
"Thank you for everything you've done for me."
msgstr ""
"Pardon, Boss. On dirait qu'il y a du monde. Maintenant que Mamma n'est plus "
"là, je vais partir. Je ne sais pas où... On se reverra peut-être. Merci pour "
"tout ce que tu as fait pour moi."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:834
msgid ""
"You're looking a bit crowded, Boss. I'll just wait here for you until you've "
"worked things out. Mom's cooking reminds me of my ex-wife... not sure if "
"that's a good thing or bad thing..."
msgstr ""
"Tu as l'air d'avoir beaucoup à faire, Boss. Je vais t'attendre ici, le temps "
"que tu t'occupes de tout. La cuisine de la Mamma me rappelle mon ex-femme... "
"Je ne sais pas si c'est une bonne ou une mauvaise chose."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:835
msgid ""
"I would love to, Boss. It's just that you don't look like you have any more "
"room. I'll just head over to Mom's. I haven't been there in a while. Just "
"come get me if you find some room for me."
msgstr ""
"Ca me ferait plaisir, Boss. C'est juste que tu ne sembles pas avoir beaucoup "
"de place. Je vais aller chez la Mamma. Je n'y suis pas allé depuis un "
"moment. Viens me chercher si tu trouves de la place pour moi."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:840
msgid ""
"Ed's over at Vault City. He's a Brahmin Dealer. He was just one of my many "
"suppliers. Vault City's not too far from here."
msgstr ""
"Ed est à la Cité de l'Abri. C'est un trafiquant de Brahmines. Il faisait "
"juste partie de mes nombreux fournisseurs. La Cité de l'Abri n'est pas loin "
"d'ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:845
msgid ""
"I told you, it's over here. [Vic points to a location on your Pip-Boy 2000.]"
msgstr ""
"Je te l'ai dit, c'est là-bas. [Vic désigne une direction sur ton Pip-Boy.]"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:900
msgid "You learned about Vic being a trader."
msgstr "Tu savais que Vic était marchand."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1100
msgid "Fully healed, Boss. Anything else?"
msgstr "Guérison complète, Patron. Autre chose ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1200
msgid "Almost perfect condition, Boss."
msgstr "Etat presque parfait, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1300
msgid "I'm mostly healed up, Boss, but I've been better."
msgstr "Je suis presque guéri, Patron. Mais j'ai connu des jours meilleurs..."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1400
msgid "I tried, Boss, but I'm not doing so hot. I'll do what I can though."
msgstr ""
"J'ai essayé, Patron, mais je suis pas au top de ma forme. Je ferai de mon "
"mieux."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1500
msgid "Whatever you say, Boss."
msgstr "C'est toi le patron, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1501
msgid "Here? Right here? Okay, you're the Boss."
msgstr "Ici ? Juste ici ? D'accord, c'est toi le patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1502
msgid ""
"Right. I'll stay here until you come back, Boss. You will come back, right?"
msgstr ""
"D'accord. Je reste ici et j'attends ton retour, Patron. Tu reviendras, hein ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1503
msgid "As long as you want. I'm not going anywhere."
msgstr "Aussi longtemps que tu voudras. Je ne bouge pas d'ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1504
msgid "Of course, Boss."
msgstr "Bien sûr, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1600 dialog/nhmyron.msg:712
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr "Si tu le dis."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1601
msgid "Good call Boss."
msgstr "Bien parlé, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1602
msgid "Great thinking, Boss."
msgstr "Bien vu, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1603
msgid "Sure, Boss. Anything else?"
msgstr "Bien sûr, Patron. Autre chose ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1604
msgid "Away it is, Boss."
msgstr "C'est loin, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1605
msgid "No problem, Boss."
msgstr "Pas de problème, Patron"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1606
msgid "Done, Boss."
msgstr "C'est fait, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1700 dialog/dcvic.msg:1803 dialog/dcvic.msg:2500
msgid "Sure, Boss."
msgstr "Certainement, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1701
msgid "Close it is, Boss."
msgstr "C'est tout près, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1702
msgid "You know best, Boss."
msgstr "C'est toi qui sais, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1703
msgid "I'm right behind ya, Boss."
msgstr "Je suis juste derrière toi, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1704
msgid "Like glue, Boss."
msgstr "Comme un pot de colle, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1705
msgid "If you say so, Boss."
msgstr "Si tu le dis, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1706
msgid "Oh. Okay, Boss."
msgstr "Oh, d'accord, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1800
msgid "OK, I'll keep my distance, but not too far, Boss."
msgstr "D'accord, je garde mes distances, mais pas trop, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1801
msgid "Okay, I won't, Boss."
msgstr "D'accord, je ne le ferai plus, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1802
msgid "I'll just stay back a little then, Boss."
msgstr "Je reste juste un peu en retrait, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1900
msgid "Right Boss. I'll hang way back."
msgstr "D'accord, Patron. Je reste loin."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1901
msgid "What ever you say, Boss."
msgstr "C'est toi le patron, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1902
msgid "There you go, Boss."
msgstr "Voilà, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1903
msgid "Standing back, Boss."
msgstr "Je m'écarte, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1904
msgid "Backing away, Boss."
msgstr "Je prends mes distances, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1905
msgid "Spreading out, Boss."
msgstr "Je m'éloigne, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:1906
msgid "Okay, Boss."
msgstr "D'accord, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2000
msgid "Uh, Boss? You seem a bit crowded. I'll just keep waiting here for ya."
msgstr "Heu... Patron ? Tu as l'air un peu perturbé. Je t'attends ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2100
msgid ""
"You're scaring me, Boss. What's happened to you? You look... well,\n"
" scary. I think I'll just hang out here for a while..."
msgstr ""
"Tu me fais peur, Patron. Que t'arrive-t-il ? Tu as l'air... effrayant. Je "
"crois que je vais attendre un petit moment par ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2200
msgid "You bet, Boss!"
msgstr "Certainement, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2201
msgid "Darn right I will, Boss."
msgstr "Tu peux compter sur moi, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2202
msgid "Sure thing, Boss."
msgstr "Pas de problème, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2203
msgid "Ready to go when you are, Boss."
msgstr "On peut y aller quand tu veux, Patron."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2204 dialog/vcnancy.msg:281
msgid "Great! Let's go."
msgstr "Génial ! Allons-y."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2206
msgid "You're the best, Boss!"
msgstr "Tu es le meilleur, Boss !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2207
msgid "You won't be disappointed. No more mistakes!"
msgstr "Tu ne seras plus déçu. Plus d'erreur !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2208
msgid "I'll be careful this time, don't you worry!"
msgstr "Je vais faire attention cette fois, ne t'inquiète pas !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2209
msgid ""
"I knew you would forgive me for that... um. So, uh, Boss. What's the plan?"
msgstr ""
"Je savais que tu me pardonnerais... Hum. Alors, euh, Boss. Quel est le plan !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2210
msgid "I won't let you down, Boss!"
msgstr "Je ne te laisserai pas tomber, Boss !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2211
msgid "You're super, Boss!"
msgstr "Tu es formidable, Boss !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2212
msgid ""
"I knew I wasn't too old for this. Those were just bad odds! Right, Boss?"
msgstr ""
"Je savais que je n'étais pas trop que je n'avais pas dépassé l'âge pour ça. "
"C'était juste de la malchance. D'accord, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2300
msgid ""
"From Ed. He's a brahmin dealer over in Vault City. You been there before?\n"
" Let me show you on that map thing of yours."
msgstr ""
"De la part d'Ed. Il est trafiquant de Brahmines à la Cité de l'Abri. Tu y es "
"déjà allé ? Je vais te montrer sur la carte."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2305
msgid "Vault City. Here. Let me show you on that fancy map thing of yours."
msgstr "La Cité de l'Abri. Ici. Je vais te montrer sur cette drôle de carte."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2310
msgid "He should be around here somewhere."
msgstr "Il devrait être quelque part par ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2311
msgid "Vault City. Check that fancy map thing of yours."
msgstr "La Cité de l'Abri. Regardes sur cette drôle de carte."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2403
msgid "Where did you get the Vault 13 water flask?"
msgstr "Où t'es-tu procuré la fiole d'eau de l'Abri 13 ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2501
msgid "Ask anything, Boss."
msgstr "Demande-moi ce que tu veux, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2502
msgid "I'll help you if I can, Boss."
msgstr "Si je le peux, je t'aiderai, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2503
msgid "I'm not in trouble am I, Boss?"
msgstr "Je n'ai pas d'ennuis, pas vrai, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2504
msgid "Did I do something wrong, Boss?"
msgstr "Ai-je fait quelque chose de mal, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2600
msgid "What'll we do now, Boss?"
msgstr "Que va-t-on faire maintenant, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2601
msgid "What's the plan, Boss?"
msgstr "Quel est le plan, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2602
msgid "Doing my best, Boss."
msgstr "Je vais faire de mon mieux, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2603
msgid "What can I do for you, Boss?"
msgstr "Que puis-je faire pour toi, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2604
msgid "Change of plans, Boss?"
msgstr "Les plans ont changé, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2605
msgid "Different strategy, Boss?"
msgstr "Une nouvelle stratégie, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2700
msgid ""
"Boss, they got me good. You've got to get me to a doctor. I don't know if I "
"can\n"
" back you up anymore."
msgstr ""
"Boss, ils m'ont bien eu. Tu dois me conduire chez un docteur. Je ne sais pas "
"si je vais encore pouvoir te couvrir."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2701
msgid ""
"I need a doctor, Boss. I'm really messed up. I don't know if I can fight\n"
" with you anymore."
msgstr ""
"J'ai besoin d'un docteur, Boss. Ca ne va vraiment pas. Je ne sais pas si je "
"vais encore pouvoir me battre à tes côtés."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2702
msgid "Boss, I'm really messed up. You got to get Lenny to check me out."
msgstr ""
"Boss, ça ne va vraiment pas. Tu dois aller chercher Lenny pour qu'il "
"m'ausculte."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2800
msgid "Hey, Boss. You want me to join up with you now?"
msgstr "Hé, Boss. Tu veux bien que je t'accompagne ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2801
msgid "Hey, Boss. I don't mind waiting for you. I'm a real patient man."
msgstr ""
"Hé, Boss. Ca ne m'ennuie pas de t'attendre. Je suis quelqu'un de très "
"patient."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2802
msgid "We joining up again, Boss? I'll try harder."
msgstr "On se retrouve, Boss ? Je vais essayer de faire encore mieux."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2803
msgid ""
"I was afraid you might not come back. It sure is nice to see you again, Boss."
msgstr ""
"J'avais peur que tu ne reviennes pas. Ca fait vraiment plaisir de te revoir, "
"Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2804
msgid "You looking for company again?"
msgstr "Tu cherches encore de la compagnie ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2805
msgid "I'm ready to go, Boss."
msgstr "Je suis prêt à partir, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2806
msgid "I knew you wouldn't leave me."
msgstr "Je savais que tu ne m'abandonnerais pas."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2807
msgid "Need some back up?"
msgstr "Tu as besoin de soutien ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2808
msgid "Need something repaired, don't you? I'm your man, Boss!"
msgstr ""
"Tu as besoin de faire réparer quelque chose ? Je suis l'homme de la "
"situation, Boss !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2809
msgid "Don't worry, Boss. Sulik and I'll get along, honest."
msgstr "Ne t'inquiète pas Boss. Sulik et moi allons partir, vraiment."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:2811
msgid "Stay here. I'll be right back."
msgstr "Reste ici. Je vais revenir."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3100
msgid "What? Uh... okay, Boss. If you say so."
msgstr "Quoi ? Euh... Ok, Boss. Si tu le dis."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3101
msgid "Can I put something else on, Boss? I'm a little worried."
msgstr "Puis-je ajouter quelque chose, Boss ? Je suis un peu contrarié."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3102
msgid "Okay... you're not going to leave me here... Are you, Boss?"
msgstr "Ok... Tu ne vas pas me laisser ici... Pas vrai, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3103
msgid "But... I mean... Of course, Boss. Coming right off."
msgstr "Mais... Enfin, je veux dire... Certainement, Boss. J'arrive."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3200
msgid ""
"Well, Boss... I'm pretty good with small arms. I can handle almost any "
"rifle, shotgun, and most small-medium pistols. I 'can' use knives. I've also "
"got a pretty good throwing arm, but my aim's not the best in the world... "
"actually, it's pretty horrible. Sorry, Boss. I'm really trying to get better."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, Boss... Je manie assez bien les petites armes. Je sais me servir de "
"pratiquement toutes les carabines, fusils et de la plupart des pistolets "
"petits et moyens. Je manie également les couteaux. Je suis assez bon au "
"lancement des armes, même si ma visée n'est pas parfaite... En fait, elle "
"est minable. Pardon, Boss. J'essaie vraiment de m'améliorer."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3201
msgid ""
"Like I said, Boss, I prefer small arms. I can handle almost any rifle, "
"shotgun, and most of those small-medium pistols. If we're really in a pinch "
"I can try using a knife or even thrown weapons."
msgstr ""
"Comme je te l'ai dit, Boss, je préfère les petites armes. Je sais me servir "
"de pratiquement tout, carabines, fusils et de la plupart des pistolets de "
"petit et moyen calibres. Et si la situation l'exige, je peux aussi essayer "
"le maniement du couteau et toute autre arme."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3300
msgid ""
"I 'can' use knives and I've got a pretty good throwing arm, but... my aim's "
"not the best in the world. Actually it's pretty horrible. Sorry, Boss. I'm "
"really trying to get better."
msgstr ""
"Je sais me servir des couteaux et je suis assez habile, même si ma visée "
"n'est pas parfaite... En fait, elle est minable. Pardon, Boss. J'essaie "
"vraiment de m'améliorer."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3301
msgid ""
"Like I said, Boss. Knives and I've got pretty good throwing arm... I just "
"miss a lot."
msgstr ""
"Comme je l'ai dit, Boss. Je manie bien les couteaux et je suis assez "
"habile... C'est juste que je manque très souvent ma cible."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3400
msgid "I've had it up to here!"
msgstr "J'en ai jusque là !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:3401
msgid "I'm going to rip your darn head off! No one hurts my family!"
msgstr ""
"Je vais t'arracher ta fichue tête ! On ne fait pas de mal à ma famille !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4000
msgid "Over here?"
msgstr "Ici ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4001
msgid "This better Boss?"
msgstr "C'est mieux, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4002
msgid "How 'bout here?"
msgstr "Et ici ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4003
msgid "Yes Boss."
msgstr "Oui, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4005
msgid "Where we going?"
msgstr "Où nous aller ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4006
msgid "We leaving Boss?"
msgstr "Nous partir, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4007
msgid "I'm moving."
msgstr "Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4008
msgid "Sorry Boss."
msgstr "Pardon, Boss"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4009
msgid "Better?"
msgstr "Mieux ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4010
msgid "Ooof."
msgstr "Ouf."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4011
msgid "How's this Boss?"
msgstr "Et là, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4012
msgid "I'll stand over here."
msgstr "Je vais rester ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4013
msgid "I'll just move over here now."
msgstr "Je vais aller ici maintenant."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4100
msgid "Boss! I'm not doing so well here."
msgstr "Boss ! Ce n'est pas mieux ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4101 dialog/scdocjub.msg:106
msgid "I need a doctor."
msgstr "Je dois voir un médecin."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4102
msgid "Oh, boy. This really hurts."
msgstr "Oh, la vache. Ca fait vraiment mal !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4103 game/cmbatai2.msg:1011 game/cmbatai2.msg:1062
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1332 game/cmbatai2.msg:32011 game/cmbatai2.msg:32711
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32762 game/cmbatai2.msg:33262 game/combatai.msg:1011
#: game/combatai.msg:1062 game/combatai.msg:1332 game/combatai.msg:32011
#: game/combatai.msg:32711 game/combatai.msg:32762 game/combatai.msg:33262
#: game/combatai.msg:41643 game/combatai.msg:41667 game/combatai.msg:41677
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "Aïe !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4104
msgid "Ouch."
msgstr "Oh là là !"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4105
msgid "Dang it."
msgstr "Eh merde."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4106
msgid "Medic?"
msgstr "Docteur ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4107
msgid "I'm hanging in there... barely."
msgstr "Je reste ici... A peine."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4200
msgid "I never liked this place."
msgstr "Je n'ai jamais aimé cet endroit."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4201
msgid "Why is this place so clean?"
msgstr "Pourquoi cet endroit est-il si propre ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4202
msgid "Do you smell something, Boss?"
msgstr "Tu as senti quelque chose, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4203
msgid ""
"You know, Boss. I don't think I'll be coming back here when we're through. I "
"can no longer call it home."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, Boss. Je ne crois pas que je reviendrai ici lorsqu'on aura fini. Ce "
"n'est plus chez moi."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4204
msgid "It sure is a lot dirtier than I remember."
msgstr "C'est vraiment plus sale que dans ma mémoire."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4205
msgid "We're not staying here long, are we Boss?"
msgstr "On ne va pas rester ici longtemps, pas vrai, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4206
msgid "This place'll never change."
msgstr "Cet endroit ne changera jamais."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4207
msgid "Boss, I'm not going to miss this place."
msgstr "Boss, cet endroit va me manquer."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4208
msgid "Thanks again for getting me out of this place, Boss."
msgstr "Merci encore de m'avoir fait quitter cet endroit, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4209
msgid "I really owe you one, Boss."
msgstr "Je te suis vraiment reconnaissant, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4210
msgid "Wow, this place sure has changed."
msgstr "Oh là là, cet endroit a vraiment changé."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4211
msgid "I haven't been here in ages."
msgstr "Cela fait une éternité que je ne suis pas venu ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4212
msgid "I'm going to retire here."
msgstr "Je ne vais pas passer ma retraite ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4213
msgid "I could open a repair shop around here."
msgstr "Je pourrais ouvrir un atelier de réparations dans le coin."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4300
msgid ""
"Ah, a sight for sore eyes. This is... was my place, but I guess you knew "
"that. Right, Boss?"
msgstr ""
"Ah, un endroit pour les yeux enflammés. C'est... C'était chez moi, mais je "
"crois que tu le sais déjà. Pas vrai, Boss ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4400
msgid "Sulik, don't you be looking at me like that."
msgstr "Sulik, arrête de me regarder comme ça..."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4401
msgid "Boss, Sulik's glaring at me again."
msgstr "Boss, Sulik n'arrête pas de me fixer."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4402
msgid "Nice pooch."
msgstr "Joli clebs."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4500
msgid "La de da..."
msgstr "La de da..."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4501
msgid "Ho hum."
msgstr "Ho hum."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4502
msgid "Waiting for the Boss..."
msgstr "Attendre le Boss...."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4503
msgid "I'm waiting for the Boss."
msgstr "J'attends le Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4504
msgid "Just waiting."
msgstr "J'attends, c'est tout."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4505
msgid "The Boss sure wouldn't leave me behind..."
msgstr "Le Boss ne m'abandonnerait certainement pas."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4506
msgid "Knock Knock... who's there... wait. How'd that go..."
msgstr "Toc, toc... Qui est-là ? Attends. Comment ça se passe..."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4507
msgid "Still waiting."
msgstr "J'attends toujours."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4508 dialog/hcfemale.msg:160 dialog/hcfemale.msg:255
#: dialog/hcmale.msg:160 dialog/hcmale.msg:255 dialog/ncactres.msg:280
msgid "What's that smell?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que ça sent ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4509
msgid "Anything to repair around here?"
msgstr "Y a-t-il quelque chose à réparer dans le coin ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4510
msgid "Here I am... waiting for the Boss."
msgstr "Je suis ici... J'attends le Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4511
msgid "An old man like me, wasting away his talents, just standing here."
msgstr ""
"Un vieil homme comme moi, en train de gaspiller ses talents à attendre ici."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4512
msgid "I sure wish I had a stick of gum... it's been decades."
msgstr "J'aimerais tant manger du chewing-gum. Ca fait des années."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4513
msgid "I need to get out of the relic business... nothing but trouble."
msgstr "Je dois quitter ce fichu boulot... C'est trop d'ennuis."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4514
msgid "Why is waiting so tiring..."
msgstr "Pourquoi c'est si ennuyeux d'attendre...."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4600
msgid "Uh, thanks, Boss."
msgstr "Euh, merci, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4602
msgid "You sure you know what you're doing?"
msgstr "Tu sais vraiment ce que tu fais ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4603
msgid "Can't we just rest instead?"
msgstr "On ne peut pas plutôt se reposer ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4604
msgid "Should we make camp?"
msgstr "Devons-nous installer un campement ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4605
msgid "Am I that bad off?"
msgstr "Suis-je aussi mauvais ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4700
msgid "Not too much, Boss."
msgstr "Pas autant, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4701
msgid "If you insist, Boss."
msgstr "Si tu insistes, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4702
msgid "Boss, my head's not going to explode, is it?"
msgstr "Boss, ma tête ne va pas exploser, hein ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4703
msgid "Boss, I think I'm starting to like that stuff."
msgstr "Boss, je crois que je commence à aimer ce truc."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4704
msgid "I'm feeling a bit funny, Boss."
msgstr "Je me sens un peu bizarre, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4705
msgid "You sure you have enough of that to spare."
msgstr "Tu es sûr que tu en auras assez pour toi ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4706
msgid "Sure, Boss. I'll take some."
msgstr "Certainement, Boss. Je vais en prendre un peu."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:4707
msgid "Thanks, Boss."
msgstr "Merci, Boss."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:5000
msgid "I'm a bit hungry at the moment. We'll talk again at Mom's."
msgstr "J'ai un peu faim là. T'veux pas retourner voir Mamma ?"

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:5500
msgid "I feel like I broke a limb, Boss. You better have a look."
msgstr "Boss, je crois que je me suis cassé un membre. Tu devrais regarder."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:5501
msgid "I feel like I am burning up, Boss. You better have a look."
msgstr "Boss, j'ai l'impression de brûler. Tu devrais jeter un oeil."

#: dialog/dcvic.msg:5502
msgid "I feel like I have been poisoned, Boss. You better have a look."
msgstr "Boss, je me sens comme si on m'avait empoisonné. Tu devrais regarder."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:150
msgid "He seems to be paying close attention to the door next to him."
msgstr "Il semble très intéressé par la porte à côté de lui."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:200
msgid "Hey! Hands off."
msgstr "Hé ! Bas les pattes !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:210 dialog/scsherif.msg:117
msgid "Problems?"
msgstr "Un problème ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:211
msgid "Practicing?"
msgstr "On s'entraîne ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:220
msgid "There you go."
msgstr "Et voilà."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:230
msgid "Hey, how's it going?"
msgstr "Hé ! Comment ça va ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:231
msgid "Hey, you joined up, huh? Cool. Hope we go on some runs together."
msgstr ""
"Alors, tu fais partie du club ? Super. On pourrait se faire une chasse "
"ensemble un de ces jours."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:232
msgid "So, what is it you want to talk about?"
msgstr "Alors, de quoi tu veux qu'on parle ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:233
msgid "So, who's in there?"
msgstr "Alors, qui est là dedans ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:235
msgid "Good, thanks."
msgstr "Merci bien."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:236 dialog/scsherif.msg:159
msgid "Got to go."
msgstr "Faut que j'y aille."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:237
msgid "Wuk?"
msgstr "Avail ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:238
msgid "Meko veek?"
msgstr "Renconter Viic ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:239
msgid "Ugruk."
msgstr "Ougrouk."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:240
msgid "Ruru!"
msgstr "Rourou !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:250
msgid ""
"His name's Vic - some merchant that broke something of my boss's, or "
"something like that. Not too sure."
msgstr ""
"Il s'appelle Vic. C'est un marchand qui a cassé quelque chose à mon patron, "
"un truc dans ce genre. J'chais pas trop."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:251
msgid ""
"His name's Vic - some merchant that broke something of the boss's, or "
"something like that. Not too sure."
msgstr ""
"Il s'appelle Vic. C'est un marchand qui a cassé un truc du patron. J'chais "
"pas trop."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:252 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:253
msgid ""
"Oh, him? Yeah, some merchant. I think he broke something, but I'm not sure. "
"Why? You know him?"
msgstr ""
"Ah, lui ? Ouais, un marchand. Je crois qu'il a cassé quelque chose, mais "
"j'chais pas trop. Pourquoi ? Tu le connais ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:255
msgid "Why are you guarding him?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tu le gardes ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:256 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:287 dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:397
msgid "Who's your boss?"
msgstr "Qui c'est ton patron ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:258
msgid "Well, I'm fairly skilled in repairing things. Maybe I could help?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai quelques compétences en réparation. Je pourrais peut-être être utile ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:259
msgid "Well, I'm fairly skilled in the sciences, maybe I could help?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai quelques compétences en science. Je pourrais peut-être être utile ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:260
msgid "The door's locked. Could you open it?"
msgstr "La porte est verrouillée. Est-ce que tu peux l'ouvrir ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:275
msgid ""
"Thanks for cash. I'm just letting you talk to him. No funny stuff. He can't "
"leave that room without Metzger's okay."
msgstr ""
"Merci pour le fric. Je te laisse lui parler, c'est tout. Pas "
"d'entourloupette. Il ne quitte pas cette pièce sans l'autorisation de "
"Metzger."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:276
msgid ""
"Now, I'm just letting you talk to him, okay? No funny stuff. He can't leave "
"that room without Metzger's okay."
msgstr ""
"Je te laisse lui parler, c'est tout. Pas d'entourloupette. Il ne quitte pas "
"cette pièce sans l'autorisation de Metzger."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:285
msgid ""
"To be sure no one bugs him while he works on something for the boss, but "
"mainly to be sure he doesn't run off."
msgstr ""
"Pour être sûr que personne ne l'embête pendant qu'il travaille pour le "
"patron, mais surtout pour éviter qu'il s'échappe."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:286
msgid ""
"Just to be sure he doesn't run off, I guess. He fixed that radio somehow."
msgstr ""
"C'est seulement pour éviter qu'il s'échappe, je suppose. Il a réparé cette "
"radio."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:290
msgid "Okay thanks."
msgstr "D'accord, merci."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:295
msgid ""
"Oh, sure. I didn't mean you could see him, now that you're a slaver and all."
msgstr ""
"Oh, bien sûr. Je n'ai jamais dit que tu pouvais le voir, maintenant que t'es "
"esclavagiste et tout ça."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:296
msgid ""
"Oh, sure. I guess so. He's not busy and he's not going anywhere, so no harm "
"I guess."
msgstr ""
"Oh, bien sûr. Je pense que oui. Il n'a rien à faire et nulle part où aller. "
"Il n'y a pas de problème j'imagine."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:297
msgid "Well, could you open the door then?"
msgstr "Alors, peux-tu ouvrir la porte ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:305
msgid ""
"Of course. I didn't know you wanted to talk to him right now, sorry. I just "
"thought you were curious or something."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. Je ne savais pas que tu voulais lui parler tout de suite. J'ai cru "
"que tu te renseignais, c'est tout."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:310
msgid ""
"Huh? You just in the habit of walking around into places you don't know? "
"This is the Slaver's Guild."
msgstr ""
"Hein ? C'est une habitude de te promener librement dans des lieux que tu ne "
"connais pas ? Ici, c'est la Guilde des Esclavagistes."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:311
msgid "Oh, so that would make your boss's name..."
msgstr "Oh, alors, ça, ce sera pour le nom de ton patron..."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:312
msgid "Oh, that's where I am? I thought I was in Kansas."
msgstr "Oh, c'est ici que je suis ? Je croyais être dans le Kansas."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:320
msgid ""
"Where? No, never heard of it. This is the Den. Not sure about that place, "
"but I don't get out much. Sorry."
msgstr ""
"Où ça ? Jamais entendu parler. Ici, c'est La Fosse. Je ne connais pas bien "
"cet endroit, je ne sors pas beaucoup. Je m'excuse."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:322
msgid "Uh, okay. Thanks."
msgstr "Heu, d'accord. Merci."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:330
msgid "Damn, man. Metzger's the slaver master. He runs things around here."
msgstr ""
"Mon pauvre. Metzger c'est le Maître des Esclavagistes. C'est lui qui dirige "
"tout ici."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:331
msgid ""
"Damn, lady. This is the last place a lady like you would want to be. "
"Metzger's the slaver master."
msgstr ""
"Ma pauvre. C'est pas un endroit pour une dame comme vous. Metzger c'est le "
"Maître des Esclavagistes."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:332
msgid "Oh, where's his office?"
msgstr "Oh, où il est son bureau ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:340
msgid "Right through the back door there."
msgstr "Juste derrière cette porte au fond."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:350
msgid "Sorry, I don't understand."
msgstr "Je regrette, je ne comprends pas."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:360
msgid "Sorry, Vic doesn't get visitors."
msgstr "Désolé, Vic ne reçoit pas de visites."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:361
msgid "Yeah, that's Vic."
msgstr "Ouais, c'est Vic."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:362
msgid "Seve?"
msgstr "Vois Viic ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:363
msgid "Surek?"
msgstr "Liik ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:364
msgid "Gaw."
msgstr "Zouu."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:370
msgid "Sure, you can see him."
msgstr "Tu peux le voir, bien sûr."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:371
msgid "Sure, you can see him. Let me unlock that for you."
msgstr "Tu peux le voir, bien sûr. Je vais t'ouvrir."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:372
msgid "Tank."
msgstr "Mèssi."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:380
msgid ""
"Oh really? I'm sure the boss would appreciate it. Just as long as he stays "
"put. We don't want him running off again."
msgstr ""
"Ah oui ? Je suis certain que le patron serait content. Il suffit qu'il ne "
"bouge pas d'ici. On ne veut pas qu'il se fasse la malle encore une fois."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:390
msgid "No, sorry. He's busy working on something for the boss."
msgstr "Non, je regrette. Il bosse sur un truc pour le Patron."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:391
msgid "Sorry, can't do that. Direct orders from the boss."
msgstr "Je regrette, je peux pas. Ordre du Patron."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:392
msgid "Well, you got my money?"
msgstr "Eh ben, t'as mon fric ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:393
msgid "I just need to ask him a few questions."
msgstr "Je veux seulement lui poser quelques questions."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:394
msgid "Oh, come on. Just let me talk to him real quick."
msgstr "Allez... Laisse-moi lui parler vite fait."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:395
msgid "Yes. Here."
msgstr "Oui. Voilà."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:410
msgid "Stop bothering me. Go talk to Metzger. He's the boss."
msgstr "Arrête de m'emmerder. Va parler à Metzger. C'est lui le Patron."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:411
msgid "Leave me alone! What's your problem?"
msgstr "Laisse-moi tranquille ! C'est quoi, ton problème ?"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:412
msgid "I said talk to Metzger!"
msgstr "Je t'ai dit d'aller parler à Metzger !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:413
msgid ""
"Okay, fine! You can talk to him, but that's it! He's not stepping a foot "
"outside that room. Got it? Now beat it!"
msgstr ""
"D'accord, c'est bon. Tu peux aller lui parler. Mais, écoute-moi bien : il ne "
"met pas un pied dehors. Compris ? Maintenant, file !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:430
msgid ""
"Yeah, talk to Metzger. I'm sure he has some work available. I think he said "
"he needed another man."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, va parler à Metzger. Il a sûrement du travail pour toi. Je crois "
"qu'il a besoin d'un autre homme."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:431
msgid ""
"Yeah, talk to Metzger. I'm sure he has some work available. He said he "
"needed another man... but I'm sure you'll do."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, va parler à Metzger. Il a sûrement du travail pour toi. Je crois "
"l'avoir entendu dire qu'il avait besoin d'un autre homme... mais je pense "
"que tu feras l'affaire."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:432
msgid "Talk to Metzger."
msgstr "Va parler à Metzger."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:433
msgid "Ruru?"
msgstr "Rourou !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:450
msgid "Get him, guys."
msgstr "Les gars, attrapez-le !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:451
msgid "Get her, guys."
msgstr "Les gars, attrapez-la !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:460
msgid "He's busy."
msgstr "Il est occupé."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:461
msgid "Please, he won't leave the room. I promise."
msgstr "S'il te plaît. Il ne quittera pas cette pièce. Promis."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:462
msgid "Can't we work something out - financially maybe?"
msgstr "On peut peut-être s'arranger... j'veux dire, financièrement."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:470
msgid ""
"Well, uh... I don't know. I guess it wouldn't hurt just for you to talk to "
"him. $300 and I'll let you in."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, heu... je ne sais pas. Tu ne feras rien de mal, si c'est juste pour "
"lui parler. $300 et je te laisse rentrer."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:471
msgid "You're nuts. That's too much!"
msgstr "T'es malade. C'est trop !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:472
msgid "Screw you, buddy!"
msgstr "Non mais tu rêves !"

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:474
msgid "Sorry, can't afford that."
msgstr "Je regrette. Trop cher pour moi."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:480
msgid "Fine, see if I care."
msgstr "D'accord. Ca va pas m'empêcher de dormir..."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:491
msgid "I said no. Now beat it. You've got to talk to Metzger."
msgstr "J'ai dit \"non\". Maintenant, casse-toi. Va parler à Metzger."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:500
msgid "Too bad you didn't join us."
msgstr "Dommage que tu ne te sois pas joint à nous."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:501
msgid "You should join the guild."
msgstr "Tu devrais devenir membre de la Guilde."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:502
msgid "Just doing that guard thing."
msgstr "Je ne fais que surveiller."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:503
msgid "Hope Vic works out for you."
msgstr "J'espère que ça marchera avec Vic."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:504
msgid "Vic better be working hard for ya."
msgstr "Vic a intérêt à travailler dur pour toi."

#: dialog/dcvicgrd.msg:505
msgid "Maybe I'll catch you on a run."
msgstr "Un jour je t'aurai pendant une chasse."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:100
msgid "This town looks like one mean place. A good place to own a gun."
msgstr "Cette ville a l'air misérable. L'endroit idéal pour porter un pistolet."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:200
msgid "You helped Lara's gang to win the battle."
msgstr "Tu as aidé le gang de Lara à gagner la bataille."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:300
msgid "You've successfully ambushed Lara's gang."
msgstr "Tu as piégé avec succès le gang de Lara."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:400
msgid "You've found Becky's still for Frankie."
msgstr "Tu as trouvé l'alambic de Babeth pour Lara."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:500
msgid "You've destroyed Becky's still."
msgstr "Tu as détruit l'alambic de Babeth."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:600
msgid "You convinced Frankie to buy from Becky."
msgstr "Tu as convaincu Frankie d'acheter à Babeth."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:700
msgid "You finished your first slave run."
msgstr "Tu as terminé ta première chasse aux esclaves."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:800
msgid "You paid Fred's debt off to Rebecca."
msgstr "Tu paies les dettes de Fred à Elizabeth."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:900
msgid "You returned Rebecca's book."
msgstr "Tu rends le livre d'Elizabeth."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:1000
msgid "You returned Anna's locket."
msgstr "Tu rends le médaillon d'Anna."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:1100
msgid "You managed to fast talk your way inside the church."
msgstr "Tu baratines afin d'entrer dans l'église."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:1200
msgid "You delivered Smitty's meal."
msgstr "Tu livres le repas de Smitty."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:1300
msgid "You have found a weakness in Tyler's gang."
msgstr "Tu as trouvé une faiblesse dans le gang de Tyler."

#: dialog/denbus1.msg:1400
msgid "You have gotten permission for Lara's gang to attack."
msgstr "Tu as obtenu la permission pour le gang de Lara d'attaquer."

#: dialog/denbus2.msg:100
msgid "*** THIS IS WHERE THE TOWN ENTERANCE MESSAGE SHOULD BE ***."
msgstr "*** C'EST ICI QUE LE MESSAGE D'ENTREE DANS LA VILLE DEVRAIT ETRE ***."

#: dialog/denres1.msg:100
msgid "You have entered the residential end of The Den."
msgstr "Tu es entré dans le quartier résidentiel de La Fosse."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:100
msgid "Bio-storage malfunction!"
msgstr "Dysfonctionnement du biostockage !"

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:101
msgid "Level 4 Containment breach."
msgstr "Brèche de l'endiguement du niveau 4."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:102
msgid "Level 4 contaminated."
msgstr "Niveau 4 contaminé."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:103
msgid "Biohazard seals Level 3 compromised."
msgstr "Dispositif de protection du bio-risque du niveau 3 en danger."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:104
msgid "Level 3 Containment breach."
msgstr "Brèche de l'endiguement du niveau 3."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:105
msgid "Level 3 contaminated."
msgstr "Niveau 3 contaminé."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:106
msgid "Biohazard seals Level 2 compromised."
msgstr "Dispositif de protection du bio-risque du niveau 2 en danger."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:107
msgid "Level 2 Containment breach."
msgstr "Brèche de l'endiguement du niveau 2."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:108
msgid "Level 2 contaminated."
msgstr "Niveau 2 contaminé."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:109
msgid "Biohazard seals Level 1 compromised."
msgstr "Dispositif de protection du bio-risque du niveau 1 en danger."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:110
msgid "Level 1 Containment breach."
msgstr "Brèche de l'endiguement du niveau 1."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:111
msgid "Level 1 Contaminated."
msgstr "Niveau 2 contaminé."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:112
msgid " minutes and "
msgstr " minutes et "

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:113
msgid " seconds to evacuate."
msgstr " secondes pour évacuer."

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:114
msgid " minute and "
msgstr " minute et "

#: dialog/depolv1.msg:115
msgid " second to evacuate."
msgstr " seconde pour évacuer."

#: dialog/dianngrv.msg:101
msgid "The name on the gravestone reads: \"Anna Winslow.\""
msgstr "Le nom d'Anna Winslow est gravé sur la pierre tombale."

#: dialog/dianngrv.msg:200
msgid "You put Anna's bones to rest."
msgstr "Tu donnes le repos aux ossements d'Anna."

#: dialog/dibones.msg:100
msgid "You see some bones."
msgstr "Tu vois des os."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:100 dialog/sssign.msg:100
msgid "You see a bulletin board."
msgstr "Tu vois un tableau d'affichage."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:150
msgid "There seem to be a few messages posted on it."
msgstr "On dirait que des messages sont accrochés dessus."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:200
msgid ""
"Den Bulletin: Maintained by Rebecca's Casino Bar, best drinks in the Den. "
msgstr ""
"Le bulletin de La Fosse : avec le soutien du Casino Bar d'Elisabeth, les "
"meilleures boissons de toute La Fosse."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:201
msgid "Den Bulletin: Maintained by Rebecca's Casino Bar..."
msgstr "Le bulletin de La Fosse : avec le soutien du Casino Bar d'Elisabeth."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:202
msgid "[Someone has scribbled something on the side of this post.]"
msgstr "[Quelqu'un a griffonné un mot sur le côté de cette annonce.]"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:203
msgid "[You notice that a part of this post has been torn off.]"
msgstr "[Tu remarques qu'une partie de cette annonce a été arrachée.]"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:204
msgid "Slaver's Guild"
msgstr "La Guilde des Esclavagistes"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:205
msgid "Bars & Gambling"
msgstr "Bars & Jeux"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:206
msgid "Dining"
msgstr "Restaurant"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:207
msgid "Shops"
msgstr "Magasins"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:225
msgid ""
"The Slaver's Guild is the best and only supplier of slaves in the wastes."
msgstr ""
"La Guilde des Esclavagistes est le meilleur et l'unique fournisseur "
"d'esclaves de tout le désert."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:250
msgid ""
"For employment opportunities, buying or selling of slaves, see Slave Master "
"Metzger."
msgstr ""
"Vous cherchez du travail, vous vendez ou vous achetez des esclaves... "
"Adressez-vous au Maître des esclavagistes, M. Metzger."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:275
msgid ""
"The Slaver's Guild is located on the east side of town, past Becky's and "
"Frankie's."
msgstr ""
"La Guilde des Esclavagistes se situe dans le quartier Est de la ville, après "
"chez Babeth et chez Frankie."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:300
msgid ""
"They are currently not selling slaves to the general public, due to "
"increased demand."
msgstr ""
"En ce moment, ils ne vendent pas d'esclaves aux particuliers, à cause d'une "
"forte augmentation de la demande."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:325
msgid "[Two are listed.]"
msgstr "[Deux noms se trouvent sur la liste.]"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:350
msgid "Rebecca's Casino Bar has both gambling and great affordable drinks."
msgstr ""
"Le Casino Bar d'Elisabeth propose des jeux mais aussi des boissons à des "
"prix très abordables."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:375
msgid ""
"We are located just east of here. We are the first building on the left as "
"you enter town. Be sure to come by and say hello!"
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes situés juste à l'Est d'ici. C'est le premier bâtiment sur la "
"gauche en arrivant en ville. Passez donc nous voir !"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:400
msgid ""
"Becky's a hore and her drinks is watered down! She's a krook and a lier! ["
"The writing is barely legible.]"
msgstr ""
"Babeth est une p$%@ et ses boissons sont coupées à l'eau ! C'est une voleuse "
"et une sale menteuse ! [L'écriture est à peine lisible.]"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:401
msgid "[The message that was here is neatly torn off.]"
msgstr "[Le message qui se trouvait là a été déchiré proprement.]"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:425
msgid "Words words... by... words... Bar... words... in the Den."
msgstr ""
"Des mots... des mots... par... des mots... bar... des mots... A La Fosse."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:426
msgid "You find it all very confusing and your head starts to hurt."
msgstr "Tu ne comprends plus rien et tu commences à avoir mal à la tête."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:450
msgid ""
"Frankie runs a bar, inn, and 'pleasure' business on the east side of town."
msgstr ""
"Frank dirige un bar qui fait aussi auberge et maison de \"joie\" dans les "
"quartiers est de la ville."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:475
msgid ""
"Mom's is the only restaurant in the Den. She's located on the east side of "
"town just south of the Slaver's Guild."
msgstr ""
"La Mamma est le seul restaurant de La Fosse. Il se trouve dans les quartiers "
"est de la ville, au Sud de la Guilde des Esclavagistes."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:500
msgid ""
"[It looks like someone tried to set it on fire. You can't make out any of "
"the posts.]"
msgstr ""
"[On dirait que quelqu'un a essayé d'y mettre le feu. Tu ne peux distinguer "
"aucune des annonces.]"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:525
msgid "[There are three posts.]"
msgstr "[Il y a trois annonces.]"

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:550
msgid "Tubby sells all sorts of items, but primarily drugs and ammo."
msgstr ""
"Dodu vend toute sorte de choses, mais surtout du matos et des munitions."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:575
msgid ""
"Tubby's is located west of this bulletin board. It's the first building on "
"the right as you enter town."
msgstr ""
"Chez Dodu, ça se trouve à l'Ouest de ce tableau d'affichage. C'est le "
"premier bâtiment à droite en entrant dans la ville."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:600
msgid ""
"Flick sells various items out of his 'office' in the residential building "
"directly south from here and right below Rebecca's Casino Bar."
msgstr ""
"Flick vend toutes sortes de choses en provenance de son \"bureau\" dans le "
"bâtiment résidentiel, directement au Sud d'ici. C'est juste en dessous du "
"Casino Bar d'Elisabeth."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:625
msgid "Smitty is the local mechanic. He sometimes has things for sale."
msgstr ""
"Smitty, c'est le mécano de service et parfois il a quelque chose à vendre."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:650
msgid "Smitty's located in the junkyard on the southwest corner of town."
msgstr "Tu peux trouver Smitty au dépotoir, au Sud-Ouest de la ville."

#: dialog/dibulbrd.msg:1000 dialog/schenry.msg:124 dialog/scmerk.msg:179
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "[Continuer]"

