msgstr "L'Abri 15"

#: dialog/eccvnmst.msg:300
msgid "Thanks for your business."
msgstr "Merci pour l'échange."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:100
msgid "You see one meeeean looking dog."
msgstr "Tu vois un chien qui a l'air trèèès méchant."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:101 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:102
msgid "You see Dogmeat."
msgstr "Tu vois Canigou."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:103
msgid ""
"The dog gives a low whine when it sees the vault suit. It looks like it "
"wants to come with you."
msgstr ""
"Le chien pousse un gémissement à la vue de la combinaison de l'Abri. On "
"dirait qu'il veut venir avec toi."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:104 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:111 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:118
msgid "Whistle"
msgstr "Sifflement."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:105 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:112 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:119
msgid "Maybe you ken come wif me when I haf more ruum."
msgstr "Tu fourras fenir afec moi quand f'aurais pluf de plafe."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:106 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:113
msgid "Uh-uh, doggie. Yu stay."
msgstr "Hé-ho, le toutou. Toi tu restes là."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:107 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:114 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:122
msgid "C'mon, boy. Time to do some damage."
msgstr "Allez, le chien. C'est l'heure de faire des dégâts."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:108 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:115
msgid ""
"Don't worry, boy. I'll come back and get you when I have some room in my "
"party."
msgstr ""
"Ne t'inquiète pas. Je reviendrai te chercher quand j'aurai plus de place."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:109 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:116
msgid "Sorry, Dogmeat. Not this time."
msgstr "Je regrette, Canigou. Pas cette fois."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:110
msgid ""
"The dog greedily swallows the iguana on a stick, then looks at you "
"expectantly."
msgstr ""
"Le chien avale la brochette d'iguane avec avidité, puis te lance un regard "
"plein d'espoir."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:117
msgid "You see one meeeean-looking dog."
msgstr "Tu vois un chien à l'air trèèès méchant."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:120
msgid "Wait doggie, no move."
msgstr "Attends, toutou. Pas bouger."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:121 dialog/hcprof.msg:148 dialog/nc3monte.msg:244
#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:466 dialog/ncbishop.msg:208 dialog/nclabish.msg:236
#: dialog/ncwriply.msg:342 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:111 dialog/vccasidy.msg:106
#: dialog/vccoubar.msg:118 dialog/vccoubar.msg:124 dialog/vccoubar.msg:129
#: dialog/vccoubar.msg:135 dialog/vccurtis.msg:126 dialog/vcdarrow.msg:126
#: dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:119 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:126 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:129
#: dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:132 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:137 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:144
#: dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:257 dialog/vcfarrel.msg:126 dialog/vcgatgrd.msg:133
#: dialog/vcgatgrd.msg:138 dialog/vcgreg.msg:123 dialog/vcgreg.msg:128
#: dialog/vckohl.msg:116 dialog/vckohl.msg:121 dialog/vclynett.msg:151
#: dialog/vcmainwk.msg:127 dialog/vcmainwk.msg:138 dialog/vcmainwk.msg:348
#: dialog/vcmainwk.msg:353 dialog/vcmclure.msg:116 dialog/vcmoore.msg:107
#: dialog/vcmoore.msg:202 dialog/vcnancy.msg:140 dialog/vcnancy.msg:144
#: dialog/vcnancy.msg:148 dialog/vcrandal.msg:123 dialog/vcrandal.msg:128
#: dialog/vcrandal.msg:134 dialog/vcrandal.msg:140 dialog/vcrandal.msg:152
#: dialog/vcskeeve.msg:115 dialog/vcskeeve.msg:195 dialog/vcskeeve.msg:205
#: dialog/vcskeeve.msg:230 dialog/vcstark.msg:134 dialog/vcstark.msg:362
#: dialog/vcwalace.msg:113 dialog/vcwalace.msg:120 dialog/vcwalace.msg:137
#: dialog/vcwalace.msg:143 dialog/vcwalace.msg:150 dialog/vcwalace.msg:208
#: dialog/vcwalace.msg:248 dialog/vicencom.msg:170 dialog/vicencom.msg:180
#: dialog/vicencom.msg:183 dialog/vicencom.msg:186
msgid "Shamble off"
msgstr "Dégage !"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:123
msgid "I'll come back and get you when I have some room in my party."
msgstr "Je reviendrai te chercher quand j'aurai plus de place."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:124 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:130
msgid "Stick close to me. All right, boy?"
msgstr "Reste près de moi. D'accord ?"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:125 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:131
msgid "Keep a medium distance, Dogmeat."
msgstr "Garde tes distances, Canigou."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:126 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:132
msgid "Stay far away from me, Dogmeat. Watch my back."
msgstr "Reste loin de moi, Canigou. Surveille les arrières."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:127 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:133
msgid "Stay, Dogmeat. Stay!"
msgstr "Rester, Canigou. Rester !"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:128
msgid "I think I'll just leave Dogmeat alone."
msgstr "Je crois que je vais laisser Canigou tranquille."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:129
msgid "Dogmeat gives a sharp bark, then a low growl."
msgstr "Canigou lance un aboiement aigu, puis un grognement sourd."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:134
msgid "Thanks, Dogmeat. You kick ass."
msgstr "Merci, Canigou. Tu es le plus fort !"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:135 dialog/ecdogmet.msg:136
msgid "Awooooooooooo"
msgstr "Ahouuuuuuuu"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:137
msgid "Ey'e mate, you screwen with me dog."
msgstr "Hé, le chien, te fous pas de moi !"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:138
msgid "Grrrrr...."
msgstr "Grrrrr...."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:139
msgid "(I wonder if I can get Dogmeat to follow me differently?)"
msgstr "(Je m'demande si Canigou pourrait me suivre d'une manière différente ?)"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:150 dialog/generic.msg:905 dialog/mcladdie.msg:151
#: dialog/slvcc3.msg:103 game/misc.msg:9064
msgid "Woof! Woof!"
msgstr "Wouaf ! Wouaf !"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:200
msgid ""
"Here boy, I got something for you! Let's see somebody mess with you now! ("
"You place the K-9 Kevlar on Dogmeat.)"
msgstr ""
"Regarde ce que j'ai pour toi, mon beau ! Voyons voir si quelqu'un s'en prend "
"à toi maintenant ! (Tu mets le Kevlar de K9 sur Canigou.)"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:201
msgid ""
"Is the armor weighting you down, boy? Here, let's take that thing off. (You "
"remove the K-9 Kevlar from Dogmeat.) "
msgstr ""
"Cette armure te pèse, hein mon beau ? Allez enlève là. (Tu enlèves le Kevlar "
"de K-9 à Canigou.)"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:300
msgid "*Wimper*"
msgstr "*Aboie*"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:301
msgid "Awooooooooooo! *wimper*"
msgstr "Awooooooooooo ! *Aboie*"

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:1110
msgid ""
"The dog greedily swallows the contents of the can of dog food, then looks at "
"you expectantly."
msgstr ""
"Le chien avale goulûment le contenu de la boite de conserve, et te regarde "
"avec expectation."

#: dialog/ecelron.msg:100 dialog/hcguard.msg:110
msgid "You see a Hubologist."
msgstr "Tu vois un Hubologiste."

#: dialog/ecelron.msg:101
msgid "Do you think you can escape the wrathful eye of the Hub?"
msgstr "Penses-tu pouvoir échapper à l'oeil courroucé du Centre ?"

#: dialog/ecelron.msg:102
msgid "You are raw meat. You are recruits. Pray you do not become enemies."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'êtes que de la chair à pâté, des recrues. Priez pour ne pas devenir "
"des ennemis !"

#: dialog/ecelron.msg:103
msgid "Perhaps you would like to join the Hubologists?"
msgstr "Tu aimerais peut-être te joindre aux Hubologistes ?"

#: dialog/ecelron.msg:104
msgid "Walk carefully here. We have Shi in the town. Harm nothing in our city."
msgstr ""
"Marche avec précaution ici. On a des Shis en ville. N'abîme rien dans notre "
"ville."

#: dialog/ecelron.msg:105
msgid "Perhaps you will be permitted to gaze upon our project."
msgstr "Tu auras peut-être le droit de jeter un coup d'oeil à notre projet."

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:100
msgid "You see an Enclave Patrolman."
msgstr "Tu vois un Patrouilleur de l'Enclave."

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:200
msgid ""
"You're an illegal alien on Enclave territory. Proposition 312 orders us to "
"shoot on sight.\n"
" Sorry, boy!"
msgstr ""
"Tu as pénétré illégalement sur le territoire de l'Enclave. La proposition "
"312 nous ordonne de tirer à vue. Désolé."

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:201
msgid "He's a mutant spy! Take him out, team!"
msgstr "C'est un espion mutant ! Qu'on l'attrape !"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:202 dialog/ecelvpat.msg:303
msgid ""
"As a loyal soldier of the Enclave, I got orders to kill you. Hope you don't "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"Je suis un soldat loyal de l'Enclave. J'ai l'ordre de te tuer. Tu ne m'en "
"veux pas, hein ?"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:203
msgid ""
"Base we got an intruder, sector 3; awaiting orders... Kill him? Roger that "
"base."
msgstr ""
"J'appelle la base... Intrus dans le secteur 3 ! Attendons vos ordres. - "
"Exterminer ? Bien reçu."

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:204
msgid ""
"Now I suppose you're going to tell me you're just out looking for a water "
"chip. Do I look dumb?\n"
" Get him!"
msgstr ""
"Tu vas certainement me dire que tu cherches seulement une puce d'eau. J'ai "
"l'air bête, ou quoi ? Attrapez-moi cette crapule !"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:205
msgid "Die, wasteland scum!"
msgstr "Crève, pourriture du désert !"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:206 dialog/ecelvpat.msg:304
msgid ""
"You! It's your kind that destroyed this once mighty nation. You're gonna pay!"
msgstr ""
"Toi ! Ceux de ton espèce ont détruit cette nation autrefois puissante. Tu "
"vas le payer !"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:207
msgid ""
"Hey, Louie! You ever seen what one of these babies does to soft tissue? "
"Watch!"
msgstr ""
"Hé ! Tu as déjà vu ce que cette petite merveille fait aux peaux-douces ? "
"Regarde !"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:300
msgid "Geez, I hate having to kill a woman. Let's make this quick, okay?"
msgstr "Je n'aime pas devoir tuer une femme. Réglons ça vite fait, d'accord ?"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:301
msgid "Alarm! Alarm!"
msgstr "Alerte ! Alerte !"

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:302
msgid "Looks like you come a long way for nothing, lady. "
msgstr "On dirait que tu es venue de loin pour rien, ma belle."

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:305
msgid ""
"Don't worry, it's only some wasteland bimbo. She won't put up much of a "
"fight."
msgstr ""
"Ne t'inquiète pas, c'est qu'une pouffe du désert. Elle ne se défendra pas "
"beaucoup."

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:306
msgid "It's a shame we couldn't have met under different circumstances."
msgstr ""
"C'est dommage, nous aurions pu nous rencontrer dans d'autres circonstances."

#: dialog/ecelvpat.msg:307
msgid ""
"Don't talk to me! You'll not corrupt me with your feminine temptations! Die!"
msgstr "Ne me parle pas ! Ton charme féminin ne me corrompra pas. Crève !"

#: dialog/eceric.msg:101
msgid "This is Eric."
msgstr "Eric."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:100 dialog/echomest.msg:100
msgid "You see a lean, tan looking man."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme mince au teint hâlé."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:101 dialog/ecfarmer.msg:201 dialog/echomest.msg:101
#: dialog/echomwfe.msg:101
msgid "You see a farmer."
msgstr "Tu vois une fermière."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:102 dialog/echomest.msg:102
msgid "You notice he has a farmer's tan."
msgstr "Tu remarques qu'il a le teint hâlé d'un fermier."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:103 dialog/echomest.msg:103
msgid ""
"You arrived just in the nick of time. If you hadn't gotten here when you "
"did... Well, let's just\n"
" be thankful that you came when you did. We don't have much, but I'd like "
"you to accept this as a\n"
" reward for helping us. [He hands you something.]"
msgstr ""
"Tu arrives juste à temps. Avant, ça aurait été... Disons que, heureusement, "
"tu arrives au bon moment. Nous n'avons pas grand-chose mais j'aimerais que "
"tu acceptes ceci en récompense pour nous avoir aidés. [Il te tend quelque "
"chose.]"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:105 dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:109 dialog/echomest.msg:105
#: dialog/wcbrnbot.msg:133 dialog/wsterm3a.msg:117 dialog/wsterm3c.msg:112
msgid "Ug"
msgstr "Arg."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:106 dialog/echomest.msg:106
msgid "Thanks again for helping us."
msgstr "Merci encore de nous avoir aidés !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:109
msgid ""
"You just keep your hands where I can see them. We've been plagued by bandits "
"lately and I think\n"
" you just might be one of them. What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"Laisse tes mains là où je peux les voir. Dernièrement, on a été tourmentés "
"par des bandits, et je pense que tu pourrais être l'un d'eux. Que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:110 dialog/echomest.msg:110
msgid "I just wanted to trade for supplies."
msgstr "Je voulais seulement faire des échanges de provisions."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:111 dialog/echomest.msg:111
msgid "I'm just passing through. I'll be on my way."
msgstr "Je ne fais que passer. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:113 dialog/echomest.msg:113
msgid "Well, I guess there's no harm in that. Here's what I got to trade."
msgstr "Eh bien, je ne vois aucun mal à ça. Voilà ce que j'ai à échanger."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:115 dialog/echomest.msg:115
msgid "OK, now git!"
msgstr "Bon, maintenant, casse-toi !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:117 dialog/echomest.msg:117
msgid "I said git!"
msgstr "J'ai dit \"Casse-toi\" !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:119 dialog/echomest.msg:119
msgid ""
"[He relaxes a bit.] You're too stupid to be a bandit. Do you need supplies?"
msgstr ""
"[Il se détend un peu.] Tu es trop bête pour être un bandit. Tu as besoin de "
"provisions ?"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:121 dialog/echomest.msg:121
msgid "Eh eh."
msgstr "Hé, hé, hé !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:122 dialog/echomest.msg:122
msgid "Well then, we got no business. You just keep moving, then."
msgstr "Bon, alors, on ne fait pas affaire ensemble. Passe ton chemin."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:124 dialog/echomest.msg:124
msgid "Leave my farm!"
msgstr "Quitte ma ferme !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:125 dialog/echomest.msg:125
msgid "Nobody is going to take my home from me."
msgstr "Personne ne prendra ma maison !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:126 dialog/echomest.msg:126
msgid "Filthy bandits."
msgstr "Sale bandits !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:127 dialog/echomest.msg:127
msgid "Get off my land."
msgstr "Hors de mes terres !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:128 dialog/echomest.msg:128 dialog/ectravlr.msg:145
msgid "Can't trust anyone these days."
msgstr "On ne peut plus faire confiance à personne."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:129 dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:101 dialog/echomest.msg:129
#: dialog/echomwfe.msg:201
msgid "Damn bandits."
msgstr "Saleté de bandits !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:130 dialog/echomest.msg:130
msgid "I've worked too hard to give up now."
msgstr "J'ai travaillé trop dur pour abandonner maintenant !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:131 dialog/echomest.msg:131
msgid "Maybe I'll farm elsewhere."
msgstr "Je m'installerai peut-être ailleurs."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:132 dialog/echomest.msg:132
msgid "I'm just a poor farmer."
msgstr "Je ne suis qu'un pauvre fermier."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:133 dialog/echomest.msg:133
msgid "Please, don't burn my farm down."
msgstr "Pitié, ne mets pas le feu à ma ferme !!"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:134 dialog/echomest.msg:134
msgid "I didn't like farming anyway."
msgstr "Je n'aimais pas être fermier de toute façon."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:136 dialog/echomest.msg:136
msgid "Take my wife - please..."
msgstr "Prends ma femme, je t'en prie !"

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:200
msgid "You see a lean, tanned woman."
msgstr "Tu vois une femme mince, au teint hâlé."

#: dialog/ecfarmer.msg:202 dialog/echomwfe.msg:102
msgid "You notice she has a farmer's tan."
msgstr "Tu remarques qu'elle a le teint hâlé d'une fermière."

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:100 dialog/echomkid.msg:100
msgid "Plbbt. Can't get me."
msgstr "Blblblb. Tu peux pas m'attraper."

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:101 dialog/echomkid.msg:101
msgid "My pa's gonna whip you."
msgstr "Mon papa te fouettera."

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:102 dialog/echomkid.msg:102
msgid "Take this."
msgstr "Prends ça."

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:103 dialog/echermit.msg:123 dialog/echomkid.msg:103
#: dialog/ecoutcst.msg:106 dialog/mcgrisha.msg:153
msgid "Go away!"
msgstr "Va-t'en !"

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:104 dialog/echomkid.msg:104
msgid "Pblbbt!"
msgstr "Blblblb !"

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:105 dialog/echomkid.msg:105
msgid "Whaaa!"
msgstr "Ahhhhh !"

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:107 dialog/echomkid.msg:107 dialog/mcmiria.msg:400
msgid "Daddy!"
msgstr "Papa !"

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:200 dialog/echomkid.msg:200
msgid "You see a young child."
msgstr "Tu vois un enfant."

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:201 dialog/echomkid.msg:201
msgid "It's a little boy."
msgstr "C'est un petit garçon."

#: dialog/ecfrmkid.msg:202 dialog/echomkid.msg:202
msgid "It's a little girl."
msgstr "C'est une petite fille."

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:100 dialog/echomwfe.msg:200
msgid "This is my house."
msgstr "Voici ma maison."

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:102 dialog/echomwfe.msg:202
msgid "Leave us alone!"
msgstr "Laisse-nous tranquilles !"

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:103 dialog/echomwfe.msg:203
msgid "I hate bandits."
msgstr "Je déteste les bandits. "

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:104 dialog/echomwfe.msg:204
msgid "We have nothing for you to steal."
msgstr "Nous ne possédons rien que tu puisses voler."

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:105 dialog/echomwfe.msg:205
msgid "Don't kill me."
msgstr "Epargne-moi !"

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:106 dialog/echomwfe.msg:206
msgid "I've had enough."
msgstr "J'en ai assez."

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:107 dialog/echomwfe.msg:207
msgid "Take what you want."
msgstr "Prends ce que tu veux."

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:108 dialog/echomwfe.msg:208
msgid "Please, don't kill me."
msgstr "Pitié, épargne-moi !"

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:109 dialog/echomwfe.msg:209
msgid "I hated farming anyway."
msgstr "Je déteste la ferme de toute façon."

#: dialog/ecfrmwfe.msg:110
msgid "Please don't burn the house down."
msgstr "Pitié, ne mets pas le feu à la maison !"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:100
msgid "You see a Fisherman."
msgstr "Tu vois un Pêcheur."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:101
msgid ""
"You are just in time to witness the blessings of the Goddess of the Sea."
msgstr ""
"Tu arrives juste à temps pour être témoin des grâces de la Déesse de la mer."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:104
msgid ""
"Just before a big storm we hurl spears into the sea to show our bravery "
"against the elements.\n"
" If we have proven ourselves worthy, the Goddess rewards us with fruit."
msgstr ""
"Juste avant un grand orage, nous jetons des lances dans la mer pour montrer "
"notre courage face aux éléments. Si nous avons été braves, la Déesse nous "
"récompense de ses fruits."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:105
msgid ""
"When the season of storms begins, we throw Broc flowers out on the sea with "
"the tide. After\n"
" the Goddess works her magic, she returns the Broc flowers as the rare "
"Xander root. "
msgstr ""
"A la saison des orages, on jette des fleurs de Broc à la mer. Ensuite, la "
"Déesse opère sa magie et elle nous renvoie les fleurs de Broc transformées "
"en précieuses racines de Xandre."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:106
msgid ""
"We offer tribute to the Goddess of the Sea each year in the form of Xander "
"root. If the\n"
" Goddess deems us worthy, she will turn the Xander root into Broc flowers. "
msgstr ""
"Chaque année, on fait offrande à la Déesse de la mer de racines de Xandre. "
"Si la Déesse nous trouve courageux, elle nous renvoie les racines de Xandre "
"transformées en fleurs de Broc."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:107
msgid ""
"After a bountiful harvest, we give tribute to the Goddess of the Sea that "
"she might watch over\n"
" and protect us.  Every year she has rewarded our piety by sending spears on "
"the tide as sign that she\n"
" is watching over us."
msgstr ""
"Après une bonne récolte, on fait offrande à la Déesse de la mer afin qu'elle "
"nous protège. Chaque année, elle a récompensé notre piété en envoyant des "
"lances au-dessus de la marée pour nous montrer sa protection."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:108
msgid "May I see what the Goddess has bestowed upon you?"
msgstr "Puis-je voir ce que la Déesse vous a offert ?"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:110
msgid ""
"Here is what the great Goddess has given us this year. We will gladly share "
"her blessings with\n"
" you, for a price."
msgstr ""
"Voici ce que la Déesse nous apporté cette année. Nous serions heureux de "
"partager ses grâces avec toi, moyennant finance."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:111
msgid "Junk [$10]"
msgstr "Ferraille [$10]"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:112
msgid "Laser Pistol [$10000]"
msgstr "Pistolet laser [$10 000]"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:113
msgid "Sharpened sticks [$40]"
msgstr "Bâtons aiguisés [$40]"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:114
msgid "Fruit [$5]"
msgstr "Fruits [$5]"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:115
msgid "Xander [$20]"
msgstr "Racine de Xandre [$20]"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:116
msgid "Broc [$10]"
msgstr "Fleur de Broc [$10]"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:118
msgid ""
"[He points you in the direction of the sea.] Just keep walking. The Goddess "
"wishes to meet you\n"
" personally."
msgstr ""
"[Il tend l'index en direction de la mer.] Ne t'arrête pas de marcher. Notre "
"Déesse désire te rencontrer personnellement."

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:119 dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:121 dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:123
#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:108 dialog/ecravpty.msg:110 dialog/ecravpty.msg:112
#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:114 dialog/ecravpty.msg:116 dialog/ecravpty.msg:118
#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:129 dialog/ecravpty.msg:131 dialog/ectrader.msg:117
#: dialog/ectrader.msg:119
msgid "[End]"
msgstr "[Terminé]"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:120
msgid "May the blessing of the Goddess of the Sea go with you."
msgstr "Que les grâces de notre Déesse de la mer t'accompagnent !"

#: dialog/ecfshrmn.msg:122
msgid ""
"[He frowns as you fail to produce the required sum of money.] Perhaps "
"another time, then."
msgstr ""
"[Il fronce les sourcils quand il voit que tu n'as pas assez d'argent.] "
"Alors, peut-être une autre fois."

#: dialog/ecgalaha.msg:101
msgid "This is Sir Galahad."
msgstr "Sieur Galahad."

#: dialog/ecgalaha.msg:102
msgid "He blushes when he notices you staring at him."
msgstr "Il rougit quand il remarque que tu le fixes du regard."

#: dialog/ecgalaha.msg:103
msgid "Sir Galahad, at the ready!"
msgstr "Sieur Galahad, toujours prêt !"

#: dialog/ecgalaha.msg:104
msgid "I once was a prisoner of Castle Anthrax."
msgstr "Un jour, j'étais prisonnier du Château d'Anthrax."

#: dialog/ecgalaha.msg:105
msgid "Sir Lancelot rescued me. Damn him!"
msgstr "J'ai été sauvé par le Sieur Lancelot. Qu'il soit maudit !"

#: dialog/ecgalaha.msg:106
msgid "I could have been a prisoner. [Sniff]"
msgstr "J'aurais pu être fait prisonnier. [Sniff]"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:100
msgid "Get off our turf!"
msgstr "Dégage de notre territoire !"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:101
msgid "You're on the wrong side of the tracks, fella."
msgstr "Hé toi ! T'es pas sur la bonne route là !"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:102
msgid "This is gonna hurt."
msgstr "Ca va faire mal."

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:103
msgid "Whatcha' doing in my hood?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu fous dans mon quartier ?"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:104
msgid "You ever had a knuckle sandwich?"
msgstr "Tu as déjà goûté un sandwich au poing américain ?"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:105
msgid "Scram!"
msgstr "Fous le camp !"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:106
msgid "You'll regret this!"
msgstr "Tu vas le regretter !"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:107
msgid "Tough cookie!"
msgstr "Pas de bol !"

#: dialog/ecgangs.msg:108 dialog/ecscaven.msg:106
msgid "Next time."
msgstr "Une prochaine fois."

#: dialog/ecgrdtrm.msg:100
msgid "You see a terminal with a functioning water chip."
msgstr "Tu vois un terminal avec une puce à eau en état de marche."

#: dialog/ecgrdtrm.msg:101
msgid "You see a terminal with a malfunctioning water chip."
msgstr "Tu vois un terminal avec une puce à eau défectueuse."

#: dialog/ecgrdtrm.msg:102
msgid ""
"You have broken the water chip... it might be anywhere from 100 to 150 days "
"before this\n"
" Vault runs out of water. For some reason, this thought comforts you."
msgstr ""
"Tu as cassé la puce à eau... Cet Abri sera à court d'eau dans 100 à 150 "
"jours. Tu ne sais pas pourquoi, mais cette pensée te soulage."

#: dialog/ecgrdtrm.msg:103
msgid "Whoops."
msgstr "Oups."

#: dialog/ecgrdtrm.msg:104 dialog/vimedcom.msg:203 dialog/vimedcom.msg:207
#: dialog/viterm.msg:102
msgid "*Beep*"
msgstr "<Beep>"

#: dialog/ecgrdtrm.msg:105 dialog/vimedcom.msg:206
msgid "*Bee-Oop*"
msgstr "<Bee-Oop>"

#: dialog/ecgrdtrm.msg:106
msgid "*Beep* *Bee-Oop*"
msgstr "<Beep> <Bee-Oop>"

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:100
msgid "Here mousy, mousy."
msgstr "Hé, toi, petite souris..."

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:101
msgid "Grundel need you to make stew."
msgstr "Grundel vouloir toi pour faire ragoût."

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:102
msgid "Come here, wittle mousy."
msgstr "Viens ici petite souris."

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:103
msgid "Kind Grundel no hurt you."
msgstr "Gentil Grundel pas faire mal à toi."

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:104
msgid "Tasty little ones."
msgstr "Petites très bon goût."

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:105
msgid "Come on, mousy. Me hungry."
msgstr "Allez petite souris. Moi avoir faim."

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:106
msgid "Squeek, Squeeeek. SQUEEEEK!"
msgstr "Couic-couic-couic-COUIIIIC !"

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:107
msgid "OK, OK, me lied, me gonna to eat you."
msgstr "Bon, moi mentir. Moi te manger."

#: dialog/ecgrunde.msg:110
msgid "Oooh! You a big mousy. Make good dinner for Grundel."
msgstr "Ohhh ! Toi être grosse souris. Faire gros repas pour Grundel."

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:100
msgid "You see a scarred traveler."
msgstr "Tu vois un voyageur balafré."

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:101
msgid "You see the merchant's guard."
msgstr "Tu vois le garde du marchand."

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:200
msgid "No drawn weapons near the boss."
msgstr "Pas d'armes près du patron !"

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:201
msgid "No one comes to the boss armed."
msgstr "Aucune personne armée ne s'approche du patron !"

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:202
msgid "Put your weapon away before we shoot you."
msgstr "Range ton arme avant qu'on te tire dessus !"

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:203
msgid "Put 'em away or get away."
msgstr "Range ça ou va-t'en !"

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:250
msgid "You were warned -- now you will pay."
msgstr "Tu n'as pas écouté. Maintenant, tu vas payer."

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:300
msgid "Talk to the boss, 'e'll set you up right."
msgstr "Va parler au patron. Il va s'occuper de toi."

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:301
msgid "I take my job seriously. Mess with the boss, and you die."
msgstr ""
"Je prends mon boulot au sérieux. Pas d'embrouille avec le patron ou tu "
"crèves."

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:302
msgid "The boss is a good guy for the most part."
msgstr "Le patron n'est pas un mauvais type au fond."

#: dialog/ecguard.msg:303
msgid "Don't even think of stealing from the boss."
msgstr "N'essaie jamais te voler le patron !"

#: dialog/echermit.msg:100 dialog/echermit.msg:101
msgid "You see a hermit."
msgstr "Tu vois un ermite."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:102
msgid "It looks as if he hasn't washed in years."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il ne s'est pas lavé depuis des années."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:103
msgid ""
"Can guess you why I hermit? [It seems he hasn't spoken to anyone in years.]"
msgstr ""
"Toi deviner pourquoi moi ermite ? [Il n'a, semble-t-il, parlé à personne "
"depuis des années.]"

#: dialog/echermit.msg:105 dialog/ectrappr.msg:105
msgid "Just passing through."
msgstr "Je ne fais que passer."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:107
msgid "Me want left alone."
msgstr "Moi vouloir être solitaire."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:108
msgid ""
"Since I'm here, maybe we can barter. I'm sure I have something you might "
"want."
msgstr ""
"Profitons que je sois ici pour faire du troc. J'ai certainement quelque "
"chose pour toi."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:109
msgid "I'll leave you alone then."
msgstr "Bon, je te laisse tranquille alors."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:110
msgid "Trade. Then leave you will."
msgstr "Echange. Et toi partir."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:111
msgid "OK, here's what I have to trade."
msgstr "D'accord, voilà ce que j'ai à troquer."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:112
msgid "I best leave."
msgstr "Je ferais mieux de partir."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:113
msgid "Leave now."
msgstr "Pars maintenant."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:115
msgid "Hmm... I like you. No ear talk off. Stay, trade me and you."
msgstr "Hum... moi bien aimer toi. Pas trop parler. Toi et moi, troc."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:116
msgid "K'"
msgstr "Ok."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:118
msgid "Nice talk. Go now. Tired am I."
msgstr "Content parler. Partir maintenant. Moi fatigué."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:120
msgid "Talk give pain in head. Go."
msgstr "Parler faire mal dans tête. Partir."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:121
msgid "Done me talk to you."
msgstr "Moi fini parler avec toi."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:122
msgid "No talk. Go."
msgstr "Pas parler. Partir."

#: dialog/echermit.msg:124
msgid "Leave home!"
msgstr "Quitter maison !"

#: dialog/echermit.msg:125
msgid "How you dare me attack!"
msgstr "Comment toi oser attaquer moi ?"

#: dialog/echermit.msg:126
msgid "Leave alone me."
msgstr "Laisser tranquille moi."

#: dialog/echlyppl.msg:100
msgid "How dare you interrupt my meditation!"
msgstr "Comment oses-tu interrompre ma méditation ?"

#: dialog/echlyppl.msg:101
msgid "Spirits of the land, attack!"
msgstr "Esprits de la terre, à l'attaque !"

#: dialog/echlyppl.msg:102
msgid "Great Spirit, protect me."
msgstr "Grands Esprits, protégez-moi !"

#: dialog/echlyppl.msg:103
msgid "My bones nourish the earth... many years from now."
msgstr "Mes os nourriront la terre... mais pas maintenant."

#: dialog/echlyppl.msg:104
msgid "Screw the spirits; I'm outta here."
msgstr "Esprits, laisse béton ! J'me tire !"

#: dialog/echlyppl.msg:105
msgid "You see a holy man."
msgstr "Tu vois un illuminé."

#: dialog/echomest.msg:109
msgid ""
"You just keep your hands where I can see them. We've been plagued by bandits "
"lately, and I\n"
" think you just might be one of them. What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"Laisse tes mains là où je peux les voir ! Dernièrement, nous avons été "
"tourmentés par des bandits, et je pense que tu pourrais être l'un d'eux. Que "
"veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/echomest.msg:200
msgid "Thanks fer your help."
msgstr "Merci de ton aide."

#: dialog/echomest.msg:201
msgid "Bout time some order was brought to these here lands."
msgstr ""
"Il était temps que quelqu'un ramène de l'ordre dans ce désert de pouilleux."

#: dialog/echomles.msg:100 dialog/echomles.msg:105
msgid "Food!"
msgstr "Manger !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:101
msgid "Give us food!"
msgstr "Donne-nous à manger !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:102
msgid "We're hungry!"
msgstr "On a faim !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:103
msgid "Some money for those less fortunate."
msgstr "De l'argent pour les plus démunis !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:107
msgid "My children are starving."
msgstr "Mes enfants meurent de faim !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:108
msgid "Nobody cares about us."
msgstr "Personne ne s'occupe de nous !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:109 game/combatai.msg:2009
msgid "Don't kill me!"
msgstr "Epargne-moi !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:110
msgid "I just wanted some food."
msgstr "Je voulais seulement à manger."

#: dialog/echomles.msg:111
msgid "Forgive me."
msgstr "Pardonne-moi !"

#: dialog/echomles.msg:112
msgid "The beggar takes the item."
msgstr "Le mendiant prend l'objet."

#: dialog/echomwfe.msg:100
msgid "You see a lean, tan looking woman."
msgstr "Tu vois une femme mince au teint hâlé."

#: dialog/echomwfe.msg:210
msgid "Please, don't burn the house down."
msgstr "Pitié, ne mets pas le feu à la maison !"

#: dialog/echomwfe.msg:220 dialog/hcfemale.msg:209 dialog/hcmale.msg:209
#: dialog/rcmodjes.msg:104 dialog/scmrkgrd.msg:108 dialog/vcconnar.msg:500
msgid "Don't bother me."
msgstr "Ne me dérange pas."

#: dialog/echomwfe.msg:230 dialog/mcslag.msg:301 dialog/tribec3.msg:207
#: dialog/tribec8.msg:207
msgid "Thank you for helping us."
msgstr "Merci de nous avoir aidés."

#: dialog/echomwfe.msg:231
msgid "I wish there were more people like you in this world."
msgstr "J'aimerais qu'il y ait plus de personnes comme toi dans ce monde."

#: dialog/echunter.msg:100
msgid "You see a hunter."
msgstr "Tu vois un chasseur."

#: dialog/echunter.msg:101
msgid "You are welcome here, Chosen One."
msgstr "Je te souhaite la bienvenue, Etre Elu."

#: dialog/echunter.msg:102
msgid "Have you found the holy GECK?"
msgstr "As-tu trouvé le Sacré J.E.K ?"

#: dialog/echunter.msg:103
msgid "Return with the GECK soon."
msgstr "Reviens avec le J.E.K au plus tôt."

#: dialog/echunter.msg:104
msgid "May your travels be without pain."
msgstr "Que tes voyages se passent sans douleur."

#: dialog/echunter.msg:105
msgid "Return to us that which is owed."
msgstr "Rapporte-nous notre dû."

#: dialog/echunter.msg:106
msgid "You must hurry, Chosen One."
msgstr "Tu dois te dépêcher, Etre Elu !"

#: dialog/echunter.msg:107
msgid "Our prayers are with you, Chosen One."
msgstr "Nos prières t'accompagnent, Etre Elu."

#: dialog/ecirrad.msg:100
msgid "You receive a dose of radiation."
msgstr "Tu reçois une dose de radiations."

#: dialog/ecjohn.msg:101
msgid "This is John."
msgstr "John."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:100
msgid "You see a man strumming a lute."
msgstr "Un homme qui joue du luth."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:101
msgid "This is Joshua."
msgstr "Joshua."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:102
msgid "He is a traveling minstrel."
msgstr "Un troubadour ambulant."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:103
msgid "Brave Sir Robin ran away..."
msgstr "Le courageux Sieur Robin s'est enfui."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:104
msgid "Bravely ran away, away..."
msgstr "Courageusement, il s'est enfui."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:105
msgid ""
"When danger reared its ugly head, he bravely turned his tail and fled..."
msgstr ""
"Le danger a montré son horrible visage, alors il a courageusement tourné les "
"talons et s'est enfui."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:106
msgid "Yes, Brave Sir Robin turned about..."
msgstr "Oui, le courageux Sieur Robin a tourné..."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:107
msgid "And gallantly he chickened out. Bravely taking to his feet..."
msgstr "Et galamment, il s'est dégonflé. Il a pris ses jambes à son cou."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:108
msgid "He beat a very brave retreat..."
msgstr "Il a battu en retraite avec courage."

#: dialog/ecjoshua.msg:109
msgid "Oh, Brave Sir Robin."
msgstr "Oh, courageux Sieur Robin !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:100
msgid "You see a man wearing minimal clothing."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme qui porte le strict minimum."

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:101 dialog/eckaga2.msg:101 dialog/eckaga3.msg:101
msgid "You see Kaga."
msgstr "Tu vois Kaga."

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:103
msgid "He is wearing pants and looks like he came from a tribe."
msgstr "Il porte des pantalons et on dirait qu'il vient d'une tribu."

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:104 game/cmbatai2.msg:36120 game/combatai.msg:36120
msgid "I should have been the Chosen One!"
msgstr "Ca aurait dû être moi l'Etre Elu !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:105
msgid "How dare Arroyo cast me out of the tribe."
msgstr "Comment les gens d'Arroyo ont-ils osé chasser Kaga de la tribu ?"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:106
msgid "I will have my revenge on you!"
msgstr "Kaga se vengera !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:107
msgid "Kaga will send you to the next life."
msgstr "Kaga va t'envoyer dans l'au-delà !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:108 dialog/eckaga4.msg:108 game/cmbatai2.msg:36100
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36200 game/combatai.msg:36100 game/combatai.msg:36200
msgid "We will meet again!"
msgstr "On se reverra !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:109 game/cmbatai2.msg:36102 game/combatai.msg:36102
msgid "I have never been beaten before!"
msgstr "Personne n'a encore réussi à battre Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:110
msgid "I will dedicate myself to your destruction."
msgstr "Il consacrera sa vie à te détruire !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:150 dialog/eckaga2.msg:150 dialog/eckaga3.msg:150
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:150 dialog/eckaga5.msg:150
msgid ""
"[A tall and powerfully built warrior stands before you, his eyes blaze with "
"hatred as he looks you over.] So, they cast out Kaga, then deem YOU the "
"Chosen One? Ha! You think being the grandchild of the Vault Dweller makes "
"you special?! You think you are better than I, Kaga the Great?!"
msgstr ""
"[Un grand guerrier puissamment bâti se tient devant toi, ses yeux reflètent "
"la haine alors qu'il te passe en revue] Alors comme ça, ils ont chassé Kaga, "
"et ont fait de TOI l'Etre Elu ? Ha ! Tu penses qu'être le petit fils de "
"l'Habitant de l'Abri te rend exceptionnel ?! Tu crois que tu vaux mieux que "
"moi, Kaga le Grand ?!"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:151 dialog/eckaga2.msg:151 dialog/eckaga3.msg:151
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:151 dialog/eckaga5.msg:151
msgid "Well, I AM the Chosen One, aren't I?"
msgstr "Hé bien, JE SUIS, l'Etre Elu, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:152 dialog/eckaga2.msg:152 dialog/eckaga3.msg:152
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:152 dialog/eckaga5.msg:152
msgid "Hey now, hold on a second. I never said I was better than you."
msgstr "Hé, attends une seconde. J'ai jamais dit que je valais mieux que toi."

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:160 dialog/eckaga2.msg:160 dialog/eckaga3.msg:160
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:160 dialog/eckaga5.msg:160
msgid ""
"That title will mean nothing when Kaga rips the head from your shoulders!"
msgstr "Ce titre ne voudra plus rien dire lorsque Kaga t'arrachera la tête !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:161 dialog/eckaga2.msg:161 dialog/eckaga3.msg:161
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:161 dialog/eckaga5.msg:161
msgid ""
"No words can save your hide. With your death, Kaga's honor shall be "
"restored. Kaga will now take his vengeance!"
msgstr ""
"Aucune parole ne te sauvera la peau. Toi mort, mon honneur sera restauré. "
"Kaga va maintenant prendre sa revanche !"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:200 dialog/eckaga2.msg:200 dialog/eckaga3.msg:200
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:200 dialog/eckaga5.msg:200
msgid "Ooglie?"
msgstr "Ooglie ?"

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:201 dialog/eckaga2.msg:201 dialog/eckaga3.msg:201
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:201 dialog/eckaga5.msg:201
msgid ""
"What!? They picked *you* to be the Chosen One? Oh my, they've become "
"desperate."
msgstr ""
"Quoi !? C'est *toi* qu'ils ont choisi comme Etre Elu ? Ho-la-la, ils doivent "
"être désespérés."

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:202 dialog/eckaga2.msg:202 dialog/eckaga3.msg:202
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:202 dialog/eckaga5.msg:202
msgid "Me no likie. U lookie bad."
msgstr "Moi pas aimer toi. Toi l'air méchant."

#: dialog/eckaga1.msg:203 dialog/eckaga2.msg:203 dialog/eckaga3.msg:203
#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:203 dialog/eckaga5.msg:203
msgid ""
"Kaga won't even bother speaking with you further. Prepare to die at the "
"hands of Kaga!"
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas de temps à perdre à te parler. Prépare-toi à mourir des mains de "
"Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:100
msgid "You see a man wearing leather armor."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme qui porte une armure en cuir."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:102
msgid ""
"He is wearing leather armor and has an annoying habit of talking about "
"himself in the third person."
msgstr ""
"Il porte une armure en cuir. Il a une sale manie, il parle de lui à la "
"troisième personne."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:103
msgid "This will be the last time Kaga meets you."
msgstr "Ce sera notre dernière rencontre."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:104
msgid "After Kaga kill you, he will burn Arroyo to the ground."
msgstr "Il te tuera, puis il mettra Arroyo à feu et à sang."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:105 game/cmbatai2.msg:36240 game/cmbatai2.msg:36340
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36440 game/cmbatai2.msg:36540 game/combatai.msg:36240
#: game/combatai.msg:36340 game/combatai.msg:36440 game/combatai.msg:36540
msgid "Feel the wrath of Kaga!"
msgstr "Sens la colère de Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:106
msgid "I am the great Kaga!"
msgstr "Il est le grand Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:107
msgid "Kaga is to be feared by all."
msgstr "Il sera respecté par tous."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:108
msgid "Kaga will have your head for a trophy."
msgstr "Kaga fera de ta tête un trophée."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:109
msgid "Surrender and your death will be quick."
msgstr "Rends-toi et ta mort sera rapide."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:110
msgid "Kaga will be back!"
msgstr "Je reviendrai !"

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:111
msgid "You cannot kill the great Kaga!"
msgstr "Tu ne peux pas tuer le grand Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:112
msgid "You are lucky Kaga has business elsewhere."
msgstr "Tu as de la chance, les affaires appellent Kaga ailleurs."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:113
msgid "Kaga will meet you again."
msgstr "On se reverra."

#: dialog/eckaga2.msg:120
msgid "It's that Kaga guy again."
msgstr "C'est encore ce Kaga."

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:100
msgid "You see a man wearing metal armor."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme qui porte une armure métallique."

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:102
msgid ""
"Yep, it's Kaga the not-so-great. He has metal armor and wants to kill you."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, c'est Kaga le pas si Magnifique que ça. Il porte une armure "
"métallique et veut te tuer."

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:103
msgid "You again!"
msgstr "Encore toi !"

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:104
msgid "I grow tired of our constant meetings."
msgstr "Il commence à en avoir marre de nos rencontres incessantes."

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:105
msgid "Chosen One - hmph!"
msgstr "Etre Elu, hum..."

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:106 game/combatai.msg:36321
msgid "Let's end this."
msgstr "Finissons-en !"

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:107
msgid "You will regret you ever heard the name Kaga!"
msgstr "Tu regretteras d'avoir entendu un jour le nom de Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:108 game/cmbatai2.msg:36323 game/combatai.msg:36323
msgid "My skills have increased since we last met."
msgstr "Ses compétences ont progressé depuis notre dernière rencontre."

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:109 game/cmbatai2.msg:36300 game/cmbatai2.msg:36400
#: game/combatai.msg:36300 game/combatai.msg:36400
msgid "This is getting to be a bad habit."
msgstr "Ca devient une sale manie !"

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:110
msgid "Kaga needs to train a little more."
msgstr "Kaga a besoin de plus d'entraînement."

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:111
msgid "Kaga will return."
msgstr "Kaga reviendra !"

#: dialog/eckaga3.msg:120
msgid "So we meet again, Kaga."
msgstr "Tiens Kaga, comme on se retrouve."

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:100
msgid "You see a man wearing combat armor."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme qui porte une armure de combat."

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:101
msgid "You see Kaga in combat armor."
msgstr "Tu vois Kaga vêtu d'une armure de combat."

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:102
msgid "He is wearing combat armor and seems to have some decent weapons."
msgstr "Il porte une armure de combat. On dirait qu'il a de bonnes armes."

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:103
msgid "This time I'm prepared for you."
msgstr "Cette fois, il t'attendait."

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:104 game/cmbatai2.msg:36420 game/combatai.msg:36420
msgid "The Chosen One will never return to Arroyo!"
msgstr "L'Etre Elu ne retournera jamais à Arroyo !"

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:105 game/cmbatai2.msg:36421 game/combatai.msg:36421
msgid "Kaga will crush you!"
msgstr "Kaga te réduira en miettes !"

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:106 game/cmbatai2.msg:36422 game/combatai.msg:36422
msgid "Kaga fears no one!"
msgstr "Kaga n'a peur de personne !"

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:107
msgid "Hold still, so Kaga can get a good shot."
msgstr "Ne bouge plus, laisse Kaga viser !"

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:109 game/combatai.msg:36402
msgid "This is not the last you will see of Kaga."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas la dernière fois que tu verras Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:110
msgid "Kaga definitely needs more training."
msgstr "Kaga a vraiment besoin d'un entraînement plus poussé."

#: dialog/eckaga4.msg:120
msgid "Go away Kaga!"
msgstr "Casse-toi Kaga !"

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:100
msgid "You see a man wearing MKII power armor. He doesn't look friendly."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un homme qui porte une SuperArmure Mk II. Il n'a pas l'air très "
"amical."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:101
msgid "You see Kaga in MKII power armor."
msgstr "Tu vois Kaga dans sa SuperArmure Mk II."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:102
msgid "A big hunk of metal with arms and guns."
msgstr "Un gros morceau de métal avec des bras et des fusils."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:103
msgid "I tire of the chase. Let's finish this."
msgstr "Il en a marre de cette chasse. Finissons-en."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:104
msgid "This is the last time you will meet Kaga."
msgstr "C'est la dernière fois que tu rencontres Kaga."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:105 game/cmbatai2.msg:36521 game/combatai.msg:36521
msgid "You are no match for Kaga."
msgstr "Tu n'es pas à la hauteur de Kaga."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:106
msgid "I look forward to sending you on your next life."
msgstr "Il a hâte de t'envoyer dans ta prochaine vie !"

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:107
msgid "You have been a worthy enemy."
msgstr "Tu as été un digne adversaire."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:108
msgid "This part of the wastes doesn't need a do-gooder like you."
msgstr "Cette région du désert n'a pas besoin d'une bonne âme dans ton genre."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:109
msgid ""
"After I kill you, I will be the most feared person in this part of the "
"wastes."
msgstr ""
"Il va te tuer, et il deviendra la personne la plus respectée de cette région "
"du désert !"

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:110
msgid "I am looking forward to going home to Arroyo - to burn it down."
msgstr "Il a hâte de retourner à Arroyo... pour tout brûler !"

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:111
msgid "Kaga will be famous for killing you."
msgstr "Kaga sera célèbre pour le meurtre de ta petite personne."

#: dialog/eckaga5.msg:120
msgid "Kagaaaaaaaa!"
msgstr "Kagaaaaaaaa !"

#: dialog/ecmel.msg:100 dialog/ecmel.msg:101
msgid "You see a man in black."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme en noir."

#: dialog/ecmel.msg:102
msgid "It is a man in black. And he doesn't seem too happy."
msgstr "C'est un homme en noir. Et il n'a pas l'air très content."

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:100
msgid "You see a strange beast."
msgstr "Tu vois une bête étrange."

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:101
msgid "You see a super-mutant that looks a bit deranged."
msgstr "Tu vois un Super Mutant qui a l'air un peu dérangé."

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:103
msgid "Approach no further! Melchior the Magnificent commands you!"
msgstr "N'approche pas ! C'est un ordre de Melchior le Magnifique !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:104
msgid "Behold, I am the greatest magician in the world!"
msgstr "Regarde, je suis le plus grand magicien du monde !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:105
msgid "Tremble before the might of Melchior the Magnificent!"
msgstr "Trrrremble devant la puissance de Melchior le Magnifique !!"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:106
msgid "My pets will feast on your bones!"
msgstr "Mes animaux feront un festin de tes os !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:107
msgid "I warned you! Attack, my pets!"
msgstr "Tu n'as pas voulu m'écouter. (à ses animaux :) Attaquez !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1000
msgid "SHAHOOEY!"
msgstr "CHAOUIIII !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1001
msgid "My claw pets take care you."
msgstr "Mes animaux à griffes vont s'occuper de toi !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1002
msgid "Claw thing attack!"
msgstr "Attaque, truc à griffes !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1010
msgid "ABADABRA!"
msgstr "ABRACADABRA !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1011
msgid "Melchior make fire pets to burn human."
msgstr "Melchior fait des animaux de feu pour brûler les humains !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1012
msgid "Burn da HU - MUN!"
msgstr "Brûlez les HU-MAINS !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1020
msgid "ZIMZOWY!"
msgstr "ZIMZOOUIII !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1021
msgid "Jaw pet tear you up!"
msgstr "Mes animaux à dents vont te dévorer !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1022
msgid "Chomp him my precious."
msgstr "Croque-le mon doux petit !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1030
msgid "KALIMAJIGGER!"
msgstr "KALIMASTRONEF !"

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1031
msgid "Shit! Me only got fat rats left."
msgstr "Merde ! Moi avoir encore seulement des gros rats."

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1032
msgid "Me running out of pets."
msgstr "Moi plus avoir assez d'animaux."

#: dialog/ecmelchr.msg:1050
msgid "Uh Oh. Me outta furries to mootate."
msgstr "Heu... Oh ! Moi plus avoir de bêtes à poils pour transformation."

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:100
msgid "You see a little rugrat."
msgstr "Tu vois un petit gamin."

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:101
msgid "You see Melchior, Jr."
msgstr "Tu vois Melchior Jr."

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:150
msgid "He seems like a smiley, big-eyed kid."
msgstr "C'est un enfant souriant aux grands yeux. "

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:200
msgid "Hello! I'm Melchior, Jr."
msgstr "Bonjour ! Je m'appelle Melchior Jr."

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:201
msgid "My dad's a miner. His name is Melchior just like mine."
msgstr "Mon père est mineur. Il s'appelle Melchior comme moi."

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:202
msgid "My dad is a good miner, but he wants to be a magician."
msgstr "Mon père est un bon mineur, mais il veut être magicien."

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:203
msgid "Daddy's stage name is Melchior the Magnificent."
msgstr "Le nom de scène de mon papa c'est Melchior le Magnifique. "

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:204
msgid "His best trick was pulling a rat out of a hat."
msgstr "Son meilleur tour, c'était de faire sortir un rat de son chapeau. "

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:205
msgid "He went away with some men dressed in metal clothes."
msgstr "Il est parti avec des hommes vêtus d'habits métalliques. "

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:206
msgid "I hope dad comes back soon. I miss his magic tricks."
msgstr "J'espère que papa reviendra bientôt. Ses tours de magie me manquent. "

#: dialog/ecmelkid.msg:207
msgid "I'm going to be a great magician like my dad."
msgstr "Plus tard, je serai un grand magicien, comme papa."

#: dialog/ecmercs.msg:100
msgid "You see a mercenary."
msgstr "Tu vois un mercenaire."

#: dialog/ecmercs.msg:101
msgid "Practice time, boys!"
msgstr "Tous à l'entraînement, les gars !"

#: dialog/ecmercs.msg:102
msgid "Easy target."
msgstr "Cible facile."

#: dialog/ecmercs.msg:103
msgid "Run... I like moving targets."
msgstr "Cours... j'aime les cibles qui bougent !"

#: dialog/ecmercs.msg:104
msgid "Kill zone!"
msgstr "Zone de mise à mort !"

#: dialog/ecmercs.msg:105
msgid "Hostile contact confirmed."
msgstr "Confirmation de contact hostile."

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:100
msgid "You see a mobster."
msgstr "Tu vois un gangster."

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:101
msgid "Well, well - what have we got here?"
msgstr "Hé bien ! Que vois-je là ?"

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:102
msgid ""
"Simple travelers, eh? Ain't no such thing. You need help with any of your "
"valuables? "
msgstr ""
"De simples voyageurs, hein ? Ca n'existe pas. Vous avez besoin d'aide pour "
"vos objets de valeur ?"

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:103
msgid ""
"Watch where you're walking around Reno, or you're gonna get hurt. Stay outta "
"my way."
msgstr ""
"Fais gaffe où tu mets les pieds à Reno, ou tu risques de te faire mal. Et "
"que je ne te trouve pas sur mon chemin !"

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:104 dialog/nccorbro.msg:246 dialog/ncnikki.msg:210
#: dialog/ncnikki.msg:242 dialog/ncprosti.msg:868 dialog/zidcegrl.msg:215
#: dialog/zidcegrl.msg:261
msgid "Hello, "
msgstr "Bonjour, "

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:106
msgid "What are you doing out here, "
msgstr "Que fais-tu par ici, "

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:108
msgid "We were just coming out to check on you, "
msgstr "On voulait seulement savoir comment tu allais, "

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:109
msgid ". Nice day today, eh, "
msgstr ". Quelle belle journée, hein, "

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:111
msgid "Did you come out here to get away from it all, "
msgstr "Tu es ici pour échapper à tout ça ? "

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:112 dialog/ncliljes.msg:5560 dialog/ocgoris.msg:1156
msgid "? "
msgstr " ?"

#: dialog/ecmobstr.msg:113
msgid " was wondering what you were up to, "
msgstr " se demandait ce que tu manigançais, "

#: dialog/ecmonshn.msg:100
msgid "You see a moonshiner."
msgstr "Tu vois un bouilleur de cru clandestin."

#: dialog/ecmonshn.msg:101
msgid "We sell only the highest quality liquor. You interested?"
msgstr ""
"On vend uniquement des alcools de la plus haute qualité. Ca t'intéresse ?"

#: dialog/ecmonshn.msg:102
msgid "Yes, let's see what you got."
msgstr "Oui, voyons ce que tu as."

#: dialog/ecmonshn.msg:105
msgid "Then beat it! We're busy."
msgstr "Alors casse-toi, on a du boulot."

#: dialog/ecmonshn.msg:106
msgid "I make sure the mix of alcohol is just right."
msgstr "Je fais en sorte que le mélange d'alcool soit parfait."

#: dialog/ecmonshn.msg:107
msgid "Baka. BAka BAKA!"
msgstr "Baka. BAka BAKA !"

#: dialog/ecmonshn.msg:108
msgid "Thanks for the business."
msgstr "Merci pour tout."

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:100
msgid "You see a well-traveled person."
msgstr "Tu vois quelqu'un qui a beaucoup voyagé."

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:102
msgid "Wow, I rarely see people out here."
msgstr "Hé ben, je vois rarement des gens par ici."

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:103
msgid "Hey! Wait! I have things that could help you along!"
msgstr "Hé ! Attends ! J'ai quelque chose qui pourrait t'aider."

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:104
msgid "Hey! Do you have anything to trade for these?"
msgstr "Hé ! Tu voudrais échanger quelque chose contre ça ?"

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:105
msgid "This must be my lucky day. Come, see what I have for sale."
msgstr "Ca doit être mon jour de chance. Viens voir ce que j'ai à vendre."

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:200
msgid ""
"Greetings, traveler! I rarely see many people along this route, but\n"
" am always happy to have new customers. Would you like to trade?"
msgstr ""
"Salut ! Je ne vois pas souvent du monde sur cette route, mais j'ai toujours "
"plaisir à recevoir de nouveaux clients. Tu veux faire des échanges ?"

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:201
msgid ""
"Hey there! It's really great that you stopped. Most people along this\n"
" route just keep right on going. Hey, would you like to trade some things?"
msgstr ""
"Hé, salut ! C'est super que tu fasses une halte ici. La plupart des gens qui "
"suivent cette route passent sans s'arrêter. Hé, tu veux bien faire des "
"échanges ?"

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:202
msgid "Would you be interested in a little trade?"
msgstr "Un petit échange t'intéresserait-il ?"

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:250
msgid "That'd be good."
msgstr "Ca serait bien."

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:251
msgid "Sorry, have to keep on moving."
msgstr "Je regrette, je ne peux pas m'arrêter."

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:252
msgid "Yah. Me got stuff!"
msgstr "Ahhh, moi avoir choses !"

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:260
msgid "Good trading with you. Good luck in your travels."
msgstr "C'est sympa de faire affaire avec toi. Bonne chance pour tes voyages !"

#: dialog/ecmrchnt.msg:270
msgid "Glad to have you back. Can I interest you in something else?"
msgstr "Quel plaisir de te voir de retour ! Tu t'intéresses à autre chose ?"

#: dialog/ecmstamy.msg:100
msgid "A die-hard soldier from the Master's army."
msgstr "Un soldat restant de l'armée du Maître."

#: dialog/ecmstamy.msg:101
msgid "Master says bring all normies to him."
msgstr "Le Maître a dit de lui amener tous les norms."

#: dialog/ecmstamy.msg:102
msgid "All normies must be dipped."
msgstr "Tous les norms doivent être trempés."

#: dialog/ecmstamy.msg:103
msgid "Squish the normie!"
msgstr "Ecrabouillez les norms !"

#: dialog/ecmstamy.msg:104
msgid "Me want hear you make squish noise."
msgstr "Moi vouloir entendre bruit quand réduire toi en bouillie."

#: dialog/ecmststr.msg:100
msgid "You see a helpful stranger."
msgstr "Tu vois un étranger qui à l'air serviable."

#: dialog/ecmststr.msg:101
msgid "You see the mysterious stranger."
msgstr "Tu vois un étranger qui à l'air mystérieux."

#: dialog/ecmststr.msg:102
msgid "I will help thee."
msgstr "Je vais t'aider."

#: dialog/ecmststr.msg:103
msgid "I don't talk much."
msgstr "Je ne parle pas beaucoup."

#: dialog/ecmststr.msg:104
msgid "Looks like you could use some assistance."
msgstr "On dirait que t'as besoin d'un coup de main."

#: dialog/ecmststr.msg:105 dialog/qcgranit.msg:110
msgid "Let's rock!"
msgstr "Yeah !"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:100 dialog/ecnomchf.msg:100
msgid "You see a nomad."
msgstr "Tu vois un nomade."

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:101
msgid "Hello, you look new around here."
msgstr "Bonjour, tu n'es pas d'ici, on dirait."

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:102
msgid "You should talk to the chief."
msgstr "Tu devrais parler au chef."

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:103
msgid "I don't think it is as hot today as it was yesterday."
msgstr "Je crois qu'aujourd'hui il ne fait pas aussi chaud qu'hier."

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:104
msgid "So what's life like in the city?"
msgstr "Alors, comment c'est la vie en ville ?"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:105 dialog/ecnomchf.msg:116 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:143
msgid "Infidel!"
msgstr "Infidèle !"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:106 dialog/ecnomchf.msg:117 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:144
msgid "Why do you attack us?"
msgstr "Pourquoi nous attaques-tu ?"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:107 dialog/ecnomchf.msg:118 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:145
msgid "I will defend the tribe with my life!"
msgstr "Je défendrai la tribu au prix de ma vie !"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:108
msgid "How dare you violate our hospitality!"
msgstr "Comment oses-tu violer notre hospitalité ?!"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:109 dialog/ecnomchf.msg:120 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:147
msgid "Be gone!"
msgstr "Hors d'ici !"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:110 dialog/ecnomchf.msg:121 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:148
msgid "Leave us."
msgstr "Laisse-nous !"

#: dialog/ecnomad.msg:111 dialog/ecnomchf.msg:122 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:149
msgid "We are a peaceful tribe."
msgstr "Notre tribu est pacifique."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:101
msgid "He appears to be a nomad chieftain."
msgstr "Chef nomade."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:102
msgid ""
"By his dress and the way he carries himself, he must be a leader of some "
"sort."
msgstr ""
"Ses habits et sa prestance montrent qu'il est certainement une sorte de chef."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:103
msgid ""
"Ah, a traveler. Be welcome to my humble tent. Take shade from the unending "
"heat of the land."
msgstr ""
"Je te souhaite la bienvenue dans mon humble tente. Viens à l'ombre t'abriter "
"de la chaleur infinie de la terre."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:104
msgid "Thank you; I graciously accept your offer of shade."
msgstr "Merci, j'accepte ta proposition bien volontiers."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:105
msgid "I must decline your offer. I am just passing through."
msgstr "Je dois refuser ta proposition. Je ne fais que passer."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:106 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:108 dialog/generic.msg:302
#: dialog/mccornel.msg:301
msgid "Ooga."
msgstr "Ooga."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:107
msgid ""
"Be welcome, then. We have long been away from the 'civilized' lands. We are "
"in need of\n"
" certain items. Perhaps we might be able to trade?"
msgstr ""
"Alors ta présence est la bienvenue. Nous n'avons pas fait de troc avec les "
"\"civilisés\" depuis longtemps. Nous avons besoin de certains produits. Et "
"si nous faisions quelques échanges ?"

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:108 dialog/mcjo.msg:165
msgid "What do you have to trade?"
msgstr "Quels produits proposez-vous ?"

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:109
msgid "I have nothing to trade. Sorry."
msgstr "Je n'ai rien à échanger, je regrette."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:110
msgid "Perhaps another time, then? May your travels be free of danger."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être une autre fois, hein ? Que tes voyages se passent sans danger !"

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:112
msgid "How unfortunate. Then rest and be welcome in my camp."
msgstr "Quel dommage... Alors repose-toi et sois ici chez toi."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:113 dialog/tribec4.msg:641
msgid "Thank you. Bye."
msgstr "Merci. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:114
msgid ""
"My offer of shade has come too late for you. The sun must have boiled away "
"words from your\n"
" brain. I must be kind to those less fortunate than I. Stay as long you like "
"in my camp, dimwitted one."
msgstr ""
"Ma proposition est arrivée trop tard. Le soleil a déjà brûlé les mots dans "
"ton cerveau. Je dois être bon avec les moins bien lotis que moi. Reste aussi "
"longtemps qu'il te plaira dans mon campement, faible d'esprit..."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:119 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:146
msgid "How dare you violate our hospitality."
msgstr "Comment oses-tu violer notre hospitalité ?!"

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:200
msgid ""
"Ah, a traveler. I am sorry that we have no tent from which you may take "
"shade from the unending heat of the land. Do rest a moment, so that we may "
"talk."
msgstr ""
"Ah, un voyageur. Je suis désolé que nous n'ayons pas de tente pour vous "
"protéger de la chaleur incessante de cette terre. Repose-toi un instant, "
"afin que nous puissions discuter."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:201
msgid "Thank you; I graciously accept your offer."
msgstr "Merci, j'accepte volontiers ton offre."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:202
msgid "How unfortunate. Rest a moment then; you are welcome among us."
msgstr "Quel dommage. Alors repose-toi et sois ici chez toi."

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:203
msgid "I do hope you found what you needed. Anything else?"
msgstr "J'espère que tu as trouvé ce dont tu avais besoin. Autre chose ?"

#: dialog/ecnomchf.msg:204
msgid "Not today. I must be going."
msgstr "Pas aujourd'hui. Je dois y aller."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:100
msgid "You see a nomad shaman."
msgstr "Tu vois un chaman nomade."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:101
msgid "He appears to be a nomad shaman."
msgstr "On dirait un chaman nomade."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:102
msgid "The strong smell of herbs cling to this one's clothing."
msgstr "L'odeur forte des herbes reste accrochée à ses vêtements."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:103
msgid ""
"Hello, stranger. I am the tribe shaman. I am skilled in the art of healing."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour. Je suis le chaman de cette tribu. Je possède des pouvoirs de "
"guérison."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:105
msgid "I am in need of healing."
msgstr "J'ai besoin d'une guérison."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:106
msgid "Can you combine the Xander root and the Broc flower?"
msgstr "Peux-tu mélanger la racine de Xandre et la fleur de Broc ?"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:109
msgid "Be still and I will examine you."
msgstr "Reste calme. Je vais t'examiner."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:110 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:124 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:126
#: dialog/tribec9.msg:207 dialog/tribec9.msg:209
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[Continuer]"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:111
msgid "I have found these afflictions."
msgstr "Voici les maux que j'ai trouvés : "

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:112
msgid "Can you help me?"
msgstr "Peux-tu m'aider ?"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:113
msgid "I can perform the following for a price:"
msgstr "Pour ce prix-là, je peux : "

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:114
msgid "Please extract the poison from my body."
msgstr "S'il te plaît, extrais ce poison de mon corps."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:115
msgid "Please heal me."
msgstr "Guéris-moi, je t'en prie !"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:116
msgid "See what you can do for my broken limb."
msgstr "Vois ce que tu peux faire avec mon membre cassé."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:118 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:119 dialog/ecnomsha.msg:120
msgid "You have been healed."
msgstr "Tu as été guéri."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:121
msgid "I am in need of more of your skills."
msgstr "J'ai encore besoin de tes compétences."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:122
msgid "Thank you; I feel much better. Bye."
msgstr "Merci, je me sens beaucoup mieux. Salut."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:123
msgid "My skills are limited, and I cannot help you any further in this area."
msgstr ""
"Mes compétences sont limitées et je ne peux pas t'aider plus dans ce domaine."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:125
msgid "You do not require this type of healing."
msgstr "Tu n'as pas besoin de ce genre de soin."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:127
msgid ""
"Ahh... You are familiar with the healing properties of these two plants. It "
"will only cost\n"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Ah, tu connais les vertus thérapeutiques de ces deux plantes. Ca te coûtera "
"seulement "

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:128
msgid "Please combine the two plants for me."
msgstr "S'il te plaît, mélange ces deux plantes pour moi."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:129
msgid "Maybe later, bye."
msgstr "Plus tard peut-être. Salut."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:130
msgid ""
"[You watch as he carefully crushes and combines the two plants, and then "
"hands you precisely\n"
" measured doses of the powder.]"
msgstr ""
"[Tu le regardes broyer avec soin les deux plantes et les mélanger. Il te "
"tend des quantités de poudre dosées avec précision.]"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:132
msgid "You seem to be short on cash. Return later when your purse is fatter."
msgstr ""
"On dirait que tu n'as plus d'argent. Reviens plus tard, quand ton porte-"
"monnaie sera plus garni."

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:134
msgid "I do not have time for such nonsense. Leave!"
msgstr "Je n'ai pas de temps à perdre avec ces sottises. Pars !"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:136
msgid "[Poisoned]"
msgstr "[Empoisonnement]"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:137
msgid "[Injured]"
msgstr "[Blessures]"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:138
msgid "[Radiated]"
msgstr "[Irradiation]"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:139
msgid "[Crippled]"
msgstr "[Estropie]"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:140
msgid "Cure poison,"
msgstr "te donner de l'antidote, "

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:141
msgid "Fix crippled limbs,"
msgstr "soigner tes membres estropiés, "

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:142
msgid "Healing $"
msgstr "Guérison $"

#: dialog/ecnomsha.msg:150
msgid "and I will combine the two for you."
msgstr " et je mélangerai les deux plantes pour toi."

#: dialog/ecoutcst.msg:100
msgid "Do not run."
msgstr "Ne cours pas !"

#: dialog/ecoutcst.msg:101
msgid "We are your friends."
msgstr "Nous sommes tes amis."

#: dialog/ecoutcst.msg:102
msgid "Do not attack."
msgstr "N'attaque pas !"

#: dialog/ecoutcst.msg:103
msgid "Sucker."
msgstr "Saloperie !"

#: dialog/ecoutcst.msg:104
msgid "Leave us!"
msgstr "Laisse-nous tranquilles !"

#: dialog/ecoutcst.msg:105
msgid "Unclean!"
msgstr "Dégueulasse !"

#: dialog/ecpariah.msg:100
msgid "You see ragged looking dog that could expire at any moment."
msgstr "Tu vois un pauvre chien à l'air miteux, au bord de l'agonie."

#: dialog/ecpariah.msg:101
msgid "It is that damn bad luck dog."
msgstr "Encore un chien de malheur..."

#: dialog/ecpariah.msg:102
msgid ""
"This dog has several patches of fur missing and almost seems to be a walking "
"corpse. He also seems to have a glass eye."
msgstr ""
"Il lui manque des plaques entières de poils. On dirait un cadavre ambulant."

#: dialog/ecpariah.msg:103
msgid "The dog seems to take a liking to you. This can't be good."
msgstr "Ce chien commence à bien t'aimer. Ca n'est pas bon signe."

#: dialog/ecpatsy.msg:100
msgid "A man."
msgstr "Un homme."

#: dialog/ecpatsy.msg:101
msgid "Patsy."
msgstr "Patsy."

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:100
msgid "This animal should really be put out of its misery."
msgstr "Quelqu'un devrait mettre fin à la détresse de ce chien."

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:101
msgid ""
"It resembles a dog. Too bad the hair on this poor thing is falling off in "
"clumps."
msgstr ""
"On dirait un chien, dommage que les poils de cette pauvre bête tombent par "
"poignées."

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:102
msgid "You see one screwed up, ugly dog. He likes you, though."
msgstr "Tu vois un chien minable et déglingué. Il t'aime bien pourtant."

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:110
msgid "Whhuff"
msgstr "Ouaouff !"

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:111
msgid "Whheee uuuuuhhhh ffff"
msgstr "Ouuuuaaaaaouuuuuffff !"

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:112
msgid "hufff ffffuuffff"
msgstr "Ouuuuuuuuffffffuuuuuffff"

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:113
msgid "arrr arrr ffff"
msgstr "Arrgg arrgg fffff"

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:114
msgid "HHHoooowowowowww"
msgstr "OOOOuuuuuouuuouuouu"

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:115
msgid "ehhhh hufff"
msgstr "Ehhhh ouuuuufff"

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:200
msgid "You feel a lot more safe now that the dog is dead."
msgstr "Tu te sens bien plus en sécurité maintenant que le chien est mort."

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:201
msgid ""
"There really isn't much you can do for this animal. The bullet to kill it is "
"probably worth\n"
" more."
msgstr ""
"Tu ne peux pas faire grand chose pour cette bête. La balle qui la tuerait "
"vaut bien plus que la bête elle-même."

#: dialog/ecpdog.msg:202
msgid "Yup, he is really bad off. Besides, you really don't want to touch it."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, il est vraiment mal en point. En plus, tu ne tiens pas vraiment à le "
"toucher."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:100
msgid "You see a Prospector."
msgstr "Tu vois un chercheur."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:101
msgid ""
"Hold it right there, stranger! I'm not used to ambushing strangers, but I "
"need supplies and I\n"
" can't leave my claim. Want to do a quick trade?"
msgstr ""
"Reste où tu es ! Généralement, je ne tends pas d'embuscade aux étrangers "
"mais j'ai besoin de provisions et je ne peux pas quitter ma concession. On "
"fait un échange rapide ?"

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:103
msgid "I've got nothing to trade. Sorry."
msgstr "Je n'ai rien à échanger. Je regrette."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:104
msgid "Booga."
msgstr "Booga."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:105
msgid ""
"What a stroke of luck. You can't talk can you? Can't talk, can't tell anyone "
"where my claim\n"
" is. Let's trade."
msgstr ""
"Quel pot ! Tu ne peux pas parler, hein ? Tu ne peux raconter à personne où "
"se trouve ma concession ! Faisons affaire."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:107
msgid "OK, beat it! And you better not tell anyone where my claim is."
msgstr ""
"Allez, casse-toi. Et t'as pas intérêt à aller raconter où se trouve ma "
"concession !"

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:109
msgid "I think you better keep moving."
msgstr "Passe donc ton chemin."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:110
msgid "We have nothing more to talk about."
msgstr "On n'a plus rien à se dire."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:111
msgid "On your way!"
msgstr "Pars !"

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:112
msgid "Go get 'em."
msgstr "Allez les gars, attrapez-les !"

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:113
msgid "Can't have you tell'en anyone where my claim is."
msgstr ""
"Je ne peux pas te laisser raconter à tout le monde où se trouve ma "
"concession."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:114
msgid "Why'd you go an attack me?"
msgstr "Pourquoi m'attaquer ?"

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:115
msgid "Now I have to kill you."
msgstr "Maintenant, je dois te tuer."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:116
msgid "I just wanted some supplies."
msgstr "Je voulais seulement quelques provisions."

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:117
msgid "You can have my claim!"
msgstr "Tu n'auras pas ma concession !"

#: dialog/ecprospe.msg:118 game/cmbatai2.msg:2000 game/cmbatai2.msg:2005
#: game/combatai.msg:2000 game/combatai.msg:2005
msgid "Mercy!"
msgstr "Pitié !"

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:100
msgid "Ah! Another recruit."
msgstr "Ah, une nouvelle recrue !"

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:101
msgid "Join or die!"
msgstr "Suis-nous ou crève !"

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:102
msgid "Be all you can be."
msgstr "Exprime-toi !"

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:103
msgid "The few, the proud, the mercenaries."
msgstr "Les rares, les fiers et les mercenaires."

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:104
msgid "Join us!"
msgstr "Viens avec nous !"

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:105
msgid "4F."
msgstr "Va te f... f... "

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:106
msgid "Time to look elsewhere."
msgstr "Il est temps d'aller voir ailleurs."

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:107
msgid "Go join the Navy."
msgstr "Engage-toi donc dans la marine."

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:109
msgid "Whoa! Look at the time, I gotta go!"
msgstr "Hou la ! T'as vu l'heure ? Il faut que je file !"

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:110
msgid "Recruit."
msgstr "Recrue."

#: dialog/ecprsgng.msg:111
msgid "Sergeant."
msgstr "Sergent."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:100
msgid "Gay pride!"
msgstr "Gay Pride !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:101
msgid "Down with heteros!"
msgstr "A bas les hétéros !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:102
msgid "Outsiders are not welcome!"
msgstr "Les étrangers ne sont pas les bienvenus !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:103
msgid "Proud to be a dyke!"
msgstr "Fière d'être lesbienne !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:104
msgid "Girl power!"
msgstr "Le Pouvoir aux filles !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:105
msgid "Don't need a man!"
msgstr "Pas besoin des hommes !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:106
msgid "The Rainbow Confederation will live on."
msgstr "La Confédération Arc-en-ciel vivra !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:107
msgid "Retreat to the Love Shack."
msgstr "Tous à la Cabane d'Amour !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:108
msgid "We shall overcome!"
msgstr "Nous vaincrons !"

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:109
msgid "Welcome to the Rainbow Confederation."
msgstr "Bienvenue à la Confédération Arc-en-ciel."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:110
msgid "Your kind are welcome here."
msgstr "Les gens comme toi sont les bienvenus."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:111
msgid "You're one of us."
msgstr "Tu es comme nous."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:112
msgid "Colonizers."
msgstr "Colon."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:113
msgid "Colon-ist."
msgstr "Colon."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:114
msgid "Queer."
msgstr "Tapette."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:115
msgid "Pansy."
msgstr "Tantouse."

#: dialog/ecraibow.msg:116
