msgid "This looks to be a "
msgstr "On dirait "

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:100
msgid "You see a rough-looking person."
msgstr "Tu vois quelqu'un qui a l'air d'une brute."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:101
msgid "You see a raider."
msgstr "Tu vois un pillard."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:200
msgid "You trespass into our lands. Now you die!"
msgstr "Tu as pénétré sur nos terres. Tu dois mourir !"

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:201
msgid "How dare you come here uninvited!"
msgstr "Comment oses-tu venir ici sans invitation ? "

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:202
msgid "Die, city walker!"
msgstr "Crève !"

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:203
msgid "Your death should bring me some money."
msgstr "Ta mort devrait me rapporter un peu d'argent."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:204
msgid "Flee before me, puny one!"
msgstr "Fuis devant moi, misérable !"

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:205
msgid "You know the drill, gentlemen."
msgstr "Messieurs, vous connaissez la marche à suivre !"

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:206
msgid "No witnesses."
msgstr "Pas de témoins."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:207
msgid "Cover me."
msgstr "Couvrez-moi."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:208 game/combatai.msg:36855
msgid "No mercy!"
msgstr "Pas de pitié !"

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:209
msgid "The man says no survivors."
msgstr "\"Pas de survivants\", c'est la consigne."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:210
msgid "Bishop says no trespassing."
msgstr "Bishop a dit : \"Propriété privée\"."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:211
msgid "Let's get paid!"
msgstr "On veut être payés !"

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:300
msgid "You see Frog Morton."
msgstr "Tu vois Gâchette Morton."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:301
msgid "You see Toad Morton."
msgstr "Tu vois Barillet Morton."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:302
msgid "You see Newt Morton."
msgstr "Tu vois Crosse Morton."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:303
msgid "You see Snake Morton."
msgstr "Tu vois Colt Morton."

#: dialog/ecraider.msg:305
msgid "You killed my brother! Now I kill you!"
msgstr "Tu as tué mon frère ! Maintenant, je vais te tuer !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:100
msgid "You see a group of well-armed travelers."
msgstr "Tu vois un groupe de voyageurs bien armé."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:101
msgid "They're still well-armed strangers."
msgstr "Faut dire que ce sont des étrangers très bien armés."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:102
msgid ""
"They have clean, well-polished weapons and are wearing some kind of badge on "
"their chests."
msgstr ""
"Leurs armes sont propres, bien astiquées. Ils portent des sortes de badges "
"sur la poitrine."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:103
msgid "We're looking for slaver patrols. Seen any, stranger?"
msgstr "On cherche des patrouilles esclavagistes. Tu en as vu ?"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:104
msgid "Greetings stranger. Sure hope you're not a slaver - for your own sake."
msgstr ""
"Salut. J'espère que tu n'es pas esclavagiste. Ca vaudrait mieux pour toi."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:105
msgid ""
"Nice meeting you, stranger. Don't mind us and there won't be any trouble."
msgstr ""
"C'est un plaisir de te rencontrer. Ne fais pas attention à nous et tout ira "
"bien."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:106
msgid ""
"We're the NCR Rangers - we make the world a better place. Just thought you'd "
"like to know."
msgstr "Nous sommes le Commando de la RNC, nous luttons pour un monde meilleur."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:107
msgid "We're Rangers. Killing slavers is our business."
msgstr "Nous sommes le Commando. Tuer les esclavagistes, c'est notre métier."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:108
msgid "Damn, slave-lover. You're gonna die hard!"
msgstr "Espèce de philo-esclavagiste. Tu vas crever !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:109
msgid "Shit - I warned you!"
msgstr "T'aurais dû m'écouter !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:110
msgid "Your type ain't needed around here - so die."
msgstr "Les gens dans ton genre, on n'en a pas besoin ici ! Crève !!"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:111
msgid "Always the guns. Doesn't anybody just surrender anymore?"
msgstr "Toujours les armes... Ca n'arrêtera donc jamais ?"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:112
msgid "Well, that's it - open season!"
msgstr "Tu l'auras cherché ! La chasse est ouverte !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:113
msgid "Uh -- I'll go get reinforcements. Don't move!"
msgstr "Heu, que personne ne bouge, je vais chercher des renforts !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:114
msgid "\"We can take 'em,\" he said. Sure..."
msgstr "\"On les aura !\", qu'il avait dit. Ouais, c'est ça..."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:115
msgid "Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!"
msgstr "Hou-hou-hou-hou !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:116
msgid "Crap! I'm out of here!"
msgstr "Merde ! J'me casse !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:117
msgid "I'm not dying for this!"
msgstr "Je ne mourrai pas pour ça !"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:118
msgid ""
"I see you got a tattoo there -- the mark of the slavers. You wouldn't be a "
"slaver now, would you?"
msgstr ""
"Je vois que tu as un tatouage là, la marque des esclavagistes. Tu n'es pas "
"esclavagiste, dis ?"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:121
msgid ""
"Too bad - for you. We're NCR Rangers. Ever heard of us? We kill slavers."
msgstr ""
"Pas de chance. T'as déjà entendu parler du Commando de la RNC ? C'est nous. "
"On tue les esclavagistes."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:122
msgid "You are such a lying sack of shit. Take 'em!"
msgstr "Espèce de tas de merde !!"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:123
msgid "Greetings, stranger. We're NCR Rangers. Who be you?"
msgstr ""
"Salut ! Je m'appelle Ezéchiel. Je fais partie du Commando de la RNC. Qui es-"
"tu ?"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:124 dialog/ecranger.msg:127 dialog/fcchemst.msg:107
#: dialog/fcrocman.msg:111 dialog/fcrocman.msg:123 dialog/fcrocman.msg:129
#: dialog/ocgoris.msg:118 dialog/qcgranit.msg:124 dialog/schenry.msg:109
#: dialog/vcmclure.msg:140
msgid "None of your business."
msgstr "Ca ne te regarde pas."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:125
msgid "Say, I've heard that name. You're a Ranger, aren't you?"
msgstr "Hé, j'ai déjà entendu ce nom. Tu fais partie du Commando, c'est ça ?"

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:128
msgid "Fine, be anti-social. At least you're not a slaver. Goodbye."
msgstr "Sois asocial si tu veux. Au moins tu n'es pas esclavagiste. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ecranger.msg:129
msgid ""
"Pleased to meet you, fellow Ranger. Keep your eyes clear for trouble. See "
"you around."
msgstr ""
"C'est un plaisir de te connaître. Garde les yeux ouverts en cas de danger. A "
"plus tard."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:100
msgid "This person seems to be swaying slightly."
msgstr "On dirait que cette personne titube un peu."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:101
msgid "You see the party bartender."
msgstr "Tu vois la personne qui s'occupe du bar."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:102
msgid "It seems he's been sampling some of his merchandise."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il a goûté quelques échantillons de ses boissons."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:103
msgid "Wha... whas..what cans I gets yas. [Hick.]"
msgstr "Quoi... qui... qu'est-ce que je te sers ? <Hic>"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:104
msgid "Nuka-Cola [$6]"
msgstr "Nuka-Cola [$6]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:105
msgid "Beer [$15]"
msgstr "Bière [$15]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:106
msgid "Booze [$30]"
msgstr "Bibine [$30]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:107 dialog/ecravpty.msg:126
msgid "Nothing today. Thanks."
msgstr "Rien pour aujourd'hui. Merci."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:109
msgid "Ohhhh... that ain't no fun ta drinks. [He hands you your drink.]"
msgstr "Ohhh... C'est pas marrant à boire. [Il te donne ta boisson.]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:111
msgid ""
"Here ya goes. It's a bit warm cuz it hasn't had time to cool. Sellen' the "
"stuff faster than I\n"
" can makes it. [It's warm, it's yellow it's....]"
msgstr ""
"Et voilà. C'est un peu chaud, ça a pas eu le temps de refroidir. Ca me prend "
"plus de temps à faire qu'à vendre. [C'est chaud, c'est jaune, c'est...]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:113
msgid "[You feel the walls of your stomach dissolve as you take a large gulp.]"
msgstr "[Tu avales une gorgée et tu sens la paroi de ton estomac se dissoudre.]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:115
msgid "Whoa...[hick] I thinks yuz had nuf ta drinks already."
msgstr "Hou la ! <Hic> J'crois qu't'en as déjà assez sifflé comme ça."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:117
msgid "Ahhh man! You don't have enuf money! Cum back when ya gets sum."
msgstr ""
"Ahhh ! T'as pas assez de fric sur toi ! Reviens quand tu auras l'oseille."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:119
msgid "He has a bit of a wild look to him."
msgstr "Il a l'air un peu sauvage."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:121
msgid "He seems a bit jittery."
msgstr "Il semble un peu nerveux."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:122
msgid "Whatdoyawant? Igotitall!"
msgstr "Kestuveu ? Jé-seu-kil-te-fau !"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:123
msgid "Mentats [$560]"
msgstr "Mentats [$560]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:124
msgid "Buffout [$400]"
msgstr "Buffout [$400]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:125
msgid "Psycho [$800]"
msgstr "Psycho [$800]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:128
msgid "Thatsgreat! Givemethemoneyandgetoutofhere. Igotabusinesstorun."
msgstr "Super ! Filemoimonfrikékaseutoidela. Jéunkomerseuafèreutourné."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:130
msgid ""
"Likethesayinggoes. Nomoneynohoney. Oh. Thatsforsex. Howaboutnodoughnoblow.\n"
" Comebackwhenyougotsomecash."
msgstr ""
"Komeudileprovèrbeu : \"Sitapadefriktupeupacétonchemin\". Oh. "
"Nonsacépourlesèxeu. \"Padeflouzeupadebistouilleu\"\". \"Revienkantuoradufrik"
"\"\"."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:132
msgid "Heheheh! Lookslikeyoucanusesomementats. Giveme$1000."
msgstr "Héhéhé ! Ondirékunedoseudeumentatsteferépademal. Filemoi $1 000."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:133
msgid "[Give the man $1000]"
msgstr "[Donner $1 000 au gars.]"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:135
msgid "OHYEAH! Thiswillpickyourightup!"
msgstr "Ahouais ! Seutrukvateuremonter !"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:150
msgid "Hey, you're kinda cute; whats your name?"
msgstr "Hé, t'es pas mal, toi. C'est quoi ton petit nom ?"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:151
msgid "A'lil higher. Ohh, yeah."
msgstr "Encore un p'tit coup. Oh, ouais !"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:152
msgid "You ready ... get jiggy with it?"
msgstr "Tu es d'accord pour faire un petit voyage ? "

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:153
msgid "Naw..naw..naw..naw nuh naw."
msgstr "Gna... gna... gna... gna..."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:154
msgid "Watch like this. Yeah."
msgstr "Regarde, comme ça. Ouais !"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:155
msgid "Na't now go away."
msgstr "Pas maintenant, allez va-t'en."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:156
msgid "Lemme be drunk over here."
msgstr "Laisse-moi me péter la gueule. "

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:157
msgid "Go get jiggy ..somewhere else."
msgstr "Va planer... ailleurs."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:158
msgid "How about you and me get away from the crowd?"
msgstr "Et si on s'éloignait un peu de la foule ?"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:159
msgid "Uhh, let's do it!"
msgstr "Heu, d'accord, allons-y. "

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:160
msgid "Naa, I'm drunk."
msgstr "Ahhh. Je suis complètement ivre. "

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:161
msgid "[Burb] ::smile::"
msgstr "<Burp> ::Sourire::"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:170
msgid "Hey, you want to go behind that bush?"
msgstr "Hé, tu veux faire un tour derrière ce bosquet ?"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:171
msgid "You ever been high and done it?"
msgstr "Tu l'as déjà fait quand tu en avais pris ?"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:172
msgid "I could show you the stars, baby."
msgstr "Je pourrais te montrer les étoiles, mon chou."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:173
msgid "You know I want some lovin'."
msgstr "Moi j'ai besoin d'amouuuuur ~~"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:174
msgid "I was hoping to run into someone who was ready to go."
msgstr "J'espérais rencontrer quelqu'un qui voudrait venir avec moi."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:175
msgid "That was enough for me."
msgstr "Ca me suffit."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:176
msgid "Hey, you got a cigarette?"
msgstr "Hé, t'as une clope ? "

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:177
msgid "Hey, now don't get too attached -- I like my freedom."
msgstr "Hé, ne commence pas à t'attacher. Je tiens à ma liberté."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:178
msgid "You're as sleek as a panther and I want you."
msgstr "Tu es ma panthère et je veux te monter comme une bête de la jungle."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:180
msgid "Not now; I gotta shoot up."
msgstr "Pas maintenant. Je plane à donf."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:181
msgid "Man the hatches. We're goin' in."
msgstr "Hé, quelle planque ! On y va !"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:200
msgid "Don't be a jerk!"
msgstr "Sois pas dégueulasse !"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:201
msgid "Go party elsewhere."
msgstr "Va faire la fête ailleurs."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:202 dialog/hcfemale.msg:206 dialog/hcmale.msg:206
msgid "Who let you in?"
msgstr "Comment as-tu pu entrer ?"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:203
msgid "This is not cool!"
msgstr "C'est pas sympa !"

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:204
msgid "Chill dude."
msgstr "Cool, Raoul."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:205
msgid "Relax man!"
msgstr "Relax, Max."

#: dialog/ecravpty.msg:210
msgid "It seems she's been sampling some of her own merchandise."
msgstr "On dirait qu'elle a goûté quelques échantillons de ses boissons."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:100
msgid "You see... a red-haired heroine model."
msgstr "Tu vois une héroïne aux cheveux roux."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:101
msgid ""
"You see a strikingly attractive red-haired woman in a Vault 13 jumpsuit. She "
"is glaring angrily\n"
" into the distance."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois une femme remarquablement belle aux cheveux roux, vêtue d'une "
"combinaison de l'Abri 13. Elle regarde au loin, furieuse."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:102 dialog/ecredhro.msg:103
msgid "You see a red-haired heroine model. She is glaring into the distance."
msgstr "Tu vois une héroïne aux cheveux roux. Elle regarde au loin."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:104
msgid "I can't believe I didn't make the final cut in Fallout 1."
msgstr ""
"Je n'apparais pas dans la séquence finale de Fallout 1. J'arrive pas à y "
"croire !"

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:105
msgid "They chose that black-haired *strumpet* instead. Of all the nerve!"
msgstr "A la place, ils ont choisi une *catin* aux cheveux noirs. Quel culot !"

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:106
msgid "A *black-haired* female model. Can you get any more generic? BOR-ing."
msgstr ""
"Une femme *aux cheveux noirs*. On pouvait pas faire plus commun, Trop NUL !"

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:107
msgid "Redheads are infinitely more interesting."
msgstr "Les rousses sont tellement plus intéressantes."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:108
msgid ""
"That black-haired female model got in only because she slept with *every* "
"artist on the team."
msgstr ""
"Cette femme aux cheveux noirs a été prise uniquement parce qu'elle a couché "
"avec *tous* les artistes de l'équipe."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:109
msgid "AND the programmers."
msgstr "Et les programmeurs."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:110
msgid ""
"AND the project leader. They're soooo easily swayed. Show a little skin, and "
"their spines turns to\n"
" rubber."
msgstr ""
"Et le directeur de projet. Tim se laisse siiii facilement entraîner ! Tu lui "
"montres un bout de chair et il se liquéfie !"

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:111
msgid ""
"So I get shafted and end up being \"filler NPCs\" in Vault 13. Keee-rist. "
"Talk about typecasting."
msgstr ""
"Alors je me fais jeter et je termine dans un rôle de \"PNJ Bouche-trou\" à "
"l'Abri 13. Tu parles d'un stéréotype !"

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:112
msgid ""
"I'm surprised they rendered that black-haired female model with any clothes."
msgstr ""
"Quelle n'a pas été ma surprise de constater que cette femme aux cheveux "
"noirs portait des vêtements !"

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:113
msgid ""
"I mean, it's not like she was IN them very much during the screening process."
msgstr ""
"Enfin, je veux dire, sachant que pendant la projection, elle ne les avait "
"PAS souvent sur le dos."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:115
msgid "I hate men."
msgstr "Je déteste les hommes."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:116
msgid "Well, except for that dreamy Scotty Everts."
msgstr "Bon, d'accord, sauf le beau Scotty Everts."

#: dialog/ecredhro.msg:117
msgid ""
"I think he stuck up for me. I only had to sleep with him a few times for him "
"to vote for me."
msgstr ""
"Je crois qu'il me soutient. J'ai seulement dû coucher avec lui quelques fois "
"pour qu'il vote pour moi."

#: dialog/ecrobin.msg:101
msgid "This is Sir Robin."
msgstr "Sieur Robin."

#: dialog/ecrobin.msg:102
msgid "He looks like he's ready to run."
msgstr "Il semble prêt à courir."

#: dialog/ecrobin.msg:103
msgid "Sir Robin, at your service."
msgstr "Sieur Robin, à votre service."

#: dialog/ecrobin.msg:104
msgid "You're not going to try to hurt me are you?"
msgstr "Tu ne vas pas me faire mal, hein ?"

#: dialog/ecrobin.msg:105
msgid "There's no need for violence, is there?"
msgstr "Pas besoin d'utiliser la violence, hein ?"

#: dialog/ecscaven.msg:100 dialog/ecslaver.msg:112
msgid "This is our territory."
msgstr "C'est notre territoire ici."

#: dialog/ecscaven.msg:101 dialog/mcslag.msg:151
msgid "You're not wanted here."
msgstr "Ta présence n'est pas bienvenue ici."

#: dialog/ecscaven.msg:102
msgid "I think you need to pay a toll."
msgstr "Je crois que tu dois payer une taxe."

#: dialog/ecscaven.msg:103
msgid "We don't usually scavenge off the living."
msgstr "En général, on ne se sert pas sur les vivants."

#: dialog/ecscaven.msg:104
msgid "That's some nice stuff you have there."
msgstr "Tu as de jolies choses."

#: dialog/ecscaven.msg:107
msgid "Running's a bitch!"
msgstr "Saloperie de course !"

#: dialog/ecscaven.msg:108
msgid "You get to keep your stuff... this time."
msgstr "Tu peux garder tes affaires... cette fois."

#: dialog/ecset.msg:100
msgid "You see... Set."
msgstr "Tu vois... Set."

#: dialog/ecset.msg:101
msgid ""
"You see a decaying ghoul with machine parts sticking out of his head. It's "
"hard to tell whether\n"
" he's senile or not."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois une Goule en putréfaction. De sa tête sortent des pièces de machine. "
"Difficile à dire si elle est sénile ou non."

#: dialog/ecset.msg:102 dialog/ecset.msg:103
msgid "You see Set. He is talking to himself."
msgstr "Tu vois Set. Il parle tout seul."

#: dialog/ecset.msg:104 dialog/ecset.msg:105
msgid "\"Dirtnap!\""
msgstr "\"Fais dodo !\""

#: dialog/ecset.msg:106
msgid "\"Dirtnap... Makes my shadow GROW.\""
msgstr "\"Fais dodo... Ca fait grandir mon ombre.\""

#: dialog/ecset.msg:108
msgid "Dirt."
msgstr "Fais."

#: dialog/ecset.msg:109
msgid "Nap."
msgstr "Dodo."

#: dialog/ecset.msg:110
msgid "Dirtnap!"
msgstr "Fais dodo !"

#: dialog/ecset.msg:111
msgid "Heh-heh. I ruuule Necropolis."
msgstr "Hé, hé, hé ! Je suis le chef de Nécropolis."

#: dialog/ecset.msg:112
msgid "Normies. Everywhere, normies."
msgstr "Des norms ! Partout des norms !"

#: dialog/ecset.msg:113
msgid "Name's Set. Yours is World-a-hurt."
msgstr "\"Moi, c'est Set. Toi, c'est Monde-de-brute.\""

#: dialog/ecset.msg:114
msgid "Chuckle-chuckle."
msgstr "Guili-guili ! "

#: dialog/ecset.msg:115
msgid "Nap. Dirt. Napdirt!"
msgstr "Dodo. Sale. Dodosale !"

#: dialog/ecsirlau.msg:101
msgid "Sir Launcelot."
msgstr "Sieur Lancelot."

#: dialog/ecsirlau.msg:102
msgid "He's caressing his gun."
msgstr "Il caresse son fusil."

#: dialog/ecsirlau.msg:103
msgid "Sir Launcelot, at your service."
msgstr "Sieur Lancelot, pour vous servir."

#: dialog/ecsirlau.msg:104
msgid "Bugger off!"
msgstr "Casse-toi !"

#: dialog/ecsirlau.msg:105
msgid "You looking for a fight?"
msgstr "Tu cherches la bagarre ?"

#: dialog/ecsirlau.msg:106
msgid "Ouch! Stop poking me!"
msgstr "Aïe ! Arrête !"

#: dialog/ecslave.msg:100 dialog/fcdocsqa.msg:113 dialog/kchild.msg:162
#: dialog/mcchild.msg:162
msgid "Please don't hurt me!"
msgstr "Ne me fais pas mal."

#: dialog/ecslave.msg:101
msgid "Are you my new master?"
msgstr "Tu es mon nouveau maître ?"

#: dialog/ecslave.msg:102
msgid "Please set me free."
msgstr "La liberté, s'il te plaît."

#: dialog/ecslave.msg:103
msgid "I really want to be free."
msgstr "Je veux être libre."

#: dialog/ecslave.msg:104
msgid "Run away!!"
msgstr "Sauve qui peut !!"

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:100
msgid "These will fetch a good price at market."
msgstr "J'en tirerai un bon prix au marché."

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:101
msgid "Try not to damage the merchandise."
msgstr "Essaie de ne pas abîmer la marchandise."

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:102
msgid "You'll make a spirited slave."
msgstr "Tu feras un esclave plein d'entrain."

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:103
msgid "This is not good."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas bien."

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:104 game/cmbatai2.msg:2901 game/cmbatai2.msg:12001
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:26001 game/cmbatai2.msg:26101 game/cmbatai2.msg:44902
#: game/combatai.msg:2901 game/combatai.msg:12001 game/combatai.msg:26001
#: game/combatai.msg:26101 game/combatai.msg:44902
msgid "Retreat!"
msgstr "Fuyons !"

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:105
msgid "Maybe I'll sell furniture instead."
msgstr "Je devrais peut-être me mettre à vendre des meubles à la place."

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:106
msgid "Fellow slavers should not attack one another."
msgstr "Les esclavagistes ne devraient pas se battre entre eux."

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:107
msgid "The guild will hear of this!"
msgstr "La guilde sera mise au courant !"

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:109
msgid "Any luck?"
msgstr "De la chance ?"

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:110
msgid "Find any good slaves?"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé de bons esclaves ?"

#: dialog/ecslaver.msg:111
msgid "We're looking for new stock."
msgstr "On vient renouveler notre stock."

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:100
msgid "You see a pathetic looking spammer."
msgstr "Tu vois un camelot pathétique."

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:110
msgid "You see absolutely nothing of interest."
msgstr "Tu ne vois rien d'intéressant."

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:120
msgid "Will there be a Mac version?"
msgstr "Y aura-t-il une version Mac ?"

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:121
msgid "I want multi-player!"
msgstr "Je veux le mode multi-joueurs !"

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:122
msgid "I hate you all!"
msgstr "Je vous déteste tous !"

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:124
msgid "You can't hurt me!"
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez pas me faire mal !"

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:125
msgid "I'm the Grim Reaper, you can't kill me. Aren't I funny."
msgstr "Je suis la Mort, vous ne pouvez pas me tuer. Je ne suis pas drôle."

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:126
msgid "I want a tank!"
msgstr "Je veux une citerne !"

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:127
msgid "Where's my chainsaw?"
msgstr "Où est ma tronçonneuse ?"

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:129
msgid "I didn't mean to be such a jerk."
msgstr "Je ne pensais pas être un tel crétin."

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:130
msgid "I didn't mean those death threats."
msgstr "Je ne pensais pas ces menaces de mort."

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:131
msgid "I'm sorry, Buffy!"
msgstr "Je suis désolé Buffy !"

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:132
msgid "I'm sorry, Unwashed! I just wanted to be noticed."
msgstr "Je suis désolé ! Je voulais juste être remarqué."

#: dialog/ecspammr.msg:133
msgid "I want an on-line version!"
msgstr "Je veux une version on-line !"

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:100
msgid "You see... Tandi."
msgstr "Tu vois... Tandi."

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:101
msgid ""
"You see a cute, raven-haired girl with a winsome expression. She is gazing "
"dreamily into the\n"
" distance."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois une fille mignonne aux cheveux de jais, l'air charmeur. Elle regarde "
"au loin, rêveuse."

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:102 dialog/ectandi.msg:103
msgid "You see Tandi. She is gazing dreamily into the distance."
msgstr "Tu vois Tandi. Elle regarde au loin, rêveuse."

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:104
msgid "Hi! So you're a descendent of the Fallout 1 hero? Wow! I'm Tandi! Hi!"
msgstr ""
"Salut ! Alors, ton ancêtre était un héros de Fallout 1 ? Génial ! Moi, c'est "
"Tandi !"

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:105
msgid ""
"I didn't want to just blurt it out, but your grandfather sure was cute! "
"*Sigh*"
msgstr ""
"Je sais, je me laisse aller mais je dois dire que ton grand-père était "
"vraiment mignon ! ::Soupir::"

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:106
msgid "Ian? I think he's still in Fallout 2 somewhere. Vault City, maybe?"
msgstr ""
"Ian ? Il est toujours dans Fallout 2, je crois. Peut-être à la Cité de "
"l'Abri."

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:107
msgid ""
"Actually, I hear *I'm* in Fallout 2 somewhere. I don't want to go find me, "
"though... might creep\n"
" us both out."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que *moi* aussi j'étais dans Fallout 2. Je ne veux pas me "
"voir... ça nous foutrait la trouille."

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:108
msgid ""
"Sorry I didn't have better combat skills in Fallout 1. I guess I didn't get "
"out much."
msgstr ""
"Mes compétences de combat dans Fallout 1 laissaient plutôt à désirer. "
"Désolée. J'étais pas trop dégourdie à l'époque."

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:109
msgid "Say... do you and Tycho still keep in touch?"
msgstr "Alors, êtes-vous restés en contact Tycho et toi ?"

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:110
msgid ""
"So there was this bug when you rescued me from the raiders and brought me "
"back to Dad, he'd go\n"
" ballistic. Gosh, that sucked!"
msgstr ""
"Il y avait ce bug quand tu m'as sauvée des pillards et ramenée chez mon "
"père. Il était vert de rage. Ca craignait !"

#: dialog/ectandi.msg:111
msgid ""
"I'd join you, but I'm waiting for my Dad, Aradesh, to show up. He was "
"supposed to join me a few\n"
" revisions ago."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais t'accompagner, mais j'attends l'arrivée de mon père, Aradesh. Il "
"aurait dû me rejoindre il y a quelques révisions déjà."

#: dialog/ectinwod.msg:100 dialog/ectinwod.msg:101
msgid "You see a man in some type of armor."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme avec une armure."

#: dialog/ectinwod.msg:102
msgid "His armor seems to be quite rusty."
msgstr "Son armure semble assez rouillée."

#: dialog/ectinwod.msg:103
msgid "Oil can."
msgstr "Bidon d'huile."

#: dialog/ectinwod.msg:104
msgid ""
"Thanks a lot. You have no idea how long I have been stuck here. Well, take "
"this for your trouble. I have to go."
msgstr ""
"Merci beaucoup. Tu n'imagines pas combien de temps je suis resté bloqué ici. "
"Je te prie d'accepter ceci pour ce que tu as fait. Je dois partir."

#: dialog/ectinwod.msg:105
msgid "Uhh, thanks."
msgstr "Euh, merci."

#: dialog/ectinwod.msg:106
msgid "Sorry, gotta run. I'll see you some other time."
msgstr "J'm'excuse mais là faut qu'j'y aille. Je te verrai une prochaine fois."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:100
msgid "Want hear new recipe?"
msgstr "Tu veux connaître une nouvelle recette ?"

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:101
msgid "What kind?"
msgstr "Laquelle ?"

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:102
msgid "Rat surprise."
msgstr "Surprise de rat."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:103
msgid "Sound good. How me make?"
msgstr "Miam bon. Comment moi faire ?"

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:104
msgid "Catch rat. Careful no squish too much."
msgstr "Attraper rat. Attention pas presser trop fort."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:105
msgid "How no squish? Every time I club them, they pop. Very messy."
msgstr "Comment pas presser ? Quand je les frappe, ils éclatent. Dégueulasse."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:106
msgid "You want hear recipe or not? Catch rat your problem."
msgstr "Toi vouloir entendre recette ou pas ? Attraper rat ton problème."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:107
msgid "Me sorry."
msgstr "Moi regretter."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:108
msgid "Like said, catch rat. Hang by tail on wall."
msgstr "Comme moi dire, attraper rat. Attacher sur mur avec queue."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:109
msgid "Let hang til tail fall off. It ready then."
msgstr "Enlever quand queue tomber. C'est prêt."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:110
msgid "Eat quickly, if let sit too long, the surprise crawl out and fly away."
msgstr ""
"Manger vite. Si laisser trop longtemps, surprise sortir en rampant puis "
"s'envoler."

#: dialog/ectlkmut.msg:111
msgid "Sound yummy."
msgstr "Miam-miam."

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:100
msgid "A salesman."
msgstr "Un représentant."

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:101
msgid "Willy."
msgstr "Willy."

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:102
msgid "A slick traveling salesman."
msgstr "Un représentant rusé."

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:103
msgid ""
"Greetings, friend, my name is Willy and have I got a deal for you. [He seems "
"to be reading from\n"
" a card, and after a while you doze off.]"
msgstr ""
"Salutations, je m'appelle Willy et je veux te proposer un marché. [On dirait "
"qu'il lit une carte, et après un moment, tu t'endors.]"

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:104
msgid "Zzzzzzz..."
msgstr "<Zzzzzzz...>"

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:105
msgid ""
"[You groggily open your eyes as you finally notice that someone is kicking "
"you.] Well, are you\n"
" interested or not?"
msgstr ""
"[Groggy, tu ouvres les yeux, et tu t'aperçois que quelqu'un te donne des "
"coups.] Alors, ça t'intéresse ou pas ?"

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:106
msgid "Interested in what?"
msgstr "C'est quoi qui devrait m'intéresser ?"

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:107 dialog/wsterm3c.msg:108
msgid "Erg?"
msgstr "Argh ?"

#: dialog/ectrader.msg:108
msgid ""
"Why, it slices it dices and it'll also come in handy against pesky critters. "
"A bargain at any\n"
" price, but for you it's on special for only "
msgstr ""
"Ca coupe en tranches, ça coupe en dés et c'est aussi très pratique contre "
"ces sales petites bestioles. Une affaire, quel que soit le prix. Et pour "
"toi, c'est seulement $"

