#: dialog/fselcomp.msg:200
msgid ""
"[The Hubologist Church appears to be hugely wealthy. The standard approach "
"is to ask a new recruit to donate all\n"
" his or her worldly possessions to the Church as a sign of good faith. When "
"someone isn't asked to do this, apparently\n"
" it means the Hubologists aren't intending to deal fairly. They have a huge "
"cache of loot stashed somewhere in the desert.\n"
" After a bit hacking and mathematical calculations, you determine the "
"coordinates of the stash. You mark them down in your Pip-Boy.]"
msgstr ""
"[L'Eglise d'Hubol semble incroyablement riche. L'approche standard consiste "
"à demander aux nouvelles recrues de faire don à l'Eglise de tous leurs biens "
"terrestres en témoignage de leur bonne foi. Lorsque les Hubologistes ne le "
"demandent pas, ce n'est pas bon signe. Ils ont caché un butin colossal "
"quelque part dans le désert. Après quelques piratages et de complexes "
"calculs mathématiques, tu réussis à déterminer les coordonnées de son "
"emplacement. Tu les notes dans ton Pip-Boy.]"

#: dialog/fselcomp.msg:201
msgid ""
"[The Hubologist Church appears to be hugely wealthy. The standard approach "
"is to ask a new recruit to donate all\n"
" his or her worldly possessions to the Church as a sign of good faith. When "
"someone isn't asked to do this, apparently\n"
" it means the Hubologists aren't intending to deal fairly. They have a huge "
