msgid "Nothing today, thanks."
msgstr "Rien pour aujourd'hui, merci."

#: dialog/ncbarten.msg:250
msgid ""
"Oh, you mean old man McGee? He's mostly harmless. Spent near a fortune on\n"
" that old slot machine and hasn't seen a return in years. I think it's "
"busted. \n"
" Anyways... can I get you something, friend?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, tu veux parler du vieux McGee ? Il est pas méchant. Il a dépensé une "
"fortune dans cette vieille machine à sous et n'en tire rien depuis des "
"années. Peu importe... Qu'est-ce que je t'offre ?"

#: dialog/ncbarten.msg:260
msgid ""
"That's Jesus' little boy, Lil' Jesus. Him and that knife are like close\n"
" friends... I've seen him do some wicked things with it. Anyways, can I get\n"
" you something, friend?"
msgstr ""
"C'est le gamin de Jésus, le P'tit Jésus. Il ne se sépare jamais de son "
"couteau... Je l'ai déjà vu s'en servir pour des trucs pas catholiques. Peu "
"importe, qu'est-ce que j't'offre ?"

#: dialog/ncbarten.msg:270
msgid "Pleasure doin' business with ya."
msgstr "C'est un plaisir de faire des affaires avec toi."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:100
msgid "You see Big Jesus Mordino."
msgstr "Tu vois Big Jésus Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:150
msgid ""
"You see a fat man with beady black eyes. He is covered in sweat and "
"breathing heavily."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un homme gras aux yeux noirs perçants. Il est en sueur et respire "
"bruyamment."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:151
msgid ""
"You see Big Jesus Mordino. He is covered in sweat and is breathing heavily."
msgstr "Tu vois Big Jésus Mordino. Il est en sueur et respire bruyamment."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:201
msgid "That does not... belong to you."
msgstr "Ceci ne... t'appartient pas."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:202
msgid "Touch that again, and you shall... die on Golgotha."
msgstr "Touche ça encore une fois et tu... mourras à Golgotha."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:210 dialog/ncsalvat.msg:201
msgid "::Wheeze::"
msgstr "::Respiration bruyante::"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:212
msgid "::Wipes sweat from forehead.::"
msgstr "::Il essuie la sueur qui perle sur son front::"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:220
msgid "You are the... *cough*... most valued of my men."
msgstr "Tu es le... [Tousse...] plus précieux de mes hommes."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:221
msgid "Are the people of Reno showing you... *cough*... proper respect?"
msgstr ""
"Les gens de Reno se montrent-ils bien... [Tousse...] respectueux à ton égard "
"?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:230
msgid "Urgggg..."
msgstr "<Aaaaaaa...>"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:231
msgid "...Dios mio..."
msgstr "... Dios mio..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:232
msgid "...my heart..."
msgstr "... mon coeur..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:233
msgid "hurrkkkk"
msgstr "<Harrkkkk>"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:240
msgid ""
"(The man turns to face you. He looks sick with fever: Sweat trickles down "
"his face and stains his clothes. "
msgstr ""
"[L'homme se retourne. Il a l'air fiévreux : la sueur dégouline le long de "
"son visage et tache ses vêtements.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:241
msgid ""
"He's ignoring you and staring at Myron; it looks like he's waiting for Myron "
"to speak.)"
msgstr "[Il t'ignore et fixe Myron, on dirait qu'il attend que Myron parle.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:242
msgid "He's staring at you; it looks like he's waiting for you to speak.)"
msgstr "[Il te fixe, on dirait qu'il attend que tu parles.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:243
msgid "[Stare back at him with your meanest stare.]"
msgstr "Tu le fixes de ton regard le plus méchant."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:244
msgid "[Stare back at him with mild disinterest.]"
msgstr "Tu le fixes avec un léger désintérêt."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:245
msgid "[Stare back at him with a sneering gaze.]"
msgstr "Tu le fixes d'un regard méprisant."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:246
msgid "[Stare back at him with affected disinterest.]"
msgstr "Tu le fixes avec un désintérêt affecté."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:247 dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:381 dialog/ncsalvat.msg:234
#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:246 dialog/ncwriply.msg:356
msgid "[Wander off.]"
msgstr "[Partir]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:249
msgid "Are you Jesus Mordino?"
msgstr "Es-tu Jésus Mordino ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:250
msgid "Sorry. I've entered the wrong room."
msgstr "Je m'excuse. J'ai dû me tromper de pièce."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:260
msgid ""
"You. (Mordino glares at Myron as he enters, black lightning flashing in his "
"eyes.) You have... left your post. Your USE\n"
" to me is at an... end. (He makes a motion, and his guards reach for their "
"weapons.)"
msgstr ""
"Toi ! [A l'arrivée de Myron, Mordino foudroie celui-ci du regard.] Tu as... "
"quitté ton poste. Tu ne me SERS plus à... rien. [Il fait un geste et ses "
"gardes se saisissent de leurs armes.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:261
msgid ""
"(The man's gaze darkens. He makes a motion, and his guards reach for their "
"weapons.)"
msgstr ""
"[Le regard de l'homme s'assombrit, il fait un geste et ses gardes se "
"saisissent de leurs armes.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:262
msgid ""
"(Big Jesus's gaze turns black. He makes a motion, and his guards reach for "
"their weapons.)"
msgstr ""
"[Le regard de Big Jésus s'assombrit, il fait un geste et ses gardes se "
"saisissent de leurs armes.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:263
msgid "Aieeeeeeee!"
msgstr "Aïeeeeeeee !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:264
msgid "Play along!"
msgstr "Prends ça !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:266
msgid "Whoa! Whoa...!"
msgstr "Ouah ! Ouah... !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:267
msgid "Hey! Hold on a second...!"
msgstr "Hé ! Attends une seconde... !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:268
msgid "You want some of THIS, *Fatman?!* You WANT SOME of "
msgstr "Tu veux un peu de CA, *Gros tas* ?!! Tu VEUX UN PEU de --"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:275
msgid ""
"(The man speaks in a rasping voice.) I... am Jesus Mordino. You... will "
"address me as SENOR Mordino. (A bead of sweat trickles\n"
" down his forehead.) What... is your business with me?"
msgstr ""
"[L'homme parle avec une voix râpeuse :] Je... suis Jésus Mordino. Tu... "
"m'appelleras *Señor* Mordino. [Une perle de sueur dégouline sur son front.] "
"Que me... veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:276
msgid ""
"You have... returned. (A bead of sweat trickles down his forehead.) What... "
"is your business with me?"
msgstr ""
"Tu es... de retour. [Une perle de sueur dégouline sur son front.] Que me... "
"veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:277 dialog/scfelix.msg:108 dialog/scmerk.msg:129
#: dialog/scmira.msg:111 dialog/scvortis.msg:110
msgid "I'm looking for work."
msgstr "Je cherche du travail."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:278
msgid "I spoke to your son, Senor Mordino. I'm looking for work."
msgstr "J'ai parlé à votre fils, Señor Mordino. Je cherche du travail."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:279
msgid ""
"I spoke to your son, Senor Mordino. I'm a slaver, and I'm looking to sell "
"slaves."
msgstr ""
"J'ai parlé à votre fils, Señor Mordino. Je suis esclavagiste et je cherche à "
"vendre des esclaves."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:280
msgid "You know anything about Mr. Wright's son's death?"
msgstr "Tu sais quelque chose au sujet de la mort du fils de M. Wright ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:281
msgid "Is the heat bothering you? You seem... uncomfortable."
msgstr "Souffres-tu de la chaleur ? Tu n'as pas l'air... à l'aise."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:282
msgid "No business today. I have to go now."
msgstr "Rien pour aujourd'hui. Je dois y aller."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:290
msgid ""
"(Studies you for a long time, then shakes his head.) You... do not look "
"STRONG enough. I have no work for you."
msgstr ""
"[Il t'étudie un long moment, puis fait non de la tête.] On... dirait que tu "
"n'as pas la marque de la FORCE. Je n'ai pas de travail pour toi."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:291
msgid ""
"(Studies you for a long time, then shakes his head.) You... are a WOMAN. "
"What I need done is not woman's work."
msgstr ""
"[Il t'étudie un long moment, puis fait non de la tête.] Tu... es une FEMME. "
"Le travail que je propose n'est pas fait pour les femmes."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:292
msgid "Give me a chance. Give me a job -- any job -- I can do it."
msgstr ""
"Donne-moi une chance. Donne-moi du travail, n'importe lequel. J'en suis "
"capable."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:293
msgid "Give me a chance, Senor Mordino. Give me a job, any job, I can do it."
msgstr ""
"Donne-moi une chance, Señor Mordino. Donne-moi du travail, n'importe lequel. "
"Je peux le faire."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:294
msgid "Let me prove myself. I can do it."
msgstr "Laisse-moi faire mes preuves. Je peux le faire."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:295
msgid "Let me prove myself, Senor Mordino. I can do it."
msgstr "Laisse-moi faire mes preuves, Señor Mordino. Je peux le faire."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:296
msgid "All right then. Catch you later."
msgstr "Très bien. A plus tard."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:305
msgid ""
"(Sweat trickles down Mordino's face. His expression darkens.) I have... "
"spoken. I have NO work for you. Leave... and do NOT return."
msgstr ""
"[Le visage de Mordino dégouline de sueur, son expression s'assombrit.] "
"J'ai... dit mon dernier mot. Je n'ai PAS de travail pour toi. Pars... et ne "
"reviens PAS."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:306
msgid "C'mon, Big Jesus... just one chance..."
msgstr "Allez, Big Jésus... Donne-moi juste une chance..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:307 dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:458
msgid "All right then. Goodbye."
msgstr "D'accord. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:315
msgid ""
"(Mordino is silent for a moment, then he speaks.) I am Jesus Mordino. Head "
"of the Mordino family. You have come\n"
" to... my casino. My home. You have shown me... no respect. You will LEARN."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino reste silencieux un moment avant de parler.] Je suis Jésus Mordino. "
"Chef de la famille Mordino. Tu viens dans... mon casino. Ma maison. Tu ne me "
"témoignes... aucun respect. Je vais t'APPRENDRE !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:316
msgid "I think it's YOU who's going to learn a thing or two..."
msgstr "C'est TOI qui vas apprendre quelques petites choses..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:317
msgid "Whoa! Hold on... let's talk about this! C'mon, now..."
msgstr "Houla ! Attends... on va en parler ! Ecoute..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:318
msgid "Make a run for the door."
msgstr "[Tu cours vers la porte]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:319
msgid ""
"::Dive for cover, draw weapons in slow motion as thugs explode from the "
"woodwork.::"
msgstr ""
"[Des brutes jaillissent soudain, tu plonges pour te mettre à l'abri et "
"dégaines au ralenti]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:325
msgid ""
"(Mordino waits. As you watch, another bead of sweat trickles down the side "
"of his face.)"
msgstr ""
"[Mordino attend. Tu le regardes, et une autre goutte de sueur dégouline le "
"long de son visage.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:326
msgid "I was looking to sell some slaves..."
msgstr "Je voudrais vendre des esclaves..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:327
msgid "What do you know about Richard Wright's death?"
msgstr "Que sais-tu sur la mort de Richard Wright ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:335
msgid ""
"(Studies you.) I... do not know you, but I will... hear you. (Wipes sweat "
"from his forehead.) "
msgstr ""
"[Il t'étudie.] Je... ne te connais pas, mais je vais... t'écouter. [Il "
"essuie la sueur qui coule sur son front.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:336
msgid "You have slaves to sell?"
msgstr "Tu as des esclaves à vendre ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:337
msgid "Yes, right here with me. Take a look and make me an offer."
msgstr "Oui, ici même. Jette un coup d'oeil et fais-moi une offre."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:338
msgid ""
"No, I don't. Actually, I made an error. I'm looking for work, not to sell "
"slaves."
msgstr ""
"Non. J'ai fait une erreur en fait. Je cherche du travail, pas à vendre des "
"esclaves."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:339
msgid "No... actually, I had some questions for you."
msgstr "Non... en fait, j'avais des questions à te poser."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:340
msgid "No, I'm sorry. I just remembered I have to be somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"Non, je regrette. Je viens juste de me souvenir que je dois aller ailleurs."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:345
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies your companions. His gaze stops on Miria, and he licks his "
"lips.) Your puta looks fresh... I will\n"
" give you 250 chips for her."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie tes compagnons. Son regard s'arrête sur Miria et il se "
"pourlèche.] Ta puta a l'air fraîche... Je t'en donne 250 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:346
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies your companions. His gaze stops on Davin.) Though he looks "
"weak, I will take that boy there.\n"
" 200 chips for him."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie tes compagnons. Son regard s'arrête sur Davin.] Bien qu'il "
"ait l'air faible, je vais prendre ce garçon. 200 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:347
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies your companions. His gaze stops on Sulik... and he wrinkles "
"his nose.) The tribal... he stinks, but he\n"
" looks strong. I will take him for 100 chips."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie tes compagnons. Son regard s'arrête sur Sulik... Il fronce "
"le nez.] Le tribal... Il pue, mais il a l'air fort. Je le prends pour 200 "
"jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:348
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies your companions. His gaze stops on Vic.) I will take the "
"old man... he looks like he has a few years\n"
" of work left in him. I will take him for 100 chips."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie tes compagnons. Son regard s'arrête sur Vic.] Je prends le "
"vieil homme... On doit encore pouvoir en tirer quelques bonnes années de "
"travail. 100 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:349
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies your companions. His gaze stops on Cassidy.) I will take "
"the old man... he looks like he has a\n"
" few years of work left in him. I will take him for 100 chips."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie tes compagnons. Son regard s'arrête sur Cassidy.] Je prends "
"le vieil homme... on doit encore pouvoir en tirer quelques bonnes années de "
"travail. 100 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:350
msgid ""
"(Mordino's gaze immediately stops on the Robobrain.) That machine there. I "
"will give you 500 chips for him."
msgstr ""
"[Le regard de Mordino s'arrête immédiatement sur le Robo-cerveau.] Cette "
"machine, là. Je t'en donne 500 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:351
msgid ""
"(Mordino's gaze immediately stops on the cyberdog.) I will buy that... "
"machine dog from you. I will give you 500\n"
" chips for him."
msgstr ""
"[Le regard de Mordino s'arrête immédiatement sur le cyberchien.] Je t'achète "
"ce... cyberchien. Je t'en donne 500 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:352
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies your companions, then shakes his head.) You have nothing I "
"want."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie tes compagnons et fait non de la tête.] Tu n'as rien pour "
"moi."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:353
msgid ""
"Senor Mordino, please... the slave is worth MUCH more than that. It has many "
"years of faithful service remaining."
msgstr ""
"Señor Mordino, je t'en prie... l'esclave vaut BEAUCOUP plus. Il lui reste "
"encore de longues années de fidèle service."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:354
msgid "That is a fair price. You may have the slave."
msgstr "C'est un bon prix. Tu peux avoir l'esclave."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:355 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:239 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:255
msgid ""
"Actually, I'm not looking to sell that one just yet. I did have some "
"questions I wanted to ask you..."
msgstr ""
"En fait, je ne veux pas vendre celui-ci pour l'instant. Il y a une ou deux "
"questions que je voulais te poser..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:356 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:240 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:256
msgid "Actually, I'm not looking to sell that slave. Let's deal another time."
msgstr ""
"En fait, je ne cherche pas à vendre cet esclave. On fera affaire une autre "
"fois."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:357 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:241
msgid "Very well. I had some questions for you, though..."
msgstr "Très bien. Mais j'avais encore une ou deux questions à te poser..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:358 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:242
msgid "All right. Some other time when I get better stock, then."
msgstr "Très bien. Alors, une autre fois, quand j'aurai un meilleur stock."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:370
msgid ""
"No. She has seen much hard travel and looks tired... 250 chips for her or "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"Non. Elle a fait des voyages éprouvants et a l'air fatiguée... C'est 250 "
"jetons ou rien."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:371
msgid "The boy looks soft and weak. I'll not give more than 200 chips for him."
msgstr ""
"Ce garçon a l'air mou et faible. Je ne t'en donnerai pas plus de 200 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:372
msgid ""
"No. The tribal smells and looks to be... difficult. It will be hard to break "
"him in. 100 chips."
msgstr ""
"Non. Le tribal sent fort et a l'air d'être... difficile. Ca va être dur de "
"le dresser. 200 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:373
msgid "The man is old. I will take him for 100 chips."
msgstr "Cet homme est vieux. Je le prends pour 100 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:375
msgid "No. 500 chips."
msgstr "Non. 500 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:377
msgid ""
"Senor Mordino, please... you are in danger of insulting me. This is prime "
"stock, it is worth much more than that."
msgstr ""
"Señor Mordino, je t'en prie... Tu risques de me faire un affront. C'est du "
"premier choix, ça vaut beaucoup plus."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:390
msgid ""
"(Mordino walks around Miria, examines her face carefully, then slaps her "
"ass.) Hmmmm. 500 chips for her, then."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino tourne autour de Miria, examine son visage avec attention puis lui "
"met la main aux fesses.] Mmmmm... 500 jetons pour elle."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:391
msgid ""
"(Mordino walks around Davin, rolls up the boy's sleeve and examines his "
"muscles, then checks his eyes for drug use.)\n"
" Hmmmm. He looks strong enough. 400 chips for him, then."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino tourne autour de Davin, remonte les manches du garçon et examine "
"ses muscles, puis vérifie qu'il n'utilise pas de stimulants en observant ses "
"yeux.] Mmmmm. Il a l'air assez fort. 400 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:392
msgid ""
"(Mordino walks around Sulik, frowning.) Hmmmm. He looks strong... and "
"tolerant of pain, to stick a bone in his\n"
" nose so far. 200 chips for him."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino tourne autour de Sulik en fronçant les sourcils.] Mmmm... Il a "
"l'air fort... et capable de supporter la douleur, vu l'os qu'il s'est "
"enfoncé dans le nez. 200 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:393
msgid ""
"(Mordino walks around Vic, frowning.) Hmmmmm. I will take him for 200 chips. "
"No more."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino tourne autour de Vic en fronçant les sourcils.] Hum. Je le prends "
"pour 200 jetons. Pas plus."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:394
msgid ""
"(Mordino walks around Cassidy, frowning.) Hmmmmm. I will take him for 200 "
"chips. No more."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino tourne autour de Cassidy en fronçant les sourcils.] Hum. Je le "
"prends pour 200 jetons. Pas plus."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:395
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies the Robobrain for a few minutes.) A thousand chips, then."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie le Robo-cerveau pendant quelques minutes.] Un millier de "
"jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:396
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies the cyberdog for a few minutes.) A thousand chips, then."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino étudie le cyberchien pendant quelques minutes.] Un millier de "
"jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:410
msgid "(Mordino has Miria led away while counting your money.) Here."
msgstr "[Mordino fait emmener Miria pendant qu'il compte ton argent.] Voilà."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:411
msgid "(Mordino has Davin led away while counting your money.) Here."
msgstr "[Mordino fait emmener Davin pendant qu'il compte ton argent.] Voilà."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:412
msgid "(Mordino has Sulik led away while counting your money.) Here."
msgstr "[Mordino fait emmener Sulik pendant qu'il compte ton argent.] Voilà."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:413
msgid "(Mordino has Vic led away while counting your money.) Here."
msgstr "[Mordino fait emmener Vic pendant qu'il compte ton argent.] Voilà."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:414
msgid "(Mordino has Cassidy led away while counting your money.) Here."
msgstr "[Mordino fait emmener Cassidy pendant qu'il compte ton argent.] Voilà."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:415
msgid "(Mordino has Robobrain led away while counting your money.) Here."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino fait emmener le Robo-cerveau pendant qu'il compte ton argent.] "
"Voilà."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:416
msgid "(Mordino has the cyberdog led away while counting your money.) Here."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino fait emmener le cyberchien pendant qu'il compte ton argent.] Voilà."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:417
msgid "Would you like to see what else I have in stock?"
msgstr "Veux-tu voir ce que j'ai d'autre en stock ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:418
msgid ""
"Thank you, Senor Mordino. By the way, I had some questions I wanted to ask "
"you..."
msgstr "Merci, Señor Mordino. A propos, j'avais des questions à te poser..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:419
msgid "Thank you, Senor Mordino. I hope the slave serves you well. Goodbye."
msgstr ""
"Merci, Señor Mordino. J'espère que l'esclave te servira bien. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:430
msgid ""
"(Sweat trickles down Mordino's face. His expression darkens.) You are a dog, "
"and a SON of a dog. I will not buy\n"
" from the likes of you. Leave... and do NOT return."
msgstr ""
"[Le visage de Mordino dégouline de sueur, son expression s'assombrit.] Tu es "
"un rapace, et un FILS de rapace. Je n'achèterai rien à des gens de ton "
"espèce. Pars... et ne reviens PAS."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:431
msgid "Senor Mordino, please... reconsider..."
msgstr "Señor Mordino, je t'en prie... Penses-y..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:432 dialog/ncmason.msg:270
msgid "(Leave quietly.)"
msgstr "[Tu pars tranquillement]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:440
msgid ""
"(Mordino studies you.) Very well. I... have work for you. Take... (Takes a "
"deep wheezing breath, wipes sweat from his forehead.)\n"
" ...this package... to the *stables* north of Reno. Give it to a man... "
"Ramirez, then return."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino t'étudie.] Très bien. J'ai... du travail pour toi. Porte... [Il "
"prend une profonde et bruyante inspiration et essuie la sueur de son front.] "
"... ce paquet... aux *Etables* au Nord de Reno. Donne-le à un homme... "
"Ramirez, et reviens."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:441
msgid "Okay. Sounds easy enough."
msgstr "Ok. Ca a l'air assez simple."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:442
msgid "I will go there now, Senor Mordino."
msgstr "J'y vais de ce pas, Señor Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:443
msgid "What's in the package?"
msgstr "Que contient ce paquet ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:444
msgid "Uh, I've changed my mind. I think I'll pass."
msgstr "Heu, j'ai changé d'avis. Je pense que je vais y aller."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:450
msgid "I... do not pay you... to ask questions."
msgstr "Je... ne te paie pas... pour poser des questions."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:451
msgid ""
"Well, I'd like to know what I'm carrying before I drop it off. Is it "
"dangerous?"
msgstr ""
"Je voudrais savoir ce que je transporte avant de déposer le paquet. C'est "
"dangereux ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:452
msgid "Nevermind then. I'm off."
msgstr "Ca ne fait rien. J'y vais."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:460
msgid ""
"Head north up Virgin street, past the casinos... follow the trail that leads "
"outside of town. You will... come to the\n"
" Stables. Now go."
msgstr ""
"Suis la rue de la Vierge vers le Nord, après les casinos... prends le chemin "
"qui mène hors de la ville. Tu arriveras... aux Etables. Vas-y maintenant."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:461
msgid "(Follow his directions...)"
msgstr "[Tu suis ses explications]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:470
msgid "Have... you done as I asked?"
msgstr "As-tu fait ce que j'ai demandé ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:471
msgid "No, I haven't delivered the package yet."
msgstr "Non, je n'ai pas encore livré le paquet."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:472
msgid "Yes, I delivered it to Ramirez as you asked."
msgstr "Oui, je l'ai livré à Ramirez comme tu l'as demandé."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:473
msgid ""
"Yes, I've been to the Stables and dropped off your package... do you know "
"what they DO there? They're torturing\n"
" slaves with drugs."
msgstr ""
"Oui, j'ai été aux Etables et j'ai déposé ton paquet... Tu sais ce qu'ils "
"FONT là-bas ? Ils torturent des esclaves avec des stimulants !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:474
msgid ""
"Yes, I gave your package to that guard, Ramirez... you know that guy's a "
"jethead? He was REEKING of Jet fumes."
msgstr ""
"Oui, j'ai donné ton paquet à ce garde, Ramirez... Tu sais que ce type "
"s'éclate au Jet ? Il PUAIT le Jet à cent mètres !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:480
msgid ""
"Then... why are you here? (Big Jesus wipes his forehead, then takes a deep "
"breath.) WHY did you not deliver the package?"
msgstr ""
"Et... que fais-tu là ? [Big Jésus s'essuie le front et prend une profonde "
"inspiration.] POURQUOI t'as pas livré le paquet ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:481
msgid "Well, I had some questions first..."
msgstr "Eh bien, je voulais d'abord te poser des questions..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:482
msgid "I'm going to go do it right now."
msgstr "Je vais le faire tout de suite."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:483
msgid "Uh, you know what? I think I'll take care of it right now..."
msgstr "Heu, tu sais quoi ? Je crois que je vais m'en occuper tout de suite..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:490
msgid ""
"(Nods.) Very well. Here is... your payment. A hundred... chips. For a... "
"simple delivery... it is\n"
" more than enough."
msgstr ""
"[Il hoche la tête.] Très bien. Voilà... ton paiement. Cent... jetons. Pour "
"une... simple livraison... c'est plus qu'il n'en faut."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:491
msgid "It's better than nothing, I guess."
msgstr "C'est mieux que rien, je suppose."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:492
msgid "Thank you, Senor Mordino."
msgstr "Merci, Señor Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:500
msgid ""
"(Squints angrily. A bead of sweat trickles down the side of his face.) They "
"are... cattle. No more."
msgstr ""
"[Il jette un coup d'oeil énervé. Une perle de sueur dégouline le long de son "
"visage.] C'est... du bétail. C'est tout."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:501
msgid "You monster... you just signed your own death warrant."
msgstr "Espèce de monstre... tu viens de signer ton arrêt de mort !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:502
msgid "Uh... just checking. About my payment..."
msgstr "Heu... je veux juste vérifier. Mon paiement..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:510
msgid ""
"I have no more... work for you. (Nods at the door.) I wish to be alone. "
"Leave now... and do NOT return."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai plus... de travail pour toi. [Il te montre la porte.] Je voudrais "
"être seul. Laisse-moi... et ne reviens PAS."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:511
msgid "Aw, c'mon. There must be SOME other job that I could do..."
msgstr ""
"Oh, arrête. Il DOIT bien y avoir un autre travail que je pourrais faire..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:520
msgid ""
"I... have more work for you. I need someone... (He takes a deep wheezing "
"breath, then wipes sweat from his forehead.) ... to collect\n"
" my percentage from the... Corsican Brothers. They are LATE in their "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"J'ai... encore du travail pour toi. J'ai besoin de quelqu'un... [Il prend "
"une profonde et bruyante inspiration puis essuie la sueur de son front.] ... "
"pour récupérer mon pourcentage auprès des... Frères Corses. Leurs paiements "
"sont EN RETARD."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:523
msgid "I think I'll pass. Thanks anyway."
msgstr "Je crois que je vais y aller. Merci quand même."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:530
msgid ""
"Head north up Virgin street. They are across from the gym... if they give "
"you trouble... if they make excuses... HURT them."
msgstr ""
"Prends la rue de la Vierge vers le Nord. Ils sont en face du gymnase... "
"S'ils font des problèmes... S'ils cherchent des excuses... Tu leur fais MAL."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:531
msgid "Okay. I'm on it."
msgstr "Ok. J'y vais."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:532
msgid "Very well, Senor Mordino."
msgstr "Très bien, Señor Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:540
msgid ""
"I said you could... HURT the Corsican Brothers. I did not give you "
"permission to... KILL them."
msgstr ""
"J'ai dit que tu pouvais faire... MAL aux Frères Corses. Je ne t'ai pas donné "
"la permission de... les TUER !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:541
msgid "Hey, look... they started throwing down, and I just defended myself..."
msgstr ""
"Hé, écoute... Ils ont commencé à m'attaquer, et je n'ai fait que me "
"défendre..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:542
msgid ""
"They were saying bad things about your mother, Big Jesus. I HAD to kill them."
msgstr ""
"Ils disaient des choses pas bien sur ta mère, Big Jésus. Il FALLAIT que je "
"les tue !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:543
msgid "Oh. Guess I misheard."
msgstr "Oh. J'ai dû mal comprendre."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:551
msgid ""
"Uh... yes, but I don't have the money on me. Just give me some time, and "
"I'll return it to you."
msgstr ""
"Heu... Oui, mais je n'ai pas l'argent. Donne-moi juste un peu de temps, et "
"je te le ramènerai."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:552
msgid "Yes, here is the money."
msgstr "Oui, voilà ton argent."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:554
msgid "No, uh, I'll go take care of it now."
msgstr "Non, heu, je vais m'en occuper maintenant."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:560
msgid ""
"Then... why are you here? (He wipes his forehead, then takes a deep breath.) "
"WHY do you not have the money?"
msgstr ""
"Dans ce cas... que fais-tu là ? [Il s'essuie le front et inspire "
"profondément.] POURQUOI n'as-tu pas l'argent ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:561
msgid "Well, you see, I had some questions first..."
msgstr "Eh bien, en fait, j'avais d'abord des questions à te poser..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:562
msgid "Good question. I'm going to go do it right now."
msgstr "Bonne question. Je vais aller le faire tout de suite."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:570
msgid ""
"(Nods as you give him the money.) Here. Half... is yours. Heh. They had "
"already paid me this month, but I like\n"
" to keep them... on their toes."
msgstr ""
"[Il hoche la tête tandis que tu lui donnes l'argent.] Tiens. La moitié... "
"est à toi. Hé. Ils m'avaient déjà payé ce mois-ci, mais j'aime qu'ils "
"restent... en alerte."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:571
msgid "Hey, thanks, Big Jesus."
msgstr "Hé, merci, Big Jésus."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:580
msgid ""
"(Senor Mordino looks at you for a long time, then nods slightly.) I have one "
"last job for you. There... (Takes\n"
" a deep wheezing breath, wipes sweat from his forehead.)... is a MAN who "
"must die."
msgstr ""
"[Señor Mordino te regarde un long moment puis hoche doucement la tête.] J'ai "
"un dernier travail pour toi. Un... [Il prend une profonde et bruyante "
"inspiration, essuie la sueur de son front.] ... homme doit mourir."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:581
msgid "He's as good as dead. The corpse got a name?"
msgstr "C'est comme s'il était déjà mort. Le cadavre a un nom ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:582
msgid "Who is this man?"
msgstr "Qui est cet homme ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:583
msgid "Who is this man you wish dead, Senor Mordino?"
msgstr "Qui est l'homme que tu souhaites voir mort, Señor Mordino ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:584
msgid "Whoa, nobody say anything about murder. Forget it."
msgstr "Houla, personne ne m'avait parlé de meurtre. Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:585
msgid "I cannot take this job, Senor Mordino, I'm sorry. Goodbye."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas accepter, Señor Mordino, je regrette. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:595
msgid ""
"You come to me for work. I give you... work and you complain like a CHILD. ("
"Takes a deep, rasping breath, then coughs.)\n"
" You... are no longer welcome here... in my casino. Leave."
msgstr ""
"Tu viens me demander du travail. Je t'en donne... et tu te plains comme un "
"GOSSE. [Il prend une profonde inspiration haletante puis il tousse.] Tu... "
"n'as plus rien à faire... dans mon casino. Va-t'en."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:596
msgid ""
"You come to me for work. You refuse my... offer. (Takes a deep, rasping "
"breath, then coughs.)\n"
" You... are no longer welcome here... in my casino. Leave."
msgstr ""
"Tu viens me demander du travail. Tu refuses mon... offre. [Il prend une "
"profonde inspiration haletante puis il tousse.] Tu... n'as plus rien à "
"faire... dans mon casino. Va-t'en."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:597
msgid "Before I go, I had some questions I wanted to ask you..."
msgstr "Avant de partir, j'ai quelques questions à te poser..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:598
msgid "I'm not done TALKING to you yet, \"Big Jesus.\""
msgstr "Je n'ai pas fini de te PARLER, « Big Jésus »."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:599
msgid "My apologies, Senor Mordino. I will leave at once."
msgstr "Toutes mes excuses, Señor Mordino. Je pars tout de suite."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:600
msgid "Why don't you MAKE me leave?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tu ne me FAIS pas partir ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:610
msgid ""
"This man, Louis Salvatore... he has killed many of my men... many PROUD men "
"of the Mordino family. He... butchered them\n"
" in the street like... dogs. (His hand clenches into a fist.) It is my will "
"that this man die."
msgstr ""
"Cet homme, Louis Salvatore... Il a tué nombre de mes hommes... Des hommes "
"FIERS de la famille Mordino. Il... Il les a massacrés dans la rue comme "
"des... chiens. [Il serre le poing.] Je veux voir cet homme mort !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:611
msgid "If you got the chips, he's good as dead."
msgstr "Si t'as les jetons pour payer, alors il est déjà mort."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:612
msgid ""
"Wait a minute. Louis Salvatore who rules the Salvatore family? The ones that "
"have the lightbringers that\n"
" can slice men in half?"
msgstr ""
"Attends une minute. Louis Salvatore de la famille Salvatore ? Ceux qui "
"possèdent ces pisto-lasers qui tranchent les hommes en deux ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:613
msgid ""
"I will see the Mordino family avenged, Senor Mordino. I will return when I "
"have completed the task."
msgstr ""
"Je veillerai à la vengeance de ta famille, Señor Mordino. Je reviendrai "
"quand ma tâche sera accomplie."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:614
msgid "I can't accept this assignment. I'm leaving."
msgstr "Je ne peux accepter cette mission. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:615
msgid "All right then. I'll do it."
msgstr "Très bien. Je vais le faire."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:620
msgid "I shall pay you... when Salvatore breathes no more."
msgstr "Je te paierai... quand Salvatore ne respirera plus."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:621
msgid ""
"Wait a minute. Louis Salvatore who rules the Salvatore family? The ones that "
"have the lightbringers that can\n"
" cut men in half?"
msgstr ""
"Attends une minute. Louis Salvatore de la famille Salvatore ? Ceux qui "
"possèdent ces pisto-lasers qui coupent les hommes en deux ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:623
msgid "I don't stick my neck out for nothing. I'm outta here."
msgstr "Je passe pas la tête dehors pour rien. Je me casse."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:630
msgid ""
"(Mordino nods, studies your expression.) Does that... make you afraid? If "
"so, leave. (Points at door.) The Mordino\n"
" family has no use for... cowards."
msgstr ""
"[Mordino hoche la tête, étudie ton expression.] Ca te fait peur ? Si oui, va-"
"t'en. [Il te montre la porte.] La famille Mordino n'a pas besoin de... "
"lâches."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:631
msgid "No, I'll do it."
msgstr "Non, je vais le faire."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:633
msgid "Call me a coward, but I like breathing. I'll pass on this job."
msgstr ""
"Très bien, je m'en vais. Tu peux me traiter de lâche, mais j'aime bien "
"respirer."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:640
msgid ""
"(Nods.) That is good. The man is old... a cripple... he hides in his bar, "
"\"Salvatore's,\" near the Bishop Casino.\n"
" He is a... coward and never leaves his room upstairs. When he is... dead, "
"return."
msgstr ""
"[Il hoche la tête.] C'est bien. Il est vieux... et paralysé... Il se cache "
"dans son bar, « Chez Salvatore », à côté du Casino Bishop. C'est un lâche "
"qui ne quitte jamais sa chambre. Reviens quand il sera... mort."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:641
msgid "Cripple?"
msgstr "Paralysé ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:650
msgid ""
"(Nods.) The butcher's legs... are weak. (Jesus wipes his forehead, then "
"draws another weak breath.)\n"
" He also has... difficulty... breathing. He takes air through an... oxygen "
"tank."
msgstr ""
"[Il hoche la tête.] Les jambes de ce boucher... sont faibles. [Jésus "
"s'essuie le front puis inspire poussivement.] Il a aussi... du mal... à "
"respirer. Il utilise un... ballon d'oxygène."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:651
msgid "Oxygen tank, huh? Hmmmm. All right."
msgstr "Un ballon d'oxygène, hein ? Hum. D'accord."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:652
msgid "I'll be back when he is dead, Senor Mordino."
msgstr "Je reviendrai quand il sera mort, Señor Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:660
msgid "Louis Salvatore lives. Why have you returned?"
msgstr "Louis Salvatore est vivant. Pourquoi reviens-tu ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:661
msgid ""
"(A bead of sweat trickles down the side of Mordino's face.) You have done as "
"I asked? Louis Salvatore is dead?"
msgstr ""
"[Une perle de sueur dégouline le long du visage de Mordino.] Tu as fait ce "
"que je t'ai demandé ? Louis Salvatore est-il mort ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:662
msgid "He is dead. Your family is avenged, Senor Mordino."
msgstr "Il est mort. Ta famille est vengée, Señor Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:663
msgid "No, I shall return when I have killed him."
msgstr "Non, je reviendrai quand je l'aurai tué."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:664
msgid "Salvatore's too well-guarded. I'm going to have to cancel on this job."
msgstr ""
"Salvatore est trop bien protégé. Je vais devoir renoncer à cette mission."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:670
msgid "If you... run from this job, I will have you... KILLED."
msgstr "Si tu... ne termines pas ce travail, je te ferai... TUER !"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:671
msgid "Since you put it that way, I shall return when he's dead."
msgstr "Si tu le prends comme ça, je reviendrai quand il sera mort."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:672
msgid ""
"Try anything, and you'll be joining the Mordinos that the Salvatores "
"butchered."
msgstr "Touche-moi, et tu rejoindras les Mordino massacrés par les Salvatore."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:680
msgid ""
"So I have heard. (Nods respectfully.) You have done... well. My faith in you "
"is not misplaced. Here is... your\n"
" payment. Five hundred... chips. "
msgstr ""
"J'ai bien entendu. [Il hoche respectueusement la tête.] Tu as... réussi. Je "
"ne suis pas déçu de t'avoir fait confiance. Voici... ton paiement. Cinq "
"cent... jetons."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:682
msgid "That'll do... for now."
msgstr "Ca suffira... pour l'instant."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:683
msgid "And... armor and a weapon you may find... useful."
msgstr "Et... une armure et une arme qui pourraient t'être... utiles."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:690
msgid ""
"(Nods.) Your success... pleases me. I would welcome you into the Family "
"Mordino. (Clasps your shoulders.) Will\n"
" you join our family? Your strength shall be... our strength."
msgstr ""
"[Il hoche la tête.] Ton succès... me réjouit. Bienvenue dans la famille "
"Mordino. [Il te donne une accolade.] Veux-tu appartenir à notre famille ? Ta "
"force sera... nôtre."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:691
msgid "It would please me to become a member of Family Mordino."
msgstr "Ca me ferait plaisir de devenir membre de la famille Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:692
msgid ""
"I can't join the Mordinos. But don't get me wrong, Big Jesus: It was a "
"pleasure working with you."
msgstr ""
"Je ne peux pas. Mais ne le prends pas mal, Big Jésus : c'était un plaisir de "
"travailler pour toi."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:693
msgid "I don't want to join, thanks. I've got a village I have to save first."
msgstr "Non merci. J'ai d'abord un village à sauver."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:700
msgid ""
"(Nods.) I'm sorry that is your choice. As I said, your success pleases me... "
"I would hate for your skills\n"
" to be used by one of my... competitors. (Motions to his guards, who reach "
"for their weapons.)"
msgstr ""
"[Il hoche la tête.] Je regrette ton choix. Comme je l'ai dit, j'apprécie ton "
"succès... Je n'aimerais pas que tes talents soient utilisés par un de mes... "
"concurrents. [Il fait un geste à ses gardes, qui se saisissent de leurs "
"armes.]"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:710
msgid ""
"That is good. Do you have... a name by which you wish to be called? All "
"Mordinos... all Reno... shall\n"
" know this name."
msgstr ""
"C'est bien. Y a-t-il... un nom qui te plairait ? Tous les Mordino... Tout "
"Reno... Tout le monde doit connaître ce nom."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:711
msgid "Yeah, how about..."
msgstr "Ouais, par exemple..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:720
msgid ""
"... that is a good name. (Nods.) The Mordino name has... weight in New Reno. "
"Visit... the Cat's Paw... New Reno Arms... and\n"
" tell them you are of my family... they will treat you well."
msgstr ""
"... C'est un bon nom. [Il hoche la tête.] Le nom de Mordino a... un certain "
"poids à New Reno. Va... au Cat's Paw... à l'Armurerie... et dis-leur que tu "
"es de ma famille... Ils te recevront bien."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:730
msgid ""
"(Stares at you for a long time, then squints in confusion.) Why... do you "
"ask me this? I have... HEARD what happened. (Wipes\n"
" his brow.) The boy took too much Jet and died."
msgstr ""
"[Il te fixe un long moment, l'air confus.] Pourquoi me demandes-tu ça ? "
"J'ai... SU ce qui s'est passé. [Il s'essuie le front.] Le garçon a pris trop "
"de Jet et il est mort."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:731
msgid ""
"That's the problem. The Mordinos are the biggest suppliers of Jet in New "
"Reno. That makes you the ones who will\n"
" take the blame."
msgstr ""
"C'est le problème. Les Mordino sont les plus gros fournisseurs de Jet à New "
"Reno. Vous serez donc considérés comme coupables."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:732
msgid "Do you know where he got the Jet?"
msgstr "Sais-tu où il s'est procuré le Jet ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:733
msgid "All right then. Just asking. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "D'accord. Je ne faisais que demander. J'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:734
msgid "I see. I think I better be going."
msgstr "Je vois. Je crois que je ferais mieux d'y aller."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:740
msgid ""
"(Wheezes, wipes more sweat from his forehead.) If the Wrights had the... "
"SENSE they were born with, they would... know\n"
" we are not the only family with Jet in New Reno. We... do NOT kill children."
msgstr ""
"[Il respire bruyamment, essuie encore la sueur qui coule sur son front.] Si "
"les Wright avaient encore toute leur... INTELLIGENCE, ils... sauraient que "
"nous ne sommes pas la seule famille qui a du Jet à New Reno. Nous... ne "
"tuons PAS les enfants."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:741
msgid ""
"Just adults, huh? I mean, Jet takes a while to kill someone, but it works, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Seulement des adultes, hein ? Le Jet tue lentement, mais ça marche, non ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:742
msgid ""
"Somebody else might, and they might blacken the Mordino name. You know who "
"might have sold Richard the Jet\n"
" that killed him?"
msgstr ""
"Quelqu'un d'autre pourrait, et le nom de Mordino pourrait être sali. Tu sais "
"qui pourrait avoir vendu à Richard le Jet qui l'a tué ?"

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:743 dialog/ncrenesc.msg:463 dialog/nhmyron.msg:873
msgid "I see. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Je vois. Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:744
msgid "Thanks for the information, Senor Mordino. I must be going now."
msgstr "Merci pour ces informations, Señor Mordino. Je dois y aller maintenant."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:750
msgid ""
"(Shakes head.) I... know little of the lives of pushers in Reno. (Takes a "
"raspy breath, coughs slightly.) You... might ask\n"
" my son... in the casino, below."
msgstr ""
"[Il hoche la tête.] Je... ne sais pas grand-chose de la vie des dealers à "
"Reno. [Il prend une respiration haletante, tousse légèrement.] Tu... peux "
"demander à mon fils... au casino, en dessous."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:751
msgid "I will. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "D'accord. Mais dis-moi..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:752
msgid "I will. Thanks, Senor Mordino."
msgstr "Très bien. Merci, Señor Mordino."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:760
msgid ""
"The temperature does not... agree with me. My breathing is... sometimes "
"difficult. In times of stress or other physical\n"
" activity, I tire quickly. Sometimes, I have chest pains."
msgstr ""
"La fièvre ne me... vaut rien de bon. Ma respiration est... quelquefois "
"difficile. En période de stress ou d'autres activités physiques, je me "
"fatigue rapidement. Parfois, j'ai des douleurs dans la poitrine."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:761
msgid ""
"Really? Well, it's good you don't take any methamphetamines or stimulants, "
"then. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""
"Vraiment. C'est une bonne chose que tu ne prennes pas de stimulants, alors. "
"J'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:762
msgid "I see. I better be going now."
msgstr "Je vois. Je ferais mieux d'y aller."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:770
msgid ""
"I do not know you... you come to me... without anyone's word to give your "
"offer... weight. (Wipes his brow, then takes\n"
" a deep, rattling breath.) I have NO work for you."
msgstr ""
"Je ne te connais pas... Tu viens me voir... sans aucune recommandation pour "
"donner... du poids à ton offre. [Il s'essuie le front puis respire "
"profondément et bruyamment.] Je n'ai PAS de travail pour toi."

#: dialog/ncbigjes.msg:771
