#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:469
msgid "You don't need my name. Just let me see him."
msgstr "Tu n'as pas besoin de savoir mon nom. Laisse-moi le voir."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:471
msgid "Forget it. You don't need to check... I'll be going."
msgstr "Laisse tomber. T'as pas besoin de vérifier... Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:475
msgid ""
"(The guard steps away for a moment, opens a panel on one of the walls and "
"whispers something. He waits for a minute, listens, then turns back to you.) "
msgstr ""
"[Le garde s'éloigne un instant, fait coulisser une paroi dans le mur et "
"murmure quelque chose. Il attend une minute, écoute, et se retourne vers "
"toi.]"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:476
msgid "He doesn't know you. Piss off, pal. You're wasting our time."
msgstr "Il ne te connaît pas. Barre-toi, mon gars. Tu perds ton temps."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:477
msgid "He doesn't know you. Piss off, hon. You're wasting our time."
msgstr "Il ne te connaît pas. Va-t'en, ma jolie. Tu perds ton temps."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:478
msgid "Let me see him. Now."
msgstr "Laisse-moi le voir. Maintenant."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:479
msgid "Tell him I have a suitcase for him... from Mr. Moore."
msgstr "Dis-lui que j'ai une sacoche pour lui... de la part de M. Moore."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:480
msgid "Forget it then."
msgstr "Alors, tant pis."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:490
msgid ""
"(The guard steps away for a moment, opens a panel on one of the walls and "
"whispers something.\n"
" He waits for a minute, listens, then turns back to you and shrugs.) He says "
"you can head on up."
msgstr ""
"[Le garde s'éloigne un instant, fait coulisser une paroi dans le mur et "
"murmure quelque chose. Il attend une minute, écoute, et se retourne vers toi "
"en haussant les épaules.] Il dit que tu peux monter."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:496 dialog/ncwriply.msg:5382
msgid "! "
msgstr " !"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:497
msgid "Mr. Bishop 'xpecting you?"
msgstr "M. Bishop t'attend ?"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:498
msgid "Yes. Can I head on up? We have business to discuss."
msgstr "Oui. Je peux monter ? On doit discuter affaires."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:499
msgid "No, not right now. Take care, guys."
msgstr "Non, pas maintenant."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:505
msgid "Sure, go on up, "
msgstr "Bien sûr, monte, "

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:507
msgid "Next time, don't even sweat asking... just head on up."
msgstr "La prochaine fois, tu peux économiser ta salive et monter directement."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1228 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1229
msgid ". Now."
msgstr ". Maintenant."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1229 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1230
msgid ". Ain't your family gonna be missing you?"
msgstr ". Tu ne vas pas manquer à ta famille ?"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1230 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1228
msgid " family is a bunch of pussies. What you think about that?"
msgstr ", cette famille, c'est une bande de mauviettes. Que penses-tu de ça ?"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1231 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1231
msgid " had time to do much more than kiss their bosses' ass."
msgstr ""
" ont eu le temps de faire un peu plus que de lécher les bottes du patron."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1236 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1236
msgid " family is a bunch of pussies. Now I see it's true."
msgstr ""
", cette famille, c'est une bande de mauviettes. Maintenant, je vois que "
"c'est vrai."

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1247 dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1276 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1252
#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:1266
msgid "! You can't be showing weapons in here, awright?"
msgstr " ! Interdiction de montrer tes armes ici, compris ? "

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1265 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1260
msgid ". You taking care of yourself?"
msgstr ". Tu fais attention à toi ?"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1266 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1261
msgid ". What's up?"
msgstr ". Quoi de neuf ?"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1277 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1267
msgid "! Put that weapon away."
msgstr " ! Range cette arme !"

#: dialog/ncbisgrd.msg:1279 dialog/ncbismen.msg:1269
msgid "! You can show your tits, but you can't show weapons in here, awright?"
msgstr " ! Ici, tu peux montrer tes nichons, mais pas tes armes, compris ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:100
msgid "You see Mr. Bishop."
msgstr "Tu vois M. Bishop."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:150
msgid "You see a powerful-looking middle-aged man."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme, la cinquantaine, il a l'air redoutable."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:151
msgid "You see Mr. Bishop. He looks grim."
msgstr "Tu vois M. Bishop. Il a une mine lugubre."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:200
msgid "You got some balls coming in here. "
msgstr "Tu en as du culot de venir ici toi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:201
msgid "You got some balls. "
msgstr "Tu as du culot."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:202
msgid ""
"Why didn't you just tack a sign on your chest that says, 'dumb mother "
"fucker?' "
msgstr ""
"T'aurais aussi pu porter une pancarte avec : *Sale con* d'écrit dessus. "

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:203
msgid "Eat lead, you "
msgstr "Va te faire foutre, "

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:204
msgid " bastard."
msgstr " connard."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:205
msgid "Eat lead, you stupid son of a bitch."
msgstr "Va te faire foutre, petit con."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:206
msgid "Eat lead, bitch."
msgstr "Va te faire foutre, salope."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:207
msgid "Me not LIKE lead taste gross"
msgstr "Moi pas aimer foutre, pas bon."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:209
msgid "If that's what you want carved on your tombstone, so be it..."
msgstr "Si c'est ce que tu veux de gravé sur ta pierre tombale, alors..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:210
msgid "Poor choice of last words."
msgstr "Tu aurais pu mieux choisir tes derniers mots."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:211
msgid "[Run for it.]"
msgstr "Sauve-toi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:220
msgid "What th --? Who are you and what the HELL do you want?"
msgstr "Quoi... ? Qui es-tu ? Que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:223
msgid "Me Whoo?"
msgstr "Moi quiii ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:225
msgid ""
"I am a warrior on a holy quest to retrieve the Garden of Eden Creation Kit. "
"Do you know where I might find it?"
msgstr ""
"Voici la quête sacrée qui m'amène : je cherche un Jardin d'Eden en Kit. "
"Saurais-tu me dire où je peux le trouver ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:226
msgid "I'm looking for a Garden of Eden Creation Kit. Can you help me?"
msgstr "Je suis à la recherche d'un Jardin d'Eden en Kit. Pourrais-tu m'aider ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:227
msgid "I'm looking for a place called Vault 13. Have you heard of it?"
msgstr "Je cherche un endroit appelé l'Abri 13. Tu en as déjà entendu parler ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:228
msgid "I thought you might have some more work for me."
msgstr "J'ai pensé que tu aurais peut-être du travail à me donner."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:229
msgid "Sorry -- wrong room."
msgstr "Je m'excuse, j'ai dû me tromper de pièce."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:240
msgid ""
"(Studies you.) Even under all that get-up, you still look like one of them "
"tribals... (Snorts.) The boys said you got a\n"
" briefcase for me. From a mutual \"acquaintance.\" Let's see it."
msgstr ""
"[Il t'observe.] Même derrière ce déguisement, on reconnaît en toi le "
"tribal... [Il grogne.] Les gars m'ont dit que tu avais une sacoche à me "
"donner. De la part d'une *connaissance* commune. Voyons ça."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:242
msgid ""
"Uh... funny thing, that... seems like somewhere from the door to here I "
"misplaced it."
msgstr ""
"Heu... c'est drôle... j'ai dû la poser quelque part entre la porte et ici..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:243
msgid "Actually, I'd like to hold onto it. I'll bring it back in a while."
msgstr "J'aimerais la garder. Je te l'apporterai dans quelque temps."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:250
msgid ""
"(Opens briefcase, checks contents, snaps case shut.) It's from Moore, all "
"right. 'Cept this note in here says\n"
" you can't be trusted farther than a snake can shit. You done walked into "
"the WRONG room, tribal."
msgstr ""
"[Il ouvre la sacoche, vérifie son contenu, puis la referme d'un coup sec.] "
"Ca vient de Moore. Mais, à l'intérieur, un mot dit qu'on ne peut pas te "
"faire confiance. Je regrette, c'est PAS la bonne pièce, tribal !"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:251
msgid ""
"(Opens briefcase, checks contents, snaps case shut.) It's from Moore, all "
"right. Says you check out, tribal. Lucky\n"
" for you...(Smiles.)...you come in here with a bad rep, and you're asking "
"for a quick trip to the sky."
msgstr ""
"[Il ouvre la sacoche, vérifie son contenu, puis la referme d'un coup sec.] "
"Ca vient de Moore. Ta route s'arrête ici, tribal. Tu as de la chance... [Il "
"sourit.] ...Tu t'amènes ici avec une mauvaise réputation et tu demandes un "
"voyage cosmique express."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:252
msgid "Maybe so, but I'm going to be the only one walking out."
msgstr "Peut-être, mais au moins moi je m'en sortirai."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:253
msgid ""
"Well, I delivered the case like Moore asked... now about the payment...?"
msgstr ""
"Bon, j'ai livré la sacoche comme promis à Moore... et pour ce qui est de la "
"paie... ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:254
msgid "I'm curious. What's in the briefcase?"
msgstr "Qu'y a-t-il dans cette sacoche ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:255
msgid "Glad everything's in order... look, I've got to be going."
msgstr "Tout est en ordre, tant mieux... Ecoute, il faut que je file."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:265
msgid "Hold your horses, tribal... we ain't even discussed payment yet. "
msgstr "Arrête ton char, tribal... On n'a pas encore parlé de la paie."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:266
msgid "Hold your horses, tribal... I have some questions for you first. "
msgstr "Arrête ton char, tribal... Chaque chose en son temps."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:267
msgid ""
"(Studies you.) So... where do YOU know Moore from? He trying to play "
"politics amongst the tribes now? Ha! That boy missed\n"
" his calling."
msgstr ""
"[Il t'observe.] Alors... Où l'as-tu connu Moore ? Il fait de la politique "
"chez les tribals maintenant ? Ha ! Ce garçon a raté sa vocation !"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:268
msgid ""
"I met him in Vault City, spreading the word. I offered to help him out by "
"delivering this briefcase to you."
msgstr ""
"Je l'ai rencontré à la Cité de l'Abri, il répandait la bonne parole. Je lui "
"ai proposé de l'aider en t'apportant cette sacoche."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:269
msgid ""
"I just happened to run across him during my travels. I offered to help him "
"out by delivering this briefcase to you."
msgstr ""
"Je l'ai rencontré au cours de mes voyages. Je lui ai proposé de l'aider en "
"t'apportant cette sacoche."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:275
msgid ""
"Heh... damn human of you... for all his preaching, ol' Tomcat Moore can't "
"seem to step off his soapbox long enough to actually\n"
" do any legwork. Heh... still, that don't make him any different than any "
"other NCR boy."
msgstr ""
"Hé... saleté d'humain... Encore les même sermons du vieux coureur de jupon "
"de Moore. Il n'arrête pas son baratin, mais il ne fait pas grand-chose. "
"Hé... Il n'est pas différent des autres gars de la RNC. "

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:276
msgid "He does preach a lot. Still, he seems to make a lot of sense."
msgstr "Il fait beaucoup de sermons. Mais tout ça n'a pas beaucoup de sens."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:277
msgid "He does have a certain... way with words."
msgstr "C'est un beau... parleur."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:278
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, at some point the work's gotta be done, and they call me to make "
"sure things get delivered... like\n"
" that briefcase."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, mais un jour ou l'autre, le boulot doit être fait. Et on m'appelle "
"pour être sûr que tout arrive à bon port... comme cette sacoche."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:285
msgid ""
"(To himself.) 'Course, being able to whip a crowd into a frenzy ain't too "
"bad if you're going into politics...\n"
" (Studies you suspiciously.) You ain't NCR, too, are you? Tomcat's about the "
"only one of them I can stand for the moment."
msgstr ""
"[A part :] Bien sûr, quand on fait de la politique, ce n'est pas mal de "
"savoir haranguer les foules... [Il t'observe d'un air suspicieux.] Tu n'es "
"pas de la RNC, hein ? Ce coureur de jupons de Moore est le seul que je "
"supporte en ce moment."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:286
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm from the NCR, too. It's not the best, but it's a living. I'm "
"pretty much a free agent."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, je suis de la RNC moi aussi. C'est pas le top, mais on fait aller. "
"J'ai toute la liberté d'action."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:287
msgid ""
"No, I'm just a traveler. I agreed to help Moore out because I needed work."
msgstr ""
"Non, je ne suis qu'un globe-trotter. J'ai accepté d'aider Moore parce que "
"j'avais besoin de travailler."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:295
msgid ""
"(Nods at case.) Well, this briefcase was worth it. A little slice of Vault "
"City inside, some of that precious\n"
" tech that frigid bitch Lynette doesn't want to part with... but hey, "
"tribal, I ain't paid you yet. Here's your cut."
msgstr ""
"[Il acquiesce.] Eh bien, ça en valait la peine. A l'intérieur, il y a une "
"petite tranche de la Cité de l'Abri, un tech précieux dont cette salope de "
"Lynette ne veut pas se séparer... Mais, tribal, je ne t'ai pas encore payé. "
"Voici ta part."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:296
msgid ""
"Say... I don't have any other jobs lined up at the moment. Do you have any "
"work for me?"
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, je n'ai pas d'autre boulot pour le moment. As-tu du travail pour moi "
"?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:297
msgid "Yeah... thanks. Look, I've got to be going."
msgstr "Ouais... merci. Ecoute, il faut que je parte."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:305
msgid ""
"No... I ain't got no more work for you... but hey, thanks for all you've "
"done. "
msgstr ""
"Non... je n'ai pas de travail à te donner, mais... je te remercie pour tout "
"ce que tu as fait."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:306
msgid ""
"No... I ain't got nothing for you. Lotta deaths down in NCR recently have "
"made my life a little easier... but hey, thanks\n"
" for the delivery. "
msgstr ""
"Non... je n'ai pas de travail à te donner. Dernièrement, les décès en RNC "
"m'ont simplifié la vie... mais, merci pour cette livraison."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:307
msgid ""
"(Nods at the exit.) Now you go on and get outta here. I got other business "
"to attend to."
msgstr ""
"[D'un mouvement de tête, il indique la sortie.] Maintenant, sors d'ici. Les "
"affaires m'attendent."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:308
msgid ""
"I deliver that stupid case to you all the way from Vault City, then you give "
"me the brush off? I\n"
" think I'll just take the REST of my payment out of your safe."
msgstr ""
"Je t'apporte cette foutue sacoche depuis la Cité de l'Abri, et toi, tu "
"m'envoies promener ? Je vais me servir dans ton coffre et prendre le RESTE "
"de ma paie !!"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:309
msgid ""
"No, I don't think I'll be leaving just yet. You still got BUSINESS with "
"me... dead man."
msgstr ""
"Non, je ne partirai pas tout de suite. On a encore des choses à régler "
"ensemble... Tu es un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:310
msgid "All right, then. I'm leaving."
msgstr "D'accord. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:315
msgid ""
"Hold on a minute there, tribal...(Smiles, taps briefcase.) Ol' Tomcat says "
"you're a team player. I need people like that.\n"
" I got a job for you, if you're interested."
msgstr ""
"Attends une minute, tribal... [Il sourit et frappe sur la sacoche.] Ce vieux "
"coureur de jupons dit que tu as l'esprit d'équipe. J'ai besoin de gens comme "
"toi. Je peux te proposer un travail si ça t'intéresse."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:317
msgid "No, I've really got to be heading on."
msgstr "Non, il faut vraiment que je parte."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:325
msgid "(Checks you out for a moment, then nods.) Yeah... I got a job for you. "
msgstr ""
"[Il t'observe pendant un moment, puis acquiesce.] Ouais... j'ai du travail "
"pour toi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:326
msgid ""
"I have this...\"problem\" down South in NCR. This fella, Westin, has a big "
"mouth that needs to be shut... permanently.\n"
" Half a grand, easy money."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un *problème* dans le Sud, en RNC. Il s'appelle Westin, c'est une "
"grande gueule qui aurait besoin d'être bouclée... définitivement. $500, "
"c'est de l'argent facile."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:327
msgid "No problem. This Westin is as good as dead."
msgstr "Pas de problème. Westin est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:328
msgid "Not interested. Find somebody else."
msgstr "Ca ne m'intéresse pas. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:335
msgid ""
"Hold on. I ain't FINISHED telling you everything yet. I want this guy dead, "
"but it can't LOOK like he was aced. Don't put a bullet in his skull, don't "
"stab him to death, don't do ANYTHING that smells of a hit."
msgstr ""
"J'ai pas encore TERMINE. Il me faut ce gars mort, mais il DOIT avoir l'air "
"de pas avoir eu de chance. Tu me suis ? Ne lui fiche pas une balle en pleine "
"tronche, ne le poignarde pas, ne fais RIEN qui fasse penser à un règlement "
"de compte."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:336
msgid "What? How --"
msgstr "Quoi ? Comment... ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:337
msgid "That's gonna cost ex --"
msgstr "Ca va coûter un peu p..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:338
msgid "Because...?"
msgstr "Parce que... ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:345
msgid ""
"Because that's the way it HAS to be done. You piss off anyone down there, "
"make them think that I had ANYTHING to\n"
" do with that son of a bitch kicking the bucket, and I'll make sure no one "
"can identify your corpse."
msgstr ""
"Parce que c'est AINSI. Si tu fais un scandale, si tu laisses insinuer que "
"j'ai QUELQUE CHOSE à voir avec la mort de ce salaud, je peux t'assurer que "
"personne n'arrivera à identifier ton corps après l'autopsie !"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:346
msgid ""
"How the hell am I supposed to whack somebody and NOT make it look like "
"murder?"
msgstr "Comment veux-tu que je le crève sans que ça ait l'air d'un meurtre ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:347
msgid "Forget it... not my style. Find somebody else. I'm outta here."
msgstr ""
"Laisse tomber... c'est pas mon genre. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre. Moi j'me "
"casse."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:355
msgid ""
"That's YOUR problem, tribal, not mine. Do some mumbo-jumbo, mix up some "
"poisonous plants and slip it into his drink,\n"
" choke him in his sleep, push him off a building, I don't care. Just so it "
"doesn't look like a hit."
msgstr ""
"C'est TON problème, tribal, pas le mien. Débrouille-toi. Donne-lui à boire "
"une infusion de plantes vénéneuses, étouffe-le dans son sommeil, jette-le du "
"haut d'un immeuble, je m'en fous, du moment que ça ressemble pas à un "
"règlement de compte."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:356
msgid ""
"All right... and one more time in case I ain't made myself CRYSTAL clear: "
"it's got to look like an accident, or\n"
" it's no good."
msgstr ""
"Et encore une fois, si je ne me suis pas BIEN fait comprendre : il faut que "
"ça ressemble à un accident, sinon c'est pas bon."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:357
msgid "Done. I'll be back after Westin has had his... \"accident.\""
msgstr "D'accord. Je reviendrai après *l'accident* de Westin."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:358
msgid ""
"I HEARD you the first time. I'll be back after Westin has had his... "
"\"accident.\""
msgstr "J'avais COMPRIS ! Je reviendrai après *l'accident* de Westin."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:359
msgid ""
"If you don't want me to put a bullet in his skull, that's gonna raise the "
"price a little."
msgstr ""
"Si tu ne veux pas que je lui mette une balle dans la tête, ça va te coûter "
"plus cher."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:360
msgid ""
"You want me to make it look like an accident, eh? Then I need to know more "
"about this 'Westin.'"
msgstr ""
"Tu veux que je maquille ce meurtre en accident, hein ? Alors, il faut que "
"j'en sache plus sur Westin."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:361
msgid "I'm not the person for this job. Forget it."
msgstr "Laisse tomber, je ne suis pas la personne pour ce genre de boulot."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:370
msgid ""
"All right then. I expect to hear from you soon. And remember, tribal, you "
"don't know me, and we never had this\n"
" conversation. Word gets out, and I'll put you down."
msgstr ""
"D'accord. J'attends de tes nouvelles bientôt. Et souviens-toi, tribal, tu ne "
"me connais pas, et nous n'avons jamais eu cette conversation. S'il y a une "
"fuite, c'est la mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:371
msgid ""
"Don't you worry about ME, Bishop. You just make sure you got that cash "
"waiting for me when I get back."
msgstr ""
"Ne t'inquiète pas pour MOI, Bishop. Occupe-toi seulement d'avoir le fric "
"quand je reviendrai."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:372
msgid "No problem. I'll be back."
msgstr "Pas de problème. Je reviendrai."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:380
msgid ""
"I'm already paying you more than YOUR life's worth, tribal. Don't push me."
msgstr "Je te paie déjà plus que tu ne vaux, tribal. Ne me cherche pas."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:381
msgid ""
"A thousand or nothing. This is a special job, and I got expenses. I got to "
"get to NCR, arrange the 'accident,'\n"
" and most likely have to shell out some MORE cash for some special 'accident-"
"prone' items to get things done. So\n"
" don't push ME, all right?"
msgstr ""
"C'est 1000 ou rien. C'est un boulot spécial, je dois engager des dépenses, "
"aller en RNC, organiser *l'accident*... Et il faut encore trouver du fric "
"pour les trucs qui font plus vrai et pour que ça ne rate pas. Alors, ne me "
"cherche pas, compris ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:382
msgid "Make it an even thousand, and you got yourself a hitman."
msgstr "Va pour 1000 et je fais ce que tu veux."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:383
msgid "750 chips oughta cover it."
msgstr "750 devraient suffire."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:384
msgid "500 chips, then. Westin's a dead man."
msgstr "Va pour 500 jetons. Westin est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:385
msgid "Then forget it. Get somebody else. I'm outta here."
msgstr "Alors laisse tomber. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre, moi j'm'en vais."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:390
msgid "You want WHAT? Tribal, you're lucky to get as much as you're getting."
msgstr ""
"Tu veux QUOI ? tribal, tu as déjà de la chance de recevoir ce que je vais te "
"donner."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:391
msgid "Look, last time: It's going to cost you more than 500 chips."
msgstr "Ecoute, c'est la dernière fois. Ca va te coûter plus de 500 jetons."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:393
msgid "Then forget it. Find somebody else. I'm outta here."
msgstr "Alors laisse tomber. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:400
msgid ""
"All right then! You BETTER deliver, tribal. You don't, if you mess this up "
"or if ANYONE hears about this deal, and\n"
" I'm gonna put a knife wound on your body for every chip you asked for."
msgstr ""
"D'accord ! T'as intérêt à assurer, tribal. Si tu fais une connerie, ou si "
"quelqu'un entend parler de notre affaire, le tarif sera un coup de couteau "
"par jeton que tu m'as demandé."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:401
msgid "No problem. Westin's a dead man."
msgstr "Pas de problème. Westin est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:402
msgid ""
"That so? Well, then find somebody else to solve your problem. I'm outta here."
msgstr ""
"Ah c'est comme ça ?! Alors trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre pour régler ton "
"problème. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:410
msgid "Hmmmm. All right, fair enough... what do you need to know?"
msgstr "Hum. D'accord. C'est normal. Que veux-tu savoir ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:411 dialog/ncbishop.msg:616 dialog/vcdwnbar.msg:146
msgid "Like...?"
msgstr "C'est-à-dire... ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:412
msgid ""
"Where can I FIND this guy? I don't want to have to hunt his ass down when I "
"get to NCR."
msgstr ""
"Où vais-je TROUVER ce type ? J'ai pas envie de le pister dans toute la RNC."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:413
msgid "This guy got any kin, any family? Any witnesses I got to worry about?"
msgstr "Ce type a-t-il de la famille ? Peut-il y avoir des témoins gênants ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:414
msgid "What's this guy's health like? Any illnesses?"
msgstr "Quel est son état de santé ? Il est malade ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:416
msgid "What does this Westin DO? What's his job schedule like?"
msgstr "Que fait-il, ce Westin ? Connais-tu son emploi du temps ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:417
msgid "I don't want this job. Find somebody else."
msgstr "Je ne veux pas de ce boulot. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:425
msgid ""
"He's got a ranch in NCR. Follow the brahmin stink, and you should find it "
"without too much trouble."
msgstr ""
"Il a un ranch en RNC. Il suffit de suivre la puanteur des Brahmines pour le "
"trouver. Ca devrait être facile."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:426
msgid "I had some other questions about Westin..."
msgstr "J'avais d'autres questions sur Westin..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:428
msgid "The more I hear about this, the less I like it. Forget this."
msgstr "Plus j'en entends parler, moins ça me botte. Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:435
msgid ""
"No kids, no wife, no family to speak of. There might be some ranch hands, "
"but they shouldn't be too much trouble."
msgstr ""
"Pas d'enfants, pas de femme, pas de parents. Il devrait y avoir les ouvriers "
"du ranch, mais ça ne devrait pas poser trop de problèmes."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:437
msgid "Wait a minute... \"ranch hands?\" Are they ARMED? And how many is SOME?"
msgstr ""
"Attends une minute... « les ouvriers du ranch » ? Ils sont armés ? Il y en a "
"combien ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:438
msgid "All right, that's good enough to go on. Westin's a dead man."
msgstr "D'accord, ça me suffit. Westin est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:445
msgid ""
"Probably armed... and as for a headcount, I haven't GOT one. I know he's got "
"workers, and there's most likely more\n"
" than one. Dealing with them's YOUR problem, tribal."
msgstr ""
"Ils sont probablement armés... mais je ne sais pas combien ils sont. Je sais "
"qu'il a des ouvriers. Il en a certainement plusieurs. A toi de te "
"débrouiller, tribal."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:446
msgid ""
"Great, that's really helpful. Look, I had some other questions about "
"Westin..."
msgstr ""
"Super, ça m'aide. Ecoute, j'ai encore quelques questions à te poser sur "
"Westin..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:447
msgid "Well, that's enough to go on. Westin's a dead man."
msgstr "D'accord, ça me suffit. Westin est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:455
msgid ""
"Well... rumor has it he doesn't go out much. I thought I heard something "
"'bout him having a bad heart, so he doesn't\n"
" exert himself much. (Snorts.) Either that, or he doesn't like the sun."
msgstr ""
"Il paraît qu'il ne sort pas beaucoup. J'ai entendu dire qu'il avait des "
"problèmes cardiaques, alors il ne fait pas beaucoup d'exercice. [Il grogne.] "
"Soit ça, soit il n'aime pas le soleil."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:456
msgid "Hmmmm. I had some other questions about Westin..."
msgstr "Hum. J'ai d'autres questions sur Westin..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:457
msgid ""
"Heart trouble, huh? Does he have a doctor? Does he take any medication for "
"it?"
msgstr ""
"Des problèmes cardiaques, hein ? Qui est son médecin ? Il prend des "
"médicaments ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:465
msgid ""
"(Smiles.) I like the way you think, tribal... well, I don't know if he takes "
"any drugs for his heart, but I know he'd have\n"
" to be pretty damn careful about which ones he DID take with that heart o' "
"his."
msgstr ""
"[Il sourit.] J'aime ta façon de penser, tribal. Je ne sais pas s'il prend "
"des médicaments pour son coeur, mais je sais qu'il devrait faire gaffe aux "
"trucs qu'il s'enfile avec le coeur qu'il a."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:475
msgid "(Frowns.) He's a brahmin rancher. An animal herder. So?"
msgstr "[Il fronce les sourcils.] C'est un éleveur de Brahmines. Et alors ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:476
msgid "All right then. I had some other questions about Westin..."
msgstr "D'accord. J'ai d'autres questions sur Westin."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:477
msgid ""
"No, he's something MORE. Or else we wouldn't be having this conversation."
msgstr ""
"Non, y doit y avoir AUTRE chose. Sinon, cette conversation n'aurait pas lieu."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:485
msgid ""
"(Glares at you.) He's also a councilor in the NCR congress. That SCARE you, "
"tribal? It shouldn't. Do your job, and\n"
" you got nothing to worry about. Fuck it up, and Westin'll be the least of "
"your worries."
msgstr ""
"[Il te foudroie du regard.] Il est aussi conseiller au congrès de RNC. Ca te "
"fait peur, tribal ? Y a pas de quoi. Fais ton boulot et tout ira bien. Si tu "
"rates ton coup, tu peux commencer à te faire du souci."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:488
msgid ""
"A \"councilor in the NCR Congress?\" Screw this. Find somebody else... "
"somebody with a death wish."
msgstr ""
"Conseiller au Congrès de RNC ? Merde. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre... "
"Quelqu'un qui a envie de mourir."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:495
msgid ""
"All right then. Don't be a stranger now... I always got work for somebody "
"who gets results."
msgstr ""
"C'est d'accord. Passe me voir de temps en temps. J'ai toujours du travail "
"pour ceux qui ont des résultats."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:496
msgid "I'll keep that in mind. Goodbye."
msgstr "Je m'en souviendrai. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:500
msgid "You done Westin yet?"
msgstr "Tu en as déjà fini avec Westin ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:501
msgid "You DAMN well better have some good news for me. Is Westin dead or not?"
msgstr ""
"Tu as intérêt à avoir de bonnes nouvelles pour moi. Westin est mort ou non ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:502
msgid "Tribal, my patience is wearing thin. Did you DO the goddamn job or not?"
msgstr ""
"Tribal, je commence à perdre patience. Il est fait ce foutu boulot, oui ou "
"non ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:503
msgid ""
"Actually... funny thing, you might appreciate the irony... I had a counter "
"offer. Let me show you what it is."
msgstr ""
"En fait... c'est drôle, tu apprécieras peut-être l'ironie. On m'a fait une "
"autre proposition. Je vais te montrer."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:504
msgid ""
"Westin has had an... accident, yes. Terrible shame, a man like that dying so "
"suddenly. Now about the money you owe me..."
msgstr ""
"Westin a eu un... accident. Quel dommage, il est mort si subitement. Et à "
"propos de l'argent que tu me dois..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:505
msgid "Not yet. I've got a few things to take care of first."
msgstr "Pas encore. Il faut que je règle deux ou trois choses avant."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:507
msgid "I came back to tell you I won't be doing the job. Forget it."
msgstr "Je viens te dire que je ne le ferai pas alors laisse tomber."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:515
msgid "You stupid bastard..."
msgstr "Espèce d'enfoiré..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:516
msgid "You dumb bitch..."
msgstr "Espèce de salope..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:517
msgid ""
"you got some balls coming back here after fucking up the way you did in NCR. "
"Why didn't you just tack a sign on Westin\n"
" saying, 'contract hit?' Yer gonna be a long time dying."
msgstr ""
"Tu as du culot de revenir ici après avoir cafouillé en RNC. T'aurais aussi "
"pu mettre une pancarte sur Westin qui disait *meurtre mafieux* ! Ton agonie "
"sera longue."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:519
msgid "Poor choice of last words, Bishop..."
msgstr "Tu aurais pu mieux choisir tes derniers mots, Bishop..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:525
msgid ""
"Hey, tribal. That job's still open... if you want it. Pay's good. You "
"interested?"
msgstr ""
"Hé, tribal. Ce boulot est à toi si tu le veux. La paie est bonne. Ca "
"t'intéresse ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:536
msgid "Here's your payment."
msgstr "Voilà ta paie."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:537
msgid "Got any more work for me?"
msgstr "Tu as encore du boulot pour moi ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:538
msgid "This settle things between you and me now? If so, I'll be going."
msgstr "Nous sommes quittes maintenant ? Alors, je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:539
msgid "All right then. Pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr "Très bien. C'était un plaisir de faire des affaires avec toi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:545
msgid ""
"Hold on a minute there, tribal... you did good. I got another job for you, "
"IF you're interested."
msgstr ""
"Attends une minute, tribal... Tu as bien travaillé. J'ai un autre boulot à "
"te proposer. SI ça t'intéresse."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:547
msgid "No, thanks. I'm not interested."
msgstr "Non, merci. Ca ne m'intéresse pas."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:550
msgid "(Checks you out for a moment, then nods.) "
msgstr "[Il t'observe un instant, puis acquiesce.]"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:551
msgid "Yeah... I got a job for you. "
msgstr "Ouais... j'ai du boulot pour toi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:552
msgid ""
"I have another...\"problem\" down in NCR. Nail one, another pops up. This "
"dead man's name is Carlson. He don't know he's\n"
" dead yet. "
msgstr ""
"J'ai un autre... *problème* en RNC. Quand y'en a plus, y'en a encore. Le "
"futur macchabée s'appelle Carlson. Il ne le sait pas mais il est déjà froid."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:553
msgid ""
"I have a...\"problem\" down south in NCR. The dead man's name is Carlson. He "
"don't know he's dead yet. "
msgstr ""
"J'ai un autre... *problème* en RNC. Le futur macchabée s'appelle Carlson. Il "
"ne le sait pas mais il est déjà froid."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:554
msgid "Make it happen, and it's worth 500 to you."
msgstr "Si tu t'en occupes, je t'en donnerai 500."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:555
msgid "No problem. This Carlson is as good as dead."
msgstr "Pas de problème. Carlson est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:556
msgid "ANOTHER murder?"
msgstr "Un AUTRE meurtre ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:565
msgid ""
"Ain't murder. Murder's an ugly word. This is business. Politics, if you "
"will. Both two respectable institutions.\n"
" You want the job or what?"
msgstr ""
"C'est pas un meurtre. Quel vilain mot. Moi je te parle d'affaire, de "
"politique, si tu préfères. Ce sont deux institutions respectables. Tu le "
"veux ce boulot ou pas ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:575
msgid ""
"One more thing: I don't care if you go in there guns blazing with ol' "
"Carlson. He's bound to be holed up there pretty\n"
" tight after Westin bought it, so it doesn't need to be pretty, it just "
"needs to be DONE, capiche?"
msgstr ""
"Encore une chose. Tu peux y mettre le paquet avec ce vieux Carlson, je m'en "
"fous. Il ne lui reste plus qu'à se planquer, maintenant que Westin est "
"crevé. Alors toi, tu t'embarrasses pas avec les détails, tu fais juste ton "
"boulot, capiche ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:576
msgid ""
"I don't care if you go in there guns blazing with ol' Carlson. He's holed up "
"in his mansion tight, so it doesn't need\n"
" to be pretty, it just needs to be DONE, capiche?"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux y mettre le paquet avec ce vieux Carlson, je m'en fous. Il ne lui "
"reste plus qu'à se planquer chez lui. Alors, t'embarrasse pas avec les "
"détails, fais le boulot, capiche ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:577
msgid ""
"And one more time in case I haven't made myself clear: I don't care HOW you "
"whack this son of a bitch as long as he's\n"
" dead and stays that way."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas été assez clair on dirait, je me fous de savoir COMMENT tu "
"crèves ce salopard, du moment qu'il est refroidi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:578
msgid "Understood. I'm on it."
msgstr "Compris."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:579
msgid "All RIGHT... I heard you the first time. I'm on it."
msgstr "C'est BON... J'avais compris la première fois. Je suis de la partie."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:580
msgid "If that's the way it's gotta be... now let's talk about that price."
msgstr "Si c'est comme ça... Maintenant, parlons des tarifs."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:581
msgid "I'm gonna need some info on this Carlson guy before I do anything."
msgstr "J'ai besoin d'avoir des renseignements sur ce Carlson avant d'agir. "

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:582
msgid ""
"Oh, so NOW it's okay to go in with guns blazing? THAT would have been "
"helpful with Westin. Forget this."
msgstr ""
"Oh, alors maintenant, on peut utiliser les grands moyens ? Ca aurait été "
"pratique avec Westin. Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:583
msgid "Not interested. Find someone else."
msgstr "Ca m'intéresse pas. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:590
msgid ""
"What the hell is this shit with you? I TOLD you the price. We AIN'T gonna "
"negotiate. End of story... capiche?"
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce qui te prend ? Je t'ai dit le PRIX. J'ai JAMAIS parlé de "
"négocier... capiche ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:591
msgid ""
"Look, Bishop. I iced Westin. He was no cakewalk, but I DID it. None of your "
"boys could've done it, or you would've\n"
" sent one of them. You want results? Then you talk to ME, and you better "
"talk a price I want to hear."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, Bishop. J'ai refroidi Westin. C'était pas du gâteau, mais je l'ai "
"fait. Aucun de tes hommes n'aurait réussi, sinon tu les y aurais envoyés. Tu "
"veux des résultats ? Alors viens me voir, et tu as intérêt à annoncer le "
"prix que je veux entendre."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:592
msgid "1000 chips. That's all it'll take to put Carlson in early retirement."
msgstr ""
"1000 jetons. C'est tout ce qu'il faut pour envoyer Carlson en retraite "
"anticipée."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:593
msgid "500 chips then. Carlson's a dead man."
msgstr "500 jetons et Carlson est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:594
msgid "Then forget it. Find somebody else."
msgstr "Alors laisse tomber. Trouve-toi quelqu'un d'autre."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:600
msgid ""
"All right... a thousand chips. And that's it. I don't want to hear any more "
"bullshit. Next words that cross your lips\n"
" better be 'yes, Mr. Bishop. I'll do it.'"
msgstr ""
"Va pour 1000 jetons. Ca suffit, je ne veux plus rien entendre. La prochaine "
"fois que tu ouvres la bouche, c'est pour dire « Oui, M. Bishop. Tu peux "
"compter sur moi. »"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:601
msgid "Yes, Mr. Bishop. I'll do it."
msgstr "Oui, M. Bishop. Tu peux compter sur moi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:602
msgid "I'll SETTLE for 1000 chips. This time."
msgstr "C'est d'accord pour 1000 jetons. Cette fois-ci."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:603
msgid "1000 chips? Are you joking? Make it 1500 and you got a deal."
msgstr "1000 jetons ? C'est une plaisanterie ? 1500 et je marche."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:604
msgid "Forget it. I don't need this shit."
msgstr "Laisse tomber. J'ai pas besoin de cette merde."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:605
msgid "Forget it. I don't need this."
msgstr "Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:615
msgid ""
"(Chews it over, then nods slightly.) Fair enough... what do you need to know?"
msgstr "[Il réfléchit puis acquiesce.] C'est normal... Que veux-tu savoir ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:622
msgid "What does this Carlson DO? What's his job schedule like?"
msgstr "Que fait-il, ce Carlson ? Tu connais son emploi du temps ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:630
msgid ""
"He's holed up in the presidential mansion in NCR. Can't miss it. Finding a "
"way in and whacking the geezer is your job."
msgstr ""
"Il se terre dans sa résidence présidentielle en RNC. Tu peux pas le louper. "
"Ton boulot, c'est de le trouver et de le descendre."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:631
msgid "I had some other questions about Carlson..."
msgstr "J'aimerais te poser d'autres questions sur Carlson..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:632
msgid "All right, that's good enough to go on. Carlson's a dead man."
msgstr "D'accord. Ca vaut la peine de continuer. Carlson est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:640
msgid ""
"His wife's dead, but he's got a son, only seven or eight years old, that "
"lives in the mansion with him...(Thinks.)...the\n"
" place is bound to be guarded, though, so keep an eye out for security."
msgstr ""
"Sa femme est morte, et il vit avec son fils qui doit avoir 7 ou 8 ans... [Il "
"réfléchit...] ...La résidence est certainement gardée, alors fais gaffe à la "
"sécurité."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:642
msgid "Wait a minute... how MANY guards?"
msgstr "Attends une minute. COMBIEN y'a de gardes ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:650
msgid ""
"Don't know exactly how many. I'd scope out the place, get a feel for the "
"numbers. Of course, dealing with them's\n"
" YOUR problem, tribal."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas exactement combien y'en a. Tu devrais aller jeter un coup "
"d'oeil pour te faire une idée. Bien sûr, tu t'occupes des gardes, c'est TON "
"problème, tribal."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:651
msgid ""
"Great, that's really helpful. Look, I had some other questions about "
"Carlson..."
msgstr ""
"Super, ça m'est très utile. Ecoute, j'ai d'autres questions à te poser sur "
"Carlson..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:652
msgid "Well, that's enough to go on. Carlson's a dead man."
msgstr "D'accord, ça me suffit. Carlson est un homme mort."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:660
msgid ""
"No, nothing like that... that I KNOW of. He's a paranoid bastard, sure, but "
"I don't think he's sick or nothing. (Frowns.) Then\n"
" again, he's a pretty OLD guy, so his health can't be that great."
msgstr ""
"Non, pas que je sache. C'est un connard parano, c'est sûr, mais je ne crois "
"pas qu'il soit malade. [Il fronce les sourcils.] Mais d'un autre côté, il "
"est assez VIEUX, alors il doit être assez frêle."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:670
msgid ""
"(Glares at you.) He's the NCR Vice President. Don't let it bother you... get "
"in one good shot, and they'll be fitting him\n"
" for a coffin. Just make sure you're ABLE to get in at least one good shot."
msgstr ""
"[Il te foudroie du regard.] C'est le vice-président de la RNC. Ne te laisse "
"pas impressionner... Tire-lui dessus et ils prépareront son cercueil. Assure-"
"toi qu'il reçoive au moins une balle."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:671
msgid "All right then. I had some other questions about Carlson..."
msgstr "C'est d'accord. J'avais d'autres questions à te poser sur Carlson."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:673
msgid ""
"The \"Vice President of NCR?\" Screw this. Find somebody else... somebody "
"with a death wish."
msgstr ""
"Le vice-président de la RNC !?! Non mais tu délires !! Trouve-toi quelqu'un "
"d'autre... quelqu'un qui ait envie de mourir."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:680
msgid "You done Carlson yet?"
msgstr "Alors, tu lui as fait la peau à Carlson ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:681
msgid ""
"You DAMN well better have some good news for me. Is Carlson dead or not?"
msgstr ""
"T'as INTERET à avoir de bonnes nouvelles pour moi. Carlson est-il mort ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:682
msgid "Tribal, my patience is wearing thin. Did you kill Carlson or not?"
msgstr "Tribal, je commence à perdre patience. Tu as tué Carlson, oui ou non ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:683
msgid ""
"They're fitting Carlson for a coffin right now. Well, what's left of him, "
"anyway."
msgstr ""
"Ils sont en train de préparer le cercueil de Carlson. Enfin, pour ce qu'il "
"en reste..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:695
msgid ""
"(Smiles.) Good job, tribal. I'm impressed... and I'm not an easy man to "
"impress. "
msgstr ""
"[Il sourit.] C'est du bon boulot, tribal. Je ne me laisse pas facilement "
"impressionner... mais, là, je suis agréablement surpris."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:705
msgid ""
"Not exactly... (Smiles.) What I got is an OFFER: How about becoming part of "
"the Family? I got big plans, and I could\n"
" use you: you're resourceful, tough, and you get things DONE. That's the "
"kind of soldier I need."
msgstr ""
"Pas exactement... [Il sourit.] J'ai une PROPOSITION. Tu veux faire partie de "
"la Famille ? J'ai de grands projets, et tu pourrais m'être utile : tu es "
"solide, tu as des ressources, et tu fais bien ton boulot. C'est ce qu'il me "
"faut."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:706
msgid "I'm interested. What's in it for me?"
msgstr "Ca m'intéresse. Qu'est-ce que je gagne ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:707
msgid ""
"Thanks, but I can't be tied down... my village and my people are counting on "
"me."
msgstr ""
"Non, merci. Je ne veux pas d'attaches... Mon village et mon peuple comptent "
"sur moi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:715
msgid ""
"Hold on... you didn't think I'd let you just WALK with what you know, did "
"you? Heh. C'mon now... there's skeletons that\n"
" need to be buried before this matter's closed. Letting you walk around... "
"that's just bad policy."
msgstr ""
"Attends... Tu ne crois quand même pas que j'allais te laisser partir avec "
"tout ce que tu sais, hein ? Hé ! Il y a du ménage à faire avant que cette "
"histoire ne soit terminée. C'est pas un bon plan de te laisser te promener "
"n'importe où."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:716
msgid ""
"Hold on... you didn't think things were settled between us, did you? Heh. "
"C'mon now... by my accounts, you still got a LOT\n"
" you have to pay for. Plus, I can't let you leave with what you know... bad "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"Attends, tu ne crois quand même pas que tout est réglé entre nous, hein ? Hé "
"! Allez, j'ai fait les comptes : tu as encore PAS MAL de dettes envers moi. "
"Et puis, je ne peux pas te laisser partir avec tout ce que tu sais. C'est "
"pas un bon plan."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:717
msgid ""
"Don't talk stupid, Bishop. Let me go, or I'll turn your backwater casino "
"into an inferno. \"Capiche?\""
msgstr ""
"Ne fais pas l'idiot, Bishop. Laisse-moi partir, ou je transforme ton casino "
"pépère en enfer, *capiche* ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:718
msgid "Makes sense. Let me introduce you to my 9mm policy."
msgstr "C'est clair. Laisse-moi te montrer mon *bon plan* de 9 mm."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:719
msgid "\"Bad policy?\" I'll SHOW you BAD POLICY, YOU SON OF A B --"
msgstr ""
"*Pas un bon plan* ? Je vais te montrer, moi, ce que c'est qu'un bon plan, "
"FILS DE PUTE !"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:725
msgid "All right then, bottom line: "
msgstr "Bon, d'accord. Résultat : "

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:726
msgid ""
"You got a taste for women? I can make sure you're NEVER lonely again. Maybe "
"you don't like the bitches,\n"
" that's fine, I'll get you some glitterboys you can park your meat in."
msgstr ""
"Tu aimes les chattes ? Sois tranquille, t'en auras plus qu'il en faut. Tu "
"n'aimes peut-être pas les salopes, alors je vais te donner des petits "
"travelos où tu pourras garer ta viande."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:727
msgid ""
"You got any young stud you fancy? I'll set you up with all the pretty boys "
"you want. Or maybe you swing the other way,\n"
" eh? I'll make sure you have a partner for every day of the week."
msgstr ""
"Tu voudrais bien te faire un vrai mâle ? Tu peux avoir tous les beaux mecs "
"que tu veux. Mais tu préfères peut-être le sexe faible, hein ? Sois "
"tranquille, tu auras une bête de sexe pour chaque jour de la semaine."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:728
msgid "Keep talking."
msgstr "Cause toujours."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:735
msgid ""
"You like to fly, get high, wire up? I can get you all of that. You want "
"weapons, new hardware, a better piece of iron\n"
" to plug some schlep with? All that bullshit... yours. IF... (Raises a "
"finger.) IF you join the family."
msgstr ""
"Tu aimes la défonce, la vraie ? Je peux te donner tout ce que tu veux. Tu "
"veux des armes, du matos récent, un bon flingue pour tirer sur les cons ? "
"Tout ça... c'est pour toi. SI... [Il lève l'index.] Si tu rentres dans la "
"famille..."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:736
msgid "Sounds good. Sign me up... boss."
msgstr "Ca marche. Mets-moi sur la liste... patron."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:740
msgid "All right then...! You got a name you want to be called?"
msgstr "D'accord... ! Comment veux-tu qu'on t'appelle ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:745
msgid ""
"...I like it, I like it. Now, if you wanna cash in on your reputation, hit "
"the bar downstairs, or head down Virgin\n"
" Street to the Cat's Paw. If you want to get some weapons, head on over to "
"New Reno Arms."
msgstr ""
"... Ca me plaît. Maintenant, si tu veux tirer profit de ta réputation, "
"descends au bar, ou va dans la Rue de la Vierge, au Cat's Paw. Si tu veux "
"des armes, va à l'Armurerie de New Reno."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:746
msgid "Will do... boss."
msgstr "Ca marche... patron."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:751
msgid ". Everybody treating you all right?"
msgstr ". Tout le monde est-il aux petits soins avec toi ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:752
msgid ""
"Everything's going good, Mr. Bishop. Just thought I'd check in, make sure "
"everything's going well for you.\n"
" See you later."
msgstr ""
"Tout baigne, M. Bishop. Je voulais simplement m'assurer que tout allait bien "
"de ton côté. A plus tard."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:753
msgid ""
"Everything's going great. YOUR family in particular is showing me... EVERY "
"courtesy. (Smile knowingly, then leave.)"
msgstr ""
"C'est parfait. La FAMILLE, en particulier, est pleine... d'attentions "
"délicates. [Tu lances un sourire entendu puis tu pars.]"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:755
msgid ""
"Hey, before you go... you going to be stopping by and seeing my wife again, "
"tribal? "
msgstr ""
"Hé, avant de partir... Dis-moi... Vas-tu encore passer voir ma femme, tribal "
"?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:756
msgid ""
"Hey, before you go... you going to be stopping by and getting high with my "
"daughter again, tribal? "
msgstr ""
"Hé, avant de partir... Dis-moi... Vas-tu encore voir ma fille et te défoncer "
"avec elle, tribal ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:757
msgid ""
"Do a little pow-wow? Eh? (Bishop's smiling, but there's not a trace of humor "
"in it.)"
msgstr ""
"Un tête-à-tête ? Hein ? [Bishop sourit, mais sans aucune trace d'humour.]"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:758
msgid ""
"What happened between me and Leslie... er, Mrs. Bishop... didn't mean "
"anything. We might as well have been... shaking hands."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui s'est passé entre Leslie, heu... Mme Bishop et moi... ce n'était rien "
"du tout. On aurait aussi bien pu se... serrer la main."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:759
msgid "Hey... look, nothing happened, all right?"
msgstr "Hé... écoute, il ne s'est rien passé, d'accord ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:760
msgid "What about it, Bishop?"
msgstr "Qu'y a-t-il, M. Bishop ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:761
msgid ""
"Maybe if you paid ATTENTION to Angela ever once in a while, she wouldn't "
"look for attention... elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Si tu faisais plus ATTENTION à Angela de temps en temps, elle n'irait pas "
"voir... ailleurs."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:762
msgid ""
"You'd be surprised how much those 'pow-wows' please your wife. It's as if "
"she's NEVER had good sex."
msgstr ""
"Tu serais surpris de constater combien ces têtes-à-tête font plaisir à ta "
"femme. Elle n'avait JAMAIS eu d'orgasme."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:763
msgid "That's the LAST tribal crack you're ever going to make. Prepare to die."
msgstr "C'était ta DERNIERE plaisanterie tribal. Prépare-toi à mourir."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:770
msgid ""
"What, you think a little SHIT like you can fuck MY wife in MY penthouse and "
"say 'NO' when I ask you for a simple favor?"
msgstr ""
"Quoi, tu crois qu'une sous-MERDE comme toi peut se taper MA femme dans MON "
"appartement et me refuser un petit service ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:771
msgid ""
"You think a little SHIT like you can fuck MY daughter in MY penthouse and "
"then say 'NO' when I ask you for a simple favor?"
msgstr ""
"Tu crois qu'une sous-MERDE comme toi peut se taper MA fille dans MON "
"appartement et me refuser un petit service ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:772
msgid ""
"Nothing happened! I swear! I don't care what she said! I was drunk! And "
"high! It was some other hero model, not me!"
msgstr ""
"Il ne s'est rien passé ! J'te l'jure ! Je me fous de ce qu'elle t'a dit ! "
"J'avais bu ! J'étais HS ! C'était un autre personnage héroïque, pas moi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:773
msgid "Get to the POINT, Bishop."
msgstr "Va droit au BUT, Bishop."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:774
msgid ""
"Get to the POINT, Bishop. I don't have time for your faux jealousy, all "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Va droit au BUT, Bishop. J'ai pas de temps à perdre avec tes crises de "
"jalousie, d'accord ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:775
msgid "How about I do your entire family a favor and kill you right now?"
msgstr ""
"Et si je rendais un service à toute ta famille en te tuant tout de suite ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:785
msgid ""
"My wife belongs to ME. Anything that TOUCHES my wife belongs to ME. You got "
"a choice, tribal: either give me a pound\n"
" of flesh, or you take the job, and we're even."
msgstr ""
"Ma femme m'appartient. Tout ce qui TOUCHE à ma femme m'appartient. Tu as le "
"choix, tribal : soit tu me donnes un kilo de viande, soit tu acceptes le "
"boulot et nous sommes quittes."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:786
msgid ""
"My wife belongs to ME. Anything that gets put IN my wife belongs to ME. You "
"got a choice, tribal: either give me a pound\n"
" of flesh, or you take the job, and we're even."
msgstr ""
"Ma femme m'appartient. Tout ce qui entre DANS ma femme m'appartient. Tu as "
"le choix, tribal : soit tu me donnes un kilo de viande, soit tu acceptes le "
"boulot et nous sommes quittes."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:787
msgid ""
"My daughter is MINE. Anything that gets put IN my daughter belongs to ME. "
"You got a choice, tribal: either give me\n"
" a pound of flesh, or you take the job, and we're even."
msgstr ""
"Ma fille m'appartient. Tout ce qui entre DANS ma fille m'appartient. Tu as "
"le choix, tribal : soit tu me donnes un kilo de viande, soit tu acceptes le "
"boulot et nous sommes quittes."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:788
msgid "You can have the pound of flesh... just come get it."
msgstr "Oh, tu peux avoir ton kilo de viande... Si tu viens la chercher."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:789
msgid "All right then. I'll do it..."
msgstr "D'accord. Tu peux compter sur moi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:790
msgid "Your wife ain't WORTH that much."
msgstr "Ta femme ne VAUT pas autant."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:791
msgid "Your daughter ain't WORTH that much."
msgstr "Ta fille ne VAUT pas autant."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:800
msgid ""
"Hey, but before you go... I like the look of your weapons there, tribal... "
"kind of reminds me of this rumor I heard not too\n"
" long ago."
msgstr ""
"Hé, avant de partir... J'aimerais jeter un coup d'oeil sur tes armes, "
"tribal. Ca me fait penser à ces rumeurs que j'ai entendues il n'y a pas très "
"longtemps."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:801
msgid "Rumor?"
msgstr "Des rumeurs ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:805
msgid ""
"Yeah... rumor in the wastes is somebody that matches your description wiped "
"out those raiders south of Vault City. "
msgstr ""
"Ouais... des rumeurs dans le désert. Tu ressembles à quelqu'un qui a tué des "
"pillards au Sud de la Cité de l'Abri."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:806
msgid "Had a big-ass mutant with a vise connected to his shoulder with him. "
msgstr ""
"Il était accompagné d'un mutant avec un gros cul qui portait quelque chose "
"sur les épaules."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:807
msgid "Had some robot with a brain in a dome with him. "
msgstr "Il était accompagné d'un tribal avec un os dans le nez."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:808
msgid "Had some tribal with a bone through his nose with him. "
msgstr "Il était accompagné d'un robot avec le cerveau en calotte."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:809
msgid "What you got to say to that?"
msgstr "Que réponds-tu à ça ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:810
msgid "Say to wut?"
msgstr "Répondre à quoi ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:811
msgid "Oh that was ME! ME! I did it!"
msgstr "Oh, c'était moi ! C'est moi qui l'ai fait."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:812
msgid "Yeah, that was me."
msgstr "Ouais, c'était moi."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:813
msgid "What have I got to say to that? Nothing. Why?"
msgstr "Ce que je réponds à ça ? Rien. Pourquoi ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:814
msgid "Big desert, lots of raiders. Could be you're mistaken."
msgstr "Le désert est grand et plein de pillards. Tu dois te tromper."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:815
msgid ""
"Big desert, lots of character models look like me. Could be you're mistaken."
msgstr ""
"Le désert est grand et plein de personnages comme moi. Tu dois te tromper."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:820
msgid ""
"Well, you must be some kind of ballsy mother fucker to waste all those boys "
"by your lonesome. "
msgstr "Tu dois avoir des couilles pour zigouiller tous ces gars tout seul."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:821
msgid ""
"Well, you must be some kind of badass bitch to waste all those boys by your "
"lonesome. "
msgstr ""
"Tu dois être une sacrée gonzesse pour zigouiller tous ces gars toute seule."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:822
msgid ""
"Could be I don't LIKE what you did down there. COULD be I had some of my "
"best people in that camp."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être que je N'APPRECIE pas ce que tu as fait là-bas ? PEUT-ETRE qu'il y "
"avait mes meilleurs gars dans ce camp !"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:823
msgid ""
"Could be that if any guns get drawn in here, you'll FIND out what happened "
"to those raiders personally."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être que si on introduit les armes ici, tu VERRAS personnellement ce "
"qui est arrivé à ces pillards."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:824
msgid ""
"Maybe you should have trained them better. It was like shooting a bunch of "
"geckos. DRUNK geckos."
msgstr ""
"Tu aurais peut-être dû mieux les entraîner. C'était comme si je tirais sur "
"un troupeau de geckos complètement BOURRES."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:825
msgid ""
"I didn't know they were working for you. They didn't exactly want to talk."
msgstr ""
"Je ne savais pas qu'ils travaillaient pour toi. Ils n'avaient pas exactement "
"l'intention de discuter."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:835
msgid "That so? I think you were there. I think you're responsible. "
msgstr "C'est vrai ? Je croyais que tu étais là-bas. C'est de ta faute."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:836
msgid ""
"Way I see it, you OWE me big, tribal. You gotta do the work of twenty men to "
"pay off that debt. "
msgstr ""
"De mon point de vue, tu as une grosse dette envers moi. Et pour la "
"rembourser, tu devras faire le travail de 20 personnes."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:837
msgid "You take the job, then... maybe... we can call it even."
msgstr "Tu acceptes le boulot, et... on dira que nous sommes quittes."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:838
msgid ""
"Not from where I'm standing. I figure one gunshot to your head oughta clear "
"the debt."
msgstr ""
"Ce n'est pas mon point de vue. Je trouve qu'une balle dans ta petite tête "
"annulerait la dette."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:840
msgid ""
"They attacked ME, Bishop. I don't owe you anything, and I'm not going to do "
"your dirty work. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"C'est MOI qui ai subi une attaque, Bishop. Je ne te dois rien, et je ne "
"ferai pas ton sale boulot. Compris ?"

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:900
msgid "You have delivered Thomas Moore's briefcase."
msgstr "Tu as livré la sacoche de Thomas Moore."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:925
msgid "You have assassinated Westin."
msgstr "Tu as assassiné Westin."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:950
msgid "You whacked Carlson."
msgstr "Tu as zigouillé Carlson."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:975
msgid "You have become a made man of the Bishop family."
msgstr "Maintenant, tu fais partie de la famille Bishop."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:1805
msgid ""
"Yeah... rumor in the wastes is somebody that matches your description helped "
"put a stop to the raiders south of Vault City. "
msgstr ""
"Ouais... des rumeurs dans le désert. Tu ressembles à quelqu'un qui a aidé à "
"mettre un terme aux attaques des pillards au Sud de la Cité de l'Abri."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:1820
msgid ""
"Well, you must be one sly motherfucker to convince their guide to stop "
"leading them through the mountains.\n"
" And it could be I don't LIKE what you did down there."
msgstr ""
"Tu dois être un bel enfoiré de salaud pour convaincre leur guide d'arrêter "
"de les conduire à travers la montagne. Et il se pourrait que je n'AIME pas "
"du tout ce que tu as fait là-bas."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:1836
msgid ""
"Way I see it, you OWE me big, tribal. I don't like people messing with "
"affairs that aren't theirs. "
msgstr ""
"De mon point de vue, tu as une grosse dette envers moi, tribal. Je n'aime "
"pas trop les gens qui fourrent leur nez dans les affaires des autres."

#: dialog/ncbishop.msg:1840
msgid ""
"I don't owe you anything, and I'm not going to do your dirty work. "
"Understand?"
msgstr "Je te dois rien du tout, et je ne ferai pas ton sale boulot. Compris ?"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:100
msgid "You see one of Bishop's men."
msgstr "Tu vois un homme de main de Bishop."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:150
msgid ""
"You see a rugged looking man dressed in leather armor. Numerous scars and "
"gunshot wounds\n"
" cover his body."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un homme à l'air bourru, vêtu d'une cuirasse. Son corps est couvert "
"de nombreuses cicatrices et blessures par balles."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:151
msgid ""
"You see one of Bishop's men. He is scanning the area and fingering his "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un homme de main de Bishop. Il scrute les environs en tripotant son "
"arme."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:201
msgid "::cheers::"
msgstr "::Sourie::"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:202 dialog/vcbarcit.msg:103 dialog/vcdarrow.msg:103
#: dialog/vcfarrel.msg:103 dialog/vcgenfam.msg:103 dialog/vcwrkcit.msg:103
msgid "::claps::"
msgstr "::Applaudissements::"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:210 dialog/ncliljes.msg:230 dialog/ncmormen.msg:210
msgid "Nice piece you got there, "
msgstr "Joli morceau que tu as là !"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:215
msgid "Uh, why are you sneaking around, "
msgstr "Hé, qu'est-ce que tu fous par ici, "

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:216
msgid "Uh, hey, "
msgstr "Hé... hé, "

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:225
msgid "You just walked into the wrong place, dipshit."
msgstr "Tu t'es trompé d'endroit, enflure."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:232
msgid "You just walked into the wrong place, bitch."
msgstr "Tu t'es trompé d'endroit, trouduc !"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:268
msgid ""
"Honey, you can't be carryin' weapons in here. Heh-heh... you're deadly "
"enough as it is."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas te laisser montrer ton arme à tout le monde, désolé."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:284
msgid "Loved \"Vault Sex-Teen.\" It was inspiring. A cinematic tour-de-force."
msgstr ""
"Si tu cherches des rôles qui demandent de l'endurance, je suis ton homme."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:285 dialog/nccaspat.msg:256 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:205
#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:230 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:205 dialog/ncdrgdlr.msg:203
#: dialog/ncjunkie.msg:215 dialog/ncliljes.msg:203 dialog/ncmormen.msg:203
#: dialog/ncnikki.msg:202 dialog/ncperson.msg:267 dialog/ncpimp.msg:266
#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:254 dialog/ncprosti.msg:288 dialog/ncprosti.msg:434
#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:626 dialog/ncprosti.msg:789 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1022
#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:1197 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1370 dialog/ncwritee.msg:202
#: dialog/zidcegrl.msg:202
msgid "::Whistles::"
msgstr "::Siffle::"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:320
msgid "I *thought* I smelled mutant. You better get his yellow ass outta here."
msgstr "Ca sent le mutant, ici. Vire ton pote, et vite."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:326
msgid "I'm hitting the Cat's Paw after work."
msgstr "Il faut aimer Reno..."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:330
msgid ""
"I thought the President was a myth, a boogey man used to scare children."
msgstr ""
"Je croyais que le Président était un mythe, une sorte de père Fouettard pour "
"faire peur aux enfants."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:331 dialog/ncmormen.msg:361
msgid ""
"You look like you've been through hell and back. Relax a little. You deserve "
"it."
msgstr ""
"New Reno a été conçu par Chris Avellone, le scénario est de Tom French. Le "
"bruit court qu'ils vont bientôt se marier."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:332
msgid ""
"They were gonna dump some new virus into the air? Bastards. Hope you shot a "
"few for me."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que tu avais esquinté l'Enclave au Sud. C'est courageux."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:333
msgid "You might want to replay the game as a different character."
msgstr "Tu devrais recommencer avec un nouveau type de personnage."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:334 dialog/ncsalmen.msg:161
msgid "You've got some serious muscle to bust the Enclave like you did."
msgstr ""
"Tu dois avoir de sacrés muscles pour vaincre l'Enclave comme tu l'as fait !"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:335
msgid ""
"Just wandering around after you're done, picking up some EXPs, huh? Well, "
"please don't\n"
" kill ME, 'kay?"
msgstr ""
"Tu te fais les derniers points d'expérience disponible, hein ? Me tue pas, "
"je ne vaux rien, mon équipement non plus."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:336
msgid ""
"New Reno was designed by Chris Avellone and scripted by Tom French. Rumor "
"has it they will\n"
" marry soon."
msgstr ""
"New Reno a été conçu par Chris Avellone, le scénario est de Tom French. Le "
"bruit court qu'ils vont bientôt se marier."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:337
msgid ""
"I hope I get to be a major character in Fallout 3, like Tandi or Ian. Being "
"a thug sucks."
msgstr ""
"J'espère que j'aurais un super rôle dans Fallout 3. Etre un garde, c'est "
"chiant."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:338
msgid "Yeah, I scored with Tandi once. When she was young, I mean."
msgstr ""
"J'ai déjà eu un rancard avec Tandi... Quand elle était jeune, bien sûr !"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:339
msgid "That Lynette chick is in bad need of some lovin', y'know?"
msgstr "Lynette... Elle n'est pas trop désespérée, sexuellement parlant ?"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:340
msgid "Heard you busted up that Enclave down South. Pretty brave."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que tu avais esquinté l'Enclave au Sud. C'est courageux."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:353
msgid ""
"I heard Tommy the Balls is back in town, checking up on things. Watch out "
"for him."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que \"Tommy Les Boules\" était de retour, il a peut-être "
"besoin de main-d'oeuvre."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:354
msgid "You see Tommy the Balls, stay outta his way."
msgstr "Si tu vois \"Tommy Les Boules\", évite d'encombrer son chemin."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:355
msgid "Put in a good word with Bishop for me?"
msgstr "Tu passeras le bonjour à John de ma part !"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:356
msgid "Nice threads. Wish I had it in good with the boss, too."
msgstr ""
"Pas mal, tes fringues ! Moi aussi j'aimerais être dans les petits papiers du "
"patron."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:357
msgid "Any tips for a fella like me?"
msgstr "Je peux t'apporter quelque chose, patron ?"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:358
msgid "Family Bishop's been good to me."
msgstr "John Bishop m'a toujours aidé."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:359
msgid "John Bishop is gonna rule this town."
msgstr "John Bishop va bientôt dominer la ville."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:360 dialog/ncsalmen.msg:258
msgid "Everything's been pretty quiet today."
msgstr "Tout a été plutôt calme aujourd'hui."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:361
msgid "Storm's coming."
msgstr "Une tornade arrive."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:362
msgid "Stink from Golgotha was awful last night."
msgstr "Ils ont enterré un sacré pestiféré à Golgotha, la nuit dernière."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:363
msgid "When we gonna whack one of the other families?"
msgstr "Quand allons-nous dégommer une famille concurrente ?"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:364
msgid "With you on our side, those other families don't stand a chance, boss."
msgstr "Avec toi de notre côté, les autres familles vont souffrir."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:365
msgid "Get you anything, boss?"
msgstr "Besoin de quelque chose ?"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:366
msgid "Any word on the other families?"
msgstr "Des infos sur la concurrence ?"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:367
msgid "Um, got any Jet?"
msgstr "Euh, t'as du Jet de côté ?"

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:368
msgid "I sure could use a drink..."
msgstr "J'ai soif, mais mon script m'empêche de boire."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:369
msgid "Mrs. Bishop was checking me out again. It makes me uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"Bishop est dur, mais c'est le prix à payer pour être une famille solide."

#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:370
msgid ""
"Mrs. Bishop keeps looking at me like a slab of beef. I wish she'd realize "
"that I just\n"
" want to be held."
msgstr ""
"La femme Bishop n'a jamais porté le moindre regard sur moi. Le jour où elle "
"saura tout sur mes envies..."

