#: dialog/ncbismen.msg:393 dialog/nccaspat.msg:241 dialog/ncliljes.msg:350
#: dialog/ncmormen.msg:268 dialog/ncperson.msg:293 dialog/ncsalmen.msg:295
msgid ""
