#: dialog/nccasbou.msg:352
msgid ""
"Busting the Enclave makes you almost as much a badass as Tommy the Balls."
msgstr ""
"Avoir détruit l'Enclave fait de toi un mec pratiquement aussi dur que \"Tommy"
