"t'observe, méfiant."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:151
msgid "You see Keith Wright. He's looking at you warily."
msgstr "Tu vois Keith Wright. Il t'observe, méfiant."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:201
msgid "Whatdya want?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:230
msgid "Make another move toward that door, an' you'll be sorry."
msgstr "Un autre pas vers cette porte, et tu vas le regretter."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:250
msgid ""
"Slaver, you done come to the wrong side of town. If you don't start explain' "
"yourself, yer gonna be\n"
" in a whole mess of trouble."
msgstr ""
"Tu te trompes de quartier, sale esclavagiste. Soit tu t'expliques, et vite, "
"soit tu vas avoir de gros problèmes... et vite !"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:251
msgid ""
"I don't know you, my Dad don't know you, and if you don't start explainin', "
"it ain't gonna matter."
msgstr ""
"Je te connais pas, mon papa te connaît pas, et si tu t'expliques pas, ça "
"n'aura plus d'importance."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:252
msgid "How's it goin', "
msgstr "Comment va, "

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:253
msgid "Thanks for finding out who killed Richard, "
msgstr "Merci d'avoir découvert l'assassin de Richard, "

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:254
msgid "Whatdya want now?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:256
msgid "Jabawokee Ding Dong"
msgstr "Jabawokee Ding Dong."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:259
msgid "I'm looking for a job. Chris sent me by. Is Family Wright hiring?"
msgstr ""
"Je cherche du boulot. C'est Chris qui m'envoie. La famille Wright embauche-t-"
"elle ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:262
msgid "Hey, Keith. I ran into your Mom."
msgstr "Salut, Keith. J'ai croisé ta maman."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:263
msgid "Can you tell me about your brother Richard?"
msgstr "Tu peux me parler de ton frère Richard ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:280
msgid ""
"Get outta here, dimbulb. Next time you talk to me, I'll plug you fulla holes."
msgstr ""
"Casse-toi pauv'tache. Si jamais tu me reparles, je te fais des trous partout."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:281
msgid "Holes holes holes in my soles"
msgstr "Trous, trous, trous, dans mes genoux."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:282
msgid "Shamma Lamma DING DONG"
msgstr "Shamma Lamma DING DONG."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:290
msgid "Get outta here! I ain't warning you again!"
msgstr "Casse-toi ! Je le redirai pas !"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:291
msgid "A-gin, my shin, lots of din-din"
msgstr "Répa, répare, si j'pars..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:292
msgid "DING DONG! DING DONG!"
msgstr "DING DONG ! DING DONG !"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:300
msgid "I warned you, dim..."
msgstr "Je t'ai averti, mou du..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:310
msgid ""
"I'm Keith Wright of the Family Wright. Now, you gonna tell me what yer doing "
"here?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis Keith Wright, de la Famille Wright. Bon, tu me dis ce qui t'amène ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:312
msgid "Chris told me to stop by. I'm looking for work. Can you help me?"
msgstr "Chris m'a dit de passer. Je cherche du boulot. Tu peux m'aider ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:313
msgid "Keith Wright, huh? I ran into your mother."
msgstr "Keith Wright, hein ? J'ai croisé ta mère."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:325
msgid ""
"This is the Family Wright HOUSE. Now, you gonna tell me what yer doing here?"
msgstr ""
"Ici, c'est la MAISON de la Famille Wright. Alors, tu me dis ce qui t'amène ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:335
msgid "Chris sent you, huh?"
msgstr "C'est Chris qui t'envoie, hein ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:336
msgid "That's right. He said you might have some work for me."
msgstr "Oui. Il a dit que tu aurais peut-être du boulot pour moi."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:345
msgid "I don't know if it'd do any good, but I guess I could ask Pa..."
msgstr "Je sais pas si ça servira à grand-chose, mais je vais demander à p'pa."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:346
msgid "If you could, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr "Entendu, merci d'avance."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:355
msgid "Naw... we don't hire muscle like the other families, 'least not now. "
msgstr ""
"Nan... On n'engage pas de gros bras comme les autres familles, en tout cas, "
"pas pour l'instant. "

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:356
msgid "Naw... we don't traffic with slaver trash like the other families. "
msgstr ""
"Nan... On bosse pas avec ces ordures d'esclavagistes comme les autres "
"familles. "

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:357
msgid "You better git."
msgstr "Tu ferais mieux de filer."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:358
msgid "I'm not leaving until I see Mr. Wright."
msgstr "Je ne partirai pas sans voir M. Wright."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:365
msgid ""
"Naw, I reckon you WILL be leaving, 'cause you look like the kinda person who "
"likes living. Now get."
msgstr ""
"Ah, je crois que tu vas partir, parce que tu as l'air de tenir à la vie. "
"Allez, file."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:366
msgid "I'm NOT leaving."
msgstr "Je ne partirai PAS."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:375
msgid "I WARNED you..."
msgstr "Je t'avais PREVENU..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:376
msgid "You want some of THIS, BOY?! You want some of THIS?! Then come GET s --"
msgstr "C'est CA que tu veux ??? Vraiment ??? Allons VIENS, on va --"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:380
msgid "Uh... what about her? Has she gotten herself in trouble again?"
msgstr "Heu... Et alors ? Elle a encore réussi à se mettre dans la panade ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:381
msgid "No. Is that a common occurrence?"
msgstr "Non. Ca lui arrive souvent ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:383
msgid "No, I was just curious. Later, Keith."
msgstr "Non, simple curiosité. A plus tard, Keith."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:390
msgid ""
"Sometimes. She's always preachin' and hollerin' about the evils o' drink and "
"gamblin' and damn\n"
" near everything else. Causes quite a stir, sometimes, and gets Dad real "
"upset."
msgstr ""
"Des fois. Elle arrête pas de prêcher contre la boisson, le jeu et le reste, "
"rapport que c'est les instruments du Malin. Il y a des jours où ça fait du "
"raffut, et p'pa en a marre."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:391
msgid "Does your Mom have any idea what your family does?"
msgstr "Ta Maman sait ce que fait ta famille ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:392
msgid "I'll bet. Well, thanks for talking with me, Keith."
msgstr "J'imagine. Merci d'avoir discuté avec moi, Keith."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:400
msgid ""
"Naw, she don't know half of it. She thinks Dad's all clean and above the "
"board, but she ain't too\n"
" bright to catch on to what he's doin'. If she found that still beneath the "
"train station, she'd raise cain, she would."
msgstr ""
"Non, elle en sait pas la moitié. Elle croit que Papa est réglo, mais elle "
"est pas assez futée pour comprendre ce qu'il fait. Si elle découvrait cet "
"alambic sous la gare, elle ferait un sacré foin."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:401
msgid "I see. Thanks, Keith."
msgstr "Je vois. Merci, Keith."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:410
msgid ""
"(Shakes head.) She done it this time, wrecking Pa's stills n' all. The "
"workers were too afraid\n"
" ta stop her, and Pa threw a fit, and she threw one right back at him. "
"(Shrugs.) It'll take Pa a while to\n"
" get back up on his feet."
msgstr ""
"[Il secoue la tête.] Une fois, elle a démoli les alambics de p'pa. Les "
"ouvriers avaient trop peur pour l'arrêter, p'pa s'est mis dans une rage "
"folle, et elle aussi. [Il hausse les épaules.] Il va lui en falloir, du "
"temps, à p'pa, pour s'en remettre."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:420
msgid "Good kid. Damn, if we ever find out who done it to him..."
msgstr "Un bon môme. Merde, si jamais on trouve qui lui a fait ça..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:421
msgid "Any ideas who might've done it?"
msgstr "Tu as une idée de qui pourrait avoir fait ça ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:422
msgid "Well, hopefully you'll find the killer. Bye, Keith."
msgstr "Bon, j'espère que tu trouveras le tueur. Salut, Keith."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:430
msgid ""
"Lotta other families sell Jet, coulda been any one of them. Mordino's got "
"the most Jet dealers, though,\n"
" cause they make the most Jet. Me, I'm bettin' it was one of them."
msgstr ""
"Il y a plein d'autres familles qui vendent du Jet, ça pourrait être "
"n'importe laquelle. Mais c'est Mordino qui a le plus de dealers et qui en "
"fabrique le plus. Je parie que c'est l'un d'eux."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:431
msgid "What dealers do you suspect?"
msgstr "Tu soupçonnes quels dealers ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:432
msgid "Can you tell me a little about Richard?"
msgstr "Tu peux m'en dire un peu plus sur Richard ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:440
msgid ""
"Bunch of 'em: Jagged Jimmy J on 2nd Street, that old sonuvabitch Renesco in "
"the West End... and Jules\n"
" deals, too, at th' fronta town, but mostly to dumb tourists. Then there's "
"Little Jesus Mordino."
msgstr ""
"Plusieurs. Jimmy J l'édenté sur la 2ème Rue, ce vieux salaud de Renesco dans "
"le West End... Il y a Jules qui refourgue à l'entrée de la ville, surtout à "
"des pigeons de touristes. Et il y a P'tit Jésus Mordino."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:441
msgid "Little Jesus Mordino?"
msgstr "P'tit Jésus Mordino ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:442
msgid "Can you tell me a little more about Richard?"
msgstr "Tu peux m'en dire un peu plus sur Richard ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:443
msgid "Thanks for the info, Keith."
msgstr "Merci du renseignement, Keith."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:450
msgid ""
"Quiet kid, clean kid. Kept outta trouble, and for a Wright, that's "
"something. We buried\n"
" him on the Golgotha plains a while ago, but even so, Mom still don't want "
"his room disturbed.\n"
" It's hard for her to let go, y'know?"
msgstr ""
"Un gosse calme, clean. Il évitait les ennuis, et c'est pas courant, pour un "
"Wright. On l'a enterré à Golgotha il y a quelque temps, mais m'man veut "
"toujours pas qu'on touche à sa chambre. Elle se fait pas à l'idée qu'il est "
"plus là."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:451
msgid ""
"Which room was his? Do you think your mother would mind if I looked in there?"
msgstr ""
"C'était laquelle, sa chambre ? Tu crois que ta mère refuserait que j'y jette "
"un coup d'oeil ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:452
msgid "Any dealers you suspect may have given him the Jet?"
msgstr "A ton avis, quels dealers lui ont refilé du Jet ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:454
msgid "Buried in Golgotha, huh? Hmmm. Thanks for the info, Keith."
msgstr "Enterré à Golgotha, hein ? Hum. Merci du renseignement, Keith."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:460
msgid ""
"His room? It's the empty one next to Mom's room, the second one down from "
"the kitchen. As fer looking around... well... look, don't stay\n"
" long... and don't mess the place up, or Mom'll pop a clip if she finds out."
msgstr ""
"Sa chambre ? La pièce centrale de ce côté-ci de la maison. Jeter un coup "
"d'oeil, heu... Ecoute, reste pas longtemps, et touche à rien, ou m'man va "
"couler une bielle si elle s'en aperçoit."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:461
msgid "Thanks, Keith. I won't be long."
msgstr "Merci, Keith. Je ferai vite."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:470
msgid ""
"Hold on. (Knocks on door behind him.) Pa? (He sticks his head in, there's "
"some mumbling, then he comes back and nods at the door.)\n"
" You ken go in, but watch out. Dad's in a pissy mood."
msgstr ""
"Attends. [Il frappe à la porte derrière lui.] P'pa ? [Il passe la tête par "
"l'entrebâillement, on entend murmurer, puis il ressort la tête.] Tu peux "
"entrer, mais fais gaffe, p'pa est d'une sale humeur."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:480
msgid ""
"He's Big Jesus' son. A bastard, more like. He mighta caught Richard alone, "
"then pumped him fulla\n"
" Jet outta spite. You looking for him, check out the Desperado. Little Jesus "
"hangs out there with his old man."
msgstr ""
"Le fils de Big Jésus. Le bâtard, plutôt. Il a pu trouver Richard seul et le "
"gaver de Jet par méchanceté. Si tu le cherches, passe au Desperado. P'tit "
"Jésus y traîne souvent avec son vieux."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:1220
msgid ". What's goin' on?"
msgstr ". Que se passe-t-il ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:1252
msgid ". Everybody treating you all right? Anything I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
". Tout le monde s'occupe bien de toi ? Je peux faire quelque chose pour toi ?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:1253
msgid ""
". We owe you big, and the Wrights always pay their debts. What can I do for "
"you?"
msgstr ""
". On te doit une fière chandelle et les Wright paient toujours leurs dettes. "
"Que puis-je pour toi ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:100
msgid "You see Miss Kitty."
msgstr "Tu vois Miss Kitty."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:150
msgid ""
"You see a stunning woman. Despite her... revealing dress, her bearing is "
"professional and businesslike."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois une superbe créature. Même si sa robe est assez... suggestive, elle "
"se comporte en femme d'affaires."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:200
msgid ""
"First quarter revenues are up slightly... now, if we account for the "
"increased tribute..."
msgstr ""
"Les revenus du premier trimestre sont en hausse... Bon, si on tient compte "
"de l'augmentation du pourcentage..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:201
msgid "If I catch her taking Jet, even a *whiff,* she's out of here..."
msgstr ""
"Si je la vois prendre du Jet, même rien qu'une *dose*, je la jette dehors..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:202
msgid ""
"Monthly physicals are coming around again... right in time for the new "
"caravan season."
msgstr ""
"Bientôt la visite médicale mensuelle... Juste à temps pour l'arrivée des "
"caravanes."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:203
msgid "Need to get some more girls for that pool party at Bishop's..."
msgstr "Il faut quelques filles de plus pour la piscine-party chez Bishop..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:204
msgid "Damn Macrosoft spreadsheets..."
msgstr "Saletés de feuilles de calcul Macrosoft..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:205
msgid ""
"Spend so much time updating these spreadsheets, I don't get any REAL work "
"done."
msgstr ""
"Je passe tant de temps à mettre à jour ces feuilles de calcul que je n'ai "
"plus le temps de BOSSER."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:206
msgid "Jules better send some horny... and wealthy... people this way soon."
msgstr ""
"Jules ferait mieux d'envoyer par ici des gens aux bourses... et à la "
"bourse... bien garnies. Et vite."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:215
msgid ""
"(The woman before you is stunningly beautiful. As you address her, she looks "
"up from her work, and\n"
" smiles.) Ah, a new face! I'm Miss Kitty... welcome to the Cat's Paw."
msgstr ""
"[La femme devant toi est d'une beauté renversante. Lorsque tu t'adresses à "
"elle, elle lève la tête et sourit.] Ah ! Une nouvelle tête ! Je suis Miss "
"Kitty... Bienvenue au Cat's Paw."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:216
msgid "Hello again!"
msgstr "Rebonjour !"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:217
msgid "Why, if it isn't Reno's most famous prizefighter!"
msgstr "Tiens, mais c'est la star de la boxe la plus célèbre de Reno !"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:218
msgid "I wondered when Mr. "
msgstr "Je me demandais quand M. "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:219
msgid "My, my, if isn't the star of the golden screen."
msgstr "Tiens, tiens, mais c'est la star de l'écran."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:220
msgid " What's your pleasure today, sir?"
msgstr " Qu'est-ce qui vous ferait plaisir aujourd'hui, monsieur ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:221
msgid " What's your pleasure today, miss?"
msgstr " Qu'est-ce qui vous ferait plaisir aujourd'hui, mademoiselle ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:222
msgid "preshshure?"
msgstr "Plaisir ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:223
msgid "Yuu haf prettee hair"
msgstr "Toi... jolis cheveux."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:224
msgid "Yuu said 'pleashure' Huh-Huh-Huh-Huh-Huh"
msgstr "Tu as dit plaisir... <Hé hé hé hé hé>"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:225
msgid ""
"George sayz we gonna haf a few achers of owr own an' I shud keep away from "
"yuu or he won't lemme\n"
" play wit the rabbitz so me go now"
msgstr ""
"George y dit qu'on fa afoir des prob'èmes et qu'y faut plus que j'te voye ou "
"y me laissera plus jouer avec les lapins alors j'y vais maintenant."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:226
msgid "Jules told me to come here if I was looking for some... action."
msgstr "Jules m'a dit de venir ici si je cherchais de... l'action."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:227
msgid "I'm looking for some... action."
msgstr "Je cherche de... l'action."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:228
msgid "Actually, I'd like to ask you some questions."
msgstr "En fait, je voudrais te poser quelques questions."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:229
msgid ""
"You know, I've been finding magazines named \"Cat's Paw\" throughout the "
"desert, and I have no\n"
" idea what they are. I have one right here."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, j'ai trouvé des magazines intitulés « Cat's Paw » dans le désert, "
"et je ne sais pas ce que c'est. J'en ai un ici."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:230
msgid "Here's that collection of Cat's Paw magazines you asked for."
msgstr "Voici la collection de magazines Cat's Paw demandée."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:240
msgid ""
"(The pretty lady puts the palm of her hand on your forehead.) Oh, you poor "
"thing... you can stay in here\n"
" for a little while to get in from the heat, but you can't be here too long, "
"okay? Promise me now."
msgstr ""
" [La jolie dame met la paume de sa main sur ton front.] Oh... Pauvre de "
"toi... Tu peux rester ici un moment pour t'abriter de la chaleur, mais pas "
"longtemps, d'accord ? Promets-le-moi."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:241
msgid "Okayy, pretty ladee fank you"
msgstr "D'accord cholie madame merfi."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:245
msgid ""
"(Smiles and winks.) Is that so? Well, then, you've come to the right place. "
"Whatever your pleasure or\n"
" fantasy, we can provide it... and don't be shy, we've heard it all. So, "
"what would you like?"
msgstr ""
"[Elle sourit et te fait un clin d'oeil.] Ah bon ? Dans ce cas, tu es au bon "
"endroit. Quel que soit le genre de plaisir que tu cherches, on te le "
"donnera... Ne sois pas timide, on a l'habitude. Qu'aimerais-tu ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:246
msgid ""
"Well, pardon me for coming on strong, but I'd like to get to know YOU "
"better. What time do you get off?\n"
" Uh, work, I mean."
msgstr ""
"Pardon de poser des questions aussi directes, mais j'aimerais mieux TE "
"connaître. A quelle heure tu tires ? Euh, à quelle heure tu te tires d'ici, "
"je veux dire."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:247
msgid "Depends... what's on the menu?"
msgstr "Ca dépend... Qu'y a-t-il au menu ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:248
msgid "I'd like to hook up my friend here with a little something special."
msgstr "Mon ami ici présent aimerait quelque chose de spécial."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:249
msgid "I'd like to hook up one of my friends here. It's their... uh, birthday."
msgstr ""
"Un de mes amis ici présent aimerait quelque chose de spécial. C'est son... "
"Heu, son anniversaire."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:250
msgid "I'd like to ask you some questions..."
msgstr "J'aimerais te poser quelques questions."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:251
msgid "Actually, I've changed my mind. Performance anxiety and all. Goodbye."
msgstr "En fait, j'ai changé d'avis. Le trac, tout ça... Au revoir."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:255
msgid "I'm flattered, but... no. I can't."
msgstr "J'apprécie, mais... non. Je ne peux pas."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:256
msgid "Aw, c'mon. Just a drink. No pressure. We'll have a great time."
msgstr "Juste un verre, allons. Ce sera avec plaisir. On va s'amuser."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:257
msgid ""
"Look, if you don't like women, that's fine. Hell, I don't like most women I "
"meet. We have something in\n"
" common already."
msgstr ""
"Si tu n'aimes pas les femmes, tant pis. Je ne les aime pas moi non plus. Ca "
"nous fait déjà un point commun."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:258
msgid "Hey, don't worry... I won't wear the power armor, okay?"
msgstr "Hé, ne t'en fais pas... J'enlèverai la SuperArmure, d'accord ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:259
msgid "All right then. I'd like to ask you some questions..."
msgstr "D'accord. J'aimerais te poser quelques questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:260
msgid "Sorry, didn't mean to pressure you. Goodbye."
msgstr "Je regrette, je m'en voudrais d'insister. Au revoir."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:265
msgid ""
"(Looks around, then leans in and whispers.) Look... come back after\n"
" you've done what you've had to do to save your people, and then we'll talk, "
"okay?"
msgstr ""
"(Elle jette un regard alentour, puis se penche vers toi.) Ecoute, reviens "
"quand tu auras sauvé ton peuple, et on aura une petite discussion, d'accord ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:267
msgid "It's a date. See you then."
msgstr "C'est noté. Au revoir, alors."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:275
msgid ""
"Well...(Ticks off the menu on her fingers.)...we have honey loving, the "
"dipstick swirl, humjobs, and various\n"
" other exotica. (Smiles.) Question is, what are YOU in the mood for?"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien... [Elle énumère le menu sur ses doigts.] On a l'amour au miel, la "
"fille-trempette, toutes sortes de sucettes, et diverses autres spécialités. ["
"Elle sourit.] De quoi as-tu envie, TOI ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:276
msgid "I'd like some... oral attention."
msgstr "J'aimerais un truc plutôt... oral."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:277
msgid "Just some basic, raunchy, low-down, dirty sex oughta do me just fine."
msgstr "Une bonne coucherie bien sale serait parfaite."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:278
msgid "I'd like a full upper and lower body workout."
msgstr "Je voudrais la totale."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:279
msgid "Is it okay if I just, you know, talk with them?"
msgstr "Pourrais-je, hum... juste parler avec elles ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:280
msgid "I have a special... dramatic... request."
msgstr "J'ai une requête assez... spéciale."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:290 dialog/vcmoore.msg:216
msgid "All right then. "
msgstr "Bon, très bien."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:291
msgid "(Winks.) That'll be no charge."
msgstr " [Clin d'oeil.] C'est gratuit."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:292
msgid "That'll be "
msgstr " Ca fera... "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:293
msgid "Done. Here's the money."
msgstr "Marché conclu. Voilà l'argent."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:294
msgid "Can't argue about that price. Let's do it."
msgstr "C'est donné. Allons-y tout de suite."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:295
msgid "Nevermind. I'd like to ask you some questions..."
msgstr "Peu importe. J'aimerais te poser d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:296
msgid "I don't have enough money... maybe another time."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas assez d'argent... Une autre fois, peut-être."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:320
msgid "Why, of course you can. We call it the \"Kesting special.\" "
msgstr " Bien sûr. On appelle ça le « Kesting spécial »."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:322
msgid "Only costs "
msgstr " Ca ne coûte que "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:323
msgid "Why do you call it that?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est-ce que ça s'appelle comme ça ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:325
msgid "Sounds like a deal. I'll take that then."
msgstr "Bonne affaire. Je prends."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:326
msgid "Maybe some other time. I'd like to ask you some questions..."
msgstr "Une autre fois, peut-être. Je voudrais te poser quelques questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:335
msgid ""
"Well... rumor has it there was once an employee of a famous computer company "
"who enjoyed talking with\n"
" others. (Shrugs.) "
msgstr ""
" Ah... D'après la rumeur, c'était le nom d'un employé d'une célèbre société "
"informatique qui adorait discuter avec les gens. [Elle hausse les épaules.]"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:336
msgid "By coincidence, he also only made "
msgstr " Il se trouve aussi qu'il ne gagnait que "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:337
msgid ""
"By coincidence, he also made no money at all, so talking was all he could "
"afford."
msgstr ""
" Il se trouve aussi qu'il ne gagnait pas du tout d'argent. Donc, tout ce "
"qu'il pouvait se payer, c'était ça."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:338
msgid "Oh. Well, sign me up for the talking session then. Here's the "
msgstr "Oh, je vais prendre la discussion, alors. Voici les "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:340
msgid "I think I'll pass. I'd like to ask you some questions..."
msgstr "Je passe. Je voudrais te poser quelques questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:351
msgid "Well, there's no harm in asking..."
msgstr "Pose toujours..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:352
msgid "All right. (Smiles.) Answers might cost you, though..."
msgstr ""
"D'accord. [Elle sourit.] Mais les réponses ne seront peut-être pas "
"gratuites..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:353
msgid "Sure. What questions did you have?"
msgstr "Bien sûr. Lesquelles ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:354
msgid "I heard some of your girls are chosen to go... visit Myron."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que certaines de tes filles... rendent visite à Myron, "
"parfois."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:355
msgid "Jules told me to come here for some... action."
msgstr "Jules m'a dit de venir ici si je voulais m'amuser."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:361
msgid "Actually, I better be going."
msgstr "En fait, je ferais mieux de partir."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:375
msgid "Chances are that we can accommodate you. Your request would be...?"
msgstr ""
"Il y a toutes les chances que nous puissions la satisfaire. De quoi s'agit-"
"il ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:376
msgid ""
"I'd like my partner to dress up in a Vault jumpsuit, call me the \"Vault "
"Dweller,\" and I've got to find\n"
" their \"Vault Sex-Teen.\""
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais que la personne mette une combinaison de l'abri et m'appelle « "
"Habitant de l'Abri » pendant que j'essaie de trouver son petit abri..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:377
msgid ""
"I'd like to be \"captured\" by some ravishing she-mutant, then be forced to "
"take a dip in her mutating \"vat.\""
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais *tomber aux mains* d'une charmante mutante qui me forcerait à "
"plonger dans sa *cuve* de mutation."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:378
msgid ""
"I'd like to play the role of \"Herk,\" a nubile young slave stolen from his "
"village by a band of lusty\n"
" female slavers. Here's the catch... he can only communicate using his BODY."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais jouer le rôle de « Herk », un jeune esclave nubile enlevé par des "
"esclavagistes femelles. Il ne pourrait communiquer qu'au moyen de son CORPS."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:379
msgid ""
"I'd like to play the role of \"Zena,\" a nubile young slave stolen from her "
"village by a band of\n"
" slavers. Here's the catch... she can only communicate using her BODY."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais jouer le rôle de « Zena », une jeune esclave nubile enlevée par "
"des esclavagistes. Elle ne pourrait communiquer qu'au moyen de son CORPS."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:380
msgid ""
"I'd like to be \"captured\" by a sarcastic mutant lieutenant, interrogated "
"roughly, then dunked\n"
" in his mutating vats."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais *tomber aux mains* d'un lieutenant mutant sarcastique qui me "
"malmènerait et qui me plongerait dans ses *cuves* de mutation."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:381
msgid ""
"You have any girls that look like Angela Bishop? I need to work off some "
"excitement."
msgstr ""
"Tu as des filles qui ressemblent à Angela Bishop ? Il me faut un exutoire, "
"là."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:382
msgid ""
"You have any girls that look like Mrs. Bishop? I need to work off some "
"excitement."
msgstr ""
"Tu as des filles qui ressemblent à Mme Bishop ? Il me faut un exutoire, là."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:383
msgid "I'd like to ask you some questions instead..."
msgstr "J'aimerais plutôt te poser quelques questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:384
msgid "Actually, Nevermind. I've got to go."
msgstr "Peu importe, en fait. Il faut que je parte."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:395
msgid "Of course. (Scans your companions.) Which one?"
msgstr "Bien sûr. [Elle passe en revue tes compagnons.] Lequel ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:396
msgid ""
"Could you take care of Lenny? I don't think he's ever even kissed a girl."
msgstr ""
"Tu pourrais t'occuper de Lenny ? Je me demande s'il a jamais embrassé une "
"fille."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:397
msgid "You got anyone who can, uh, \"handle\" Marcus?"
msgstr "Tu as quelqu'un qui pourrait, heu, *s'occuper* de Marcus ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:398
msgid "This little pervert Myron here."
msgstr "Ce petit pervers de Myron, là."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:399
msgid "\"Bone Nose\" here, if you catch my drift. Heh heh."
msgstr "*Dans l'os*, là, si tu vois ce que je veux dire. <Hé hé>"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:400
msgid "Cassidy here. I think it's been a while."
msgstr "Cassidy, là. Je crois que ça fait longtemps, pour lui."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:401
msgid "Vic. \"Trader\" Vic."
msgstr "Vic. Vic « le Marchand »."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:402
msgid ""
"Can one of your girls read the dictionary to Robobrain? It stimulates his "
"brain center."
msgstr ""
"Est-ce qu'une de tes filles peut lire le dictionnaire à Robo-cerveau ? Ca "
"stimule ce qui lui sert de neurones."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:403
msgid "Doc's looking to take a \"temperature\" or two."
msgstr "Doc aimerait bien *prendre la température* à quelqu'un."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:404
msgid "Davin here could use... a lot... more experience."
msgstr "Davin aurait besoin d'acquérir plus... beaucoup plus... de pratique."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:405
msgid "Miria wants to take a walk on the wild side."
msgstr "Miria veut voir la vie sous tous les angles."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:406
msgid "Actually, no one, thanks."
msgstr "En fait, non, merci."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:407
msgid ""
"Dex here. Better keep an eye on him though, he can get a little out of "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois Dex. Tu ferais bien de garder un oeil sur lui, il peut-être un peu "
"incontrôlable."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:408
msgid "Cat Jules here. Watch out though, he might bite the girls."
msgstr "Voici Cat Jules. Fais gaffe, il pourrait mordre les filles."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:409
msgid ""
"Kitsune here. Hopefully you can satisfy her Asian needs, if you know what I "
"mean."
msgstr ""
"Voici Kitsune. Avec un peu de chance tu as quelque chose ici pour satisfaire "
"ses exigences asiatiques, si tu vois ce que je veux dire."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:420
msgid ""
"This your friend here? (Looks your companion up and down, nods.) I think we "
"can accommodate you... "
msgstr ""
"C'est cette personne, là ? [Elle la regarde et hoche la tête.] Je crois que "
"nous pouvons trouver quelque chose pour toi. "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:421
msgid ""
"(Looks your companion up and down, nods.) I think we can accommodate you... "
msgstr ""
"[Elle regarde la personne que tu as désignée et hoche la tête.] Je crois que "
"nous pouvons trouver quelque chose pour toi. "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:422 dialog/ncslots.msg:153
msgid " chips."
msgstr " dollars."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:423
msgid "Don't worry about the money. There's no charge."
msgstr "Ne t'en fais pas pour l'argent. C'est gratuit."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:424
msgid "Okay. Here you go."
msgstr "Bon, allons-y."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:425
msgid "Can't argue with that price. Done."
msgstr "C'est un prix qui ne se refuse pas. Marché conclu."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:426
msgid "Maybe later... look, I had some other questions."
msgstr "Peut-être plus tard... Bon, j'avais d'autres questions."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:427
msgid "Hmmm. Maybe some other time when I have enough cash."
msgstr "Hum. Peut-être une autre fois, quand j'aurai assez d'argent."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:428
msgid "Actually, I've changed my mind. Goodbye."
msgstr "En fait, j'ai changé d'avis. Au revoir."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:440
msgid ""
"(Looks surprised.) Let me see. (Glances at magazine.) Well, well... you "
"know, I had heard a rumor that\n"
" - in the pre-war years -- the Cat's Paw was a publishing house... for "
"pornographic materials."
msgstr ""
"[Elle a l'air étonnée.] Voyons voir. [Elle jette un coup d'oeil sur le "
"magazine.] Eh bien... Tu sais, j'avais entendu dire que, avant la guerre, le "
"Cat's Paw était une maison d'édition... de livres pornographiques."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:441
msgid "For pornogru - porn-o-gra - pornu - uh, a publishing house, you said?"
msgstr ""
"De livres pornogru... pornagri... pornu... euh, une maison d'édition, tu "
"disais ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:442
msgid "This place was a publishing house?"
msgstr "Cet endroit était une maison d'édition ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:450
msgid ""
"Yes... the rooms here were used for film shoots with models from across the "
"world. (Seems entranced by the magazine.)\n"
" Quite a little piece of history you have there."
msgstr ""
"Oui, on filmait des mannequins du monde entier ici, dans les chambres. [Elle "
"paraît fascinée par la revue.] C'est une vraie pièce de musée que tu as là."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:451
msgid "Well, you know, I just read this for the articles."
msgstr "Oh, tu sais, je ne lis que les articles."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:452
msgid ""
"I'm just glad to know what the damn thing is. It's irritating to keep "
"examining it and getting\n"
" that same message over and over. I'll probably STILL get it even though "
"it's identified now."
msgstr ""
"Ca me fait plaisir de savoir ce qu'est ce satané truc. C'est agaçant de "
"l'examiner et de recevoir sans cesse le même message. Bon, ma curiosité est "
"satisfaite, mais je vais sans doute le garder quand même."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:460
msgid ""
"You know... if you can bring me a complete set... say, ten issues, I'll buy "
"them from you. They'd be good for\n"
" a display, might attract customers. Are you interested?"
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, si tu m'apportais une série complète... dix numéros, disons... je "
"te les achèterais. Ils iraient bien pour un étalage, ils pourraient attirer "
"le chaland. Ca t'intéresse ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:461
msgid "If I can FIND that many... say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Il faudrait que j'en TROUVE autant. Bon, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:462
msgid "Actually, I happen to have ten right here."
msgstr "Eh bien, il se trouve que j'en ai justement dix sur moi."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:463
msgid "Sure. If I come across that many, I'll be sure to stop by."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Si jamais j'en trouve autant, je passerai ici."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:470
msgid "Wonderful! I'll give you $500 for the set."
msgstr "Magnifique ! Je t'en donne 500 dollars."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:471
msgid "$500? After collecting ALL of these? No way. Make it a thousand."
msgstr ""
"500 dollars ? Pour une telle collection ? Pas question. Disons plutôt 1000."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:472
msgid ""
"Sounds good. Here you go. But hey, careful with number five... the pages "
"look like they are glued together."
msgstr ""
"D'accord, les voilà. Mais fais bien attention au numéro 5... Les pages sont "
"toutes collées les unes aux autres."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:473
msgid "No, I think I'll keep them... say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Non, je vais les garder. Dis, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:474
msgid "No thanks, I've become attached to them. Maybe some other time."
msgstr "Non merci, je ne veux pas m'en séparer. Une autre fois, peut-être."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:480
msgid "Hmmmmm. Seven fifty, and you got a deal."
msgstr "Hmmm... 750, et l'affaire est dans le sac."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:481
msgid "$750? All right, then. They're yours."
msgstr "750 dollars ? D'accord, ils sont à toi."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:482
msgid "I think I'll keep them then... say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Je crois que je vais les garder. Dis, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:483
msgid "Forget it. Maybe some other time."
msgstr "Tant pis. Une autre fois, peut-être."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:490
msgid "Here you go. (Counts out the money, hands it to you.) Thanks again."
msgstr "Tiens. [Elle compte l'argent et te le tend.] Merci encore."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:492 dialog/rcmcgrew.msg:228
msgid "Not a problem. Goodbye."
msgstr "Pas de problème. Au revoir."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:500
msgid ""
"Really? (Examines No. 5, then goes through the rest of your stack.) Hmmmm. "
"Well, it looks like you have\n"
" two of them, so you can have this one back... but let me get the stain out "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Ah ? [Elle examine le numéro 5, puis le reste de ta pile.] Hum. Il est en "
"double, je t'en laisse un... Mais d'abord, je vais enlever cette tâche."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:501
msgid ""
"Okay. Uh... by the way, that stain isn't mine. I have no idea how it got "
"there."
msgstr ""
"D'accord... Au fait, ce n'est pas moi qui l'ai faite, cette tâche. Je ne "
"sais pas d'où elle vient."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:502
msgid ""
"Okay. Are you sure you can get that stain out? It looks glued in there "
"pretty tight."
msgstr ""
"D'accord. Crois-tu que tu réussiras à l'enlever ? Elle a vraiment l'air bien "
"collée."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:510
msgid ""
"Happens all the time around here...(Miss Kitty starts cleaning the magazine.)"
"...mostly to the sheets. That\n"
" should do it...(Holds it up.)...good issue - has an article on energy "
"weapons, it looks like. Here you go."
msgstr ""
"Ca arrive tout le temps, ici... [Miss Kitty entreprend de nettoyer la revue.]"
" Surtout au poster central. Bon, ça devrait aller... [Elle le brandit.] Un "
"numéro intéressant... avec un article sur les armes à énergie, on dirait. "
"Tiens."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:512
msgid "An article on energy weapons? Thanks. I might read it later on."
msgstr "Sur les armes à énergie. Merci. Il faudra que je le lise."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:520
msgid ""
"(As you speak, she looks up, startled.) You! You came back! I... I thought "
"you might be dead. (She looks\n"
" relieved.) I was so *worried.* Risking your life, taking on the Enclave... "
"that's the bravest thing I've ever heard."
msgstr ""
"[Au son de ta voix, elle lève la tête, ébahie.] Toi ! Tu es de retour. Je... "
"je ne te croyais plus de ce monde. [Elle a l'air soulagée.] Je me faisais "
"tellement de *souci*. Risquer ta vie en attaquant l'Enclave... Quel courage !"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:521
msgid ""
"(As you speak, she looks up, startled.) You! I've heard about you. (Her face "
"beams with admiration.) Risking\n"
" your life, taking on the Enclave... that's the bravest thing I've ever "
"heard."
msgstr ""
"[Au son de ta voix, elle lève la tête, ébahie.] Toi ! J'ai entendu parler de "
"toi. [Elle te dévisage, admirative.] Risquer ta vie en attaquant "
"l'Enclave... Quel courage !"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:522
msgid ""
"! I'm glad you've come back again. Just having a hero like yourself around "
"does wonders for business:\n"
" risking your life, taking on the Enclave... That's the bravest thing I've "
"ever heard."
msgstr ""
" ! Je suis ravie de te revoir. Avoir quelqu'un d'héroïque comme toi par ici "
"fait du bien aux affaires. Risquer ta vie, attaquer l'Enclave... Quel "
"courage !"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:523
msgid ""
"Shucks, Miss Kitty. It taint nothing nobody else wouldnta done in mah place."
msgstr "Voyons, Miss Kitty. N'importe qui en aurait fait autant."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:524
msgid ""
"Daaaaamn right, baby. And that's the bravest thing you're ever gonna hear, "
"cause I'm the BADDEST of\n"
" the bad."
msgstr ""
"Oh, oui, mon coeur. Il n'y a pas plus courageux que moi parce que je suis le "
"plus MECHANT."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:525
msgid ""
"It was nothing that any pissed-off woman who had her village kidnapped "
"wouldn't have done."
msgstr ""
"Toute femme en colère après qu'on ait kidnappé tout son village en aurait "
"fait autant."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:526
msgid ""
"And that's the bravest thing you're EVER gonna hear about, cause I'm the "
"BADDEST bitch\n"
" in the wastes."
msgstr ""
"Oh, oui, chérie. Il n'y a pas plus courageuse que moi, parce que je suis la "
"plus MECHANTE."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:527
msgid "Thanks. Just doing my job as a heroine."
msgstr "Merci. J'essaie de bien faire mon boulot d'héroïne."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:528
msgid "Thanks. Just doing my job as a hero."
msgstr "Merci. J'essaie de bien faire mon boulot de héros."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:529
msgid "Kicking ass and taking names, that's my job."
msgstr "Botter des culs, c'est mon boulot."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:545
msgid "You are so humble. "
msgstr "Quelle humilité ! "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:546
msgid "You are so strong. So... confident. "
msgstr "Quelle force ! Quelle... confiance en soi ! "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:547
msgid ""
"I LOVE that about you. (Makes sweeping gesture at Cat's Paw.) You are always "
"welcome here, free of charge."
msgstr ""
"J'ADORE ce style que tu as. [Elle montre tout le Cat's Paw d'un geste large.]"
" Tu peux venir ici pour rien quand tu veux."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:548
msgid "So... how about that date we talked about way back when?"
msgstr "Alors... et ce rendez-vous dont on avait parlé à l'époque ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:549
msgid "So... how about... you know, you and me... like... you know."
msgstr "Alors... et, tu sais, toi et moi... heu... tu vois ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:550
msgid ""
"Baby, I got to feeling like a machine, and that's no way to feel. C'mere."
msgstr ""
"Chérie, j'ai l'impression d'être une machine, et ça me plaît pas du tout. "
"Viens un peu ici."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:551
msgid "Great! Look, I had some questions before I indulge myself..."
msgstr "Super ! Dis, j'aurais quelques questions avant de me laisser aller..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:552
msgid "Thanks. I appreciate it, Miss Kitty."
msgstr "Merci, Miss Kitty. J'apprécie."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:553
msgid "I expect nothing less. I'll collect later."
msgstr "C'est bien le moins. J'en profiterai plus tard."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:565
msgid "All right then, "
msgstr "D'accord, "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:566
msgid "...let me just get my coat."
msgstr " ... laisse-moi juste prendre mon manteau."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:567
msgid "No rush. Take your time."
msgstr "Prends ton temps."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:568
msgid "Good thing I've got my \"coat\" in my pocket. Heh-heh."
msgstr "Heureusement que j'ai mon *manteau* dans ma poche ! <Hé hé !>"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:569
msgid "Sure. But hurry up... we've got reservations at eight. In my PANTS."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. Mais dépêche-toi. On a des réservations pour huit heures. Dans mon "
"PANTALON."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:570
msgid "Sure. But hurry up... you and my tongue got reservations at eight."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. Mais dépêche-toi. On a des réservations pour huit heures, ma "
"langue et toi."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:575 dialog/nclabish.msg:665
msgid "Oh, "
msgstr "Oh, "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:576
msgid ", you Enclave-smashing animal..."
msgstr ", espèce de brute briseuse d'Enclave..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:577
msgid "::Bwanbwan-bwan-ba-bwan oookwaka oookwaka::"
msgstr "*Bouanouan-bouan-ba-bouan oukouaka oukouaka*"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:585
msgid ""
"(Nods.) Yes, that's correct. We usually have to train them extensively to "
"suppress their natural\n"
" revulsion. It's almost a rite of passage now. Still, if a girl can abide "
"Myron, it means she's tough..."
msgstr ""
"[Elle hoche la tête.] Exact. On doit les entraîner longuement pour leur "
"apprendre à réprimer leur dégoût naturel. C'est un vrai rite de passage, "
"maintenant. Mais si une fille peut supporter Myron, c'est qu'elle en a..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:586
msgid ""
"I'd like to meet him. Think I could volunteer to be his next \"choice?\""
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais le voir. A ton avis, je peux me porter volontaire pour être la "
"prochaine *visite* ?"

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:588
msgid "Hmmmm. Thanks for the information."
msgstr "Hum. Merci du renseignement."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:595
msgid ""
"(Studies you, then makes a circling gesture with her finger.) Turn around "
"for me. Hmmmm... "
msgstr "[Elle t'examine.] Tourne-toi, un peu ? Hmmm... "

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:596
msgid ""
"no, I don't think you'd make the cut. Maybe if you cleaned yourself up a "
"little more, made\n"
" yourself... presentable. Sorry."
msgstr ""
"Non, je ne crois pas que tu lui conviendrais. Il faudrait que tu te nettoies "
"un peu, que tu sois un peu plus présentable. Navrée."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:597
msgid ""
"yes... yes, I think you'd do just fine. Are you interested in the job? All "
"of my other girls\n"
" are... sick of it."
msgstr ""
"Oui... oui, je crois que ça irait. Le boulot t'intéresse ? Toutes mes autres "
"filles le trouvent... à gerber."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:599
msgid "Hmmmph. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Hum. J'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:600
msgid "No, but I may ask again later. I had some other questions..."
msgstr ""
"Non, mais je te redemanderai ça plus tard, peut-être. J'ai d'autres "
"questions..."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:610
msgid ""
"(Nods.) Excellent. One of the Mordino lieutenants should be showing up soon. "
"If you want to take a\n"
" seat, I'll present you as one of the... applicants."
msgstr ""
"[Elle hoche la tête.] Parfait. Un des lieutenants de Mordino devrait arriver "
"bientôt. Si tu veux bien t'asseoir, je te présenterai comme... candidate."

#: dialog/nckitty.msg:611
msgid "All right... I'll wait for him."
msgstr "D'accord. Je vais l'attendre."

