#: dialog/nclabish.msg:275
msgid "Sorry I asked. I better be going."
msgstr "Je regrette. Je ferais mieux d'y aller."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:276
msgid "Sorry, Mrs. Bishop. I didn't mean to pry. I'll leave."
msgstr ""
"Je regrette, Mme Bishop. Je ne voulais pas faire preuve d'indiscrétion. Je "
