#: dialog/nclabish.msg:309
msgid ""
"Uh, condom? Sure we did. I think. I mean, I'm pretty sure. Maybe I'll just "
"go check right now."
msgstr ""
"Un préservatif, quoi ? Evidemment. Je crois bien. Enfin, j'veux dire, c'est "
"sûr. Je vais aller vérifier."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:315
msgid "'"
msgstr "'"

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:316
