msgstr "D'accord, j'irai voir."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:363
msgid "Very well, thanks for your time. I appreciate it."
msgstr "Très bien, merci pour tout. J'apprécie."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:370
msgid "Dear boy... "
msgstr "Cher petit..."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:371
msgid "Dear girl... "
msgstr "Chère petite..."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:372
msgid ""
"the people of Reno have enough difficulty remembering which whore they left "
"their\n"
" cocks in when they wake in the morning, much less know where to find "
"anything such as what\n"
" you describe."
msgstr ""
"Les habitants de Reno ont déjà assez de mal à se rappeler à leur réveil dans "
