#: dialog/nclabish.msg:374
msgid "All right... I was just asking. Later, then."
msgstr "D'accord... Je posais juste la question. A plus tard, alors."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:375
msgid "Very well. Thanks for your time."
msgstr "Très bien. Merci pour tout."

#: dialog/nclabish.msg:380
msgid ""
"Hold on a moment. (Studies you.) You seem to be... new in town. Would you "
"care to join\n"
" me for a drink in my chambers? We can discuss New Reno; it's a dangerous "
"place to those\n"
" unfamiliar with its ways."
msgstr ""
"Une minute. [Elle t'examine.] Tu débarques, ici. Que dirais-tu de te joindre "
"à moi pour prendre un verre dans ma chambre ? On parlera de New Reno, c'est "
