#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:524 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1092
msgid "Your friend with the bone in his nose... great gimmick."
msgstr "Ton ami avec son os dans le nez... Beau costume."

#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:525 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1093
