#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:530 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1098
msgid "How much does your friend with the bone in his nose charge?"
msgstr "Combien coûte ton ami avec un os dans le nez ?"

#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:531 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1099
