#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:532 dialog/ncprosti.msg:1100
msgid "Your friend with the bone in his nose over-compensating for something?"
msgstr "Ton ami sur-compense son manque avec un os dans le nez ?"

#: dialog/ncprosti.msg:534
