"Je vends surtout des stimulants euphorisants. C'est pour cela qu'ils m'ont "
"affublé de cette appellation stupide, « l'homme fusée ». Pffff. Je vends "
"aussi des provisions pour les caravanes. Tu as BESOIN de quelque chose ou je "
"peux retourner à mon boulot ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:306
msgid ""
"Rocketman, huh? Know the line in that Elton John song, \"Rocketman, burning "
"off the mmmncfnfm there at home?' What's\n"
" he really saying there?"
msgstr ""
"L'homme fusée, rocketman en anglais, comme dans la chanson d'Elton John qui "
"fait « Rocketman, burning off the mmmncfnfm there at home » ? Il dit quoi en "
"fait ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:307 dialog/vcdarrow.msg:128 dialog/vcdarrow.msg:142
#: dialog/vcfarrel.msg:128 dialog/vcfarrel.msg:142
msgid "Can I see what you have in stock?"
msgstr "Je peux voir ce que tu as en stock ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:308
msgid "You sell drugs here in the STORE?"
msgstr "Tu vends des stimulants ici dans la BOUTIQUE ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:309
msgid "You mean like selling drugs to Wright's son?"
msgstr "Tu veux dire que t'as vendu des stimulants au fils de Wright ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:310
msgid "Go on back to what you were doing."
msgstr "[Partir]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:320
msgid ""
"(Renesco glares at you. It looks like he is undressing you mentally, then "
"tearing you limb from limb.)"
msgstr ""
"[Renesco te fixe d'un regard furieux. Tu as l'impression qu'il te déshabille "
"mentalement, puis qu'il t'arrache les membres un par un.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:321
msgid "Nevermind, then. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Bon, c'est pas grave. J'avais encore une ou deux questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:330
msgid ""
"(Renesco looks at you in disgust.) Yes. In the STORE. This isn't the 20th "
"century where drugs are sold by\n"
" street corner cockroaches who live in constant fear of the authorities."
msgstr ""
"[Renesco te regarde d'un air dégoûté.] Oui. Dans la BOUTIQUE. On est plus au "
"vingtième siècle et les stimulants ne sont plus vendus au coin des rues par "
"de sombres individus vivants dans la peur des autorités."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:331
msgid "Well, then -"
msgstr "Bon, dans ce cas --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:332
msgid "But -"
msgstr "Mais --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:333
msgid "Uh, I think I better -"
msgstr "Heu, je crois que je devrais --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:350
msgid ""
"This is NEW RENO. There are no cops, no law, and there's plenty of customers "
"who don't mind buying poison at the\n"
" pharmacy down the street. Does THAT answer your question, primate?"
msgstr ""
"Tu es à NEW RENO ici. Il n'y a pas de flics, pas de loi, et plein de clients "
"que ça ne dérange pas d'acheter du poison à la pharmacie du coin. Ca répond "
"à ta question, primate ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:351
msgid "All except one: Was Richard Wright one of your customers?"
msgstr ""
"Tout sauf ce que je voulais savoir : Richard Wright était-il l'un de tes "
"clients ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:352
msgid "All right, all right... what have you got in stock?"
msgstr "D'accord... Qu'as-tu en stock ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:353
msgid "Actually, I had some more questions..."
msgstr "En fait, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:354
msgid ""
"But, like you said, the drugs are... poisonous. They kill the spirit. "
"Doesn't it bother you to sell them?"
msgstr ""
"Mais, tu l'as dit toi-même, les stimulants sont... du poison. Ils tuent. Ca "
"ne te dérange pas d'en vendre ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:355
msgid "Sure does. I'll be going now."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Je dois y aller."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:365
msgid ""
"Does it BOTHER me to sell them to idiots, slavers, crime lords and tribals "
"that the world would be better off\n"
" without? Primate, three words: get out more."
msgstr ""
"Si ça me DERANGE d'en vendre à des idiots, à des esclavagistes, à des "
"patrons du crime et à des tribals sans qui le monde irait bien mieux ? "
"Primate, rien que trois mots : sors plus souvent."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:366
msgid "OK... can I see what you have in stock?"
msgstr "Ok... Puis-je voir ce que tu as en stock ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:367
msgid "All right, all right. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "D'accord. Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:368
msgid ""
"The drugs here in New Reno are finding their way to other places, and "
"hurting people there. Doesn't that concern you?"
msgstr ""
"Les stimulants vendus ici s'exportent et font du mal ailleurs. Cela ne te "
"préoccupe pas ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:369
msgid "I'll start by leaving right now."
msgstr "Je vais commencer par partir immédiatement."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:375
msgid "So? What do I care about them?"
msgstr "Et alors ? Qu'est-ce que j'en ai à faire ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:377
msgid ""
"The human race suffered a horrible tragedy. Now we are trying to rebuild. "
"Selling Jet seems... counterproductive\n"
" to that reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"La race humaine a subi une horrible tragédie. On essaie de tout rebâtir. La "
"vente de Jet semble... contre-productive dans cette reconstruction."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:378
msgid "Well, whatever. I must be going now."
msgstr "Comme tu veux. Je dois y aller maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:385
msgid ""
"So. What. No one is FORCING those idiots to inhale Jet. No one's going "
"around and jamming it down their\n"
" throats!"
msgstr ""
"Et alors. Personne ne FORCE ces idiots à inhaler du Jet. Personne ne les y "
"oblige, personne ne les gave avec !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:386
msgid "Can I see -"
msgstr "Puis-je voir --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:387
msgid "But don't -"
msgstr "Mais ne --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:388
msgid "That is your -"
msgstr "C'est ton --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:395
msgid ""
"Those lamphead rock humpers in Redding KNOW what they're taking, so I don't "
"feel a millimeter of pity for 'em!\n"
" Far as I'm concerned, Jet weeds out the human trash that shoulda died when "
"the bombs dropped!"
msgstr ""
"Ces glandeurs à la noix de Redding SAVENT ce qu'ils prennent, et j'éprouve "
"pas une once de pitié pour eux ! Je dis que le Jet élimine des ordures qui "
"auraient dû crever avec les bombes !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:396
msgid "Uh, okay. Can I see your stock?"
msgstr "Euh, Ok. Je peux voir ton stock ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:397
msgid "Where is this Redding you speak of? Why do you mention them?"
msgstr "Où est ce Redding dont tu parles ? Pourquoi parles-tu d'eux ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:398
msgid "You mentioned Redding specifically. Why is Jet so prevalent in Redding?"
msgstr "Tu as parlé de Redding. Pourquoi le Jet y est-il si répandu ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:400
msgid "That is your right to feel that way. I must be going now."
msgstr "Tu as le droit de penser ça. Je dois y aller maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:410
msgid ""
"Well, Redding's a... special case. See, there's people in Reno who make sure "
"Redding's well-supplied. After all, you\n"
" taste Jet once, you're hooked. It's how I make MY living."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, Redding est... un cas à part. Il y a des gens à Reno qui font en "
"sorte que Redding soit bien approvisionné. Après tout, une fois que t'as "
"goûté au Jet, t'es accroc. Voilà comment je gagne MA vie."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:411
msgid "Speaking of which, can I see your stock?"
msgstr "A propos, puis-je voir ton stock ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:412
msgid "Who is making sure Redding is well-supplied? And why?"
msgstr "Qui fait en sorte que Redding soit bien approvisionné ? Et pourquoi ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:413
msgid "So I noticed. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "J'ai remarqué. Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:414
msgid "I see... I must be going now."
msgstr "Je vois... Je dois y aller maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:420
msgid ""
"Well, tribal, I doubt you have the sense to notice this yet, but New Reno "
"doesn't produce anything useful.\n"
" It's like a big, brightly-lit prairie tick sitting out in the desert. Now, "
"Redding, on the other hand..."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, tribal, je doute que tu aies réussi à le remarquer par toi-même, "
"mais New Reno ne produit rien d'utile. C'est comme une grande prairie bien "
"éclairée au milieu du désert. Mais Redding, par contre..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:422
msgid "...DOES produce something useful."
msgstr "...PRODUIT quelque chose d'utile."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:430
msgid ""
"First and last time I'm gonna warn you, tribal: Don't finish my goddamn "
"sentences. I don't like smartass primates\n"
" that talk when they should listen. No wonder you all still use spears..."
msgstr ""
"C'est la première et la dernière fois que je le dis, tribal : ne finis pas "
"mes foutues phrases. J'aime pas les primates arrogants qui parlent au lieu "
"d'écouter. Pas étonnant que vous utilisiez encore des lances..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:431
msgid ""
"Not all of us. For example, I use a variety of weapons to kill people... let "
"me show you."
msgstr ""
"Faux. Par exemple, j'utilise des tas d'armes différentes pour tuer les "
"gens... Je vais te montrer."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:432
msgid "Forgive me. Please go on."
msgstr "Pardonne-moi. Continue."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:433
msgid "Burn in hell. I'm outta here. "
msgstr "Va griller en enfer. Je me tire."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:440
msgid ""
"Redding has a stable work force that mines raw materials, mostly gold. New "
"Reno sure could use that gold. Somebody\n"
" figures all we gotta do is get those miners addicted, and we got 'em for "
"life. You understand now?"
msgstr ""
"Redding a une main d'oeuvre stable qui extrait des matières premières, "
"principalement de l'or. New Reno saurait utiliser cet or. Quelqu'un a pensé "
"qu'il suffit de rendre ces mineurs dépendants au Jet et le tour est joué. Tu "
"comprends ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:441
msgid "Yes... except for one thing: Where did Jet come from?"
msgstr "Oui... A part un truc : d'où est sorti le Jet ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:442
msgid "Who's trying to addict all the miners?"
msgstr "Qui essaie de transformer les mineurs en toxicomanes ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:443
msgid "Yeah, I understand. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Ouais, je comprends. Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:444
msgid "I don't want to hear anymore. I must be going now."
msgstr "Je ne veux pas en savoir plus. Je dois y aller maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:450
msgid ""
"(Points at Myron.) Why don't you ask your little horny toad friend there? "
"I'm sure he'd be happy to tell you. (Glares\n"
" at Myron.) Right, kid?"
msgstr ""
"[Il désigne Myron.] Pourquoi ne demandes-tu pas à ton copain à la sale "
"tronche de crapaud en rut ? Je suis sûr qu'il se ferait un plaisir de te le "
"dire. [Il fixe Myron d'un regard furieux.] N'est-ce pas, gamin ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:451
msgid ""
"We have one person to thank for Jet. You heard of Family Mordino's little "
"golden boy, Myron? Well, the little\n"
" bastard CREATED Jet. Big Jesus Mordino just let everyone know where they "
"could get it."
msgstr ""
"T'as entendu parler du jeune prodige de la famille Mordino, Myron ? Eh bien, "
"ce petit con a CREE le Jet. Big Jésus Mordino explique simplement à tout le "
"monde où on peut se le procurer."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:452
msgid "Tell me more about Myron."
msgstr "Parle-moi encore de Myron."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:453 dialog/nhmyron.msg:1619
msgid "Is there any cure for Jet?"
msgstr "Existe-t-il un remède contre le Jet ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:460
msgid ""
"Big Jesus Mordino's funneling Jet into Redding. Typical power play. Once the "
"pipeline really gets going, those\n"
" miners are goners."
msgstr ""
"Big Jésus Mordino est en train d'introduire le Jet à Redding. Le jeu du "
"pouvoir. Une fois qu'ils se sont habitués, ces mineurs sont fichus."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:461
msgid "Where did Jet come from?"
msgstr "D'où est sorti le Jet ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:470
msgid ""
"Horny as a toad and all the morals of one. Smart kid, though. High IQ. "
"Wasting his brains manufacturing drugs, that's\n"
" for damn certain."
msgstr ""
"Autant de moralité qu'un crapaud en rut. Mais un gosse pas bête. Un QI hors "
"norme. Il gâche ses neurones à fabriquer des stimulants, ça c'est sûr, bon "
"sang."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:480
msgid ""
"The Mordinos' got him locked up somewhere. Heavily-guarded, probably. Don't "
"know exactly where."
msgstr ""
"Les Mordino l'ont enfermé quelque part. Sûrement très bien gardé. Je ne sais "
"pas exactement où."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:481
msgid "Thanks for the information. Can I see what you have in stock?"
msgstr "Merci pour ces informations. Je peux voir ce que tu as en stock ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:490
msgid ""
"A CURE for methamphetamine addiction?! Ha! I only know two: one is death. "
"The other is locking yourself\n"
" in a cage for a year without Jet and sweat it out of your system. Hmmmph. "
"\"Cure,\" my ass! What nonsense!"
msgstr ""
"Un REMEDE contre la dépendance aux méta-amphétamines ?!! Ha ! Je n'en "
"connais que deux : le premier c'est la mort. L'autre c'est de t'enfermer "
"dans une cage pendant un an sans Jet et d'exSuder tout le Jet de ton "
"système. Pfff. *Un remède*, mon cul ! N'importe quoi !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:492
msgid "There must be a cure. What's Jet's chemical composition?"
msgstr "Il doit y avoir un remède. Quelle est la composition chimique du Jet ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:505
msgid "Why don't you ask your friend there? He designed the drug."
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi ne demandes-tu pas à ton pote ? C'est lui qui a créé ce stimulant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:506
msgid ""
"I just sell the stuff. I'd ask a scientist. Or Myron. He designed the drug."
msgstr ""
"Je ne fais qu'en vendre. Il faudrait voir avec un scientifique. Ou avec "
"Myron. C'est lui qui a créé ce stimulant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:515
msgid "(Renesco glares at you in silence.)"
msgstr "[Renesco te fixe en silence d'un regard furieux.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:516
msgid "(Renesco glares at you again, this time in silence.)"
msgstr "[Renesco te lance à nouveau un regard furieux, mais en silence.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:517
msgid ""
"I think you'd like Arroyo. It's a peaceful village. Except for the plants "
"possessed by evil spirits... and of course, the temple\n"
" of trials filled with those deadly spear traps and the man-eating giant "
"ants."
msgstr ""
"Je crois qu'Arroyo te plairait. C'est un village tranquille. A part les "
"plantes possédées par des esprits maléfiques... et bien sûr, le temple des "
"épreuves rempli de pièges meurtriers et de fourmis géantes mangeuses d'homme."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:518
msgid "Hey, you ever heard of a Garden of Eden Creation Kit? Or Vault 13?"
msgstr ""
"Hé, t'as déjà entendu parler du Jardin d'Eden en Kit ? Ou de l'Abri 13 ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:519
msgid "Okay, then... I'm out of here."
msgstr "Ok, d'accord... Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:525
msgid "(Renesco continues to glare at you.)"
msgstr "[Renesco continue de te fixer d'un regard furieux.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:526
msgid ""
"And sometimes the elder gets upset at little things, like... heh-heh... that "
"one night when I ignored my vow of\n"
" celibacy and snuck out with Reyna - Whose - Legs - Crush - With - Strength -"
" of - Thousand - Snakes to the Arroyo canyon..."
msgstr ""
"Et parfois la doyenne est contrariée pour de petits riens, comme... hé hé... "
"la nuit où j'avais oublié mon voeu de célibat et où j'étais sorti en "
"cachette dans le canyon d'Arroyo avec Reyna - Aux - Jambes - Qui - "
"T'enserrent - Comme - Mille - Serpents..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:535
msgid "(Renesco gives you a withering stare.)"
msgstr "[Renesco te lance un regard cinglant.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:536
msgid ""
"It was like yesterday. Reyna's body glowed like silver in the moonlight when "
"she knelt down and... hey, you know what?\n"
" You might like the elder. She's about your age."
msgstr ""
"Je m'en souviens comme si c'était hier. Le corps de Reyna brillait comme de "
"l'argent dans le clair de lune lorsqu'elle s'est agenouillée... Hé, tu sais "
"quoi ? Tu pourrais apprécier la doyenne. Elle a environ ton âge."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:545
msgid ""
"(Renesco continues to glare at you as if he could somehow make you disappear "
"just by imagining it hard enough.)"
msgstr ""
"[Renesco continue de te fixer d'un regard furieux comme s'il pouvait te "
"faire disparaître simplement en se concentrant.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:546
msgid ""
"Did I mention Arroyo was founded by my ancestor, the holy Vault Dweller? He "
"made a legendary journey from the\n"
" south after defeating a great evil. (Puff up chest and stare proudly into "
"the distance.) Now, *I* am the deliverer of my\n"
" tribe, chosen to search for the holy GECK!"
msgstr ""
"Ai-je mentionné qu'Arroyo a été fondé par mon ancêtre, le saint Habitant de "
"l'Abri ? Il fit un voyage légendaire depuis le Sud après avoir vaincu un "
"grand mal. [Tu gonfles le torse et fixes fièrement le lointain.] Maintenant, "
"JE vais sauver ma tribu, je suis l'Etre Elu en quête du saint J.E.K !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:547
msgid "Okay, then, enough stories... I better be on my way. Praise the Vault!"
msgstr ""
"Ok, bon, assez d'histoires... Je ferais mieux d'y aller. L'Abri soit loué !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:555
msgid "(Renesco's glare crumbles.) "
msgstr "[Le regard furieux de Renesco se désagrège.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:556
msgid ""
"GECK? As in 'Garden of Eden Creation Kit?' Comes with a basic replicator "
"unit, holodisc reader with selections\n"
" from the library of congress, and a little pen flashlight?"
msgstr ""
"J.E.K ? Jardin d'Eden en Kit ? Avec une unité de reproduction, un lecteur "
"d'holodisques fourni avec des ouvrages de la bibliothèque du congrès et un "
"petit stylo qui fait aussi torche ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:557
msgid ""
"Yes, but that's not important right now. I haven't finished telling you "
"about Arroyo."
msgstr ""
"Oui, mais ce n'est pas ce qui compte pour le moment. Je n'ai pas fini de te "
"parler d'Arroyo."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:558
msgid ""
"Yes! My village is having trouble with crops, and the GECK is needed to "
"restore them. Do you know where I can find one?"
msgstr ""
"Oui ! Mon village rencontre des problèmes agricoles et le J.E.K est "
"nécessaire pour y remédier. Sais-tu où je peux en trouver un ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:559
msgid ""
"It is said to be sealed within Vault 13, or so the legends say. Do you know "
"of such a place?"
msgstr ""
"Selon les légendes, il serait enfermé dans l'Abri 13. Tu as déjà entendu "
"parler de cet endroit ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:560
msgid ""
"If you're not going to LISTEN when I recite the holy scriptures, I'm out of "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Si tu n'as pas l'intention d'ECOUTER alors que je récite les saintes "
"écritures, je m'en vais."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:561
msgid "Could be. Look, I have to go."
msgstr "Peut-être. Ecoute, je dois y aller."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:570
msgid ""
"Your backwater herb-smoking village be damned, and you along with it. Why "
"is\n"
" a primate like you looking for a GECK?"
msgstr ""
"Que ton trou perdu de village rempli de fumeurs d'herbe soit maudit, et toi "
"avec. Pourquoi un primate comme toi recherche-t-il un J.E.K ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:571
msgid ""
"Arroyo... my backwater herb-smoking village, as you say... is having trouble "
"with its crops. The GECK is needed\n"
" to restore them."
msgstr ""
"Arroyo... mon trou perdu de village rempli de fumeurs d'herbe, comme tu "
"dis... a des problèmes avec ses récoltes. Le J.E.K est nécessaire pour y "
"remédier."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:572
msgid "It is said to be sealed within Vault 13. Do you know of such a place?"
msgstr ""
"On dit qu'il est enfermé dans l'Abri 13. As-tu entendu parler de cet endroit "
"?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:573
msgid "I don't think I feel like sharing that at the moment. Goodbye."
msgstr "Je crois pas avoir envie de partager ça en ce moment. Salut."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:580
msgid ""
"Hmmmmm. It sure could do that... easy. IF you could find one. Don't even "
"know where you'd start looking. NCR\n"
" or Vault City, maybe, but I doubt they'd have one... still..."
msgstr ""
"Hum. Ca pourrait certainement... marcher. SI tu en trouvais un. Je ne sais "
"même pas où tu pourrais chercher. En RNC ou à la Cité de l'Abri, peut-être, "
"mais je doute qu'ils en aient un... quoique..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:581 dialog/nhmyron.msg:756
msgid "Still...?"
msgstr "Quoi... ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:590
msgid ""
"Still, those self-righteous bastards might be able to point you in a "
"direction. If they speak slowly and use small words..."
msgstr ""
"Quoique, ces connards arrogants pourraient peut-être t'indiquer où aller. "
"S'ils parlent doucement et avec des mots simples..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:591
msgid ""
"NCR or Vault City you say? I will go in search of these places and ask their "
"villagers about the GECK. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"En RNC ou à la Cité de l'Abri tu dis ? Je vais chercher ces endroits et "
"questionner les villageois au sujet du J.E.K. Merci."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:592
msgid ""
"Why would the GECK not be in sacred Vault 13? The scriptures SAY that the "
"GECK is sealed within the sacred Vault 13."
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi le J.E.K ne serait-il pas dans le saint Abri 13 ? Les écritures "
"DISENT que le J.E.K est enfermé dans le saint Abri 13."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:593
msgid "Very funny. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Très drôle. J'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:594
msgid "Okay, then... I'll go check it out. Thanks."
msgstr "Ok, alors... Je vais aller voir ça. Merci."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:600
msgid ""
"Hell no, primate. I've heard of vaults, sure, but not Vault 13. Closest "
"thing is Vault City to the northeast... and\n"
" if those aristocratic jackanapes inhabited a Vault once, they sure as hell "
"don't live there no more."
msgstr ""
"Non, primate. J'ai entendu parler des abris, bien sûr, mais pas de l'Abri "
"13. Il y a bien la Cité de l'Abri, au Nord-Est... mais si ces canailles "
"d'aristocrates habitaient autrefois un Abri, plus maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:601
msgid ""
"Vault City, you say? I will go in search of this Vault city and ask their "
"villagers about the GECK.\n"
" Thank you, Renesco. Praise the Vault! "
msgstr ""
"La Cité de l'Abri, tu dis ? Je vais aller chercher cette Cité et questionner "
"les villageois au sujet du J.E.K. Merci, Renesco. L'Abri soit loué !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:602
msgid "\"Vaults?\" There is more than one Vault?"
msgstr "« Des Abris ? » Il y en a plusieurs ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:610
msgid ""
"If you're going to Vault City, don't thank me, primate. You're better off in "
"New Reno. At least the people\n"
" sizing you up for a coffin are honest about it."
msgstr ""
"Si tu vas à la Cité de l'Abri, primate, ne me remercie pas. Tu es bien mieux "
"à New Reno. Au moins les gens qui creusent ta tombe ne te le cachent pas."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:611
msgid "Okay, then... I'm on my way to Vault City. Praise the Vault! "
msgstr "Ok... Je pars pour la Cité de l'Abri. L'Abri soit loué !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:612
msgid "I see. Thanks for the warning. "
msgstr "Je vois. Merci pour l'avertissement."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:620
msgid ""
"Why do you think it's called Vault THIRTEEN, spearchucker? What, was your "
"tribe short on brains or do you just\n"
" perform ritual lobotomies to cleanse the tiny voice of reason that speaks "
"in your head?"
msgstr ""
"D'après toi, primate, pourquoi il porte le nom d'Abri TREIZE ? Quoi, y avait "
"pas de cerveaux dans ta tribu ou vous pratiquez des lobotomies rituelles "
"pour faire taire la petite voix de la raison dans vos têtes ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:623
msgid ""
"Yeah, there you go sugar-talking me again. Thanks... for the info, at least. "
msgstr ""
"Ouais, tu recommences avec ta voix mielleuse. Merci... pour les infos du "
"moins."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:630
msgid ""
"A person's past ain't a smart topic of conversation here in New Reno. Now, "
"what is you want?"
msgstr ""
"Le passé de quelqu'un n'est pas un sujet de conversation en vogue ici à New "
"Reno. Bon, que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:632
msgid ""
"You sound like an educated man. Have you ever heard of a GECK or a place "
"called Vault 13?"
msgstr ""
"Tu me fais l'impression d'un homme cultivé. As-tu déjà entendu parler d'un "
"J.E.K ou d'un endroit nommé Abri 13 ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:634
msgid "Nothing, nevermind."
msgstr "Rien. Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:640
msgid ""
"(Renesco snatches the glasses from you and puts them on. His eyes widen.) "
"Sweet Reno! THAT'S what this damn\n"
" shop looks like. (Frowns.) What a mess... and what is that on the shelves? "
"Looks like brahmin shit."
msgstr ""
"[Renesco t'arrache les lunettes des mains et les chausse. Ses yeux "
"s'élargissent.] Douce Reno ! L'ETAT de cette foutue boutique ! [Il fronce "
"les sourcils.] Quel bazar... et là sur les étagères ? On dirait de la merde "
"de Brahmine."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:641
msgid "You're welcome..."
msgstr "Pas d'quoi."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:642
msgid "Enjoy."
msgstr "Amuse-toi bien."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:650
msgid "Hmpphh! I... hmmm... uh... where did you get these?"
msgstr "Mmmmmm ! Je... mmmm... heu... où as-tu trouvé ça ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:651 dialog/ncrenesc.msg:661
msgid ""
"Well, there was this tiny radscorpion, see, and there was this scientist "
"that was training him, and... you know what? Even I\n"
" don't believe it. Just keep them, all right?"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, tu vois, il y avait ce minuscule radscorpion et ce savant qui "
"l'entraînait et... Tu sais quoi ? Même moi j'y crois pas. Ecoute, t'as qu'a "
"les garder, d'accord ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:652
msgid "Let's just say I found them. Somewhere."
msgstr "Disons que je les ai trouvées, c'est tout."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:660
msgid "Hey! Waitaminute! Where did you get these?"
msgstr "Hé ! Attends une seconde ! Où as-tu trouvé ça ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:670
msgid ""
"Well, I... hmnnn... I'm... eh, grateful. I thought I was going to have to "
"suffer with those broken frames for the\n"
" rest of my life. If I can do something for you, you let me know... and, uh, "
"I'll THINK about it."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je... hmnnn... je suis... heu, reconnaissant. Je pensais que "
"j'allais devoir souffrir avec ces montures cassées pour le restant de mes "
"jours. Si je peux faire quelque chose pour toi, tu me tiens au courant... "
"et, heu, je vais y PENSER."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:671
msgid "How about a discount?"
msgstr "Que dis-tu d'une remise ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:672
msgid ""
"Nevermind... look, just wear them in good health, okay? I had some other "
"questions..."
msgstr ""
"Y'a pas de quoi... Ecoute, contente-toi de bien les porter, Ok ? J'avais "
"d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:673
msgid ""
"Someday - and that day may never come - I'll call upon you to do a service "
"for me. But until that day\n"
" accept these glasses as a gift on my daughter's wedding day. "
msgstr ""
"Un jour, mais ce jour ne viendra peut-être jamais, je te demanderai de me "
"rendre un service. Mais d'ici là accepte ces lunettes comme un cadeau, en ce "
"jour où ma fille se marie."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:680
msgid "Ehhh..."
msgstr "Heu..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:681
msgid "Errr..."
msgstr "Err..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:683
msgid "Okay! Okay! I'll give you a discount! Hmphhh."
msgstr "Ok ! Ok ! Je vais te faire une remise ! Pffff."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:684
msgid "C'mon. Just a little discount. C'mon..."
msgstr "Allez. Juste une petite remise. Allez..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:687
msgid "Great! Let's see what you've got, \"buddy.\""
msgstr "Génial ! Voyons voir ce que tu proposes, « mon pote »."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:688
msgid "Excellent! Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Excellent ! Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:689
msgid "I'll be back to shop later. "
msgstr "Je reviendrai faire des achats plus tard."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:701
msgid "Look, I'm a busy man..."
msgstr "Ecoute, je suis très occupé..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:702
msgid "Well? Out with it already!"
msgstr "Alors ? Tu vas parler !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:704
msgid "Did I ever tell you about my village Arroyo?"
msgstr "Je t'ai déjà parlé de mon village Arroyo ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:706
msgid "Did you sell Jet to Richard Wright?"
msgstr "As-tu vendu du Jet à Richard Wright ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:707
msgid "I've come to collect Mr. Salvatore's tribute."
msgstr "Je viens chercher le tribut de M. Salvatore."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:710
msgid "I'm looking for some mine parts for Broken Hills..."
msgstr "Je cherche des pièces d'équipement minier pour les Collines Brisées..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:711
msgid "You have an interesting vocabulary... are you from around here?"
msgstr "Ton vocabulaire est intéressant... Tu es du coin ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:712
msgid "Nevermind. "
msgstr "Peu importe."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:725
msgid "(Eyes narrow.) So?"
msgstr "[Il plisse les yeux.] Alors ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:726
msgid ""
"Well, I need the parts to fix the air purifier in their mine. I was told you "
"could help me."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, j'ai besoin de pièces pour réparer le purificateur d'air de leur "
"mine. On m'a dit que tu pourrais m'aider."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:727
msgid ""
"Well, I need the parts to fix the air purifier in their mine. Zaius sent me. "
"He said, uh... said... uh... shit."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, j'ai besoin de pièces pour réparer le purificateur d'air de leur "
"mine. C'est Zaius qui m'envoie. Il a dit, heu... heu... merde."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:728
msgid ""
"Well, I need the parts to fix the air purifier in their mine. Zaius sent me. "
"He said, 'The canary's kicked the bucket.'"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, j'ai besoin de pièces pour réparer le purificateur d'air de leur "
"mine. C'est Zaius qui m'envoie. Il a dit « Le canari a cassé sa pipe »."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:735
msgid ""
"Yes, I do happen to have some parts that could fix the air purifier. 100 "
"bucks."
msgstr ""
"Oui, en effet, j'ai des pièces qui pourraient réparer le purificateur d'air. "
"100 dollars."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:736
msgid "I'll take it. Here you go."
msgstr "D'accord. Voilà."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:737
msgid "How about fifty bucks?"
msgstr "Que dis-tu de cinquante dollars ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:738
msgid "Uh, I don't have a hundred on me... I'll be back later with the cash. "
msgstr ""
"Heu, je n'ai PAS cent jetons sur moi... Je reviendrai plus tard avec "
"l'argent."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:745
msgid "Inflation due to managerial irritation with hagglers. 200 or nothing."
msgstr ""
"Inflation due à l'agacement du chef face aux marchandeurs. C'est 200 ou rien."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:746
msgid "(Frowns.) 200 or nothing."
msgstr "[Il fronce les sourcils.] 200 ou rien."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:747
msgid "Two hundred?! You said a HUNDRED a second ago!"
msgstr "Deux cents ?!! Tu as dit CENT il y a une seconde !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:748
msgid "Uh, I'll take it. Here you go."
msgstr "Heu, c'est bon. Voilà."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:749
msgid ""
"Uh, I don't have two hundred on me... I'll be back later with the cash. "
msgstr ""
"Heu, je n'ai pas deux cents jetons sur moi... Je reviendrai plus tard avec "
"l'argent."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:755
msgid ""
"I STRONGLY doubt that is what he said. It wasn't 'The canary's kicked the "
"bucket,' was it?"
msgstr ""
"Je doute FORTEMENT que ce soit ce qu'il a dit. Ce n'était pas plutôt « Le "
"canari a cassé sa pipe » ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:756 dialog/vcmainwk.msg:324
msgid "Well, yes."
msgstr "Ben, oui."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:761
msgid "\"And?\""
msgstr "« Et ? »"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:765
msgid "And the SECOND part was...?"
msgstr "Et la SECONDE partie c'était quoi... ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:766
msgid ""
"\"Second part?\" He didn't say anything about a SECOND part. That low-down "
"bast -!"
msgstr ""
"« Seconde partie ? » Il n'a pas parlé de SECONDE partie. Cet espèce de sale "
"conna -- !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:769
msgid ""
"Just testing you. There is no second part. Well, if Zaius sent you, I "
"SUPPOSE I have some parts to spare. "
msgstr ""
"C'était juste un test. Il n'y a pas de seconde partie. Bien, si tu viens de "
"la part de Zaius, je SUPPOSE que je peux te donner des pièces. "

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:770
msgid "Here you go. Don't drop them."
msgstr "Les voilà. Ne les laisse pas tomber."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:771 dialog/vcbarkus.msg:203 dialog/vclynett.msg:315
#: dialog/vclynett.msg:693 dialog/vclynett.msg:724 dialog/vclynett.msg:735
msgid "Thanks. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Merci. J'avais encore une ou deux questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:772
msgid "Uh, thanks. "
msgstr "Heu, merci."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:780
msgid ""
"Don't you even TRY and pin that accusation on me. You want to know who did "
"it, ask Tweedledum and Tweedledumber\n"
" if they're still selling Jet laced with arsenic."
msgstr ""
"N'essaie même pas de m'accuser d'une chose pareille. Tu veux savoir qui "
"c'est, alors demande à Tweedledum et à Tweedledumber s'ils vendent encore du "
"Jet coupé avec de l'arsenic."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:781
msgid "'Tweedledum' and 'Tweedledumber?' Who are they?"
msgstr "« Tweedledum » et « Tweedledumber » ? Qui sont-ils ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:782
msgid "Jules said to ask you. He says you sell bad shit."
msgstr "Jules m'a dit de te demander. Il dit que tu vends de la merde."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:783
msgid "Jagged Jimmy said to ask you. He says you sell bad shit."
msgstr ""
"Jimmy J l'Edenté m'a dit de te demander. Il dit que tu vends de la merde."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:784
msgid "They both said to ask YOU about it. They say you sell bad shit."
msgstr ""
"Ils m'ont tous les deux dit de te demander à TOI. Il disent que tu vends de "
"la merde."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:785
msgid "I don't think it was arsenic... I DO think he was poisoned, though."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pense pas que c'était de l'arsenic... Mais j'ai la conviction qu'il a "
"été empoisonné."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:786
msgid "Can you tell me anything about this empty Jet canister?"
msgstr "Que peux-tu me dire sur ce tube de Jet vide ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:788
msgid "I'll go ask them then. "
msgstr "Je vais aller leur demander alors."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:795
msgid ""
"That vulture Jules and that lying reprobate 'Jagged Jimmy.' Jules is always "
"perched near the entrance\n"
" to town looking for ignorant visitors to victimize, and Jagged Jimmy deals "
"on 2nd Street to the rest of the Reno cattle."
msgstr ""
"Ce vautour de Jules et ce menteur dépravé de « Jimmy J l'Edenté ». Jules est "
"toujours posté à l'entrée de la ville, à attendre des visiteurs ignorants "
"pour les détrousser, et Jimmy l'Edenté revend sur la deuxième rue aux autres "
"gorets de Reno."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:798
msgid ""
"They said to ask you. They say you sell bad shit. Shit that kills people."
msgstr ""
"Ils m'ont dit de te demander. Il disent que tu vends de la merde. De la "
"merde qui tue les gens."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:800
msgid "I'll go talk to them then. "
msgstr "Je vais aller leur parler alors."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:805
msgid "Look, primate... you don't even KNOW what you're babbling about."
msgstr "Ecoute, primate... Tu ne SAIS même pas de quoi il retourne."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:806
msgid "Oh, I think I -"
msgstr "Oh, je pense que je --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:807
msgid "Yeah? Well then, why don't -"
msgstr "Ouais ? Dans ce cas, pourquoi --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:808
msgid "Nevermind. I had some other qu -"
msgstr "C'est rien. J'avais d'autres qu --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:809
msgid "Look I better be go -"
msgstr "Ecoute je ferais mieux d'y --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:815
msgid ""
"OPEN your mouth again and even a WHISPER, even a HINT, reaches Mr. Wright "
"that I... or you... might've had anything\n"
" to do that boy's OD, our lives ain't worth Brahmin shit. If THAT happens --"
msgstr ""
"Si tu l'OUVRES encore, si un MURMURE, si une ALLUSION arrive aux oreilles de "
"M. Wright sur le fait que je... ou que nous avons quelque chose à voir avec "
"l'overdose de ce garçon, nos vies valent moins que la merde de Brahmine. Si "
"CELA se produit --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:816
msgid "Oh? So you -"
msgstr "Oh ? Alors tu --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:817
msgid "Me?! Now hold on just a -"
msgstr "Moi ?!! Attends juste un --"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:825
msgid ""
"If THAT happens, you tribal SHIT, I SWEAR you'll die before I do. Now... for "
"the LAST time, that kid never bought SHIT\n"
" from me, understand? Don't you EVER say his name in here again, or so help "
"me..."
msgstr ""
"Si CELA se produit, espèce de MERDE de tribal, je JURE que tu mourras avant "
"moi. Maintenant... pour la DERNIERE fois, je n'ai jamais vendu de MERDE à ce "
"gosse, tu piges ? Ne prononce JAMAIS PLUS son nom ici, sinon..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:826
msgid ""
"JULES says he didn't sell to the kid. JIMMY says he didn't sell to the kid. "
"YOU say you didn't sell to him. One\n"
" of you is lying."
msgstr ""
"JULES dit qu'il a rien vendu au gosse. JIMMY dit qu'il a rien vendu au "
"gosse. TU dis que tu ne lui a rien vendu. L'un d'entre vous ment."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:827
msgid ""
"JULES says he didn't sell to the kid. JIMMY says he didn't sell to the kid. "
"YOU say you didn't sell to him. Either\n"
" you all are lying, or... somebody else is responsible."
msgstr ""
"JULES dit qu'il a rien vendu au gosse. JIMMY dit qu'il a rien vendu au "
"gosse. TU dis que tu ne lui a rien vendu. Soit vous mentez tous, soit... "
"quelqu'un d'autre est responsable."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:828
msgid ""
"Can you tell me anything else about Richard Wright? Who did he hang around "
"who might have used drugs?"
msgstr ""
"Que peux-tu me dire d'autre sur Richard Wright ? Traînait-il avec des gens "
"qui utilisent des stimulants ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:829
msgid "All right... look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "D'accord... Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:830
msgid "Okay, okay... I'm going now. "
msgstr "Ok, Ok... J'y vais maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:835
msgid ""
"I can answer that easy. One of those two mongrels is lying to save their "
"behind. Between the two, they\n"
" sell 90% of the Jet in Reno, and that's the only place the 'boy' we're "
"talking about could've gotten it from."
msgstr ""
"Facile. Un de ces deux bâtards ment pour sauver sa peau. A eux deux, ils "
"vendent 90% du Jet ici à Reno, et c'est le seul endroit où le garçon dont "
"nous parlons aurait pu s'en procurer."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:836
msgid ""
"Or somebody that bought from one of you three. Who were your customers last "
"month who might have had contact\n"
" with... the victim?"
msgstr ""
"Ou quelqu'un qui a acheté à l'un de vous trois. Qui sont tes clients du mois "
"dernier qui pourraient avoir été en contact avec... la victime ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:837
msgid ""
"Can you tell me anything else about Richard Wright? Did he hang around "
"anyone else who might have used drugs?"
msgstr ""
"Que peux-tu me dire d'autre sur Richard Wright ? Traînait-il avec quelqu'un "
"qui utilise des stimulants ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:838
msgid "I see... I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Je vois... J'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:839
msgid "I'm going now. "
msgstr "J'y vais maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:845
msgid "You STUPID bastard. "
msgstr "Espèce de GROS CON ! "

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:846
msgid "You STUPID bitch. "
msgstr "Espèce de GROSSE CONNE. "

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:847
msgid ""
"I TOLD you not to say his name in here. Get out! I see you again, I'll SHOOT "
"YOU DEAD. If Mr. Wright comes looking\n"
" for me, thinks I killed his boy, YOU'LL die first."
msgstr ""
"Je t'ai DIT de pas prononcer son nom ici. Dégage ! Si tu reviens, je te FAIS "
"LA PEAU. Si M. Wright pense que j'ai tué son garçon et me cherche, TU "
"mourras en premier."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:848
msgid "Don't threaten me, old man..."
msgstr "Ne me menace pas, vieillard..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:849
msgid "Whoa. I'm going now. "
msgstr "Ouahou. J'y vais maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:855
msgid ""
"I have NO idea. I didn't know the boy, so I don't know his friends OR his "
"habits. The only one who could tell\n"
" you for sure is too busy being dead in Golgotha to tell you."
msgstr ""
"Je n'en ai AUCUNE idée. Je ne connaissais pas le gamin, et je ne connais NI "
"ses amis NI ses habitudes. Le seul qui pourrait te renseigner est refroidi à "
"Golgotha."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:858
msgid "Maybe I'll do that. Goodbye. "
msgstr "Peut-être. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:865
msgid ""
"Then you wasted a trip. I PAID Mr. Salvatore his 'tribute' *two weeks ago,* "
"as per the schedule. I don't know\n"
" who you are, or what you think you're doing, but you aren't getting one red "
"chip from me. Get."
msgstr ""
"T'as fait le voyage pour rien. J'ai PAYE son « tribut » à M. Salvatore *il y "
"a deux semaines*, comme prévu. Je ne sais pas qui tu es, ou pour qui tu te "
"prends, mais t'auras rien. Pigé ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:866
msgid ""
"Look, gramps. Stop giving me a hard time. Cough up the chips, or you'll be "
"coughing up blood."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, papy. Arrête de me compliquer la vie. Crache les jetons ou je te "
"fais cracher du sang."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:867
msgid ""
"I am Mr. Salvatore's representative. You will give me the tribute I have "
"asked for, and you will do so now."
msgstr ""
"Je représente M. Salvatore. Tu vas me donner le tribut que je t'ai demandé, "
"et tout de suite."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:868
msgid "I'll check with Mr. Salvatore about the schedule, then I'll be back. "
msgstr "Je vais vérifier avec M. Salvatore et je reviens."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:875
msgid "You lose your hearing, boy? "
msgstr "Tu es sourd, mon garçon ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:876
msgid "You lose your hearing, girl? "
msgstr "Tu es sourde, ma fille ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:877
msgid ""
"I SAID I. PAID. THE. TRIBUTE. ALREADY. *Two weeks ago.* If you were really "
"from Salvatore, you would know that. Now git!"
msgstr ""
"JE T'AI DIT QUE J'AI DEJA PAYE LE TRIBUT. *Il y a deux semaines*. Si tu "
"venais vraiment de la part de Salvatore tu saurais ça. Espèce d'enflure !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:878
msgid "Look. Last time: Hand over the chips."
msgstr "Ecoute. Pour la dernière fois : donne-moi le fric."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:879
msgid ""
"You are the one who has lost your hearing. I am Mr. Salvatore's "
"representative, and you will pay the tribute."
msgstr ""
"C'est plutôt toi qui deviens sourd. Je représente M. Salvatore, et tu vas "
"payer le tribut."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:880
msgid ""
"I warned you, gramps. Looks like we'll be doing this the hard way. Time to "
"die."
msgstr ""
"Je t'aurais prévenu, papy. On dirait qu'il va falloir employer la manière "
"forte. Ton heure a sonné."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:881
msgid "I'll check with Mr. Salvatore about the tribute, then I'll be back. "
msgstr "Je vais vérifier avec M. Salvatore au sujet du tribut et je reviens."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:890
msgid ""
"Prove you're from Salvatore, and I'll CONSIDER giving you the chips. Else, "
"you aren't getting shit."
msgstr ""
"Prouve que tu viens de la part de Salvatore, et j'ENVISAGERAI de te donner "
"le fric. Sinon, tu peux toujours te gratter."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:891
msgid ""
"I do not need to prove myself. I am his representative, and that is all you "
"need to know."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas à le prouver. Je le représente, et c'est tout ce que tu dois "
"savoir."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:892
msgid "What, you think this laser pistol is just for show?"
msgstr "Quoi, tu crois que ce pistolet laser c'est juste pour rigoler ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:893
msgid "If you do not give me the tribute in five seconds, I WILL kill you."
msgstr "Si tu ne me donnes pas le tribut d'ici cinq secondes, je VAIS te tuer."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:900
msgid ""
"Get the hell out of here, you penny-ante thug! You so much as show your face "
"in here again, and I'll shoot you myself!"
msgstr ""
"Bon sang tire-toi, espèce de brute ancestrale ! Si tu oses revenir montrer "
"ta tête ici, je te tuerai moi-même !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:901
msgid "I warned you. Time to die."
msgstr "Je t'avais prévenu. Ton heure a sonné."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:910
msgid ""
"Hmmmph. Don't matter, I can't pay. The last collection nearly wiped me out."
msgstr ""
"Pfffff. C'est sans importance, je ne peux pas payer. La dernière perception "
"a vidé mes caisses."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:911
msgid ""
"That is not my concern. You will get me the money now. Mr. Salvatore does "
"not want to hear your excuses."
msgstr ""
"C'est pas mon problème. Tu vas me trouver cet argent maintenant. M. "
"Salvatore ne veut pas entendre tes excuses."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:920
msgid ""
"Threatening me ain't gonna help. Mr. Salvatore wants his money. I don't have "
"it. He'll be mad at me, but he'll\n"
" be mad at you, too. Salvatore doesn't LIKE people who let him down... you "
"better figure out something quick."
msgstr ""
"La menace n'arrangera rien. M. Salvatore veut son argent. Je ne l'ai pas. Il "
"va être vert contre moi, mais contre toi aussi. Salvatore n'aime PAS les "
"gens qui le laissent tomber... Tu ferais mieux de vite trouver une solution."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:921
msgid ""
"I already have. I will pay your share for this period. In exchange, you will "
"give me a discount at your store."
msgstr ""
"C'est déjà fait. Je vais payer ta part pour cette fois. En échange, tu vas "
"me faire une remise dans ta boutique."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:924
msgid "I'll try and figure something out... I'll be back."
msgstr "Je vais essayer de trouver quelque chose... Je reviens."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:930
msgid "Now hold on, you Neanderthal..."
msgstr "Attends un peu, Néandertal..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:931
msgid ""
"I will not argue with you anymore. My patience is at an end. Those are my "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"Je ne vais pas continuer à discuter avec toi. Ma patience est à bout. C'est "
"ça ou rien."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:940
msgid ""
"I... look, now, I... hmmmm... all right, then. You get a...\"discount.\""
msgstr ""
"Je... Ecoute, maintenant, je... Hummm... D'accord. Je t'offre une... « "
"remise »."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:941
msgid "Let me see your stock. I will make my 'purchases' now."
msgstr "Fais-moi voir ton stock. Je vais faire mes « achats »."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:943
msgid "I don't want anything now, but don't worry, I'll be back. "
msgstr "Je veux rien pour l'instant, mais ne t'inquiète pas, je reviendrai."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:950
msgid ""
"(Folds arms.) Adequate. If you are expecting some handout for being a Good "
"Samaritan, you are GRAVELY\n"
" mistaken. Now... what do you want?"
msgstr ""
"[Il croise les bras.] Si tu espères une récompense pour ta bonne action, tu "
"fais VRAIMENT erreur. Maintenant... que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:951
msgid ""
"Goddamn whatever deathclaw or marketing director spawned you! You WANT "
"something?! Here! HERE! Take THIS!\n"
" Take ALL I have! Anything to get you to LEAVE ME ALONE!"
msgstr ""
"Maudit soit le Griffemort ou le responsable marketing qui t'a fait naître ! "
"Tu VEUX quelque chose ?!! Tiens ! TIENS ! Prends CA ! Prends TOUT ce que "
"j'ai ! Mais LAISSE-MOI TRANQUILLE !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:952
msgid "Let me see your stock."
msgstr "Fais-moi voir ton stock."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:955
msgid "What the hell IS this...? "
msgstr "Mais qu'est-ce que C'EST que ça... ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:960
msgid "Poisoned? What are you babbling about?"
msgstr "Empoisonné ? Qu'est-ce que tu racontes ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:961
msgid ""
"The body's condition was consistent with Radscorpion poisoning. I think he "
"died because his Jet was poisoned,\n"
" NOT because of an overdose."
msgstr ""
"L'état du corps faisait penser à un empoisonnement au venin de radscorpion. "
"Je pense qu'il est mort parce que son Jet était empoisonné, PAS à cause "
"d'une overdose."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:962
msgid ""
"I found an empty Jet canister in his room. It had traces of Radscorpion "
"venom in it."
msgstr ""
"J'ai trouvé un tube de Jet vide dans sa chambre. Il contenait des traces de "
"venin de radscorpion."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:964
msgid "Forget it. I have to be going now. "
msgstr "Laisse tomber. Je dois y aller maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:970
msgid ""
"Radscorpion...? (Renesco suddenly freezes, as if remembering something.)"
msgstr ""
"Radscorpion... ? [Renesco s'immobilise soudain, comme s'il se souvenait de "
"quelque chose.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:971
msgid "You son of a bitch. You *poisoned* the kid, didn't you?"
msgstr "Espèce de fils de pute. Tu as *empoisonné* le gosse, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:972
msgid "You know something about it, don't you?"
msgstr "Tu sais quelque chose, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:980
msgid "Whoa! Now wait just a minute...!"
msgstr "Houla ! Mais attends une minute... !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:981
msgid ""
"Don't mess with me, Renesco! You try and weasel out of this one, and you'll "
"be joining Richard. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"M'embrouille pas, Renesco ! Si t'essaies de te débiner, tu rejoindras "
"Richard. C'est compris ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:982
msgid ""
"That's it. Me and Mr. Wright are going to have a little talk. Good day, "
"Renesco... or should I say, \"goodbye.\""
msgstr ""
"Ca suffit. M. Wright et moi on va avoir une petite discussion. Au revoir, "
"Renesco... ou plutôt, « Adieu »..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:990
msgid ""
"Wait a minute! Look... I didn't SELL it to the kid! He never bought ANYTHING "
"from me! I... was ASKED\n"
" to make some Jet laced with radscorpion venom, but... but I DIDN'T sell it "
"to the kid!"
msgstr ""
"Attends une minute ! Ecoute... Je ne l'ai pas VENDU au gosse ! Il ne m'a "
"jamais RIEN acheté ! On... m'a DEMANDE de préparer du Jet coupé avec du "
"venin de radscorpion, mais... mais je ne l'ai PAS vendu au gosse !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:991
msgid "You were ASKED to make poisoned Jet? For who?"
msgstr "On t'a DEMANDE de préparer du Jet empoisonné ? Qui ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:992
msgid "Who DID you sell it to?"
msgstr "A qui l'AS-TU vendu ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:995
msgid ""
"The Salvatores requested it -- they said it was a...\"special order.\" I "
"didn't know they were going to give\n"
" it to the Wright kid. You HAVE to believe me... I don't poison kids!"
msgstr ""
"Les Salvatore. Ils ont dit que c'était une... « commande spéciale ». Je "
"savais pas qu'ils allaient le filer au gamin Wright. Tu DOIS me croire... Je "
"n'empoisonne pas les gosses !"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:996
msgid "Just adults, huh, Renesco? You sorry son of a bitch..."
msgstr "Seulement les adultes, hein, Renesco ? Espèce de fils de pute..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:997
msgid ""
"WHY did you poison the Jet? You had to know they were going to kill someone "
"with it."
msgstr ""
"POURQUOI as-tu empoisonné le Jet ? Tu savais bien qu'ils allaient tuer "
"quelqu'un avec."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:998
msgid "All right, all right, I believe you. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "D'accord, d'accord, je te crois. J'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:999
msgid "Just shut up. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Ferme-la. Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1000
msgid "The Salvatores, huh? I think Mr. Wright will want to know about this. "
msgstr ""
"Les Salvatore, hein ? Je pense que M. Wright sera intéressé par cette "
"information."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1005
msgid ""
"The Salvatores OWN me, they OWN this place, and when they want something, I "
"give it to them, or they'll kill\n"
" me and have me replaced. I never meant any harm to that boy."
msgstr ""
"J'APPARTIENS aux Salvatore, cet endroit leur APPARTIENT, quand ils veulent "
"quelque chose je leur donne, sinon ils me feraient tuer et remplacer. Je "
"n'ai jamais voulu faire de mal à cet enfant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1007
msgid "Just shut up. Look, I had some other questions for you..."
msgstr "Ferme-la. Ecoute, j'avais d'autres questions pour toi..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1008
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure you had the best of intentions while you were spiking that "
"Jet with poison. Goodbye, Renesco."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, c'est ça, t'avais les meilleures intentions du monde quand t'as "
"injecté ce poison dans le Jet. Adieu Renesco."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1009
msgid "Later, Renesco. "
msgstr "A plus tard, Renesco."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1020
msgid ""
"It's empty. It's a Jet canister like the hundreds of others all over New "
"Reno. Anything else I can help you with?"
msgstr ""
"Vide. C'est un tube de Jet comme des centaines d'autres à New Reno. Autre "
"chose que je puisse faire pour toi ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1021
msgid "Does this belong to you?"
msgstr "Ceci t'appartient-il ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1022
msgid ""
"Know anything about the radscorpion venom traces that are in this canister?"
msgstr ""
"T'as une idée sur les traces de venin de radscorpion qui sont dans ce tube ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1023
msgid "Yeah, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Ouais, j'avais d'autres questions..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1030
msgid "No. Anything ELSE I can help you with?"
msgstr "Non. Je peux faire AUTRE chose pour toi ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1033
msgid "No. Goodbye. "
msgstr "Non. Au revoir."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1040
msgid ""
"Golgotha? Mass graveyard outside of town to the south. Follow the stench... "
"the one OTHER than your own."
msgstr ""
"Le Golgotha ? Un énorme cimetière situé au Sud, hors de la ville. Suis la "
"puanteur... l'AUTRE bien sûr, pas la tienne."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1042
msgid ""
"You keep sweet-talking me like that, Renesco, and you'll be a long time "
"dying. "
msgstr ""
"Si tu continues à me parler sur ce ton doucereux, Renesco, ton agonie sera "
"terrible."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1043
msgid "THANKS, Renesco. "
msgstr "MERCI, Renesco."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1526
msgid ""
"And sometimes the elder gets upset at little things, like... heh-heh... that "
"one night when I ignored my vow of\n"
" chastity and snuck out with Kor - Who - Thunders - Like - a - Thousand - "
"Stallions to the Arroyo canyon..."
msgstr ""
"Et parfois la doyenne est contrariée pour de petits riens, comme... hé hé... "
"la nuit où j'avais oublié mon voeu de chasteté et où j'étais sortie en "
"cachette dans le canyon d'Arroyo avec Kor - Qui - Fulmine - Comme - Mille - "
"Etalons..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1536
msgid ""
"It was like yesterday. Kor's body rippled like bronze in the moonlight as I "
"knelt down and... hey, you know what?\n"
" You might like the elder. She's about your age."
msgstr ""
"Je m'en souviens comme si c'était hier. Le corps de bronze de Kor ondulait "
"dans le clair de lune lorsque je me suis agenouillée et... Hé, tu sais quoi "
"? Tu pourrais apprécier la doyenne. Elle a environ ton âge."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:2000
msgid "You have exposed Renesco's involvement in Richard Wright's death."
msgstr ""
"Tu as découvert l'implication de Renesco dans la mort de Richard Wright."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:5257
msgid " is so big. Me go now "
msgstr " est très grand. Moi partir maintenant."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:5259
msgid " no shout WHY YOU KEEP SHOUTING BE STOPPING THE SHOUTING "
msgstr " pas crier, POURQUOI TOI CRIER COMME CA ? ARRETE CRIER."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:5260
msgid ""
"...*sniff*...go get big brother to beat you up, old man! Then we'll have ice "
"cream and...*sniff*...CAKE\n"
" and a big party with clowns and..."
msgstr ""
"... [Sniff...] Moi aller chercher grand frère pour taper toi, vieux ! Après "
"nous manger glace et... [Sniff...] du GATEAU et belle fête avec clowns et..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6000
msgid ""
"I was looking for some pointers on heart health. Think you could fill me in "
"on a thing or two?"
msgstr ""
"Je cherche des infos sur la santé cardiaque. Tu pourrais me filer un tuyau "
"ou deux ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6010
msgid ""
"I know this must come as something of a shock to you, but a white smock does "
"not automatically confer a cardiology degree. I am a pharmacist. I produce "
"chems. Then you buy them. Then, you leave. Quietly."
msgstr ""
"Je pense que ça va te faire un choc, mais une blouse blanche ne donne pas "
"automatiquement droit à un diplôme en cardiologie. Je suis pharmacien. Je "
"produit des drogues. Tu les achètes. Et tu t'en vas. Calmement."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6011
msgid "Fair enough. Moving on, then..."
msgstr "D'accord. Faisons ça, alors..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6012
msgid "C'mon, could you humor me? Just this once? Pretty pleeease?"
msgstr "Allez, sois un peu indulgent. Juste cette fois ? St'euplait ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6020
msgid ""
"Fine. My prescription is cigarettes and red meat, in large quantities. Was "
"that all? If I have to put up with much more vacuous prattle today, I'm "
"liable to have a stroke myself."
msgstr ""
"Ok. Ma prescription c'est pas de cigarettes et de viande rouge, en grande "
"quantité. Et c'est tout. Si je devais continuer avec ce genre de blabla "
"inutile toute la journée, je serais bon pour avoir une attaque moi-même."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6021
msgid ""
"Yeah, you are pretty high strung, aren't you? I'll bet Hakunin could help "
"you with that. He's the medicine man back home, in Arroyo. Say, have I ever "
"told you about Arroyo?"
msgstr ""
"Ouais, t'es plutôt tendu non ? Je pense que Hakunin pourrait t'aider. C'est l"
"'homme-médecine de ma tribu, à Arroyo. T'ai-je déjà parlé d'Arroyo ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6022
msgid "And wouldn't that be a tragedy. Next question..."
msgstr "Et ça ne serait pas une tragédie. Question suivante..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6023
msgid "Okay then, just one more quick thing..."
msgstr "D'accord, encore une ou deux questions rapidement..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6024
msgid "Gee, thanks Renesco. I knew I could count on you. You take care now."
msgstr ""
"Hé, merci Renesco. Je savais que je pouvais compter sur toi. Prends soin de "
"toi."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6030
msgid "I need you to fix me up with a special order."
msgstr "J'ai besoin que tu m'aides pour cette commande spéciale."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6031
msgid "So, about that special order we were discussing..."
msgstr "A propos de cette commande spéciale dont nous avons discuté..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6040
msgid ""
"Yes? And? Were you expecting me to read your mind, or would you like me to "
"surprise you?"
msgstr ""
"Ouais ? Et ? Tu espères que je lise dans tes pensées, ou tu veux que je te "
"surprenne ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6041
msgid ""
"Not on your life, asshole. What I need are some... um... pills. For, um... ("
"trail off, glance pointedly in the direction of your belt buckle, look "
"Renesco in the eye, and clear your throat)."
msgstr ""
"Jamais de la vie, sale con. J'ai besoin de... euh... pilules. Pour, euh... ["
"Tu regardes distinctement en direction de ta ceinture, puis tu le fixes dans "
"les yeux et tu t'éclaircis la gorge.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6042
msgid ""
"Not on your life, asshole. What I need are some... um... pills. For, um... a "
"man's... (trail off, glance pointedly in the direction of your belt buckle, "
"look Renesco in the eye, and clear your throat)."
msgstr ""
"Jamais de la vie, sale con. J'ai besoin de... euh... pilules. Pour, euh... "
"un homme... [Tu regardes distinctement en direction de ta ceinture, puis tu "
"le fixes dans les yeux et tu t'éclaircis la gorge.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6043
msgid ""
"I'd like you to make me a batch of, erm, \"Corsican Brothers chewable "
"multivitamins.\""
msgstr ""
"J'aimerai que tu me concoctes un peu de, euh, \"Cocktail Multivitaminé des "
"Frères Corses\"."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6044
msgid ""
"I'm looking for something you'd use to, uh, sharpen your spear, you know? "
"Put a little bite back into your gecko?"
msgstr ""
"Je cherche quelque chose qui pourrait t'aider à, euh, aiguiser ma lance, tu "
"vois ? Un truc qui ajoute du mordant à ton p'tit gecko ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6045
msgid ""
"I'm looking for something a man would use to, uh, sharpen his spear, you "
"know? Put a little bite back into his gecko?"
msgstr ""
"Je cherche quelque chose qui pourrait aider un homme à, euh, aiguiser sa "
"lance, tu vois ? Un truc qui ajoute du mordant à son p'tit gecko ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6046
msgid ""
"I'm looking for a complex PDE5-inhibitor compound, and I need the pills made "
"according to my distinct specifications."
msgstr ""
"Je cherche un composant complexe, un inhibiteur de PDE5, et en pilules pour "
"satisfaire mes spécifications."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6050
msgid ""
"What in Golgotha are you babbling about? English, Tribal! Do you speak it?"
msgstr ""
"Par tous les saints de Golgotha, mais qu'est-ce que tu baragouines ? En "
"français, tribal ! Tu sais parler Français ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6051
msgid ""
"(Sigh...) I would like you to make me some... erectile dysfunction "
"medication."
msgstr ""
"[Soupir...] J'aimerais que tu me fasses un médicament contre... les "
"problèmes d'impuissance."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6052
msgid "You know. Boner pills. Uh, for a friend."
msgstr "Tu sais bien. Des pilules pour bander. Euh, pour un ami, bien sûr."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6053
msgid "Boner pills. Not for me, obviously."
msgstr "Des pilules pour bander. Pas pour moi, évidemment."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6054
msgid "You know exactly what I mean, you withered old bastard."
msgstr "Tu sais exactement de quoi je parle, vieux bâtard flétri."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6060
msgid ""
"(He leers derisively at you.) Hnn! I wouldn't exactly call that a \"special\""
" order. Half the reason this deviant cesspit of a city exists is to provide "
"rutting degenerates such as yourself with an easy means of drowning in their "
"own unsavory juices."
msgstr ""
"[Il lorgne sur toi avec dérision.] Ha ! Je n'appellerais pas exactement ça "
"une commande *spéciale*. Simplement parce si ce cloaque de ville existe, "
"c'est pour proposer à des dégénérés de ton genre, un moyen facile de se "
"noyer dans leur jus infect."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6061
msgid ""
"I've got over a dozen brands here. Take your pick. And don't hurt yourself "
"thinking too hard about it; they're all completely identical aside from the "
"packaging."
msgstr ""
"J'ai une bonne douzaine de marques. Fais ton choix. Et ne te casse pas trop "
"la tête, elles sont toutes identiques mis à part le paquetage."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6062
msgid "None of that is going to cut it. I need these made to order."
msgstr "C'est pas grave. J'en ai besoin pour une commande."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6063
msgid "That's a good start, but I had something specific in mind."
msgstr "C'est un bon début, mais j'avais autre chose en tête."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6070
msgid ""
"(He sneers.) Oh, discerning customer, are you? Fine. Go on. It's been awhile "
"since I got to charge anyone the specialty rate. Most of the local street "
"vermin could care less what they're killing themselves with."
msgstr ""
"[Il renifle.] Oh, un client perspicace ? Bien, continuons. Ca fait longtemps "
"que je n'ai pas fait de spécialité hors des clous. La plupart des vermines "
"du quartier en ont rien à foutre, tant que ça les défonce."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6071
msgid ""
"Yeah, I hear that works out pretty well for you. Get those dollar signs out "
"of your eyes, though, I'm not asking for anything too special. Just take "
"some of that off the rack crap, grind it up, and shape it into smooth, "
"circular, red pills, about yea big. Sound doable?"
msgstr ""
"Ouais, j'ai entendu dire que ça marchait bien pour toi. Mais tu peux retirer "
"les dollars dans tes yeux, je ne cherche pas quelque chose de trop spécial. "
"Prends la came classique et mets la en forme de pilules rouges et rondes. "
"C'est faisable ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6072
msgid ""
"(Show Renesco one of the heart pills.) What I need you to do is to make me a "
"batch of those pills, only they need to look *exactly* like this one."
msgstr ""
"[Tu montres à Renesco une des pilules pour le coeur.] Ce dont j'ai besoin, "
"c'est que tu me fasses un genre de pilule comme ça. Elles doivent rassembler "
"*exactement* à ça."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6073
msgid ""
"Chemically, the base formulation can match the generic. As far as physical "
"parameters... hmm... let's say, about a centimeter and a half in diameter, "
"smooth, mildly rounded face, dull red coating. Lozenge edge of about an "
"eighth-centimeter. Shouldn't be too much of a challenge for a man of your "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Chimiquement, la formule de base peut être générique, mais au niveau "
"physique... Hmm... Disons un centimètre et demi de diamètre, lisse, "
"légèrement arrondi sur les faces avec une mince pellicule rouge très fine. "
"Le bord du losange doit faire 8 centimètres. Cela ne devrait pas être trop "
"dur pour quelqu'un avec ton expérience."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6080
msgid ""
"Hmmm. Is that all? Remedial stuff, really. And the base materials are dirt "
"cheap. Accounting for labor... $200 should suffice."
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. C'est tout ? C'est un genre de lifting pour médoc. Et les matériaux de "
"base sont pas chers. Pour le travail... $200 devraient suffire."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6081
msgid ""
"What?! If I wanted to get screwed, I'd have gone to the Cat's Paw! At least "
"I'd know what I was getting myself into."
msgstr ""
"Quoi ?! Si je voulais me faire entuber profond, j'irais direct au Cat's Paw "
"! Au moins je sais pourquoi je paie, là-bas."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6082
msgid ""
"You know as well as I do that we're talking about $15 in chems and five "
"minutes of mortar work. I think we need to talk some numbers here."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, je sais parfaitement qu'on parle de $15 de médoc et de 5 minutes de "
"boulot dans un mortier. Je pense qu'on doit reparler chiffres, là."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6083
msgid "All right. You've got overhead, I've got better places to be. $200."
msgstr "D'accord. Tu y ajoutes des notes de frais. Allez, j'dois y aller. $200."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6084
msgid ""
"Not sure I can spare that much at the moment. Maybe we'll come back to this "
"later."
msgstr "Je crois pas que j'ai autant d'argent sur moi. Je reviendrai plus tard."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6090
msgid ""
"(His scowl deepens.) I'm not in the mood to beat around the bush with you. "
"You think I'm going to buy that you're just some particularly picky homo not-"
"so-erectus? PLEASE! Do you have any idea how long I've been doing this?"
msgstr ""
"[Il te fusille du regard.] Je suis pas trop d'humeur à aller jouer dans les "
"buissons avec toi. Tu crois que j'vais acheter ça parce que je suis juste un "
"homo-pas-érectus du genre exigeant ? Mais OUI, c'est ça !! Sais-tu au moins "
"depuis quand je le fais ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6091
msgid ""
"You obviously haven't spent much time out of your cave, so take my word for "
"it when I say there aren't too many kinds of pills going around that match "
"that oddly specific description of yours, and one *very notable* one comes "
"to mind immediately. \"Specialty\" items, specialty prices, throwback. "
"Welcome to New Reno. That'll be $300."
msgstr ""
"Tu as l'air d'avoir passé pas mal de temps dans ta cave, alors écoute moi "
"bien quand je dis que ce n'est pas le genre de pilules qui court les rues. "
"Des objets *Spéciaux*, entraînent des pris *spéciaux*. Bienvenue à New Reno, "
"ce sera $300."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6092
msgid ""
"Look, I made sure no one even *breathed your name* in connection with that "
"Wright affair. You do this for me, we're square. Okay?"
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, je suis certain que personne n'a encore prononcé ton nom dans "
"l'affaire Wright. Tu fais ça pour moi et on est quitte, d'accord ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6093
msgid ""
"I covered your ass with Salvatore. Consider this collection on your debt."
msgstr ""
"J'ai couvert ton cul pour les Salvatore. Tu peux mettre ça sur le compte de "
"ta dette envers moi."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6094
msgid ""
"I don't think *Mr. Bishop* would be very happy with you if he knew you were "
"hindering his interests like this, Renesco."
msgstr ""
"Je ne crois pas que *Monsieur Bishop* sera très content d'apprendre que tu "
"entraves ses intérêts comme ça, Renesco."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6095
msgid "Fine. $300, and that's for the pills *and* your discretion. Understand?"
msgstr "D'accord. $300, et c'est pour les pilules ET ta discrétion. Compris ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6096
msgid ""
"Whoa, easy there fuzzy little man peach. Maybe I'll just come back when "
"you're in a better mood."
msgstr ""
"Whaou, mon petit chaton je t'ai frisé les moustaches ? Je reviendrai plus "
"tard quand tu seras de meilleure humeur."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6100
msgid ""
"Well. I guess that concludes our business, then. I must say, tribal, this "
"has been... almost *tolerable*. Now, sit on your hands and try not to ruin "
"the moment. (Renesco takes your money and goes to work.)"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien. J'ai l'impression que cela conclut notre affaire. Je dois dire, "
"tribal, que c'était à peu près... *supportable*. Allez fais le beau et "
"essaie de ne pas te gâcher la surprise. [Renesco prend ton argent et va "
"travailler.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6101
msgid ""
"(Minutes pass. Renesco dusts off his hands and rolls a pill bottle "
"indistinguishable from Westin's across the counter at you.) There you are. "
"Now, are we done here?"
msgstr ""
"[Les minutes passent. Renesco s'essuie les mains et te fait rouler une boîte "
"de pilules identiques à celle de Westin sous la vitre du comptoir.] Et "
"voilà. C'est bon ?"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6103
msgid "That's it for me. See you around."
msgstr "C'est parfait pour moi. On se voit plus tard."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6110
msgid ""
"(Renesco flushes, nostrils flaring in anger, but then looks down and begins "
"cleaning his glasses very intently on his smock as he speaks.) Primate, the "
"ONLY two things I will EVER be indebted to you for are JACK and SHIT."
msgstr ""
"[Renesco rougit, ses narines s'ouvrent de colère, mais ensuite il regarde "
"vers le sol et nettoie ses lunettes sur sa blouse alors qu'il te parle.] "
"Ecoute bien primate, les deux seules choses pour lesquelles je serai jamais "
"endetté vis à vis de toi sont VA-TE et FAIRE-FOUTRE."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6111
msgid ""
"Now, that being the case... if it will disabuse you of this intolerable "
"provincial delusion that you've somehow got something over me, the very "
"THOUGHT of which makes me ill in ways I lack the words to describe... "
msgstr ""
"Maintenant, qu'il en est ainsi... J'espère que cela réduira au silence tes "
"délires hallucinatoires selon lesquels tu te permets de me parler sur ce "
"ton. La moindre PENSEE relative à tout ceci me rend malade, j'en trouve à "
"peine les mots..."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6112
msgid ""
"I... SUPPOSE... your thrice damned pills are a small price to pay. And if I "
"EVER AGAIN hear you say a word that even RHYMES with \"owe,\" the shop is "
"getting a new chimp-skin rug. Sit down, shut up, and work on growing a pair "
"of opposable thumbs while I get this compounded. (Renesco goes to work.)"
msgstr ""
"Je... SUPPOSE... que tes trois putains de pilules ne coûtent pas si cher, "
"après tout. Mais si tu reviens ne serait-ce qu'UNE SEULE FOIS avec un mot "
"qui rime avec DETTE dans la bouche, ce magasin aura un nouveau squelette en "
"guise de mascotte. Assieds-toi, ferme là et réfléchis à comment te faire "
"pousser une paire de pouces opposables pendant que je prépare le composé. ["
"Renesco va travailler.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6120
msgid ""
"(Renesco gazes around wide-eyed at the rest of the shop's chemically "
"stupefied patrons before leaning in and rounding on you in a lowered voice, "
"sibilant with rage) You. IGNORANT. Toad-licking, tumleweed worshipping ass. "
"I don't think *Mr Bishop* would be very happy AT ALL if he were to hear that "
"one of the talking brahmin turds on his payroll had been dropping his name "
"while purchasing HIGHLY SPECIALIZED MURDER WEAPONS."
msgstr ""
"[Renesco regarde les autres clients défoncés dans le magasin et s'adresse à "
"toi d'une voix basse, mais remplie de colère.] Toi. L'ABRUTI. Le boulet "
"insignifiant lécheur de cul. Je ne crois pas que *Monsieur Bishop* sera "
"content DU TOUT s'il venait à entendre qu'une de ses Brahmines idiotes avait "
"lâché son nom en achetant des ARMES DE MEURTRES EN SERIE."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6121
msgid ""
"In fact, I don't think *anyone involved* would be very happy about it in the "
"end, unless you count the feeling of relief that comes when Bishop's people "
"finally tire of pulling bits off of you with METALWORKING TOOLS and decide "
"to FINISH THE JOB."
msgstr ""
"En fait, je crois que *personne d'autre* ne serait heureux au final, à moins "
"que tu penses au soulagement que tu auras quand les gardes de Bishop en "
"auront assez de te tirer des morceaux de chair avec leurs OUTILS EN METAL et "
"qu'ils décident de TERMINER LE TRAVAIL une fois pour toutes."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6122
msgid ""
"(He blanches.) Oh God. I didn't hear this. I can't know this. Turn around. "
"Get out. NOW. Find somewhere else to finish this mystical, ancestral vision "
"quest up your own ass. Somewhere far, far away. (Renesco hurries off to look "
"busy on the other side of his cage.)"
msgstr ""
"[Il blanchit.] Oh mon dieu. Je n'ai pas entendu ça. Je ne sais rien. Va-"
"t'en. MAINTENANT. Trouve quelqu'un d'autre pour finir cette quête mystique "
"et ancestrale qui te sort du trou de balle. Quelque part loin, très loin. ["
"Renesco se dépêche d'avoir l'air occupé de l'autre côté de sa cage.]"

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6130
msgid ""
"All the parts that weren't belches or grunts, anyway. Now wait here. ("
"Renesco takes your money and goes to work). And for the love of God, *try* "
"not to get any of my merchandise stuck in your simian face-holes while my "
"back is turned."
msgstr ""
"Finalement tu as sorti autre chose que des rots et des grognements. Attends "
"ici. [Renesco prends ton argent et va travailler]. Et pour l'amour de Dieu, "
"n'essaie de ne pas te fourrer un de mes produits dans tes trous de nez alors "
"que j'ai le dos tourné."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6141
msgid ""
"Oh, *this* again. My fee is $200, in the highly likely event that it slipped "
"your mind."
msgstr ""
"Oh, encore *ça*. C'est $200, dans le cas le plus probable où ça t'aurais "
"échappé."

#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:6142
msgid ""
"Once more, in case you were distracted by something shiny the first time "
"around: $300. And don't push your luck."
msgstr ""
"Encore une fois, au cas où tu aurais été distrait la dernière fois : c'est $"
"300. Et ne tente pas trop ta chance avec moi."

#: dialog/ncrent.msg:100
msgid ""
"You have entered the outskirts of the walled settlement of New California "
"Republic."
msgstr ""
"Tu es entré dans le campement aux alentours des murs de la République de "
"Nouvelle Californie."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:100
msgid "You see the lead researcher, Marjorie Reed."
msgstr "Tu vois Marjorie Reed, la chef des chercheurs."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:150
msgid ""
"You see a tired-looking woman. Her head has been shaved bald, and she is "
"wearing a white coat."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois une femme à l'air fatiguée. Elle a le crâne rasé et porte une blouse "
"blanche."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:151
msgid ""
"You see Marjorie Reed. She is filling a hypodermic, grumbling slightly to "
"herself."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois Marjorie Reed. Elle remplit une seringue. Elle grommelle toute seule."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:200
msgid "Hello, Myron."
msgstr "Salut, Myron."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:201
msgid "Myron, do you have a minute...?"
msgstr "Myron, as-tu une minute... ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:202
msgid "Any more word when new slaves will be delivered, Myron?"
msgstr "As-tu entendu parler d'un nouvel arrivage d'esclaves, Myron ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:203
msgid "Myron, these new results are very promising..."
msgstr "Myron, les derniers résultats sont très prometteurs..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:204
msgid "Myron, a minute of your time?"
msgstr "Myron, as-tu une minute ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:215 dialog/ncscient.msg:159
msgid "Where the hell is Myron..."
msgstr "Merde, où est Myron ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:216 dialog/ncscient.msg:160
msgid "Get Myron up here. He has to see this."
msgstr "Fais venir Myron. Il faut qu'il voie ça."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:217 dialog/ncscient.msg:161
msgid "Wish these slaves would shut up..."
msgstr "J'aimerais que ces esclaves la ferment..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:218 dialog/ncscient.msg:162
msgid "Where did I leave that syringe..."
msgstr "Où ai-je laissé cette seringue..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:219
msgid "Has anyone seen No. 31? He was here just a second ago."
msgstr "Quelqu'un a-t-il vu le n°31 ? Il était là il y a une seconde."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:220 dialog/ncscient.msg:164
msgid "Have the slaves bring more of the Jet Beta."
msgstr "Débrouille-toi pour que les esclaves apportent plus de Jet Béta."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:221 dialog/ncscient.msg:165
msgid "Test results from Jet Beta are very promising, but..."
msgstr "Les résultats des tests de Jet Béta sont très prometteurs, mais..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:222 dialog/ncscient.msg:166
msgid ""
"\"High\" lasts 15 min to an hour... calculate one dose/hour period... "
"hmmmmnnn."
msgstr ""
"Ca *plane* de 15 minutes à une heure... Calculer la période d'une dose par "
"heure... Hum."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:223
msgid "No. 12 still keeps having nasal bleeding..."
msgstr "N°12 souffre toujours de saignements de nez."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:224
msgid ""
"That's the fifth time No. 12 has had seizures... up the dose, see what "
"happens..."
msgstr ""
"C'est la cinquième fois que n°12 fait des crises... On augmente la dose et "
"on voit..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:225 dialog/ncscient.msg:169
msgid "Well, what SORT of hallucinations was he having?"
msgstr "Bon, quelles SORTES d'hallucinations avait-il ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:226 dialog/ncscient.msg:170
msgid ""
"Check that one's heart rate. If it's still within tolerable limits, up the "
"dosage."
msgstr ""
"Vérifie son pouls. S'il est encore dans des limites tolérables, augmente la "
"dose."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:227 dialog/ncscient.msg:171
msgid ""
"Why did the slave in the control group kill herself? We weren't even testing "
"her!"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi l'esclave du groupe témoin s'est-elle suicidée ? On ne s'est même "
"pas servi d'elle pour faire des expériences !"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:228
msgid "Damn guards can keep track of their own asses..."
msgstr "Ces foutus gardes sont une vraie bande d'incapables."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:235
msgid "Hello, Myron, sir. Tests are proceeding as scheduled."
msgstr "Bonjour chef. Les tests se passent comme prévu."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:236
msgid ""
"Myron, sir, this new strain of Jet is extremely addictive. The slaves are "
"almost willing to kill each other for it."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron, ce nouveau lot de Jet crée une forte dépendance. Les esclaves "
"sont presque prêts à s'entre-tuer pour en avoir."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:237
msgid ""
"Myron, sir, you'll be pleased to note that the slaves would rather take Jet "
"than eat, it's so potent."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron, tu seras content de savoir que les esclaves préfèrent prendre "
"du Jet plutôt que se nourrir."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:238 dialog/ncscient.msg:203
msgid "Who are these people with you, Myron? New subjects?"
msgstr "Qui sont ces gens Myron ? De nouveaux sujets ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:239
msgid ""
"Myron, sir, the third test group seem to be doing the best of all the groups."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron, il semble que le troisième groupe soit le meilleur de tous."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:240
msgid ""
"Myron, sir, if you have a moment... I think the next test group should "
"include at least three children, sir."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron, si tu as un moment... Je crois que le prochain groupe devrait "
"comporter au moins 3 enfants."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:241
msgid ""
"Myron, sir, No. 46 had a heart attack; we are restricting doses to six times "
"a day from now on."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron, le n°46 a eu une attaque cardiaque, nous avons réduit les doses "
"à 6 par jour."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:242
msgid ""
"Myron, sir, please... we need a new shipment of hypodermics from Vault City. "
"We can't keep re-using these."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron... Nous aurions besoin d'une nouvelle livraison de seringues de "
"la Cité de l'Abri. On ne peut pas réutiliser celles-ci à l'infini."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:243 dialog/ncscient.msg:156
msgid "Any more word when new slaves will be delivered, Myron, sir?"
msgstr "On a des nouvelles du prochain arrivage d'esclaves, chef ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:244
msgid ""
"Myron, sir, we moved three slaves from the control group into the test group "
"because of those respiratory failures we had last week."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron, nous avons déplacé 3 esclaves du groupe témoin vers le groupe "
"d'essai à cause des problèmes respiratoires de la semaine dernière."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:245
msgid ""
"Myron, bad news, sir. We had to shoot one slave for trying to escape. What a "
"waste."
msgstr ""
"Chef, Myron, mauvaise nouvelle : nous avons dû abattre un esclave qui "
"tentait de s'échapper. Quel gâchis."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:246
msgid ""
"Myron, this new hallucinogen you've developed is promising, but it is not as "
"addictive as Jet..."
msgstr ""
"Myron, l'hallucinogène que nous développons en ce moment est prometteur, "
"mais il ne rend pas aussi dépendant que le Jet."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:250
msgid "(The bald woman doesn't even look up from her clipboard.) Yes?"
msgstr "[La femme chauve ne lève même pas les yeux de son écritoire.] Oui ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:253
msgid "Heh-heh. You bald. You look like man"
msgstr "Hé-hé ! Toi chauve. Toi ressembler homme."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:254
msgid "Delenn?"
msgstr "Delenn ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:257
msgid ""
"Sorry, I thought you were some other bald woman with a clipboard. I'll be "
"going now."
msgstr ""
"Pardon, j'ai cru que tu étais une autre femme chauve avec un écritoire. Je "
"dois partir."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:265
msgid ""
"(The woman looks up and glares at you.) Are you one of the control subjects? "
"As if matters anyway... Guards! Detain this slave!"
msgstr ""
"[La femme lève les yeux et te fusille du regard.] Fais-tu partie des cobayes "
"? Peu importe de toute façon... Gardes ! Attrapez cet esclave !"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:266
msgid "Where slave? Me no see one"
msgstr "Où ça esclave ? Moi pas voir."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:275
msgid ""
"Look, I'm VERY busy, so if you don't mind... [Glances up from her clipboard "
"at you, then scowls.] WHO are you? How did you get in here?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai des tas de choses à faire, si tu permets... [Elle jette un oeil par-"
"dessus l'écritoire, puis fait la grimace.] Qui es-tu ? Comment as-tu fait "
"pour entrer ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:276
msgid ""
"Look, I'm VERY busy, so if you don't mind... [Glances up from her clipboard "
"at you, then scowls.] You again? What do you want now?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai ENORMEMENT de choses à faire, si tu permets... [Elle jette un oeil par-"
"dessus l'écritoire, puis fait la grimace.] Encore toi ? Que veux-tu ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:277
msgid "Your barn door's open. Heh-heh... get it? I kill me."
msgstr ""
"On rentre ici comme dans un moulin... étable, moulin... elle est bonne hein ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:278
msgid "I'm one of the new personnel assigned here."
msgstr "Je fais partie du personnel récemment affecté ici."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:279
msgid "I'm looking for Myron. Is he around?"
msgstr "Je cherche Myron. Il est par ici ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:280
msgid "Are those test results you have on that clipboard? Can I see them?"
msgstr "Ce sont des résultats sur l'écritoire ? Je peux les voir ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:295
msgid "This area is not open for... visitors. Leave or I will call the guards."
msgstr ""
"Ce service n'est pas ouvert aux... visiteurs. Pars ou j'appelle les gardes."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:296
msgid "But hey, I had some questions for you..."
msgstr "Mais, je voulais te poser des questions..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:298
msgid ""
"Are those test results you have on that clipboard? Can I see them? I'm "
"something of a researcher myself."
msgstr ""
"Ce sont des résultats de test sur l'écritoire ? Je peux les voir ? Moi aussi "
"je fais de la recherche, enfin, pas la même."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:300
msgid "Very well. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Très bien. Je m'excuse de t'avoir dérangée."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:310
msgid "Guards! Guards, detain this person!"
msgstr "Gardes ! Gardes, attrapez cette personne !"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:315
msgid ""
"MORE guards. Ha! As if they do any good... look, you SHOULD have received "
"instructions from whoever sent you here. Talk\n"
" to the other guards to find out your assignment. Now go."
msgstr ""
"ENCORE des gardes. Ha ! Comme si ça changeait quelque chose... Ecoute, tu "
"aurais dû recevoir des instructions de la personne qui t'a envoyé ici. Va "
"parler à l'autre garde pour savoir où tu dois aller. Vas-y !"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:316
msgid ""
"I'm not a guard; I'm one of the new researchers. Do you have an assignment "
"for me?"
msgstr ""
"Je ne vais pas être garde, je fais de la recherche. Tu as du travail pour "
"moi ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:317
msgid ""
"Excuse me, but I was hoping YOU could show me around. I saw you standing "
"over here and\n"
" felt COMPELLED to talk to you. Perhaps after the tour we could have "
"dinner...?"
msgstr ""
"Excuse-moi, j'espérais que tu pourrais me faire visiter. Je t'ai vue et j'ai "
"ressenti le BESOIN de te parler. Peut-être qu'après la visite, on pourrait "
"aller manger..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:318
msgid "Thanks. You've been very helpful."
msgstr "Merci. Ton aide m'a été très utile."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:325
msgid ""
"You're a RESEARCHER...? Hmmmm. I've never seen you before. How much do you "
"know about pharmaceutical research?"
msgstr ""
"Tu fais de la RECHERCHE ? Hum. C'est la première fois que je te vois. Tu t'y "
"connais en recherche pharmaceutique ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:326
msgid "Uh, enough. Just sit back and watch me go."
msgstr "Heu, assez. Reste là, ne te dérange pas."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:327
msgid ""
"I know a fair amount about the composition and manufacture of base "
"neurochemical compounds, and I think I\n"
" could be of some assistance in your studies."
msgstr ""
"J'en connais un morceau sur la composition et la fabrication à base de "
"composés neurochimiques. Je pourrais utilement contribuer à tes études."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:328 dialog/ncwrichi.msg:412 dialog/vcstark.msg:278
#: dialog/vcstark.msg:282
msgid "I have to be going."
msgstr "Je dois partir."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:335
msgid ""
"Ha! I think I'll just watch you go, period. Leave before I call the guards."
msgstr ""
"Ha ! Je crois que je vais te laisser filer. Pars avant que j'appelle les "
"gardes."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:337
msgid "I'm going...::mumble::...you bald-headed bitch."
msgstr "Je m'en vais... [Marmonne.] ... tête d'oeuf."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:345
msgid ""
"Hmmmm. All right then. Let me give you a run-down on what we do here: we "
"test the effects and potency of a metamphetamine\n"
" called Jet."
msgstr ""
"Hum. D'accord. Laisse-moi te briefer sur notre activité ici : nous testons "
"les effets et la force d'une méta amphétamine qui s'appelle le Jet."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:346
msgid "I see. And how is the research coming?"
msgstr "Je vois. Et où en sont les recherches ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:347
msgid ""
"I think I have the idea. I'll examine the rest of the testing area myself."
msgstr "Je crois que j'ai une idée. Je vais faire le reste des tests moi-même."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:355
msgid ""
"Not so well. Our schedule is tight, and we need to purify the Jet "
"manufacturing process soon."
msgstr ""
"Pas très bien. Notre programme est très juste et nous devrons bientôt "
"purifier le procédé de fabrication du Jet."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:356
msgid "Why? Jet seems addictive enough already."
msgstr "Pourquoi ? Il semblerait que le Jet rende déjà assez dépendant."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:357
msgid "Why the tight schedule?"
msgstr "Pourquoi un programme juste ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:358
msgid ""
"Sounds like a tough job. Look, I have to take care of something real quick - "
"I'll be back."
msgstr ""
"Ca a l'air dur comme boulot. Ecoute, je dois m'occuper de quelque chose, "
"mais je reviens."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:365
msgid ""
"No one's come out and said it, but it's probably due to Jet distribution in "
"Redding. Jet's potent *enough,* but\n"
" there's a good deal of room for improvement, and the 'brass' wants to "
"increase Jet addiction in Redding."
msgstr ""
"Personne ne l'a jamais dit, mais c'est probablement dû à la distribution de "
"Jet à Redding. Le Jet est *assez* fort, mais on peut encore faire de gros "
"progrès. Et l'armée veut augmenter la dépendance de Jet à Redding."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:366
msgid "What's the deal with Redding?"
msgstr "Que se passe-t-il avec Redding ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:367
msgid "Well, good luck meeting the schedule."
msgstr "Eh bien, bonne chance pour terminer dans les délais."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:375
msgid ""
"It's potent *enough,* but there's room for improvement. The 'brass' wants to "
"increase Jet distribution in\n"
" Redding, and they want the addiction rate as close to 100% as we can get "
"it. It's going to require us pulling some long hours."
msgstr ""
"Le Jet est *assez* fort, mais on peut encore faire de gros progrès. Et "
"l'armée veut augmenter la distribution de Jet à Redding. Le but est "
"d'atteindre un taux de dépendance le plus proche de 100%. Ca va nous "
"demander encore pas mal de boulot."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:377
msgid "Thanks for the information. I'll be back later."
msgstr "Merci pour ces renseignements. Je reviendrai plus tard."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:385
msgid ""
"Addict the miners in Redding to Jet, and whoever controls the Jet, controls "
"Redding. Typical power play."
msgstr ""
"Il suffit de rendre dépendants au Jet les mineurs de Redding. Celui qui "
"contrôle le Jet contrôle Redding. C'est le jeu du pouvoir habituel."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:386
msgid "So... who does control the drugs?"
msgstr "Alors, qui contrôle la came ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:395
msgid ""
"Who controls the drugs? The Mordinos. Of course, Myron laid all the "
"groundwork for Jet's composition.\n"
" We do mostly clean-up work."
msgstr ""
"Qui contrôle la came ? Les Mordino. Bien sûr, Myron a fait le plus gros avec "
"la composition de Jet. Nous faisons surtout de la purification."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:396
msgid "Is Myron your boss?"
msgstr "Myron, c'est ton patron ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:405
msgid ""
"You COULD call it that. He's a smart one, I'll give him that, but he doesn't "
"care much about what goes\n"
" on up here. He mostly stays in the basement vault... no visitors except for "
"the train of prostitutes. Typical project leader."
msgstr ""
"En QUELQUE sorte. Il faut bien avouer que c'est un malin. Mais il se fout "
"pas mal de ce qui se passe ici. En général, il reste au sous-sol... Les "
"visiteurs sont interdits, sauf les putes. C'est un chef de projet typique."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:406
msgid "Could I see him?"
msgstr "Puis-je le voir ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:407
msgid ""
"Yeah, though marketing's worse. Anyway, thanks for the information. I'll be "
"back later."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, il y a pire, il y a le marketing. Merci quand même pour les "
"renseignements. Je reviendrai."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:415
msgid ""
"I suppose... let me give you a temporary badge; just show it to the guards. "
"Keep it quick, though, Myron doesn't\n"
" like people staying long."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose... Prends ce badge provisoire, et montre-le aux gardes. Fais "
"vite, Myron n'aime pas les gens qui restent trop longtemps."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:416
msgid ""
"I suppose... let me give you a temporary badge; just show it to the guards. "
"Keep it quick, though, Myron doesn't\n"
" like people staying long... though he may make an exception in your case."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose... Prends ce badge provisoire, et montre-le aux gardes. Fais "
"vite, Myron n'aime pas les gens qui restent trop longtemps... mais il fera "
"peut-être une exception pour toi."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:417
msgid "Thanks for the badge. I'll see you later."
msgstr "Merci pour le badge. Je reviendrai te voir plus tard."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:425
msgid "Look, I'm VERY busy, so if you don't mind..."
msgstr "Ecoute, j'ai des tas de choses à faire, si tu permets..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:426
msgid "Look, I... I'm, uh, very busy, so if you would please excuse me..."
msgstr "Ecoute, heu... J'ai heu... Des tas de choses à faire, si tu permets..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:427
msgid "Nevermind then..."
msgstr "Alors tant pis..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:428 dialog/vcsteve.msg:110
msgid "Thanks anyway."
msgstr "Merci quand même."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:429
msgid "Thanks anyway...::mumble:: ...you uppity cue-balled bitch."
msgstr "Merci quand même... [Marmonne.] crâne d'oeuf."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:435
msgid ""
"This... hmm... I'm VERY flattered, but I'm also very busy at the moment... "
"so... uh..."
msgstr ""
"Ce... Hum... Je suis très flattée mais j'ai des tas de choses à faire en ce "
"moment... Alors, heu..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:436
msgid ""
"Well, do you mind if I came by and picked you up after work then? No "
"pressure... just some dinner, some\n"
" conversation. You look like someone who might need to take a little break "
"from work. Things here must keep you very busy."
msgstr ""
"Alors si tu veux, je passe te chercher après le boulot. Je te force pas... "
"On ira dîner, c'est tout, et on fera un brin de causette. On dirait que tu "
"as besoin de penser à autre chose que le boulot. Il a l'air d'y avoir "
"beaucoup de travail pour toi."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:437
msgid "Well, I had to ask. Thanks anyway."
msgstr "Bon, j'ai essayé. Merci quand même."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:445
msgid ""
"Oh, not THAT busy... heh... well, no, pretty busy. I mean, mostly it's "
"routine drug testing, and occasionally we have\n"
" a slave go over the edge..."
msgstr ""
"Oh, je suis pas terriblement occupée, mais assez. Les expériences, c'est la "
"routine, et de temps en temps, un esclave pète les plombs."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:446
msgid ""
"Doesn't purposely injecting experimental metamphetamines into enslaved "
"humans make you question your basic humanity?"
msgstr ""
"Ca ne te pose pas de problème éthique d'injecter sciemment des méta "
"amphétamines expérimentales sur des humains réduits à l'esclavage ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:447
msgid ""
"Wow. That sounds dangerous. You ever get hurt? Do you have many patient "
"fatalities?"
msgstr ""
"Ca a l'air dangereux. Ca t'arrive de te faire mal ? Le taux de mortalité est-"
"il important ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:448
msgid "Drug testing? Really? How are things going?"
msgstr "Des expériences de stupéfiants ? Comment ça se passe ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:449
msgid "Sounds interesting, but I have to go... uh, I'll be back, though."
msgstr "Ca m'a l'air intéressant, mais je dois partir... Heu, je reviendrai."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:455
msgid "Was that some poor attempt at a joke?"
msgstr "C'était une mauvaise blague, hein ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:456
msgid ""
"Just asking. I mean, what if you had been sold into slavery, been taken "
"here, then pumped full of drugs?"
msgstr ""
"Simple question. Et si c'était toi qui avais été vendue comme esclave, "
"amenée ici, et bourrée de stupéfiants ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:457
msgid "Uh, yes. I have to be going."
msgstr "Heu, oui. Il faut que je parte."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:465
msgid ""
"I'm on THIS side of the stalls, they're on THAT side. Since we're getting "
"into hypotheticals, would\n"
" YOU like to find out what it's like to be them? We have an extra stall or "
"two."
msgstr ""
"Moi, je suis de CE côté, les esclaves sont de l'AUTRE côté. Puisque nous "
"parlons d'hypothèse, tu veux faire l'expérience, il nous reste certainement "
"une place."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:466
msgid "Now hold on a minute..."
msgstr "Attends une minute..."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:467
msgid "Uh, no thanks. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Heu, non merci. Je m'excuse de t'avoir dérangée."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:475
msgid ""
"Slave deaths? A few. Mostly accidental overdoses - usually a tech's fault - "
"or self-inflicted injuries.\n"
" Some ingest too much Jet, and they REALLY want to fly."
msgstr ""
"Les accidents mortels surviennent par overdose, résultats d'erreurs "
"professionnelles en général, ou de blessures volontaires. Certains avalent "
"trop de Jet et ils veulent VRAIMENT planer. "

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:476
msgid "Other than that, how's the drug testing going?"
msgstr "A part ça, comment se passent les tests de stupéfiants ?"

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:477
msgid "I bet. Well, thanks for the information. You've been very helpful."
msgstr ""
"C'est clair. Merci pour ces renseignements. Ton aide a été très précieuse."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:485
msgid ""
"Try downstairs in the lab. The guarded door. If you see him, tell him to "
"come up here when he has the\n"
" chance. IF he's not too busy."
msgstr ""
"Va voir au labo, au sous-sol. Il y a une porte gardée. Si tu le vois, dis-"
"lui de monter quand il aura un moment. Seulement s'il n'est pas trop occupé."

#: dialog/ncresear.msg:1000
msgid "You get a temporary pass from Marjorie."
msgstr "Marjorie te donne un passe provisoire."

