#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:100
msgid "You see a cute \"little person.\""
msgstr "Tu vois une jolie « petite personne »."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:101
msgid "You see Stuart Little."
msgstr "Tu vois Stuart Little."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:150
msgid ""
"You see a midget in children's clothes. He is chewing on a toothpick and "
"studying you."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un nain avec des vêtements d'enfant. Il mâchouille un cure-dents et "
"t'observe."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:151
msgid ""
"You see Stuart Little, the midget boxing agent. He is chewing on a toothpick "
"and studying you."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois Stuart Little, l'agent de boxe nain. Il mâchouille un cure-dents et "
"t'observe."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:152
msgid ""
"You see Stuart Little, the midget boxing agent. He looks so cute. Like a "
"smelly, red-haired teddy bear."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois Stuart Little, l'agent de boxe nain. Il est tellement mignon. On "
"dirait un nounours roux qui sent fort."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:200
msgid ""
"Kid, I knew you'd do good, but I didn't know you were gonna save the world, "
"too. Good job."
msgstr ""
"Hé, je savais que tu te débrouillerais, mais je savais pas que t'allais "
"aussi sauver le monde. Bon boulot."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:201
msgid "You done me proud, kid."
msgstr "Je suis fier de toi, mon petit."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:202
msgid "You went the distance, kid. You done Stuart proud."
msgstr "T'as bien tenu le coup. Stuart est fier de toi."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:210
msgid "I wish I coulda seen you put your fist through the Enclave."
msgstr "J'aurais bien voulu te voir flanquer ton poing à travers l'Enclave."

#: dialog/ncstulit.msg:211
