#: dialog/nctray.msg:100
msgid "You see a good-looking black man... er, no, wait. You see T-Ray."
msgstr "Tu vois un bel homme noir... Heu, non, attends. Tu vois T-Ray."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:150
msgid ""
"You see a heavily muscled black man with thick glasses, a light beard, and "
"an attitude."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un homme noir très musclé avec de grosses lunettes et une barbe "
"courte. Il se donne des airs de grande gueule."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:151
msgid "You see T-Ray. He looks pretty good in them jeans."
msgstr "Tu vois T-Ray. Il est pas mal dans ce jean."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:152
msgid ""
"You see T-Ray. He occasionally flexes and feels his biceps, whispering \"damn"
"\" to himself."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois T-Ray. De temps à autre, il contracte ses biceps et les palpe, en se "
"murmurant à lui-même *putain*."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:153
msgid "You can barely make out T-Ray past all that attitude."
msgstr "Tu as du mal à reconnaître T-Ray sous ces airs de grande gueule."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:200
msgid "Hey, it wasn't my fault that condom we were using had a hole in it."
msgstr "Hé, c'est pas ma faute si le préservatif qu'on a utilisé était troué."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:201
msgid ""
"Whoa! I wasn't bragging to everyone about you and me doing it. Really! Musta "
"been somebody else."
msgstr ""
"Holà ! Je me suis vanté à personne de ce qu'on a fait. Vraiment ! Ca doit "
"sûrement être quelqu'un d'autre."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:202
msgid ""
"DAMN, woman. After I hit those skins, you go off and save the world. That's "
"T-Ray's power for you."
msgstr ""
"PUTAIN. Dès que j'ai fini, tu t'en vas pour aller sauver le monde. C'est ça "
"l'effet T-Ray."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:210
msgid ""
"I been telling everyone that you and me is TIGHT. That when I give the word, "
"it's like it was you givin' the orders."
msgstr ""
"J'ai dit à tout le monde que toi et moi, c'était du sérieux. Que tout ce que "
"je dis, c'est toi qui me le dictes."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:211
msgid ""
"You're lucky I was around to save your ass, or the Enclave woulda had you "
"for BREAKFAST."
msgstr ""
"T'as de la chance que j'aie été là pour sauver ta peau. L'Enclave n'aurait "
"fait qu'une BOUCHEE de toi."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:212
msgid "Yo, hero. You be sure to tell everyone that T-Ray's your man, aiight?"
msgstr "Hé. Oublie pas de dire à tout le monde que T-Ray est ton homme, Ok ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:220
msgid "Whoa, we're in the presence of royalty. Big hero, comin' through."
msgstr "Ho ! La royauté nous fait l'honneur de sa présence."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:221
msgid ""
"You know, you coulda stopped by before you went off and did that shit, then "
"I coulda helped you whack the President."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, t'aurais pu passer me voir avant d'aller faire ces conneries, "
"j'aurais pu t'aider à flanquer une dérouillée au Président."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:222
msgid ""
"I woulda gone to the Enclave, too, 'cept I was talkin' on the phone too much."
msgstr ""
"Moi aussi, j'aurais pu aller à l'Enclave, sauf que j'étais trop occupé à "
"passer des coups de fil."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:230
msgid "How many horsepower does that thing you have on get?"
msgstr "Combien de chevaux a ce truc que tu portes ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:232
msgid ""
"Any chance you let me have that armor for a little bit? I ain't gonna strip "
"it, I just wanna borrow it."
msgstr ""
"Ce serait possible de t'emprunter cette armure pour quelque temps ? Je vais "
"pas la démonter, je veux juste l'emprunter."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:250
msgid "If it ain't the man, here to oppress me again."
msgstr "Si c'est pas encore le même homme qui revient m'accabler."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:251
msgid "Yeah, Impala's a good car, but it ain't no Omni."
msgstr "Ouais, l'Impala est une bonne voiture, mais ça vaut pas une Omni."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:252
msgid "Whenever I make love to you, it's hot lava..."
msgstr "Quand je te fais l'amour, c'est comme de la lave en ébullition..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:253
msgid "Damn, this car needs a brass rope around the license plate."
msgstr ""
"Putain, il manque un fil de cuivre autour de la plaque d'immatriculation."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:255
msgid "Interior smells like someone took a shit in there."
msgstr "L'intérieur pue comme si quelqu'un avait posé un étron dedans."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:256
msgid "Interior smells like gecko assholes."
msgstr "L'intérieur pue le gecko pourri."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:257
msgid "What the hell does a car need to RUN for?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est-ce qu'une foutue voiture a besoin de marcher ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:258
msgid "Car ain't gotta run to get you where you need to go, nawimean?"
msgstr ""
"Une voiture a pas besoin de marcher pour t'amener où tu veux, tu vois ce que "
"j'veux dire ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:259
msgid "My car ain't fast, but my lovin' is."
msgstr "Ma voiture est p't-être pas rapide, mais moi si."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:260
msgid "I can't believe my brick is as LARGE as it is."
msgstr "J'arrive pas à croire que mon truc est aussi GROS que ça."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:261
msgid "I'm hung like a 2-headed brahmin."
msgstr "Je suis monté comme une Brahmine à deux têtes."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:265
msgid ""
"The Highwayman's got a full analog system and no computers. None of the "
"fancy stuff."
msgstr ""
"La Highwayman a un système entièrement analogique et pas d'ordinateurs. Rien "
"de tous ces trucs à la mode."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:266
msgid "The Highwayman's a sweet car; Chryslus sure knew how to build 'em."
msgstr "La Highwayman est une sacrée bagnole. Chryslus savait vraiment y faire."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:267
msgid "I give piece a chance."
msgstr "Je lui donne une chance."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:268
msgid "I'll give your piece a chance."
msgstr "Je donne une chance à ton engin."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:275
msgid "Who're you? What're you doing here?"
msgstr "T'es qui ? Que fais-tu ici ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:276
msgid ""
"Damn. Look what just walked in... looks like them upper body workouts is "
"finally paying off. What can I do for you, sweet thing?"
msgstr ""
"Regarde qui vient d'entrer... On dirait que les séances d'entraînement du "
"haut du corps ont été payantes. Que puis-je faire pour toi, mon chou ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:277
msgid "You again? What do you want NOW?"
msgstr "Encore toi ? Que veux-tu ENCORE ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:278
msgid ""
"Damn, woman... you again? What do you want NOW? I don't want to hear no shit "
"about how I got you pregnant..."
msgstr ""
"Putain, poupée... Encore toi ? Que veux-tu ENCORE ? Viens pas me raconter "
"que je t'ai mise en cloque..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:280
msgid " go where "
msgstr " aller où "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:281 dialog/nhmyron.msg:6218
msgid " go"
msgstr " aller."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:283
msgid "Where did you get that Highwayman? I like the look of it."
msgstr "Où l'as-tu trouvée cette Highwayman ? Elle est pas mal."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:284
msgid "That car you have in the garage belongs to me."
msgstr "Cette voiture, là, dans ton garage, m'appartient."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:285
msgid "You the one who stole my car, asshole?"
msgstr "C'est toi qui a volé ma voiture ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:286
msgid "I'm Bishop's lieutenant, "
msgstr "Je suis le lieutenant de Bishop, "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:287
msgid "I'm one of Bishop's lieutenants. I'm here for his car."
msgstr ""
"Je suis l'un des lieutenants de Bishop. Il m'envoie chercher sa voiture."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:288
msgid "I have come to collect Mr. Bishop's free batteries."
msgstr "M. Bishop m'envoie chercher les batteries gratuites."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:289
msgid "Can you upgrade the Highwayman?"
msgstr "Peux-tu améliorer la Highwayman ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:290
msgid "Can I buy some batteries from you?"
msgstr "As-tu des batteries à vendre ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:291
msgid "Nothing. I'm going now."
msgstr "Rien. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:300
msgid ""
"Man, this AIN'T no bathroom, and you shore as hell ain't going in here. Now "
"git."
msgstr ""
"Mon pote, ça c'est PAS des toilettes et toi tu te casses d'ici. Tout de "
"suite."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:301
msgid ""
"Girl, this AIN'T no bathroom, and you shore as hell ain't going in here. Now "
"git."
msgstr ""
"Poupée, ça c'est PAS des toilettes et toi tu te casses d'ici. Tout de suite."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:302
msgid ""
"You wanna GO? Here? Well... (Looks you up and down) ...a man's gotta do who "
"a man's gotta do. Let's get down to bitness."
msgstr ""
"Tu veux le faire ? Ici ? Bon... [En te regardant de la tête aux pieds :] "
"Quand il faut y aller, faut y aller. Passons aux choses sérieuses."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:306
msgid "Get down to business."
msgstr "Au boulot."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:307
msgid "Uh, no thanks. I've changed my mind. Good-bye."
msgstr "Heu, non merci. J'ai changé d'avis. Au revoir."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:320
msgid "Aiight then..."
msgstr "Bon d'accord..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:321
msgid "Uh-uh-uh"
msgstr "Oh-oh-oh."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:330
msgid ""
"Aw, so you just PLAYING with T-Ray? All right, then. Get, woman... I got "
"better bitches to do with my time."
msgstr ""
"Oh, tu veux juste t'AMUSER avec T-Ray ? Bon, très bien. Fous le camp, "
"poupée... J'ai d'autres chattes à fouetter."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:331
msgid "Time keepz on ticking, ticking, ticking... inta the fuuuuture"
msgstr "L'horloge du temps continue à faire tic-tac, tic-tac... vers le futur."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:333
msgid ""
"If suppose if you can catch dogs, you're welcome to do whatever you want "
"with them. Good-bye."
msgstr ""
"J'imagine que si tu sais attraper des chiens, tu peux faire tout ce qui te "
"passe par la tête avec eux. Au revoir."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:334
msgid "The fact you have sex with dogs does not surprise me. Good-bye."
msgstr "Pas étonnant que tu te tapes des chiens. Salut."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:340
msgid ""
"The Highwayman outside? Damn RIGHT you like the look of her. That's one "
"sweet machine, a recent ac-quisition... we're just\n"
" about to spruce her up, make some adjustments, then sell her off to ol' man "
"Bishop."
msgstr ""
"La Highwayman, là dehors ? UN PEU qu'elle est pas mal. C'est un joli joujou, "
"une acquisition récente... On va juste l'astiquer, faire quelques réglages, "
"et la vendre au vieux Bishop."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:341
msgid "\"Adjustments?\" What kind of adjustments?"
msgstr "Des *réglages* ? Quel genre de réglages ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:342
msgid ""
"Sell her to BISHOP? Look, idiot... Bishop's dea... er, I mean, I can meet "
"Bishop's offer."
msgstr ""
"La vendre à BISHOP ? Ecoute, débile... Bishop est mor... Heu, je veux dire, "
"je peux offrir le même prix que Bishop."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:343
msgid ""
"Sell her to Bishop? Hell, I can meet Bishop's offer and then raise it some."
msgstr ""
"La vendre à Bishop ? Mais je peux en offrir le même prix que lui, et même un "
"peu plus."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:344
msgid "What a coincidence. I'm Bishop's lieutenant, "
msgstr "Quelle coïncidence. Je suis le lieutenant de Bishop, "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:346
msgid "Actually, you won't be selling that car to anyone. The car's mine."
msgstr "En fait, tu ne vendras cette voiture à personne. C'est la mienne."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:347
msgid "Sounds like a good deal. Catch you later."
msgstr "Ca me paraît intéressant. Je repasserai."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:360
msgid ""
"Jazz up the engine, clean out the interior, put a brass rope around the "
"license plate - and kick some of that shit\n"
" outta the trunk, make some room. When we're done, it'll be worth some "
"serious chips to Mr. Bishop."
msgstr ""
"On va améliorer le moteur, nettoyer l'intérieur, ajouter un fil de cuivre "
"autour de la plaque d'immatriculation, et virer les trucs inutiles du "
"coffre, pour l'agrandir. Après, on en obtiendra un petit paquet de M. Bishop."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:361
msgid "Sell her to Bishop? I can meet Bishop's offer and then raise it some."
msgstr ""
"La vendre à Bishop ? Je peux en offrir le même prix que lui, et même un peu "
"plus."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:362
msgid "What a coincidence. I'm one of Bishop's lieutenants: "
msgstr "Quelle coïncidence. Je suis l'un des lieutenants de Bishop : "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:365
msgid "Sounds good. Catch you later then."
msgstr "Ca m'a l'air intéressant. Je repasserai."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:375
msgid ""
"You're gonna match BISHOP'S offer? That's a lot of scrilla, man. A LOT of "
"chips. Plus, he's one of the top men in\n"
" Reno, y'know? I get him this machine, there's... FRINGE benefits."
msgstr ""
"Tu vas en offrir autant que BISHOP ? Ca fait un paquet de pépettes, mon "
"pote. Un PAQUET de jetons. En plus, c'est un des hommes les plus importants "
"de Reno. Si je lui donne cet engin, j'ai des avantages... en nature."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:376
msgid ""
"You're gonna match BISHOP'S offer? That's a lot of scrilla, woman. A LOT of "
"chips. Plus, he's one of the top men in\n"
" Reno, y'know? I get him this machine, there's... FRINGE benefits."
msgstr ""
"Tu vas en offrir autant que BISHOP ? Ca fait un paquet de pépettes poupée. "
"Un PAQUET de fric. En plus, c'est un des hommes les plus importants de Reno. "
"Si je lui donne cet engin, j'ai des avantages... en nature."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:377
msgid "I'm listening..."
msgstr "J'écoute."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:378
msgid "1000 chips change your mind?"
msgstr "1000 jetons, ça pourrait te faire changer d'avis ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:379
msgid "750 chips change your mind?"
msgstr "750 jetons, ça pourrait te faire changer d'avis ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:380
msgid "500 chips change your mind?"
msgstr "500 jetons, ça pourrait te faire changer d'avis ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:381
msgid "Actually, I don't have enough chips to make you an offer right now..."
msgstr ""
"En fait, j'ai pas encore assez de jetons pour te faire une proposition..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:382
msgid ""
"How about a night with me, T-Ray? You ain't never going to have anything "
"better."
msgstr "Et que dirais-tu d'une nuit avec moi, T-Ray ? Tu trouveras pas mieux."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:383
msgid ""
"My offer's this: I'll leave you in one piece if you give me MY car back "
"right now."
msgstr ""
"Ma proposition, c'est que je te laisse en un seul morceau si tu me rends MA "
"voiture tout de suite."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:384
msgid "Nevermind... I have to be going."
msgstr "Tant pis... Il faut que j'y aille."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:395
msgid ""
"Man, that amount couldn't even afford to change my clothes, much less change "
"my mind. "
msgstr ""
"Mon pote, cette somme ne me permettrait même pas de changer de fringues, "
"alors encore moins d'avis."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:396
msgid ""
"Woman, that amount couldn't even afford to change my clothes, much less "
"change my mind. "
msgstr ""
"Poupée, cette somme ne me permettrait même pas de changer de fringues, alors "
"encore moins d'avis."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:397
msgid "You must think cars are cheap."
msgstr "Tu crois peut-être que les voitures valent pas cher."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:398
msgid "Let's re-negotiate then."
msgstr "Bon, renégocions alors."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:399
msgid ""
"Look, I can't make you an offer right now, but once I get the chips "
"together..."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, je ne peux pas te faire de proposition pour l'instant, mais quand "
"j'aurai rassemblé le fric..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:401
msgid ""
"No, but your life is. I'll leave you in one piece if you give me back MY car "
"right now."
msgstr ""
"Non, mais ta vie, elle, elle vaut pas cher. Je te laisse en un seul morceau "
"si tu me rends tout de suite MA voiture."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:402
msgid "I don't have time for this right now. Good-bye."
msgstr "J'ai pas le temps pour l'instant. Au revoir."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:420
msgid ""
"Naw, I already got one dog I give a bone to, and I ain't looking to start a "
"kennel. From the looks of you, you ain't\n"
" got nothing that would be worth my time."
msgstr ""
"Nan, j'ai déjà un chien à nourrir, je cherche pas à monter un chenil. A en "
"juger par ce que je vois, t'as rien qui vaille la peine que je perde mon "
"temps."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:421
msgid "Your loss. Let me see your stock then."
msgstr "Tant pis pour toi. Fais voir ce que t'as en stock alors."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:422
msgid ""
"Know what? I'm SICK of listening to you and your bullshit. I'm going to "
"carve you into so many pieces you could\n"
" start your own butcher shop."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais quoi ? J'en ai MARRE de t'écouter débiter tes conneries. Je vais te "
"découper en tellement de petits morceaux que tu pourras monter ta propre "
"boucherie."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:423
msgid "All right then. I'm leaving."
msgstr "Très bien. Je m'en vais."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:436
msgid "Screw negotiating, then. Give me MY car back, right now. Or else."
msgstr ""
"Au diable les négociations, alors. Rends-moi MA voiture, tout de suite. "
"Sinon..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:437
msgid ""
"Forget this. I'm going to carve you into so many pieces you could start your "
"own butcher shop."
msgstr ""
"Pas question. Je vais te découper en tellement de morceaux que tu pourras "
"monter ta propre boucherie."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:445
msgid ""
"(His eyes slide up and down your body.) I don't know if you're worth all "
"THAT, woman. This is a HIGHWAYMAN we're talking about..."
msgstr ""
"[Ses yeux te reluquent de la tête aux pieds.] Je ne sais pas si tu vaux tout "
"ça, poupée. C'est une HIGHWAYMAN dont il s'agit..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:446
msgid "Oh, I'm worth all that. And more."
msgstr "Oh, je vaux bien tout ça. Et même plus."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:455
msgid ""
"Curse me for a fool... it's a done deal, then. I get some playtime, then you "
"can drive that Highwayman outta here."
msgstr ""
"Que le diable m'emporte... Marché conclu, alors. Je vais m'amuser un peu et "
"après tu pourras partir avec la Highwayman."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:456
msgid "Let's get to it, then."
msgstr "Allons-y, alors."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:457
msgid "Screw negotiating. Give me MY car back, right now. Or else."
msgstr ""
"Les négociations on s'en fout. Rends-moi MA voiture, tout de suite. Sinon..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:458
msgid "I've changed my mind. I think I'm just going to kill you instead."
msgstr "J'ai changé d'avis. Je pense que je vais plutôt te tuer."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:470
msgid ""
"Look, why are you wasting my time? If you ain't got the chips, then you "
"ain't got no business here. I got better\n"
" things to do than be talking to your cheap ass."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, pourquoi me fais-tu perdre mon temps ? Si t'as pas de fric, y a pas "
"d'affaire possible. J'ai mieux à faire que de parler à des minables fauchés "
"comme toi."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:471
msgid ""
"Only thing that's cheap in here is your life. I'll leave you in one piece if "
"you give me back MY car right now."
msgstr ""
"La seule chose qui vaille pas cher ici, c'est ta vie. Je te laisserai en un "
"seul morceau si tu me rends MA voiture tout de suite."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:472
msgid "You know, that was your last chance. Now I'm just going to KILL you."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, c'était ta dernière chance. Maintenant, il me reste plus qu'à te "
"TUER."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:485
msgid "YOUR car? "
msgstr "TA voiture ? "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:486
msgid "Man, you don't even know what the hell you're talking about. "
msgstr "Mon pote, tu sais même pas de quoi tu parles. "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:487
msgid "Woman, you don't even know what the hell you're talking about. "
msgstr "Poupée, tu sais même pas de quoi tu parles. "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:488
msgid ""
"That Highwayman was scrap, left lying around, and guess what? Now it's ours. "
"'Course, you got an ISSUE with that, we\n"
" could settle it here and now..."
msgstr ""
"Cette Highwayman, c'était un bout de ferraille à l'abandon et devine quoi ? "
"Maintenant, elle est à nous. Bien sûr, si ça te pose un PROBLEME, on peut le "
"régler ici, maintenant..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:489
msgid "Yeah, I got an issue with it. Let's go, chop shop boy..."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, ça me pose un problème. Allez, puisque tu le prends sur ce ton..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:490
msgid "What are you doing with the car?"
msgstr "Que fais-tu avec la voiture ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:491
msgid ""
"No, that's cool. You can have the damn Highwayman. Piece of shit anyway. "
"Uses too much 'tricity, smells like gecko inside,\n"
" trunk's too small... be perfect for you, though. See ya."
msgstr ""
"Non, pas de problème. Tu peux prendre cette foutue Highwayman. C'est de la "
"ferraille de toute façon. Elle utilise trop de jus, l'intérieur pue le "
"gecko, le coffre est trop petit... Mais ce sera parfait pour toi. A plus."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:492
msgid "No, I haven't got an issue with it... yet. See you."
msgstr "Non, ça me pose pas de problème... pour l'instant. A bientôt."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:500
msgid "Whoa, hold on there! *Piece of shit? Smells like Gecko?* "
msgstr "Holà, attends un peu ! *De la ferraille* ? *Elle pue le gecko* ? "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:501
msgid "Man, what kinda Jet you been taking? "
msgstr "Mon pote, t'as pris trop de Jet ou quoi ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:502
msgid "Woman, what kinda Jet you been taking? "
msgstr "Poupée, t'as pris trop de Jet ou quoi ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:503
msgid ""
"This is a HIGHWAYMAN. Not only does it run, but after I fix it up, it's "
"gonna purr like a woman beneath me."
msgstr ""
"C'est une HIGHWAYMAN. Non seulement elle fonctionne, mais une fois réparée, "
"elle va ronronner comme une bonne femme."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:504
msgid "I'm sick of listening to you. Eat lead, chop shop boy..."
msgstr "J'en ai marre de t'écouter. Tu vas bouffer du plomb..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:505
msgid "What are you fixing on the car?"
msgstr "Que répares-tu sur la voiture ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:506 dialog/vcgreg.msg:174
msgid "Whatever. I'm outta here."
msgstr "Peu importe. Je me tire d'ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:520
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's what I THOUGHT. You better run along now 'fore Momma gets "
"worried about you."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, c'est BIEN ce que je pensais. Tu ferais mieux de filer maintenant, ta "
"môman va s'inquiéter."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:521
msgid ""
"No, actually, it's YOUR Mom that gets worried without me around to please "
"her."
msgstr ""
"Non, c'est TA maman qui va s'inquiéter si je suis pas là pour lui faire "
"plaisir."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:522
msgid "Let it go and leave quietly."
msgstr "[Laisser tomber et file sans faire d'histoires]"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:530
msgid ""
"All right, then. It's a done deal. (Scans the money quickly, pockets it.) "
"The Highwayman's all yours. It ain't got no\n"
" battery juice, of course, and it ain't got none of the special amen-ities I "
"was gonna add..."
msgstr ""
"Bon, d'accord. Marché conclu. [Il examine rapidement l'argent, puis le met "
"dans sa poche.] La Highwayman est à toi. Elle a pas de jus, bien sûr, et "
"aucun des équipements spéciaux que j'allais ajouter..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:531
msgid "What amenities are you talking about?"
msgstr "De quels équipements parles-tu ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:532
msgid "I am sick of this bullshit run-around. Eat lead, chop shop boy..."
msgstr "J'en ai marre de ces conneries. Je vais te faire bouffer du plomb..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:533
msgid "Oh, but you've given me so MUCH already. I'm outta here."
msgstr "Oh, mais tu m'as déjà TELLEMENT donné. Je me tire d'ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:540
msgid ""
"(T-Ray wipes the sweat off his body.) Goddamn, woman. All right then, the "
"Highwayman's all yours. It ain't got none\n"
" of the special amen-ities I was gonna add..."
msgstr ""
"[T-Ray essuie la sueur de son corps.] Putain, poupée. Bon, d'accord, la "
"Highwayman est à toi. Elle a aucun des équipements spéciaux que j'allais "
"ajouter..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:541
msgid "*Huff-huff* What amenities are you...*huff-huff*...talking about?"
msgstr "<Huff-huff> De quels équipements... <Huff-huff> ... tu parles ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:542
msgid ""
"I am sick of this...*huff-*huff*...bullshit run-around. Eat...*wheeze*"
"...lead, chop shop boy..."
msgstr ""
"J'en ai marre de ces... <Huff-huff> ... conneries. Je vais... [Respire "
"bruyamment] ... te faire bouffer du plomb..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:543
msgid ""
"I...*huff-huff*...got my car back, and I...*huff-huff*...don't want you "
"touching it anymore. I'm... outta here."
msgstr ""
"J'ai... <Huff-huff> ... ma voiture et je... <Huff-huff> ... veux plus que tu "
"la touches. Je me... tire d'ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:550
msgid ""
"Sure can. I can jazz up the battery charger, spruce up the engine, clean out "
"the interior a little, give it a shine, put\n"
" a brass rope around the license plate - and  kick some of that shit outta "
"the trunk, make some more room. 500 chips."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. Je peux améliorer le chargeur de la batterie, améliorer le moteur, "
"nettoyer un peu l'intérieur, la faire reluire, mettre un fil de cuivre "
"autour de la plaque d'immatriculation, et virer les trucs inutiles du "
"coffre, pour l'agrandir. Le tout pour 500 jetons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:551
msgid ""
"You know, jazz up the battery charger, spruce up the engine, clean out the "
"interior a little, give it a shine, put a brass\n"
" rope around the license plate - and  kick some of that shit outta the "
"trunk, make some more room. Any of that interest you?\n"
" Only 500 chips."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais quoi, je peux améliorer le chargeur de la batterie, améliorer le "
"moteur, nettoyer un peu l'intérieur, la faire reluire, mettre un fil de "
"cuivre autour de la plaque d'immatriculation, et virer les trucs inutiles du "
"coffre, pour l'agrandir. Ca t'intéresse ? Je te la laisse pour 500 jetons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:552
msgid "Sure. Here's 500 chips."
msgstr "D'accord. Voilà 500 jetons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:553
msgid "How about 300 chips?"
msgstr "Tu pourrais pas me la laisser pour 300 jetons ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:554
msgid ""
"I ain't got that much on me right now. How about I bring it back when I have "
"the cash?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai pas grand-chose sur moi. Pourrais-je te payer quand j'aurai plus de "
"fric ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:555
msgid "How about some more sweet love?"
msgstr "Que dirais-tu d'un peu plus de tendresse ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:556
msgid "How about my body? That interest you?"
msgstr "Que dirais-tu de mon corps ? Ca t'intéresse ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:558
msgid "I'm SICK of this bullshit run-around. Eat lead, chop shop boy..."
msgstr "J'en ai MARRE de tes conneries. Je vais te faire bouffer du plomb..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:559
msgid "I don't want you touching my car anymore. I'm outta here."
msgstr "Je veux plus que tu touches à ma voiture. Je me tire d'ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:575
msgid ""
"Done. (Takes money) It's all taken care of. An' look: you ever need "
"batteries, come talk to me, and I'll hook you up."
msgstr ""
"Voilà. [Il prend l'argent] Tout est réglé. Et si t'as besoin de batteries, "
"reviens me voir et je m'en occuperai."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:576
msgid "Can I see what you have in stock now?"
msgstr "Je peux voir ce que t'as en stock maintenant ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:577
msgid "All right, then, thanks. Catch you later, T-Ray."
msgstr "Bon, très bien, merci. A plus tard, T-Ray."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:590
msgid "(Shakes his head.) Naw, that ain't gonna cut it. 500 or nothing."
msgstr "[Secoue la tête.] Nan, je peux pas faire moins. C'est 500 ou rien."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:615
msgid ""
"Course you can. It's all good. An' look: you ever need any batteries for it, "
"come talk to me, and I'll hook you up."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. C'est tout bon. Et si t'as besoin de batteries, reviens me voir et "
"je m'en occuperai."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:616
msgid "Actually, I need some batteries right now."
msgstr "En fait, j'aurais besoin de batteries tout de suite."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:617
msgid ""
"I could use some batteries, but you know what? I don't feel like paying with "
"chips... would you be interested in something... ELSE?"
msgstr ""
"J'aurais besoin de batteries, mais tu sais quoi ? J'ai pas envie de payer "
"avec des jetons... Tu ne serais pas intéressé par AUTRE CHOSE ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:619
msgid "All right, then. Catch you later."
msgstr "Bon, très bien. A bientôt."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:630
msgid ""
"(Shrugs) Sorry, we ain't got no batteries now... come back in a week or two, "
"maybe some will have turned up.\n"
" 'Course... we could just conduct bitness ANYWAY..."
msgstr ""
"[Hausse les épaules.] Désolé, on n'a pas de batteries en ce moment... "
"Reviens dans une semaine ou deux, peut-être qu'on en aura. Bon, mais ça nous "
"empêche pas de faire des AFFAIRES..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:632
msgid "Sorry, only when it IS business. Later, T-Ray."
msgstr "Je regrette, seulement s'il s'agit d'affaires. A plus tard, T-Ray."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:640
msgid ""
"Damn, bitch! I just gave you sweet love five minutes ago! You trying to KILL "
"me?"
msgstr ""
"Je t'ai déjà donné mon corps y a cinq minutes ! Tu veux me TUER ou quoi ?!"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:641
msgid "Now, hold on..."
msgstr "Attends un peu..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:642
msgid "C'mon, I need a charge, and only YOUR sweet love is going to do it."
msgstr ""
"Allez, j'ai besoin qu'on me redonne de la force et il y a que TOI qui peux "
"faire ça."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:643
msgid "Nevermind then. Be that way."
msgstr "Tant pis alors. Laisse tomber."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:650
msgid ""
"Naw, I already got one dog I give a bone to, and I ain't looking to start a "
"kennel. From the looks of you, you ain't\n"
" got nothing that would be worth my time. 500 chips is what sprucing up the "
"Highwayman's gonna cost."
msgstr ""
"Nan, j'ai déjà un chien à nourrir et je cherche pas à monter un chenil. A en "
"juger par les apparences, je vois rien qui vaille la peine que je perde mon "
"temps. 500 jetons, c'est le prix à payer pour remettre la Highwayman sur son "
"trente-et-un."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:651
msgid "All right then. Here's 500 chips."
msgstr "Bon, très bien. Voilà 500 jetons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:653
msgid ""
"Know what? I'm SICK of listening to your bullshit. I'm going to put you down."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais quoi ? J'en ai MARRE d'écouter tes conneries. Je vais te faire taire."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:660
msgid ""
"(Stops you before you turn away.) Now hold on a minute, woman. I didn't say "
"I didn't HAVE no sweet love for you.\n"
" Let's get down to bitness."
msgstr ""
"[Il t'arrête avant que tu aies tourné les talons.] Bon, attends un peu, "
"poupée. J'ai pas dit que j'pouvais pas te donner de l'AMOUR. Passons aux "
"choses sérieuses."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:661
msgid ""
"(Looks you up and down.) A man's gotta do who a man's gotta do. Let's get "
"down to bitness."
msgstr ""
"[Te regardant de la tête aux pieds :] Quand il faut y aller, faut y aller. "
"Passons aux choses sérieuses."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:662
msgid "Get down to \"bitness.\""
msgstr "Passons aux choses *sérieuses*."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:663
msgid "No, I've changed my mind. Bye."
msgstr "Non, j'ai changé d'avis. Salut."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:670
msgid ""
"Hey! The big hero comes 'round to T-Ray's neck o' the woods! Welcome, "
"welcome... "
msgstr ""
"Hé ! Le grand héros qui vient dans les parages de T-Ray ! Bienvenue, "
"bienvenue..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:671
msgid ""
"Hey, sweet-thing. You come back to relax with the Ray after you done kicking "
"the world's ass? "
msgstr ""
"Hé, ma jolie. Tu reviens te détendre avec Ray après avoir flanqué quelques "
"dérouillées au monde ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:672
msgid ""
"Say... I got something you might be interested in for yo car... IF you still "
"have it."
msgstr ""
"Ecoute... J'ai quelque chose qui pourrait t'intéresser pour ta bagnole... Si "
"tu l'as encore."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:673
msgid "Wut izzit"
msgstr "Kess-keussé ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:675
msgid "What have you got for the car?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que t'as pour la voiture ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:690
msgid ""
"Damn, woman! I just gave you sweet love five minutes ago! You trying to KILL "
"me?"
msgstr ""
"Nom de dieu, poupée ! Je t'ai déjà donné mon corps y a cinq minutes ! Tu "
"veux me TUER ou quoi ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:691
msgid "You wanna go AGAIN? Damn, woman! Don't your legs EVER close?"
msgstr "T'en veux ENCORE ? Bon Dieu ! Tu refermes donc jamais tes jambes ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:693
msgid "C'mon, I need a-fixin', and only YOUR sweet love is going to do it."
msgstr ""
"Allez, j'ai besoin qu'on me remonte le moral et il y a que TOI qui sais "
"faire ça."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:710
msgid ""
"(Studies you, frowns) Yeah, sure you are. I know ALLA Bishop's lieutenants, "
"and you ain't one of them.\n"
" (Nods at the door.) Get outta here before I lose my temper."
msgstr ""
"[Il t'observe et fronce les sourcils.] Ouais, c'est ça. Je connais TOUS les "
"lieutenants de Bishop et toi t'en fais pas partie. Sors d'ici avant que je "
"perde mon calme."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:711
msgid "I AM one of Bishop's lieutenants. Now are we gonna deal, or what?"
msgstr ""
"Mais, je SUIS l'un des lieutenants de Bishop. Bon, on peut faire affaire ou "
"quoi ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:712
msgid "I'm leaving, I'm leaving..."
msgstr "Je m'en vais, je m'en vais..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:720
msgid ""
"(Sneers) Yeah, we're gonna deal all right. Better hope you ain't got no "
"family who's gonna miss you..."
msgstr ""
"[Ricane.] Ouais, on va en faire des affaires. J'espère pour toi que t'as pas "
"de famille qui va te regretter..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:721
msgid ""
"You better hope that you got a family that'll be able to find all your "
"pieces."
msgstr ""
"J'espère pour toi que t'as de la famille qui pourra retrouver tous tes "
"morceaux."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:730
msgid ""
"(Studies you.) You're one of Bishop's lew-tenants?! Naw... if you were, "
"you'd be a little taller, a little\n"
" more... (looks skeptical) ...bad-ass."
msgstr ""
"[T'observe.] T'es l'un des lieut'nants de Bishop ?!! Nan... Si c'était vrai, "
"tu serais plus balaise, et t'aurais l'air un peu plus... [Il prend un air "
"sceptique.] ... méchant."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:731
msgid "(Studies you.) You're "
msgstr "[Il t'observe.] Tu es "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:732
msgid "I'm legit. You challengin' me?"
msgstr "Je le suis vraiment. Tu me provoques ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:734
msgid "Don't believe everything you hear. Let's talk about Mr. Bishop's car."
msgstr ""
"Ne crois pas tout ce qu'on te dit. Parlons un peu de la voiture de M. Bishop."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:735
msgid "Forget this conversation. I'm outta here."
msgstr "Oublie cette conversation. Je me tire d'ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:745
msgid ""
"(Raises his hands in mock surrender) Naw, naw, I was just playin' witcha."
msgstr ""
"[Il Lève ses bras en faisant mine de se rendre.] Nan, nan, je me moquais "
"gentiment de toi."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:746
msgid "Let's talk about Mr. Bishop's car."
msgstr "Parlons un peu de la voiture de M. Bishop."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:747
msgid "Next time you better watch yourself. I'm outta here."
msgstr "La prochaine fois, fais gaffe à toi. Je me tire d'ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:755
msgid ""
"Aiight, aiight... here's the deal: we can do all the upgrades, spruce her "
"up, and get it to Mr. Bishop pronto.\n"
" Price... (Shrugs, smiles) ...question is: how CAN you put a price on a "
"Highwayman like this?"
msgstr ""
"D'aaac, d'ac... Voilà ce que je te propose : on peut faire toutes les "
"améliorations, l'astiquer et l'apporter tout de suite à M. Bishop. Le "
"problème... [Il ricane et sourit.] ... c'est de déterminer le PRIX d'une "
"Highwayman comme celle-ci..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:757
msgid "I don't have TIME for your bullshit. What's the bottom-line?"
msgstr "J'ai pas le TEMPS d'écouter tes conneries. Va droit au but."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:758
msgid ""
"You're right. You can't. I will be taking the car with me, and Mr. Bishop "
"will let you continue your operation here."
msgstr ""
"T'as raison. On peut pas. Alors, écoute, j'emmène la voiture avec moi et M. "
"Bishop te laissera continuer tes affaires ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:759
msgid "I don't have time for this. I'm outta here."
msgstr "J'ai pas le temps pour ça. Je me tire d'ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:770
msgid ""
"As I see it, this Highwayman... most likely the last of its kind in working "
"order... is worth at LEAST 3000 chips... but\n"
" y'know what? (Winks) I'm willing to part with this fine machine for 2700 "
"chips considerin' the condition. A-course, we'd\n"
" need ta talk about FRINGE benefits: club privileges, free admission to the "
"ho-house..."
msgstr ""
"Je vois ça comme ça : cette Highwayman, probablement la dernière de son "
"genre en état de fonctionnement, vaut au moins 3 000 jetons... mais tu sais "
"quoi ? [Il te fait un clin d'oeil.] Je suis prêt à te la laisser pour 2700 "
"jetons, vu son état. Bien sûr, il faut discuter des bénéfices en NATURE : "
"privilèges du club, entrées gratuites..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:771
msgid "2700? Done. Here you are."
msgstr "2700 ? Marché conclu. Voilà."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:772
msgid "Mr. Bishop is prepared to offer you 1500 chips."
msgstr "M. Bishop est prêt à t'en offrir 1500 jetons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:773
msgid "2700? No, no... Mr. Bishop will take it for 900 chips."
msgstr "2700 ? Non, non... M. Bishop t'en offre 900 jetons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:774
msgid ""
"I have a counter-offer. I will take the car for no charge, and Mr. Bishop "
"will permit you to continue your operation here."
msgstr ""
"Je te fais une autre proposition. Je prends la voiture gratos et M. Bishop "
"te laisse continuer tes affaires ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:775
msgid "I'll tell Mr. Bishop and return with his reply."
msgstr "Je vais le dire à M. Bishop et je reviendrai te donner sa réponse."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:780
msgid ""
"(T-Ray blinks, then smiles slow and wide as you pass off the chips.) Now, I "
"like a deal that's concluded fast and\n"
" simple; pleasure doing bitness with you, pleasure doing bitness... now "
"about those fringe benefits...?"
msgstr ""
"[T-Ray te fait un clin d'oeil, puis sourit lentement au moment où tu lui "
"donnes l'argent.] Bon, j'aime les marchés conclus vite faits bien faits. "
"C'est un plaisir de traiter avec toi, un vrai plaisir... Bon, et à propos "
"des avantages en nature... ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:781
msgid ""
"You will have to discuss those with Mr. Bishop. Mr. Bishop has one last "
"request: free batteries from your shop.\n"
" I will be the courier for these pick-ups."
msgstr ""
"Tu devras discuter de ça avec M. Bishop. M. Bishop a une dernière requête : "
"des batteries gratuites de ton magasin. C'est moi qui ferai ces livraisons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:782
msgid ""
"The other benefits you will have to discuss with Mr. Bishop himself. Be sure "
"to go to talk to him armed and\n"
" shouting loudly about what he owes you. He respects men like that."
msgstr ""
"Pour les autres avantages, tu devras en discuter avec M. Bishop lui-même. Je "
"te conseille d'aller le voir armé et de te faire entendre sur ce qu'il te "
"doit. Il ne respecte que les gens comme ça."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:783
msgid ""
"You will have to talk to Mr. Bishop about your fringe benefits. Goodbye."
msgstr "Tu devras discuter des avantages en nature avec M. Bishop. Au revoir."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:790
msgid "Man, that amount couldn't even afford to change my clothes! "
msgstr ""
"Mon pote, cette somme ne me permettrait même pas de changer de fringues !"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:791
msgid "Woman, that amount couldn't even afford to change my clothes! "
msgstr "Poupée, cette somme ne me permettrait même pas de changer de fringues !"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:792
msgid "What, does Bishop think cars are CHEAP?!"
msgstr "Quoi, M. Bishop croit peut-être que les voitures ne valent rien ?!!"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:793
msgid "Perhaps you feel you are being treated... unfairly?"
msgstr "Tu penses peut-être qu'on te traite... injustement ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:794
msgid ""
"Mr. Bishop has made a GENEROUS offer of 1500 chips. You won't like the next "
"offer."
msgstr ""
"M. Bishop a fait une proposition GENEREUSE de 1500 jetons. Je ne pense pas "
"que tu aimeras la proposition suivante."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:795
msgid ""
"Then perhaps an offer of 900 chips will be more to your liking. Mr. Bishop "
"will be pleased your work comes so cheaply."
msgstr ""
"Dans ce cas, que dirais-tu de 900 jetons ? M. Bishop sera content que ton "
"travail soit si bon marché."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:797
msgid ""
"Since his generous offer has been refused, I'm instructed to take the car "
"for no charge."
msgstr ""
"Etant donné que son offre généreuse a été refusée, j'ai pour instruction de "
"prendre la voiture gratuitement."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:798
msgid "I tire of this conversation. I will return later."
msgstr "J'en ai marre de cette conversation. Je reviendrai plus tard."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:810
msgid "Nine hun... man, are you joking?! "
msgstr "Neuf cen... Attends, tu rigoles ?!!"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:811
msgid "Nine hun... woman, are you joking?! "
msgstr "Neuf cen... Eh poupée, tu rigoles ?!!"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:812
msgid ""
"Cut the bull-shit! This is a HIGHWAYMAN. They don't make them ANYWHERE "
"anymore, see? There's OTHER families that'll be\n"
" willin' to pay for it if that cheap bastard Bishop won't..."
msgstr ""
"Arrête tes conneries ! C'est une HIGHWAYMAN. Ils en font PLUS des comme ça, "
"tu vois ? Y'a d'AUTRES familles qui sont prêtes à payer le prix si ce "
"gripsou de Bishop ne la veut pas..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:814
msgid ""
"Mr. Bishop has made a GENEROUS offer of 900 chips. You won't like the next "
"offer."
msgstr ""
"M. Bishop a fait une proposition GENEREUSE de 900 jetons. Je ne pense pas "
"que tu aimeras la proposition suivante."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:816
msgid ""
"So you are dealing with other families? Mr. Bishop will be interested to "
"hear that."
msgstr ""
"Alors tu traites avec d'autres familles ? M. Bishop sera intéressé de "
"l'apprendre."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:817
msgid "I'm sorry? What did you just call Mr. Bishop?"
msgstr "Pardon ? Comment tu viens d'appeler M. Bishop ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:818
msgid "I tire of this. We'll talk again later."
msgstr "J'en ai marre. On en reparlera plus tard."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:830
msgid ""
"(T-Ray freezes. For a second, you think he's going to attack you, but then "
"he relaxes.) Man, this is a raw deal. "
msgstr ""
"[T-Ray s'interrompt d'un coup. Pendant une seconde, tu penses qu'il va "
"t'attaquer, mais il se détend.] Mon pote, c'est pas un cadeau."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:831
msgid ""
"(T-Ray freezes. For a second, you think he's going to attack you, but then "
"he relaxes.) Woman, this is a raw deal. "
msgstr ""
"[T-Ray s'interrompt d'un coup. Pendant une seconde, tu penses qu'il va "
"t'attaquer, mais il se détend.] Poupée, c'est pas un cadeau."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:832
msgid "What have I ever done to Bishop to deserve this? Huh?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que j'ai fait à Bishop pour mériter ça ? Hein ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:834
msgid ""
"I'd take it up with Mr. Bishop. Oh... Mr. Bishop has one last request: he "
"would like free batteries from your shop.\n"
" I will be the courier for these pick-ups."
msgstr ""
"A ta place, j'en parlerais à M. Bishop. Oh... M. Bishop a une dernière "
"requête : il veut des batteries gratuites de ton magasin. C'est moi qui "
"ferai ces livraisons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:835
msgid ""
"I'm sure it was something. He doesn't like you much. Pleasure doing business "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"T'as sûrement fait quelque chose. Il t'aime pas tellement. C'était un "
"plaisir de faire affaire avec toi."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:845
msgid ""
"Naw, naw, nothin' like that...! Me and Mr. Bishop, we see eye to eye on "
"this, no problems. He's treated me right, and you\n"
" tell him that, aiight? But... uh... what 'bout those fringe benefits I "
"mentioned...?"
msgstr ""
"Nan, nan, rien de tout ça ! Moi et M. Bishop, on partage le même point de "
"vue, pas de problème. Il a été réglo avec moi et tu le lui diras, hein ? "
"Mais... Heu... A propos des avantages en nature que j'ai mentionnés... ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:846
msgid ""
"You will have to discuss those with Mr. Bishop. Mr. Bishop has one last "
"request: he would like free batteries from your\n"
" shop. I will be the courier for these pick-ups."
msgstr ""
"Tu devras discuter de ça avec M. Bishop. M. Bishop a une dernière requête : "
"il veut des batteries gratuites de ton magasin. C'est moi qui ferai ces "
"livraisons."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:847
msgid ""
"The other benefits you will have to discuss with Mr. Bishop. Be sure to go "
"to talk to him armed and shouting loudly\n"
" about what he owes you. He respects men like that."
msgstr ""
"Pour les autres avantages, tu devras en discuter avec M. Bishop. Je te "
"conseille d'aller le voir armé et de te faire entendre sur ce qu'il te doit. "
"Il ne respecte que les gens comme ça."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:855
msgid "(T-Ray's smile fades.) Aiight... sure, sure... not a problem."
msgstr "[Le sourire de T-Ray s'évanouit.] Bon... Bien sûr... Pas de problème."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:856
msgid "Excellent. Give me all the batteries you have in stock right now."
msgstr "Excellent. Donne-moi toutes les batteries que t'as en stock."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:865
msgid ""
"I will, I will... hey, you tell your boss he can buy batteries from me, too. "
"I keep finding new ones every day round here."
msgstr ""
"J'y vais, j'y vais... Bon, dis à ton patron qu'il peut aussi acheter des "
"batteries ici. Je continue à en trouver des nouvelles tous les jours par ici."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:866
msgid "Really? Let me see what you have in stock."
msgstr "Vraiment ? Montre-moi ce que t'as en stock."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:875
msgid ""
"We ain't got any batteries right now; most of the cars we've stripped ain't "
"turned up shit. Give us a week or two, aiight?"
msgstr ""
"On n'a pas de batteries en ce moment, les voitures qu'on a démontées avaient "
"rien de valable. Donne-nous une semaine ou deux, Ok ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:876
msgid "All right. I'll let it slide. This time. See ya."
msgstr "Très bien. Je ferme les yeux. Pour cette fois. A bientôt."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:885
msgid ""
"(T-Ray's shoulders slump a little.) Aiight, aiight. Here you go. It's all I "
"got."
msgstr ""
"[T-Ray baisse un peu les épaules.] Ok, Ok. Tiens. C'est tout ce que j'ai."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:886
msgid ""
"All right. I'll be back in two weeks for the next batch. Have them ready for "
"Mr. Bishop."
msgstr ""
"D'accord. Je reviendrai dans deux semaines pour la prochaine livraison. Mets-"
"les de côté pour M. Bishop."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:896
msgid "Okay. I'll try back later."
msgstr "D'accord. Je repasserai plus tard."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:905
msgid "Sure, we got some."
msgstr "Bien sûr, on en a quelques-unes."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:906
msgid "Could I check out your stock?"
msgstr "Je peux voir ce que t'as en stock ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:907
msgid ""
"Well, I'd really like one, but I don't want to pay for it. Is there "
"something... ELSE I could do to pay for it?"
msgstr ""
"Ben, j'en voudrais bien une, mais je ne veux pas payer pour ça. Je pourrais "
"pas payer avec... AUTRE chose ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:909
msgid "Just checking. Be seeing you."
msgstr "Je vérifiais juste. A bientôt."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:915
msgid ""
"Grav-plates! These beauties'll let you FLY cross the wasteland, and they "
"have a recycling power chip, so they\n"
" barely suck up any juice. How do you like that? You want 'em?"
msgstr ""
"Des plaques à éperons ! Ouais, pour la prochaine fois que tu traverses le "
"désert et que tu vois des connards que t'aimes pas ? Avec cette plaque, tu "
"as la POSSIBILITE de les faire sortir de la route et de tout leur piquer. "
"Qu'en penses-tu ? Tu la veux ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:916
msgid "Me like me take"
msgstr "Moi aimer, moi prendre."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:918
msgid "Sounds good. I'll take it."
msgstr "Ca a l'air pas mal. Je prends."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:919
msgid "Not right now. I have come to collect Mr. Bishop's free batteries."
msgstr "Pas maintenant. Je suis ici pour les batteries gratuites de M. Bishop."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:920
msgid ""
"Not right now. Can you upgrade the Highwayman without adding the grav plates?"
msgstr ""
"Pas maintenant. Tu peux améliorer la Highwayman sans ajouter de plaques à "
"éperons ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:921
msgid "Not right now. Can I buy some batteries from you instead?"
msgstr "Pas maintenant. Je peux t'acheter des batteries à la place ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:922
msgid "No, not at the moment. Maybe later. See ya."
msgstr "Non, pas maintenant. Peut-être plus tard. A bientôt."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:930
msgid ""
"(T-Ray spends an hour or two in the shop. When he emerges, the grav-plates "
"have been installed.)"
msgstr ""
"[T-Ray passe une heure ou deux dans le magasin. Quand il revient, les "
"plaques à éperons sont installées.]"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:931
msgid "Thanks, T-Ray. Appreciate it. I'll go try them out."
msgstr "Merci, T-Ray. Je vais aller les essayer."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:940
msgid "Help yourself, hero."
msgstr "Fais comme chez toi."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:941
msgid "What's mine is yours. Tell everybody I said that, too."
msgstr "Ce qui est à moi est à toi. Oublie pas de mentionner que j'ai dit ça."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:942
msgid ""
"Damn. You save the world, and you STILL got to go through everybody's shit."
msgstr ""
"Bon Dieu d'Bon Dieu. Tu sauves le monde et tu dois QUAND MEME supporter les "
"conneries des autres."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:950
msgid "Get away from my shit."
msgstr "Dégage."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:951
msgid "Next time you touch my shit, you're going to get yo ass beat."
msgstr "La prochaine fois que tu touches à ça, ça finira mal."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:1000
msgid "You got the car back without using violence."
msgstr "Tu as repris la voiture sans avoir recours à la violence."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:1001
msgid "You successfully tricked T-Ray."
msgstr "Tu as réussi à rouler T-Ray."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:1002
msgid "You have received a free supply of car batteries."
msgstr "Tu as réussi à obtenir des batteries de voiture gratuites."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:1100
msgid "Too... much... sex... gonna... blow..."
msgstr "Trop... de... sexe... je... vais... m'écrouler..."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:2000
msgid "You got a battery for the Highwayman."
msgstr "Tu as obtenu une batterie pour la Highwayman."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:2010
msgid "You got the upgrade for the Highwayman."
msgstr "Tu as fait réparer la Highwayman."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:5286
msgid ". I'm here for the car."
msgstr ". Je suis ici pour la voiture."

#: dialog/nctray.msg:5731
msgid "?! I heard "
msgstr " ?! J'ai entendu dire que "

#: dialog/nctray.msg:5733
msgid ". You challengin' me?"
msgstr ". Tu me provoques ?"

#: dialog/nctray.msg:6731
msgid " was a little taller, a little more... (looks skeptical) ...bad-ass."
msgstr ""
" était un peu plus balaise, et avait l'air un peu plus... [Il prend un air "
"sceptique.] ... méchant."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:101
msgid "You see Mike \"the Masticator.\""
msgstr "Tu vois Mike « le Mastiquateur »."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:158
msgid "Hurgghhh"
msgstr "<Hurgghhh>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:159
msgid "Gunhrrhh"
msgstr "<Gunhrrhh>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:160
msgid "Mike smash."
msgstr "Mike tout casser."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:161
msgid "I really like vanilla ice cream."
msgstr "J'aime bien la glace à la vanille."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:162
msgid "Gnarrrr"
msgstr "<Gnarrrr>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:163
msgid "Nrrrurhhh"
msgstr "<Nrrrurhhh>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:164
msgid "Mike like ears."
msgstr "Mike aimer les oreilles"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:165
msgid "Ears mmmmmmm."
msgstr "Oreilles <Hummmmmm...>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:166
msgid "Grrrrrr"
msgstr "<Grrrrrr>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:167
msgid "Gr. Gr? Grrrrrrr."
msgstr "<Gr. Gr ?> <Grrrrrrr>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:168
msgid "Gr?"
msgstr "<Gr ?>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:169
msgid "Rrrgggg"
msgstr "<Rrrgggg>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:170
msgid "Me eat ears."
msgstr "Moi manger oreilles."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:171
msgid "Ears yum."
msgstr "Oreilles, miam-miam."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:172
msgid "Gr... grrrgr?"
msgstr "<Gr...> <Grrrgr ?>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:173
msgid "Snrggg"
msgstr "<Snrggg>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:174
msgid "Me hate Robbin' Givens."
msgstr "Moi détester Robbin' Givens."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:175
msgid "Grrrrrgrrrrgrrr... grrr... grrr... grr! Grr! Grrr?"
msgstr "<Grrrrrgrrrrgrrr...> <Grrr...> <Grrr...> <Grr !> <Grr !> <Grrr ?>"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:176
msgid "What does 'percentage' mean?"
msgstr "Quoi « pourcentage » vouloir dire ?"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:200
msgid "::Mike cowers as you approach::"
msgstr "::Mike tremble lorsque tu t'approches::"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:201
msgid "::Mike whines as you approach::"
msgstr "::Mike gémit lorsque tu t'approches::"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:202
msgid "::Mike holds up his hands in surrender as you approach::"
msgstr "::Mike fait signe qu'il se rend lorsque tu t'approches::"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:203
msgid "You cute."
msgstr "Toi mignonne."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:204
msgid "Me like your ears."
msgstr "Moi aimer oreilles à toi."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:206
msgid "Robin? That you?"
msgstr "Robin ? C'est toi ?"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:100
msgid "You see Coffin Willie."
msgstr "Tu vois Willie Cercueil."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:150
msgid "You see an old, stinky, crusty ghoul. And boy, does he SMELL."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois une vieille Goule, puante et bourrue. Et en plus, qu'est-ce qu'elle "
"PUE !"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:200
msgid "Whoa. This grave SMELLS."
msgstr "Ho ! Cette tombe PUE."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:201
msgid "Oh, well... better keep digging."
msgstr "Eh bien... Vaudrait mieux continuer à creuser."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:202
msgid "What th-?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que --"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:203
msgid "About friggin' time! Could you dig any SLOWER, idjit?"
msgstr "C'est pas trop tôt ! Tu pourrais pas creuser plus LENTEMENT !"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:204
msgid "Outta my way, smoothie."
msgstr "Fiche le camp, Peaudouce."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:205
msgid "D'dad?"
msgstr "P'pa ?"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:206
msgid "Not now, Lenny, I ain't in th' mood to be talkin'."
msgstr "Pas maintenant, Lenny, j'suis pas d'humeur à parler."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:300
msgid ""
"Jest pop inta Reno fer a lil' drinking n' whoring, n' damned smoothies jam "
"me inna goddamn grave..."
msgstr ""
"J'étais juste allé à Reno pour boire un verre et voir les putes et ces "
"enfoirés de Peaudouces m'ont enterré vivant..."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:301
msgid "Good thing I ain't got no nose, or I woulda choked on my own stink."
msgstr ""
"Heureusement que j'ai pas d'odorat, sinon je suffoquerais sous ma propre "
"puanteur."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:302
msgid "Ghouls don't get no damn r'spect."
msgstr "Les Goules n'ont pas le moindre respect."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:303
msgid ""
"Just stopped in the city for a drink, n' those Reno assholes bury me alive."
msgstr ""
"J'étais juste allé à la ville pour boire un verre et ces enfoirés de Reno "
"m'ont enterré vivant."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:304
msgid "Nothing more boring than bein' in a coffin for months."
msgstr ""
"Y a rien de plus ennuyeux que d'rester dans un cercueil pendant des mois."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:305
msgid "Hands off, smoothie. I got places to go."
msgstr "Bas les pattes, Peaudouce. Il faut que je m'en aille."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:306
msgid "Get your smoothie mitts offa me, smoothie."
msgstr "Ne me touche pas avec tes sales pattes, Peaudouce."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:500
msgid ""
"The headstone reads: \"Here lies the dumbest son of a bitch ever to set foot "
"in New Reno.\""
msgstr ""
"Les mots suivants sont écrits sur la pierre tombale : « Ici repose le plus "
"con jamais venu à New Reno. »"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:550
msgid "There's a horrible odor flowing from the grave."
msgstr "Une odeur nauséabonde se dégage de la tombe."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:601
msgid "I ken hear someome movin' round out there!"
msgstr "J'entends quelqu'un marcher par-là !"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:602
msgid "Don't step onna grave! It packs the dirt in!"
msgstr "Ne marche pas sur la tombe ! Ca fait rentrer la terre !"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:603
msgid "Quick, GET A SHOVEL!"
msgstr "Vite, ATTRAPE UNE PELLE !"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:604
msgid "Would somebody dig me up already? I need a drink!"
msgstr "Quelqu'un pourrait-il me faire sortir ? J'ai besoin d'un verre !"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:605
msgid "That a worm I feel? Oh... nevermind."
msgstr "C'est un ver que je sens ? Oh... Tant pis."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:700
msgid "Ug, smellie in hole."
msgstr "Urk, trou beaucoup puer."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:701
msgid "Me dig more for smellie shinies."
msgstr "Moi creuser pour richesses puantes."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:702
msgid "Huh, You not shini-!?"
msgstr "Hein, toi pas être richesse !?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:100
msgid "You see one of the Wright children. "
msgstr "Tu vois un des enfants des Wright."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:150
msgid "You see a black-haired little boy."
msgstr "Tu vois un petit garçon aux cheveux noirs."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:151
msgid "You see a black-haired little girl."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois une petite fille aux cheveux noirs. Elle a une coupe de cheveux si "
"courte que tu l'aurais presque confondue avec un garçon."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:155
msgid "He sticks his tongue out at you."
msgstr "Tu vois un des enfants des Wright. Il te tire la langue."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:156
msgid "He is glaring at you sullenly."
msgstr "Tu vois un des enfants des Wright. Il te regarde."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:157
msgid "She sticks her tongue out at you."
msgstr "Tu vois un des enfants des Wright. Elle te tire la langue."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:158
msgid "She looks at you suspiciously."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un des enfants des Wright. Elle a des cheveux si courts qu'elle "
"correspond parfaitement au modèle infantile masculin par défaut."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:159
msgid "She is glaring at you sullenly."
msgstr "Tu vois un des enfants des Wright. Elle te regarde."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:175 dialog/ncwriply.msg:272
msgid "Fallout 2 was brought to you by the letter Z."
msgstr "Fallout 2 vous a été présenté par Nuka-Cola."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:178 dialog/ncwriply.msg:279
msgid "Thanks fer savin us, "
msgstr "Merci d'nous avoir sauvés, "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:179 dialog/ncwrichi.msg:290
msgid "I wanna save th'world just like you when I grow up."
msgstr "Je sauverai l'monde comme toi quand je s'rai grand !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:180 dialog/ncwrichi.msg:291 dialog/ncwriply.msg:281
msgid "Can I be a hero like you when I grow up?"
msgstr "Est-ce que j'peux être un héros comme toi quand j'serai grand ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:181 dialog/ncwriply.msg:282
msgid "I wanna be "
msgstr "Moi, j'veux être "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:190
msgid "Are you a ROBOT?"
msgstr "Es-tu un robot ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:191
msgid "How do you go pee-pee in that thing?"
msgstr "Comme tu peux faire pipi avec ce truc ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:192
msgid "Can I ride around on your shoulders? Pleeease?"
msgstr "Je peux monter sur tes épaules ? S'il te plaît !!!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:193
msgid "Will you come play with us? Pleeease?"
msgstr "Tu viens jouer avec nous ? S'il te plaît !!!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:200 dialog/ncwriply.msg:310
msgid "You better run 'fore my Daddy sees you."
msgstr "T'ferais mieux d'courir 'vant qu'on papa t'voit."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:201 dialog/ncwriply.msg:311
msgid "You better run 'fore my brothers see you."
msgstr "T'ferais mieux d'courir 'vant qu'mes frères t'voient."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:202 dialog/ncwriply.msg:312
msgid "Yer a bad person. You better leave 'fore I tell on you."
msgstr ""
"T'es un méchant. T'f'rais mieux d'courir avant j'aille dire à tout le monde "
"que t'es là."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:210
msgid "I see you! I see you!"
msgstr "Je t'ai trouvé ! Je t'ai trouvé !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:211
msgid "Are you playin' hide and go seek? Can I play, too?"
msgstr "Tu joues à cache-cache ? Je peux jouer aussi ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:215
msgid "Look at the robot! Look at the robot!"
msgstr "Regarde le robot ! Regarde le robot !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:216
msgid "Is that a reeeal brain inside that robot?"
msgstr "C'est un VRAI cerveau dans le robot ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:217
msgid "Oooooooh. Look at the robot!"
msgstr "Oooohhhh ! Un robot !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:218
msgid "Look at the mutant! Look at the mutant!"
msgstr "Regard le mutant ! Regarde le mutant !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:219
msgid "Mutant, stoopant, mutant, stoopant"
msgstr "Mutant, stupide, Mutant, stupide."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:220
msgid "Is that a reeeal mutant? He's fugly."
msgstr "C'est un VRAI mutant ? Il est moche !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:221
msgid "Oooooooh. Look at the mutant!"
msgstr "Oooohhhh ! Un mutant !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:222
msgid "That mutant's BIG. Bigger than Daddy."
msgstr "Ce mutant est énorme. Plus que papa."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:230
msgid "Ghoul! Look, itz a ghoul!"
msgstr "Une Goule ! Regardez, c'est une Goule !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:231
msgid "Ewwwwwww! Ghoul! Ghoul!"
msgstr "Ouuuuuuhhhh ! Une Goule !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:232
msgid "Ghoul-eee ghoul-eee ghoul-eee!"
msgstr "Gou-le ! Gou-le ! Gou-le !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:233
msgid "Look at the metal doggie!"
msgstr "Regardez le toutou métallique !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:234
msgid "Doggie! Here, doggie!"
msgstr "Toutou, ici toutou !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:235
msgid "I want a doggie, too!"
msgstr "Je veux le même toutou !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:292
msgid "I wanna be you when I grow up."
msgstr "Je serai comme toi quand je serai grand"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:293
msgid "Why you wanna be me? Me DUMB"
msgstr "Pourquoi toi vouloir être moi ? Moi CRETIN..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:294
msgid "Me once wear girl head like hat."
msgstr "Moi avoir déjà porté tête de fille comme chapeau !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:295
msgid "[Wander off]"
msgstr "[Partir]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:296
msgid "Heh-heh. Why thank you, little one. But take a tip from "
msgstr "Hé Hé ! Moi te remercier. Moi donner conseil de la part de "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:297
msgid "Follow your dreams. You can achieve your goals. I'm living proof."
msgstr "Suis tes rêves. Tu peux accomplir tes objectifs."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:298
msgid ""
"Sure you can. Say, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you "
"know what happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"Pour sûr tu peux. Dis, j'ai appris pour la mort de Richard. Tu saurais ce "
"qu'il lui est arrivé ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:299
msgid ""
"I once drove through three states wearing this one little girl's head like a "
"hat."
msgstr ""
"J'ai déjà roulé sur 3 Etats avec cette tête de fille, coiffée comme une "
"casquette."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:300
msgid "[Let him go back to playing.]"
msgstr "[Tu le laisses retourner jouer]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:301
msgid "[Let her go back to playing.]"
msgstr "[Tu la laisses retourner jouer]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:310
msgid ""
"Uh-uh! Yer SMART! Yer a HERO and yer BRAVE and I wanna be YOU when I grow "
"up. Thanks fer savin' us, "
msgstr ""
"Oh Oh ! T'es gentil ! t'es un héros et t'es courageux et j'veux être toi "
"quand je s'rai grand. Merci d'nous avoir sauvé, "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:311
msgid "Thankzzz little pershun. You make "
msgstr "Merci, petit gars. Tu fais "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:315
msgid "Okay, "
msgstr "D'accord, "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:316
msgid ""
"You take care now, you hear, little one? I've got some more hero things to "
"do."
msgstr ""
"Tu prends soin de toi, d'accord, p'tit gars ? Il faut que j'aille faire des "
"trucs héroïques."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:320
msgid "(The kid stops you.) Um... "
msgstr "[L'enfant t'arrête.] Hum... "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:321
msgid "Uh... no. I promise."
msgstr "Euh... Non, j'ai promis."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:322
msgid "Uh... not as far as you know."
msgstr "Euh... Rien que tu saches."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:323
msgid ""
"Don't worry, little one. I'll come back and visit you as a different "
"character."
msgstr ""
"T'inquiète pas, p'tit... Je reviendrai avec un autre personnage... ou dans "
"Fallout 3, qui ne devrait pas tarder..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:324
msgid "Don't worry, little one. You won't feel a thing."
msgstr "T'inquiète pas, petit... Tu sentiras rien."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:330
msgid "Will we dream?"
msgstr "Est-ce qu'on rêvera ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:331
msgid "Uh... sure. Sure you will."
msgstr "Euh... Bien sûr que tu rêveras !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:332
msgid ""
"Beats me. I don't seem to dream, so you probably don't either. Life's a "
"bitch, huh?"
msgstr ""
"Pince-moi. Je ne rêve pas, et toi non plus. Tu penses qu'on sera là dans "
"Fallout 3 ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:341
msgid "Watz a rowboat?"
msgstr "Quoi être ROBOT ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:344
msgid "Heh-heh. Aren't you cute. No, I'm not a robot, little one."
msgstr "Hé hé, il est mignon... Non, je suis pas un robot."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:345
msgid ""
"No, no, I'm a regular person under this armor. By the way, I was sorry to "
"hear about your brother, Richie.\n"
" Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"Non, non, je suis une vraie personne sous cette armure. D'ailleurs, j'ai "
"appris la nouvelle à propos de Richard. Tu saurais pas ce qu'il lui ai "
"arrivé, des fois ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:355
msgid "Yer DUMB."
msgstr "T'es BETE..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:356
msgid "SO ARE YOU"
msgstr "TOI aussi"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:357
msgid "Same to you, cept more of it"
msgstr "Comme toi, mais encore plus."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:358
msgid "Yer dumb-errrr"
msgstr "Tu es plus bête."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:359
msgid "He who smelt it dealt it"
msgstr "Qui se ressemble s'assemble."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:360
msgid "Takes one t'know one!"
msgstr "Oeil pour oeil dent pour dent."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:361
msgid "Run away crying"
msgstr "[Tu t'en vas en pleurant]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:370
msgid "Yer the dumbest. Yer dumbest!"
msgstr "T'es le plus bête ! T'es le plus bête !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:395
msgid ""
"Nuh-uh, DUMBHEAD! (The kid runs off, his laughter ringing cruelly in your "
"ears.)"
msgstr ""
"Nan-nan, GROS DEBILE ! [L'enfant s'enfuit, son rire résonne cruellement dans "
"tes oreilles.]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:396
msgid ""
"Me no want to talk to you ANYWAY... *snfff*... me... *snfff*... have a "
"PARTY...\n"
" with *snfff* CAKE and ICE CREAM... and YOU can't come [Leave.]"
msgstr ""
"Moi plus vouloir parler avec toi, EN PLUS... [Sniff] moi... [Sniff] faire la "
"FETE avec... [Sniff] des GATEAUX et de la GLACE... et TOI pas venir, nah ! ["
"Il Part.]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:405
msgid ""
"(The kid blinks, opens his mouth, then closes it. A tear wells up and turns "
"into a full sob.)"
msgstr ""
"[L'enfant s'apprête à ouvrir la bouche, mais non. Une larme coule de son "
"oeil, puis il se met à brailler.]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:406
msgid "Hee hee ME win"
msgstr "Hé hé moi gagner."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:410
msgid "Oh. (Thinks for a moment, then squints at you.) Why ARENCHA a robot?"
msgstr "Pourquoi t'es pas un robot ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:411
msgid "Uh... because... well, robots and people have different... uh, parts."
msgstr ""
"Euh... Parce que... les robots et les humains ont des pièces différentes..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:425
msgid "Oh, yeah? (Seems suspicious.) Like what?"
msgstr "Ah ouais ? Comme quoi ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:426
msgid ""
"Uh... well... say, kid, didn't your Mommy and Daddy explain this to you?"
msgstr "Euh, ben... Dis-moi, p'tit, tes parents t'ont pas expliqué ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:427
msgid "Uh... well! Look at the time! I must be going."
msgstr "Euh... T'as vu l'heure ? Faut que j'y aille !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:435
msgid "Explain what?"
msgstr "Expliquer quoi ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:436
msgid ""
"Uh... well... robots... have oil inside. Humans... well, humans... bleed."
msgstr "Euh, ben... Les robots ont de l'huile... Les humains saignent."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:445
msgid ""
"Mommy an' my big sisters bleed every month or so. Then they get really mean. "
"I wish they were robots."
msgstr ""
"Ma maman et mes grandes soeurs saignent une fois par mois ou presque. Puis "
"elles vont beaucoup mieux. Si seulement c'était des robots."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:446
msgid ""
"Uh... yeah. Great, kid. Look, I have to be going - don't tell yer Mom I was "
"talking to you."
msgstr ""
"Euh, cool... Faut que j'y aille. Dis pas à tes parents que je t'ai parlé de "
"ça."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:456
msgid "I just pee but haveta get used to th'smell"
msgstr "Je fais pipi, mais j'ai dû m'habituer à l'odeur."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:459
msgid ""
"Heh-heh. Actually, I just urinate in the armor, and it recycles everything. "
"Isn't that interesting?\n"
" Do you know what 'recycling' means, little one?"
msgstr ""
"Hé hé, en fait je fais pipi dans mon armure, et elle recycle tout. "
"Intéressant, non ? Tu sais ce que *recycler* signifie, non ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:460
msgid ""
"Not comfortably, that's for sure. Say, I was sorry to hear about your "
"brother, Richie.\n"
" Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"Pas très confortable, en effet. Dis, j'ai appris la nouvelle pour Richard. "
"Tu ne saurais pas ce qu'il lui est arrivé, par hasard ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:475
msgid "That's GROSS."
msgstr "C'est dégueulasse !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:476
msgid "Yes! Recycling means you drink pee!"
msgstr "Oui ! *Recycler* signifie que tu bois ton pipi !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:477
msgid "YER gross, pee-pee FACE"
msgstr "T'es dégueu !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:479
msgid "Uh, heh... heh. No actually, it means..."
msgstr "Euh, hé hé ! En fait, ça veut dire..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:485
msgid "You drink pee-pee! You drink pee-pee!"
msgstr "Tu bois le pipi ! Tu bois le pipi !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:486
msgid ""
"Uh, heh... heh... keep your voice down, little one... recycling doesn't mean "
"that I drink p... well, not EXACTLY... look..."
msgstr ""
"Euh, hé hé... Baisse d'un ton, veux-tu ? *Recycler* ne veut pas dire que je "
"bois le... euh... en fait... EXACTEMENT... écoute..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:487
msgid "Let the little shit go back to playing."
msgstr "[Tu laisses ce morveux retourner jouer]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:495
msgid "Is that a REAL robot?"
msgstr "C'est un VRAI robot ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:499
msgid "The Robobrain? Why, yes it is."
msgstr "Le robocerveau ? Oui, c'en est un !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:500
msgid "It THINKS it is. Don't even get me started."
msgstr "Il PENSE que c'en est un. Ne lui en parle pas..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:501
msgid "Yeah, but don't bother it. I think it wants to destroy the human race."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, mais ne l'ennuie pas.. Apparemment, il pense à détruire l'humanité."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:502
msgid ""
"Yes, it is. Say, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you know "
"what happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"Oui, c'en est un. Dis, j'ai appris la nouvelle pour Richard. Tu saurais pas "
"ce qu'il lui est arrivé ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:515
msgid "Are YOU a robot, too?"
msgstr "T'es un robot, aussi ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:525
msgid "Is that a REAL mutant?"
msgstr "C'est un VRAI mutant ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:526
msgid "Mootant?"
msgstr "Mutant ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:529
msgid "Why, yes it is. His name is Marcus. Don't worry, he doesn't bite."
msgstr "Pourquoi ? Oui, c'est un mutant. T'inquiète pas, il ne mord pas..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:530
msgid ""
"Why, yes it IS a mutant. Gosh, I sure hope he isn't hungry for little "
"children."
msgstr ""
"Oui, c'en est un. T'as de la chance, il n'aime pas manger les petits enfants."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:531
msgid ""
"Why, yes. A very HUNGRY mutant. And it's right about snack time, too. How "
"convenient."
msgstr "Oui, c'est un mutant AFFAME. Et justement, c'est l'heure du goûter !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:532
msgid ""
"Yes, he is. Say, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you know "
"what happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"Oui, c'en est un. Dis, j'ai appris la nouvelle pour Richard. Tu saurais pas "
"ce qu'il lui est arrivé ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:540
msgid "The kid stops and looks at you."
msgstr "L'enfant s'arrête et te regarde."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:541
msgid "Helloooo"
msgstr "Saaaluuuut."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:544
msgid "Hello, little man."
msgstr "Salut, p'tit gars."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:545
msgid "Hello there, little girl."
msgstr "Salut, p'tite."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:546
msgid ""
"I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you know what happened to "
"him?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis désolé pour ce qui est arrivé à Richard. Tu saurais ce qu'il lui est "
"arrivé ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:555
msgid "Are you sick?"
msgstr "T'es malade ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:556
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tu me demandes ça ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:560
msgid "You LOOK sick."
msgstr "Tu AS L'AIR malade."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:561
msgid "I am sick."
msgstr "Je suis malade."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:565
msgid "Do you take medicine?"
msgstr "Tu prends des médicaments ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:566
msgid "There is no medicine for what I have."
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de médicaments pour ce que j'ai..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:570
msgid "Wanna sing?"
msgstr "Tu veux chanter ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:571
msgid "Sing?"
msgstr "Chanter ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:575
msgid "Do you know 'He's Got the Whole World in His Hands?'"
msgstr "Tu connais : 'Il tenait le monde entier entre ses doigts' ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:580
msgid ""
"::Sings:: 'He's got the whole world in his hands. He's got the whole wide "
"world in his hands.' Come on."
msgstr ""
"[Chante.] 'Il tenait le monde entier entre ses doigts. Il tenait le monde "
"entier entre ses doigts.' Vas-y."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:581
msgid ""
"::Sing:: He's got the whole world in his hands. He's got the whole wide "
"world in his hands."
msgstr ""
"[Chante.] Il tenait le monde entier entre ses doigts. Il tenait le monde "
"entier entre ses doigts."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:585
msgid ""
"::Singing Together:: He's got the whole world in his hands. ::Singing winds "
"down:: He's got the whole world in his hands."
msgstr ""
"[Chantent ensemble.] Il tenait le monde entier entre ses doigts. [Le chant "
"baisse.] Il tenait le monde entier entre ses doigts."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:586
msgid ""
"Thank you for singing with me. I might be back later... if I need a hat."
msgstr ""
"Merci d'avoir chanté avec moi. Je reviendrai... Si j'ai besoin d'une "
"casquette."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:590
msgid "(The kid blinks at you.)"
msgstr "[L'enfant ne t'écoute pas]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:591
msgid "All right, then. Talk to you later."
msgstr "Tout va bien, alors... A plus..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:595
msgid "(The child runs off.)"
msgstr "[L'enfant s'en va.]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:650
msgid "Really? What else?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Quoi d'autre ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:665
msgid "Is that a REAL ghoul?"
msgstr "C'est une VRAIE Goule ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:666
msgid "Gool?"
msgstr "Goule ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:669
msgid "Why, yes it is. His name is Lenny. Don't worry, he doesn't bite."
msgstr "Ouais, c'en est une. T'inquiète pas, elle ne mord pas..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:670
msgid ""
"Why, yes it IS a ghoul. Gosh, I sure hope he isn't hungry for little "
"children."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, c'en est une. T'as de la chance, elle ne mange pas les p'tits enfants."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:671
msgid ""
"Why, yes. A very HUNGRY ghoul. And it's right about snack time, too. How "
"convenient."
msgstr "Oui, une Goule AFFAMEE. Et justement, c'est l'heure du goûter !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:685
msgid ""
"Hello, Mar-cus mutant. Yer awful big. Hee-hee... and yer fidget animation is "
"funny."
msgstr ""
"Salut, Marcus le mutant. T'es affreusement gros. Et ton animation "
"d'immobilité est pitoyable !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:686
msgid "Hello, Len-ee ghoul. Phew... yer reeally smelly."
msgstr "Salut, Lenny la Goule. Ouah, tu sens fort !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:687
msgid "It sure is, isn't it? So... what's up, kid?"
msgstr "Ouais..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:688
msgid "He sure is, isn't he? So... what's up kid?"
msgstr "Ouais..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:689
msgid "Well, gotta go. See you later."
msgstr "Bon, j'dois y aller... A plus."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:695
msgid "(The kid turns pale, then runs away, screaming.)"
msgstr "[L'enfant commence à avoir peur, puis il s'enfuit en criant.]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:696
msgid ""
"Heh heh heh heh. \"Izzat a REAL mutant?\" Teach her not to ask questions."
msgstr ""
"Hé hé hé hé ! \"C'est un VRAI mutant\" ? J'leur apprendrai à poser les "
"BONNES questions."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:697
msgid ""
"\"Hungry\" mutant! Sheesh. Everyone knows that mutants don't eat hum - uh, "
"why're you looking at me like that, Marcus?"
msgstr ""
"Un mutant AFFAME ! Ha ha ! Tout le monde le sait que les mutants ne mangent "
"pas les gens. Euh, pourquoi tu me regardes comme ça Marcus ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:698
msgid ""
"Heh heh heh heh. \"Izzat a REAL ghoul?\" Teach her not to ask questions."
msgstr ""
"Hé hé hé hé ! \"C'est une VRAIE Goule\" ? J'leur apprendrai à poser les "
"BONNES questions."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:699
msgid ""
"\"Hungry\" ghoul! Sheesh. Everyone knows that ghouls don't eat hum - uh, "
"why're you looking at me like that, Lenny?"
msgstr ""
"Une Goule AFFAMEE ! Ha ha ! Tout le monde le sait que les Goules ne mangent "
"pas les gens. Euh, pourquoi tu me regardes comme ça Lenny ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:710
msgid ""
"Uh-uh. Daddy's real mad about it cuz he doesn't know who killed Richie. He "
"says if he ever catches us\n"
" doing Jet, he'll give us a whippin'."
msgstr ""
"Euh, non. Papa a dit que s'il nous voyait avec du Jet, il nous fouetterait "
"pour qu'on ne recommence plus."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:711
msgid "Do you know WHO might have given Richie the Jet that killed him?"
msgstr "tu sais QUI pourrait lui avoir donné le Jet qui l'a tué ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:712
msgid "Do you know WHERE Richie got that Jet that killed him?"
msgstr "Tu sais Où il a pu récupérer le Jet qui l'a tué ?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:713
msgid "Let the child go back to playing."
msgstr "[Tu laisses l'enfant retourner jouer]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:720
msgid "Uh-uh."
msgstr "Non."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:730
msgid ""
"Uh-uh. He was hangin' out a lot on th' West side of town, around Commercial "
"Row, and Dad told us not ta go over there."
msgstr ""
"Il se baladait souvent de l'autre côté de la ville, chez les commerçants. "
"Papa nous a interdit d'y aller, d'ailleurs..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:800
msgid "*Shhh* I'm supposed to be sleeping."
msgstr "<Shhh !!> Je suis supposé être en train de dormir."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:801
msgid ""
"I need to get some sleep. I've got a big game of metal insect warrior "
"tomorrow."
msgstr "Je dois dormir. J'ai joue au jeu du guerrier insecte de métal, demain."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:802
msgid "If daddy finds out I'm not asleep, he'll be really, really mad."
msgstr ""
"Si papa découvre que je ne dors pas, il sera vraiment, vraiment furieux."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:900
msgid "My ding-a-ling, my ding-a-ling."
msgstr "Mon ding-a-ling, mon ding-a-ling."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:901
msgid "::Holds up fake gun:: Reach for the skies, varmit!"
msgstr "::Tenant un faux pistolet:: Tu vas rejoindre le ciel, vermine !"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:902
msgid "One good turn deserves another, between your legs hangs your mother."
