#: dialog/wsterm1a.msg:133
msgid ""
"[Pressing <Ctrl><Alt><C> causes the program to crash. You hope the rest of "
"the security measures are this easy to defeat.]"
msgstr ""
"[La combinaison <Ctrl><Alt><C> plante le programme. Tu espères pouvoir "
