#: dialog/wsterm1a.msg:137
msgid "It's no use. The program is just too complicated for you to understand."
msgstr "Ton incompétence a déclenché le système d'alarme."

#: dialog/wsterm1a.msg:138
msgid "Your ineptness has caused you to set off the alarm system."
msgstr "Laisse tomber, ce programme est trop compliqué pour toi."

#: dialog/wsterm1a.msg:200
