#: dialog/wsterm1a.msg:300 dialog/wsterm3a.msg:300 dialog/wsterm3b.msg:300
#: dialog/wsterm3c.msg:300 dialog/wsterm4a.msg:300
msgid "The computer seems to have some sort of defense mechanism."
msgstr "L'ordinateur semble disposer d'un mécanisme de sécurité."

