msgstr "[Cerveau cybernétique]"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:200
msgid ""
"[Although readings indicate this brain is alive, neural output levels are "
"way below normal.]\n"
"                           Retrieve?"
msgstr ""
"[Bien que les mesures indiquent que ce cerveau est vivant, les niveaux de "
"sortie neuronaux sont bien en dessous de la normale.]"
"                           Extraire ?"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:204
msgid ""
"[The brain waves are active, but differ from those of a human brain.]\n"
"                                                          Retrieve?"
msgstr ""
"[Les ondes du cerveau sont actives mais diffèrent de celles d'un cerveau "
"humain.]                                                          Extraire ?"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:208
msgid ""
"[Brain activity is that of an average human.]\n"
"                   Retrieve?"
msgstr ""
"[L'activité du cerveau correspond à celle d'un humain normal.]"
"                   Extraire ?"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:212
msgid ""
"[Brain activity is off the charts! By the looks of it the signals are of "
"both digital and human origin.]\n"
"           Retrieve?"
msgstr ""
"[L'activité du cerveau dépasse tous les paramètres connus ! On dirait des "
"signaux mixtes, humains et numériques.]           Extraire ?"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:216
msgid ""
"[The robot quickly leaves to retrieve your brain. Upon returning you notice "
"that the robot appears to be having problems. The observation is driven home "
"when the robot explodes suddenly. Luckily for you, it managed to deliver the "
"brain before it expired.]"
msgstr ""
"[Le robot part rapidement te chercher un cerveau. Au retour, le robot semble "
"avoir des problèmes. Tu t'en rends compte brutalement lorsque le robot "
"explose. Heureusement pour toi, le cerveau a été livré intact avant "
"l'explosion.]"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:218
msgid ""
"Cadaver Retrieval Menu\n"
"                                          Private Dobbs"
msgstr ""
"Menu Extraire cadavre                                          Soldat Dobbs"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:220
msgid "Retrieve Private Dobbs"
msgstr "[Extraire le Soldat Dobbs]"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:223
msgid ""
"[According to the readings, Private Dobbs is alive! He's located in the "
"Experimental Biomed Gel regeneration tank.]\n"
"   Retrieve?"
msgstr ""
"[D'après les paramètres affichés, le soldat Dobbs est vivant ! Il est "
"entreposé dans le réservoir de régénération de gel Biomed expérimental.]   "
"Extraire ?"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:227
msgid ""
"[The body of Private Dobbs is now lying at your feet, but to your surprise, "
"he stands up and starts talking to you. Funny, he doesn't look dead.]"
msgstr ""
"[Le corps du soldat Dobbs repose à tes pieds. Soudain il se relève et se met "
"à marcher vers toi. Bizarre, il n'a pas l'air mort.]"

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:229
msgid "There are no cadavers currently in storage."
msgstr "Aucun cadavre actuellement en stock."

#: dialog/wsterm4c.msg:232
msgid ""
"[Even though you can plainly see empty storage units, the readout says they "
"are all full. Must be an error in the program. Oh well.]"
msgstr ""
"[Même si tu vois clairement des unités de stockage vides, l'écran indique "
"qu'elles sont pleines. Il doit s'agir d'une erreur de programme. Oh, bof !]"

