msgid "My guts are on fire!"
msgstr "J'ai les tripes en feu !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1533 game/combatai.msg:1533
msgid "My life-spirits flee from me."
msgstr "Mon esprit vital m'abandonne."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1534 game/combatai.msg:1534
msgid "I've been torn open!"
msgstr "Je me suis fait déchiqueter !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1535 game/combatai.msg:1535
msgid "May I live long enough to finish you."
msgstr "J'espère que je vivrai assez longtemps pour te faire la peau."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1536 game/combatai.msg:1536
msgid "Ancestors, I am coming."
msgstr "Ancêtres, me voilà !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1537 game/combatai.msg:1537
msgid "I will never see the village again."
msgstr "Je ne reverrai plus jamais le village."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1538 game/combatai.msg:1538
msgid "At least I will die with honor."
msgstr "Au moins, je mourrai avec honneur."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1539 game/combatai.msg:1539
msgid "My brothers shall avenge me."
msgstr "Mes frères me vengeront."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1540 game/combatai.msg:1540
msgid "I have no breath left in me."
msgstr "Je suis à bout de souffle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1541 game/combatai.msg:1541
msgid "You have taken my soul."
msgstr "Tu as volé mon âme."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1542 game/combatai.msg:1542
msgid "You would mutilate me?"
msgstr "Tu serais capable de me mutiler ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1543 game/combatai.msg:1543
msgid "I'm gutted like a brahmin."
msgstr "Je me suis fait étriper comme une Brahmine."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1544 game/combatai.msg:1544
msgid "I don't feel good."
msgstr "Je m'sens pas bien."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1545 game/combatai.msg:1545
msgid "I can't feel my legs."
msgstr "Je sens plus mes jambes."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1546 game/combatai.msg:1546
msgid "Suddenly, I feel warm and sleepy."
msgstr "J'ai froid tout à coup et j'ai envie de dormir."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1547 game/combatai.msg:1547
msgid "Errrggggg!"
msgstr "Errrhhhh !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1548 game/combatai.msg:1548
msgid "Gack! cough, cough."
msgstr "Ack !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1549 game/combatai.msg:1549
msgid "Must continue, must slay enemy...."
msgstr "Devoir continuer... anéantir l'ennemi..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1550 game/combatai.msg:1550
msgid "The darkness beckons to me."
msgstr "Les ténèbres m'appellent."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1551 game/combatai.msg:1551
msgid "The hour of my death approaches."
msgstr "L'heure de ma mort approche."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1552 game/combatai.msg:1552
msgid "The Shaman was right, I do not return."
msgstr "Le Chaman avait raison, je ne peux pas revenir."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1553 game/combatai.msg:1553
msgid "The outworlder has slain me."
msgstr "L'étranger a réussi à m'anéantir."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1554 game/combatai.msg:1554
msgid "I am killed."
msgstr "Je suis mort."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1555 game/combatai.msg:1555
msgid "My guts are loosened from my spine!"
msgstr "On m'a sorti les tripes du ventre !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1556 game/combatai.msg:1556
msgid "Do not let me shame myself in death."
msgstr "Accorde-moi une mort honorable."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1557 game/combatai.msg:1557
msgid "Damn these pesky intestines."
msgstr "Au diable ces foutus intestins !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1558 game/combatai.msg:1558
msgid "Hey, look here, I can see my lunch."
msgstr "Hé, regarde, je vois mon repas de midi."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1559 game/combatai.msg:1559
msgid "Where has all the air gone?"
msgstr "Où est passé tout l'air ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1560 game/cmbatai2.msg:1570 game/combatai.msg:1560
#: game/combatai.msg:1570
msgid "I will crawl to kill you."
msgstr "Je vais te tuer, même si je dois ramper."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1561 game/cmbatai2.msg:1571 game/combatai.msg:1561
#: game/combatai.msg:1571
msgid "Must keep standing, must...."
msgstr "Dois rester debout, dois..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1562 game/cmbatai2.msg:1572 game/combatai.msg:1562
#: game/combatai.msg:1572
msgid "Do not make me run to catch you!"
msgstr "Ne m'oblige pas à te courir après pour t'attraper !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1563 game/cmbatai2.msg:1573
msgid "You would cripple me, Coward!"
msgstr "Tu voudrais m'estropier, espèce de lâche !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1564 game/cmbatai2.msg:1574 game/combatai.msg:1564
#: game/combatai.msg:1574
msgid "Awwwwgg!"
msgstr "Aoooohhhh !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1565 game/cmbatai2.msg:1575 game/combatai.msg:1565
#: game/combatai.msg:1575
msgid "Bone? So white...."
msgstr "Un os ? Aussi blanc... "

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1566 game/combatai.msg:1566
msgid "Why can't I walk?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est-ce que je ne peux plus marcher ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1567 game/combatai.msg:1567
msgid "Arrrrrrgh."
msgstr "Arrrrrrhhh."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1568 game/combatai.msg:1568
msgid "Unnhhh."
msgstr "Hhhan."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1569 game/combatai.msg:1569
msgid "Leg feels like fire."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression d'avoir les jambes en feu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1576 game/combatai.msg:1576
msgid "Can't walk. Oh the pain...."
msgstr "Peux pas marcher. Ahh, quelle douleur... "

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1577 game/combatai.msg:1577
msgid "I will burn off your foot for that."
msgstr "Je vais te brûler le pied pour ce coup-là !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1578 game/combatai.msg:1578
msgid "Ooooo-ouuuuch!"
msgstr "Ooooo-ouuuille !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1579 game/combatai.msg:1579
msgid "Leg burns like fire."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression que mes jambes sont en feu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1580 game/combatai.msg:1580
msgid "The darkness is here."
msgstr "Les ténèbres m'entourent."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1581 game/combatai.msg:1581
msgid "Where are you?"
msgstr "Où es-tu ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1582 game/combatai.msg:1582
msgid "Help, help me."
msgstr "A l'aide ! Aidez-moi !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1583 game/combatai.msg:1383 game/combatai.msg:1583
msgid "I can still hear you."
msgstr "Je t'entends toujours."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1584
msgid "Seeking to blind me? You Coward!"
msgstr "T'essaies de m'aveugler ? Espèce de lâche !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1585 game/combatai.msg:1585
msgid "My sight has been stolen."
msgstr "On a volé mes yeux !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1586 game/combatai.msg:1586
msgid "You can take my eyes but not my courage!"
msgstr "Tu peux toujours prendre mes yeux. Je ne perdrai jamais courage !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1587 game/combatai.msg:1587
msgid "Come here so I can kill you!"
msgstr "Approche un peu que je te tue !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1588 game/combatai.msg:1588
msgid "The darkness, the darkness, Aaaiiiieee!"
msgstr "Les ténèbres, les ténèbres, Aaaïïïïee !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1589 game/combatai.msg:1589
msgid "Where's my eye, where is it!?!"
msgstr "Où il est mon oeil......où est-ce qu'il est !?!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1590 game/combatai.msg:1590
msgid "I have too many young already."
msgstr "J'ai déjà bien trop de petits."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1591 game/combatai.msg:1591
msgid "You fight without honor."
msgstr "Tu te bats sans honneur."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1592 game/combatai.msg:1592
msgid "I'm married, didn't use it anyway."
msgstr "De toute façon, je m'en servais plus depuis mon mariage."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1593 game/combatai.msg:1593
msgid "Holy spirits, the world just exploded."
msgstr "Esprits sacrés, le monde vient d'exploser."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1594 game/combatai.msg:1594
msgid "Gasp... can't breath...."
msgstr "Arrf... peux plus respirer..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1595 game/combatai.msg:1595
msgid "In high, squeaky, voice--Ouch!"
msgstr "D'une voix pointue et grinçante--Ouille !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1596 game/combatai.msg:1596
msgid "Unnhhh. I need to sit down for a bit."
msgstr "Hhhan. Il faut que je m'assoie un peu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1597 game/combatai.msg:1597
msgid "You bastard--I kill you slow for that."
msgstr "Tu vas me le payer, ordure ! Je vais te tuer à petit feu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1598 game/combatai.msg:1598
msgid "You know nothing of honor."
msgstr "Tu ne sais pas ce que c'est que l'honneur."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1599 game/combatai.msg:1599
msgid "I butcher you like animal for that."
msgstr "A l'abattoir !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1600
msgid "Oh, my pretty face"
msgstr "Oh, mon joli minois !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1601 game/combatai.msg:1601 game/combatai.msg:41200
msgid "My brains hurt."
msgstr "J'ai mal au crâne."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1602 game/combatai.msg:1602
msgid "Now I look like Van Gogh."
msgstr "Je ressemble à Van Gogh maintenant."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1603 game/combatai.msg:1603
msgid "Damn, there goes my nose."
msgstr "Hé, mon nez."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1604 game/combatai.msg:1604
msgid "Hey, that's my last tooth."
msgstr "Hé, c'était ma dernière dent !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1605 game/combatai.msg:1005 game/combatai.msg:1605
msgid "I've been scalped!"
msgstr "J'ai perdu mon scalp !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1606 game/combatai.msg:1606
msgid "I'd rather have a bottle in front-of-me..."
msgstr "Je préfèrerais avoir une bouteille en face de moi..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1607 game/combatai.msg:1607
msgid "Let me give you a piece of my mind."
msgstr "Laisse-moi te donner un morceau de cervelle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1608 game/combatai.msg:1608
msgid "That's me one good eye, Arrr."
msgstr "C'est mon seul oeil qu'est encore bon, Haarrr."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1609 game/combatai.msg:1609
msgid "Brings a tear to me one good eye."
msgstr "Ca me fait monter les larmes au seul oeil que j'ai encore."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1610 game/cmbatai2.msg:1626 game/combatai.msg:1610
#: game/combatai.msg:1626
msgid "You've disarmed me!"
msgstr "J'ai plus d'arme !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1611 game/combatai.msg:1611
msgid "Ooohh, da pain, da pain."
msgstr "Ooohh, ouille ouille ouille."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1612 game/combatai.msg:1612
msgid "I've still got a couple fingers left."
msgstr "Il me reste encore quelques doigts."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1613 game/cmbatai2.msg:1627 game/combatai.msg:1613
#: game/combatai.msg:1627
msgid "I only need one finger for *you* bub."
msgstr "Il me suffit d'un doigt pour *te* faire ta fête."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1614 game/combatai.msg:1614
msgid "I guess I'll give you a hand then."
msgstr "Bon, je vais t'aider alors."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1615 game/combatai.msg:1615
msgid "That's worse than a hangnail."
msgstr "C'est pire qu'un ongle incarné."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1616 game/combatai.msg:1616
msgid "That's just gonna kill my backswing."
msgstr "Ca va foutre en l'air mon swing !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1617 game/combatai.msg:1617
msgid "I'll stab you with my stump!"
msgstr "J'vais te donner des coups de moignon !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1618 game/combatai.msg:1618
msgid "Hey, where'd my fingers go?"
msgstr "Hé, ils sont où mes doigts ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1619 game/combatai.msg:1619
msgid "This'll be great for that Capt. Hook look."
msgstr "Cool le look à la capitaine Crochet !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1620 game/combatai.msg:1620
msgid "I shoulda used right-guard."
msgstr "J'aurais dû m'y prendre par la droite."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1622 game/cmbatai2.msg:36022 game/cmbatai2.msg:36033
#: game/combatai.msg:1622 game/combatai.msg:36022 game/combatai.msg:36033
msgid "You're gonna regret that!"
msgstr "Tu vas le regretter !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1623 game/combatai.msg:1623
msgid "I'm being moyderd heya."
msgstr "On est en train de me faire subir des sévices."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1624 game/combatai.msg:1624
msgid "There goes Wimbledon."
msgstr "Wimbledon, c'est plus la peine d'y compter."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1625 game/combatai.msg:1625
msgid "Sieg... oh, never mind."
msgstr "Sieg... oh, ça fait rien."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1628 game/combatai.msg:1628
msgid "I'll kick you to death then."
msgstr "J'vais te rouer de coups jusqu'à la mort !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1629 game/combatai.msg:1629
msgid "There goes my silver-sequined glove!"
msgstr "Mon gant à paillettes argentées !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1630 game/combatai.msg:1630
msgid "That's *my* liver, give it back!"
msgstr "C'est *mon* foie, rends-le moi !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1631 game/combatai.msg:1631
msgid "Just a little more to the right, ahhh, that's better."
msgstr "Juste un tout p'tit plus peu sur la droite, ahhh, c'est mieux."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1632 game/combatai.msg:1632
msgid "Gerrk!"
msgstr "Gerrk !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1633 game/combatai.msg:1633
msgid "What's that musty smell? Oh, it's my innards."
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce que c'est que cette odeur de renfermé ? Oh, mais c'est mes "
"entrailles."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1634 game/combatai.msg:1634
msgid "Now that you've eviscerated me, I'm sooo svelte! Thanks!"
msgstr "Ah je suis si svelte maintenant sans mes viscères ! Merci !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1635 game/combatai.msg:1635
msgid "./~ I left my heart.../~"
msgstr "/~ J'ai laissé mon coeur.../~"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1636 game/combatai.msg:1636
msgid "That tickled my ribs."
msgstr "Ca m'a chatouillé les côtes."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1637 game/combatai.msg:1637
msgid "Who needs an appendix anyway."
msgstr "L'appendice, on s'en passe très bien de toute façon."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1638 game/combatai.msg:1638
msgid "Just a little off the edges there, doc."
msgstr "Juste dans ce coin là, doc."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1639 game/combatai.msg:1639
msgid "Arrggghh, my spine!"
msgstr "Ahhh, ma colonne vertébrale !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1640 game/combatai.msg:1133 game/combatai.msg:1640
msgid "My legs, I can't feel my legs."
msgstr "J'sens plus mes jambes !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1641 game/combatai.msg:1641
msgid "It's a gut-wound Sarge."
msgstr "C'est un coup aux boyaux Sergent."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1642 game/combatai.msg:1642
msgid "Lungs are for sissies."
msgstr "Les poumons c'est pour les mauviettes."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1643 game/combatai.msg:1643
msgid "Hey, I've got ribs!"
msgstr "Hé, j'ai des côtes !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1661 game/cmbatai2.msg:36061 game/combatai.msg:1661
#: game/combatai.msg:36061
msgid "You're gonna pay for that!"
msgstr "Tu vas m'le payer !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1662 game/combatai.msg:1662
msgid "Argh! You break my leg, I break your neck!"
msgstr "Aarrh ! Tu me casses une jambe, j'te tords le cou !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1663 game/combatai.msg:1663
msgid "Damn, there goes my Tango."
msgstr "Mince, je peux dire adieu au Tango."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1664 game/combatai.msg:1664
msgid "Damn, there go my toes."
msgstr "Hé, je peux dire adieu à mes doigts de pied !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1665 game/combatai.msg:1665
msgid "I guess I need a leg up."
msgstr "Je crois que j'ai besoin d'aide !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1666 game/combatai.msg:1666
msgid "You scuffed my blue suede shoes!"
msgstr "T'as égratigné le vernis d'mes belles chaussures !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1667 game/combatai.msg:1667
msgid "You whacked my wingtips!"
msgstr "T'as brutalisé mes ailes !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1668 game/combatai.msg:1668
msgid "And I just shaved them too."
msgstr "Et je viens de m'épiler !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1669 game/combatai.msg:1669
msgid "I'll bite your kneecaps off!"
msgstr "Je vais t'arracher les rotules !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1671 game/combatai.msg:1671
msgid "You gored my Gucci's!"
msgstr "T'as bousillé mon Gucci !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1672 game/combatai.msg:1672
msgid "Ouch! Hey! That's below the belt!"
msgstr "Ouille ! Hé ! C'est en dessous d'la ceinture !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1673 game/combatai.msg:1673
msgid "You can raise welts like nobody else."
msgstr "Tu fais des balafres comme personne."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1674 game/combatai.msg:1674
msgid "Spank me Mommy, I've been naughty."
msgstr "Donne-moi la fessée, j'ai pas été sage."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1675 game/combatai.msg:1675
msgid "That'll scab-up nicely."
msgstr "Ca va faire une belle croûte."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1676 game/combatai.msg:1676
msgid "Is all that blood mine?"
msgstr "C'est à moi tout ce sang ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1677 game/combatai.msg:1677
msgid "Marshall Dillon, Marshall Dillon!"
msgstr "Inspecteur Derrick, Inspecteur Derrick !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1678 game/combatai.msg:1678
msgid "That's going to blister."
msgstr "Ca va faire des cloques."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1679 game/combatai.msg:1679
msgid "Kai, yai, yippee, ai, ay!"
msgstr "Yippie-Kaï... Aïe !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1680 game/cmbatai2.msg:36080 game/combatai.msg:1680
#: game/combatai.msg:36080
msgid "Damn blood in my eyes!"
msgstr "Foutu sang dans les yeux !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1683 game/combatai.msg:1107 game/combatai.msg:1184
#: game/combatai.msg:1683 game/combatai.msg:41283
msgid "Who turned out the lights?"
msgstr "Qui c'est qu'a éteint la lumière ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1684 game/combatai.msg:1684
msgid "Hah, that was my glass eye!"
msgstr "Hé, mon oeil de verre !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1685 game/combatai.msg:1685
msgid "Squishes like a ripe grape, don't it?"
msgstr "Ca s'écrase comme du raisin trop mûr, hein ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1686 game/combatai.msg:1686
msgid "I've got my eye on you, uh, could you hand it back please?"
msgstr "J'ai l'oeil sur toi... euh... tu pourrais m'le rendre s'te plaît ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1687 game/combatai.msg:1687
msgid "I can still track you by sound alone!"
msgstr "Je te repère au son tu sais !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1688
msgid "Aiyeee! Aiyeee! my eye!"
msgstr "Aïïïe ! Mon oeil !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1689 game/combatai.msg:1689
msgid "You're blinding me 'cause you're afraid, ain't ya."
msgstr "Tu m'aveugles parce que t'as la trouille, hein ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1690 game/combatai.msg:1690
msgid "Aren't you chivalrous."
msgstr "Quelle chevalerie !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1691 game/combatai.msg:1691
msgid "Yooooouuuuch!"
msgstr "Ouuuille !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1692 game/combatai.msg:1692
msgid "Unnhhhhh!"
msgstr "Hhhan !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1693 game/combatai.msg:1693
msgid "Maybe if I just don't move for a while...."
msgstr "Peut-être que si j'arrête de bouger pendant quelque temps..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1694 game/combatai.msg:1694
msgid "That's my beef bologna!"
msgstr "Eh, mes spaghetti bolognaise !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1695 game/combatai.msg:1695
msgid "There goes my social life."
msgstr "Je peux dire adieu à ma vie sociale..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1696 game/combatai.msg:1696
msgid "I think I need to sit down for a bit."
msgstr "Il faut que j'm'assoie un instant."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1697 game/combatai.msg:1697
msgid "Gee, if there were any female ghouls I'd be angry with you."
msgstr "Eh ben, si y'avait des femmes Goules, tu m'le paierais très cher !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1698 game/combatai.msg:1698
msgid "Oohh, that hurt."
msgstr "Oohh que ça fait mal."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1699 game/combatai.msg:1699
msgid "Did that...? Oh, yeah, that hurts."
msgstr "Est-ce que... ? Oh, oui, ça fait mal."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1700 game/combatai.msg:1700
msgid "Hey look! Prairie oysters."
msgstr "Hé regarde ! Des rognons !"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1701 game/combatai.msg:1701 game/combatai.msg:41292
msgid "Chopped nuts anyone?"
msgstr "Des rognons hachés, ça tente quelqu'un ?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1702 game/combatai.msg:1702 game/combatai.msg:41291
msgid "No more writing my name in the snow."
msgstr "Fini mon nom écrit dans la neige."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1703 game/combatai.msg:1703
msgid "Not the fricken head you..."
msgstr "Pas dans la tête espèce de sale..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1704 game/cmbatai2.msg:12301 game/combatai.msg:1704
msgid "My... head... getting... dizzy"
msgstr "Ma... tête... ça... tourne..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1705 game/cmbatai2.msg:12302 game/combatai.msg:1705
#: game/combatai.msg:12302
msgid "Ugnnn!"
msgstr "Ugnnn !"

