#: game/editor.msg:145
msgid ""
"Tag skills are skills your character specializes in.  Each tag skill gains +"
"20%, and increases twice as fast.  You must pick three tag skills."
msgstr ""
"Les atouts personnels correspondent aux spécialités de ton personnage. "
"Chaque atout personnel donne +20% et augmente deux fois plus vite. Tu dois "
"choisir trois atouts."

#: game/editor.msg:146
msgid "Optional Traits"
msgstr "Qualités facultatives (traits)"

#: game/editor.msg:147
msgid ""
"Optional traits describe your character in more detail.  All traits will "
"have positive and negative effects.  You may choose up to two traits during "
"creation."
msgstr ""
"Les qualités facultatives (traits) décrivent ton personnage plus en détail. "
"Toutes les qualités ont des effets positifs et négatifs. Pour créer ton "
"personnage, tu peux choisir au maximum deux qualités."

#: game/editor.msg:149
msgid "two traits!"
msgstr "qualités maximales !"

#: game/editor.msg:150
msgid "Skills"
msgstr "Compétences"

#: game/editor.msg:151
msgid ""
"Skills are learned knowledge.  Skills increase by experience, or during the "
"course of the game by special events.  The higher the skill level, the "
"better you are at that skill."
msgstr ""
"Correspondent aux connaissances acquises. Augmentent selon l'expérience ou "
"les événements. Tes performances sont meilleures quand le niveau de la "
"compétence est élevé."

