#: game/editor.msg:1100
msgid ""
"This is a ranged stat that represents your general reputation. The higher "
"the number, the better known and respected you are. If your rep is negative, "
"you are hated by some for your evil actions."
msgstr ""
"Statistique reflétant ta réputation générale. Plus cette valeur est élevée, "
"plus on te respecte. Si ta réputation est négative, cela signifie que "
"certains te détestent pour tes actions malveillantes."

#: game/editor.msg:1101
msgid ""
"You have killed a large number of people. This is generally not a good thing "
"to get known for. People from the wrong side of the track will like you a "
"little more, however."
msgstr ""
"Tu as tué beaucoup de gens. Il est préférable de ne pas t'en vanter. "
"Pourtant cela peut aussi t'attirer les faveurs de certaines personnes "
"malveillantes."

#: game/editor.msg:1102
msgid ""
"Your actions have revealed you to be a champion of the people. Your war "
"against evil and villainy is widely known. Honorable people will respect you "
"better."
msgstr ""
"Tes actions ont fait de toi un champion. Ta lutte contre le mal et l'infamie "
"est largement reconnue. Cela peut t'attirer les faveurs de personnes "
"honorables."

#: game/editor.msg:1103
msgid ""
"You have killed children, the youth of the wasteland. This is considered to "
"be a really bad thing. You evil, evil person."
msgstr ""
"Tu as tué des jeunes gens, des jeunes du désert, ce qui est très mal vu. Tu "
"es un être diabolique."

#: game/editor.msg:1104
msgid "You thoroughly enjoy Nuka-Cola, the pop of the post-nuclear world."
msgstr "Tu raffoles de Nuka-Cola, le soda du monde post-nucléaire."

#: game/editor.msg:1105
msgid ""
"You are addicted to the chem Buffout. You must take this chem on an ongoing "
"basis or suffer the effects of withdrawal."
msgstr "Tu dois prendre du Buffout régulièrement pour te sentir bien."

#: game/editor.msg:1106
msgid ""
"You are suffering from Mentat addiction. You must take this particular chem "
"or suffer withdrawal."
msgstr "Tu dois prendre des Mentats régulièrement pour te sentir bien."

#: game/editor.msg:1107
msgid ""
"You have a chem addiction. If you do not take Psycho on a regular schedule, "
"you will suffer. If you do, others will suffer."
msgstr ""
"Si tu n'absorbes pas régulièrement du Psycho, tu souffres. Et si tu "
"souffres, tu fais souffrir les autres."

#: game/editor.msg:1108
msgid ""
"Your body has become addicted to RadAway. While not life threatening, you "
"must take it regularly."
msgstr ""
"Ton corps est devenu dépendant de l'Anti-Rad. Bien que ta vie ne soit pas en "
"danger, tu dois en prendre régulièrement."

#: game/editor.msg:1109
msgid ""
"You have a problem with alcohol. Actually, you have many problems with your "
"drinking habits."
msgstr ""
"Tu as un problème avec la bouteille. Et ton alcoolisme entraîne beaucoup "
"d'autres problèmes."

#: game/editor.msg:1110
msgid "You have a chem addiction. You must take Jet on a regular basis."
msgstr "Tu es accro stimulants. Tu dois prendre du Jet régulièrement."

#: game/editor.msg:1111
msgid ""
"Tragically, you are addicted to the Garnering. You are constantly in search "
"of new expansions."
msgstr ""
"C'est tragique, tu es accro au jeu de cartes Tragic. Tu es constamment à la "
"recherche de nouvelles cartes."

#: game/editor.msg:1112
msgid "TEMPORARY - What is this?"
msgstr "TEMPORAIRE - Qu'est-ce que c'est que ça ?"

#: game/editor.msg:1113
msgid ""
"You know sex. You know foreplay. You know how to please a member of the "
"opposite sex and leave them hungry for more."
msgstr ""
"Le sexe, les préliminaires, ça te connaît. Tu sais donner du plaisir à une "
"personne du sexe opposé de sorte qu'elle en redemande."

#: game/editor.msg:1114
msgid ""
"You are the heavyweight champion of Northern California. You have gained "
"fame, respect, the love of thousands... and a bonus to your toughness and "
"unarmed skill."
msgstr ""
"Tu es le champion de Californie du Nord catégorie poids lourd. Tu as droit à "
"la gloire, au respect, à l'amour des foules... Ainsi qu'un bonus à la "
"résistance et à la compétence Corps à Corps."

#: game/editor.msg:1115
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: You sleep with anything that walks on two legs. Sometimes, "
"you're not even that discriminating."
msgstr ""
"Soyons francs : tu coucherais avec tout ce qui a deux jambes. Parfois, tu ne "
"te donnes même pas la peine de vérifier."

#: game/editor.msg:1116
msgid ""
"\"They're dead, they don't care,\" has become your motto. Digging up the "
"remains of others is more than a hobby for you."
msgstr ""
"Ils sont morts, ils s'en fichent, non ? Telle est ta devise, à présent. "
"Déterrer les restes des autres est beaucoup plus qu'un passe-temps pour toi."

#: game/editor.msg:1117
msgid ""
"You are a \"Made Man\" of the Salvatore Family. You are well-known, well-"
"respected, and look great in a fedora."
msgstr ""
"Tu es un Membre de la Famille Salvatore. On te connaît, on te respecte, et "
"le chapeau mou te va à ravir."

#: game/editor.msg:1118
msgid "You got hitched. Hey, it's your problem, not ours."
msgstr "On t'a passé l'anneau au doigt. Hé c'est ton problème, pas le nôtre."

#: game/editor.msg:1119
msgid ""
"You are a big, bright, shining star. Your sexual exploits are well-known "
"throughout New Reno."
msgstr ""
"Tu es la nouvelle étoile du sexe, et tes exploits sont connus de tout New "
"Reno."

#: game/editor.msg:1120
msgid ""
"You have been marked as a member of the Slaver's Guild. The tattoo on your "
"forehead makes your profession evident to everyone you meet."
msgstr ""
"Tout le monde sait que tu es membre de la Guilde des Esclavagistes. Le "
"tatouage sur ton front proclame ton allégeance à la face du monde."

#: game/editor.msg:1121
msgid ""
"You really need to get out more. Your sexual exploits have been... well, two "
"dimensional."
msgstr ""
"Il faut que tu sortes un peu. Tes performances sexuelles sont... bon, "
"avouons-le, médiocres."

#: game/editor.msg:1122
msgid ""
"You are a \"Made Man\" of the Bishop Family. You are well-known, well-"
"respected, and look great in a fedora."
msgstr ""
"Tu es un Membre de la Famille Bishop. On te connaît, on te respecte, et le "
"chapeau mou te va à ravir."

#: game/editor.msg:1123
msgid ""
"You are a \"Made Man\" of the Mordino Family. You are well-known, well-"
"respected, and look great in a fedora."
msgstr ""
"Tu es un Membre de la Famille Mordino. On te connaît, on te respecte, et le "
"chapeau mou te va à ravir."

#: game/editor.msg:1124
msgid ""
"You are a \"Made Man\" of the Wright Family. You are well-known, well-"
"respected, and look great in a fedora."
msgstr ""
"Tu es un Membre de la Famille Wright. On te connaît, on te respecte, et le "
"chapeau mou te va à ravir."

#: game/editor.msg:1125
msgid "Your spouse is no longer with you. I hope you're happy."
msgstr "Ta moitié est partie. J'espère que tu es content(e)."

#: game/editor.msg:1126
msgid ""
"You are a smoker. They say it'll kill ya, but you're not dead yet. And "
"anyway, it's a good way to look damn cool in a post-apocalyptic world."
msgstr ""
"Tu es un fumeur. Ils disent que ça va te tuer, mais tu n'es pas encore mort. "
"De toute façon, c'est une sacrée bonne manière pour mourir dans un monde "
"post-apocalyptique."

#: game/editor.msg:2000
msgid "Idolized"
msgstr "Idolâtré"

#: game/editor.msg:2001
msgid "Liked"
msgstr "Aimé"

#: game/editor.msg:2002
msgid "Accepted"
msgstr "Accepté"

#: game/editor.msg:2003
msgid "Neutral"
msgstr "Neutre"

#: game/editor.msg:2004
msgid "Antipathy"
msgstr "Antipathie"

#: game/editor.msg:2005
msgid "Hated"
msgstr "Haï"

#: game/editor.msg:2006
msgid "Vilified"
msgstr "Diffamé"

#: game/editor.msg:2100
msgid ""
"Everyone in this area would like to be you. You're the toast-of-the-town and "
"are held up as a shining example of all that a person can be."
msgstr ""
"Tout le monde dans le coin aimerait te ressembler. La ville entière te fait "
"fête et te considère comme l'exemple à suivre."

#: game/editor.msg:2101
msgid ""
"People wave, and greet you, wherever you go in this area. Everyone has heard "
"talk of you, and they like what they've heard."
msgstr ""
"Les gens te saluent, de la voix et du geste, chaque fois qu'ils te voient en "
"ce lieu. Tout le monde a entendu parler de toi, et en bien."

#: game/editor.msg:2102
msgid ""
"Although, you're not greeted with open arms, most people in this area will "
"at least nod in acknowledgment when you meet. You fit in as well as most."
msgstr ""
"Même si on ne te reçoit pas à bras ouverts, on te gratifie d'un signe de "
"tête quand tu croises quelqu'un dans la rue. Il y a pire, comme traitement."

#: game/editor.msg:2103
msgid ""
"Though normally suspicious of strangers, the people of this area haven't "
"made up their minds about you yet."
msgstr ""
"Bien qu'ils se méfient des étrangers, les gens du coin te laissent le "
"bénéfice du doute... pour l'instant."

#: game/editor.msg:2104
msgid "You're just another out-of-towner in this area. Probably up to no good."
msgstr ""
"Tu viens d'ailleurs, comme tant d'autres par ici. Et tu ne dois pas valoir "
"grand-chose."

#: game/editor.msg:2105
msgid ""
"You've proven to the people in this area that their initial distrust was "
"well founded. People in this area look at you and mutter to one another when "
"you come near. They know you're up to no good."
msgstr ""
"Tu as prouvé aux gens du coin que leur défiance initiale à ton égard était "
"justifiée. On te dévisage et on baisse le ton en ta présence. On sait bien "
"que tu n'as rien d'un ange."

#: game/editor.msg:2106
msgid ""
"Staring and muttering, some cross the street to avoid walking near you, "
"while others, spit and turn away when you come near. Everyone knows that "
"you're one of the worst things that's ever slithered into this area."
msgstr ""
"On te dévisage, on marmonne, on change de trottoir sur ton passage. Il y en "
"a même qui se retournent et qui crachent par terre. Tout le monde sait bien "
"que tu es la pire vermine qu'on ait jamais vue par ici."

