"You've got the shakes. You have this intense urge to drink something with "
"alcohol in it."
msgstr ""
"Tu as des tremblements. Tu as cette envie intense de boire quelque chose "
"alcoolisé, tout de suite."

#: game/k_alcohl.msg:4
