#: game/misc.msg:1000
msgid "You feel very nauseous."
msgstr "Tu as des nausées."

#: game/misc.msg:1001
msgid ""
"You feel very nauseous, and after some mild vomiting, slightly fatigued."
msgstr "Tu as des nausées et, après avoir vomi, tu te sens un peu à plat."

#: game/misc.msg:1002
msgid ""
"You are very fatigued, the vomiting does not stop, and your recovery time is "
"impaired."
msgstr ""
"Tu es très à plat, les vomissements continuent et ta période de guérison est "
"compromise."

#: game/misc.msg:1003
msgid ""
"You are hemorrhaging violently. You are very sick, and your hair is falling "
"out."
msgstr ""
"Tu souffres d'une violente hémorragie. Tu es très malade et tu perds tes "
"cheveux."

#: game/misc.msg:1004
msgid ""
"You are hemorrhaging violently and continuously. The vomitus is stained red "
"from your blood. Your skin is falling off of your bones."
msgstr ""
"Tu souffres d'une hémorragie violente et incontrôlable. Tu vomis du sang. Ta "
"peau se détache de tes os."

#: game/misc.msg:1005
msgid ""
"There is bleeding from your intestines and you have severe diarrhea. You "
"feel bloated and are in intense agony."
msgstr ""
"Tu souffres d'une hémorragie intestinale et d'une terrible diarrhée. Ta peau "
"est boursouflée. Tu es à l'agonie."

#: game/misc.msg:1006
msgid "You have died from radiation sickness."
msgstr "Tu meurs des suites d'une irradiation."

#: game/misc.msg:1007
msgid "You have received a large dose of radiation."
msgstr "Tu as reçu une importante dose de radiations."

#: game/misc.msg:1008
msgid "The geiger counter is clicking."
msgstr "Le compteur Geiger réagit."

#: game/misc.msg:1009
msgid "The geiger counter is clicking wildly."
msgstr "Le compteur Geiger réagit vivement."

#: game/misc.msg:2000
msgid "You cannot get there."
msgstr "Tu ne peux pas y aller."

#: game/misc.msg:2001
msgid "The lock is jammed."
msgstr "Le verrou est bloqué."

#: game/misc.msg:3000
msgid "You have been poisoned!"
msgstr "Tu es victime d'un empoisonnement !"

#: game/misc.msg:3001
msgid "You take damage from poison."
msgstr "Le poison agit sur ton organisme."

#: game/misc.msg:3002
msgid "You feel a little better."
msgstr "Tu te sens un peu mieux."

#: game/misc.msg:4000
msgid "Due to your inept handling, the explosive detonates prematurely."
msgstr "A cause de ta maladresse, la charge explose prématurément."

#: game/misc.msg:5000
msgid "uses"
msgstr "utilise"

#: game/misc.msg:5001
msgid "is out of ammo for the"
msgstr "est à court de munitions pour : "

#: game/misc.msg:5002
msgid "reloads the"
msgstr "recharge : "

#: game/misc.msg:6000
msgid "Ask about what?"
msgstr "Que veux-tu savoir ?"

#: game/misc.msg:7000
msgid "You aren't wearing the Pip-Boy!"
msgstr "Tu ne portes pas le Pip-Boy !"

#: game/misc.msg:8000
msgid "You are overloaded."
msgstr "Tu es en surcharge."

#: game/misc.msg:8001
msgid "%s is overloaded."
msgstr "%s est en surcharge."

#: game/misc.msg:8500
msgid ""
"You gain %d experience points for successful use of the outdoorsman skill."
msgstr ""
"Tu gagnes %d points d'expérience pour avoir utilisé avec succès ta "
"compétence Vie en plein air."

#: game/misc.msg:9000
msgid "%s has gained in some abilities."
msgstr "%s a progressé dans certaines caractéristiques."

#: game/misc.msg:9010
msgid "Whoa. I suddenly felt a rush of experience."
msgstr "Oh ! Je ressens soudain une bouffée d'expérience."

#: game/misc.msg:9011
msgid "Level up, baby! Level up!"
msgstr "Niveau supérieur, mon chou ! Niveau supérieur !"

#: game/misc.msg:9012
msgid ""
"I feel a great disturbance in the force. As if all my skills have gained "
"percentage points."
msgstr ""
"Je ressens une perturbation dans la force. Comme si toutes mes compétences "
"avaient gagné % points."

#: game/misc.msg:9013
msgid "I feel tougher. Stronger. Smarter."
msgstr "Je ressens plus de force, plus d'intelligence, plus de résistance."

#: game/misc.msg:9020
msgid ""
"Wow! I feel as if I've passed some arbitrary experience value and gained "
"more power!"
msgstr ""
"Ah ! J'ai l'impression d'avoir franchi un cap arbitraire d'expérience et "
"gagné en puissance !"

#: game/misc.msg:9021
msgid "Aaagggh! Muscles... bulging... Stats... increasing.... Gaining level..."
msgstr ""
"Aaah ! Mes muscles... enflent... Mes caractéristiques... augmentent.... Un "
"niveau de plus..."

#: game/misc.msg:9022
msgid ""
"Gimme a diploma and a silly lookin' hat with a tassel, 'cause I just "
"graduated!"
msgstr "Vous pouvez me saluer bien bas, parce que j'ai pris du galon !"

#: game/misc.msg:9023
msgid "Hey, I feel more powerful! Does that mean I get a pay raise?"
msgstr "Hé ! Je sens plus de puissance ! J'ai droit à une augmentation ?"

#: game/misc.msg:9030
msgid "It's all comin' back to me now..."
msgstr "Ca me revient, maintenant..."

#: game/misc.msg:9031
msgid "Heh. Guess you can teach an old dog new tricks."
msgstr "Hé. On peut apprendre aux vieux singes à faire la grimace, j'imagine !"

#: game/misc.msg:9032
msgid "Looks like all this travelling has paid off."
msgstr "On dirait bien que les voyages ont fini par former ma jeunesse."

#: game/misc.msg:9033
msgid "I've learned some new tricks."
msgstr "J'ai appris deux ou trois trucs."

#: game/misc.msg:9040
msgid "Grandfather teaches. We learn."
msgstr "Grand-père parle. Nous apprenons."

#: game/misc.msg:9041
msgid "We learn more from the spirits, Mahn."
msgstr "Nous apprenons plus des esprits, mec."

#: game/misc.msg:9042
msgid "We be learnin' now."
msgstr "Nous apprendre, oui !"

#: game/misc.msg:9043
msgid "Da great spirit move in Sulik now."
msgstr "Grand esprit entrer dans Sulik."

#: game/misc.msg:9044
msgid "We be one wit da Grandfather Bone now, Mahn."
msgstr "Nous rejoindre Grand-père des Os, maintenant."

#: game/misc.msg:9045
msgid "We be the Grandfather now."
msgstr "Nous être Grand-père, maintenant."

#: game/misc.msg:9050
msgid "Oh dear... I've actually learned something from this."
msgstr "Oh... Quelle surprise ! J'ai bel et bien appris quelque chose."

#: game/misc.msg:9051
msgid "The guilt of this is going to kill me."
msgstr "Cela me fera mourir de honte."

#: game/misc.msg:9052
msgid "I can't believe I survived this far."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas croire que j'ai survécu jusqu'ici."

#: game/misc.msg:9070 game/misc.msg:9071 game/misc.msg:9090
#: game/misc.msg:9091 game/misc.msg:9100 game/misc.msg:9101
#: game/misc.msg:9110 game/misc.msg:9111 game/misc.msg:9140
#: game/misc.msg:9141 game/misc.msg:9150 game/misc.msg:9151
#: game/misc.msg:9160 game/misc.msg:9161 game/misc.msg:9170
#: game/misc.msg:9171 game/misc.msg:9180 game/misc.msg:9181
msgid "I learned some new things!"
msgstr "J'ai appris des nouveaux trucs !"

#: game/misc.msg:9080
msgid "I do believe I have gained some knowledge!"
msgstr "Je crois bien que j'ai appris quelque chose d'utile !"

#: game/misc.msg:9081
msgid "Clarity of knowledge is a gift."
msgstr "Le savoir est un cadeau."

#: game/misc.msg:9082
msgid "I seem to be maturing nicely."
msgstr "La valeur n'attend pas le nombre des années..."

#: game/misc.msg:9083
msgid "I am surpassing even Gruthar in knowledge."
msgstr "Je dépasse même Gruthar, niveau savoir."

#: game/misc.msg:9084
msgid "I am stronger amongst those of the pack now."
msgstr "Je suis un des plus forts de la meute, à présent."

#: game/misc.msg:9085
msgid "I am now the mightiest amongst my pack."
msgstr "Je suis le plus fort de la meute, à présent."

#: game/misc.msg:9120
msgid "DATA ANALYSIS COMPLETE. UPGRADING ALL SYSTEMS."
msgstr "ANALYSE DES DONNEES TERMINEE. REMISE A NIVEAU TOUS SYSTEMES."

#: game/misc.msg:9121
msgid "NEW DATA COLLECTED. ENHANCING TARGETING SYSTEMS."
msgstr "NOUVELLES DONNEES ACQUISES. REMISE A NIVEAU DES SYSTEMES DE VISEE."

#: game/misc.msg:9122
msgid "SYSTEM RETROFITTING COMPLETED."
msgstr "REMISE A NIVEAU SYSTEME TERMINEE."

#: game/misc.msg:9123
msgid "TARGETING SYSTEMS RECALIBRATED. 20% INCREASE IN ACCURACY."
msgstr "SYSTEMES DE VISEE RECALIBRES. PRECISION SUPPLEMENTAIRE : 20%."

#: game/misc.msg:9124
msgid "OPTIMAL PERFORMANCE REACHED."
msgstr "PERFORMANCES OPTIMALES ATTEINTES."

#: game/misc.msg:9130
msgid "Boss! I think I'm finally getting the hang of this."
msgstr "Patron ! Je sens que ça vient !"

#: game/misc.msg:9131
msgid "I'm actually getting better! Told you I wouldn't let you down, Boss."
msgstr "Je m'améliore ! Je t'avais dit que je te laisserais pas tomber, Patron."

#: game/misc.msg:9132
msgid ""
"Hey... wait... now I get it. I don't think I'm leading my targets enough."
msgstr ""
"Hé... Minute... Je comprends. Je laissais trop de latitude à mes cibles."

#: game/misc.msg:9133
msgid "See, Boss! You can teach an old dog new tricks!"
msgstr ""
"Tu vois, Patron ? On peut apprendre à un vieux singe à faire des grimaces !"

#: game/misc.msg:9134
msgid "You know what, Boss? I think I'm actually learning a thing or two."
msgstr "Tu sais quoi, Patron ? Je crois que j'ai appris un ou deux trucs."

#: game/misc.msg:9135
msgid ""
"I'm getting pretty good at this. See, Boss. All good things get better with "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Je deviens pas mal à ces trucs-là. Tu vois, Patron, c'est comme le bon vin, "
"je m'améliore en vieillissant."

#: game/misc.msg:9190
msgid "Woof WOOF!"
msgstr "Ouaf OUAF !"

#: game/misc.msg:9191 game/misc.msg:9192 game/misc.msg:9193
#: game/misc.msg:9194
msgid "Woof WOOF WOOOOF!"
msgstr "Ouaf OUAF OUAF !"

#: game/misc.msg:9195
msgid "Wa-WOOOOF!"
msgstr "Ouh OUAF !"

#: game/misc.msg:9240
msgid "Initiating program update, Master... Upgrade complete."
msgstr "Initialisation mise à jour programme, Maître... Mise à jour terminée."

#: game/misc.msg:9241
msgid "Installing software upgrade, Master... Version 2.0 installed."
msgstr "Installation mise à jour programme, Maître... Version 2.0 installée."

#: game/misc.msg:9242
msgid "Performing hardware modifications, Master... Systems nominal."
msgstr "Modifications matériel en cours, Maître... Systèmes opérationnels."

#: game/misc.msg:9243
msgid "Performing hardware modifications, Master... Systems optimal!"
msgstr "Modifications matériel en cours, Maître... Systèmes optimaux !"

#: game/misc.msg:9260
msgid "There's more than one way to skin a cat."
msgstr "Il y a plus d'une façon d'écorcher un chat."

#: game/misc.msg:9261
msgid "The lower I fall, the higher I fly."
msgstr "Le plus bas je tombe, le plus haut je vole."

#: game/misc.msg:9262
msgid "Live. Learn. Evolve."
msgstr "Vivre. Apprendre. Evoluer."

#: game/misc.msg:9263
msgid "I hear and I forget; I see and I remember; I do and I understand."
msgstr ""
"J'écoute et je pardonne; Je vois et je me rappelle; Je fais et je comprends."

#: game/misc.msg:9264
msgid "I *am* the Nine."
msgstr "Je *suis* la numéro Neuf."

#: game/misc.msg:9270
msgid ""
"You know, I think I'm starting to recover from that whole being frozen thing."
msgstr ""
"Tu sais, je pense que je suis en train de retrouver mes fonctions que je "
"croyais encore gelées."

#: game/misc.msg:9271
msgid "Ahh... yes. I can feel the old magic coming back to me now."
msgstr "Ahh... Ouais. Je peux sentir la magie revenir en moi maintenant."

#: game/misc.msg:9272
msgid "I don't want to blow your mind, but I just got even better."
msgstr ""
"Je ne veux pas te prendre la tête, mais je crois que je viens de devenir "
"meilleur."

#: game/misc.msg:9273
msgid ""
"Head's up, I've just become perfect. Now lets find some whores so we can "
"celebrate."
msgstr ""
"Youpi, je viens juste de devenir parfait ! Allons voir les putes pour fêter "
"ça."

#: game/misc.msg:9274
msgid ""
"It seems I've surpassed perfection. I suppose if anyone was capable of it, "
"it was me."
msgstr ""
"Je crois que j'ai surpassé la perfection. J'imagine que si quelqu'un en "
"était capable c'était bien moi."

#: game/misc.msg:9280
msgid "The Cat is back!"
msgstr "Le Chat est de retour !"

#: game/misc.msg:9281
msgid "Are my eyes playing tricks or does my ass look better than ever?"
msgstr ""
"Mes yeux sont-ils en train de me jouer des tours ou mon cul a-t-il l'air "
"encore plus beau ?"

#: game/misc.msg:9282
msgid "My cat senses are tingling!"
msgstr "Mes sens de chat sont en plein éveil !"

#: game/misc.msg:9283
msgid "If only I had some fish to go with this experience."
msgstr "Si seulement j'avais du poisson pour aller avec toute cette expérience."

#: game/misc.msg:9284
msgid "This Cat is unstoppable!"
msgstr "Le Chat est inarrêtable !"

