"Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Carabine semi-automatique Colt Rangemaster, calibre .223. Tir simple "
"uniquement. FO min: 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1100
msgid "Flamer"
msgstr "Lance-flammes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1101
msgid ""
"A Flambe 450 model flamethrower, varmiter variation. Fires a short spray of "
"extremely hot, flammable liquid. Requires specialized fuel to work properly. "
"Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Un lance-flammes Flambe-Tout modèle 450, variante Varmiter. Pulvérise et "
"enflamme un court jet de liquide inflammable. Nécessite un combustible "
"spécial. FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1200
msgid "Minigun"
msgstr "Minigun"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1201
msgid ""
"A Rockwell CZ53 Personal Minigun. A multi-barreled chaingun firing 5mm "
"ammunition at over 60,000 RPM. Min ST: 7."
msgstr ""
"Mini-canon personnel Rockwell CZ53. Fusil à chaîne à multiples canons tirant "
"des cartouches 5 mm à plus de 60 000 tours/minute. FO min: 7."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1300
msgid "Rocket Launcher"
msgstr "Lance-roquettes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1301
msgid ""
"A Rockwell BigBazooka rocket launcher. With the deluxe 3 lb. trigger. Fires "
"AP or Explosive Rockets. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Lance-roquettes Rockwell BigBazooka, avec détente de luxe 3 lb. Tire des "
"balles perforantes ou des roquettes explosives. FO min: 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1400
msgid "Explosive Rocket"
msgstr "Roquette explosive"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1401
msgid "A rocket with a large explosive warhead."
msgstr "Roquette dotée d'une grosse ogive explosive."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1500
msgid "Plasma Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil à plasma"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1501
msgid ""
"A Winchester Model P94 Plasma Rifle. An industrial-grade energy weapon, "
"firing superheated bolts of plasma down a superconducting barrel. Powered by "
"Micro Fusion Cells. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Fusil à plasma Winchester modèle P94. Arme à énergie de qualité "
"industrielle, tirant des salves de plasma surchauffé via un canon "
"supraconducteur. Alimenté par des cellules à micro fusion. FO min: 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1600
msgid "Laser Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet laser"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1601
msgid ""
"A Wattz 1000 Laser Pistol. Civilian model, so the wattage is lower than "
"military or police versions. Uses small energy cells. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Pistolet laser Wattz 1000. Modèle civil à la puissance de consommation en "
"watts inférieure aux versions de l'armée et de la police. Utilise de petites "
"cellules énergétiques. FO min: 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1701 game/pro_item.msg:38101
msgid "High tech armor, made out of advanced defensive polymers."
msgstr ""
"Armure d'une technologie de pointe, constituée de polymères défensifs "
"avancés."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1800
msgid "Desert Eagle .44"
msgstr "Desert Eagle .44"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1801
msgid ""
"An ancient Desert Eagle pistol, in .44 Magnum. Interest in late 20th century "
"films made this one of the most popular handguns of all times. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Ancien pistolet Desert Eagle, version .44 Magnum. L'intérêt récent porté aux "
"films de la fin du XXème siècle en a fait de l'arme la plus populaire de "
"tous les temps. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:1900 game/pro_misc.msg:2600 game/pro_scen.msg:46100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:46200 game/pro_scen.msg:46300 game/pro_scen.msg:46400
msgid "Rock"
msgstr "Rocher"

#: game/pro_item.msg:1901
msgid "It's a rock. The Granite-Inc. model is an upgraded version. Min ST: 1."
msgstr ""
"Et bien, c'est une pierre. Le modèle Granite & Cie est une version "
"améliorée. FO min. : 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2000
msgid "Crowbar"
msgstr "Pince à levier"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2001
msgid ""
"A very solid and heavy piece of metal, specially designed to exert leverage. "
"Or pound heads. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Pièce de métal très solide et lourde, spécialement conçue pour faire levier. "
"Ou tabasser les autres. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2100
msgid "Brass Knuckles"
msgstr "Protections cuivrées"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2101
msgid ""
"Hardened knuckle grip that is actually made out of steel. They protect your "
"hand, and do more damage, in unarmed combat. Min ST: 1."
msgstr ""
"Protections renforcées en acier. Elles protègent les mains et sont très "
"efficaces lors des combats au Corps à Corps. FO min: 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2200
msgid "14mm Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet 14 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2201
msgid ""
"A Sig-Sauer 14mm Auto Pistol. Large, single shot handgun. Excellent "
"craftsmanship. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Pistolet automatique Sig-Sauer 14 mm. Arme de gros calibre à tir simple. "
"Excellente conception. FO min: 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2300
msgid "Assault Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil d'assaut"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2301
msgid ""
"An AK-112 5mm Assault Rifle. An old military model, out of use around the "
"time of the war. Can fire single-shot or burst, using the high velocity 5mm "
"rounds. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Fusil d'assaut AK-112 5 mm. Ancien modèle militaire hors service au moment "
"de la guerre. S'utilise en mode tir simple ou rafale avec des balles 5 mm à "
"grande vitesse. FO min: 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2400
msgid "Plasma Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet à plasma"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2401
msgid ""
"Glock 86 Plasma Pistol. Designed by the Gaston Glock AI. Shoots a small bolt "
"of superheated plasma. Powered by a small energy cell. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Pistolet à plasma Glock 86. Fut conçu par l'IA Gaston Glock. Lance des "
"petites salves de plasma surchauffé. Alimenté par une petite cellule "
"énergétique. FO min: 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2500
msgid "Grenade (Frag)"
msgstr "Grenade (à frag.)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2501
msgid ""
"A generic fragmentation grenade. Contains a small amount of high explosives, "
"the container itself forming most of the damaging fragments. Explodes on "
"contact. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Une grenade classique à fragmentation. Contient une petite quantité "
"d'explosifs brisants, le réceptacle fournit la plupart des fragments "
"dangereux. Explose par contact. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2600
msgid "Grenade (Plasma)"
msgstr "Grenade (plasma)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2601
msgid ""
"A magnetically sealed plasma delivery unit, with detonating explosives. "
"Creates a blast of superheated plasma on contact. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Unité de plasma à capsules magnétiques avec explosifs. Surchauffé, le plasma "
"explose au contact de la cible. FO min: 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2700
msgid "Grenade (Pulse)"
msgstr "Grenade (à impulsions)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2701
msgid ""
"An electromagnetic pulse grenade, generating an intense magnetic field on "
"detonation. Doesn't affect biological creatures. Contact fuze. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Grenade à impulsions électromagnétiques générant un champ magnétique intense "
"à la détonation. N'affecte pas les créatures biologiques. S'amorce au "
"contact de la cible. FO min: 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2800
msgid "Gatling Laser"
msgstr "Laser Gatling"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2801
msgid ""
"An H&K L30 Gatling Laser. Designed specifically for military use, these were "
"in the prototype stage at the beginning of the War. Multiple barrels allow "
"longer firing before overheating. Powered by Micro Fusion Cells. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Laser Gatling H&K L30. Spécialement conçues à des fins militaires, ces armes "
"n'étaient encore que des prototypes au début de la Guerre. Les canons "
"multiples permettent des tirs plus longs avant la surchauffe. Alimenté par "
"des cellules à micro fusion. FO min: 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:2900
msgid "10mm JHP"
msgstr "CCM 10 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:2901
msgid "Ammunition. Caliber: 10mm, jacketed hollow-point."
msgstr "Munitions. Calibre : 10 mm, charges creuses à manchon."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3000
msgid "10mm AP"
msgstr "Balles perforantes de 10 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3001
msgid "Ammunition. Caliber: 10mm, armor piercing."
msgstr "Munitions. Calibre : 10 mm, perforantes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3100
msgid ".44 Magnum JHP"
msgstr "CCM .44 Magnum"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3101
msgid "A brick of ammunition, .44 Magnum caliber, jacketed hollow-point."
msgstr "Munitions, .44 Magnum, charges creuses à manchon."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3200 game/proto.msg:302
msgid "Flamethrower Fuel"
msgstr "Combustible pour lance-flammes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3201
msgid ""
"A cylinder containing an extremely flammable liquid fuel for flamethrowers."
msgstr "Un magasin contenant un liquide combustible hautement inflammable."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3300
msgid "14mm AP"
msgstr "Balles perforantes de 14 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3301
msgid "Large caliber ammunition. 14mm armor piercing."
msgstr "Munitions de gros calibre. 14 mm, perforantes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3400
msgid ".223 FMJ"
msgstr "MEM .223"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3401
msgid "A case of ammunition, .223 caliber, full metal jacket."
msgstr "Boîte de munitions, calibre .223, manchon entièrement métallique."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3500
msgid "5mm JHP"
msgstr "CCM de 5mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3501
msgid ""
"A brick of small, lightweight ammunition. Caliber: 5mm, jacketed hollow-"
"point."
msgstr "Munitions légères. Calibre : 5 mm, charges creuses à manchon."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3600
msgid "5mm AP"
msgstr "Balles perforantes de 5mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3601
msgid "A brick of small, lightweight ammunition. Caliber: 5mm, armor piercing."
msgstr "Munitions petites et légères. Calibre : 5 mm, perforantes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3700
msgid "Rocket AP"
msgstr "Roquette perforante"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3701
msgid ""
"A rocket shell, with a smaller explosive, but designed to pierce armor "
"plating."
msgstr ""
"Une roquette avec une charge explosive plus réduite conçue pour percer les "
"plaques de blindage."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3800
msgid "Small Energy Cell"
msgstr "Petite cellule énergétique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3801
msgid "A small, self-contained energy storage unit."
msgstr "Une petite unité indépendante de stockage d'énergie."

#: game/pro_item.msg:3900
msgid "Micro Fusion Cell"
msgstr "Cellule à micro fusion"

#: game/pro_item.msg:3901
msgid "A medium sized energy production unit. Self-contained fusion plant."
msgstr ""
"Une unité de production d'énergie de taille moyenne. Centrale autonome à "
"fusion."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4001
msgid ""
"A healing chem. When injected, the chem provides immediate healing of minor "
"wounds."
msgstr ""
"Une substance curative. Une fois injecté, ce stimulant permet de soigner les "
"blessures superficielles."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4100
msgid "Money"
msgstr "Argent"

#: game/pro_item.msg:4101
msgid "Legal tender for the world of the wastes."
msgstr "Monnaie courante dans le monde du désert."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4200
msgid "Fridge"
msgstr "Réfrigérateur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:4201
msgid "A refrigerator. Out of coolant."
msgstr "Un réfrigérateur au liquide de refroidissement épuisé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4300 game/pro_item.msg:4400
msgid "Ice Chest"
msgstr "Glacière"

#: game/pro_item.msg:4301 game/pro_item.msg:4401
msgid "On old-style ice chest. The hinges are in good working condition."
msgstr ""
"Une glacière dans le style ancien. Les charnières fonctionnent toujours."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4500
msgid "Throwing Knife"
msgstr "Couteau de lancer"

#: game/pro_item.msg:4501
msgid ""
"A knife, balanced specifically for throwing. Made of titanium, and laser "
"sharpened. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Un couteau conçu spécifiquement pour le lancer. Composé de titane et affûté "
"au laser. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4600 game/pro_item.msg:9300
msgid "Bag"
msgstr "Sac"

#: game/pro_item.msg:4601 game/pro_item.msg:9301
msgid "An average sized bag. Made from weaved brahmin hairs."
msgstr "Un sac de taille moyenne. Tissé à partir de crins de Brahmine."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4701
msgid ""
"A small kit containing basic medical equipment. Bandages, wraps, antiseptic "
"spray, and more."
msgstr ""
"Une petite trousse contenant du matériel médical de base. Bandages, "
"couvertures, désinfectant etc."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4801
msgid ""
"A chemical solution that bonds with radiation particles and passes them "
"through your system. Takes time to work."
msgstr ""
"Une solution chimique absorbant les particules radioactives pour les faire "
"quitter ton organisme. Nécessite du temps avant de fonctionner."

#: game/pro_item.msg:4900
msgid "Antidote"
msgstr "Antidote"

#: game/pro_item.msg:4901
msgid ""
"A bottle containing a home-brewed antidote for poison. A milky liquid with "
"floating pieces of radscorpion flesh."
msgstr ""
"Un flacon contenant un antidote de fabrication artisanale contre le poison. "
"Liquide laiteux avec des morceaux flottants de chair de radscorpion."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5000
msgid "Reserved Item"
msgstr "Objet réservé"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5001
msgid "This is a reserved item. DO NOT USE."
msgstr "Ceci est un objet réservé. NE PAS UTILISER."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5100 game/pro_item.msg:20600 game/scrname.msg:1542
msgid "Dynamite"
msgstr "Dynamite"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5101
msgid ""
"A high explosive, consisting of nitroglycerin mixed with the absorbent "
"substance kieselguhr. Includes a timer."
msgstr ""
"Un explosif puissant, composé de nitroglycérine mélangée avec de la "
"substance absorbante à base de kiselguhr. Comprend une minuterie."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5200 game/pro_item.msg:20700
msgid "Geiger Counter"
msgstr "Compteur Geiger (Activé)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5201
msgid ""
"A Wattz Electronics C-Radz model Geiger Counter. Detects the presence and "
"strength of radiation fields."
msgstr ""
"Un compteur Geiger Wattz Electronics, modèle C-Radz. Cet appareil détecte et "
"indique le taux des radiations."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5301
msgid ""
"A pillbox of mind-altering chems. Increases memory related functions, and "
"speeds other mental processes. Highly addictive."
msgstr ""
"Une boîte de pilules stimulantes altérant l'esprit. Augmente les facultés de "
"mémorisation et accélère les autres processus mentaux. Provoque une forte "
"dépendance."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5400 game/pro_item.msg:21000
msgid "Stealth Boy"
msgstr "Homme invisible (Activé)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5401 game/pro_item.msg:21001
msgid ""
"A RobCo Stealth Boy 3001 personal stealth device. Generates a modulating "
"field that transmits the reflected light from one side of an object to the "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Appareil de furtivité personnel Homme Invisible 3001 de RobCo. Génère un "
"champ de modulation transmettant la lumière réfléchie d'un côté à l'autre "
"d'un objet, ce qui rend son porteur beaucoup plus difficile à voir."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5500
msgid "Water Chip"
msgstr "Puce d'eau"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5501
msgid ""
"This is a Vault-Tec water chip. They are typically packaged in groups of "
"five to a box."
msgstr ""
"Une puce d'eau Vault-Tek. En général, on les trouve conditionnées par boîtes "
"de cinq."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5600
msgid "Dog Tags"
msgstr "Plaques d'identification"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5601
msgid ""
"A set of military dog tags. The name Dickinson and the word Enclave are "
"barely readable."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu de plaques d'identification militaires. Le nom Darkwater est à peu "
"près la seule chose lisible."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5700
msgid "Bug"
msgstr "Microphone"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5701
msgid "A miniature microphone and transmitting device."
msgstr "Un appareil d'enregistrement et d'émission miniaturisé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5800
msgid "Tape"
msgstr "Bande"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5801
msgid ""
"A Wattz Electronics Holodisc tape. This particular tape looks to be into "
"very poor condition."
msgstr ""
"Une bande holodisque de Wattz Electronics. Cette bande semble être en "
"particulièrement mauvais état."

#: game/pro_item.msg:5900 game/pro_item.msg:20800
msgid "Motion Sensor"
msgstr "Détecteur de mouvements (Activé)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:5901
msgid ""
"A Wattz Electronics C-U model motion sensor. Detects the movement of "
"biological material over a distance of meters using a tuned radar device. "
"Having one in your inventory will also help you avoid outdoor encounters (+"
"20% Outdoorsman skill)."
msgstr ""
"Un détecteur de mouvements Wattz Electronics, modèle C-U. Détecte les "
"mouvements des créatures biologiques sur plusieurs mètres à la ronde. En "
"avoir un dans ton inventaire t'aidera aussi à éviter les rencontres en "
"extérieur (+20% à la compétence Vie en plein air pour les rencontres en "
"extérieur uniquement )."

#: game/pro_item.msg:6000 game/pro_item.msg:6100 game/pro_item.msg:6200
#: game/pro_item.msg:6300 game/pro_item.msg:6400 game/pro_item.msg:6500
#: game/scrname.msg:566
msgid "Bookcase"
msgstr "Bibliothèque"

#: game/pro_item.msg:6001 game/pro_item.msg:6101 game/pro_item.msg:6201
#: game/pro_item.msg:6301 game/pro_item.msg:6401 game/pro_item.msg:6501
msgid "A wooden bookcase."
msgstr "Une bibliothèque en bois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:6600 game/pro_item.msg:6700 game/pro_item.msg:18100
#: game/pro_item.msg:18200 game/pro_item.msg:18300 game/pro_item.msg:18400
#: game/pro_item.msg:18500 game/pro_item.msg:18600 game/pro_item.msg:18700
#: game/pro_item.msg:21400 game/pro_scen.msg:40400 game/pro_scen.msg:40500
#: game/pro_scen.msg:163600 game/pro_scen.msg:164300 game/pro_scen.msg:164400
#: game/pro_scen.msg:231300 game/pro_scen.msg:231600 game/pro_scen.msg:231700
#: game/pro_scen.msg:231800
msgid "Desk"
msgstr "Bureau"

#: game/pro_item.msg:6601 game/pro_item.msg:6701 game/pro_scen.msg:231301
msgid "A wooden desk."
msgstr "Un bureau en bois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:6800 game/pro_item.msg:6900 game/pro_item.msg:7000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:231400 game/pro_scen.msg:231500 game/scrname.msg:753
msgid "Dresser"
msgstr "Commode"

#: game/pro_item.msg:6801 game/pro_item.msg:6901 game/pro_item.msg:7001
#: game/pro_scen.msg:231401 game/pro_scen.msg:231501
msgid "A wooden dresser."
msgstr "Une commode en bois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7100
msgid "Fruit"
msgstr "Fruit"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7101
msgid ""
"A strange piece of fruit. No preservatives and no additional food coloring "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Un fruit pour le moins bizarre. Ne contient ni conservateur ni colorant."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7200
msgid "Briefcase"
msgstr "Attaché-case"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7201
msgid ""
"A briefcase, with a Made-in-the-USA label. Leather. Good condition, but the "
"combination lock is broken."
msgstr ""
"Un attaché-case en cuir portant toujours l'étiquette Made-in-USA. En bon "
"état mais la serrure à combinaison est cassée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7300
msgid "Big Book of Science"
msgstr "Grand Livre des Sciences"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7301
msgid ""
"A set of books, containing information about different scientific fields."
msgstr ""
"Une série de livres contenant des informations sur différents domaines "
"scientifiques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7400
msgid "Leather Jacket"
msgstr "Veste en cuir"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7401
msgid "A black, heavy leather jacket."
msgstr "Une veste en cuir noir et épais."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7500
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "Outil"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7501
msgid "A tool set, containing various useful tools, including pliers."
msgstr "Un kit d'outils très pratique, comprenant des tenailles."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7600
msgid "Deans Electronics"
msgstr "L'Electronique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7601
msgid ""
"A study book on the field of electronics. A note on the cover says that it "
"is for the \"budding young electrician in everyone!\""
msgstr ""
"Un livre de cours d'électronique. Une note sur la page de couverture précise "
"que ce livre s'adresse à « l'électricien en herbe qui sommeille en chacun de "
"nous ! »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7700
msgid "Electronic Lockpick"
msgstr "Passe-partout électronique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7701
msgid ""
"A Wattz Electronics Micromanipulator FingerStuff electronic lockpick. For "
"defeating electronic locks and security devices."
msgstr ""
"Un passe électronique Micromanipulator FingerStuff de Wattz Electronics. "
"Pour tous les problèmes de verrous électroniques et de systèmes de sécurité."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7800
msgid "Fuzzy Painting"
msgstr "Peinture floue"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7801
msgid ""
"An image of a singer. Obviously, very old. The image has a felt coating that "
"is still in good condition."
msgstr ""
"L'image d'un chanteur. A l'évidence, très ancien. L'image comporte un "
"revêtement en feutre toujours en bon état."

#: game/pro_item.msg:7900 game/pro_item.msg:20500 game/pro_misc.msg:2400
msgid "Flare"
msgstr "Fusée éclairante (Allumée)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:7901
msgid ""
"A flare. Creates light for a short period of time. The paper is a little "
"worn, but otherwise it is in good condition. Twist the top to activate it."
msgstr ""
"Une fusée éclairante. Produit de la lumière pour une courte période. Le "
"carton est un peu écorné, mais elle est en bon état. Tordre l'extrémité pour "
"l'activer."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8000
msgid "First Aid Book"
msgstr "Guide de secourisme"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8001
msgid "A study book on the concepts and practical use of first aid skills."
msgstr ""
"Un guide consacré à la théorie et à l'application pratique du secourisme."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8100 game/pro_item.msg:10300
msgid "Iguana-on-a-stick"
msgstr "Brochette d'iguane"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8101
msgid "A cooked iguana, roasted in its own skin."
msgstr "Un iguane cuit, rôti dans sa propre peau."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8200 game/pro_item.msg:10500 game/proto.msg:156
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Clé"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8201
msgid "A key. A key will open a particular lock."
msgstr "Une clé. Une clé correspond toujours à une serrure."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8300
msgid "Key Ring"
msgstr "Porte-clés"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8301
msgid "Multiple keys."
msgstr "Clés multiples."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8400
msgid "Lockpicks"
msgstr "Des passe-partouts."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8401
msgid ""
"A set of locksmith tools. Includes all the necessary picks and tension "
"wrenches to open conventional pin and tumbler locks."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu d'outils de serrurerie. Comprend tous les pics et clés à enrouleur "
"nécessaires pour ouvrir les serrures à gorge ou à broche conventionnelles."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8500 game/pro_item.msg:20900
msgid "Plastic Explosives"
msgstr "Plastic"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8501
msgid ""
"A chunk of Cordex, a military brand of plastic explosives. Highly stable, "
"very destructive. Includes a timer."
msgstr ""
"Un morceau de Cordex, une marque militaire d'explosifs au plastic. Très "
"stable, très dévastateur. Comprend une minuterie."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8600
msgid "Scout Handbook"
msgstr "Guide de l'Eclaireur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8601
msgid ""
"A book on the methods and ideals of Scouting. Very practical information "
"regarding outdoor life."
msgstr ""
"Un livre sur les méthodes de reconnaissance. Comporte des informations très "
"pratiques pour la vie au grand air."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8701
msgid ""
"Highly advanced steroids. While in effect, they increase strength and "
"reflexes. Very addictive."
msgstr ""
"Stéroïdes de la nouvelle génération. Tant qu'ils font effet, ils augmentent "
"la force et les réflexes. Très forte dépendance."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8800
msgid "Watch"
msgstr "Montre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8801
msgid "An expensive watch. Not really working, but it still looks nice."
msgstr ""
"Une montre de grande valeur. Elle ne fonctionne pas vraiment mais elle fait "
"joli."

#: game/pro_item.msg:8900
msgid "Motor"
msgstr "Moteur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:8901
msgid "A 40-hp electric motor."
msgstr "Un moteur électrique de 40 chevaux."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9000
msgid "Back Pack"
msgstr "Sac à dos"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9001
msgid "A basic backpack, with optional carrying straps."
msgstr "Un sac à dos ordinaire avec des lanières en option."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9101
msgid ""
"This brown bag contains instruments and chems used by doctors in the "
"application of their trade."
msgstr ""
"Cette trousse contient des instruments et des produits chimiques utilisés "
"par les médecins dans l'exercice de leur art."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9200
msgid "Scorpion Tail"
msgstr "Queue de radscorpion"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9201
msgid "The severed tail of a radscorpion."
msgstr "La queue coupée d'un radscorpion."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9400
msgid "Shotgun"
msgstr "Fusil de chasse"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9401
msgid ""
"A Winchester Widowmaker double-barreled 12-gauge shotgun. Short barrel, with "
"mahogany grip. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Un Winchester Widowmaker double canon de calibre 12. Canon court avec crosse "
"en acajou. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9500
msgid "12 ga. Shotgun Shells"
msgstr "Cartouches de fusil de chasse calibre 12"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9501
msgid ""
"Shotgun ammunition. This particular ammo is marked: \"12-gauge shells, not "
"for use by children under the age of 3.\""
msgstr ""
"Munitions pour fusil. Ces munitions portent la mention : « Cartouches de "
"calibre 12. Ne convient pas aux enfants de moins de 3 ans. »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9600
msgid "Red Pass Key"
msgstr "Passe rouge"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9601 game/pro_item.msg:30601 game/pro_item.msg:37301
msgid "An electronic security key, color coded red."
msgstr "Une clé de sécurité électronique utilisant le code de couleur rouge."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9700
msgid "Blue Pass Key"
msgstr "Passe bleu"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9701
msgid "An electronic security key, color coded blue."
msgstr "Une clé de sécurité électronique utilisant le code de couleur bleu."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9800 game/pro_scen.msg:10600 game/pro_scen.msg:10700
#: game/pro_scen.msg:10900 game/pro_scen.msg:11600 game/pro_scen.msg:11700
#: game/pro_scen.msg:11800 game/pro_scen.msg:25200 game/pro_scen.msg:25300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:25400 game/pro_scen.msg:25500 game/pro_scen.msg:25600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:27100 game/pro_scen.msg:27200 game/pro_scen.msg:27300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:27400 game/pro_scen.msg:27700 game/pro_scen.msg:41100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:41200 game/pro_scen.msg:41300 game/scrname.msg:1625
msgid "Junk"
msgstr "Vieilleries"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9801
msgid "A pile of junk parts. A little bit of everything."
msgstr "Une pile de vieilles pièces. Un peu de tout en somme."

#: game/pro_item.msg:9900
msgid "Gold Locket"
msgstr "Médaillon en or"

#: game/pro_item.msg:9901
msgid "A valuable gold locket."
msgstr "Un médaillon en or de valeur."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10000
msgid "Radio"
msgstr "Radio"

#: game/pro_item.msg:10001
msgid ""
"A model 2043B Radio Communicator, from the fine people at Wattz Electronics. "
"Dependable, rugged, and camouflaged. With the optional RS-121 interface."
msgstr ""
"Un émetteur/récepteur radio modèle 2043B de la bonne vieille entreprise "
"Wattz Electronics. Fiable, robuste et camouflé. Avec l'interface optionnelle "
"RS-121."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10100
msgid "Lighter"
msgstr "Briquet"

#: game/pro_item.msg:10101
msgid "A silver butane lighter, in good condition."
msgstr "Un briquet au butane en argent, en bon état."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10200
msgid "Guns and Bullets"
msgstr "Armes et Munitions"

#: game/pro_item.msg:10201
msgid ""
"A gun rag. A magazine devoted to the practical use of firearms, and the "
"occasional biased review."
msgstr ""
"Une feuille de chou spécialisée dans les armes. Un magazine consacré à "
"l'utilisation pratique des armes à feu avec une section critique sponsorisée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10301
msgid "Some charred meat and vegetables on a cooking stick."
msgstr "Des bouts de viande brûlée et de légumes sur une brochette."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10400
msgid "Tape Recorder"
msgstr "Magnétophone"

#: game/pro_item.msg:10401
msgid ""
"A Wattz Electronics Play-It-For-Me tape recorder. Plays and records the "
"standard 30 minute high density Record-It-Once tapes."
msgstr ""
"Un magnétophone Play-It-For-Me de chez Wattz Electronics. Permet de lire et "
"d'enregistrer les bandes Record-It-Once standard haute densité de 30 minutes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10501
msgid "A special key of some sort."
msgstr "Un genre de clé spéciale."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10600
msgid "Nuka-Cola"
msgstr "Nuka-Cola"

#: game/pro_item.msg:10601
msgid ""
"A bottle of Nuka-Cola, the flavored softdrink of the post-nuclear world. "
"Warm and flat."
msgstr ""
"Une bouteille de Nuka-Cola, la boisson gazeuse aromatisée du monde post-"
"nucléaire. Chaud et sans bulles."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10700 game/pro_item.msg:10800 game/pro_item.msg:21100
#: game/pro_item.msg:25000 game/pro_scen.msg:8200 game/pro_scen.msg:8300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:8400 game/pro_scen.msg:8500 game/pro_scen.msg:8600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:192000 game/pro_scen.msg:192100 game/pro_scen.msg:192200
#: game/pro_scen.msg:192300 game/pro_scen.msg:192400 game/pro_scen.msg:192500
#: game/pro_scen.msg:192600 game/pro_scen.msg:192700 game/pro_scen.msg:192800
#: game/scrname.msg:165
msgid "Bones"
msgstr "Os"

#: game/pro_item.msg:10701 game/pro_item.msg:10801
msgid "A collection of strange bones."
msgstr "Un gisement d'ossements bizarres."

#: game/pro_item.msg:10901
msgid ""
"Anti-radiation chems to be taken before exposure. No known side effects."
msgstr ""
"Produit anti-radiations à absorber avant toute exposition. Aucun effet "
"secondaire connu. Sans accoutumance."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11001
msgid ""
"An unique delivery system filled with strange and unknown chemicals of "
"probably military origin. It is supposed to increase the combat potential of "
"a soldier."
msgstr ""
"Un vecteur unique rempli de produits chimiques inconnus et étranges, "
"probablement d'origine militaire. Supposé améliorer le potentiel de combat "
"d'un soldat."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11100
msgid ".44 Magnum FMJ"
msgstr "MEM .44 Magnum"

#: game/pro_item.msg:11101
msgid "A brick of ammunition, .44 Magnum caliber, full metal jacket."
msgstr "Munitions, calibre .44 Magnum, manchon entièrement métallique."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11200
msgid "Urn"
msgstr "Urne"

#: game/pro_item.msg:11201
msgid ""
"A beautiful golden urn, with the name \"Harriet\" inscribed on the front and "
"ashes inside."
msgstr ""
"Une magnifique urne en or, comportant le nom « Harriet » à l'extérieur et "
"des cendres à l'intérieur."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11300
msgid "Robes"
msgstr "Aubes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:11301
msgid "Worn-looking robes."
msgstr "Les aubes des Enfants de la Cathédrale."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11400
msgid "Tangler's Hand"
msgstr "Main de Tangler"

#: game/pro_item.msg:11401
msgid ""
"A cybernetic manipulator, in the shape and form of a hand. Damaged due to "
"the sloppy nature of the removal process."
msgstr ""
"Un manipulateur cybernétique, qui à la forme exacte d'une main. Endommagé du "
"fait d'un manque d'expertise au démontage."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11501
msgid ""
"A Super Sledgehammer, manufactured by the Brotherhood of Steel, using the "
"finest weapons technology available. Includes a kinetic energy storage "
"device, to increase knockback. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Une Super Massue, fabriquée par la Confrérie de l'Acier, utilisant les "
"dernières technologies en matière d'armement. Comprend un mécanisme de "
"stockage d'énergie cinétique pour renforcer les percussions. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11601
msgid ""
"A Ripper(tm) vibroblade. Powered by a small energy cell, the chainblade rips "
"and tears into it's target. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Une lame vibrante Ripper(tm). Alimentée par une petite cellule énergétique, "
"les lames entraînées par une chaîne pénètrent et déchiquettent la cible. FO "
"min : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11701
msgid "A beautiful flower."
msgstr "Une très jolie fleur."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11800
msgid "Laser Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil laser"

#: game/pro_item.msg:11801
msgid ""
"A Wattz 2000 Laser Rifle. Uses micro fusion cells for more powerful lasers, "
"and an extended barrel for additional range. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil laser Wattz 2000. Utilise des cellules à micro fusion pour un rayon "
"laser plus puissant et dispose d'un canon rallongé améliorant la portée. FO "
"min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:11900
msgid "Necklace"
msgstr "Collier"

#: game/pro_item.msg:11901
msgid ""
"An expensive looking necklace, made from silver, gold and pressed diamonds."
msgstr "Un collier visiblement cher, en argent, or et diamants sertis."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12000
msgid "Alien Blaster"
msgstr "Arme Alien"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12001
msgid ""
"A strange gun of obviously alien origin. Looks like it can support small "
"energy cells, however. Min ST: 2."
msgstr ""
"Une arme bizarre visiblement venue d'ailleurs. Semble cependant être "
"compatible avec les petites cellules énergétiques. FO min. : 2."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12100
msgid "9mm ball"
msgstr "Balles de 9 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12101
msgid ""
"A collection of ancient 9x19mm rounds. Heavy grease to preserve them from "
"the environment. Standard bullets."
msgstr ""
"Ensemble de cartouches anciennes de 9x19 mm. Elle ont été graissées afin de "
"les protéger de l'environnement. Balles clasiques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12200
msgid "9mm Mauser"
msgstr "Mauser 9 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12201
msgid ""
"A Mauser M/96, in 9x19mm Parabellum. In excellent condition. Extremely "
"accurate. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Un Mauser Parabellum M/96, 9x19 mm. En excellent état. Extrêmement précis. "
"FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12300
msgid "Psychic Nullifier"
msgstr "Annulateur psychique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12301
msgid "A strange device, constructed from an odd technology."
msgstr "Un drôle d'appareil, produit d'une technologie bizarre."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12400
msgid "Beer"
msgstr "Bière"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12401
msgid "Some type of home brewed beer."
msgstr "Une espèce de bière brassée maison."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12500
msgid "Booze"
msgstr "Bibine"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12501
msgid "An ancient liquor, from the pre-War era."
msgstr "Un alcool vénérable, datant de l'Avant guerre."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12600
msgid "Water Flask"
msgstr "Fiole d'eau"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12601
msgid "A container for the holding and preservation of water or other liquids."
msgstr ""
"Un récipient permettant de transporter et conserver de l'eau et d'autres "
"liquides."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12700 game/pro_scen.msg:91500 game/pro_scen.msg:91600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:91700 game/pro_scen.msg:91800 game/pro_scen.msg:91900
#: game/pro_scen.msg:92000 game/pro_scen.msg:92100 game/pro_scen.msg:92200
#: game/pro_scen.msg:129700 game/pro_scen.msg:143300 game/pro_scen.msg:186900
#: game/pro_scen.msg:187900 game/pro_scen.msg:188000 game/scrname.msg:964
msgid "Rope"
msgstr "Corde"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12701
msgid "A strong, thick line. About 45 feet in length."
msgstr "Une ligne longue et épaisse. Un peu plus de dix mètres de long."

#: game/pro_item.msg:12800 game/pro_item.msg:12900 game/pro_item.msg:13000
#: game/pro_item.msg:13100 game/scrname.msg:645
msgid "Footlocker"
msgstr "Coffre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:12801 game/pro_item.msg:12901 game/pro_item.msg:13001
#: game/pro_item.msg:13101
msgid "Your basic footlocker. Holds stuff, sits at foot of bed, can be locked."
msgstr ""
"Un coffre personnel ordinaire. Il est pratique et permet de ranger pas mal "
"de choses. Il ferme à clé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:13200 game/pro_item.msg:13300 game/pro_item.msg:13400
#: game/pro_item.msg:13500 game/pro_item.msg:13600 game/pro_item.msg:13700
