msgid "Locker"
msgstr "Placard"

#: game/pro_item.msg:13201 game/pro_item.msg:13301 game/pro_item.msg:13401
#: game/pro_item.msg:13501 game/pro_item.msg:13601 game/pro_item.msg:13701
#: game/pro_item.msg:13801 game/pro_item.msg:13901 game/pro_item.msg:57801
#: game/pro_item.msg:57901
msgid "A storage container."
msgstr "Un conteneur de stockage."

#: game/pro_item.msg:14000
msgid "Access Card"
msgstr "Carte d'accès"

#: game/pro_item.msg:14001
msgid "A security access card. Still in working condition."
msgstr "Une carte d'accès de sécurité. Toujours en état de marche."

#: game/pro_item.msg:14100 game/pro_item.msg:14200
msgid "COC Badge"
msgstr "Badge EDLC"

#: game/pro_item.msg:14101 game/pro_item.msg:14201
msgid ""
"A badge in the shape of the Children of the Cathedral symbol. On one side "
"you notice bumps and indentations, almost reminding you of a key."
msgstr ""
"Un badge portant le symbole des Enfants de la Cathédrale. Sur l'un des côtés "
"tu vois des renfoncements et des ergots, rappelant presque une clé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:14300
msgid "Sniper Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil d'embuscade"

#: game/pro_item.msg:14301
msgid ""
"A DKS-501 Sniper Rifle. Excellent long range projectile weapon. Originally ."
"308, this one is chambered in the more common .223 caliber. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil d'embuscade DKS-501. Une arme excellente pour les tirs à distance. "
"D'un calibre .308 à l'origine, ce modèle a été ramené au calibre .223, "
"beaucoup plus courant. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:14401
msgid ""
"An advanced healing chem. Very powerful. Superstims will cause a small "
"amount of damage after a period of time due to the powerful nature of the "
"chemicals used."
msgstr ""
"Une substance curative évoluée. Très puissante. Les Superstims provoquent "
"quelques dégâts au bout d'une certaine période du fait de la nature "
"puissante du produit chimique utilisé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:14500 game/pro_item.msg:14600 game/pro_item.msg:14700
#: game/pro_item.msg:14800 game/pro_item.msg:14900 game/pro_item.msg:15000
#: game/scrname.msg:353 game/scrname.msg:354 game/scrname.msg:355
msgid "Bookshelf"
msgstr "Etagère"

#: game/pro_item.msg:14501 game/pro_item.msg:14601 game/pro_item.msg:14701
#: game/pro_item.msg:14801 game/pro_item.msg:14901 game/pro_item.msg:15001
msgid "A wooden bookshelf."
msgstr "Une étagère en bois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:15100 game/pro_item.msg:15200 game/pro_item.msg:15300
#: game/pro_item.msg:15400 game/pro_item.msg:15500 game/pro_item.msg:15600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:56900 game/pro_scen.msg:57000 game/pro_scen.msg:57100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:57200
msgid "Shelves"
msgstr "Etagères"

#: game/pro_item.msg:15101 game/pro_item.msg:15201 game/pro_item.msg:15301
#: game/pro_item.msg:15401 game/pro_item.msg:15501 game/pro_item.msg:15601
msgid "A set of wooden shelves."
msgstr "Un ensemble d'étagères en bois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:15700
msgid "Workbench"
msgstr "Etabli"

#: game/pro_item.msg:15701
msgid ""
"A workbench. Yep, your standard old, run of the mill, workbench. Looks nice "
"sitting there, too."
msgstr ""
"Un établi. Et oui, le bon vieil établi standard. Permet également de bien "
"s'asseoir."

#: game/pro_item.msg:15800
msgid "Tool Board"
msgstr "Panneau à outils"

#: game/pro_item.msg:15801
msgid "This board holds a variety of tools above the popular workbench."
msgstr "Ce panneau permet de ranger plusieurs outils au-dessus de l'établi."

#: game/pro_item.msg:15900 game/pro_misc.msg:3000
msgid "Molotov Cocktail"
msgstr "Cocktail Molotov"

#: game/pro_item.msg:15901
msgid "A home-made flammable grenade. Min ST: 3."
msgstr "Une grenade incendiaire faite maison. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:16000
msgid "Cattle Prod"
msgstr "Bâton d'élevage"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16001
msgid ""
"A Farmer's Best Friend model cattle prod from Wattz Electronics. Uses small "
"energy cells for power. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Un bâton d'élevage modèle Farmer's Best Friend de chez Wattz Electronics. "
"Utilise de petites cellules énergétiques. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:16100
msgid "Red Ryder BB Gun"
msgstr "Carabine BB Red Ryder"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16101
msgid "A Red Ryder BB gun. The classic. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Une carabine à air comprimé BB Red Ryder. Modèle classique. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:16200
msgid "Red Ryder LE BB Gun"
msgstr "Carabine BB avec explosif déflagrant Red Ryder"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16201
msgid ""
"A limited edition version of the Red Ryder BB gun. A true classic. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Edition limitée de la carabine BB Red Ryder. Une vraie pièce de collection. "
"FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:16300
msgid "BB's"
msgstr "Billes BB"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16301
msgid ""
"A package of BB's from before the war. In excellent condition. Stainless "
"steel."
msgstr ""
"Munitions. Une boîte contenant des billes BB datant d'avant guerre. En "
"excellent état. Acier inoxydable."

#: game/pro_item.msg:16400
msgid "Brotherhood Tape"
msgstr "Bande de la Confrérie"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16401
msgid "A holodisc from regarding the Brotherhood of Steel."
msgstr "Un holodisque se rapportant à la Confrérie de l'Acier."

#: game/pro_item.msg:16500
msgid "Iguana Stand"
msgstr "Etal d'iguanes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16501
msgid ""
"The home of Bob's Iguana Bits. What's not to love about fresh-roasted iguana?"
msgstr "Etal d'iguanes de Bob. Rien ne vaut un iguane fraîchement rôti !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16600 game/pro_item.msg:16700 game/pro_scen.msg:6100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:6200 game/pro_scen.msg:30000 game/pro_scen.msg:30100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:30200 game/pro_scen.msg:30300 game/pro_scen.msg:30400
#: game/pro_scen.msg:30500 game/pro_scen.msg:30600 game/pro_scen.msg:49300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:49400 game/pro_scen.msg:49500 game/pro_scen.msg:49600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:49700 game/pro_scen.msg:49800 game/pro_scen.msg:51600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:51700 game/pro_scen.msg:51800 game/pro_scen.msg:51900
#: game/pro_scen.msg:52000 game/pro_scen.msg:52100 game/pro_scen.msg:59100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:59200 game/pro_scen.msg:59300 game/pro_scen.msg:59400
#: game/pro_scen.msg:59500 game/pro_scen.msg:60400 game/pro_scen.msg:60500
#: game/pro_scen.msg:60600 game/pro_scen.msg:60700 game/pro_scen.msg:60800
