#: game/pro_scen.msg:183200 game/pro_scen.msg:183300 game/scrname.msg:508
msgid "Stuff"
msgstr "Choses diverses"

#: game/pro_item.msg:16801 game/pro_item.msg:16901 game/pro_item.msg:17001
#: game/pro_item.msg:17101 game/pro_item.msg:17201 game/pro_item.msg:17301
#: game/pro_item.msg:17401 game/pro_item.msg:17501 game/pro_item.msg:17601
#: game/pro_item.msg:17701 game/pro_item.msg:17801 game/pro_item.msg:17901
msgid "These are miscellaneous items, also known as \"stuff\"."
msgstr "Des objets divers parfois appelés \"choses\"."

#: game/pro_item.msg:18000 game/pro_scen.msg:17800 game/pro_scen.msg:17900
#: game/pro_scen.msg:18000 game/pro_scen.msg:19300 game/pro_scen.msg:40100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:40200 game/pro_scen.msg:40300 game/scrname.msg:1074
#: game/scrname.msg:1138 game/scrname.msg:1617
msgid "Crate"
msgstr "Caisse"

#: game/pro_item.msg:18001
msgid "A wooden crate filled with generic stuff."
msgstr "Un cageot en bois contenant diverses choses."

#: game/pro_item.msg:18101 game/pro_scen.msg:231601
msgid "A generic desk. Seen one desk, you've seen them all."
msgstr "Un bureau en bois. Quand on en a vu un, on les a tous vus."

#: game/pro_item.msg:18201 game/pro_item.msg:18301 game/pro_item.msg:18401
#: game/pro_item.msg:18501 game/pro_item.msg:18601 game/pro_item.msg:18701
#: game/pro_scen.msg:231701 game/pro_scen.msg:231801
msgid "A generic desk."
msgstr "Un bureau en bois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:18801 game/pro_item.msg:18901
msgid "A locker."
msgstr "Un placard."

#: game/pro_item.msg:19000
msgid "FEV Disk"
msgstr "Disque sur le FEV"

#: game/pro_item.msg:19001
msgid ""
"A holotape containing medical information. Can be used to enter information "
"into your Pip-Boy."
msgstr ""
"Une holobande contenant des informations médicales. Peut être utilisée pour "
"entrer des informations dans votre Pip-Boy."

#: game/pro_item.msg:19100
msgid "Security Disk"
msgstr "Disque de sécurité"

#: game/pro_item.msg:19101
msgid ""
"A holotape with the writing \"Security Log\" on the label. You can use it to "
"transfer the data it contains to your Pip-Boy."
msgstr ""
"Une holobande portant la mention \"Journal de sécurité\". Tu peux transférer "
"les données qu'elle contient vers ton Pip-Boy."

#: game/pro_item.msg:19200
msgid "Alpha Experiment Disk"
msgstr "Disque sur l'expérience Alpha"

#: game/pro_item.msg:19201
msgid "The label on this holotape reads: \"Alpha Experiment Log\""
msgstr "Cette holobande porte la mention : \"Journal de l'expérience Alpha\""

#: game/pro_item.msg:19300
msgid "Delta Experiment Disk"
msgstr "Disque sur l'expérience Delta"

#: game/pro_item.msg:19301
msgid "The label on this holotape reads: \"Delta Experiment Log\""
msgstr "Cette holobande porte la mention : \"Journal de l'expérience Delta\""

#: game/pro_item.msg:19400
msgid "Vree's Experiment Disk"
msgstr "Disque sur les expériences de Vree"

#: game/pro_item.msg:19401
msgid ""
"This holotape has been updated with medical evidence from Vree of the BoS. "
"It can be used to transfer the data to your Pip-Boy."
msgstr ""
"Cette holobande a été mise à jour avec la découverte de Vree concernant le "
"BoS. Tu peux transférer les données qu'elle contient vers ton Pip-Boy."

#: game/pro_item.msg:19500
msgid "Brotherhood Honor Code"
msgstr "Code d'honneur de la Confrérie"

#: game/pro_item.msg:19501
msgid ""
"A holotape, with a rough symbol of the Brotherhood of Steel inscribed on it. "
"Use the tape to transfer the data to your Pip-Boy."
msgstr ""
"Une holobande comportant une représentation vague du symbole de la Confrérie "
"de l'Acier. Utilisez cette bande pour transférer les données qu'elle "
"contient vers votre Pip-Boy."

#: game/pro_item.msg:19600
msgid "Mutant Transmissions"
msgstr "Transmissions des mutants"

#: game/pro_item.msg:19601
msgid ""
"This holotape looks like it was set to record audio data from a radio. Use "
"the tape to transfer the information to your Pip-Boy."
msgstr ""
"Cette holobande semble avoir été utilisée pour enregistrer des transmissions "
"radio. Utilisez cette bande pour transférer les données qu'elle contient "
"vers votre Pip-Boy."

#: game/pro_item.msg:19700 game/pro_item.msg:19800 game/pro_item.msg:19900
#: game/pro_item.msg:20000 game/pro_item.msg:20100 game/pro_item.msg:20200
#: game/pro_item.msg:20300 game/pro_item.msg:20400 game/pro_scen.msg:42400
#: game/pro_scen.msg:42500 game/pro_scen.msg:42600 game/pro_scen.msg:42700
#: game/scrname.msg:312 game/scrname.msg:436 game/scrname.msg:559
#: game/scrname.msg:560 game/scrname.msg:561 game/scrname.msg:562
#: game/scrname.msg:638 game/scrname.msg:640 game/scrname.msg:641
#: game/scrname.msg:648 game/scrname.msg:682 game/scrname.msg:758
#: game/scrname.msg:812 game/scrname.msg:813 game/scrname.msg:814
#: game/scrname.msg:837 game/scrname.msg:902 game/scrname.msg:1002
#: game/scrname.msg:1003 game/scrname.msg:1017 game/scrname.msg:1018
#: game/scrname.msg:1019 game/scrname.msg:1031 game/scrname.msg:1057
