#: game/scrname.msg:1242 game/scrname.msg:1275 game/scrname.msg:1276
#: game/scrname.msg:1361 game/scrname.msg:1362
msgid "Box"
msgstr "Boîte"

#: game/pro_item.msg:20501
msgid ""
"A flare. Creates light for a short period of time. The paper is a little "
"worn, but otherwise it is in good condition. It is lit."
msgstr ""
"Une fusée éclairante. Produit de la lumière pour une courte période. Le "
"carton est un peu écorné, mais elle est en bon état. Elle est allumée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:20601
msgid ""
"A high explosive, consisting of nitroglycerin mixed with the absorbent "
"substance kieselguhr. Includes a timer, which is ticking."
msgstr ""
"Un explosif puissant, composé de nitroglycérine mélangée avec de la "
"substance absorbante à base de kiselguhr. Comprend une minuterie, qui est "
"activée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:20701
msgid ""
"A Wattz Electronics C-Radz model Geiger Counter. Detects the presence and "
"strength of radiation fields. It is on."
msgstr ""
"Un compteur Geiger Wattz Electronics, modèle C-Radz. Cet appareil détecte et "
"indique le taux des radiations. Il est activé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:20801
msgid ""
"A Wattz Electronics C-U model motion sensor. Detects the movement of "
"biological material over a distance of meters using a tuned radar device. It "
"is on."
msgstr ""
"Un détecteur de mouvements Wattz Electronics, modèle C-U. Détecte les "
"mouvements des créatures biologiques sur plusieurs mètres à la ronde grâce à "
"un radar spécialement conçu. Il est activé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:20901
msgid ""
"A chunk of Cordex, a military brand of plastic explosives. Highly stable, "
"very destructive. Includes a timer, which is ticking."
msgstr ""
"Un morceau de Cordex, une marque militaire d'explosifs au plastic. Très "
"stable, très dévastateur. Comprend une minuterie, qui est activée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:21101
msgid "You see Ed. Ed's dead."
msgstr "Tu vois Ed. Il est mort."

#: game/pro_item.msg:21201
msgid "You are bartering for Tandi's release."
msgstr "Tu marchandes pour libérer Tandi."

#: game/pro_item.msg:21300
msgid "Remains of Gizmo"
msgstr "Restes de Gizmo"

#: game/pro_item.msg:21301
msgid "Gizmo, former crime boss of Junktown, is dead. And pretty stinky, too."
msgstr ""
"Gizmo, ancien patron de Dépôtville est mort. Il ne sent plus très bon non "
"plus."

#: game/pro_item.msg:21401
msgid "A desk. After further observation, you decide that it is still a desk."
msgstr ""
"Un bureau. Après un examen approfondi, tu constates qu'il s'agit bien d'un "
"bureau."

#: game/pro_item.msg:21500
msgid "Brotherhood History"
msgstr "Histoire de la Confrérie"

#: game/pro_item.msg:21501
msgid ""
"A holotape containing information relating to the Brotherhood of Steel. Can "
"be used to enter information into your Pip-Boy 2000."
msgstr ""
"Une holobande comportant des informations sur la Confrérie de l'Acier. Peut "
"être utilisée pour entrer des informations dans votre Pip-Boy."

#: game/pro_item.msg:21600
msgid "Maxson's History"
msgstr "Histoire de Maxson"

#: game/pro_item.msg:21700
msgid "Maxson's Journal"
msgstr "Journal de Maxson"

#: game/pro_item.msg:21800
msgid "Light Healing"
msgstr "Légère guérison"

#: game/pro_item.msg:21801
msgid "Barter for this option if you want light healing."
msgstr "Négociez cette option si tu souhaites bénéficier d'une guérison légère."

#: game/pro_item.msg:21900
msgid "Medium Healing"
msgstr "Guérison moyenne"

#: game/pro_item.msg:21901
msgid "Barter for this option if you want medium healing."
msgstr ""
"Négociez cette option si tu souhaites bénéficier d'une guérison moyenne."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22000
msgid "Heavy Healing"
msgstr "Grande guérison"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22001
msgid "Barter for this option if you want lots of care and heavy healing."
msgstr ""
"Négociez cette option si tu souhaites bénéficier de soins attentifs et d'une "
"grande guérison."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22100
msgid "Security Card"
msgstr "Carte de sécurité"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22101
msgid ""
"A keycard with a security level encoded within it's very simple electronics."
msgstr ""
"Une carte de sécurité avec code secret dans un système électronique très "
"simple."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22200
msgid "Field Switch"
msgstr "Interrupteur de champ"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22201
msgid ""
"An electronic transmission device, with a very simple, and large, toggle "
"button. It looks like it was recently made and designed for very large hands."
msgstr ""
"Un appareil de transmission électronique avec un gros bouton de bascule très "
"simple. Il semble avoir été conçu récemment pour de très grosses mains."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22300
msgid "Yellow Pass Key"
msgstr "Passe jaune"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22301 game/pro_item.msg:30501
msgid "An electronic security key, color coded yellow."
msgstr "Une clé de sécurité électronique utilisant le code de couleur jaune."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22400
msgid "Small Statuette"
msgstr "Petite statuette"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22401
msgid ""
"You think this might be a carving of the \"Pip-Boy\" but you can't be sure."
msgstr ""
"Tu penses qu'il s'agit d'une statuette du \"Pip-Boy\" mais tu n'en as pas la "
"certitude."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22500
msgid "Cat's Paw Magazine"
msgstr "Magazine 'Cat's Paw'"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22501
msgid "An issue of Cat's Paw magazine."
msgstr "Un numéro du magazine Cat's Paw."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22600
msgid "Box Of Noodles"
msgstr "Boîte de nouilles"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22601
msgid "You have no idea what \"Instant Spaghetti\" means."
msgstr "Tu vas redécouvrir le sens de « spaghettis prêts à consommer »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22700
msgid "Small Dusty Box Of Some Sort"
msgstr "Espèce de petite boîte poussiéreuse"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22701
msgid ""
"A television dinner. You're not sure, but it's definitely not edible. You're "
"not quite sure if it ever was."
msgstr ""
"Un en-cas à consommer devant la télé. Tu ne sais pas exactement ce que c'est "
"mais en tout cas ce n'est plus comestible. On peut se demander si ça l'a "
"jamais été."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22800
msgid "Technical Manual"
msgstr "Manuel technique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22801
msgid "A technical repair manual on the T-51b Power Armor."
msgstr "Un manuel technique pour la réparation de la SuperArmure T5-51b."

#: game/pro_item.msg:22900
msgid "Small Piece Of Machinery"
msgstr "Petite pièce mécanique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:22901
msgid ""
"Some mechanical component for a machine. If a machine is missing one of "
"these, then it's a safe bet it isn't working properly."
msgstr ""
"Tu regardes un motivateur systolique. Cette pièce peu commune est très "
"petite."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23000
msgid "Vault Records"
msgstr "Enregistrements de l'Abri"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23001
msgid ""
"A compendium of events and important recordings from a Vault computer "
"system. Possibly damaged."
msgstr ""
"Une combinaison d'événements et d'enregistrements importants issus d'un "
"ordinateur de l'Abri. Probablement endommagée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23100
msgid "Military Base Security Code"
msgstr "Code de sécurité de la base militaire"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23200
msgid "Hardened Power Armor"
msgstr "SuperArmure renforcée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23201
msgid ""
"A suit of T-51b Power Armor. The hardening process has improved the "
"defensive capability of this high-tech armor system."
msgstr ""
"Une SuperArmure T-51b. Les renforts ont permis d'améliorer les capacités "
"défensives de cette armure de pointe."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23300
msgid "Turbo Plasma Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil à turbo-plasma"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23301
msgid ""
"A modified Winchester P94 plasma rifle. The plasma bolt chamber has been "
"hotwired to accelerate the bolt formation process. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil à plasma Winchester modèle P94 modifié. La chambre à plasma a été "
"complétée avec un conducteur actif pour accélérer la formation des éclairs. "
"FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23400
msgid "Spiked Knuckles"
msgstr "Protections aiguisées"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23401
msgid ""
"An improved version of the classic Brass Knuckles. The Spiked Knuckles do "
"more damage, tearing into the flesh of your opponent in unarmed combat. Min "
"ST: 1."
msgstr ""
"Une version améliorée des protections en cuivre. Les protections aiguisées "
"font davantage de dégâts et permettent d'arracher des lambeaux de chair "
"pendant les combats au Corps à Corps. FO min. : 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23500
msgid "Power Fist"
msgstr "SuperPoing"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23501
msgid ""
"A \"Big Frigger\" Power Fist from BeatCo. Considered by many to be the "
"ultimate weapon to use in unarmed combat. Others are just scared. Powered by "
"small energy cells. Min ST: 1."
msgstr ""
"Un SuperPoing « Big Frigger » de chez BeatCo. Souvent considéré comme l'arme "
"ultime pour le combat au Corps à Corps. Les adversaires sont terrorisés. "
"Alimenté par de petites cellules énergétiques. FO min. : 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23600
msgid "Combat Knife"
msgstr "Couteau de combat"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23601
msgid ""
"A high-quality combat knife, the Stallona is from SharpWit, Inc. The edge of "
"this blade is guaranteed sharp for over a decade of use! Min ST: 2."
msgstr ""
"Un couteau de combat haute qualité. Le Stallona est fabriqué par SharpWit, "
"Inc. Le fil de cette lame est garanti coupant pendant plus de dix ans ! FO "
"min. : 2."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23700
msgid "Chemistry Journals"
msgstr "Les Journaux de la Chimie"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23701
msgid ""
"A random pile of literature regarding the field of Chemistry. The papers on "
"Molecular Chemistry are particularly interesting."
msgstr ""
"Une pile de divers documents concernant la chimie. Les travaux de chimie "
"moléculaire sont particulièrement intéressants."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23800
msgid "Regulator Transmission"
msgstr "Transmission d'un régulateur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23801
msgid "A holotape recording of an audio transmission."
msgstr "Un enregistrement sur holobande d'une transmission audio."

#: game/pro_item.msg:23900
msgid "Brotherhood Armor"
msgstr "Armure de la Confrérie"

#: game/pro_item.msg:23901
msgid ""
"A superior version of Combat Armor. The Brotherhood of Steel have made many "
"improvements over the standard version."
msgstr ""
"Une version améliorée de l'armure de combat. La Confrérie de l'Acier a "
"apporté des modifications à la version standard."

#: game/pro_item.msg:24000
msgid "Tesla Armor"
msgstr "Armure Tesla"

#: game/pro_item.msg:24001
msgid ""
"This shining armor provides superior protection against energy attacks. The "
"three Tesla Attraction Coil Rods disperse a large percentage of directed "
"energy attacks."
msgstr ""
"Cette armure brillante offre une meilleure protection contre les attaques à "
"l'énergie. Les trois bobines conductrices à attraction Tesla renvoient une "
"proportion élevée des attaques à l'énergie."

#: game/pro_item.msg:24100
msgid ".223 Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet calibre .223"

#: game/pro_item.msg:24101
msgid ""
"A .223 rifle modified and cut down to a pistol. This is a one-of-a-kind "
"firearm, obviously made with love and skill. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil calibre .223 modifié et scié au format pistolet. C'est une arme "
"unique en son genre, visiblement travaillée avec amour et savoir-faire. FO "
"min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:24200
msgid "Combat Shotgun"
msgstr "Fusil de combat"

#: game/pro_item.msg:24201
msgid ""
"A Winchester City-Killer 12-gauge combat shotgun, bullpup variant. In "
"excellent condition, it has the optional DesertWarfare environmental sealant "
"modification for extra reliability. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de combat Winchester City-Killer calibre 12, version bullpup. En "
"parfait état, il est équipé en outre de l'option d'isolation de "
"l'environnement DesertWarfare pour une fiabilité accrue. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:24300 game/pro_item.msg:24400 game/pro_item.msg:24800
#: game/pro_item.msg:24900 game/pro_scen.msg:36500 game/pro_scen.msg:37200
#: game/pro_scen.msg:204900 game/pro_scen.msg:205000 game/pro_scen.msg:205100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:205200 game/pro_scen.msg:206100 game/pro_scen.msg:206200
#: game/pro_scen.msg:206300 game/pro_scen.msg:206400
msgid "Pot"
msgstr "Poterie"

#: game/pro_item.msg:24301 game/pro_item.msg:24401 game/pro_item.msg:24801
#: game/pro_item.msg:24901 game/pro_scen.msg:37201
msgid "A finely crafted clay pot."
msgstr "Superbe pot en argile."

#: game/pro_item.msg:24500 game/scrname.msg:115 game/scrname.msg:124
#: game/scrname.msg:859
msgid "Chest"
msgstr "Coffre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:24501
msgid "A wooden chest."
msgstr "Un coffre en bois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:24600 game/pro_item.msg:24700 game/scrname.msg:1469
msgid "Shelf"
msgstr "Etagère"

#: game/pro_item.msg:24601 game/pro_item.msg:24701
msgid "A wood shelf with miscellaneous items."
msgstr "Une étagère en bois comportant différents objets."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25001
msgid "A pile of human bones."
msgstr "Une pile d'ossements humains."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25100
msgid "Anna's Bones"
msgstr "Os d'Anna"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25101
msgid "These bones seem unsettled."
msgstr "Ces ossements ont été dérangés."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25200
msgid "Anna's Gold Locket"
msgstr "Médaillon en or d'Anna"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25201
msgid "This well-worn golden locket opens to reveal a charming picture."
msgstr "Ce médaillon en or très usé s'ouvre sur un charmant portrait."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25300
msgid "Fuel Cell Controller"
msgstr "Contrôleur de transmission"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25301
msgid ""
"This chip controls the flow of power into a car's electric engines. Many "
"drivers quickly burnt out this chip through frequent rapid acceleration. "
"Still a valuable part to have-- if you only had a car to install it in."
msgstr ""
"Cette puce contrôle le débit d'énergie dans un moteur électrique de voiture. "
"De nombreux conducteurs la cramaient à force d'appuyer sur le champignon. "
"C'est une pièce qui garde de sa valeur... tant qu'on a la voiture qui va "
"avec."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25400
msgid "Fuel Cell Regulator"
msgstr "Régulateur de carburant"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25401
msgid ""
"Some car-owners installed this regulator, which doubles your car's mileage "
"between charges, but most drivers didn't care how much juice their cars "
"consumed, after all, power's cheap and plentiful so why worry?"
msgstr ""
"Certains propriétaires installaient ce régulateur qui double la distance que "
"parcourt une voiture entre deux mises en charge, mais la plupart se "
"fichaient du jus que leur bagnole consommait : on en aura toujours plein de "
"toute façon, hein, pas vrai ?"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25500
msgid "Day Pass"
msgstr "Passe pour un jour"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25501
msgid ""
"This slightly crumpled piece of paper grants you access to all areas of "
"Vault City, except the Vault itself, during daylight hours only."
msgstr ""
"Ce bout de papier un peu froissé te donne accès à toute la Cité de l'Abri, "
"excepté l'Abri lui-même, pendant la journée seulement."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25600
msgid "False Citizenship Papers"
msgstr "Faux papiers de citoyen"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25601
msgid ""
"This is a set of false Citizenship Papers. They look authentic enough, but "
"you doubt they could pass a serious inspection."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu de faux papiers de citoyenneté. Ils ont l'air authentiques, mais tu "
"doutes qu'ils trompent un examinateur attentif."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25700
msgid "Cornelius' Gold Watch"
msgstr "Montre en or de Cornélius"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25701
msgid ""
"This is an ancient time-piece known as a pocket watch. Time ran out for this "
"keepsake, many long years ago."
msgstr ""
"On appelle cet objet du temps jadis une montre de gousset. Le temps a "
"rattrapé cette antiquité il y a déjà bien longtemps."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25800
msgid "Hydroelectric Part"
msgstr "Pièce hydroélectrique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25801
msgid "This is a Hydroelectric Magnetosphere Regulator."
msgstr "Il s'agit d'un régulateur de magnétosphère hydroélectrique."

#: game/pro_item.msg:25900
msgid "Jet"
msgstr "Jet"

#: game/pro_item.msg:25901
msgid ""
"Jet is a powerful methamphetamine that stimulates the central nervous "
"system. The initial euphoric rush rarely lasts more than a few minutes, but "
"during that time, the user is filled with a rush of energy & strength."
msgstr ""
"Le Jet est une méta amphétamine puissante stimulant le système nerveux "
"central. La montée initiale d'euphorie dure rarement plus de quelques "
"minutes. Pendant ce temps, l'utilisateur ressent une force et une euphorie "
"incroyables."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26000
msgid "Jet Antidote"
msgstr "Antidote contre le Jet"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26001
msgid "This antidote cures the Jet addiction."
msgstr "Cette antidote permet de guérir la dépendance au Jet."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26100
msgid "Jonny's BB Gun"
msgstr "Carabine de Jonny"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26101
msgid ""
"A Red Ryder BB gun with the name 'Jonny' scratched on the stock. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Une carabine à air Red Ryder. On a gravé tant bien que mal « Jonny » sur le "
"manche. FO min : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26200
msgid "Rubber Boots"
msgstr "Bottes en caoutchouc"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26201
msgid ""
"An old pair of sturdy rubber work boots. They look durable enough to keep "
"out sludge, at least for a while."
msgstr ""
"Une vieille paire de robustes bottes de chantier en caoutchouc. Elles "
"devraient rester étanches à la boue pendant quelque temps."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26300
msgid "Slag Message"
msgstr "Message crasseux"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26301
msgid ""
"This is a message from the leader of the Slags to the townspeople of Modoc."
msgstr "Un message du chef des Slags aux citadins de Modoc."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26400
msgid "Smith's Cool Item"
msgstr "L'objet cool de Smith"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26401
msgid "LONG DESCRIPTION HERE."
msgstr "DESCRIPTION LONGUE ICI."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26500
msgid "Combat Leather Jacket"
msgstr "Veste de combat en cuir"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26501
msgid ""
"This heavily padded leather jacket is unusual in that it has two sleeves. "
"You'll definitely make a fashion statement whenever, and wherever, you "
"rumble."
msgstr ""
"Cette veste en cuir dotée d'un épais rembourrage s'illustre surtout par le "
"fait qu'elle possède, chose inhabituelle, deux manches. Voilà qui va faire "
"de toi une vraie « fashion victim »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26600
msgid "Vic's Radio"
msgstr "Radio de Vic"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26601
msgid ""
"This hand-held radio doesn't work but it looks as though it's still in "
"pretty good condition. Some of its parts could probably be salvaged for use "
"in other radios."
msgstr ""
"Ce poste de radio portatif ne marche plus, mais il est encore en assez bon "
"état. Il serait sans doute possible d'en récupérer les pièces détachées pour "
"réparer d'autres radios."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26700
msgid "Vic's Water Flask"
msgstr "Fiole d'eau de Vic"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26701
msgid ""
"This relic of the Vault was probably used to contain some sacred sacrament. "
"The Holy number 13 is emblazoned on the side of this precious link to your "
"people's past, and hopeful future."
msgstr ""
"Cette relique de l'Abri contenait sans doute un sacrement. Le Saint nombre "
"13 est gravé sur un des côtés de cet objet qui te relie au passé de ton "
"peuple et, il faut l'espérer, à son avenir."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26800
msgid "H&K CAWS"
msgstr "H&K CAWS"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26801
msgid ""
"The CAWS, short for Close Assault Weapons System, shotgun is a useful tool "
"for close-range combat. The bullpup layout gives the weapon a short, easily "
"handleable, length while still retaining enough barrel length for its high "
"velocity shells. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Le fusil CAWS est un outil indispensable pour le combat rapproché. Sa "
"conception a permis d'obtenir une arme ramassée, facile à manier, mais au "
"canon assez long pour ses balles à haute vélocité. FO min : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:26900
msgid "Robot Parts"
msgstr "Pièces de robot"

#: game/pro_item.msg:26901
msgid "A pile of damaged robot parts."
msgstr "Une pile de pièces de robot endommagées."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27000
msgid "Robo Rocket Launcher"
msgstr "Lance-roquettes robotisé"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27001 game/pro_item.msg:27401
msgid "Only used by rocket equipped robots."
msgstr ""
"Utilisée uniquement par les robots équipés de lance-roquettes robotisés."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27100 game/scrname.msg:301
msgid "Broc Flower"
msgstr "Fleur de Broc"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27101
msgid "The plentiful flower that forms the base for the powder of healing."
msgstr "Ces fleurs abondantes servent à concocter la poudre de guérison."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27200 game/scrname.msg:302
msgid "Xander Root"
msgstr "Racine de Xandre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27201
msgid "The rare root that gives healing properties to the powder of healing."
msgstr "Cette racine rare apporte ses vertus curatives à la poudre de guérison."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27301
msgid ""
"A very powerful healing magic- though it will bring the feeling of sleep to "
"your head."
msgstr "Une puissante solution de guérison magique vaguement soporifique."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27400
msgid "Robo Rocket Ammo"
msgstr "Roquette pour robots"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27500
msgid "Trophy of Recognition"
msgstr "Trophée du mérite"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27501
msgid ""
"A solid gold trophy with the inscription \"To: Dave, From: DC's, For: Being "
"a Special Person.\""
msgstr ""
"Un solide trophée en or portant l'inscription « A : Dave, De : DC, Pour : "
"Une personne qui m'est chère. »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27600
msgid "Gecko Pelt"
msgstr "Peau de gecko"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27601
msgid "This is the dried and cured hide of a Gecko."
msgstr "La peau séchée et tannée d'un gecko."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27700
msgid "Golden Gecko Pelt"
msgstr "Peau de gecko doré"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27701
msgid "This is the dried and cured hide of a Golden Gecko."
msgstr "La peau séchée et tannée d'un gecko doré."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27800
msgid "Flint"
msgstr "Silex"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27801
msgid "A stone used to sharpen weapons."
msgstr "Une pierre utilisée pour aiguiser les armes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:27900
msgid "Neural Interface"
msgstr "Interface neuronale"

#: game/pro_item.msg:27901
msgid ""
"It appears to be a set of electrodes built into a head unit with a standard "
"computer interface plug. It's broken, however."
msgstr ""
"Ressemble à un jeu d'électrodes intégrées à une unité cérébrale et disposant "
"d'un connecteur informatique standard."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28000
msgid "Sharpened Spear"
msgstr "Lance aiguisée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28001
msgid ""
"A razor tipped polearm. The shaft is wooden, and the tip is sharpened steel. "
"Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Une perche avec un bout tranchant comme un rasoir. Le manche est en bois et "
"le bout est en acier aiguisé. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28100
msgid "Dixon's Eye"
msgstr "Oeil de Dixon"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28101
msgid ""
"A small jar containing a human eye suspended in some kind of liquid. The "
"label says Corporal Dixon."
msgstr ""
"Un petit bocal renfermant un oeil humain en suspension dans un liquide non "
"identifié. Caporal Dixon est inscrit sur une étiquette."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28200
msgid "Clifton's Eye"
msgstr "Oeil de Clifton"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28201
msgid ""
"A small jar containing a human eye suspended in some kind of liquid. The "
"label says General Clifton."
msgstr ""
"Un petit bocal renfermant un oeil humain en suspension dans un liquide non "
"identifié. Général Clifton est inscrit sur une étiquette."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28300
msgid "Tommy Gun"
msgstr "Mitraillette"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28301
msgid ""
"This Thompson M1928 submachine gun is a sinister looking weapon; every time "
"you hold it, you have an urge to put on a fedora hat and crack your "
"knuckles. The Thompson is well-fed by a large 50 round drum magazine. Min ST:"
" 6."
msgstr ""
"Cette mitraillette Thompson M1928 est une arme sinistre. Lorsqu'on la tient, "
"on est pris d'une irrésistible envie de mettre un chapeau mou et de faire "
"craquer nos articulations. La Thompson est bien alimentée par un large "
"magasin à tambour de 50 balles. FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28400
msgid "Meat Jerky"
msgstr "Viande séchée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28401
msgid ""
"These smoked and dried chunks of beast-flesh remain chewy-licious and even "
"somewhat nutritious for years, and years, and years...."
msgstr ""
"Ces lanières de chair animale fumée et séchée restent comestibles, voire "
"nutritives, pendant des années et des années... et des années..."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28500
msgid "Radscorpion Limbs"
msgstr "Pinces de radscorpion"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28501
msgid ""
"These Radscorpion pincers are hollowed out and have a strap with a broken "
"buckle at the end."
msgstr ""
"Ces pinces géantes de radscorpion ont été vidées et possèdent une lanière "
"avec une boucle afin de pouvoir les porter."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28600
msgid "Firewood"
msgstr "Bûches"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28601
msgid "A pile of firewood and kindling."
msgstr "Une pile de bûches et de fagots."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28700
msgid "Scoped Hunting Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil de chasse avec viseur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28701
msgid ""
"Nothing's better than seeing that surprised look on your target's face. The "
"Loophole x20 Scope on this hunting rifle makes it easier than ever before. "
"Accurate from first shot to last, no matter what kind of game you're gunning "
"for. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Il n'y a rien de mieux que de lire la surprise sur le visage de sa cible. Le "
"viseur Meurtrière x20 de ce fusil de chasse en facilite encore davantage "
"l'emploi. Précis du premier au dernier coup, quel que soit le gibier. FO. "
"min : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28800
msgid "Car Fuel Cell"
msgstr "Carburant pour voiture"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28801
msgid "A car fuel cell."
msgstr "Du carburant pour voiture."

#: game/pro_item.msg:28900 game/pro_scen.msg:37900 game/pro_scen.msg:38000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:38100
msgid "Shovel"
msgstr "Pelle"

#: game/pro_item.msg:28901
msgid "This is a shovel for digging ditches and stuff."
msgstr "Cette pelle permet de creuser des fossés etc."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29000
msgid "Robo Melee Weapon 1"
msgstr "Arme de Mêlée pour robot n°1"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29001
msgid "For Floating Eye Robot. Does Electrical Damage."
msgstr "Pour les robots à oeil flottant. Provoque des dégâts électriques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29100
msgid "Robo Melee Weapon 2"
msgstr "Arme de Mêlée pour robot n°2"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29101
msgid "For Floating Eye Robot. Does Electrical damage."
msgstr "Pour les robots à oeil flottant. Provoque des dégâts électriques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29200 game/pro_item.msg:49600
msgid "Boxing Gloves"
msgstr "Gants de boxe"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29201 game/pro_item.msg:49601
msgid ""
"A pair of boxing gloves that smell faintly of sweat. They look like they "
"have seen a lot of use: many old blood stains still remain."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de gants de boxe qui sentent encore la sueur. Ils semblent avoir "
"pas mal vécu : de nombreuses taches de sang sont encore visibles."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29300 game/pro_item.msg:49700
msgid "Plated Boxing Gloves"
msgstr "Gants de boxe renforcés"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29301 game/pro_item.msg:49701
msgid ""
"Someone has \"accidentally\" slipped metal plates into these boxing gloves. "
"It could technically be considered cheating, but you prefer to think of it "
"as an increased opportunity to dispense bone-crunching damage."
msgstr ""
"Quelqu'un a glissé par « mégarde » des plaques de métal dans ces gants de "
"boxe. Techniquement c'est de la triche mais d'un autre côté il est toujours "
"rassurant de savoir que l'on peut briser quelques os."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29400
msgid "Vault 13 Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque de l'Abri 13"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29401
msgid "A holodisk which supposedly has the location of Vault 13."
msgstr "Un holodisque qui est censé désigner l'emplacement de l'Abri 13."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29500
msgid "Cheezy Poofs"
msgstr "Cheezy Poofs"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29501
msgid "A box of cheese flavored puffs. They are extremely good."
msgstr "Une boîte de chips au fromage. Ca a l'air extrêmement bon."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29600
msgid "H&K P90c"
msgstr "H&K P90c"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29601
msgid ""
"The Heckler & Koch P90c was just coming into use at the time of the war. The "
"weapon's bullpup layout, and compact design, make it easy to control. The "
"durable P90c is prized for its reliability, and high firepower in a ruggedly-"
"compact package. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Le Heckler & Koch P90c est arrivé sur le marché peu avant la guerre. Cette "
"arme ramassée est d'un maniement très simple. Le P90c, robuste, est apprécié "
"pour sa fiabilité, sa puissance de feu et son encombrement réduit. Munitions "
": 10 mm. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29700
msgid "Metal Pole"
msgstr "Perche métallique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29701
msgid "It's a long metal pole. What did you expect?"
msgstr "Une longue perche métallique. Tu t'attendais à quoi ?"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29800
msgid "Trapper Town Key"
msgstr "Clé des portes de Trapper Town"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29801 game/pro_item.msg:41401
msgid "A standard key."
msgstr "Une clé standard."

#: game/pro_item.msg:29900
msgid "Pipe Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil à pipe"

#: game/pro_item.msg:29901
msgid "This is a hand-made single shot rifle. Min ST: 5."
msgstr "Ce fusil est fait main et tire au coup par coup. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30000
msgid "Zip Gun"
msgstr "Pistolet Zip"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30001
msgid "A handmade single shot pistol. Min ST: 4."
msgstr "Un pistolet fait main avec tir au coup par coup. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30100
msgid "Clipboard"
msgstr "Ecritoire"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30101
msgid "This is a clipboard with the coolant report."
msgstr "Cet écritoire comporte un rapport sur le liquide de refroidissement."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30200
msgid "Gecko Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque de Gecko"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30201
msgid ""
"The label on this holotape reads: \"Gecko Economic Data.\" It's difficult to "
"interpret most of the technical charts, tables, and formulae here, but the "
"majority of the information seems to highlight the advantages of a Vault "
"City -- Gecko alliance."
msgstr ""
"L'étiquette de cet holodisque porte l'inscription : « Disque de données "
"économiques de Gecko ». Les tableaux, les plans et les formules "
"mathématiques sont difficiles à interpréter, mais semblent souligner les "
"avantages d'une alliance entre Gecko et la Cité de l'Abri."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30300
msgid "Reactor Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque du réacteur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30301
msgid ""
"The label on this holotape reads: \"Gecko Reactor Performance Data.\" This "
"disk contains a string of numbers that mean nothing to you. There sure is a "
"lot of information here and it must be important to someone, somehow."
msgstr ""
"L'étiquette de cet holodisque porte l'inscription : « Gecko : Performances "
"du réacteur ». Si tu ne comprends rien à ces lignes interminables de "
"chiffres, il y a là beaucoup de données qui doivent donc être importantes "
"pour quelqu'un."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30400
msgid "Deck of \"Tragic\" Cards"
msgstr "Jeu de cartes « Tragic : The Garnering »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30401
msgid ""
"This is a deck of cards for a collectible card game. Looks like it could be "
"an expensive hobby if you got hooked."
msgstr ""
"Ce jeu de cartes fait partie d'une collection. Attention à ne pas devenir "
"accro à ce passe-temps onéreux."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30500
msgid "Yellow Reactor Keycard"
msgstr "Passe jaune du réacteur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30600
msgid "Red Reactor Keycard"
msgstr "Passe rouge du réacteur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30700
msgid "Plasma Transformer"
msgstr "Transformateur de plasma"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30701
msgid "This is a Three-step Plasma Transformer."
msgstr "Transformateur de plasma à trois voies."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30800
msgid "Super Tool Kit"
msgstr "Super kit à outils"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30801
msgid "An impressive tool set made by \"Snap-Off\"."
msgstr "Un kit impressionnant fabriqué par « Snap-Off »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:30900
msgid "Talisman"
msgstr "Talisman"

#: game/pro_item.msg:30901
msgid "A talisman which is worn by followers of The Brain."
msgstr "Un talisman porté par les disciples du Cerveau."

#: game/pro_item.msg:31000
msgid "Gamma Gulp Beer"
msgstr "Bière Gamma Gulp"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31001
msgid "A bottle of Gamma Gulp beer. It glows in the dark!"
msgstr ""
"Une bouteille de bière Gamma Gulp. Elle est phosphorescente dans le noir !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31100
msgid "Roentgen Rum"
msgstr "Rhum Roentgen"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31101
msgid "A bottle of Roentgen rum. It glows in the dark!"
msgstr "Une bouteille de rhum Roentgen. Elle est phosphorescente dans le noir !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31200
msgid "Part Requisition Form"
msgstr "Formulaire de réquisition de pièces"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31201
msgid "This is a Part Requisition Request form."
msgstr "Il s'agit d'un formulaire de réquisition de pièces."

#: game/pro_item.msg:31300
msgid ".44 Magnum Revolver"
msgstr "Revolver calibre .44 Magnum"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31301
msgid ""
"Being that this is the most powerful handgun in the world, and can blow your "
"head clean-off, you've got to ask yourself one question. Do I feel lucky? "
"Well, do ya punk?. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Vu que c'est l'arme de poing la plus puissante du monde et qu'elle peut "
"t'arracher la tête, tu as une question à te poser : est-ce que c'est mon "
"jour de chance ? Alors, crapule, à ton avis ?"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31400
msgid "Condom (Blue Package)"
msgstr "Préservatif (sachet bleu)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31401
msgid ""
"This is a Jimmy Hats brand condom, a very reliable brand. This one is ribbed "
"for her pleasure."
msgstr ""
"Préservatif de la marque Jimmy Hats, une très bonne marque. Nervuré pour "
"plus de sensations."

#: game/pro_item.msg:31500
msgid "Condom (Green package)"
msgstr "Préservatif (sachet vert)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31501
msgid ""
"This is a Jimmy Hats brand condom, a very reliable brand. This one contains "
"phosphorous green dye #2 and is slathered in spermicidal lubricant for added "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"Préservatif de la marque Jimmy Hats, une très bonne marque. Celui-ci "
"contient de la teinture vert phosphorescent n° 2 et a été imprégnée de "
"lubrifiant spermicide pour plus de sécurité."

#: game/pro_item.msg:31600
msgid "Condom (Red Package)"
msgstr "Préservatif (sachet rouge)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31601
msgid ""
"This is a Jimmy Hats brand condom, a very reliable brand. This one contains "
"phosphorous red dye #5 and has a yummy cinnamon bun flavor... or so you "
"heard."
msgstr ""
"Préservatif de la marque Jimmy Hats, une très bonne marque. Celui-ci "
"contient de la teinture rouge phosphorescente n°5 et a un goût alléchant de "
"petit pain à la cannelle... du moins à ce qu'il paraît."

#: game/pro_item.msg:31700
msgid "Cosmetics Case"
msgstr "Produits de beauté"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31701
msgid "This is a genuine Mary May brand cosmetics case."
msgstr "Véritable trousse de produits de beauté Mary May."

#: game/pro_item.msg:31800
msgid "Empty Hypodermic"
msgstr "Seringue hypodermique vide"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31801
msgid "This is an empty hypodermic."
msgstr "C'est une seringue hypodermique vide."

#: game/pro_item.msg:31900
msgid "Switchblade"
msgstr "Couteau à cran d'arrêt"

#: game/pro_item.msg:31901
msgid ""
"The blade of this small knife is held by a spring. When a button on the "
"handle is pressed, the blade shoots out with a satisfying \"Sssssshk\" "
"sound. Min ST: 1."
msgstr ""
"La lame de ce petit couteau est retenue par un ressort. Lorsque tu appuies "
"sur le bouton situé sur le côté du manche, la lame ressort en faisant un "
"petit « Cccchhhak » très plaisant. FO min. : 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32000
msgid "Sharpened Pole"
msgstr "Piquet aiguisé"

#: game/pro_item.msg:32001
msgid "A wood pole sharpened at one end. Min ST: 4."
msgstr "Un piquet en bois aiguisé à l'une de ses extrémités. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32101
msgid ""
"A human brain that has been enhanced by the addition of electronic and "
"robotic attachments."
msgstr ""
"Un cerveau humain qui a été amélioré en greffant des composants "
"électroniques et cybernétiques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32201
msgid "A typical human brain. Normally they are found in human skulls. Yuck."
msgstr ""
"Un cerveau humain ordinaire. Se trouve généralement dans les crânes humains. "
"Pouah."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32301
msgid "A monkey brain. It's soft and squishy."
msgstr "Un cerveau de singe. Mou au toucher."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32401
msgid ""
"Quite possibly a human brain. The color doesn't seem quite right and the "
"left hemisphere of the brain has caved in on itself."
msgstr ""
"Semble bien être un cerveau humain. La couleur est un peu bizarre et "
"l'hémisphère gauche s'est effondré."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32500
msgid "Dice"
msgstr "Dés"

#: game/pro_item.msg:32501
msgid ""
"A standard pair of gambling dice. It'd be cool to get a fuzzy pair for your "
"car."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de dés standard. Ce serait sympa d'en avoir une paire pour votre "
"voiture."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32600
msgid "Loaded Dice"
msgstr "Dés pipés"

#: game/pro_item.msg:32601
msgid "A pair of loaded dice. Don't be flashing these around the casino."
msgstr "Une paire de dés pipés. Evitez de les sortir dans un casino."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32700
msgid "Easter Egg"
msgstr "Oeuf de Pâques"

#: game/pro_item.msg:32701
msgid "This is a hard boiled chicken egg painted with colored dyes."
msgstr "Oeufs de poule durs, peints avec des couleurs chatoyantes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:32800
msgid "Magic 8-Ball"
msgstr "Boule de cristal 8"

#: game/pro_item.msg:32801
msgid ""
"This black sphere is some strange precognitive device... a small window on "
"the top seems to be able to predict the future! Pre-war humanity must have "
"been geniuses to invent such a wonder!"
msgstr ""
"Cette sphère noire est une espèce de mécanisme de prédiction... une petite "
"fenêtre sur le dessus semble permettre de lire l'avenir ! La civilisation d"
"'Avant-guerre devait vraiment être très avancée pour avoir produit une telle "
"merveille !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:32900 game/scrname.msg:558
msgid "Mutagenic Serum"
msgstr "Sérum mutagénique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:32901
msgid ""
"A strange organic concoction that could possibly reverse the Mutation Factor "
"in humans."
msgstr ""
"Une étrange décoction organique qui pourrait peut-être inverser le Facteur "
"de Mutation chez les êtres humains."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33000
msgid "Crashed Vertibird"
msgstr "Hélico écrasé"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33001
msgid ""
"This is wreckage from a vertibird. Looks like it crashed here months ago."
msgstr ""
"L'épave d'un verti. On dirait qu'il s'est écrasé il y a déjà plusieurs mois."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33100
msgid "Cat's Paw Issue #5"
msgstr "Magazine 'Cat's Paw' n° 5"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33101
msgid ""
"This is the hard to find Issue 5 of Cat's Paw magazine. The pictures aside, "
"this issue has a wonderful article on energy weapons."
msgstr ""
"Le numéro 5 de 'Cat's Paw' est devenu pratiquement introuvable. En dehors "
"des images, ce numéro a un article formidable sur les armes à énergie."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33200
msgid "M3A1 \"Grease Gun\" SMG"
msgstr "Mitraillette \"Grease Gun\" M3A1"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33201
msgid ""
"This submachine gun filled National Guard arsenals after the Army replaced "
"it with newer weapons. However, the \"Grease Gun\" was simple and cheap to "
"manufacture so there are still quite a few still in use. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Cette mitraillette, après sa réforme par l'armée, est allée remplir les "
"arsenaux de la Garde Nationale. Mais le « Grease Gun » était simple et peu "
"coûteux à fabriquer, de sorte qu'on en voit encore pas mal en circulation. "
"FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33300
msgid "Heart Pills"
msgstr "Pilules pour le coeur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33301
msgid "These pills are used by people with heart problems."
msgstr "Ces pilules sont destinées aux personnes cardiaques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33401
msgid "A hypodermic needle full of powerful poison."
msgstr "Une seringue hypodermique pleine de poison."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33500 game/pro_item.msg:33600
msgid "Moore's Briefcase"
msgstr "Valise de Moore"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33501 game/pro_item.msg:33601
msgid ""
"Thomas Moore asked you to take this brahmin hide briefcase to the Bishop "
"family in New Reno. It is securely locked, and you can't seem to open it."
msgstr ""
"Thomas Moore t'a demandé d'apporter cette valise en peau de Brahmine aux "
"Bishop à New Reno. Elle est fermée à clé, et tu n'arrives pas à l'ouvrir."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33700
msgid "Lynette Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque de Lynette"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33701
msgid "This is the holodisk you got from Lynette."
msgstr "Lynette t'a transmis cet holodisque."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33800
msgid "Westin Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque de Westin"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33801
msgid "This is the holodisk you got from Westin."
msgstr "Westin t'a transmis cet holodisque."

#: game/pro_item.msg:33900
msgid "NCR Spy Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque d'espionnage"

#: game/pro_item.msg:33901
msgid ""
"This holodisk contains reports of NCR caravan schedules and security "
"information. It's addressed to Darion and signed \"F\". With this info, it's "
"easy to see how the raiders have avoided capture."
msgstr ""
"Cet holodisque comporte les horaires des caravanes RNC ainsi que toutes les "
"informations sur la sécurité. Il est adressé à Darion et signé « F ». Avec "
"ce genre d'informations, on comprend comment les pillards ont pu échapper à "
"la justice."

#: game/pro_item.msg:34000
msgid "Doctor's Papers"
msgstr "Papiers du médecin"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34001
msgid ""
"A set of very detailed plans for a Cybernetic Canine Guard Unit. With this "
"and the right facilities, a person just might be able to build a robo-dog."
msgstr ""
"Les plans d'une Unité de Garde Canine Cybernétique. Muni de ces plans et du "
"laboratoire adéquat, on peut construire un robochien."

#: game/pro_item.msg:34100
msgid "Presidential Pass"
msgstr "Passe présidentiel"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34101
msgid ""
"The bearer of this document is Security Clearance A-Prime as authorized by "
"the authority of the President of the New California Republic. It's signed "
"by President Tandi."
msgstr ""
"Ce document, qui atteste que le porteur est titulaire d'une Autorisation A-1 "
"sous l'autorité de la Présidence de la République de la Nouvelle Californie, "
"porte la signature de la présidente Tandi."

#: game/pro_item.msg:34200
msgid "Ranger Pin"
msgstr "Code commando"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34201
msgid ""
"This pin says you're an official New California Ranger. Look -- it's got a "
"code wheel and everything!"
msgstr ""
"Ce badge atteste que tu es Commando en Nouvelle Californie. Regarde, il a "
"même une fermeture à code !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34300
msgid "Ranger's Map"
msgstr "Carte de commando"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34301
msgid ""
"A map of the surrounding area -- it won't help you much -- but there are "
"code names on it for the Ranger safe houses in the north."
msgstr ""
"Une carte des environs qui ne te sert pas à grand-chose... sauf qu'elle "
"comporte les noms de code des repaires dont disposent les Commandos dans le "
"Nord."

#: game/pro_item.msg:34400 game/pro_item.msg:34500 game/pro_item.msg:34600
#: game/pro_item.msg:34700 game/pro_item.msg:37400 game/pro_item.msg:37500
#: game/pro_item.msg:37600 game/pro_scen.msg:101200
msgid "Gravesite"
msgstr "Cimetière"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34800
msgid "Advanced Power Armor"
msgstr "SuperArmure avancée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34801
msgid ""
"This powered armor is composed of lightweight metal alloys, reinforced with "
"ceramic castings at key points. The motion-assist servo-motors appear to be "
"high quality models as well."
msgstr ""
"Cette armure est faite d'un alliage léger renforcé d'un revêtement en "
"céramique au niveau des points sensibles. Les servomoteurs d'aide aux "
"mouvements semblent de toute première qualité."

#: game/pro_item.msg:34900
msgid "Adv. Power Armor MKII"
msgstr "SuperArmure avancée Mk II"

#: game/pro_item.msg:34901
msgid ""
"This powered armor appears to be composed of entirely of lightweight ceramic "
"composites rather than the usual combination of metal and ceramic plates. It "
"seems as though it should give even more protection than the standard "
"Advanced Power Armor."
msgstr ""
"Cette armure paraît entièrement faite de céramique composite légère plutôt "
"que de la combinaison habituelle de métal et de plaques de céramique. Elle "
"semble fournir une protection encore meilleure que la SuperArmure avancée "
"ordinaire."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35000
msgid "Bozar"
msgstr "Bozar"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35001
msgid ""
"The ultimate refinement of the sniper's art. Although, somewhat finicky and "
"prone to jamming if not kept scrupulously clean, the big weapon's accuracy "
"more than makes up for its extra maintenance requirements. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Le raffinement ultime dans l'art du sniper. Fragile et prompte à s'enrayer, "
"cette arme massive rachète la difficulté de son entretien laborieux par une "
"précision sans faille. FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35100
msgid "FN FAL"
msgstr "FN FAL"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35101
msgid ""
"This rifle has been more widely used by armed forces than any other rifle in "
"history. It's a reliable assault weapon for any terrain or tactical "
"situation. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Ce fusil d'assaut a été le plus utilisé au monde par les forces armées. Il "
"convient à n'importe quel terrain et à n'importe quelle situation. FO min. : "
"5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35200
msgid "H&K G11"
msgstr "H&K G11"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35201
msgid ""
"This gun revolutionized assault weapon design. The weapon fires a caseless "
"cartridge consisting of a block of propellant with a bullet buried inside. "
"The resultant weight and space savings allow this weapon to have a very high "
"magazine capacity. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Fusil d'assaut. Il tire des cartouches sans étui qui se composent d'un bloc "
"de poudre propulsive dans lequel est enchâssée une balle. L'économie de "
"poids et d'espace qui en résulte a permis d'augmenter le nombre de munitions "
"dans le chargeur. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35300
msgid "XL70E3"
msgstr "XL70E3"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35301
msgid ""
"This was an experimental weapon at the time of the war. Manufactured, "
"primarily, from high-strength polymers, the weapon is almost indestructible. "
"It's light, fast firing, accurate, and can be broken down without the use of "
"any tools. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Une arme encore expérimentale au moment de la guerre. Faite principalement "
"de polymères à haute résistance, elle est pratiquement indestructible, "
"légère, rapide, précise, et démontable sans le moindre outil. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35400
msgid "Pancor Jackhammer"
msgstr "Marteau-piqueur Pancor"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35401
msgid ""
"The Jackhammer, despite its name, is an easy to control shotgun, even when "
"fired on full automatic. The popular bullpup design, which places the "
"magazine behind the trigger, makes the weapon well balanced & easy to "
"control. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Le Marteau-piqueur, malgré son nom, est un fusil de chasse facile à manier, "
"même en mode automatique. Très ramassé, avec son chargeur installé juste "
"derrière la gâchette, il est bien équilibré. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35500
msgid "Light Support Weapon"
msgstr "Arme de support légère"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35501
msgid ""
"This squad-level support weapon has a bullpup design. The bullpup design "
"makes it difficult to use while lying down. Because of this it was remanded "
"to National Guard units. It, however, earned a reputation as a reliable "
"weapon that packs a lot of punch for its size. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Cette arme de soutien balistique est d'une utilisation difficile en position "
"couchée, ce qui explique qu'on l'ait réservée à la Garde Nationale. Elle a "
"toutefois acquis une réputation de fiabilité et de grande puissance pour sa "
"taille réduite. FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35600
msgid "Computer Voice Module"
msgstr "Module de voix synthétique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35601
msgid ""
"A circuit board with several unidentifiable parts, a microphone, and an "
"inscription that reads \"Vault-Tec Voice Recognition Module.\""
msgstr ""
"Un circuit imprimé dont tu n'arrives pas à identifier plusieurs composants, "
"un micro, et une inscription : « Module de reconnaissance vocale Vault-Tek »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35700
msgid ".45 Caliber"
msgstr "Calibre .45"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35701
msgid "Ammunition. .45 Caliber."
msgstr "Munitions. Calibre .45."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35800
msgid "2mm EC"
msgstr "EC de 2 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35801
msgid "Ammunition."
msgstr "Munitions. Balles précises et perforantes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:35900
msgid "4.7mm Caseless"
msgstr "4,7 mm sans douille"

#: game/pro_item.msg:35901
msgid "Ammunition. Caliber: 4.7mm, caseless."
msgstr "Munitions. Calibre : 4,7 mm, sans douille."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36000 game/proto.msg:312
msgid "9mm"
msgstr "9 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:36001
msgid "Ammunition. Caliber: 9mm."
msgstr "Munitions. Calibre : 9 mm."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36100
msgid "HN Needler Cartridge"
msgstr "Cartouches HN Needler"

#: game/pro_item.msg:36101
msgid ""
"Ammunition. This cartridge appears to be ammo for the HN Needler Pistol. "
"Each 'bullet' is a small hypodermic designed to inject a target with its "
"contents upon impact."
msgstr ""
"Munitions. Cette cartouche est utilisable avec le pistolet à aiguilles HN. "
"Les 'cartouches' sont en fait des seringues hypodermiques conçues pour "
"injecter leur contenu au point d'impact."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36200
msgid "HN AP Needler Cartridge"
msgstr "Cartouches HN Needler perforantes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:36201
msgid ""
"Ammunition. This cartridge appears to be armor-piercing ammo for the HN "
"Needler Pistol. The hypodermic tips are made of a strange alloy and are "
"incredibly sharp."
msgstr ""
"Munitions. Cette cartouche semble être une version perforante, utilisable "
"avec le pistolet à aiguilles HN. Les extrémités hypodermiques utilisent un "
"alliage étrange et sont incroyablement effilées."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36300 game/proto.msg:318
msgid "7.62mm"
msgstr "7,62 mm"

#: game/pro_item.msg:36301
msgid "Ammunition. Caliber: 7.62mm."
msgstr "Munitions. Calibre : 7,62 mm."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36400
msgid "Robot Motivator"
msgstr "Motivateur de robot"

#: game/pro_item.msg:36401
msgid "This is the drive mechanism for a robot."
msgstr "Le mécanisme d'entraînement des robots."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36500 game/pro_item.msg:58300 game/pro_misc.msg:4900
msgid "Plant Spike"
msgstr "Graine de plante à spores pointue"

#: game/pro_item.msg:36501
msgid ""
"An organic seed-spike that the carnivorous plants spit at potential food or "
"seed carriers."
msgstr ""
"Des graines crachées par les plantes carnivores vers les proies potentielles "
"ou les porteurs de graines."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36600
msgid "G.E.C.K."
msgstr "J.E.K."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36601
msgid ""
"The Garden of Eden Creation Kit. This unit is standard equipment for all "
"Vault-Tec vaults. A GECK is the resource for rebuilding civilization after "
"the bomb. Just add water and stir."
msgstr ""
"Jardin d'Eden en Kit. Cette unité se trouve dans tous les abris Vault-Tek. "
"Le JEK sert à rebâtir la civilisation après la bombe. Il suffit d'ajouter de "
"l'eau et de touiller."

#: game/pro_item.msg:36700 game/pro_item.msg:36800 game/pro_item.msg:36900
#: game/pro_item.msg:37000
msgid "Ammo Crate"
msgstr "Caisse de munitions"

#: game/pro_item.msg:37100 game/pro_item.msg:37101 game/pro_item.msg:37200
#: game/pro_item.msg:37201
msgid "Claw"
msgstr "Griffe"

#: game/pro_item.msg:37300
msgid "Vault 15 Keycard"
msgstr "Passe de l'Abri 15"

#: game/pro_item.msg:37700
msgid "Vault 15 Computer Parts"
msgstr "Composants informatiques de l'Abri 15"

#: game/pro_item.msg:37701
msgid ""
"Miscellaneous computer parts with various functions. A computer geek's dream."
msgstr ""
"Pièces détachées d'ordinateur de toutes sortes. Le rêve d'un mordu "
"d'informatique."

#: game/pro_item.msg:37800 game/scrname.msg:1230
msgid "Cookie"
msgstr "Biscuit"

#: game/pro_item.msg:37801
msgid "A chocolate chip cookie. Yum!"
msgstr "Un biscuit aux éclats de chocolat. Miam !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:37900
msgid "Leather Armor Mark II"
msgstr "Armure en cuir Modèle II"

#: game/pro_item.msg:37901
msgid ""
"An enhanced version of the basic leather armor with extra layers of "
"protection. Finely crafted from tanned brahmin hide."
msgstr ""
"Une version améliorée de l'armure de base en cuir, avec des couches de "
"protection supplémentaires. Fabriquée avec du cuir de Brahmine tanné et "
"patiemment travaillé."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38000
msgid "Metal Armor Mark II"
msgstr "Armure métallique Modèle II"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38001
msgid "Polished metal plates, finely crafted into a suit of armor."
msgstr ""
"Des plaques de métal polies forment une armure intégrale finement travaillée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38100
msgid "Combat Armor Mark II"
msgstr "Armure de combat Modèle II"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38200
msgid "Flamethrower Fuel MKII"
msgstr "Combustible Mk II pour lance-flammes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38201
msgid "This flamethrower fuel uses an advanced super-burn mix."
msgstr "Ce combustible utilise un mélange super inflammable très élaboré."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38300
msgid "Shiv"
msgstr "Surin"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38301
msgid ""
"This home-made knife is as dangerous as it is easily concealed. Its presence "
"can't be detected by others. Min ST: 1."
msgstr ""
"Ce couteau de fabrication artisanale est aussi dangereux que discret. On ne "
"peut pas le repérer. FO min. : 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38400
msgid "Wrench"
msgstr "Clé"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38401
msgid "A typical wrench used by mechanics. Min ST: 3."
msgstr "Une grosse clé généralement utilisée par les mécaniciens. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38500
msgid "Sawed-Off Shotgun"
msgstr "Fusil à canon scié"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38501
msgid ""
"Someone took the time to chop the last few inches off the barrel and stock "
"of this shotgun. Now, the wide spread of this hand-cannon's short-barreled "
"shots makes it perfect for short-range crowd control. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Quelqu'un a pris le temps de raccourcir de quelques centimètres le canon de "
"ce fusil de chasse. Les coups qu'il tire sont désormais suffisamment "
"dispersés pour en faire l'arme idéale du maintien de l'ordre. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38600
msgid "Louisville Slugger"
msgstr "Cogneur de Louisville"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38601
msgid ""
"This all-American, hardwood, baseball bat will knock anything right out of "
"the park. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Cette batte de baseball typiquement américaine en bois dur peut assommer "
"n'importe qui. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38700
msgid "M60"
msgstr "M60"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38701
msgid ""
"This relatively light machine gun was prized by militaries around the world "
"for its high rate of fire. This reliable, battlefield-proven design, was "
"used on vehicles and for squad level fire-support. Min ST: 7."
msgstr ""
"Cette mitrailleuse relativement légère faisait le bonheur des soldats du "
"monde entier pour sa vitesse de tir. On utilisait cette arme, qui a subi "
"l'épreuve du feu à maintes reprises, en couverture, ou montée sur un "
"véhicule. FO min. : 7."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38800
msgid "Needler Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet à aiguilles"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38801
msgid ""
"You suspect this Bringham needler pistol was once used for scientific field "
"studies. It uses small hard-plastic hypodermic darts as ammo. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Tu penses que ce pistolet à aiguilles Bringham a été utilisé pour des études "
"scientifiques sur le terrain. Ses munitions sont en fait de petites "
"fléchettes hypodermiques en plastique dur. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:38900
msgid "Avenger Minigun"
msgstr "Minigun Avenger"

#: game/pro_item.msg:38901
msgid ""
"Rockwell designed the Avenger as the replacement for their aging CZ53 "
"Personal Minigun. The Avenger's design improvements include improved, gel-"
"fin, cooling and chromium plated barrel-bores. This gives it a greater range "
"and lethality. Min ST: 7."
msgstr ""
"Rockwell a conçu l'Avenger comme le remplaçant du Mini-canon personnel CZ53. "
"Il dispose d'un système de refroidissement à ailettes et de canons chromés, "
"ce qui accroît sa puissance de feu et son efficacité. FO min. : 7."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39000
msgid "Solar Scorcher"
msgstr "Rôtisseur à énergie solaire"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39001
msgid ""
"Without the sun's rays to charge this weapon's capacitors this gun can't "
"light a match. However, in full daylight, the experimental photo-electric "
"cells that power the Scorcher allow it to turn almost anything into a crispy "
"critter. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Privée des rayons du soleil, cette arme n'allumerait pas une allumette. "
"Mais, en plein jour, les cellules photoélectriques expérimentales qui "
"l'alimentent en énergie lui permettent de griller à peu près n'importe quoi. "
"FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39100
msgid "H&K G11E"
msgstr "H&K G11E"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39101
msgid ""
"This gun revolutionized squad level support weapon design. The gun fires a "
"caseless cartridge consisting of a block of propellant with a bullet buried "
"inside. The resultant weight and space savings allow it to have a very high "
"magazine capacity. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Fusil de soutien. Il tire des cartouches sans étui qui se composent d'un "
"bloc de poudre propulsive dans lequel est enchâssée une balle. L'économie de "
"poids et d'espace qui en résulte a permis d'augmenter le nombre de munitions "
"dans le chargeur. FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39200
msgid "M72 Gauss Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil Gauss M72"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39201
msgid ""
"The M72 rifle is of German design. It uses an electromagnetic field to "
"propel rounds at tremendous speed... and pierce almost any obstacle. Its "
"range, accuracy and stopping power is almost unparalleled. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Le fusil M72, de fabrication allemande, se sert d'un champ électromagnétique "
"pour propulser ses cartouches à une vitesse incroyable... et perforer "
"n'importe quel obstacle. Sa portée, sa précision et sa puissance sont "
"inégalées. FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39300
msgid "Phazer"
msgstr "Phaseur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39301
msgid ""
"This mysterious high tech weapon appears to have some sort of energy "
"generator inside. If it wasn't damaged, this gun could be the ultimate "
"weapon against any enemy. The backup energy module consists of replaceable "
"small energy cell. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Cette arme d'une technologie mystérieuse semble avoir une sorte de "
"générateur d'énergie. Si elle n'était pas endommagée, ce serait l'arme "
"ultime. Le module d'énergie de secours se compose d'une petite pile "
"remplaçable. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39400
msgid "PPK12 Gauss Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet Gauss PPK12"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39401
msgid ""
"Praised for its range and stopping power, the PPK12 Gauss Pistol is of "
"German design. The pistol uses an electromagnetic field to propel rounds at "
"tremendous speed and punch through almost any armor. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Apprécié pour sa portée et sa puissance, le pistolet Gauss PPK12 est de "
"fabrication allemande. Il se sert d'un champ magnétique pour propulser ses "
"cartouches à une vitesse incroyable et perforer n'importe quelle armure. FO "
"min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39500
msgid "Vindicator Minigun"
msgstr "Minigun Vindicator"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39501
msgid ""
"The German Rheinmetal AG company created the ultimate minigun. The "
"Vindicator throws over 90,000 caseless shells per minute down its six carbon-"
"polymer barrels. As the pinnacle of Teutonic engineering skill, it is the "
"ultimate hand-held weapon. Min ST: 7."
msgstr ""
"La société allemande Rheinmetal AG a créé le minigun ultime. Le Vindicator "
"tire jusqu'à 90 000 cartouches à la minute par ses six canons en polymère de "
"carbone. Sommet de l'ingéniosité teutonne, il est l'arme de poing la plus "
"mortelle qui soit. FO min. : 7."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39600
msgid "YK32 Pulse Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet à impulsions YK32"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39601
msgid ""
"The YK32 is an electrical pulse weapon that was developed by the Yuma Flats "
"Energy Consortium. Though powerful, the YK32 was never considered a "
"practical weapon due to its inefficient energy usage and bulky design. Min "
"ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Le YK32 est une arme à impulsions électriques conçue par le Consortium Yuma "
"Flats Energy. Quoique puissant, le YK32 n'a pas convaincu, car gros "
"consommateur d'énergie et trop encombrant. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39700
msgid "YK42B Pulse Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil à impulsions YK42B"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39701
msgid ""
"The YK42B is an electrical pulse weapon that was developed by the Yuma Flats "
"Energy Consortium. It is considered a far superior weapon to the YK32 "
"pistol, having a greater charge capacity and range. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Le YK42B est une arme à impulsions électriques conçue par le Consortium Yuma "
"Flats Energy. Il est considéré comme une bien meilleure arme que le pistolet "
"YK32, du fait de sa meilleure capacité de charge et de sa portée supérieure. "
"FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39800
msgid ".44 Magnum (Speed Load)"
msgstr "Revolver calibre .44 Magnum (chargement rapide)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39801
msgid "A .44 Magnum Revolver with a speed loader. Min ST: 5."
msgstr "Un revolver calibre .44 Magnum avec chargeur rapide. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:39900
msgid "Super Cattle Prod"
msgstr "Super bâton d'élevage"

#: game/pro_item.msg:39901
msgid ""
"A Farmer's Best Friend model cattle prod from Wattz Electronics. This model "
"has been upgraded to increase the electrical discharge. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Un bâton d'élevage « Meilleur Ami du Fermier » de chez Wattz Electronics. Ce "
"modèle modifié délivre une décharge électrique plus puissante. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40000
msgid "Improved Flamer"
msgstr "Lance-flammes amélioré"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40001
msgid ""
"A Flambe 450 model flamethrower, varmiter variation. Fires a short spray of "
"extremely hot, flammable liquid. Requires specialized fuel to work properly. "
"This model has been modified to fire a hotter mixture which causes greater "
"combustibility. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Un lance-flammes Flambe-Tout modèle 450, variante Varmiter. Nécessite un "
"combustible spécial. Pulvérise et enflamme un court jet de liquide "
"inflammable. Ce modèle a été modifié pour mieux exploiter le combustible Mk "
"II. FO min : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40100
msgid "Laser Rifle (Ext. Cap.)"
msgstr "Fusil laser (Cap. Aug.)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40101
msgid ""
"This Wattz 2000 laser rifle has had its recharging system upgraded and a "
"special recycling chip installed that reduces the drain on the micro fusion "
"cell by 50%. Min ST: 6."
msgstr ""
"Ce fusil laser Wattz 2000 dispose d'un système de recharge amélioré et d'une "
"puce de recyclage spécifique qui réduit de 50% la quantité d'énergie "
"consommée par la cellule à micro fusion. FO min. : 6."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40200
msgid "Magneto-Laser Pistol"
msgstr "Pistolet magnéto-laser"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40201
msgid ""
"This Wattz 1000 laser pistol has been upgraded with a magnetic field "
"targeting system that tightens the laser emission, giving this pistol extra "
"penetrating power. Min ST: 3."
msgstr ""
"Ce pistolet laser Wattz 1000 dispose d'un système de visée à champ "
"magnétique qui réduit la dispersion du rayon laser et lui donne une force de "
"pénétration supérieure. FO min. : 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40300
msgid "FN FAL (Night Sight)"
msgstr "FN FAL (vision de nuit)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40301
msgid ""
"This rifle has been more widely used by armed forces than any other rifle in "
"history. It's a reliable assault weapon for any terrain or tactical "
"situation. This weapon has been equipped with a night sight for greater "
"night accuracy. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Ce fusil d'assaut a été le plus utilisé au monde par les forces armées. Il "
"convient à n'importe quel terrain et à n'importe quelle situation. Celui-ci "
"est équipé d'un viseur nocturne pour plus de précision dans l'obscurité. FO "
"min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40400
msgid "Desert Eagle (Exp. Mag.)"
msgstr "Desert Eagle (Exp. Mag.)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40401
msgid ""
"An ancient Desert Eagle pistol, in .44 Magnum. Interest in late 20th century "
"films made this one of the most popular handguns of all times. This one has "
"been equipped with an expanded magazine for longer fun and games! Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Ancien pistolet Desert Eagle, version .44 Magnum. Grâce aux films de la fin "
"du 20ème siècle, il est devenu l'un des pistolets les plus populaires de "
"tous les temps. Celui-ci est muni d'un chargeur surdimensionné, juste pour "
"rire ! FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40500
msgid "Assault Rifle (Exp. Mag.)"
msgstr "Fusil d'assaut (Exp. Mag.)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40501
msgid ""
"This Assault Rifle has an extended, military sized, ammunition clip. The "
"expanded magazine capacity makes it more fun than ever to Spray-and-Pray. "
"Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Ce fusil d'assaut a un chargeur surdimensionné de type militaire. Sa "
"capacité accrue rend son utilisation encore plus amusante. FO min. : 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40600
msgid "Plasma Pistol (Ext. Cap.)"
msgstr "Pistolet à plasma (Cap. Aug.)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40601
msgid ""
"This Glock 86 Plasma Pistol has had its magnetic housing chamber realigned "
"to reduce the drain on its energy cell. Its efficiency has doubled, allowing "
"it to fire more shots before the battery is expended. Min ST: 4."
msgstr ""
"Ce pistolet à plasma Glock 86 possède un chargeur magnétique modifié de "
"telle sorte qu'il épuise la cellule énergétique beaucoup moins vite. Son "
"efficacité est doublée. FO min. : 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40700
msgid "Mega Power Fist"
msgstr "Méga SuperPoing"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40701
msgid ""
"A \"Big Frigger\" Power Fist from BeatCo. Considered by many to be the "
"ultimate weapon to use in unarmed combat. This one has upgraded power servos "
"for increased strength. Powered by small energy cells. Min ST: 1."
msgstr ""
"Un SuperPoing « Fracasseur » de chez BeatCo, souvent considéré comme la "
"meilleure arme de combat au corp à corp. Les servomoteurs qu'il inclut "
"accroissent sa puissance. Alimenté par de petites cellules énergétiques. FO "
"min. : 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40800
msgid "Field Medic First Aid Kit"
msgstr "Trousse de secours pour médecin sur le terrain"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40801
msgid ""
"A small kit containing basic emergency medical equipment. Bandages, wraps, "
"antiseptic spray, and more."
msgstr ""
"Une trousse contenant tout l'équipement médical d'urgence de base. Bandages, "
"pansements, antiseptique etc."

#: game/pro_item.msg:40900
msgid "Paramedics Bag"
msgstr "Sac d'instruments médicaux"

#: game/pro_item.msg:40901
msgid ""
"This bag contains instruments and chems used by paramedics in the field. The "
"tools contained are specifically designed for high trauma and emergency "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"Ce sac permet de transporter tous les instruments et stimulants utilisés par "
"le personnel médical sur le terrain. Les instruments sont conçus "
"spécialement pour les traumatismes graves et les cas d'urgence."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41000
msgid "Expanded Lockpick Set"
msgstr "Jeu de passe-partout amélioré"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41001
msgid ""
"A set of locksmith tools. Includes all the necessary picks and tension "
"wrenches to open conventional pin and tumbler locks. This set also includes "
"some special tools for more difficult mechanical locking mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu d'outils de serrurerie. Comprend tous les pics et clés à enrouleur "
"nécessaires pour ouvrir les serrures à gorge ou à broche conventionnelles. "
"Ce jeu comprend également des outils spéciaux pour les mécanismes plus "
"difficiles."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41100
msgid "Electronic Lockpick MKII"
msgstr "Passe-partout électronique Mk II"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41101
msgid ""
"This is the second generation Wattz Electronics Micromanipulator FingerStuff "
"electronic lockpick. For defeating electronic locks and security devices. "
"This Mark II version includes updated software and interface tools."
msgstr ""
"La deuxième génération du passe-partout électronique Micromanipulator "
"FingerStuff de Wattz Electronics. Pour tous les problèmes de verrous "
"électroniques et systèmes de sécurité. La version modèle II comprend un "
"logiciel mis à niveau et des outils d'interfaçage."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41200
msgid "Oil Can"
msgstr "Bidon d'huile"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41201
msgid ""
"You see a can of Armor-Go. A space-age, polymer, lubricant for powered armor."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est un bidon d'Armor-Go. Un lubrifiant polymère pour les super armures "
"de l'époque interplanétaire."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41300
msgid "Stables ID Badge"
msgstr "Badge d'accès à l'étable"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41301
msgid ""
"This is a temporary ID badge. It has a red stripe through it, which seems to "
"indicate that you are a \"Stables Researcher.\""
msgstr ""
"Un passe temporaire. Il comporte une bande rouge qui semble indiquer que tu "
"fais partie de l'équipe des « Chercheurs des Etables »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41400
msgid "Vault 15 Shack Key"
msgstr "Clé de la cabane de l'Abri 15"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41500
msgid "Spectacles"
msgstr "Lunettes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41501
msgid "A set of spectacles for eye correction."
msgstr "Une paire de lunettes de vue."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41600
msgid "Empty Jet Canister"
msgstr "Boîte de Jet vide"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41601
msgid ""
"This empty Jet canister was found in Richard Wright's room. It still has "
"traces of Jet inside."
msgstr ""
"Cette boîte vide a été découverte dans la chambre de Richard Wright. Elle "
"comporte toujours des traces de Jet."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41700
msgid "Oxygen Tank"
msgstr "Réservoir à oxygène"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41701
msgid "This is the oxygen tank for Salvatore's breathing apparatus."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit du réservoir contenant l'oxygène de l'appareil respiratoire de "
"Salvatore."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41800
msgid "Poison Tank"
msgstr "Réservoir à poison"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41801
msgid ""
"This tank looks suspiciously like an oxygen tank, but there is a small skull "
"and crossbones symbol etched in the bottom. If you hadn't examined it "
"closely, you wouldn't have seen the symbol."
msgstr ""
"Ce réservoir ressemble étrangement à un réservoir à oxygène mais un crâne et "
"deux tibias croisés sont gravés au fond. Si tu n'avais pas regardé avec "
"attention, tu n'aurais pas vu ce symbole."

#: game/pro_item.msg:41900
msgid "Mine Parts"
msgstr "Pièces détachées pour la mine"

#: game/pro_item.msg:41901
msgid ""
"You see a bundle of parts that are clearly labeled \"GX-9 Air Purifier\". "
"Using your incredible deductive skills, you decide that they are probably "
"parts for a broken air purifier."
msgstr ""
"Un jeu de pièces détachées qui porte l'inscription « Purificateur d'air GX-9 "
"». Après mûre réflexion, tu te dis qu'il s'agit là de pièces détachées de "
"purificateur d'air."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42000
msgid "Morningstar Mine Scrip"
msgstr "Titre de la Mine Morningstar"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42001
msgid "This is a small chit probably used to pay Morningstar Mine Workers."
msgstr ""
"Un récépissé qui doit servir à payer les ouvriers de la Mine Morningstar."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42100
msgid "Holy Hand Grenade"
msgstr "Grenade à main sacrée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42101
msgid "A Holy relic of godly might."
msgstr "Une sainte relique de la puissance divine."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42200
msgid "Excavator Chip"
msgstr "Puce d'excavateur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42201
msgid ""
"This chip appears to be for some sort of large industrial machine. Beneath "
"the dirt and dust, it appears to be in surprisingly good shape."
msgstr ""
"Cette puce semble être une pièce allant sur une sorte de gros engin "
"industriel. Chose curieuse, elle paraît en bon état sous sa croûte de saleté "
"et de poussière."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42300
msgid "Gold Nugget"
msgstr "Pépite d'or"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42301
msgid "A nugget of gold."
msgstr "Une pépite d'or."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42400
msgid "Monument Chunk"
msgstr "Fragment de monument"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42401
msgid ""
"This is a piece of the disgruntled stone monument you found out in the "
"desert. Although many of your village would no doubt regard it as a sacred "
"relic, somehow you suspect that you have been cheated."
msgstr ""
"Un morceau de pierre trouvé dans le désert et provenant d'un ancien "
"monument. Bien que de nombreux membres de votre village le prennent pour une "
"relique, tu es plus circonspect et penses qu'on t'a berné."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42500
msgid "Stone Head"
msgstr "Tête en pierre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42501
msgid "A huge stone monument."
msgstr "Un énorme monument en pierre."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42600
msgid "Uranium Ore"
msgstr "Minerai d'uranium"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42601
msgid "A chunk of Uranium Ore, unrefined."
msgstr "Un morceau de minerai d'uranium, non traité."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42700
msgid "Flame Breath"
msgstr "Souffle de feu"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42800
msgid "Medical Supplies"
msgstr "Fournitures médicales"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42801
msgid "A box of assorted medical supplies. Nothing I can make use of though."
msgstr ""
"Une boîte contenant différentes fournitures médicales. Rien de bien utile "
"cependant."

#: game/pro_item.msg:42900
msgid "Gold Tooth"
msgstr "Dent en or"

#: game/pro_item.msg:42901
msgid ""
"This gold tooth used to belong to someone else, but they won't be needing it "
"anymore."
msgstr "Cette dent en or appartenait à Jules. Maintenant, elle est à toi."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43000
msgid "Howitzer Shell"
msgstr "Obus"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43001
msgid ""
"A 75mm Howitzer shell. The casing has mostly corroded away, but you can make "
"out these letters. EXP. 9-25-98."
msgstr ""
"Un obus de 75 mm. L'enveloppe en métal est presque complètement rouillée "
"mais tu discernes les lettres EXP. 9-25-98."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43100
msgid "Ramirez Box, Closed"
msgstr "Boîte de Ramirez, fermée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43101
msgid ""
"This is the box you received from Big Jesus Mordino to give to Ramirez at "
"the Stables."
msgstr ""
"Tu as reçu cette boîte de la part de Big Jesus Mordino et dois la donner à "
"Ramirez, à l'étable."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43200
msgid "Ramirez Box, Open"
msgstr "Boîte de Ramirez, ouverte"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43201
msgid ""
"This is the box you received from Big Jesus Mordino to give to Ramirez at "
"the Stables. It is open, and you have removed the Jet that was inside."
msgstr ""
"Tu as reçu cette boîte de la part de Big Jesus Mordino et dois la donner à "
"Ramirez, à l'étable. Elle est ouverte et tu as retiré tout le Jet qu'elle "
"contenait."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43300
msgid "Mirrored Shades"
msgstr "Lunettes de soleil"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43301
msgid ""
"This is a pair of fashionable and deadly-looking mirrored shades. Just "
"having them in your inventory makes you feel cool."
msgstr ""
"Ces lunettes réfléchissantes te donnent un air plus martial tout en restant "
"à la mode. L'idée des les avoir dans ton inventaire te met à l'aise."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43400 game/pro_item.msg:43500 game/pro_scen.msg:52700
#: game/pro_scen.msg:52800 game/pro_scen.msg:52900 game/pro_scen.msg:53000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:53100 game/pro_scen.msg:53200
msgid "Wagon"
msgstr "Wagon"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43401 game/pro_item.msg:43501 game/pro_scen.msg:52701
#: game/pro_scen.msg:52801 game/pro_scen.msg:52901 game/pro_scen.msg:53001
#: game/pro_scen.msg:53101 game/pro_scen.msg:53201
msgid ""
"A caravan wagon converted from the wrecked remains of an ancient automobile."
msgstr "Wagon de caravane construit à partir des restes d'une vieille voiture."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43600
msgid "Deck of Cards"
msgstr "Jeu de cartes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43601
msgid "A standard set of playing cards."
msgstr "Un jeu de cartes ordinaire."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43700
msgid "Pack of Marked Cards"
msgstr "Jeu de cartes truqué"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43701
msgid "Every card in this set is a red queen. Must make for some boring games."
msgstr ""
"Ce jeu de carte ne comporte que des reines rouges. Ca doit faire des parties "
"plutôt ennuyeuses."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43800
msgid "Temple Key"
msgstr "Clé du temple"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43801
msgid "A key for the Arroyo Temple door."
msgstr "La clé de la porte du temple d'Arroyo."

#: game/pro_item.msg:43900
msgid "Pocket Lint"
msgstr "Peluches"

#: game/pro_item.msg:43901
msgid "Some fuzz you found in a pocket."
msgstr "Divers débris trouvés au fond d'une poche."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44000
msgid "Biomed Gel"
msgstr "Gel Bio Med"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44001
msgid "A jar of Bio Gel used in the biomedical field."
msgstr "Un flacon de bio-gel utilisé dans le domaine biomédical."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44100
msgid "Blondie's Dog Tags"
msgstr "Plaques de Blondie"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44101
msgid ""
"These dog tags have the owner's name scratched off and the name \"Blondie\" "
"scrawled on the back. Beneath the name is the number \"11.\""
msgstr ""
"Le nom du propriétaire de ces plaques d'identification a été rayé et le nom «"
" Blondie » est gravé derrière. En dessous de ce nom figure le numéro « 11 »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44200
msgid "Angel-Eyes' Dog Tags"
msgstr "Plaques Angel-Eyes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44201
msgid ""
"These dog tags list the owner as \"Angel-Eyes.\" Beneath the name is the "
"number \"16.\""
msgstr ""
"Le nom du propriétaire de ces plaques d'identification est « Angel-Eyes ». "
"En dessous de ce nom figure le numéro « 16 »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44300
msgid "Tuco's Dog Tags"
msgstr "Plaques de Tuco"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44301
msgid ""
"These foul-smelling dog tags list the owner as \"Tuco Benedicto Pacifico "
"Juan Maria Ramirez,\" followed by the number \"27.\""
msgstr ""
"Ces plaques d'identification nauséabondes portent le nom « Tuco Benedicto "
"Pacifico Juan Maria Ramirez » suivi du numéro du numéro « 27 »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44400 game/scrname.msg:1197
msgid "Raiders Map"
msgstr "Carte des Pillards"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44401
msgid ""
"This is a crumpled map of pre-war Northern California. Reno and the "
"surrounding caravan trails are outlined in red, and there is a red \"X\" far "
"to the east of Reno with \"Raiders\" scrawled beneath it."
msgstr ""
"Une carte froissée de la Californie du Nord avant-guerre. Reno et les pistes "
"de caravanes avoisinantes sont surlignées et rouge, et il y a une croix "
"rouge à l'Est de Reno avec gribouillé en dessous le mot « Pillards »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44500
msgid "Sheriff's Badge"
msgstr "Badge du shérif"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44501
msgid "A Badge worn by the Sheriff of a town."
msgstr "Un badge porté par le shérif d'une ville."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44600
msgid "Vertibird Plans"
msgstr "Plans d'hélico"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44601
msgid "A set of plans for building Vertibirds."
msgstr "Des plans permettant de construire un hélicoptère."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44700
msgid "Bishop's Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque de Bishop"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44701
msgid ""
"This holodisk contains incriminating information on Bishop's secret deal "
"with NCR. Apparently, Bishop hired mercenaries to attack Vault City in the "
"hopes that Vault City would turn to NCR for military aid. This holodisk is "
"audio only and has no text data. Vault City might be interested in this."
msgstr ""
"Il recèle des informations sur le pacte secret conclu par Bishop avec la "
"RNC. Il semble que Bishop ait engagé des mercenaires pour attaquer la Cité "
"de l'Abri dans l'espoir que celle-ci demande une aide militaire à la RNC. "
"C'est un holodisque audio. Il pourrait intéresser la Cité de l'Abri."

#: game/pro_item.msg:44800
msgid "Account Book"
msgstr "Livre de comptes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:44801
msgid ""
"This account book lists a series of monthly payments made to the mercenary "
"band from the Bishop Family in New Reno. The payments depend heavily on how "
"much \"pressure\" the mercenaries put on Vault City. Vault City might be "
"interested in this."
msgstr ""
"Ce livre de comptes répertorie des versements mensuels de la Famille Bishop "
"de New Reno à un groupe de mercenaires. Leur montant est fortement lié à la «"
" pression » exercée par les mercenaires sur la Cité de l'Abri... que ce "
"document pourrait intéresser."

#: game/pro_item.msg:45000
msgid "Torn Paper 1"
msgstr "Bout de papier 1"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45001
msgid ""
"You see a piece of paper with writing on it. It looks like it's part of a "
"code of some sort. Unfortunately, the code is incomplete. If only you could "
"find all three pieces. You can make out the following: 1. Physics Password "
"KSLJ, 2. Chemistry Password TIU, 3. Biology Password INTL"
msgstr ""
"Un bout de papier sur lequel est écrit un code... incomplet, hélas. Il doit "
"te manquer deux autres morceaux... Tu parviens tout de même à déchiffrer les "
"inscriptions suivantes : 1. Mot de passe Physique KSLJ, 2. Mot de passe "
"Chimie TIU, 3. Mot de passe Biologie INTL"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45100
msgid "Torn Paper 2"
msgstr "Bout de papier 2"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45101
msgid ""
"You see a piece of paper with writing on it. It looks like it's part of a "
"code of some sort. Unfortunately, the code is incomplete. If only you could "
"find all three pieces. You can make out the following: KJ: Ken-Lee-9, ASPO- "
"Lo-S, VR- Dnky-Pnch-"
msgstr ""
"Un bout de papier sur lequel est écrit un code... incomplet, hélas. Il doit "
"te manquer deux autres morceaux... Tu déchiffres les inscriptions suivantes :"
" KJ : Ken-Lee-9, ASPO- Lo-S, VR- Dnky-Pnch-"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45200
msgid "Torn Paper 3"
msgstr "Bout de papier 3"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45201
msgid ""
"You see a piece of paper with writing on it. It looks like it's part of a "
"code of some sort. Unfortunately, the code is incomplete. If only you could "
"find all three pieces. You can make out the following: 7313, hi-S12908, 98790"
msgstr ""
"Un bout de papier sur lequel est écrit un code... incomplet, hélas. Il doit "
"te manquer deux autres morceaux... Tu déchiffres les inscriptions suivantes :"
" 7313, hi-S12908, 98790"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45300 game/pro_item.msg:46600
msgid "Password Paper"
msgstr "Feuille de mots de passe"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45301
msgid ""
"This is three pieces of a single page that, when assembled, reveal three "
"passwords. The text reads: 1. Physics Password KSLJKJ: Ken-Lee-97313, 2. "
"Chemistry Password TIUASPO- Lo-Shi-S12908, 3. Biology Password INTLVR- Dnky-"
"Pnch-98790"
msgstr ""
"Trois morceaux de papier qui, réunis, forment une page entière sur laquelle "
"figurent trois mots de passe : 1. Mot de passe Physique KSLJKJ : Ken-Lee-"
"97313, 2. Mot de passe Chimie TIUASPO- Lo-Shi-S12908, 3. Mot de passe "
"Biologie INTLVR- Dnky-Pnch-98790"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45400
msgid "Explosive Switch"
msgstr "Détonateur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45401
msgid "This toggle switch is the final component of an explosive device."
msgstr "Ce détonateur est l'élément terminal d'un dispositif explosif."

#: game/pro_item.msg:45500 game/scrname.msg:1020
msgid "Car Trunk"
msgstr "Coffre de voiture"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45501
msgid "The trunk is a great place to store your stuff."
msgstr "Ce coffre est un bon endroit où stocker tes affaires."

#: game/pro_item.msg:45600
msgid "Cell Door Key"
msgstr "Clé d'une porte de cellule"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45601
msgid "This key fits the Cell Door in Broken Hills."
msgstr "Cette clé ouvre la Porte de la cellule à Collines Brisées."

#: game/pro_item.msg:45700
msgid "Hubologist Field Report"
msgstr "Rapport Hubologiste"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45701
msgid "A field office report for the membership drive in the True Faith."
msgstr "Un rapport sur les motivations des membres de la Vraie Foi."

#: game/pro_item.msg:45800
msgid "M.B. Holodisk 5"
msgstr "B.M. Holodisque 5"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45801
msgid "The label reads: Message to CHQ- Confidential."
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Message à QGC, Confidentiel."

#: game/pro_item.msg:45900
msgid "M.B. Holodisk 1"
msgstr "B.M. Holodisque 1"

#: game/pro_item.msg:45901
msgid "The label reads: Radio transmission log checkpoint 1."
msgstr ""
"Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Transcriptions échanges radio poste de contrôle 1."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46000
msgid "M.B. Holodisk 2"
msgstr "B.M. Holodisque 2"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46001
msgid "The label reads: Radio transmission log checkpoint 2."
msgstr ""
"Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Transcriptions échanges radio poste de contrôle 2."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46100
msgid "M.B. Holodisk 3"
msgstr "B.M. Holodisque 3"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46101
msgid "The label reads: Radio transmission log checkpoint 3."
msgstr ""
"Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Transcriptions échanges radio poste de contrôle 3."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46200
msgid "M.B. Holodisk 4"
msgstr "B.M. Holodisque 4"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46201
msgid "The label reads: Radio transmission log research team."
msgstr ""
"Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Transcriptions échanges radio poste de contrôle 4."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46300
msgid "Evacuation Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque d'évacuation"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46301
msgid "The label reads: Base evacuation notice."
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Procédures d'évacuation de la base."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46400
msgid "Experiment Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque des expériences"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46401
msgid "The label reads: Research log."
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Comptes rendus des recherches."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46500
msgid "Medical Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque médical"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46501
msgid "The label reads: Medical log."
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Comptes rendus médicaux."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46601
msgid "A sheet of folded paper with the word \"TCHAIKOVSKY\" written on it."
msgstr "Une feuille de papier pliée avec dessus le mot « TCHAIKOVSKY »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46700
msgid "Jesse's Container"
msgstr "Conteneur de Jesse"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46800
msgid "Smitty's Meal"
msgstr "Repas de Smitty"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46801
msgid ""
"It's some kind of salad and a sandwich made out of what you think is brahmin "
"meat covered in a thick dark yellow sauce. There is also a strange pickled "
"green vegetable on the side."
msgstr ""
"Une sorte de salade, et un sandwich à ce qui te paraît être de la viande de "
"Brahmine recouverte d'une épaisse sauce gris-jaune et accompagnée d'un "
"légume vert bizarre conservé dans la saumure."

#: game/pro_item.msg:46900
msgid "Rot Gut"
msgstr "Tord-boyaux"

#: game/pro_item.msg:46901
msgid "A very strong liquor or cleaning fluid, you decide."
msgstr ""
"Un alcool très fort ou du liquide de refroidissement, à toi d'en décider."

#: game/pro_item.msg:47000
msgid "Ball Gag"
msgstr "Bâillon à boule"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47001
msgid ""
"A questionable sexual device. If you need to ask, you don't want to know."
msgstr "Un accessoire sexuel. Il te faut vraiment une explication ?"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47100
msgid "\"The Lavender Flower\""
msgstr "« La Lavande »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47101
msgid ""
"It appears to be some kind of romance novel written by Dorothy Rixon. The "
"cover has a woman laying on a bed surrounded by a hundred flowers."
msgstr ""
"Un roman à l'eau de rose écrit par une certaine Dorothy Rixon. La couverture "
"représente une femme étendue sur un lit et entourée de dizaines de fleurs."

#: game/pro_item.msg:47200
msgid "Hubologist Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque Hubologiste"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47201
msgid ""
"This holodisk is labeled \"Hubology: The Truth Behind the Lies\". It looks "
"like it works with your Pip-Boy."
msgstr ""
"L'étiquette de cet holodisque dit : « L'Hubologie : La Vérité Est Ici. » Il "
"doit être compatible avec ton Pip-Boy."

#: game/pro_item.msg:47300
msgid "Mutated Toe"
msgstr "Orteil muté"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47301
msgid ""
"You see your sixth toe. It is a small mutated part of yourself. For some "
"reason, you feel a terrible sense of loss as you look at the tiny amputated "
"toe."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois ton sixième orteil, une portion minuscule, mais mutée, de toi-même. "
"Curieusement, la vue de ce membre amputé t'emplit de nostalgie."

#: game/pro_item.msg:47400
msgid "Daisies"
msgstr "Marguerites"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47401
msgid "A flower pot of daisies. Aren't they nice?"
msgstr "Un pot de marguerites. Ne sont-elles pas jolies ?"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47600
msgid "Enlightened One's Letter"
msgstr "Lettre de l'Eclairée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47601
msgid ""
"A report addressed to AHS-9 in San Francisco. It's really dry reading- "
"tables of oppressive adjustments, expense reports, and other twaddle not "
"worth wasting your time on."
msgstr ""
"Un rapport adressé à AHS-9 à San Francisco. C'est ennuyeux à mourir : "
"tableaux, tables, courbes et graphiques dont tu arriveras très bien à te "
"passer."

#: game/pro_item.msg:47700
msgid "Broadcast Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque de journaux"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47701
msgid "The label reads: \"Galaxy News Network.\""
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : Galaxy News Network »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:47800
msgid "Sierra Mission Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque de la base Sierra"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47801
msgid "The label reads: \"Mission Statement.\""
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : « Ordre de mission. »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47900
msgid "NavCom Parts"
msgstr "Pièces détachées NavCom"

#: game/pro_item.msg:47901
msgid ""
"These are computer parts that look like they slot into the interior of a "
"machine. The fact that they say \"Poseidon Oil\" and \"Navigation Computer\" "
"on them lead you to believe they fit into a Poseidon Oil Navigation Computer."
msgstr ""
"Ces pièces doivent pouvoir s'adapter dans un ordinateur. Le fait qu'elles "
"soient étiquetées « Poséidon Oil » et « Ordinateur de navigation » te font "
"penser qu'elles sont destinées à un Ordinateur de Navigation Poséidon Oil."

#: game/pro_item.msg:48000
msgid "Bonus +1 Agility"
msgstr "Bonus +1 Agilité"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48100
msgid "Bonus +1 Intelligence"
msgstr "Bonus +1 Intelligence"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48200
msgid "Bonus +1 Strength"
msgstr "Bonus +1 Force"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48300 game/scrname.msg:1211
msgid "Fallout 2 Hintbook"
msgstr "Recueil d'indices pour Fallout 2"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48301
msgid ""
"Well, THIS would have been good to have at the beginning of the goddamn game."
msgstr ""
"Voilà un bouquin que tu aurais préféré avoir au DEBUT de cette fichue partie."

#: game/pro_item.msg:48400
msgid "Player's Ear"
msgstr "Oreille de Joueur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48401
msgid ""
"This is your ear. The Masticator bit it off during the fight and spit it on "
"your unconscious body. If you are reading this, it probably means you will "
"be reloading soon. Of course, it is possible this item has some special "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Ton oreille. Le Mastiquateur te l'a arrachée d'un coup de dents au cours du "
"combat et l'a crachée sur ton corps inconscient. Si tu lis ceci, cela "
"signifie que tu risques de devoir recharger le jeu très bientôt. Il se peut "
"également que cet objet ait une valeur quelconque."

#: game/pro_item.msg:48500
msgid "Masticator's Ear"
msgstr "Oreille du Mastiquateur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48501
msgid ""
"This is the Masticator's ear. You bit it off after pummeling him senseless. "
"Congratulations on beating him. He's one of the toughest NPC's in the game, "
"especially when you don't have any weapons or armor."
msgstr ""
"L'oreille du Mastiquateur. Tu la lui as arrachée d'un coup de dents après "
"l'avoir assommé à coups de poing. Félicitations ! C'est l'un des PNJ les "
"plus durs de tout le jeu, surtout quand on l'affronte sans armes ni armure."

#: game/pro_item.msg:48600
msgid "Refined Uranium Ore"
msgstr "Minerai d'uranium raffiné"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48601
msgid ""
"A chunk of Uranium Ore. This ore seems to have been processed somehow. It "
"seems heavier."
msgstr ""
"Un fragment de minerai d'uranium. On a dû lui faire subir un traitement, car "
"il te semble plus lourd que la normale."

#: game/pro_item.msg:48700
msgid "Note from Francis"
msgstr "Mot de Francis"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48701
msgid ""
"\"Zaius, Marcus isn't doing anything about that mutant-hater Jacob and his "
"damned conspirators. First they disable the air purifier... and then what? I "
"found their secret meeting tunnels. I figure a body or two down there could "
"implicate Jacob. If you want in, let me know. And burn the damn note this "
"time!\" -Signed, Francis."
msgstr ""
"\"Zaius, Marcus ne fait rien contre cet anti-mutant de Jacob et ses "
"comploteurs. Ils ont mis le purificateur en panne. Ensuite, j'ai trouvé les "
"tunnels secrets où ils se réunissent. Un cadavre suffirait à impliquer "
"Jacob. Si ça t'intéresse, fais-moi signe. Et brûle ce fichu mot, cette fois !"
"\" Signé: Francis."

#: game/pro_item.msg:48800
msgid "K-9 Motivator"
msgstr "Motivateur K-9"

#: game/pro_item.msg:48801
msgid "This is the drive mechanism for a K-9 series robot."
msgstr "Le mécanisme d'entraînement d'un robot modèle K-9."

#: game/pro_item.msg:48900
msgid "Special Boxer Weapon"
msgstr "Arme spéciale pour boxeur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49000
msgid "NCR History Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque d'histoire"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49001
msgid "The label reads: \"History of NCR.\""
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : « Histoire de la RNC »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:49100
msgid "Mr. Nixon Doll"
msgstr "Poupée M. Nixon"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49101
msgid ""
"You see a small doll with a big red nose. For some reason, you don't trust "
"this seemingly-innocent child's toy."
msgstr ""
"Tu vois un petite poupée au gros nez rouge. Bizarrement, tu ne te fies pas à "
"l'air innocent de ce jouet d'enfant."

#: game/pro_item.msg:49200
msgid "Tanker Fob"
msgstr "Passe électronique du pétrolier"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49201
msgid "An encoded passkey that provides access to high security areas."
msgstr "Un passe codé qui donne accès aux zones de haute sécurité."

#: game/pro_item.msg:49300
msgid "Teachings Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque des enseignements"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49301
msgid "The label reads: \"Hubologist Teachings.\""
msgstr "Sur l'étiquette, tu lis : « Enseignements Hubologiste »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:49400
msgid "Kokoweef Mine Scrip"
msgstr "Titre de la Mine Kokoweef"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49401
msgid "This is a small chit probably used to pay Kokoweef Mine Workers."
msgstr "Un récépissé qui doit servir à payer les ouvriers de la Mine Kokoweef."

#: game/pro_item.msg:49500
msgid "Presidential Access Key"
msgstr "Passe présidentiel"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49501
msgid ""
"This access key has what looks like the presidential seal on it. It appears "
"as though it's used to gain Presidential level access to computers."
msgstr ""
"Ce passe porte ce qui semble bien être le sceau présidentiel. Il doit "
"conférer un privilège d'accès de niveau présidentiel aux ordinateurs."

#: game/pro_item.msg:49800
msgid "Dual Plasma Cannon"
msgstr "Double canon à plasma"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49801
msgid "Only use for Gun Turret critter."
msgstr "A n'utiliser que sur la créature de la Tourelle d'armement."

#: game/pro_item.msg:49900
msgid "Pip-Boy Lingual Enhancer"
msgstr "Amplificateur linguistique du Pip-Boy"

#: game/pro_item.msg:49901
msgid ""
"This Pip-Boy lingual enhancer consists of a storage holodisk, a "
"microfilament cord, headgear, and an optical sensor that is placed over the "
"user's right eye. When used, an optical flash transmits an entire dictionary "
"into the user's memory, permanently improving the user's speech skills."
msgstr ""
"Inclus l'holodisque, le cordon monofilament, le casque, et le capteur "
"optique qui se place sur l'oeil gauche. Quand utilisé, un flash optique "
"transmet le contenu d'un dictionnaire entier dans la mémoire de "
"l'utilisateur, ce qui accroît ses talents oratoires."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50000
msgid "FN FAL HPFA"
msgstr "FN FAL HPFA"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50001
msgid ""
"This rifle has been more widely used by armed forces than any other rifle in "
"history. It's a reliable assault weapon for any terrain or tactical "
"situation. The HPFA is more powerful than the standard FN FAL. Min ST: 5."
msgstr ""
"Ce fusil d'assaut a été le plus utilisé au monde par les forces armées. Il "
"convient à n'importe quel terrain et à n'importe quelle situation. La "
"version HPFA est plus puissante que le FN FAL classique. Min ST: 5."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50100 game/scrname.msg:309
msgid "Wall Safe"
msgstr "Coffre-fort mural"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50200
msgid "Floor Safe"
msgstr "Coffre-fort au sol"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50300
msgid "Blue Memory Module"
msgstr "Module de mémoire bleu"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50301
msgid ""
"A read only computer memory module containing medical information. This "
"module details charisma enhancements."
msgstr ""
"Un module de mémoire en lecture seule qui contient des informations "
"médicales. Celui-ci traite de l'augmentation du charisme."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50400
msgid "Green Memory Module"
msgstr "Module de mémoire vert"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50401
msgid ""
"A read only computer memory module containing medical information. This "
"module details perception enhancements."
msgstr ""
"Un module de mémoire en lecture seule qui contient des informations "
"médicales. Celui-ci traite de l'augmentation de la perception."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50500
msgid "Red Memory Module"
msgstr "Module de mémoire rouge"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50501
msgid ""
"A read only computer memory module containing medical information. This "
"module details strength enhancements."
msgstr ""
"Un module de mémoire morte qui contient des informations médicales. Celui-ci "
"traite de l'augmentation de la force."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50600
msgid "Yellow Memory Module"
msgstr "Module de mémoire jaune"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50601
msgid ""
"A read only computer memory module containing medical information. This "
"module details intelligence enhancements."
msgstr ""
"Un module de mémoire en lecture seule qui contient des informations "
"médicales. Celui-ci traite de l'augmentation de l'intelligence."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50700
msgid "Decomposing Body"
msgstr "Cadavre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50701
msgid "This is a partially decomposed body of a humanoid creature."
msgstr "Le cadavre en décomposition d'une créature humanoïde."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50800
msgid "Rubber Doll"
msgstr "Poupée gonflable"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50801
msgid "An inflatable rubber sex doll. This model is called \"Tandi\"."
msgstr "Une poupée gonflable. Ce modèle s'appelle « Tandi »."

#: game/pro_item.msg:50900
msgid "Damaged Rubber Doll"
msgstr "Poupée gonflable endommagée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:50901
msgid ""
"This inflatable rubber sex doll has a torn seam. It's obviously been well "
"used."
msgstr "Cette poupée gonflable est crevée. Elle a dû beaucoup servir."

#: game/pro_item.msg:51000 game/pro_item.msg:51100 game/pro_item.msg:51200
#: game/pro_item.msg:51300 game/pro_item.msg:51400 game/pro_item.msg:51500
#: game/pro_scen.msg:163000 game/pro_scen.msg:163100 game/pro_scen.msg:163200
#: game/pro_scen.msg:163300 game/pro_scen.msg:163400 game/pro_scen.msg:163500
msgid "Pool Table"
msgstr "Billard"

#: game/pro_item.msg:51600
msgid "Pip-Boy Medical Enhancer"
msgstr "Amplificateur médical du Pip-Boy"

#: game/pro_item.msg:51601
msgid ""
"This Pip-Boy medical enhancer consists of a storage holodisk, microfilament "
"cord, headgear, and an optical sensor that is placed over the user's left "
"eye. When used, an optical flash transmits a dictionary of physician skills "
"and know-how into the user's memory, permanently improving the user's doctor "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"Inclus l'holodisque, le cordon monofilament, le casque, et le capteur "
"optique qui se place sur l'oeil gauche. Quand utilisé, un flash optique "
"transmet le contenu d'un manuel de médecine dans la mémoire de "
"l'utilisateur, ce qui accroît sa compétence Médecin."

#: game/pro_item.msg:51700
msgid "\"Little Jesus\""
msgstr "« P'tit Jésus »"

#: game/pro_item.msg:51701
msgid ""
"This wicked looking blade once belonged to Lil' Jesus Mordino. It has "
"numerous nicks and cuts along its surface, but its edge is razor sharp. On "
"its handle is carved \"Little Jesus.\""
msgstr ""
"Ce méchant couteau appartenait à P'tit Jésus Mordino. La surface de la lame "
"présente un grand nombre d'entailles et d'ébréchures, mais son tranchant est "
"intact. « P'tit Jésus » a été gravé sur la poignée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:51800
msgid "Dual Minigun"
msgstr "Mini-canon double"

#: game/pro_item.msg:51801
msgid "Only use for Auto-Cannon critter."
msgstr "A n'utiliser que sur les canons automatiques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:51900
msgid "Bottle Caps"
msgstr "Capsules de bouteille"

#: game/pro_item.msg:51901
msgid ""
"These are worthless bottle caps. You've heard that at one time they were "
"used as money, though you suspect its only a story."
msgstr ""
"Des capsules de bouteille sans valeur. Tu as entendu dire qu'on s'en servait "
"de monnaie à une époque, mais ce n'est sans doute qu'une histoire."

#: game/pro_item.msg:52000
msgid "Heavy Dual Minigun"
msgstr "Mini-canon double lourd"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52001
msgid "Only use for Auto-Cannon Critter."
msgstr "A n'utiliser que sur les canons automatiques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:52100 game/scrname.msg:1179
msgid "Poor Box"
msgstr "Tronc des pauvres"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52101
msgid "A small box used to collect money for the poor."
msgstr "Une petite boîte qui sert à la collecte de l'argent pour les pauvres"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52200
msgid "Wakizashi Blade"
msgstr "Wakizashi"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52201
msgid ""
"A short finely crafted knife. The tip seems to be designed to pierce armor."
msgstr ""
"Un superbe poignard court. La pointe semble conçue pour percer une armure."

#: game/pro_item.msg:52300
msgid "Survey Map"
msgstr "Carte d'état-major"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52301
msgid "It looks like a geological survey map of the Bay area."
msgstr ""
"Carte d'état-major des environs de la Baie, avec un accent sur la géologie "
"de la région"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52400
msgid "Bridgekeeper's Robes"
msgstr "Toge du gardien du pont"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52401
msgid ""
"This smelly, filthy garment must be made out of some special fabric in order "
"to have withstood the foulness of the bridgekeeper's body. Oddly enough, it "
"has plasma burns and scorch marks all over it, as if these weapons were used "
"against it... to no effect. You have NO idea why it's purple."
msgstr ""
"Ce vêtement doit être fait d'un tissu spécial pour avoir mieux résisté que "
"le cadavre du gardien du pont. Bizarre. Il présente des traces de brûlure au "
"plasma et au lance-flammes, mais il a résisté à ça AUSSI. Quant à savoir "
"pour quelle raison il est violet..."

#: game/pro_item.msg:52500
msgid "Hypo"
msgstr "Seringue hypodermique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52501
msgid ""
"A medical injection instrument of some kind. It looks very high tech. You "
"don't know what it's filled with but it appears to have only one dose left."
msgstr ""
"Une sorte d'injecteur médical hi-tech. Tu ne sais pas ce qu'il y a dedans, "
"mais il n'en reste qu'une dose."

#: game/pro_item.msg:52600 game/pro_item.msg:52700 game/pro_item.msg:52800
msgid "Dead Redshirt"
msgstr "Chemise-rouge mort"

#: game/pro_item.msg:52601 game/pro_item.msg:52701 game/pro_item.msg:52801
msgid ""
"This guy has a weird red uniform you have never seen. It looks like he died "
"from dehydration."
msgstr ""
"Ce type a un drôle d'uniforme rouge qui t'est inconnu. Il semble qu'il soit "
"mort de déshydratation."

#: game/pro_item.msg:52900
msgid "Mining Machine"
msgstr "Machine minière"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53000
msgid "End Boss Knife"
msgstr "Couteau du grand méchant"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53100
msgid "End Boss Plasma Gun"
msgstr "Fusil à plasma du grand méchant"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53200
msgid "Sam Pritchard's Map"
msgstr "La carte de Sam Pritchard"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53201
msgid ""
"This crudely-drawn map shows the area surrounding New Reno. It looks like "
"there's some sort of military base to the north."
msgstr ""
"Cette carte dessinée à la va-vite montre le secteur autour de New Reno. On "
"dirait qu'il y a une sorte de base militaire au Nord."

#: game/pro_item.msg:53300
msgid "Fire Gecko Pelt"
msgstr "Peau de gecko de feu"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53301
msgid ""
"This is the dried and cured hide of a fire gecko. It is badly burned and as "
"a result, has little value."
msgstr "La peau séchée et tannée d'un gecko de feu."

#: game/pro_item.msg:53400
msgid "Bucket"
msgstr "Seau"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53401
msgid "A medium sized bucket used to haul water from a well."
msgstr "Un seau de taille moyenne, utilisé pour récupérer l'eau d'un puits."

#: game/pro_item.msg:53500
msgid "Scaly Fish"
msgstr "Poisson à Ecailles"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53501
msgid "A scaly looking fish. If cooked, it would probably make a tasty meal."
msgstr ""
"Un poisson plein d'écailles. Cuisiné, ça pourrait faire un excellent repas."

#: game/pro_item.msg:53600
msgid "Fish"
msgstr "Poisson"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53601
msgid "A raw looking fish. If cooked, it would probably make a tasty meal."
msgstr ""
"Un poisson à l'état brut. Cuisiné, ça pourrait faire une excellent repas."

#: game/pro_item.msg:53700
msgid "Ode to the Flame Deluge"
msgstr "Ode au Déluge de Flammes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53701
msgid ""
"A novel set after a devastating nuclear war. The book excerpt describes how "
"a violent backlash against the culture of advanced knowledge and technology "
"that had led to the development of nuclear weapons took place shortly after "
"this war. Anyone of learning, and eventually anyone who could even read, was "
"likely to be killed."
msgstr ""
"Une nouvelle se déroulant après une guerre nucléaire. Ce livre décrit "
"comment la culture, et la science ont subis de graves répecrussions après "
"cette guerre. Tous ceux qui étudiaient, voire qui pouvaient lire, risquaient "
"d'être tués."

#: game/pro_item.msg:53800
msgid "Text Book"
msgstr "Livre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53801
msgid ""
"An old text book from before the Great War. It is quite technical and "
"doesn't appear to contain any useful information."
msgstr ""
"Un ancien livre datant d'avant la Grande Guerre. C'est plutôt technique et "
"il ne contient aucune information intéressante."

#: game/pro_item.msg:53900
msgid "Army Technical Manual"
msgstr "Manuel Technique de l'Armée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:53901
msgid ""
"An old technical manual designed for the United States Army Corps of "
"Engineers."
msgstr ""
"Un ancien manuel technique réalisé pour les Ingénieurs de l'Armée des Etats-"
"Unis."

#: game/pro_item.msg:54000
msgid "Operations Manual"
msgstr "Manuel d'Opérateur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54001
msgid ""
"The operations manual to the KV-75; a portable, tactical cryptographic "
"device. Also used by non-tactical users for high-level communications in the "
"local wideband telephone networks and wideband satellite terminals."
msgstr ""
"Le manuel d'opérateur du KV-75; un dispositif cryptographique tactique "
"portable. Aussi utilisé par des utilisateurs non tactiques pour des "
"communications de haut niveau dans la boucle locale du réseau de téléphonie "
"et les terminaux de satellites."

#: game/pro_item.msg:54100
msgid "Chinese Army: Special Ops Manual"
msgstr "Manuel de Survie de l'Armée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54200
msgid "Bottle of wine"
msgstr "Bouteille de vin"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54201
msgid "A fresh bottle of Abbey's finest wine."
msgstr "Un bouteille fraîche de la meilleure liqueur de l'Abbaye."

#: game/pro_item.msg:54300 game/scrname.msg:166
msgid "Diary"
msgstr "Journal"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54301
msgid ""
"It appears to be a diary which belonged to a young girl. The writing on the "
"inside cover says: \"Property of Anna\" Most of the pages are either torn or "
"faded, but one is still readable. \"Day 271: Today my mother gave me a gold "
"locket. It is the most beautiful thing I have ever owned. I will never part "
"with it.\""
msgstr ""
"Un journal qui a appartenu à une jeune fille. La couverture intérieure "
"indique : \"Propriété d'Anna\". La plupart des pages sont déchirées. \"Jour "
"271 : Ma mère m'a donné un pendentif en or. C'est la plus belle chose que "
"j'ai jamais possédée. Je ne m'en séparerai jamais.\""

#: game/pro_item.msg:54400
msgid "Botany Holodisk"
msgstr "Holodisque Botanique"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54401
msgid ""
"This information disk categorizes the various plant life that grew before "
"the Great War."
msgstr ""
"Ce disque rassemble des informations sur les différentes catégories de "
"plantes qui poussaient avant la Grande Guerre."

#: game/pro_item.msg:54500
msgid "Expired G.E.C.K."
msgstr "J.E.K expiré"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54501
msgid ""
"The Garden of Eden Creation Kit. This unit is standard equipment for all "
"Vault-Tec vaults. A GECK is the resource for rebuilding civilization after "
"the bomb. Just add water and stir. This one is well beyond is expiration "
"date. What a waste!"
msgstr ""
"Le Jardin d'Eden en Kit. Cette unité se trouve dans tous les abris Vault-"
"Tek. Le JEK sert à rebâtir la civilisation après la bombe. Il suffit "
"d'ajouter de l'eau et de touiller. Celui-ci a dépassé sa date d'expiration. "
"Quel gachis !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54600
msgid "Old Coin"
msgstr "Vieille pièce"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54601
msgid ""
"A very old coin. You are not sure whose face is on it, but it looks like it "
"could be rare and worth a lot of money."
msgstr ""
"Une très vieille pièce de monnaie. Tu n'es pas certain du visage dessus, "
"mais on dirait que c'est très rare et que ça vaut beaucoup d'argent."

#: game/pro_item.msg:54700
msgid "A watch"
msgstr "Une montre"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54701
msgid ""
"An antique watch. This brand stopped being manufactured long before the "
"Great War."
msgstr ""
"Une montre antique. Cette marque a arrêté sa fabrication longtemps avant la "
"Grande Guerre."

#: game/pro_item.msg:54800
msgid "Pack of Cigarettes"
msgstr "Un paquet de Cigarettes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54801
msgid ""
"A pack of 'Commies'. On the back it says: 'Smoke a Commie to do your bit for "
"democracy and feel better'. Lower down there's a health warning: 'As your "
"doctor, I recommend Commies for fresher breath and a winning smile'. It "
"looks like there's about 10 in a pack."
msgstr "Un vieux paquet de cigarettes d'avant la guerre."

#: game/pro_item.msg:54900
msgid "Gas Mask"
msgstr "Masque à Gaz"

#: game/pro_item.msg:54901
msgid ""
"The Protective Mask: Your mask is your first line of defense against "
"biological agents. Take care of it."
msgstr ""
"Le Masque de Protection : Votre masque est la première ligne de défense "
"contre les agents biologiques. Prenez en soin."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55000
msgid "Toaster"
msgstr "Grille-Pain"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55001 game/pro_scen.msg:189601
msgid "A silver toaster sitting on a desk."
msgstr "Un Grille-Pain en argent posé sur un bureau."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55100
msgid "Syringe"
msgstr "Seringue"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55101
msgid ""
"A pre war implement for administrating drugs. It is full of an unknown "
"substance."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositif d'avant-guerre pour l'administration de substances. Elle est "
"remplie d'un liquide inconnu."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55200
msgid "Dog Food"
msgstr "Nourriture pour chien"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55201
msgid "Several cans of dog food."
msgstr "Quelques boites de nourriture pour chien."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55300 game/scrname.msg:1510
msgid "Bug Spray"
msgstr "Aérosol insecticide"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55301
msgid "A spray can full of a substance that kills all known bugs."
msgstr ""
"Une bombe aérosol remplie d'une substance qui tue tous les insectes connus."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55400
msgid "Environmental Armor"
msgstr "Armure Environnementale"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55401
msgid "Armor best worn against biological attacks."
msgstr "Armure le plus souvent utilisée contre les attaques biologiques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55500
msgid "EPA Pamphlet"
msgstr "Brochure du Ministère de l'Environnement"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55501
msgid "A leaflet given out at the beginning of tours."
msgstr "Un prospectus distribué au début d'une visite."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55600
msgid "Drugs"
msgstr "Médicaments"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55601
msgid "Some sort of drugs preserved from before the war."
msgstr "Plusieurs sortes de médicaments préservés d'avant la guerre."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55700
msgid "Security Rooms Key Card"
msgstr "Carte de Sécurité"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55701
msgid "A key card to unlock the security rooms."
msgstr "Une carte magnétique pour ouvrir les pièces sécurisées."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55800
msgid "Test tube rack"
msgstr "Support pour tubes"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55801
msgid "A rack for holding chemical test tubes."
msgstr "Un support pour les tubes de tests chimiques."

#: game/pro_item.msg:55900
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "Clés"

#: game/pro_item.msg:55901
msgid "Keys to allow access to the storage shed on the surface."
msgstr "Clés pour accéder aux hangars de stockage."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56000 game/scrname.msg:1527
msgid "Random Chemicals"
msgstr "Produits Chimiques"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56001
msgid "DANGER! Unknown chemicals. Use with caution."
msgstr "ATTENTION ! Produits chimiques inconnus. A utiliser avec précaution."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56100
msgid "Corn Seeds"
msgstr "Graines de mais"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56101
msgid ""
"Packets of seeds, used to grow plants. These are labeled as genetically "
"modified corn seeds immune to both disease and insect infestation."
msgstr ""
"Un paquet de graines, utilisé pour faire pousser des plantes. Elles sont "
"étiquetées en maïs transgénique immunisé aux maladies et aux infestations "
"d'insectes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56200
msgid "Plant Spray"
msgstr "Aérosol désherbant"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56201
msgid "A spray can full of a substance that kills various types of plants."
msgstr ""
"Une bombe aérosol remplie d'une substance qui tue différents types de "
"plantes."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56300 game/pro_item.msg:56800
msgid "Trigger activated dynamite"
msgstr "Dynamite à détonateur activée"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56301
msgid ""
"Unlike normal dynamite which is set by a timer, this dynamite is activated "
"by a trigger."
msgstr ""
"Contrairement aux dynamites normales qui sont utilisées avec un compte à "
"rebours, cette dynamite doit être activée par un détonateur."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56400
msgid "Trigger switch"
msgstr "Détonateur"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56401
msgid "Trigger for dynamite."
msgstr "Détonateur pour dynamite."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56500 game/scrname.msg:265
msgid "Paper"
msgstr "Papier"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56501
msgid "Paper with a passcode scribbled on it."
msgstr "Papier avec un mot de passe gribouillé dessus."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56600
msgid "Experimental Seeds"
msgstr "Graines expérimentales"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56601
msgid "Packet of experimental seeds. Result of germination is unknown."
msgstr ""
"Une paquet de graines expérimentales. Les résultats de la germination sont "
"inconnus."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56700
msgid "A drill"
msgstr "Une perceuse"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56701
msgid "An electric powered drill."
msgstr "Une perceuse électrique."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56801
msgid ""
"Unlike normal dynamite which is set by a timer, this dynamite is activated "
"by a trigger. This one is armed and ready to be triggered."
msgstr ""
"Contrairement aux dynamites normales qui sont utilisées avec un compte à "
"rebours, cette dynamite est activée par un détonateur. Celle-ci est armée et "
"prête à être déclenchée."

#: game/pro_item.msg:56900
msgid "Pop Rocks"
msgstr "Pop Rocks"

#: game/pro_item.msg:56901
msgid ""
"An unopened bag of a tasty carbonated candy made of sugar, lactose (more "
"sugar), corn syrup (even more sugar), and flavoring. It is rumored that when "
"mixed with drinks like Nuka-Cola one's stomach would explode."
msgstr ""
"Un sachet encore fermé de bonbons savoureux et gazéifiés composés de sucre, "
"de lactose (sucre), de sirop de maïs (sucre), et d'agents aromatisants. La "
"rumeur prétend que s'ils sont mélangés avec des boissons comme le Nuka-Cola, "
"cela entraîne une explosion de l'estomac."

#: game/pro_item.msg:57000
msgid "Bottle of Shampoo"
msgstr "Bouteille de shampoing"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57001
msgid ""
"A premium bottle of shampoo. Unlike other leading brands, this shampoo comes "
"in an unusual flexi-plastic bottle. It was specially designed this way, so "
"when the bottle was squeezed, the right amount of shampoo was poured out - "
"no more, no less. Just a flip of the cap, and you're on your way."
msgstr ""
"Une bouteille de shampoing. Contrairement à d'autres grandes marques, ce "
"shampoing est contenu dans une flexi-bouteille. Il a été conçu de cette "
"façon pour que la bonne quantité se répande à chaque pression, ni plus, ni "
"moins. Ouvrez juste le couvercle pour en profiter !"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57100 game/pro_item.msg:58800
msgid "K-9 Kevlar"
msgstr "Kevlar de K9"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57101
msgid ""
"A dusty old set of sturdy kevlar plates set into black nylon sleeves. You "
"think it must be sized for a dwarf, until you notice a tag on the inside "
"which reads: Canine Kevlar. Large. A DoggieBuddy product. Made in Taiwan."
msgstr ""
"Un vieil ensemble poussiéreux en plaques de kevlar avec des manches en nylon "
"noir. Vous pensiez qu'il doit être fabriqué pour un nain, jusqu'à ce que "
"vous remarquiez une étiquette à l'intérieur : Canine Kevlar. Grand. Un "
"produit DoggieBuddy. Fabriqué à Taiwan."

#: game/pro_item.msg:57200
msgid "Human Ear"
msgstr "Oreille humaine"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57201
msgid ""
"A woman's ear. Gross! Only a mentally unstable person would ever remove a "
"human ear."
msgstr ""
"Une oreille de femme. Dégueulasse ! Seule une personne psychologiquement "
"instable couperait une oreille humaine."

#: game/pro_item.msg:57300
msgid "ERSI canister"
msgstr "Boîte métallique ISRE"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57301
msgid ""
"A canister of Environmental Rejection Syndrome Inhibitors. Applied to "
"specimens exiting from an extended period of hibernation."
msgstr ""
"Une boîte métallique d'inhibiteurs du syndrome de rejet environnemental. "
"Utilisé sur des spécimens sortant d'une période prolongée en état de "
"congélation."

#: game/pro_item.msg:57400 game/pro_item.msg:57600
msgid "Lightsaber"
msgstr "Sabre laser"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57401
msgid ""
"An ancient weapon from a more civilized age. Not as clumsy or as random as a "
"blaster. It was given to you by Obi-Wan-Killap. Min ST: 2"
msgstr ""
"C'est élégant, maniable, une arme noble d'une époque civilisée. Les nouveaux "
"pisto-lasers sont bien moins précis... Il t'a été donné par Obi-Wan-Killap. "
"FO Min : 2"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57500
msgid "Blaster"
msgstr "Blaster"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57501
msgid ""
"Hokey religions and ancient weapons are no match for a good blaster at your "
"side, kid. Min ST: 3"
msgstr ""
"P'tit gars, toutes ces croyances à la noix et ces armes démodées, ça vaut "
"pas un bon pisto-laser à tes côtés. Min ST: 3"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57601
msgid ""
"An ancient weapon from a more civilized age. Not as clumsy or as random as a "
"blaster. It was given to you by Empress Timeslip. Min ST: 2."
msgstr ""
"C'est élégant, maniable, une arme noble d'une époque civilisée. Les nouveaux "
"pisto-lasers sont bien moins précis... Il t'a été donné par l'Empereur "
"Timeslip. FO Min : 2."

#: game/pro_item.msg:57700 game/pro_scen.msg:187000 game/pro_scen.msg:198500
msgid "Air Processing Vent"
msgstr "Conduit d'aération"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57701
msgid "The grill on this vent looks different."
msgstr "La grille de ce ventilateur semble différente."

#: game/pro_item.msg:57800 game/pro_item.msg:57900 game/scrname.msg:644
#: game/scrname.msg:649
msgid "Metal Locker"
msgstr "Conteneur en Métal"

#: game/pro_item.msg:58000
msgid "Chinese Code Chart"
msgstr "Tableau de Code Chinois"

#: game/pro_item.msg:58001
msgid ""
"You're not certain, but it appears to be a chart containing various Chinese "
"command codes. Perhaps if you found a place to input these codes, you could "
"learn a thing or two."
msgstr ""
"Tu n'es pas certain, mais il semble que ce tableau contient plusieurs codes "
"de commande chinois. Peut-être qu'en trouvant l'endroit où entrer ces codes, "
"tu pourrais apprendre un chose ou deux."

#: game/pro_item.msg:58100 game/pro_item.msg:58200 game/pro_item.msg:58600
#: game/pro_item.msg:58700
msgid "Dead Tribal"
msgstr "Tribal mort"

#: game/pro_item.msg:58101 game/pro_item.msg:58201 game/pro_item.msg:58401
#: game/pro_item.msg:58501 game/pro_item.msg:58601 game/pro_item.msg:58701
msgid "This person has died a horrible death on the medical table."
msgstr "Cette personne est décédée d'une mort horrible sur la table médicale..."

#: game/pro_item.msg:58301
msgid ""
"An organic seed-spike that the carnivorous plants spit at potential food or "
"seed carriers. This one is sharper, and harder than usual."
msgstr ""
"Une graine crachée par les plantes carnivores vers les proies potentielles "
"ou les porteurs de graines. Celle-ci est plus pointue et plus dure que la "
"normale."

#: game/pro_item.msg:58400 game/pro_item.msg:58500
msgid "Dead Vault Dweller"
msgstr "Habitant de l'Abri mort"

#: game/pro_item.msg:58801
msgid "Wearable K-9 Kevlar (FAKE)"
msgstr "Kevlar de K9 équipable (POSTICHE)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:58900 game/pro_item.msg:58901 game/pro_item.msg:59000
msgid "Mutant Armor"
msgstr "Armure de Mutant"

#: game/pro_item.msg:59001
msgid "Wearable Mutant Armor (FAKE)"
msgstr "Armure de Mutant équipable (POSTICHE)"

#: game/pro_item.msg:59100
msgid "Small Scorpion Tail"
msgstr "Petite queue de radscorpion"

#: game/pro_item.msg:59101
msgid "The severed tail of a small radscorpion."
msgstr "La queue coupée d'un petit radscorpion."

#: game/pro_item.msg:59200
msgid "Plant seed"
msgstr "Graine de plante"

#: game/pro_item.msg:59201
msgid "A plant seed given to you by Dr. Sheng."
msgstr "Une graine qui vous a été donnée par le Dr. Sheng."

#: game/pro_item.msg:59300 game/pro_item.msg:59400 game/pro_item.msg:59500
msgid "Nothing out of the ordinary"
msgstr "Rien qui sort de l'ordinaire"

#: game/pro_item.msg:59301 game/pro_item.msg:59401 game/pro_item.msg:59501
msgid "Nothing out of the ordinary."
msgstr "Rien qui sort de l'ordinaire."

#: game/pro_item.msg:59600
msgid "Fake Heart Pills"
msgstr "Fausses pilules pour le coeur."

#: game/pro_item.msg:59601
msgid ""
"These pills would normally be used by people with heart problems, except in "
"this case death would ensue. These pills have been mixed with other "
"chemicals, resulting in a guaranteed heart-exploding experience."
msgstr ""
"Ces pilules sont normalement utilisés par les personnes souffrant de "
"problèmes cardiaques, sauf que dans ce cas la mort s'ensuivrait. Ces pilules "
"ont été mélangées avec d'autres produits chimiques avec pour résultat, une "
"crise cardiaque garantie."

#: game/pro_misc.msg:100 game/proto.msg:301
msgid "Rocket"
msgstr "Roquette"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:200
msgid "Plasma Ball"
msgstr "Balle à plasma"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:300 game/pro_misc.msg:1100 game/pro_misc.msg:1400
#: game/pro_misc.msg:1500 game/pro_misc.msg:2700 game/pro_misc.msg:2800
#: game/pro_misc.msg:2900
msgid "Explosion"
msgstr "Explosion"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:400 game/pro_scen.msg:132100 game/pro_scen.msg:132200
#: game/pro_scen.msg:132300 game/pro_scen.msg:132400 game/pro_scen.msg:132500
#: game/pro_scen.msg:132600
msgid "Blood"
msgstr "Sang"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:500
msgid "No-Trans hex"
msgstr "Carreau Non-Trans"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:600
msgid "knife"
msgstr "Couteau"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:700
msgid "spear"
msgstr "Lance"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:800
msgid "EMP Explosion"
msgstr "Explosion électromag."

#: game/pro_misc.msg:900
msgid "Laser Blast"
msgstr "Rafale laser"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:1000
msgid "Plasma Blast"
msgstr "Rafale de plasma"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:1200
msgid "Scroll Blocker"
msgstr "Bloqueur de défilement"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:1300
msgid "Electricity Bolt"
msgstr "Eclair d'électricité"

#: game/pro_misc.msg:1600 game/pro_misc.msg:1700 game/pro_misc.msg:1800
#: game/pro_misc.msg:1900 game/pro_misc.msg:2000 game/pro_misc.msg:2100
#: game/pro_misc.msg:2200 game/pro_misc.msg:2300 game/pro_misc.msg:3100
#: game/pro_misc.msg:3200 game/pro_misc.msg:3300 game/pro_misc.msg:3400
