"A hydraulic lift, designed to help provide support, power and communication "
"lines to the platform."
msgstr ""
"Un monte-charge hydraulique, prévu pour amener du matériel, de l'énergie et "
"des lignes de communication de la plate-forme du dirigeant."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:2501
msgid "If you've seen one monitor, you've seen them all."
msgstr "Si tu as vu un moniteur, tu les as tous vus."

