#: game/pro_wall.msg:129500 game/scrname.msg:366 game/scrname.msg:1124
#: game/scrname.msg:1257
msgid "Gate"
msgstr "Portail"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:7701 game/pro_scen.msg:8801 game/pro_scen.msg:8901
msgid "A wooden gate."
msgstr "Un portail en bois."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:7801
msgid "A large pile of rocks. They look indigenous to this region."
msgstr "Gros amas de rochers. Ils semblent étrangers à cette région."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:7901 game/pro_scen.msg:8001 game/pro_scen.msg:9301
msgid "A small pile of rocks."
msgstr "Petit amas de rochers."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:8101 game/pro_scen.msg:206801 game/pro_scen.msg:206901
msgid "A large pile of rocks."
msgstr "Un gros tas de cailloux."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:8201 game/pro_scen.msg:8301
msgid ""
"A large pile of bleached animal bones. At least, you think all the bones are "
"animal..."
msgstr ""
"Gros tas d'os d'animaux blanchis. Du moins, tu penses que tous les os sont "
"d'origine animale..."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:8401
msgid ""
"A very large pile of bleached bones. You cannot determine the species of the "
"dead critters."
msgstr ""
"Gros tas d'os d'animaux blanchis. Tu ne peux pas déterminer l'espèce de ces "
"créatures mortes."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:8501
msgid ""
"You think these might be Horned Kangaroo bones, but you cannot be sure. They "
"are too weathered to make a final determination."
msgstr ""
"Tu penses qu'il pourrait peut-être s'agir des os d'un kangourou cornu. "
"Difficile de l'affirmer avec certitude."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:8601
msgid "You see the bones of a large, two-headed cow."
msgstr "Tu vois les os d'une grosse vache à deux têtes."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:8701
msgid "A wooden gate. It opens, and closes, and opens, and closes, and..."
msgstr "Portail en bois. Il s'ouvre et se ferme, s'ouvre et se ferme, et..."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9001
msgid "A very large pile of rocks. They look dangerous just sitting there."
msgstr "Gros amas de rochers. Ils ont l'air menaçant."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9101
msgid ""
"A large pile of rocks. If you look closely, you can see the faces of little "
"old men in the sides of the stones."
msgstr ""
"Gros amas de rochers. En y regardant de plus près, tu peux voir les visages "
"de vieux petits hommes dans les pierres."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9201
msgid "Rocks, rocks, rocks! Everywhere you look, rocks!"
msgstr "Des rochers, des rochers, des rochers ! Il y a des rochers partout !"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9400 game/pro_scen.msg:90000 game/pro_wall.msg:46700
#: game/pro_wall.msg:46800 game/pro_wall.msg:46900 game/pro_wall.msg:47000
#: game/pro_wall.msg:47100 game/pro_wall.msg:47200 game/pro_wall.msg:47300
#: game/pro_wall.msg:47400 game/pro_wall.msg:47500 game/pro_wall.msg:47600
#: game/pro_wall.msg:47700 game/pro_wall.msg:47800 game/pro_wall.msg:47900
#: game/pro_wall.msg:48000 game/pro_wall.msg:48100 game/pro_wall.msg:48200
#: game/pro_wall.msg:48300 game/pro_wall.msg:48400 game/pro_wall.msg:48500
#: game/pro_wall.msg:48600
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "Bar"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9401
msgid "This bar has a collection of brewed beverages ready to pour."
msgstr "Ce bar a une sélection de breuvages qui t'attend."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9501
msgid "A rotting old chair made out of an ancient car seat."
msgstr "Vieille chaise pourrie recyclée à partir d'un vieux siège de voiture."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9601
msgid ""
"A smelly old chair that used be to a car seat. The springs have lost their "
"spring."
msgstr ""
"Vieille chaise malodorante qui faisait autrefois office de siège de voiture. "
"Les ressorts sont en très mauvais état."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9701 game/pro_scen.msg:9801
msgid ""
"A rotting, smelly old chair sitting on bricks for support. Looks pretty "
"uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"Vieux siège pourri et malodorant soutenu par des briques. Il n'a pas l'air "
"très confortable."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9900 game/pro_scen.msg:10000
msgid "Couch"
msgstr "Divan"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:9901 game/pro_scen.msg:10001
msgid ""
"A very uncomfortable looking sitting device, sometimes known as a couch."
msgstr "Siège très inconfortable, parfois appelé divan."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10100
msgid "Tire"
msgstr "Pneu"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10101
msgid "An old rubber tire sitting in the middle of some weeds."
msgstr ""
"Vieux pneu en caoutchouc trônant au milieu de quelques mauvaises herbes."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10200 game/pro_scen.msg:10300 game/pro_scen.msg:10400
#: game/pro_scen.msg:10500
msgid "Scrub"
msgstr "Broussailles"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10201 game/pro_scen.msg:10301 game/pro_scen.msg:10401
#: game/pro_scen.msg:10501
msgid "Some sort of desert weed."
msgstr "Quelques variétés de mauvaises herbes du désert."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10601
msgid ""
"It's a rusted car door leaning on a rusted metal barrel. A whole lot of rust "
"is going on."
msgstr ""
"Voici une portière de voiture rouillée appuyée sur un baril en métal "
"également rouillé. La rouille ne cesse de ronger."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10701
msgid ""
"A broken toilet, half-buried in the sand. Life's a pisser, then you die."
msgstr "Toilettes cassées à moitié enterrées dans le sable."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10800
msgid "Weeds"
msgstr "Mauvaises herbes"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10801
msgid ""
"Some sort of desert scrub. If it was growing in the recent past, it isn't "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Quelques mauvaises herbes du désert. Elles poussaient encore dans un passé "
"récent, mais ce n'est plus le cas."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:10901
msgid ""
"A car tire, buried in the sand. Some small pieces of wood are piled up "
"around it."
msgstr ""
"Pneu de voiture enterré dans le sable. Quelques petits morceaux de bois sont "
"entassés autour."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:11001
msgid ""
"On closer examination, you think these might actually be pieces of petrified "
"wood."
msgstr ""
"En y regardant de plus près, tu penses qu'il s'agit de morceaux de bois "
"pétrifié."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:11100 game/pro_scen.msg:11200 game/pro_scen.msg:11300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:11400 game/pro_scen.msg:11900 game/pro_scen.msg:12000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:12100 game/pro_scen.msg:12200 game/pro_scen.msg:12300
