msgid "This large metal roll-door has been jammed shut from the inside."
msgstr "Cette grande porte tournante en métal est fermée de l'intérieur."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:47701 game/pro_scen.msg:48001
msgid ""
"This large metal roll-door has been jammed shut from the inside. It reads "
"LOADING ONLY."
msgstr ""
"Cette grande porte tournante en métal est fermée de l'intérieur. On peut y "
"lire CHARGEMENT UNIQUEMENT."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48101 game/pro_scen.msg:48201
msgid ""
"This door looks suspiciously like the door you would find in a warehouse."
msgstr "Cette porte ressemble étrangement à la porte d'un entrepôt."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48300
msgid "Weather Vane"
msgstr "Girouette"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48301
msgid ""
"This simple weather vane helps inhabitants of the wasteland study the "
"weather."
msgstr ""
"Cette simple girouette aide les habitants des terres désolées à étudier le "
"temps."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48401 game/pro_scen.msg:50501 game/pro_scen.msg:50601
#: game/pro_scen.msg:50701 game/pro_scen.msg:50801
msgid "A simple altar made from painted wood."
msgstr "Simple autel en bois peint."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48500 game/pro_scen.msg:52600
msgid "Podium"
msgstr "Podium"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48501
msgid "This is a normal podium for public speaking."
msgstr "Une estrade ordinaire pour s'exprimer en public."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48701
msgid ""
"A large monitor, black and white only. The reception is pretty good for "
"being indoors without an antenna."
msgstr ""
"Grand moniteur, à affichage noir et blanc uniquement. La réception est assez "
"bonne pour se faire à l'intérieur et sans antenne."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48801
msgid ""
"A large monitor, black and white only. The robed figure is reciting "
"religious dogma at a feverish pace."
msgstr ""
"Grand moniteur noir et blanc. La silhouette revêtue d'une robe récite un "
"dogme religieux à une cadence fiévreuse."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48900 game/pro_scen.msg:49000 game/pro_scen.msg:49100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:49200 game/pro_scen.msg:154800 game/pro_scen.msg:154900
#: game/pro_scen.msg:158100 game/pro_scen.msg:158200 game/pro_scen.msg:158300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:158400 game/pro_scen.msg:206600 game/scrname.msg:1532
#: game/scrname.msg:1535 game/scrname.msg:1541
msgid "Forcefield"
msgstr "Champ de force"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:48901 game/pro_scen.msg:49001 game/pro_scen.msg:49101
#: game/pro_scen.msg:49201
msgid "This is a powerful field of energy."
msgstr "Voici un puissant champ énergétique."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:49301 game/pro_scen.msg:49401 game/pro_scen.msg:49501
#: game/pro_scen.msg:49601 game/pro_scen.msg:49701 game/pro_scen.msg:49801
msgid "A fairly ordinary wooden table."
msgstr "Table en bois assez ordinaire."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:50901
msgid ""
"A collapsed section of the roof has formed this pile of rubble. Your rope "
"leads back to the surface."
msgstr ""
"Voici les décombres d'une partie du toit qui s'est effondré. Ta corde mène à "
"la surface."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:51001
msgid "fgfgfg"
msgstr "Un tout petit tas de cailloux."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:51601 game/pro_scen.msg:51701 game/pro_scen.msg:51801
#: game/pro_scen.msg:51901 game/pro_scen.msg:52001 game/pro_scen.msg:52101
msgid "This large table looks important. Perhaps they hold meetings here?"
msgstr ""
"Cette grande table semble importante. Des réunions y sont peut-être "
"organisées."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:52201 game/pro_scen.msg:52301 game/pro_scen.msg:52401
msgid ""
"An altar designed and used by the Brotherhood of Steel. Their symbol is "
"brazenly shown."
msgstr ""
"Autel conçu et utilisé par la Confrérie de l'Acier. Leur symbole y figure "
"clairement."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:52501
msgid "A nicely fashioned, and mighty uncomfortable looking, pew."
msgstr "Très beau banc d'église qui a l'air totalement inconfortable."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:52601
msgid ""
"A nice wooden podium. There is a tele-prompter screen built into it, facing "
"the speaker."
msgstr ""
"Joli podium en bois. Un télé-souffleur y est intégré en face de l'orateur."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:53300 game/pro_scen.msg:53400 game/pro_scen.msg:53500
#: game/pro_scen.msg:53600
msgid "Mat"
msgstr "Tapis"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:53301 game/pro_scen.msg:53401 game/pro_scen.msg:53501
#: game/pro_scen.msg:53601
msgid "A training mat."
msgstr "Tapis d'entraînement."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:53700 game/scrname.msg:1098
msgid "Punching Bag"
msgstr "Sac de frappe"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:53701
msgid "This is a StrongMan(tm) punching bag."
msgstr "Voici un sac de frappe StrongMan(tm)."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:53800 game/pro_scen.msg:53900
msgid "Stair Stepper"
msgstr "Stepper"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:53801 game/pro_scen.msg:54001 game/pro_scen.msg:54101
#: game/pro_scen.msg:54201 game/pro_scen.msg:54301
msgid "An exercise machine."
msgstr "Un appareil pour faire de l'exercice."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:54000 game/pro_scen.msg:54100
msgid "Treadmill"
msgstr "Tapis de course"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:54200 game/pro_scen.msg:54300
msgid "Bench Press"
msgstr "Banc de musculation"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:54400 game/pro_scen.msg:54500
msgid "Wood Planks"
msgstr "Planches en bois"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:54401 game/pro_scen.msg:54501 game/pro_scen.msg:224701
#: game/pro_scen.msg:224801
msgid "These sturdy wooden planks have been firmly bound together."
msgstr "Ces planches de bois ont été solidement attachées ensemble."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:54600 game/pro_scen.msg:54700 game/pro_scen.msg:54800
#: game/pro_scen.msg:54900 game/pro_scen.msg:55000
msgid "Roulette Table"
msgstr "Table de roulette"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55100 game/pro_scen.msg:55200 game/pro_scen.msg:232500
#: game/pro_scen.msg:232600 game/pro_scen.msg:232700 game/pro_scen.msg:232800
msgid "Barrel"
msgstr "Baril"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55101
msgid ""
"This empty metal barrel has the nuclear trefoil symbol painted on the side "
"in bright yellow paint."
msgstr ""
"Ce baril en métal vide porte sur le côté le symbole du trèfle nucléaire "
"peint en jaune."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55201
msgid ""
"This barrel contains some green glowing goo. The nuclear trefoil symbol "
"gives a clue to what the goo might be."
msgstr ""
"Ce baril contient de la substance collante verte. Le symbole du trèfle "
"nucléaire permet d'en savoir plus sur la substance collante."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55301 game/pro_scen.msg:55401
msgid "A very modern looking computer."
msgstr "Ordinateur à l'apparence très moderne."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55500 game/pro_scen.msg:200200
msgid "Suspension Tank"
msgstr "Cuve en Suspension"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55501
msgid ""
"Some sort of medical or experimental apparatus, it looks as if it could "
"contain a human or larger sized body."
msgstr ""
"Sorte d'appareil médical expérimental. On dirait qu'il peut contenir un "
"humain, voire plus."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55600
msgid "Broken Suspension Tank"
msgstr "Réservoir à suspension cassé"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55601
msgid "A broken piece of equipment. It is beyond repair."
msgstr "Appareil cassé et irréparable."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55700
msgid "Mainframe"
msgstr "Ordinateur central"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55701
msgid ""
"A large super computer. Probably the fastest looking computer you've ever "
"seen."
msgstr ""
"Super gros ordinateur. Probablement le plus rapide que tu n'aies jamais vu."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55800
msgid "Support Platform"
msgstr "Plate-forme de soutien"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55801
msgid "This platform supports the large super computer over the cooling tanks."
msgstr ""
"Cette plate-forme soutient le super gros ordinateur au-dessus des réservoirs "
"de refroidissement."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:55900 game/pro_scen.msg:56000
msgid "Don't use"
msgstr "Ne l'utilise pas"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:56401 game/pro_scen.msg:56501
msgid "It looks like a serial cable of some sort."
msgstr "On dirait un câble série."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:56600 game/pro_scen.msg:58200 game/pro_scen.msg:59800
#: game/pro_scen.msg:59900 game/pro_scen.msg:60000 game/pro_scen.msg:85100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:85400 game/pro_scen.msg:86900 game/pro_scen.msg:87000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:87100 game/pro_scen.msg:87200 game/pro_scen.msg:87300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:87400 game/pro_scen.msg:87500 game/pro_scen.msg:87600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:87700 game/pro_scen.msg:88700 game/pro_scen.msg:89100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:89200 game/pro_scen.msg:89300 game/pro_scen.msg:89600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:89700 game/pro_scen.msg:102000 game/pro_scen.msg:102100
#: game/pro_scen.msg:102200 game/pro_scen.msg:102300 game/pro_scen.msg:102400
#: game/pro_scen.msg:102500 game/pro_scen.msg:106000 game/pro_scen.msg:111000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:111100 game/pro_scen.msg:111200 game/pro_scen.msg:111300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:111400 game/pro_scen.msg:111500 game/pro_scen.msg:111600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:111700 game/pro_scen.msg:123200 game/pro_scen.msg:123300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:123400 game/pro_scen.msg:123500 game/pro_scen.msg:140900
#: game/pro_scen.msg:220200
msgid "Sign"
msgstr "Panneau"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:56601
msgid "The sign reads BAR. That should be pretty self-evident."
msgstr "On peut lire sur cette pancarte : BAR. Ceci semble assez éloquent."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:56700 game/pro_scen.msg:56800 game/pro_scen.msg:127400
#: game/pro_scen.msg:127500 game/pro_scen.msg:127600 game/pro_scen.msg:127700
#: game/pro_scen.msg:127800 game/pro_scen.msg:127900 game/pro_scen.msg:128000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:128100 game/pro_scen.msg:128200 game/pro_scen.msg:128300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:130500 game/pro_scen.msg:130600 game/pro_scen.msg:130700
#: game/pro_scen.msg:130800 game/pro_scen.msg:130900 game/pro_scen.msg:131000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:131100 game/pro_scen.msg:131200 game/pro_scen.msg:161300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:161400
msgid "Beam"
msgstr "Poutre"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:56701
msgid "This strong beam is stationed over the crater hole."
msgstr "Cette grosse poutre est positionnée au-dessus du trou du cratère."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:56801
msgid ""
"There is a rope securely attached to the beam. It looks like you can climb "
"down into the crater now."
msgstr ""
"Une corde est bien attachée à la poutre. On dirait que tu peux à présent "
"descendre dans le cratère."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:56901 game/pro_scen.msg:57001 game/pro_scen.msg:57101
#: game/pro_scen.msg:57201
msgid "You see some very empty metal shelves."
msgstr "Voici quelques étagères en métal vides."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:57300 game/pro_scen.msg:57400 game/pro_scen.msg:57500
msgid "Bush"
msgstr "Buisson"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:57301
msgid "A desert weed of some kind. Not important to this story."
msgstr "Mauvaises herbes du désert sans importance pour l'histoire."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:57401 game/pro_scen.msg:57501
msgid "A desert weed of some kind."
msgstr "Mauvaises herbes du désert."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:57600 game/pro_scen.msg:57700 game/scrname.msg:433
msgid "Ground"
msgstr "Terrain"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:57601
msgid ""
"A nice view of the Boneyards from this tower level. You get a good feeling "
"of just how high up in the sky you are."
msgstr ""
"Belle vue sur le Cimetière depuis ce niveau de la tour. Tu te rends bien "
"compte de la hauteur à laquelle tu te trouves."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:57701
msgid "A nice view of the Boneyards from this tower level."
msgstr "Belle vue sur le Cimetière depuis ce niveau de la tour."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:57801 game/pro_scen.msg:57901 game/pro_scen.msg:58001
msgid "A good view of the outside of the Cathedral."
msgstr "Belle vue sur l'extérieur de la Cathédrale."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:58101
msgid "A door that looks perfectly at home in a cell."
msgstr "Porte qui semble être celle d'une cellule."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:58201
msgid "This sign says this store is called Darkwater's."
msgstr "Cette pancarte indique que ce magasin s'appelle Darkwater's."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:58301 game/pro_scen.msg:58401
msgid "This ladder leads into the darkness below."
msgstr "Cette échelle mène à l'obscurité souterraine."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:58500 game/pro_scen.msg:58600 game/pro_scen.msg:58700
#: game/pro_scen.msg:58800 game/pro_scen.msg:58900
msgid "Machinery"
msgstr "Machine"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:58501 game/pro_scen.msg:58601 game/pro_scen.msg:58701
#: game/pro_scen.msg:58801 game/pro_scen.msg:58901
msgid "It looks like an old printing press or manufacturing doohickey."
msgstr ""
"On dirait une vielle presse d'imprimerie ou tout autre système de "
"fabrication."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59000
msgid "Scrap Metal"
msgstr "Machine"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59001
msgid "Scrap Metal."
msgstr ""
"On dirait une vielle presse d'imprimerie ou tout autre système de "
"fabrication."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59101 game/pro_scen.msg:59201
msgid ""
"This metal table looks in good condition. There is a drain in the center of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Cette table en métal semble en bon état. On y distingue au centre un tuyau "
"d'écoulement."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59301 game/pro_scen.msg:59401 game/pro_scen.msg:59501
msgid "The metal table is covered by some kind of biomass."
msgstr "Cette table en métal est recouverte de biomasse."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59600 game/scrname.msg:365 game/scrname.msg:967
#: game/scrname.msg:1013
msgid "Bulletin Board"
msgstr "Tableau d'affichage"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59601
msgid "Notices for employment are stapled to the board. It looks well used."
msgstr ""
"Des informations d'embauche sont agrafées sur le tableau. Il semble très "
"utilisé."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59700
msgid "Shack"
msgstr "Guérite"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59701
msgid ""
"This shack is over a hundred years old, but still in excellent condition."
msgstr ""
"Cette guérite de gardien à plus de cent ans et elle est toujours en "
"excellent état."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:59801 game/pro_scen.msg:59901 game/pro_scen.msg:220201
msgid "This sign says: General Store."
msgstr "Le panneau indique : Magasin."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:60001
msgid "This sign says: Market"
msgstr "Cette pancarte indique : Marché"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:60100 game/pro_scen.msg:60200 game/pro_scen.msg:60300
msgid "Slime Pool"
msgstr "Piscine de limon"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:60101 game/pro_scen.msg:60201 game/pro_scen.msg:60301
msgid ""
"It looks very unhealthy. You might want to wear armored swim trunks before "
"taking a dip."
msgstr ""
"Cela n'a pas l'air très sain. Il te faudrait une armure avant d'y plonger."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:60401 game/pro_scen.msg:60501 game/pro_scen.msg:60601
#: game/pro_scen.msg:60701
msgid "A nice looking metal table."
msgstr "Très jolie table en fer."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:60801
msgid "This metal table has not been treated well. The rust is very pervasive."
msgstr ""
"Cette table en métal n'a pas été bien entretenue. Elle est rongée par la "
"rouille."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:60901 game/pro_scen.msg:61001 game/pro_scen.msg:61101
msgid "A good looking metal table, except for the rust."
msgstr "Très jolie table en métal, exception faite de la rouille."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61200
msgid "Fire Pit"
msgstr "Feu de camp"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61201
msgid "The fire is burning."
msgstr "Le feu brûle."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61300 game/pro_scen.msg:61400
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "Miroir"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61301
msgid "You look at yourself for a while."
msgstr "Tu te regardes un moment."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61401
msgid "You stare at your image in the mirror for a while."
msgstr "Tu regardes ton reflet dans le miroir un moment."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61501
msgid "A fully functioning sink. Nice and clean, too."
msgstr "Evier en état, beau et propre."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61601
msgid "This toilet is very clean. It works, too."
msgstr "Ces toilettes sont très propres et en plus elles fonctionnent."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61701
msgid "This urinal is functional."
msgstr "Cet urinoir est fonctionnel."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61801
msgid "If you had a toilet fetish, then this would be a nice toilet."
msgstr "Si tu aimes les toilettes, celles-ci devraient te plaire."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:61901
msgid "This sink is in perfect condition."
msgstr "Cet évier est en parfait état."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:62001
msgid "This urinal is in perfect condition."
msgstr "Cet urinoir est en parfait état."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:62100 game/pro_scen.msg:62200 game/pro_scen.msg:62300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:62400 game/pro_scen.msg:62500 game/pro_scen.msg:62600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:89400 game/pro_scen.msg:89500 game/pro_scen.msg:153700
msgid "Shower"
msgstr "Douche"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:62101 game/pro_scen.msg:62201 game/pro_scen.msg:62301
#: game/pro_scen.msg:62401 game/pro_scen.msg:62501 game/pro_scen.msg:62601
msgid "A military-style shower. Not to be used by modest people."
msgstr "Douche de style militaire. Déconseillée aux personnes pudiques."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:62701 game/pro_scen.msg:62801
msgid "A very comfortable looking bed."
msgstr "Lit apparemment très confortable."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:62901 game/pro_scen.msg:63001 game/pro_scen.msg:63101
msgid "A structurally-enhanced bunk bed."
msgstr "Lits superposés renforcés."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:63200 game/pro_scen.msg:63300 game/pro_scen.msg:64000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:64600 game/pro_scen.msg:64700 game/scrname.msg:254
#: game/scrname.msg:255 game/scrname.msg:256 game/scrname.msg:257
#: game/scrname.msg:258 game/scrname.msg:259 game/scrname.msg:260
#: game/scrname.msg:261 game/scrname.msg:262 game/scrname.msg:263
#: game/scrname.msg:264 game/scrname.msg:364 game/scrname.msg:476
#: game/scrname.msg:983 game/scrname.msg:1263 game/scrname.msg:1267
#: game/scrname.msg:1331
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:63400 game/pro_scen.msg:63500 game/pro_scen.msg:63600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:163700
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "Drapeau"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:63401 game/pro_scen.msg:63501 game/pro_scen.msg:63601
msgid "This flag is the symbol of the Children of the Cathedral."
msgstr "Ce drapeau est le symbole des Enfants de la Cathédrale."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:63701 game/pro_scen.msg:63801 game/pro_scen.msg:63901
msgid "A large computer."
msgstr "Gros ordinateur."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:64001
msgid "The terminal to a large computer."
msgstr "Le terminal d'un gros ordinateur."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:64100 game/pro_scen.msg:64200 game/pro_scen.msg:64300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:64400 game/scrname.msg:1029
msgid "Dead Body"
msgstr "Cadavre"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:64101 game/pro_scen.msg:64201 game/pro_scen.msg:64301
#: game/pro_scen.msg:64401
msgid "It looks as if this person died very painfully."
msgstr "On dirait que cette personne est morte dans la douleur."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:64501
msgid "This barred door works well as the door to a jail cell."
msgstr "Cette porte barrée fonctionne très bien comme porte de cellule."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:64800 game/pro_scen.msg:64900
msgid "Forklift"
msgstr "Chariot à fourche"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:64801 game/pro_scen.msg:64901
msgid "The forklift is inoperable."
msgstr "Ce chariot à fourche est hors service."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65000 game/pro_wall.msg:5900 game/pro_wall.msg:7500
#: game/pro_wall.msg:7700
msgid "Equipment"
msgstr "Matériel"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65100 game/pro_scen.msg:65200 game/pro_scen.msg:85300
msgid "Medical Table"
msgstr "Table médicale"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65101
msgid ""
"This table is very rusty. The drain in the center of the table is clogged."
msgstr ""
"Cette table est très rouillée. Le tuyau d'évacuation central est bouché."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65201
msgid "This table is very rusty."
msgstr "Cette table est très rouillée."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65301
msgid "This gate has a bar that raises and lowers."
msgstr "Ce portail est équipé d'une barre qui se lève ou s'abaisse."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65600 game/pro_scen.msg:193900 game/pro_scen.msg:194000
#: game/scrname.msg:737
msgid "Power Generator"
msgstr "Générateur électrique"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65601 game/pro_scen.msg:193901
msgid ""
"A Wattz ElectroBox power generator. Fairly standard as back-up generators "
"before the war."
msgstr ""
"Un Générateur Wattz ElectroBox. Un équipement de secours standard d'avant "
"guerre."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65700 game/pro_scen.msg:117200 game/pro_scen.msg:119000
msgid "Tank"
msgstr "Le Char"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65701
msgid ""
"A large water-tank. Looks well-maintained, which is probably a good thing."
msgstr ""
"Grand réservoir à eau. Il semble en bon état, ce qui est une bonne chose."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65800
msgid "Police Box"
msgstr "Cabine de police"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65801
msgid "A police box from the UK, circa 1960."
msgstr "Cabine de police britannique datant de 1960."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:65901 game/pro_scen.msg:66001 game/pro_scen.msg:66101
msgid ""
"A nicely made table. Hand-made, but it looks much nicer than any table "
"you've seen before."
msgstr ""
