#: game/pro_scen.msg:223901 game/pro_scen.msg:224001 game/pro_scen.msg:224101
#: game/pro_scen.msg:224201 game/pro_scen.msg:224601
msgid "Pieces of a broken egg shell. It glows!"
msgstr "Morceaux d'une coquille d'oeuf brisée.. Ils brillent !"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:224300 game/pro_scen.msg:224400 game/pro_scen.msg:224500
msgid "Small glowing rocks"
msgstr "Petit cailloux rayonnants"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:224301 game/pro_scen.msg:224401 game/pro_scen.msg:224501
msgid "Scattered small glowing rocks."
msgstr "De petits cailloux dispersés et rayonnants."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:224700 game/pro_scen.msg:224800
msgid "Glowing Wood Planks"
msgstr "Planches de bois rayonnantes"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:224901
msgid ""
"It's an old, glowing, fairly rickety ladder. It looks like it will barely "
"support your weight."
msgstr ""
"Voici une vieille échelle brinquebalante et rayonnante. On dirait bien "
"qu'elle ne va pas supporter ton poids."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225101
msgid "You study the glowing rocks for a while, but they never move."
msgstr ""
"Tu étudies les rochers rayonnants un moment, mais elles ne bougent jamais."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225201
msgid ""
"You keep a close eye on these glowing rocks, in case they move to attack you."
msgstr ""
"Tu gardes un oeil sur ces rochers rayonnants, au cas où ils t'attaqueraient."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225301
msgid "A large pile of glowing rocks. They look radioactive."
msgstr "Un grand amas de rochers rayonnants. Ils ont l'air radioactifs."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225401 game/pro_scen.msg:225501 game/pro_scen.msg:226001
msgid "A small pile of glowing rocks."
msgstr "Un petit amas de rochers rayonnants."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225601
msgid "A large pile of glowing rocks."
msgstr "Un petit amas de rochers rayonnants."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225701
msgid ""
"A very large pile of glowing rocks. They look dangerous just sitting there."
msgstr ""
"Un très grand amas de rochers rayonnants. Ils ont l'air dangereux à rester "
"là, comme ça."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225801
msgid ""
"A large pile of glowing rocks. If you look closely, you can see the faces of "
"little old men in the sides of the stones."
msgstr ""
"Un grand amas de rochers rayonnants. En y regardant de plus près, tu peux "
"voir les visages de vieux petits hommes dans les pierres."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:225901
msgid "Rocks, rocks, rocks! Everywhere you look, glowing rocks!"
msgstr ""
"Des rochers, des rochers, des rochers ! Il y a des rochers rayonnants "
"partout !"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:226800 game/pro_scen.msg:226900 game/pro_scen.msg:227000
#: game/pro_scen.msg:227100 game/pro_scen.msg:227200 game/pro_scen.msg:227300
msgid "Glowing Wall"
msgstr "Mur rayonnant"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:227400 game/pro_scen.msg:227500 game/pro_scen.msg:227600
#: game/pro_scen.msg:227700
msgid "Glowing Drain"
msgstr "Canalisation rayonnante"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:227501
msgid ""
"You can barely make out some movement behind the grate covering this drain. "
"You can see small green glowing eyes peering back at you. Rat eyes."
msgstr ""
"Il est pratiquement impossible de bouger derrière cette canalisation "
"d'égouts. Tu vois des petits yeux rouges qui te regardent. Des yeux de rats."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:227800 game/pro_scen.msg:227900 game/pro_scen.msg:228000
msgid "Grimy Bed"
msgstr "Lit crasseux"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:228100 game/pro_scen.msg:228200 game/pro_scen.msg:228300
#: game/pro_scen.msg:228400 game/pro_scen.msg:228500 game/pro_scen.msg:228600
#: game/proto.msg:100
msgid "Glass"
msgstr "Vitre"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:228101 game/pro_scen.msg:228201 game/pro_scen.msg:228301
msgid "This glass is difficult to see through."
msgstr "Cette vitre est à peine transparente."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:228401 game/pro_scen.msg:228501 game/pro_scen.msg:228601
msgid "This glass is barely transparent."
msgstr "Cette vitre est à peine transparente."

