#: game/skill.msg:200
msgid ""
"The use, care and general knowledge of small firearms - pistols, SMGs and "
"rifles."
msgstr ""
"Maniement, entretien et connaissance générale des petites armes à feu. - "
"Pistolets, mitraillettes et carabines."

#: game/skill.msg:201
msgid ""
"The operation and maintenance of really big guns - miniguns, rocket "
"launchers, flamethrowers and such."
msgstr ""
"Fonctionnement et entretien de l'armement lourd. - Mini-canons, lance-"
"roquettes, lance-flammes et autres."

#: game/skill.msg:202
msgid ""
"The care and feeding of energy-based weapons.  How to arm and operate "
"weapons that use laser or plasma technology."
msgstr ""
"Entretien et chargement des armes à énergie. Comment armer et manier des "
"armes utilisant des techniques au laser ou au plasma."

#: game/skill.msg:203
msgid ""
"A combination of martial arts, boxing and other hand-to-hand martial arts.  "
"Combat with your hands and feet."
msgstr ""
"Divers arts martiaux, combats de boxe et Corps à Corps. Coups de pieds et "
"coups de poings. Cela inclut les poings américains et les gants."

#: game/skill.msg:204
msgid ""
"Using non-ranged weapons in hand-to-hand, or melee combat - knives, "
"sledgehammers, spears, clubs and so on."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à combattre avec des armes blanches. Couteaux, massues, lances, "
"matraques, etc."

#: game/skill.msg:205
msgid ""
"The skill of muscle-propelled ranged weapons, such as throwing knives, "
"spears and grenades."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à lancer des armes à la main, telles que des couteaux, des lances "
"et des grenades."

#: game/skill.msg:206
msgid ""
"General healing skill.  Used to heal small cuts, abrasions and other minor "
"ills.  In game terms, the use of first aid can heal more hit points over "
"time than just rest."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à pratiquer les premiers soins. Traitement des coupures légères, "
"écorchures et autres maux bénins. La compétence Secourisme permet de guérir "
"des points d'impact plus facilement que par un simple repos."

#: game/skill.msg:207
msgid ""
"The healing of major wounds and crippled limbs.  Without this skill, it will "
"take a much longer period of time to restore crippled limbs to use."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à traiter les lésions importantes et à soigner les membres "
"estropiés.  Sans cette compétence, la durée d'attente avant de pouvoir "
"retrouver l'usage des membres estropiés est beaucoup plus importante."

#: game/skill.msg:208
msgid ""
"Quiet movement, and the ability to remain unnoticed.  If successful, you "
"will be much harder to locate.  You cannot run and sneak at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Mouvement furtif permettant de passer inaperçu. En cas de succès, il devient "
"plus difficile de te localiser. Il est impossible de courir et de se "
"déplacer furtivement en même temps."

#: game/skill.msg:209
msgid ""
"The skill of opening locks without the proper key.  The use of lockpicks or "
"electronic lockpicks will greatly enhance this skill."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à ouvrir les serrures sans la bonne clé. L'utilisation de passe-"
"partout classiques ou électroniques améliore nettement cette compétence."

#: game/skill.msg:210
msgid ""
"The ability to make the things of others your own.  Can be used to steal "
"from people or places."
msgstr ""
"Faculté de s'approprier ce qui appartient à autrui. S'applique aux personnes "
"et aux lieux."

#: game/skill.msg:211
msgid ""
"The finding and removal of traps.  Also the setting of explosives for "
"demolition purposes."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à repérer et retirer les pièges posés. Permet également de poser "
"des explosifs."

#: game/skill.msg:212
msgid ""
"Covers a variety of high technology skills, such as computers, biology, "
"physics and geology."
msgstr ""
"Recouvre diverses compétences scientifiques, notamment en informatique, "
"biologie, physique et géologie."

#: game/skill.msg:213
msgid ""
"The practical application of the Science skill for fixing broken equipment, "
"machinery and electronics."
msgstr ""
"Mise en application de la compétence Science. Réparation des équipements, "
"mécanismes et appareils électroniques endommagés."

#: game/skill.msg:214
msgid ""
"The ability to communicate in a practical and efficient manner.  The skill "
"of convincing others that your position is correct.  The ability to lie and "
"not get caught."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à communiquer de manière pratique et efficace. Capacité à se "
"montrer persuasif, à mentir et à ne pas se faire prendre."

#: game/skill.msg:215
msgid ""
"Trading and trade-related tasks.  The ability to get better prices for items "
"you sell, and lower prices for items you buy."
msgstr ""
"Sens du commerce. Capacité à tout marchander, à la vente comme à l'achat."

#: game/skill.msg:216
msgid ""
"The knowledge and practical skills related to wagering.  The skill at cards, "
"dice and other games."
msgstr ""
"L'art et la manière de parier. Talent aux jeux de cartes, de dés et autres."

#: game/skill.msg:217
msgid ""
"Practical knowledge of the outdoors, and the ability to live off the land.  "
"The knowledge of plants and animals."
msgstr ""
"Connaissance pratique de la vie en plein air et capacité à survivre en "
"milieu hostile. Connaissance de la flore et de la faune."

