msgctxt "female"
msgid "Cousin, am I glad to see you! I need your help."
msgstr "Quel plaisir de te voir cousine ! J'ai besoin de ton aide."

msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"Hello again, cousin. I guess you've noticed that things are really falling "
"apart here. Please\n"
" find the GECK. We are in desperate need!"
msgstr ""
"Rebonjour cousine. Tu vois bien que les choses se détériorent ici. Je t'en "
"prie, trouve le J.E.K. Nous en avons terriblement besoin !"

msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"Hello cousin... uh, I mean Chosen One. I hope you've found the GECK. I've "
"heard a lot of\n"
" talk about hard times to come."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour cousine... Euh, je veux dire bonjour l'Etre Elu. J'espère que tu as "
"trouvé le J.E.K. Beaucoup de mauvais présages s'annoncent."

msgctxt "female"
msgid "Hi, cousin."
msgstr "Bonjour cousine."

msgctxt "female"
msgid "I feel very sick, lover. I think I am poisoned."
msgstr "Je me sens vraiment malade, mon ange. Je pense que je suis empoisonnée."

msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, cousin. Things have been getting worse and worse since you last "
"left. People are sick,\n"
" the brahmin are dying and... I... my dog Smoke died. I miss him so much. "
"Sorry, but I can't really\n"
" talk any more..."
msgstr ""
"Je regrette, cousine. Les choses n'ont pas cessé de se détériorer depuis ton "
"départ. Les gens sont malades, les Brahmines meurent... Je... Mon chien, "
"Fumace, est mort... Il me manque tellement... Pardon, mais je ne peux "
"vraiment pas te parler davantage..."

msgctxt "female"
msgid "Oops! %s was hit instead of %s!"
msgstr "Oups ! %s a été touchée à la place de %s !"

msgctxt "female"
msgid "Oops! %s was hit instead of you!"
msgstr "Oups ! %s a été touchée à ta place !"

msgctxt "female"
msgid "Oops! %s were hit instead of %s!"
msgstr "Oups ! %s as été touchée à la place de %s !"

msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"Welcome home, cousin. Things are getting a little tight around here. Have "
"you found the holy\n"
" Thirteen and the GECK?"
msgstr ""
"Bienvenue à la maison, cousine. Les choses ne vont pas si bien que ça ici. "
"As-tu trouvé le Saint-Treize et le J.E.K ?"

